[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/2018 I was approved for a trial mod based on my income. the reason I needed a loan mod was due to my wife and [COMP');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(28,'02/28/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I have a loan with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have always made my payments on time. For some reason, I realized that there was a late payment on my credit report. As you can see, I have always had a stellar payment record with this company. I tried contacting both Experian, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with no successful resolution. Experian, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] only reporting me 30 days late twice. There was definitely an error on their part. I was never two times 30 days late.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'i have a loan with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(29,'02/28/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I contacted the application Credit Karma due to information published from lenders for my current student loans reflecting an increase to the interest of those loans but all loans showing in current status and in Deferment or Forbearance. My score recently dropped [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] points due to the reporting from these lenders of the interest accrual. I reached out to the lenders and was advised that my score should not have been affected due to the up to date status of my loans. I reached out to Credit Karma and was told it was due to the balance increase and that was the reason for the drop in score which was inaccurate.','Credit Karma, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'credit Karma contacted the application due to information published from lenders. my score recently dropped due to the balance increase.');
