INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(32,'02/27/2019','Debt collection','Medical debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','There is a charge off for {$200.00} on my credit report from Miramed Revenue Group. I have never been contacted by this group. This is not a valid debt and I think they are running a scam. I had hospital bills that have all been paid. I believe they have stolen personal information about me, and have filed this collection as a way to intimidate me into paying a debt that is not mine.','MiraMed Revenue Group LLC',2.0,4.0,'a charge off for $200.00 is on my credit report from Miramed Revenue Group. this is not a valid debt and I think they are running a');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(33,'02/27/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I''m in the market to buy a home, my friend is a realtor and he advise my to check my credit report ahead of time. By doing so i noticed a couple of items that are not mine on my credit report. I don''t understand how this is possible and its kind of sad that i have to go through all this because my identity wasn''t protected. I''m doing this on my own behalf and have reached out to the FTC and my local police department. I need these items removed from my credit report. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'i''m in the market to buy a home, my friend is a realtor. i noticed a couple of items that are not mine on my credit report.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(34,'02/27/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I have called on sereveral occasion, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  would not fix the problem. They illegally charge off on our accounts after filing for section128-21 in the stat of Wisconsin. I spoke with there collection dept 2 days before they sent it to a collection agency.they agent told me they did not agree to the court order. And did not have to follow the Wisconsin law.he told me every state is different. I live in Wisconsin and was given the card in Wisconsin so they have to follow the law.payments were made to credit on per our court order in XX/XX/2018, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/2018 Thur the trustee. They charged of the account after the payments were made. They sent the accounts to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and broke the law. We filed XX/XX/2018. And all the creditors were notified. They need to remove our accounts. They were paid by the agency.this company has a lot of complaints and should be closed. They take advantage of people.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'they charge off on our accounts after filing for section128-21 in the stat of Wisconsin. they sent the accounts to the collection agency and broke the law. they have a lot');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(35,'02/27/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I''ve tried to resolve this with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the credit bureaus but they still keep reporting it as a foreclosure when it is a good standing account. It is incorrectly reporting as a M-8 meaning mortgage foreclosure or repo. This is incorrect and the coding should be a M1, paid as agreed. Because of this, it is causing us financial distress and preventing us from purchasing a home. There was a loan modification but we have been on time since.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'it is incorrectly reporting as a mortgage foreclosure or repo. it is causing us financial distress and preventing us from buying a home.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(36,'02/27/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I received federal student loans to help pay for college tuition, The loans were in deferment until after I graduated. I had a credit score of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at the end of 2017 and when I applied for an apartment I was informed my credit score had dropped into the 500 ''s. The reason was there are 8 Federal loans through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that had been reported late for more than 4 months, The total amount of the loans is approximately {$46000.00}. I was never notified by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when the loans came due for repayment. Once this was discovered, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was contacted and the issue was resolved, or so I thought. Since I have contacted them, all payments have been on-time. I have disputed this with the credit bureaus as I feel I should not be penalized due to this situation. The disputes upheld the late payments. Student loan debt is hard enough, but to have it ruin my credit through no fault of mine in unacceptable.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'student loans were in deferment until after graduating. the loans were reported late for more than 4 months. the total amount of the loans is approximately $46000.00');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(37,'02/26/2019','Debt collection','Other debt','False statements or representation','They are trying to charge me for two months worth of rent on top of tons of excess fees. I have apartment manager at time a 30 day verbal notice of me leaving, and she informed me the apartment was rented the next month. I have also attempted to verify this and they claim it was in lease agreement they can charge 2 months of rent without 30 day notice but have Yet to provide me with a signed lease agreement only a spreadsheet with crossed out numbers.','COLLECTIONS USA, INC.',2.0,2.0,'they are trying to charge me for two months worth of rent. they claim it was in lease agreement they can charge 2 months of rent without 30 day notice.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(38,'02/26/2019','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my collection balance of {$500.00} was paid in full. I received the confirmation number and was told any future charges would be cancelled and it would come off my credit report on the next billing cycle. It came off my report and I though I was done. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was charged {$250.00} ( half of what I owed ). I spoke to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the morning of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when the charge was posted to my account and he requested I email him the bank statement which I did around [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the morning on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. He said he was the one who helped me in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and that he knows the account was paid in full and that he had cancelled the payment. He then gave me the number for a woman named [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and said she would be taking care of it. I spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on Wednesday who said they would handle it. I spoke with her 3 times on Thursday and she said " they '''' were still looking into it. On Friday around [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] she said I should be getting a call for the refund, which I did not receive. On Monday morning ( today ) I called this morning and spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] again who said that they were waiting for my balance to post on their system so they could process the refund. I requested to speak with the manager who''s name was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who told me the same thing and requested I reach out before [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] if I don''t hear from anyone. Around [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Monday afternoon I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who told me [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was on the phone and he would reach out before [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or to call soon before [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] if I hadn''t heard from him. At [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I contacted them again and said he was still on the phone but he would call me back as soon as he was off. I did not hear from him. I called their after hours line at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Monday and they said he left already. It has been almost a week since they took the money from my account for a debt that was already paid.','Genesis Credit Management, LLC',2.0,2.0,'on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my collection balance was paid in full. it came off my credit report and I though I was');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(39,'02/26/2019','Checking or savings account','Savings account','Managing an account','I opened a Savings account in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in preparation for a large purchase. After making the purchase I was planning on keeping the account. The account I was signed up for had a requirement for a minimum balance of {$3500.00}. I was not made aware of this until after the purchase in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when I had found that my account was hit with a couple months worth of maintenance fees. After calling I learned I was signed up for a savings that needed that high of a limit on. I had {$500.00} in the account and was planning on rebuilding it after the purchase. When calling to reconcile I was transferred to the bank ''s sales department first and told nothing could be done about the fee. After pushing back I was told I could only be credited back 25 % of the fee.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'account was signed up for a minimum balance of $3500.00. account was hit with a couple months worth of maintenance fees.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(40,'02/26/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I had Child support on my credit file, so I never really used my credit, I have been paying it through my job for years and decided to apply for a small loan, this passed XX/XX/2018 and I was approved, but also found these other accounts and inquires on my credit report. I did a little research and found out what steps to take in correcting the errors. So I placed a fraud alert and file a identity theft report per the Fair Credit Reporting Act. I am attaching a copy of the identity report and would like these items removed, including the inquires accounts. I discovered through my research, that these items should be removed within 5 business days, once I provide the identity theft report. 

I also went to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] website and input my information and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], stated the my personal data was stolen in their data breach..','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'I had Child support on my credit file, so I never really used my credit. I applied for a small loan, this passed XX/XX/2018 and I was approved');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(41,'02/26/2019','Debt collection','Other debt','Written notification about debt','The company that is attempting to collect from me is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. After researching the company and inputting there information into the Department of Licensing and Regulatory Affairs website, I was informed that this is not a licensed company in the state of Michigan. After additional research I am now aware that they are not licensed to collect debt and I am requesting to have this removed from my credit report. In addition, they were unable to validate the debt.','ERC',2.0,2.0,'the company that is attempting to collect from me is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_AN');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(42,'02/25/2019','Vehicle loan or lease','Loan','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','The derogatory marks on my credit report is blemishing my credit report which prevents me from obtaining the credit that I deserve. I have made several attempts to resolve this issue by asking [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  to remove late and missed payments.. The only responses were from auto generated letters stating that the accounts are valid. Under The laws of FCRA I have the right to dispute the validity of these accounts and proof from the credit bureaus must be given upon request.','BBVA COMPASS FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'derogatory marks on my credit report prevents me from getting the credit that I deserve. the only responses were from auto generated letters stating that the accounts are valid.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(43,'02/25/2019','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','Weve had this loan ( refinanced a couple years ago and the loan was sold to suntrust ) and hadnt had any issues until we signed up for bi-weekly payments. Since signing up the bank has had a hard time applying to money they take from our checking account ( we have automatic withdrawal ) to the mortgage. Twice they took the money and kept it in a holding account and then sent us a letter saying we were going to be late. We got that figured out twice. Then now I check the mortgage and the loan amount has gone up by {$1000.00}. Loans are suppose to go down. Well we had {$4000.00} in a holding account but their app was telling me that the payments were being applied. So now they have our money and are charging us interest on a loan theyre not paying. That is theft in my opinion. Weve had no-weekly payments set up since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and have yet to have they payments applied correctly','SUNTRUST BANKS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'weve had a loan refinanced a couple years ago and the loan was sold to suntrust. since signing up the bank has had a hard time applying to money they');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(44,'02/25/2019','Debt collection','Other debt','Threatened to contact someone or share information improperly','a Representative from Recovery Solution Group sending texts threatening to reach out to family, know associates, and landlord to discuss the debt','Recovery Solutions Group, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a representative from recovery solution group sent texts threatening to reach out to family, know associates, and landlord to discuss the debt.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(45,'02/24/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I have disputed the following accounts multiple times and either one of the credit reporting agencies will rightfully remove the unauthorized account and the other ones dont. I have submitted a fruad report before but still some of the accounts still remain. Before filing suit, I thought I''ll try again to dispute them .The accounts are, ( 1 ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] {$3300.00}, ( 2 ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] {$400.00}, and ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]., due to certain credit bureaus investigation stated account verified, I''m respectfully requesting the Method of Verification used to come to such an conclusion. What Method was used and by whom. How was the community transpired, via phone, fax, email, etc. What physical documentation was reviewed and by who. This is the information I''m requesting as a consumer. And as stated in the FCRA if the credit bureaus can not produce this then the above accounts shall be removed/ blocked.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'the accounts are, ( 1 ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] $3300.00, ( 2 ) [COMPTE_ANONYMIS');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(46,'02/24/2019','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','A few months ago, I was advised that the web site for managing my Suntrust mortgage account ( https : //suntrustmortgage.customercarenet.com ) was being retired in favor of suntrust.com effective XX/XX/2019. 

The " old '''' site displays this message : Please enroll in Online Banking at suntrust.com to continue to manage your mortgage online. 
You will need to create a new userID and password using your mortgage account number ( if you do not have it handy, you may log in below and locate it before leaving this site ).

When I try to log onto the new site, I get error messages indicating that my records can not be matched. I am advised to contact Suntrust by phone, but have never been able to reach a human being to help me with my issues.

I am now afraid that ( 1 ) my loan servicing will be continued electronically despite the change in parameters, and that ( 2 ) I will stop receiving important information, notifications about my account, and the ability to manage my account without a lot of effort in dealing with Suntrust ''s failure to manage my records and transfer them correctly to their new system. If they can not do something as simple as linking my account information so that I can open an online account as they have instructed, I have no basis for believing that they are recording or applying my payments correctly, either.','SUNTRUST BANKS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the web site for managing my Suntrust mortgage account was retired. the site displays this message. you will need to create a new userID and password using your mortgage account number ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(47,'02/23/2019','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','Made pursuant to 15 USC 1692g Sec. 809 ( b ) of the FDCPA. on XX/XX/2018, I submitted a complaint to the CFPB asking MIDWEST RECOVERY SYSTEMS to VALIDATE a debt that they alleged I owed. At that time I respectfully requested that MIDWEST RECOVERY SYSTEMS provide me with competent evidence that I have any legal obligation to pay them seeing as I had never heard of them, had no written contract with them and had never received any benefits from them, yet MIDWEST RECOVERY SYSTEMS had submitted negative information to all three credit reporting agencies ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) against my name and social security number and was demanding payment from me in the amount of {$410.00}. They responded to my complaint but made it very clear that I did not have any financial obligation to them in their response that stated " Additionally, a validation request has been submitted to our client. Once they have provided the requested documentation, it will be forwarded to you at the address provided in this complaint. '''' I did not request for validation from their " client. '''' I requested that MIDWEST RECOVERY SYSTEMS provide me with competent evidence that I have any legal obligation to pay them ( MIDWEST RECOVERY SYSTEMS ).','Midwest Recovery Systems',2.0,2.0,'a complaint was made to the CFPB asking MIDWEST RECOVERY SYSTEMS to VALIDATE a debt that they alleged I owed.');
