INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(49,'02/22/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I have a subscription for credit monitoring with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] through Experian. I first contacted them at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/19 to report that the information on my credit report is not accurate. It shows no credit history at all which is not correct. I have 2 active credit cards as well as a history of a paid mortgage.The agent I  spoke with, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], after a 1 hour hold time, told me she would forward the issue to their " support '''' team for resolution and that I would be contacted in 7 to 10 business days. I checked the report again after a couple weeks and it was still not correct. I called back on XX/XX/2019 and the agent, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], apologized and told me the issue would be escalated to their support team and that I would hear from someone in 3 to 5 business days. She told me to call back in 5 business days if I still had not heard from someone. On XX/XX/2019 I still had not heard so I called again. This time the agent, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], told me it was still with their support team and she would not give me any ETA for resolution. She stated it was out of her hands. I find it unacceptable that it has been over 5 weeks and no action has been taken to resolve this issue. In the meantime any credit checks done on me through Experian are showing I have no credit which is clearly not the case. Note that I also have credit monitoring through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and the information in their systems is complete and correct. Please help me get a resolution to this issue.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'credit monitoring with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] through Experian is not accurate. the information on my credit report is not accurate. the agent told me she');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(50,'02/22/2019','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Problem with a lender or other company charging your account','I had a checking account at BOA, and my balance was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] approx. I had stopped using the account and it sat there unused. The bank started charging a fee for what I understand was lack of use when it was supposed to be free checking ( by the way it was 4-6 years ago. ) from what I can surmise when the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ran out the bank started drawing from a credit line they charged [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and paid it to the account then took [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] per month to pay themselves until it was gone then charged another [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] put it in the account and proceeded to do the same thing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] per month I believe they did this 4 times until I happened to check my credit and realized this was happening and quickly closed the account. how does the bank justify taking money from my credit line, that they are making money on to pay them selves for lack of use on my account,? making interest on money they are paying them selves and charging me? 
got ta be something wrong here hope this is clear','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'the bank started charging a fee for what I understand was lack of use. it started drawing from a credit line they charged [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(51,'02/22/2019','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Written notification about debt','In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I pulled all three credit reports. I noticed an account from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I  disputed the alleged account with all three credit bureaus. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] all three credit bureaus came back as verified. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I received a letter from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. ( Letter enclosed ) Prior to this [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] did not send a dunning notice. They also did not notify me within 30 days of placing negative information into my credit file. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I sent a certified letter asking for validation of alleged account.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I disputed the alleged account with all three credit bureaus. in XX/');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(52,'02/22/2019','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I reported this to the FTC and to the Police. This debt was a result of FRAUD and identity theft. This company continues to harass me.','Michael & Associates, PC',2.0,4.0,'debt was a result of identity theft and FRAUD. this company continues to harass me.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(53,'02/22/2019','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','Stenger and Stenger, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Michigan took me to court for a credit card bill and I asked for proof of debt and the case was rescheduled. They mailed me copies of page 1 statements with a noted balance along with a copy of a standard " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Customer Agreement ''''. When we went back to court they said they would send me statement of fraud forms to fill out which asked me to write my name out 5 times. I have been a victim of fraud several times. The instances have included, but not limited to, social security numbers and taxes on two different occasions and most recently someone attempting to forward a debit card belonging to me to Florida. In no way am I comfortable sending several copies of my signature to a company whose business it is to unscrupulously collect debt from consumers. This is against the law because it is the plaintiff ''s burden to validate debt. The court is not enforcing this and they both have the upper hand because they know the law and I do not. It is my opinion that the court and the credit collector are using fear and intimidation tactics to unlawfully gain money knowing that I am a layman in matters of law. Stenger and Stenger are refusing to validate the debt and instead hoping that I will concede out of fear or be made to pay by the court because I have no way of disproving their claims.','Stenger & Stenger, P.C',2.0,4.0,'a credit card bill was sent to the court and the case was rescheduled. the court is not enforcing this and they both have the upper hand ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(54,'02/21/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','To whom it may concern, I got membership forms and a debit card to reestisablish service with Wells Fargo Bank. Then last year my new credit union paid them for a personal line of credit loan on time, the bank assumed it was delinquent and its still on my credit report.. I went to the credit union to retrieve the statements, my financial expert and your agency without follow through.Last year I went to the credit union to get statements of payment history and all of my payments went out promptly, I called my financial person about this and he didn''t seem interested or was busy and contacted your office without feedback.Thank you. Sincerely yours, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'the bank assumed it was delinquent and its still on my credit report. I went to the credit union to get statements of payment history.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(55,'02/21/2019','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','Step 1. Fraudulent purchases in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Step 2.Unprofessional handling and cooperation from Citibank.

