Step 4. Citibank Billing dispute [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , South Dakota [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Step 5.[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-Citibank- Unknown','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,4.0,'a man claiming he was from the Citibank fraud department received a call from him. he asked if he had made an $800.00 transaction');
