INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(58,'02/20/2019','Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service','Mobile or digital wallet','Fraud or scam','On XX/XX/2019 I was scammed when buying a purse from someone on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The person told me if we can do the transaction through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which was secure. And her bank chase had it. She said nothing to worry about youre money back is guaranteed. And everything was all a scam never got anything try calling back the person the number was disconnected. My bank also Chase couldnt help since they said the transaction was authorized. It is very frustrating! I just lost {$470.00}. I also went to the police department and file a report. And the reason why I knew it was a total scam was because the person had re-posted the bag for sale the next day Saturday.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/2019 scammed when buying a purse from someone on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the person told me if we can do the transaction');
