INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(97,'02/12/2019','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers','I am a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] year old [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] individual receiving social security [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I attempted to take advantage of a program within Medicare/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that allows individuals to attend health centers free of charge from my health insurance. The facility called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  is located in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Florida. 

While signing up for for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  one of the managers offered me to join a separate fitness program that would help with my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The plan consisted eight sessions a month for a hour a session totaling eight sessions a month which would cost {$150.00} per month. He also said that it wasn''t contract and i could stop whenever i wanted. So i decided to sign up thinking that If i didn''t see any meaningful progress I could just stop. 

After giving him my Capital one credit card and swipped it he then informed me I was responsible for three months of sessions at {$150.00} per month. I protested and that he said the program was not a contract and I could stop anytime. He refused to cancelled the fraudulent agreement. 

Immediaately I called Capital one to cancel the credit card payment.The representative at Capital one asked me if the contract agreement say that I had thirty days to cancel. I read the agreement it did state that i had thirty days to cancel.. The Capital one rep. said there was nothing else I needed to do but just wait for my credit care to be credit back the $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].About a later Capital one sent me a letter swhich i have in my possession, saying the 1 {$150.00} was credited bak to my card. 

About a month later Capital one sent me another notice stating the {$150.00} was reapplied back to the merchant an an additional {$300.00} would be credited to the merchant because, " the merchant provided other information that ruled in the merchants favor., When I asked Capital one to provide me with the " other information '''' they tell me anything concrete and I was referred to to an 17 page  document they sent me telling me nothing. 

I feel I am a victim of deception, misrepresentation, and fraud by both Capital one ad [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. As a remedy I want Capital one to credit my account back the {$450.00} they are charging me. 

If any other documentation proving my case is required I can mail or fax you the documents as soon as possible ... .. 

.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'a program within Medicare/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] allows individuals to attend health centers free of charge from my health insurance. the program consisted of eight sessions');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(98,'02/12/2019','Vehicle loan or lease','Loan','Struggling to pay your loan','My car got repossessed On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I''ve bin having issues with the company wellsfargo auto for almost a month an a half and even though I was behind when I got the total amount to get the car back I notice it was un accurate I asked for a transaction history and was able to notice a couple mistakes and I asked them to fix them and they only keep telling me that they have looked over it and they don''t see any mistakes and that they keep adding to the quote they have given me to get the car back but I can clearly see in the copy of my transaction history that they are able to put and remove transactions and I think they just closed my case since they are unable to do anything to benefit me for how many times they look into it instead of fixing it like I''ve asked till today XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] unless they are still looking for my two missing items and also I don''t know what else to say when they keep telling me the same thing even though the information they have given to my credit bureau states about the same amount i''ve bin telling them and I''ve bin trying to get someone else to help me out with this but even a banker  agrees with me and have tried to talk to them won''t do.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'my car got repossessed on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I''ve bin having issues with the company wellsfargo');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(99,'02/11/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','I have contacted this bureau numerous of times to remove these unauthorized hard inquiries. They have not responded back to me regarding this very important matter. They are not cooperating and its very frustrating that this bureau is reporting inaccurate information.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'unauthorized hard inquiries have been removed by this bureau. they have not responded back to me regarding this very important matter.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(100,'02/11/2019','Debt collection','Other debt','Threatened to contact someone or share information improperly','The complaint is against [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ... .[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] made a call to my current employer on XX/XX/2019 and spoke with someone in HR in lengths about an alleged debt ... .they told the HR person all about the alleged debt I may owe ... [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] made it seem as if I was going to jail behind this debt..They told the person in HR that if I didn''t contact them then I will be going to court for the alleged debt. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   then stated to the HR person the amount and court fees if they don''t get in contact with me ... Not only did the person in HR was told this ... but someone else was in her office and she had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  on speaker phone so another employee heard all of this to ... [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  even went as far as asking HR could they send a certified letter to my job for someone to sign for..I work at night so it would be impossible for me to sign for a certified letter.which in turn means anyone can/would sign for further exposing this alleged debt to unknown persons other than myself [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] also stated since they don''t have my address they are going to send a certified letter to my job ... The HR personnel was so worried after the phone call she texted me a message in this regard.. I do have that text message saved also. I''ve at the same address for 17yrs ... I called the number left [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/ case number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to see what this was all about on XX/XX/2019 ... ..The representative of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] told me if I didn''t pay then it would cost me [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in legal fees plus alleged debit of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( + ) if I didn''t pay ... .He made it seem as if court documents had already been filed when no paperwork was filed for a case in court .... I asked for a debt validation letter but have not received it as of this date .... XX/XX/2019 ....','Assured Financial Partners',2.0,2.0,'alleged debt is alleged to be a debt. if a person in HR doesn''t contact them then he will be going to court. if they don');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(101,'02/11/2019','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Trouble during payment process','I received a bright green notice on the front of my property from the Tax collector ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) indicating that my property was up for auction in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], due to non-payment of taxes for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have all my taxes and insurances escrowed in my mortgage payment which I have never missed since purchasing the property at the end of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I attempted numerous times to contact [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they referred me to the tax collector -- and I never was able to get a resolve because the taxes were not paid and the tax collector stated I needed to settle this with my mortgage company. After several months I became increasingly concerned - having checked my escrowed amounts online and seeing that all was escrowed in properly. I contacted a lawyer to assist me. During the course of his investigation he stated that finally the tax collector had a long conversation with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which stated they had actually mistakenly applied the tax payments on the property to a parcel listed under my address but in a different location???? How can that be? Suddenly, my taxes all were paid within a week. Thinking this was resolved, I was relieved. The next mortgage bill was drastically higher - $ 900+ which showed that they actually " fronted '''' my " shortage '''' of paying my taxes and now required me to pay an additional {$900.00} a month in my mortgage payment til I am " caught up '''' at the end of this year. The total they stated was the amount escrowed that they stated was paid by them on the late taxes. I have paid a lawyer over {$3000.00} to not be resolved yet. I paid my mortgage amount in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they cashed my check but still showed I am in arrears on the amount they say I owe them. I just received a notice from them that they will no longer accept any amount of mortgage lower than their required amount of over {$2700.00}! I have forwarded all this information and documentation to my lawyer who is trying to get this resolved but has not yet succeeded. I also had received a letter from the " Chairman '''' stating that they were looking into this and would let me know the results. I have yet to hear a result. My lawyer has requested [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  audit my account and has not been given any results as well. They have admitted to improperly paying my property taxes that were escrowed into my mortgage on a parcel that was listed as my address but was not my property? This is fraud. Now I am being forced to have my credit ruined due to their error and am locked out from paying my mortgage by them. I need help! I need this to be resolved before my credit is ruined. I have a monthly lawyer bill and he can not even get a resolve after nearly 6 months as well as now a " late fee '''' on my mortgage payments each month for the " overage '''' they say they paid for me.','CITIZENS FINANCIAL GROUP, INC.',2.0,4.0,'tax collector referred me to the tax collector. he said they mistakenly applied the tax payments on the property. he said they had a shortage of paying my taxes');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(102,'02/11/2019','Debt collection','Private student loan debt','Written notification about debt','NAVIENT STUDENT LOAN DEBT. AS A STUDENT AT [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] IN  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] FLORIDA. I DID NOT KNOW THAT A PRIVATE LOAN SHOULD NEVER BE AN OPTION, IF YOU COULD QUALIFY FOR A SUBSIDIZED OR NON-SUBSIZEDI LOAN. THEY REALY WERE UNINFORMATIVE OF THE RAMIFICATIONS THIS TYPE OF LOAN COULD PRESENT TO ME. THAT FORBEARANCE WAS REALLY NOT A HUGE OPTION WITH THESE TYPE OF LOANS. 

EVEN AS RECENT AT FRIDAY XX/XX/2019 EVEN THOUGH I HAVE TOLD THEM I DO NOT HAVE THE FUNDS TO PAY THAT HAVE INSISTED IN AN UNAFFORDABLE PAYMENT TO COME FROM ME.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'a PRIVATE LOAN SHOULD NEVER BE AN OPTION. EVEN THOUGH I HAVE TOLD THEM I DO NOT HAVE THE FUNDS');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(103,'02/11/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I received a denial letter on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2019, from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a car loan, due to information supplied by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reporting bureau. The credit score they supplied for me was 70 points below the other 3 reporting agencies. My husband ''s score was 110 points lower than the other 3 agencies. I have no idea who this company is or how they are authorized to report on my credit status. From the information I have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is the only Bank using this company. They are definitely not using the industry standard for Credt Scores. They have made up their own numbers ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and they are affecting my credit score and my ability to get credit. They also listed something about not having my phone number long enough. I have had the same phone number for 40 years. How can I stop them from lowering my credit score that we have worked the last 40 years to establish?','ID Analytics, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'credit reporting bureau supplied information to me. credit score was 70 points below the other 3 reporting agencies.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(104,'02/10/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I reviewed my credit report recently and notice some items that i did not authorize. I did not authorize these items and I need these items removed from my credit report. This is totally unacceptable. N/A ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] PA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , GA EMER [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I''m doing this on my own behalf. I contacted the Ftc and my local police.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'i did not authorize these items and need them removed from my credit report. this is totally unacceptable. i contacted the police and my local police.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(105,'02/10/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] OH [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : Notice for Proof of Claim Account No. : # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] To Whom it may Concern : This is a legal and notarized document. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .States Credit contracts are non-assignable even if the contract has a clause for assign ability because it violates contract Law. Where there is no fair valuable consideration given, the contract or agreement is void ab inito. The debt is nontransferable. 
If it is a contract for credit or goes to the character of the parties, it can not be transferred or assigned. No state can make a law impairing contracts, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] v. 
