INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(125,'02/05/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','TODAYS DATE : XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] IN RESPONSE TO CFPB COMPLAINT IN ASKING FOR 60 DAYS TO RESPOND [ Subject of Letter : Suppression Request ] To Whom It May Concern : According to federal credit law spelled out in the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), a credit bureau is required to respond to you and complete their investigation within 30 days. 
I would like to request the suppression of the following items from my credit report, which are the result of my falling victim to identity theft. This information does not relate to [ transactions that I have made/accounts that I have opened ], as the attached supporting documentation can attest. As such, it should be blocked from appearing on my credit report pursuant to section 605B of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Miscellaneous Reptg. Agencies [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Miscellaneous Reptg. Agencies [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Telephone Companies [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Retail, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Miscellaneous Reptg. Agencies [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Inquiry from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Supporting documents are enclosed with this letter. Please let me know if any additional information is needed. Furthermore, when you accept this request, please send the notifications required by the FCRA to all furnishers of the blocked information. 
Sincerely, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] SOC SEC # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] DOB XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ADDRESS [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], FL [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] FCRA 605B ( 15 U.S.C. 1681c-2 ) ( a ) Block.  Except as otherwise provided in this section, a consumer reporting agency shall block the reporting of any information in the file of a consumer that the consumer identifies as information that resulted from an alleged identity theft, not later than 4 business days after the date of receipt by such agency of ( 1 ) appropriate proof of the identity of the consumer ; ( 2 ) a copy of an identity theft report ; ( 3 ) the identification of such information by the consumer ; and ( 4 ) a statement by the consumer that the information is not information relating to any transaction by the consumer. ( b ) Notification. A consumer reporting agency shall promptly notify the furnisher of information identified by the consumer under subsection ( a ) of this section ( 1 ) that the information may be a result of identity theft ; ( 2 ) that an identity theft report has been filed ; ( 3 ) that a block has been requested under this section ; and ( 4 ) of the effective dates of the block. ( c ) Authority to decline or rescind. ( 1 ) In general. A consumer reporting agency may decline to block, or may rescind any block, of information relating to a consumer under this section, if the consumer reporting agency reasonably determines that ( A ) the information was blocked in error or a block was requested by the consumer in error ; ( B ) the information was blocked, or a block was requested by the consumer, on the basis of a material misrepresentation of fact by the consumer relevant to the request to block ; or ( C ) the consumer obtained possession of goods, services, or money as a result of the blocked transaction or transactions. ( 2 ) Notification to consumer. If a block of information is declined or rescinded under this subsection, the affected consumer shall be notified promptly, in the same manner as consumers are notified of the reinsertion of information under section 1681i ( a ) ( 5 ) ( B ) of this title. ( 3 ) Significance of block. For purposes of this subsection, if a consumer reporting agency rescinds a block, the presence of information in the file of a consumer prior to the blocking of such information is not evidence of whether the consumer knew or should have known that the consumer obtained possession of any goods, services, or money as a result of the block. ( d ) Exception for resellers. ( 1 ) No reseller file. This section shall not apply to a consumer reporting agency, if the consumer reporting agency ( A ) is a reseller ; ( B ) is not, at the time of the request of the consumer under subsection ( a ) of this section, otherwise furnishing or reselling a consumer report concerning the information identified by the consumer ; and ( C ) informs the consumer, by any means, that the consumer may report the identity theft to the Bureau to obtain consumer information regarding identity theft. ( 2 ) Reseller with file. The sole obligation of the consumer reporting agency under this section, with regard to any request of a consumer under this section, shall be to block the consumer report maintained by the consumer reporting agency from any subsequent use, if ( A ) the consumer, in accordance with the provisions of subsection ( a ) of this section, identifies, to a consumer reporting agency, information in the file of the consumer that resulted from identity theft ; and ( B ) the consumer reporting agency is a reseller of the identified information. ( 3 ) Notice. In carrying out its obligation under paragraph ( 2 ), the reseller shall promptly provide a notice to the consumer of the decision to block the file. Such notice shall contain the name, address, and telephone number of each consumer reporting agency from which the consumer information was obtained for resale. ( e ) Exception for verification companies. The provisions of this section do not apply to a check services company, acting as such, which issues authorizations for the purpose of approving or processing negotiable instruments, electronic fund transfers, or similar methods of payments, except that, beginning 4 business days after receipt of information described in paragraphs ( 1 ) through ( 3 ) of subsection ( a ) of this section, a check services company shall not report to a national consumer reporting agency described in section 1681a ( p ) of this title, any information identified in the subject identity theft report as resulting from identity theft. ( f ) Access to blocked information by law enforcement agencies. No provision of this section shall be construed as requiring a consumer reporting agency to prevent a Federal, State, or local law enforcement agency from accessing blocked information in a consumer file to which the agency could otherwise obtain access under this subchapter.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a credit bureau is required to respond to you and complete their investigation within 30 days. a credit bureau is required to respond to you and complete their investigation. this information does not');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(126,'02/05/2019','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','My name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I had a small business account at TD Bank at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], VA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The name on the account was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

Three months ago I noticed a deposit of {$4000.00}. I had no idea who made the deposit and I went directly to my bank to see what was going on. It seems someone made 4 {$1000.00} deposits to the bank and I notified [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a financial services representative of the bank that this was a fraud. She then froze my account and I was locked out and I could not even get a to see my account online. 

In three days they found out that as I told them the checks were no good and the bank still keep my account frozen and charged me 4 {$20.00} fees and a charge for being overdrawn. I was not allowed to make any deposits into my account from the moment it was frozen.

The bank made me fill out an affidavit of fraud for each check and they sent me a copy of the check for me to review. All four check where never signed by issuing party and the signature on the back of the checks was not mine.

I have made 9 trips to the bank and I was informed that someone sent in another check for around {$9800.00} while the account was frozen and they accepted it but they have never shown me a copy of the check and this one also bounced and once again the charged me {$20.00} for a return check and {$35.00} for a service charge. 

I received a call from the fraud department and I made them call the head teller to verify that this person worked for the bank. After I talked to this individual he informed me that he was looking into the matter and would get back to me. I have never heard from this person since that call. 

I have been working with the head teller, assistant manager and two financial reps and I was informed that the bank was working on it and I had no worries and they were not going to do anything until the end of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

At the end of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they closed my account and turned it over to a third party to collect the fees the bank charged for the bad checks, even though my account was frozen part of the time and they were warned that the checks were a fraud.','TD BANK US HOLDING COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'a bank representative of the bank told me that this was a fraud. the bank made me fill out an affidavit of fraud for each check. the bank');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(127,'02/05/2019','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','Trying to get the {$5000.00} [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] forgiveness towards my student loans which will effectively eliminate my loan. I have filled out all required paperwork twice and they keep rejecting it for no reason given. I keep being told to resubmit. Plus they never tell me when it is reject ed.

This has cost me substantial money for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. There is already several class actions against [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for many reasons regarding these kinds of practices.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'attempting to get the $5000.00 forgiveness towards my student loans. I have filled out all required paperwork twice and they keep rejecting it for no reason given. there');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(128,'02/05/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','Chase is inaccurately reporting on 2 accounts on my credit reports for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have contacted the company repeatedly with inaccurate information and closing of one account on my credit reports and it has not been resolved. The payment history is inaccurate and showing late payments.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'Chase is inaccurately reporting on 2 accounts on my credit reports. the payment history is inaccurate and showing late payments.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(129,'02/04/2019','Vehicle loan or lease','Lease','Managing the loan or lease','I turned in my vehicle to end my lease on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I got a letter stating my account was closed with a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I got a letter dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating that the state of Va assessed property taxes on the closed leased account, and that I could submit a bill of sale statement to have an abatement filed. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I called to see where I could send the requested information since it was not included in the letter. I was told they would get back with me. I still haven''t heard anything back. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I get a call from the collections department at GM Financial telling me my account is 15 days past due. I spoke with a mgr named [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] requesting that the abatement option be removed and to send me an invoice so I could pay the balance. I was told she had to reach out to the tax department to have a bill " CREATED ''''. I even asked so " I am being told I am 15 days late on something that hasn''t even been created yet? '''' On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I get a letter in the mail saying they were the documents I asked for, attached was a copy of mXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statement. Not at all what I asked for, and was incorrect in the amount due. So on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called and talked to another mgr named [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] assured me that he would indeed reach out to the proper channel and have the statement created as it still was not done, even said he would email it to me. I asked what would happen to my credit rating since time was passing and it was already past due, he said it would all be taken care of, but first the invoice needed to be sent. I even asked if there was a free option to pay my bill. Was told online, but that is only on an open account, and if I paid by phone there would be an additional [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] fee. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called again, spoke with mgr [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Explained everything and how I still have no invoice sent, even though I have begged for one to be created and mailed/emailed. I was then told " GM Financial is unable to create an invoice for a closed account, and the taxes were billed to them electronically, If I wanted a statement, I would need to go to my local tax office. '''' Even though my local tax office is not the ones saying I am past due. I asked the mgr " How is any consumer expected to pay a bill, if there is no communication sent to inform them of the amount due, due date, account number to pay, and address to send payment. '''' I was told I learned about it when they called to collect the funds after being past due for 15 days! Even if that is true, with the number of phishing/scam calls made from " financial '''' fraudsters I would never randomly pay something over the phone without being able to confirm it in hard/soft copy verification.

Any Financial Institution is legally required to send a statement/invoice and allow 28 days for payment from the closing date of the invoice. In my case a statement/invoice has not even been created, nor sent .... but is being reported as past due to all of the credit reporting companies, decreasing my credit score, credit worthiness, and brand. Even without the expected documents sent I have sent in my payment to be processed, I would like the negative factors removed and correct to the credit reporting  agencies, as the company has failed to take ownership of the issue. I have never been late on my payments in fact I paid about 15 days early each month.','GENERAL MOTORS FINANCIAL COMPANY, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a letter from a mgr requesting an abatement was sent. a mgr called me asking for the abatement option to be removed. he said');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(130,'02/04/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','Date : XX/XX/2019 Place : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] checkout counter in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], CA The associate told us that if we sign up for store membership, we would get additional discount, but when he asked for my SSN to sign up, I asked him, if this is a credit card application. He replied Yes. So, I asked him that I would like to opt out. He said, he has pulled out the application and my credit is not affected. 
I checked my experian account and a credit inquiry had already been posted. 

Date : XX/XX/2019 [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] AM PST I called Experian to dispute the enquiry and the redirected me to talk to MACYs only. 

Date : XX/XX/2019 [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] AM PST I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] asking them to withdraw the enquiry and the associate on call, told me that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] will not do anything to withdraw the enquiry. I even told them, if they can get the checkout associate on conference call, I can get a confirmation on the series of events to which they said, they won''t do that either.Also, I asked them if there''s an email Id in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to which I can write for my grievance redressal, to which they said, " Only verbal confirmation can be provided ''''','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'a credit inquiry has been posted on the experian account. the associate asked them to withdraw the enquiry. he asked them to withdraw the enquiry.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(131,'02/04/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','My family moved from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Michigan and there was no TCF Bank / [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  in the town we moved to. We did a change of address because we still had a couple bank accounts open with TCF Bank / [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They changed all of our accounts over however missed one. Somehow [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] put some unauthorized charges through our account causing overdrafts and a negative balance. TCF Bank sent notices to our old address and there was no one living at that address so the mail did not get forwarded. By the time we knew about the account being negative TCF Bank had sent it to collections within a month. TCF Bank / [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never called us or anything, instead their rude obnoxious collections company was the first we heard of a {$260.00} negative balance. I called customer service and could have paid them right away, however they told me there was nothing they could do. They told me I could go through the collections company or I could go right to the bank branch and take care of it. Over our holiday break on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], we drove 220 miles to  the closest TCF Bank / [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. We paid the balance and got a receipt. The employees at the branch treated us very well, they were very nice at the branch level. Two weeks later, on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we received notification that the " unpaid '''' balance had been put on both myself and my wife ''s credit! I called the branch and they said they would take care of it right away and for some reason our payment had not been applied. About a week later we were still getting calls about this unpaid balance from the rude obnoxious collections company. I called the branch again and they said it has been taken care of however it is still on our credit! See also my complaint on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to the CFPB regarding TCF Bank / [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Maybe they are just incompetent when it comes to customer service at their main office, maybe it''s coincidence, maybe they are targeting me and my family. My wife is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and this is all very stressful! TCF Bank soon to be TCF Bank / [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  has horrible customer service, deceptive bank products and gouges their customers with high unnecessary fees. I want this taken off me and my wife ''s credit or we are considering talking to a lawyer.','TCF NATIONAL BANK',2.0,4.0,'a couple of accounts were changed over but they missed one. the bank had sent it to collections within a month. the bank was the first we heard of a negative balance');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(132,'02/04/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','On or around XX/XX/2019 I called Citibank to inquire as to why my credit account was not updated for the month of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Upon asking why it has not been updated I was told it was because of having a {$0.00} balance that they are not required to update, in essence keeping the last update months behind and that is not transparent or factual when it comes to keeping my disclosure current. I called again on XX/XX/2019 and spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and as I explained or at least tried to, she mid conversation cut me off and said her manager has just told her that she would update my account with the Bureaus. She lied, today is XX/XX/2019 and contacted Citibank again and was told that if I could not fax or mail a copy of my financial disclosure that they could not help me even when I explained to them that I am [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and dont have access to a Fax machine or copier to be able to start a dispute with them. Upon me telling me that I couldnt meet those expectations I was told to dispute with reporting bureaus or Cfpb. So here I am starting an investigation to accomplish something Citibank could have done with a few keystrokes. The lack of empathy and general concern for their customers is astonishingly Absurd. In conclusion, all I want is for Citibank to update my disclosure every month.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'Citibank has not updated my credit account for the month of XX/XX/2019. Upon me telling me that I couldnt meet those expectations I was told to dispute with');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(133,'02/03/2019','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage','Bank of america was adjusting my account for lowering the payments and did not post my sent payments to the loan to show the government that we are behind, but we paid all on time direct deposit from my account every month. So this account is paid is full and shows late payments from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. We have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] kids and this is hurting us whenever we go for a car loan or refinance a mortgage. Please kind help us and our family will be thankful to you','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'bank of america was adjusting my account for lowering the payments. we paid all on time direct deposit from my account every month. this account is paid is full and shows late');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(134,'02/03/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I want [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account and collection removed from my credit reports. Ordered products from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] all the way back in 2013, never received my order as it was sent to an incorrect address I no longer lived at in a different state. I dont know how they got that address as that''s not what I put. When I saw it was being shipped to incorrect address I contacted right away to inform to change address as it hadnt actually shipped yet. They refused to change to correct address. After they shipped, I contacted fedex and they said the shipper could change the address with them for delivery. They would not. Was delivered to my old address in different state. I even contacted apt office at that address and they said my package was delivered there but they gave it back to fedex to return to sender since I didn''t live there anymore. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] should have received package back but still kept my bill for order as is. They would not reship to me. Obviously I was not going to keep paying for an order and goods I never received. No one would help me with this and ended up getting bill sent to collections with collection account and closed/charged off [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account show on my credit report which is not fair again for goods I never even got. Collection company would not remove when I disputed. I have screenshots from 2013 of all the emails I sent to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] informing about the address and trying to get them to do something.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'i want collection removed from my credit reports. ordered products from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] all the way back in 2013. i contacted fedex');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(135,'02/02/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','Experian keeps rejecting my disputes and falsely marking my complaints here as duplicates. They just did it again to another recent complaint and I am sick and tired of it. WHAT AM I SUPPOSED TO DO WHEN THEY REFUSE TO INVESTIGATE AND REFUSE TO DELETE ACCOUNTS THAT HAVE VIOLATIONS? Thanks to their illegal antics, I have been dealing with them for basically a year now of disputing because they''ve refused to do anything about accounts that have been -- and still are -- illegally reporting in my credit file. Each time a dispute has been requested, EXPERIAN NEVER INVESTIGATED and they NEVER REGARDED THE SHEER VIOLATIONS ON THE DISPUTED ACCOUNTS. This alone is a violation! In fact, I discovered based on the old " dates of status '''' in my report and online ( when I log in to my account ) that they have not investigated the majority of the disputed accounts ALL OF XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] & so far in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when I''ve disputed! THIS IS A VIOLATION AND MEANS THAT THEY MUST DELETE ALL DISPUTED ACCOUNTS AND MUST UPDATE THE ACCOUNTS TO POSITIVE ( which I note in my attachment ). On top of that is the fact that 1 ) There''s an account I have REPEATEDLY noted as reporting CONCURRENTLY AS " OPEN '''' AND " CLOSED '''' when it is in fact a closed account ; 2 ) There are a couple of RE-AGED ACCOUNTS ; 3 ) The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts are all reporting as late in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but I WAS NEVER LATE in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; 4 )  Two collection accounts are reporting " past due '''' when COLLECTIONS ARE NOT SUPPOSED TO REPORT A " PAST DUE ''''. Moreover, Experian sneakily includes the " past due '''' in the " status '''' ; and 5 ) There  are lots of DIFFERENT, CONFLICTING DATES on many of the accounts! This is all FACTUAL INFORMATION THAT IS VERY CLEARLY REPORTING IN EXPERIAN ''S VERY DATABASE! Yet, they have repeatedly responded refusing to investigate or even pretending to investigate while actually doing nothing at all. In fact, one of the creditors ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], formerly [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) of an account I''m disputing even said in a letter to me dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], " ... we do note that the customer has submitted multiple credit reporting disputes via [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ... ''''. Experian has been using automated systems like [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and 3rd parties to " verify '''' info, TOTALLY DISREGARDING MY DISPUTES, which is a violation of consumer law! They pass investigation off to the creditors WITHOUT DOING THEIR OWN INVESTIGATIONS and WITHOUT GETTING PROOF FROM THEM! And, they do what they did recently ( as well as a time or two before ), which is to COMPLETELY REFUSE to do anything. All of these tactics are not only absolutely ridiculous, but they''re DANGEROUS and NEGLIGENT! My credit file and my time are not a game to play with! Again, I''ve attached the disputed accounts in a document and have included my SS card and ID. PLEASE EXPEDITE THIS DISPUTE!','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'experian has refused to do anything about accounts that have been illegally reporting in my credit file. a dispute has been a violation, and they have not investigated the majority of');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(136,'02/02/2019','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Payday loan','Charged fees or interest you didn''t expect','My balance just keeps increases no matter the amount I pay. It continues to rise instead of decreasing from my payments.','CURO Intermediate Holdings',6.0,6.0,'my balance keeps increases no matter the amount I pay. it continues to rise instead of decreasing from my payments.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(137,'02/02/2019','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Other features, terms, or problems','American Express offered a statement credit of {$150.00} for spending {$750.00} on a cruise associated with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). This was POID :  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the offer expired [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I read the terms and conditions in the entirety and the following was listed " Excludes if not booked at time of reservation : airfare booked through cruise line, excursions, Prepaid food/beverage programs, ... ''''. When booking the cruise, I booked additional excursions and selected prepaid beverages while making the original reservation. While reviewing the reservation, I noticed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s website did not bundle these purchases together. I was going to have to pay for these items in separate transactions. 
On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], prior to paying, I placed a call to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] customer service and asked if there was a way for these three separate transactions to be processed together with the reservation. I was advised due to different " cost centers '''', the reservation, excursions, and food/beverages transactions are processed separately. 
Still prior to paying ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), I called American Express to discuss the offer details and inquire whether having three transactions come through at the same time and aggregate over the {$750.00} threshold for the offer will still count. The person I spoke with placed me on hold and discussed with the offers department the details of the offer. I was then advised the as long as the threshold was reached, the offer would apply. Notes were supposed to be added to my account detailing my concern prior to making the purchase, in case the offer didn''t process. I was advised the offer should process in 6 weeks. 
I proceeded to pay for the reservation on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the following posted to my account : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  - [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], FL - {$35.00} [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  - [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], FL - {$320.00} [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], FL - {$520.00} These 3 purchases combined crossed the {$750.00} threshold and were made at the time of reservation. I called American Express on or about XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] because no credit had applied. I was advised they saw the offer and it was still awaiting processing. I was told to wait 2 more weeks. 
I called again XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was advised at that time there were no notes on my file about the offer. The representative I spoke with submitted a complaint for review. I was told the complaint would be reviewed and to follow up in two weeks. 
I called again on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and advised the representative there was a complaint filed, but I lost the complaint #. I was advised there was no complaint and I did not qualify for the offer. The representative spoke with the offers department and connected back with me advising the way the purchases were made did not qualify. I told them I was advised by their company the offer would be applicable, which is why I made the purchase. I was told a complaint would be submitted to the offer ''s department for review and to call back in 2 weeks. 
I called again on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was escalated to management and spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( badge # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). I was again advised that I did not qualify for the offer due to how the purchases came through. I requested the original call be pulled for review to verify I was told the purchase would qualify. I was told the call would be pulled by their back end team and if there was a reversal of the decision, I would receive a call within 5 working days. If there was no reversal, my account would be updated with notes why. 
I called back on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The representative I spoke with placed me on hold to speak with management and when reconnected, I was advised the call was still being pulled for review and there was no official decision. I was told to call back after the weekend for an update. 
I called again on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was told the call was still being pulled for review and these things take up to 15 working days to resolve. I was told by the manager, it would be complete within 5 working days. I provided the details of who I spoke with previously to the current representative. The representative I spoke with acknowledged who the manager was and stated they would put in an escalated request from the same manager to call me back within 4 hours. I consented to American Express contacting me directly and have not received any follow up since. 
This issue has been going on for nearly 4 months with no resolution. I have placed a total of 6 follow up calls and have done by due diligence trying to resolve this with American Express directly.','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'american Express offered a statement credit of $150.00 for spending $750.00 on a cruise associated with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(138,'02/01/2019','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','Called Discover to dispute chargers under [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] around in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after trying to resolve issue with the company. Discover gave me the credit, but retracted back. I provided enough information to Discover, and clearly stated that those charges where not allowed. Company was really fishy, not returning calls, which phone number was only one, and it was the only way to get a hold of anyone. Discover postponed the evaluation, and finally declined my disputes after knowing that company closed on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Company/Seller never replied to Discover. I submitted proof of attempted getting something in writing, but how will the company reply when the company was planning to close and steal my money without me knowing. The companys phone number was only one, never return calls, and when i finally get the email, no reply whatsoever. Discover is saying that the charges are valid because the company/seller didnt confirm cancelation. The last call i made was on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and customer service/dispute told me she couldnt do anything. When i asked to speak with someone else, she did not direct me to anyone. I provided enough proof and clearly stated that the company was scamming me. Now Discover is making pay {$1700.00} when the company/seller was a complete scam, and Discover only  excuse is that the company didnt reply. Please help.','DISCOVER BANK',2.0,2.0,'Discover retracted the credit, but gave me the credit. company/seller never replied to Discover. Discover is saying that the charges are valid because the company/seller didn');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(139,'02/01/2019','Student loan','Private student loan','Incorrect information on your report','I am writing to express my dissatisfaction with the level of service I have received from Lendkey Technologies Inc.

I recently reviewed my credit report and found that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reported late payments on my credit report for the months of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which were periods in which the account was in an approved forbearance status and the required payment was submitted directly to the insurer of the loan, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]- Forbearance was approved and a payment was made on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the amount of {$270.00} to cover XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment.

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]- Forbearance was approved from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with a required payment of {$0.00} per the attached correspondence sent by your office.

Additionally, I contacted the office to submit a payment via phone on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to satisfy the payment for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This item was reported on my credit report as 30-59 days past due. When I contacted the office to have this matter resolved, the agent advised that there was no record of my calling to make a payment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the ''system '' reflects that I called on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The agent further advised that the calls are recorded, and I am confident that this call can be retrieved to validate my timely phone payment. No further action was taken by the company to investigate this matter and the negative reporting remains.

I contacted the loan servicer yet again on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after noticing that my payment for the month of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was reflecting as 30-59 days past due. I explained to the representative that I submitted my payment online on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with a payment effective date of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The agent advised that due to the holiday, the processing time was delayed and that my request to have this updated would be submitted to his supervisor and that I should expect a call back within 1-3 business days. Nearly two weeks passed and I contacted the servicer on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after I submitted a credit dispute which had an unfavorable outcome. The agent initially advised that there was no record of my call on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and after an extended hold came back and was able to validate my call. The agent advised that I was " next on the call list '''' which I do not believe to be true. The agent further advised that although my payment was submitted with an effective date of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], it was not processed until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and that the negative reporting would remain.

The payment effective date is the date in which the payment takes effect, which is the date the payment was submitted ( if within business hours ) not the date that the payment is actually processed and credited to the account. I make all of my payments on the same date due to my pay schedule and if the effective date was the processing date as the agent suggested ALL of my payments would be 30-59 days past due which is not the case.

My dealings with this company has been a nightmare. Phone calls are not returned, files are not documented, status updates are not accurate, the website reflects data such as payment effective dates, which is not consistent with the credit reporting, and the level of ignorance displayed by some of the agents is shocking as they are not able to answer simple question regarding payment effective dates and credit reporting. The defer to their supervisors and ensure a call back within 1-3 business days, which never occur.

The negative credit reporting has had a significant impact on providing for my family and the refusal to update the inaccuracies is a poor business practice and has created a huge issue with refinancing this loan. I would like to have this matter expeditiously resolved without taking legal action.','LendKey Technologies, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] were periods');
