INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(147,'01/31/2019','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Incorrect information on your report','For a long time I was pushed into applying for a forbearance by Navient. It was only a few years ago that I was told about an income driven repayment plan. I was told to make 3 payments and it would make me eligible for low monthly payments. I made those 3 payments and only then was I told about income based repayment. I''ve been on that program for a few years now and although my payments have been {$0.00} I''ve noticed recently on my credit report that my balance on these 3 federal student loans varies by thousands each month. My balance will go up from {$1000.00} to over {$5000.00} and then will go back down. I have only recently started monitoring my credit report so I''m not sure how long this has been going on. Its devastating my credit score and making me wonder what is really going on and am I being used for fraud or something else illegal. I took these loans out almost 10 years ago and have had no help until a few years ago with a payment plan to pay them off. I''ve accrued so much interest the loan amount has almost doubled and that''s ridiculous for a diploma that I cant even use.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',4.0,6.0,'a few years ago, I was told about an income driven repayment plan. a few years ago, I was told about an income driven repayment plan. my balance on these 3');
