INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(154,'01/30/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was informed by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was involved in a large data breach where my account and personal information were compromised. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I reviewed my credit report I noticed several fraudulent accounts I believe to be from this breach. I would like the incorrect documented information on my credit report removed immediately.Thank You.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was informed by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(155,'01/29/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','Please see attached Credit Reports for all three credit bureaus. The following changes have occurred since those credit reports where pulled XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : - My hard inquiries have decreased from ( approximately ) 7 to 2 ( depending on the Bureau. Please see attached documentation ). This change is a significant difference but it isn''t reflected in my score and no increases have occurred to account for it.

- All of the accounts payments listed on my reports pulled XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] were listed as okay ( " OK '''' ) and most of the amounts paid were reported. The new credit reports ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]) all omitted this valuable information ( listed as " NA '''' or nothing at all with not payment amounts ) and it lowers the evaluation score pulled by lenders.

- My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Loans length is not displayed and shows that my loans activity has started in XX/XX/XXXXbut the loans age should not be changed because the lender is the same and only the servicer has changed.

- My U.S. Education Loans were once only reported as one loan even though there were actually two. This has since been changed but didn''t increase my credit history average.

- I have attached [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  credit card statements for your review. You will notice that there are occasions when my credit card utilization is high. If you reference my XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XXXXt bank statements you will notice that there was a credit card utilization of {$900.00} ( approximately 9 % utilization ). No factors in my credit, debit or purchases have changed since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but this past [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I utilized approximately 9 % and my score went down 10 points instead of three. The recommended utilization for a credit card is 20 % and I barely use half of that so my credit card score shouldn''t have even gone down three points this past [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and certainly not 10. There is no reason for this change and I believe that they are using unfair practices to evaluate my score by miss reporting information.

- My on-time payments, my consistently low credit card utilization and my decrease in hard inquiries on my account should have significantly increased my credit score but information has been changed and inaccurately reported resulting in my credit score only going up 7 points ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  > [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), 0 points ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] > [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ), and -1 point ( Equifax [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]>[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ). I have attached the full credit reports from XX/XX/XXXXfor all three bureaus. You can review the soft [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to review the credit scores that I had at that time.

damage ever since.

- The first time I called to address the why my score went down I was told that my score didn''t change, the second time I called I was told that the score is low because of two late payments back in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. But I have been recovering from that damage for four years now and its impact on my score shouldn''t have changed because all the factors in my reports have stayed the same. I talked to about 7 different representatives and finally, after asking how I could report this, she referred me to Consumerfinance.gov.','EQUIFAX, INC.',4.0,4.0,'credit bureaus have changed their credit history average. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts were listed as okay. XX');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(156,'01/29/2019','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I received and escrow analysis showing the account with SLS had a surplus in the account. The account was not current and the letter indicated that the check would be refunded when the account was brought current. As an executor of my mother ''s estate I contacted the company. Made the payment to bring the account current. SLS shows the account current as XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was told I would have the surplus check within 2 weeks. 
Did not happen. I waited until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to follow up again. I was told I would have the check in hand by XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The delay was because they had not filled out the correct form internally to get the check released. 
Today is XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I followed up agian and was told that they would be changing my escrow account in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they would look at sending the check out sometime next month. This is causing there to be late charges to the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment since these are the funds that were to be used to pay XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s payment. They told me that was not their problem and they would also be assessing an additional late charge. I have been transferred from one person to another and placed on hold for over an hour. 
It is my understanding that they should have resolved the escrow surplus within 30 days. They have surpassed this time period and as a result of keeping our funds they are causing other late fees and charges. I just finished talking with them and they are going to see what they can do and will let me know when they find out. No time frame.','Specialized Loan Servicing LLC',2.0,2.0,'escrow analysis shows the account with SLS had a surplus in the account. the account was not current and the letter indicated that the check would be refunded when the account');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(157,'01/29/2019','Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service','Mobile or digital wallet','Fraud or scam','Buying items off of the website " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' and one of the sellers with paypal ( which is the current situation I''m in ) didn''t give me the product. On paypal, I paid " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' {$17.00} cents on XX/XX/2019, current day. Paid {$17.00} with my current balance on paypal, and the rest of the fees with my credit card. Contacted him, never responded and blocked me on all current areas where I could get a hold of him from.','PAYPAL HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,2.0,'a seller with paypal didn''t give me the product. he never responded and blocked me on all current areas where I could get a hold of him.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(158,'01/29/2019','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage','I applied for a conventional mortgage with Third Federal Savings and Loan. My application was denied. My loan officer was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( NMLS [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) who called me to share this information with me and said the reason was because of a settlement that I made on a 2nd mortgage I did back in XX/XX/2013. When I asked [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] if there was a time frame until I can reapply again she told me " Probably never again ''''. I asked her to please send me a formal denial letter from management and one was never sent to me in writing.','THIRD FEDERAL SAVINGS & LOAN ASSOCIATION OF CLEVELAND',2.0,2.0,'third federal savings and loan officer called me to share information with me. she said the reason was because of a settlement that I made on a 2nd mortgage. she told me');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(159,'01/29/2019','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','Specialized Loan Servicing : loan number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The above named company has assumed my loan since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They sent me a mortgage bill for {$5800.00} when my previous mortgage was {$1300.00}. However, I was paying {$1500.00} before to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] before my loan got sold to them. When I attempted to make a payment after speaking with them, they would not accept it unless I was going to pay {$5800.00}. I made several attempts to do so and the same response again. When asked about the reason for the increase, I am told it is my escrow shortage. My escrow was always included in my mortgage since I bought my home in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have not seen any drastic increase in my home owners insurance or my property tax that would suddenly cause such an increase in my mortgage. In fact I have been receiving tax credits for my property tax since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. There has been a {$770.00} increase in my insurance for just {$2000.00}, but that would certainly not cause such a shortage. I have tried to get answers and no one follows up and give me the information which I am seeking. I do receive letters from their office about delinquency starting from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to present. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I paid online {$3200.00} to cover the cost of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  mortgage. Then on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I mailed in a check for {$2900.00} to go towards my escrow account, because that was the amount I got back from my county for the tax credit. On Friday I received a letter from Specialized Loan Servicing ( SLS ) showing that I have an escrow shortage of {$14000.00}. My new mortgage payment will be {$2900.00}. No one has shown me who they paid that escrow to and when and how did that come about. I am on a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  income of {$2000.00} from which I pay other bills. There is absolutely no way I will be able to afford that and no way do I want to lose my house that I have invested so much in. I am now [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  years old and sick. I need investigation into this matter with hopefully a great resolution. I also want to start paying my own taxes and insurance to avoid future confusion. Please help me to resolve this matter.','Specialized Loan Servicing LLC',2.0,2.0,'escrow shortage has caused me to pay $5800.00 before mortgage. escrow was always included in my mortgage since buying my home in XX/X');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(160,'01/29/2019','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I opened a new checking account with fifth third bank on XX/XX/2018 with {$50.00} deposit. About a week later I check the transactions, the new account is negative {$60.00}. The two transactions were XX/XX/2018. The first transaction was for {$27.00} and the second transaction was for {$40.00}. I did not do either of these transactions. My new debit card did not arrive at my address yet. I called customer service to explain these fraudulent transactions. 

Also, the transactions were made in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have not been in this area of the city in months. The merchant that approved these transactions should have cameras. Were these debit or credit transactions? If pin was used, how was it activated? If credit, you can compare my signature with the thiefs signature. Fifth third sent me a letter stating they will be reversing my temporary credit of {$67.00} on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The bank states the card was not reported lost/stolen. How can I report card lost/stolen if I was still waiting to receive it by mail? I want my {$67.00} back into my account.','FIFTH THIRD FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'a new checking account with fifth third bank on XX/XX/2018 is negative. the two transactions were XX/XX/2018. the first transaction was for');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(161,'01/28/2019','Mortgage','VA mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','I am a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  Veteran who began experiencing hardship in XX/XX/2018. I contacted the sub-servicer of my mortgage ; Dovenmuehle Mortgage in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to request assistance. I had missed the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payments. 
