INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(164,'01/28/2019','Debt collection','Payday loan debt','False statements or representation','I made this personal loan with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in GA, back in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], this was sold to a collection company named CACH , LLC. The last time I made payments to this account was in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], then I lost my job and tried to pay it off i. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but the company didn''t want to settle for what i had then which was {$5000.00}, later on in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] i offered them {$6000.00} and yet again they didn''t accept it. They now are reporting this account with a balance of over {$8000.00} and with an open date as of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]! I was unemployed from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] until the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when I moved out from GA. They''re violating the fair credit reporting act, as well as they''re ruining my credit to say the least. I have never received an official letter from them with a validation of this debt or any other document with my signature on it, is not fair they can manipulate the system the way they do it to get away with their unfair practices to ruin people ''s lives and just for what? To make a few bucks! I demand for them to stop reporting this account, and to fix my credit, to close it and erase it from my history.','Resurgent Capital Services L.P.',2.0,2.0,'i made this personal loan with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in GA. this was sold to a collection company named CACH, LLC. the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(165,'01/28/2019','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','There have been some fraulent charged/scheme involved, stolen cards and unauthorized transactions on my HSBC account. I already reported to the internet law enforcement and also made a police report number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. However, HSBC still did not assist me further as according the Federal State Laws as " Consumer Credit Protection Act of 1968 '''' and Fair Credit Billing Act ''''. That HSBC did not follow the laws and failed to deliver/provide the promised under the card disclosures.

HSBC ignored my claims and even closed my credit card and debit card without notifying me neither put closed account in writing after very late as I requested. I was treated unfairly and HSBC is definitly showing misrepresntation, misleading me and caused my damages in many ways. Because they made me feel that my rights were not covered and claimed no where I could get my card under protections by federal/state laws. So they made me admited and forced me that I had to pay for all of my fraulent unauthorized transactions.','HSBC NORTH AMERICA HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,4.0,'hsb ignored my claims and closed my credit card and debit card without notifying me. HSBC is definitly showing misrepresntation, misleading me and caused my');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(166,'01/27/2019','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','My name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ... I''ve recently disputed this debt multiple times from Midland Funding ... they are not the original creditor ... the account was closed and they bought the debt from the original creditor ... I need validation that I owe this debt ... My signature is not on any contract with them ... My rights have been violated under the Fair credit reporting act ... as well as UCC 1-308 ... every time I dispute this debt collector nothing get ''s solved ... like the credit bureau ''s and this agency is committing fraud against a name that isn''t mines ... I have a Nationality ... [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ... I''m not the ALL CAPITAL LETTERS NAME on any paperwork ... I''ve stated this fact many times. Section 609 of the Fair Credit Reporting Act is suppose to protect me against agencies like this one. Why are my rights being violated and nothing is being done about it from the credit bureau ''s or by second party agencies that I don''t have a contract with?','ENCORE CAPITAL GROUP INC.',2.0,4.0,'my name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]... I''ve recently disputed this debt multiple times from Midland');
