INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(169,'01/26/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I have been trying to work with Equifax with getting this account removed from my report, they always say the information will be removed or they''ll follow up with me but they don''t. I reported this information on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was told that my documentation was mailed out on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I have yet to received that information yet as of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have contacted the bureau and the original creditor several times in regards to this situation with no response and I do not want to be held accountable for something that isn''t mines. I have sent a method of verification on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with no response to Equifax. I just want the account to be removed and from under my name and my credit report.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has been contacted by Equifax. the bureau and the original creditor have not responded.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(170,'01/26/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I pulled a copy of my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit report on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] due to suspicions that Citi cards did not properly credit or resolve a fraudulent transaction. 

My wife and I purposely did not place transactions on this account this fall & winter due to the inconvenience of multiple account number changes due to fraudulent activity. When we learned of another fraudulent charge representing the entirety of the balance ( {$11.00} ) I  contacted them ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) requesting resolution and will not be submitting payment for that billing period. There online chat gave me the following response : Yes b erest assured we have notated your account for this ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) as Your account comes with {$0.00} account liability. And you will not be liable to pay any unauthorized charges. 


This was not resolved, as I discovered in a statement received XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. ( Your payment of {$11.00} is 6 days past due. Please Make a payment now ) I called Citi ''s customer service three times that day ( Called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and she abandoned call ; Called 2nd time and it went to busy after the menu ; Called 3rd time reached [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and she will take care of disputed charge and finance charge ( estimates 3 days ) However, this amount is still being reported on our [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit report. 

I''m appreciative of any assistance you can provide. Thanks in advance!','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,4.0,'my wife and I purposely did not place transactions on this account this fall & winter due to the inconvenience of multiple account number changes due to fraudulent activity. my wife and I purposely');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(171,'01/25/2019','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Fees or interest','My credit card bill has been paid automatically via debit from my checking account using Bank of America bill pay system. That has worked like a clockwork for as long as I have had this particular account open. 
Suddenly on XX/XX/2019 it did not work even though my bank account had sufficient reserves. 

Bank of America is the credit card issuer and they claim that debit did not happen this time because of the user error and refuse to acknowledge their part in this and refuse to refund or at least partially refund the late fee and interest charged. I paid the bill in full including {$70.00} in interest and late fee as soon as I discovered this error and was late only 4-5 business days. I never received a notice that bill pay system had not worked! What is the purpose of automated bill pay if it fails without notice! 

I contacted their customer service twice. They claimed that it was a user error even though they had no idea why bill pay failed. I was told that their manager will contact me within three business days from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. That never happened. 

Please advise. Thank You!','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'bank of America claims debit did not happen this time because of user error. contacted customer service twice and claimed it was a user error.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(172,'01/25/2019','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','I have not been contacted by my servicer since I submitted my short sale package 1024.41 Loss mitigation procedures. 

We are filing a complaint because the servicer received a loss mitigation application request on XX/XX/2019. They are currently in violation of 1024.41 ( b ) ( 2 ) ( i ) - Notify the borrower in writing within 5 days ( excluding legal public holidays, Saturdays, and Sundays ) after receiving the loss mitigation application that the servicer  acknowledges receipt of the loss mitigation application and that the servicer has determined that the loss mitigation application is either complete or incomplete. If a loss mitigation application is incomplete, the notice shall state the additional documents and information the borrower must submit to make the loss mitigation application complete and the applicable date pursuant to paragraph ( b ) ( 2 ) ( ii ) of this section. The notice to the borrower shall include a statement that the borrower should consider contacting servicers of any other mortgage loans secured by the same property to discuss available loss mitigation options. 

As of todays date the servicer has not stated in writing whether the application is complete, incomplete or stated whether and or what additional documents are needed to complete the application. 

I spoke to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they received the package last XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'servicer received a loss mitigation application request on XX/XX/2019. they are currently in violation of 1024.41 ( b ) ( 2 ) (');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(173,'01/25/2019','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Other features, terms, or problems','I tried to redeem my American Express Membership Rewards points today,XX/XX/2019, but the system didnt allow me to do so. I called the customer service to inquire about this issue and after 30 minutes of being put on hold and transferred to different departments, I was finally told that my account is currently under review and that I cant redeem my points until this process ( Which doesn''t have a timeline ) is completed. 

