It is very deceitful that American Express encourages us to refer our friends and family, they advertise this on their website and send us promotional emails to invite people to apply to American Express Cards in return of a Referral Bonus and when we do, they freeze our membership rewards accounts. From what I read online about other customers experiences, this seems to be a very common complaint about American Express.','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a representative said that the system didn''t allow me to redeem my points. the representative said that the account is currently under review.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(174,'01/25/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','To Whom It May ConcernI was reviewing a copy of my credit report and discovered it contained some errors pertaining to the following Personal Information. I am requesting that you promptly update and delete. This is the third time I have requested the original contract and/or bill of sales, change of title of ownership. I have not received any thing that meets the standard of Section 609 E2 A1 Validation, Disclosure, [ 15 USC 1681g ] of the Fair Credit Reporting Act. According to the provisions of Section 612 ( b ) [ 15 USC 1681j ( b ) ], 623 A1 Inaccurate reporting. In addition if you cant obtain this info you are required to delete this information off, is held liable as well for defamation and in the state of OHIO a creditor is who collects their on debt is considered a debt collector under 1319.12 Taking assignment of debts. FDCPA I fail to see where the following companies are in compliance with OHIO LAW.  The following account are still unverified : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I demand original paperwork, contract or bills of sale something, the account are not accurate on my file','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a credit report contained some errors relating to the following Personal Information. this is the third time I have requested the original contract and/or bill of sales, change of title of ownership');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(175,'01/25/2019','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','This company has been reporting unverified and inaccurate information about me to the credit bureaus. 
I have formally requested a copy of any documents, bearing my signature, showing that I have a legally binding contractual obligation to pay them the alleged amount and they have failed to provide such verification ( As per FTC opinion letter from Attorney [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they have been made aware that a printout of a bill or itemized document does not constitute verification ). 

In addition, I have formally disputed this derogatory account with this company and they have failed to place the required " notice of dispute '''' disclosure within the required 30-day period and did not furnish the credit bureaus with the required disclosure, within the period required by law. I have retained a copy of their signature and date of receipt, as well as a time-stamped copy of my credit reports, showing that they have violated the Fair Credit Reporting Act, Section 623 ( a ) ( 3 ) and the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act Section 807 ( 8 ) by not placing the disclosure within the required 30-day period and I am now considering small claims action against them for their violations as well as for defamation and negligent enablement of identity fraud.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,4.0,'a copy of any documents bearing my signature is requested. the company has failed to provide verification. the company has formally disputed this derogatory account.');
