I don''t want to loose my home. 

Please, Please, Please, Help','Shellpoint Partners, LLC',2.0,2.0,'foreclosure notice received by mail from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(181,'01/23/2019','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Trouble using your card','I have received a Visa credit card from BBVA Compass bank and for every purchase, the account gets flagged for fraud, making it a huge inconvenience to try and get through to their fraud monitoring to unlock the account to verify that I had in fact made these purchases. On top of that, now, when I call in, I feel like my privacy has been violated. I am not calling to report fraud on the account. Instead of confirming that I had been the person making the purchases, BBVA is asking for very specific details about the transactions -- what I purchased at the retailers -- which I feel is a gross violation of my privacy.','BBVA COMPASS FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'BBVA Compass bank has a Visa credit card and it gets flagged for fraud. a fraud monitoring is needed to unlock the account to verify that I made purchases.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(182,'01/23/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I am writing this due to non-compliance with the ( Equifax, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ). They have failed to remove information that was affiliated with personal details that were challenged in the past. I strongly believe that they are in violation of the FCRA pursuant to section 605B and are outright refusing to uphold the law.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'they have failed to remove information that was affiliated with personal details. they have failed to remove information that was affiliated with personal details.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(183,'01/23/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','On XX/XX/19 I was notified from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the company I use to monitor my credit that a hard inquiry was pulled from Experian from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I never authorized this. I have printed all the details off their website and nowhere does it say they are going to be doing a hard pull against my credit. I want this inquiry removed from my credit report immediately.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a hard inquiry was pulled from Experian from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/19. I never authorized this.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(184,'01/23/2019','Debt collection','Medical debt','Took or threatened to take negative or legal action','A phone call on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from Choice recovery took place regarding a debt collection attempt that I was unaware of. During this phone call, I mentioned that I do not remember ever receiving a bill from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. because all my bills were being directed to my Lawyer. I explained that I was in a car accident where a vehicle hit me when I was stopped at a red light and the Lawyer was handling all the calls and the bills. 

At this point, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from Choice recovery told me that he was no longer aloud to discuss this account with me by law and asked for my Lawyers number, so he could contact directly. I gave him my Lawyers contact information. 

Yesterday, on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I noticed that my credit score dropped 24 points!!! When I looked to see why it dropped, it stated that 7 new accounts were opened and the total number of derogatory accounts had also increase by 7. Looking into it further, I found that all 7 new accounts and 7 derogatory accounts were from Choice Recovery INC. 

Today XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at Choice and asked why they were attacking my credit. I was told y [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that they were unable to get in touch with my lawyer and by law they are not allowed to contact me without my Lawyer ''s permission and can not discuss any other details about my case. I then asked to speak to his Manager. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] transferred a call to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and she proceeded to repeat the same information that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] presented me with. I told her that I completely understand that they are by law not allowed to contact me with out my Lawyers permission, but if you couldn''t get a hold of them, you could have at least informed of this information so I could call my Lawyer and have them directly reach out to you instead of just attacking my credit. ( They didn''t get permission to contact me from my Lawyer but didn''t get permission to attack my credit history either but they did!! ) I asked how a could get this removed from my credit history and she told me that I needed to contact my lawyer and have them contact Choice Recovery INC for something to be worked out before they could see if something could be done with my credit. 

They attacked my credit without my knowledge, without giving me a chance to resolve the issue, then hold my credit score hostage with no guarantee to fix my credit. How is this allowed? If they are not allowed to contact me by law and they don''t get a hold of my Lawyer, I''m left in the dark till one day I get a surprise of a 24 point hit to my credit score!!','Choice Recovery, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a phone call on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] took place regarding a debt collection attempt that I was unaware of. ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(185,'01/22/2019','Vehicle loan or lease','Loan','Problems at the end of the loan or lease','Bought a car, was ripped off in payment as it was increased after loan was signed. I paid on time then could not keep up with payments. I tried to refinance for a smaller payment, they refused so I told them I voluntarily surrender the car. I made sure it was clean and had gas. It was in great condition, they picked it up like I was a criminal, I handed them the keys. They auctioned it or sold it. And tried to get me to pay {$12000.00}. They then charged it off as a bad debt write off for taxes. Reported me being late XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], what it was charged off in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], still reporting late payments and a balance due of {$12000.00}. FCRA says if it is charged off the balance is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as they can no longer collect. It has been written off their taxes. I have disputed all three credit bureaus and GM still has not corrected. I have also called them directly and they are still reporting incorrectly. Do not use under any circumstances. You will be [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the end.','GENERAL MOTORS FINANCIAL COMPANY, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a car was ripped off in payment as it was increased after loan was signed. a buyer was able to refinance and surrender the car. they refused to pay');
