INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(187,'01/22/2019','Vehicle loan or lease','Lease','Problems at the end of the loan or lease','My lease with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] terminated in XX/XX/2017. I turned the vehicle in on XX/XX/2017. The remaining 2 payments were made. There was to be a termination fee charged if I did not lease another Hyundai within 30 days. We moved to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/2017 and my intention was to lease a Hyundai immediately. As you may be aware, hurricane Maria struck [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/2017. It was physically IMPOSSIBLE for me to lease another vehicle within 30 days. Dealerships were closed, power was out for months, etc., etc.. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was notified of the situation and they just did not care. They insisted I pay the fee. I refused based on the circumstances. I filed a formal complaint with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). Hyundai basically said the hurricane was not their fault and they would never waive the fee. My credit score went from being in the 830-850 range all of my life to the low 700 ''s. I feel at best they should have shown some compassion and waived the fee and at worst they should not have attempted to ruin my perfect credit.','HYUNDAI CAPITAL AMERICA',2.0,2.0,'my lease with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] terminated in XX/XX/2017. there was a termination fee charged if I did not lease');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(188,'01/22/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I would like to address this issue of this inaccurate account on my credit report. I followed your advice about contacting the collector.I sent them a letter by certified mail and it was received on XX/XX/2018 and asked them to verify the debt and investigate. As oftodaythey still have not responded to me.The company has not responded in any way. None of the credit bureaus have remedied this issue. I thought they had 30 days to investigate and fix the inaccurate account listed. It has been over 45 days and this debt has not been verified nor has it been removed from my credit profile.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the debt has not been verified or removed from my credit profile. the company has not responded in any way.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(189,'01/21/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit repair services','Confusing or missing disclosures','I recently checked my credit reports and it reported a derogatory mark from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] about a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bill. I dont know much about this kind of stuff but I when I closed my account it was never mentioned that any money was due. It says it was the past two years or so ago. However, I closed my account about a year ago, so Im not sure when this popped up, how long ago it was, or when it could be from.','ERC',2.0,2.0,'credit reports reported a derogatory mark from a bill. it says it was the past two years or so ago.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(190,'01/21/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','Dear Sir, I have received a letter from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that there is account on my name, which was numbered was " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''', I do not have any business with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on any kind of loan or insurance, there were two credit cards ( ending [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and both were closed on XX/XX/2018 and XX/XX/2018 respectively ( letters are part of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CFPB Complaint IDs [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). Individual credit card ending [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] closed with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance on XX/XX/2018 and Individual credit card ending [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] closed on XX/XX/2018 and I am paying remaining balance monthly. Apart from these two individual closed credit cards [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I do not have any business or no loans or no insurance or no business with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at all. All of sudden I received the letter from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that there is a account [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '' on my name, address and social, which is a fraud, crime and identity theft. Could CFPB direct respective credit bureaus to explain me the full details of disputed fraudulent account [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '' in written response called on my name, social, rental apartment address and various identification details. I also observed that there is a phone number called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( Home Equity of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) '', does it mean that someone has taken the loan using my name, social, address and various identification details fraudulently without my consent and authorization. Could CFPB kindly direct all the credit bureaus to file complaint against [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and account number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '' under forgery,, fraud, identity theft and crime. This is a fraud and crime that someone has taken the loan on my name, social, rental apartment address and various identification details without my consent and authorization. I am going to file the police complaint and communicate to federal department. Could CFPB kindly direct credit bureaus to dispute this fraudulent account [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '', file a complaint against [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], provide me the complete details of this account and remove it from credit report under forgery, identity theft and crime. I do not have any business with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and I have no idea what are other fraudulent details they used to obtain this loan using my identity and social.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'a letter from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] says there is account on my name, address and social. a fraud,');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(191,'01/21/2019','Debt collection','Mortgage debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','The attached documents were sent certified XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and shows as being received. They send a letter in return but NEVER do they tell me what month in XX/XX/2018 was delinquent. This account was Discharged XX/XX/2018. It was proved to discharge that XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/2018 were paid. 

