ease if there is anything you can do, I would appreciate your help to get this straightened out. I am willing to take this to litigation and ask for damages and my time.i can provide each account and dates if wish, aprox. 6 or 7 items on each report with illegal inquiries not authorized by me.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'fcra law requires all documents and documents to be verified. fcra law requires all documents to be verified and verified. fcra law requires all documents to be verified and');
