I have tried to sell the home with no success. I owe {$520000.00} on my home, it is worth at least {>= $1,000,000}. After I sell my home with all the realtor and other fees and taxes I won''t even be able to purchase another home in the area I have lived at for the past 30+ years. Since I have had to rent out my home on a regular basis I no longer qualify for the {$250000.00} tax credit when I sell it. I love my home, I want to keep my home. I am in desperate of help. I no longer have a savings, everything I have goes to making the {$3700.00} house payment. PLEASE HELP ME The stress of this nightmare is killing me physically and emotionally. My health is worse than it has been in years.

I applied for save your home CA, was told I had to take my house off the real estate market, and had to be off at least 2 months. When I called back in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  they were out of money. HARP turned me down because I had too much equity.','SELECT PORTFOLIO SERVICING, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a builder defect caused mold in my home in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the builder defect has caused mold in');
