I am been Discriminated and Retaliated as a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and US Military Veteran.

My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  pension income is sufficient equitable as l receive {$54000.00} @ year income from California Cal Pers [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  pension income and is a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] income with a cost of living increase of 3 % COLA each year on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].

I have made various calls to Capital One credit card Department to increase my Capital One Mastercard ending in # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit limit from {$500.00} to a higher amount.

But Capital One credit Department declines credit increase.

I am been Retaliated and Discriminated because of my National Origin and my file complaints against Capital One.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'capital One credit card Department approved Mastercard in ending # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMIS');
