INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(232,'01/10/2019','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Closing an account','I opened an account with Chase bank, they set the account up after runing mu personal information, took the opening deposit of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. i updated my direct deposit to direct funds to chase on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. now XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] i am being told they are closing my account, rejecting my direct deposit and will mail me a check for the money in 7 to 10 days. i asked why and was told they are refusing to tell me why, refusing to give me any information whatsoever including what information was used to make the decision and will not give me my money back immediately even though they have no reason to hold it. i had a chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bankruptcy discharged around a year ago so i donot owe them any money. yet now i am unable tee o pay my bills because chase has ALL of my money and all of my wages in limbo until the decide to send them back. the least they can do is tell me why or at the very least give me money.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'i opened an account with Chase bank, took the opening deposit of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_AN');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(233,'01/10/2019','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','I was contacted by " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' agency and was told that my current student load was with a 3rd party lender and if I changed to them it would be a direct payment and I would save money and be paid off sooner. This was my understanding of the events and I called to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  today to get further information and was told that " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' business was the 3rd party and I could be paying them for years and none of my payments would be going towards my student load debt if I don''t meet the qualifications for loan forgiveness. I am told that my money is instead to pay this 3rd party to shuffle papers and collect my money for it and none of my money is going towards my loans.','NELNET, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a 3rd party lender told me my current student load was with a 3rd party. if I changed to them it would be a direct payment and I would');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(234,'01/10/2019','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','Hello, I have a credit card with HSBC Master card with a {$3000.00} charge from a balance transfer that was not received and nobody knows anything about. It was applied on XX/XX/2018 and supposed to have been canceled 7-10 days later. I have called several times in the last 4 months and nobody knows anything or can solve the problem. I keep getting transferred from one know-nothing to the next until I am put on hold and hung up on. The charges are continuous with no resolve in sight. PLEASE HELP','HSBC NORTH AMERICA HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,2.0,'a credit card with HSBC Master card with a $3000.00 charge was applied on XX/XX/2018 and supposed to have been canceled 7-10');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(235,'01/09/2019','Student loan','Private student loan','Struggling to repay your loan','Navient is the loan provider. I have asked for a budget/ income driven loan and they through me out of the the repayment plan because I took a home equity loan to fix some things in my house. They said that new credit was the cause of them throwing me out. Later I asked for a forbearance and they said I had 4 month of forbearance available, but I could only take 3 months at a time per their policy so they charged me {$50.00} for 3 months, then another {$50.00} for 1 month. They do not treat their borrowers very nice!','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'Navient is the loan provider. I have asked for a budget/ income driven loan. they said that new credit was the cause of them throwing me out.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(236,'01/09/2019','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers','I have been an AMEX card holder for a long time. I was emailed an offer to upgrade to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit card for {$450.00}. As part of the terms, it said I would get [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] points with a {$4000.00} spend in the first 3 months. I spent that and didn''t get the points so I called in and was told it would be on my next statement. My next statement came and went and I called again. This time I was told I was never eligible and the person who told me I was getting the points was wrong. 

I would have never upgraded if I had not been victim to this " bait and switch '''' This is an illegal practice and I want my {$450.00} refunded immediately and my card closed. 

I sent them a mediation request 2 months ago and have not heard one work back. AMEX has to have THE worst customer service in the world and just lost a long time customer.','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a AMEX card holder has been emailed an offer to upgrade to the card. he said he would get points with a $4000.00');
