INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(240,'01/08/2019','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I placed an Internet order for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I then placed an order for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  lenses prescribed by my eye doctor at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My eye doctors clinic did not have the frames I liked so I placed my order with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  online. I sent a copy of my prescription as requested by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they processed my order. 

The frames were charged on my card for {$100.00} separately on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was then charged 2 split charges for the lenses On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] {$94.00} and on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] {$94.00}. The glasses were shipped XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and received on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When I unpackaged the glasses and put them on they were blurry when I looked in the distance but the reading part was ok. When I dipped my head down I could see in the distance. I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and spoke to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and he instructed me to wear the glasses for 1-2 weeks to get used to the prescription. My eye Doctor gave me the same instructions. After 1 weeks I could not handle the dizziness or headaches. I was in my local [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they were kind enough to place the glasses in their machine which measures the progression of the lenses. The technician stated these were the worst lenses they had ever seen. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] explaining the situation. He stated return the glasses unworn for a full inspection and they would issue a refund. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I both stated that is impossible the glasses have been worn since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] directed me to wear them for 1-2 weeks in order to get used to the progressive prescription. I then had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] make me a new set of lenses since we realized they were not going to help me so I was charged {$180.00} at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to order new lenses. 

I then went round and round on the phone and many emails on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] & [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which I have attached all receipts, delivery confirmation, prescription, and the new receipt from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with pictures of how bad the lenses were. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never went over a return policy with me and it was apparent they would take them back but then I would no longer have my frames and lenses and have been charged {$290.00}. They had already screwed up the lenses so bad I was not willing to lose my money and glasses to these crooks. I told them I would send the lenses back so they could inspect them and they said no so I contacted Bank of America for assistance.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'glasses were shipped XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and received on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(241,'01/08/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I have a public record & Child Support entry that was placed on my credit report and I have been trying for over 12 months to get this entry removed. I have spoken with numbers representatives, supervisors, and managers in regards to the erroneous public record and I have yet to get it resolved. This is my 14th dispute in which I am currently awaiting results. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I called and spoke with a representative and inquired how Equifax, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] verifies their public records. I want to know this information because the public record keeps coming back as mine. I had 20 representatives that told me that the request/dispute is sent as a message to the courthouse through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Once the court verifies it, the information is sent back to the credit bureau. I advised that I would like to cancel that dispute and they advised that because the dispute was already sent to the courthouse, I will need to contact them with my name and the case number. Being that I work for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I know the court system and their procedures, but decided to call anyway. 
Contacted the court and they advised that they do no disclose, release or verify any information with the credit bureaus or any 3rd parties. I decided to call Equifax back, spoke with another rep this time and they advised that the information is verified by the runner who goes to the court house. I asked what information does the runner give to the courthouse, and how and what kind of physical information does the runner give back to the credit bureau. They could not answer that, and I requested to speak with the manager. Manager advised since this is a re-investigation, no runner is involved. She advised that they use a form that they send over to the courthouse. I asked what type of form and where is it sent because the courthouse confirmed that they do not verify any information with the bureaus. All 3 major bureaus refuses to give my physical documentation ( whether tangible or electronic ) that they use to verify this these accounts are mine.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a public record & Child Support entry was placed on my credit report. I have spoken with numbers representatives, supervisors, and managers. this is my 14th dispute in which');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(242,'01/08/2019','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','An escrow account was created even though I have responded to and included all the info that was needed when the company sent it''s original letter which was in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

