INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(263,'01/03/2019','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','On XX/XX/2014 I purchased a van from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] NV. I made my payments on time for the first 2month, by the end of the 2nd month The vehicle broke down. This was the 3rd time in that 2 months. Finanlly when I took the car to my moms we pulled into a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] where the car completly stopped working. We were stranded me and my kids in another town. I immediately called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and told them to come get the vehicle and where it was. When they picked up the vehicle I advised them I did not want it back it was a lemon. When I did not pick the van back up from them they counted it as late payments and then placed the car in repossession status. This was not a repossession in any way. I would like it fixed and removed from my credit report. I have been fighting non stop with this. Please have it removed from all of my bureaus this was not a repossession and it was a lemon a bad vehicle that never worked properly. I got scammed by this company.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/2014 i bought a van from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the van broke down and was the 3rd time');
