INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(268,'01/02/2019','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I opened my Chase checking account online around XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I had a coupon code for a {$200.00} bonus if I had direct deposit made into the account by XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
It took a couple weeks for my employer to update my direct deposit information. So my first actual direct deposit into my new Chase account was made on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I receive direct deposit every Thursday now. I went into Chase on or around XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to speak to a banker and sign papers. I told her about my direct deposit and the coupon code and she verified and said yes you will be receiving that within 10 business days. I told the banker that my employer deposits my money through their bank and that bank direct deposits to my bank account. She told me not a problem. A week later I called Chase and they told me yes we see your direct deposit made by your employer and you will receive your {$200.00} bonus within 10 business days. Today I called to check the status and they told me they can not give me my bonus because my employers bank does the direct deposit and not the actual employer. I informed everyone I talked to in person and on phone how my employer does the direct deposit and they said yes its still direct deposit. Now they are going back on their word after I was promised!!','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'a week later I called Chase and they told me yes we see your direct deposit made by your employer. they said yes and they said yes it is still direct deposit. now they');
