I spoke to citimortgage and was transfer four times and spoke to someone name [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who continued to talk over me and instead of sending it to them has no real reason why they was holding monies who was supposed to be transfer to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which was not. 

