INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(270,'01/01/2019','Debt collection','Other debt','False statements or representation','Called IQ Data to inform them about court cases regarding debt. Was transferred to an agent who continued to interrupt me, would not transfer me to a supervisor, threatened to put me in a " time out '''' -- literally said time out. I attempted to give them the case information and he continuously stated that I had called multiple times with the same story. I have called this company all of twice. They contacted me previously and refused to state their identity or the debt holder.

