INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(284,'12/28/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','On XX/XX/2018 I sent a certified dispute letter to Experian regarding reportings of bankruptcy on my credit report. I asked that the information be removed because they are not my files and to provide proof of verification on how they obtained this information. On XX/XX/2018, I received an email from experian stating that the information was updated and is accurate. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called experian to receive proof of verification and I was laughed at over the phone, I was told they didnt have to provide proof of who reported it. I also spoke with a floor supervisor name [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who states he is in a call center in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] informs me that the bankruptcy court verified this information. However I spoke with the clerk of the US Bankruptcy Court of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] District Georgia who informed me that they do not report any information to the credit agencies. Experian is refusing to provide me with the company whom they claim verified this information. And based on the information I received they did not get verification.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'experian sent a certified dispute letter to experian regarding reportings of bankruptcy on my credit report. the company who obtained the information did not get verification. the company that');
