INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(290,'12/27/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] hasnt reported my credit card account to equifax and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  its been almost two months and i called them and never heard back from them and i closed the fraud dispute and told [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that this credit card account belong to me and it only been reported to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and they refuse to report to other two credit agencies and never heard back from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  account number ending [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and i would need this account to be reported ASAP THANK YOU','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'equifax hasnt reported my credit card account to equifax. i closed the fraud dispute and told them that this account belongs to me. they refuse to');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(291,'12/26/2018','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','I have a student loan with Great Lakes. Without asking me, they signed me up to have all bills and payment information sent to an email that I do not regularly check. When we called to find out why we were getting past due notices but had never gotten a bill Great Lakes told us that they automatically send all bills via email, without asking first if that is what we want. 

Great Lakes should not be permitted to choose the delivery method of bills and payment information. The customer should be allowed the option to choose their delivery preference. Because of this we were unaware that a payment was due, and were charged extra interest. 

It is unfair to communicate only by email, without first asking if that is okay.','GREAT LAKES',2.0,2.0,'Great Lakes should not be allowed to choose the delivery method of bills and payment information. the customer should be allowed the option to choose their delivery preference.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(292,'12/26/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Getting a credit card','We received a Letter in the mail addressed to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at our home address. It said that synchrony bank received the request for credit for a credit program with Walmart. It stated that unfortunately they were unable to approve the request at that time because of prior application has been submitted too recently. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] does not live at our address and we do not know this person. We believe this is a case of fraud. Synchrony bank told me to send the letter to them and they would investigate it. The back of the letter also said to contact the consumer financial protection agency.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,4.0,'synchrony bank received a letter in the mail addressed to synchrony bank. it said that they received the request for credit for a credit program with Walmart. it stated');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(293,'12/26/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Incorrect information on your report','This is in reference to account number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], oh property address [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] New Jersey zip [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Account number name under [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

To whom it may concern. 

I used to have an account with Wells Fargo. Back then I had a mortgage with Wells Fargo. Throughout my. Of time of being with Wells Fargo, I have filed multiple complaints with consumer financial protection bureau. I had contacted Wells Fargo number the times to assist me in my mortgage. However, over a. Of time nothing panned out to work for me with this mortgage company. Including done giving me a due date that my mortgage is due, telling me I had a Grace peroid 15 days later. That was another thing the grace. That was told was available to me, was all a lie as well. basically your mortgage payment was due on the day it was due with no grace peroid. 


Over time, I started to struggle more with this mortgage company. Because the grace. Was no such thing. This started to cause problems with my mortgage. If your payment wasn''t received on the exact due date, they already consider you default it with your mortgage. Even though a grace period was offered. They never really honored their grace period. 

Wells Fargo, will start to say you are behind on your mortgage. That you already are in default. So if you try to pay them after the due date any ready considered you in default, they would not accept your payment. Even when you had your payment. And if you try to make a partial payment they still wouldn''t take that either. 

Wells Fargo made my life a living [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When I realized that I was going to still have problems with Wells Fargo, and there was no winning with them. I realize the best thing to do was to get rid of my house. I sold a house, thinking that was the best thing to do just to get rid of Wells Fargo. 

However, the nightmare still continues. Now that I relocated to another state completely, to start a new beginning with my family. I realize Wells Fargo still follows me into my present and future. When I try to apply for a loan or even get an apartment, I was told that Wells Fargo reported so many lates on my credit report and basically destroyed my credit report for me to get anything moving forward. I did try to reach out to Wells Fargo, as a goodwill adjustment, to remove any lates that I might have on my credit report or anything negative as well. Including [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] removing any old accounts and to let them know this account is no longer active. So it will allow me to either get a loan or even an apartment. When I was speaking to the right, they said they would try to help me. Please also remember, in my credit report says my account is still active and they still report an old accounts.. 

after reviewing my credit report again, after the fact I went speak to Wells Fargo. Nothing was ever done on their end. Even though they said they would do it for me so I can get that loan on apartment that I needed.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a mortgage company has a grace period that is not honored. the company has a grace period that is not honored. the company has a grace period that is not honored');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(294,'12/26/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I received a phone call from a Debt collector from Colorado ( phone # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and I asked them to Stop calling. ( They''ve got the wrong person!!! The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] calling Itself [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] called me back and left me a lengthy, DEMANDING message giving ultimatum that I should Call [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] xt [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] TODAY to talk to her! The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said this message is for " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''''. I am NOT that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they are looking for, This is NOT [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] # there may be a Last name resemblance but not all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] are the same! They probably dug my # from the Internet thinking I am related to the debt owner that did not pay it''s debts. I have a perfect credit with 800+ score and pay my bills on time, I don''t owe anybody jack! This [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  better STOP BOTHERING ME and calling my Cell repeatedly for some [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] debt. I am Not providing my address or email or phone number in the required fields as I don''t want the debt collectors to access my other personal contact Info and gain more ways to contact and harass me. This is a Complaint to let you know that the WRONG person is being Harassed by debt collectors..','Alliance Data Card Services',2.0,2.0,'a debt collector from Colorado called me back and asked them to Stop calling. the debt collector said this message is for "[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''');
