INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(317,'12/19/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I have been a customer of 5/3 Bank since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and had good expierences with them up until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I did a mobile deposit to Acc # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was given {$100.00} available upfront. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the funds were not available and the bank took back the {$100.00} in funds that were given upfront. I was advised on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that the funds would be available fully on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I disagree with the decision. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I went to my local bank branch and spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] regarding the extended hold and explained I have never had an extended hold placed on a deposit before ever in 4 years. I also brought proof that the business I deposited had cleared from the other bank and showed a statement where the funds were available from the other bank account at the other institution. The local branch at 5/3 has done nothing to help me receive the funds any earlier with the proof that they cleared. It is 7 days before the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Holiday and now im without funds to pay for my bills, living expenses and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for my family. I have attached a copy of the Reg CC hold guidelines that the bank claims they did to my deposit. I was never given the first {$100.00} and my hold was longer then 5 business days. The deposit was less then {$5000.00}','FIFTH THIRD FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'5/3 bank customer reveals he has never had an extended hold placed on a deposit before ever in 4 years. he says he has never had an extended hold placed on');
