INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(336,'12/15/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], CA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], TN [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] RE : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CARD Dear Credit Bureaus, This letter is a formal complaint that you are reporting inaccurate and incomplete credit information. 
I HAVE INCLUDED DOCUMENTS OF PROOF ABOUT THIS COMPANIES ERRORS, AS THEY HAVE IGNORED MY DISPUTES FOR NEW REPORTING OR DELETION. 

1 ) THE BALANCE IS INCORRECT : I HAVE ENCLOSED THE CORRECT BALANCE PROVIDED FORM THE COMPANY AND YOU CAN SEE ITS WRONG ON MY CREDIT REPORT 2 ) THEY HAVE REFUSED TO REMOVE MY LATE PAYMENTS ( WHICH WERE LATE DUE TO AN ERROR ON THEIR REPORTING SYSTEM ) EVEN THOUGH THEY VERBALLY SAID THEY WOULD. I WAS PROVIDED A REFRENCE # ON XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 3 ) AS OF XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] THEY REPORTED I OWED THEM {$0.00}, WHICH WAS TRUE, THEN LESS THAN ONE MONTH LATER ON A CLOSED PREPAID ACCOUNT I SOMEHOW INCRUED {$140.00} OF CHARGES? INCORRECT REPORTING MONTH AFTER MONTH ON MY CREDIT REPORTS 4 ) KNOWINGLY REPORTING INNCORECTLY AGAINST ME I am distressed that you have included the ABOVE information in my credit profile and have failed to maintain reasonable procedures in your operations to assure maximum accuracy in the credit reports you publish. BECAUSE OF THEIR NEGLIGENCE, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CLOSED MY CREDIT ACCOUNT WITH A LIMIT OF {$1500.00} WHICH HAD A {$0.00} BALANCE. CITING RECENT NEGATIVE REPORTING AGAINST ME ON MY CREDIT REPORTS. THIS IS DIRECTLY BECAUSE OF FIRST PROGRESSS INNACURATE REPORTING OF MY ACCOUNT WITH THEM. 

I respectfully request to have all negative information they reported against me removed and the late marks must be deleted from all 3 bureaus reports as soon as possible : 60 days past due and the 2 months of late payments and the balance I do not have reported as {$0.00}. Which is incorrect as they actually owe me {$200.00}, as it was a secured card and I made all the payments in full and on time every month this card was open. This item is completely inaccurate and incomplete and is a very serious error in reporting. Please supply a corrected credit profile to all creditors who have received a copy within the last 6 months, or the last 2 years for employment purposes. 

Additionally, please provide the name, address, and telephone number of each credit grantor or other subscriber you notified to me within 15 days. 

Under federal law, you have 30 days to complete your reinvestigation. Be advised that the description of the procedure used to determine the accuracy and completeness of the information is hereby requested as well, to be provided within 15 days of the completion of your reinvestigation. 

Sincerely, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], CA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','Synovus Bank',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(337,'12/15/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Getting a credit card','I was shopping at a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  store in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], CA on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] evening. Then I remembered I should update my address on my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  credit card. So, I went to the front desk and asked for address to be changed. Store personnel asked for SSN to look me up. Then she applied for a new card without my knowing while lying to me that if I update my address I will receive a new spare card as well. That sounded odd and then she continued to print me a card receipt all of a sudden. I should have caught on to her act when the screen asked for my income, but she kept saying I had to update all my information. It appeared she thought I wouldn''t understand the situation as she most likely assumed English was not my first language. Now I have 2 [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  cards in my hand and this is all just upsetting how blantantly unethical clerk was as well as a store manager who didn''t seem to believe me.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'a clerk at a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] store in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] asked for a new card. she');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(338,'12/15/2018','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I have been complaining about this fraudulent account on my credit all of 2018. I have no knowledge of how my information was obtained in order to put it on my credit reports. I have never applied for services or lines of credit with this company. And never have I given anyone else perimission to do so nor co-signed.','Alliance Data Card Services',2.0,4.0,'i have been complaining about this fraudulent account on my credit all of 2018. I have no knowledge of how my information was obtained.');
