The SOL for California is 4 years.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'debt by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is outside the SOL for the state of California. the SOL for California is 4 years.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(340,'12/14/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','I received a letter from Mr. Cooper on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in which I was given five options to choose from. The five options are and I quote : 1. Refinance the loan with us or another lender ; 2. Modify the loan with us ; 3. A voluntary payment forbearance temporally gives you more time to pay your voluntary monthly payment ; 4. A voluntary repayment plan that allows missed voluntary payments to be made up over time ; 5. or If you are not able to continue voluntarily paying the mortgage, your best option may be to find more affordable housing. You may be able to either surrender your home through a Deed in lieu or sell your home and use the proceeds to pay off the loan, even if the proceeds are not enough to pay the loan in full ( short sale ). These are the options given and I chose the Short Sale. I hired a Real Estate Agent Who called Mr. Cooper to seek approval for the short sale. Mr. Cooper responded that my Real Estate Agent should enroll in Mr Cooper ''s Short Sale Validation Program which she did. Mr. Cooper asked for documents to be submitted also which she did. Mr Cooper asked my  Agent to List my house with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], also which she did. Now to my greatest surprise I received a foreclosure sale notice from The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that my house is scheduled for foreclosure sale on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. First of, Mr. Cooper is violating the Virginia Dual Tracking Law. Second of all, Mr. Cooper is violating Virginia Foreclosure law by not advertising the foreclosure sale on the local news paper. Then The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] lied AGAIN as usual that I should find enclosed the advertisement of the foreclosure sale in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I couldn''t find any attached advertisement as claimed by The Trustees.','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',2.0,4.0,'a letter from a real estate agent from the''short sale'' received from the''short sale''. the short sale is a short sale. the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(341,'12/14/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','Creditor is reporting accounts that are invalid and unverified. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  have investigated this account and they concluded the account was not matching my records of being assigned to me. I would like proof these accounts were disputed per FCRA/ FDCPA. This is causing me anguish and its slandering my good name. Please block this account from my report so I can breathe again.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'creditor is reporting accounts that are invalid and unverified. comPTE_ANONYMISÉ have investigated this account.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(342,'12/14/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','On XX/XX/2018, my wife and I checked our online mortgage account with Mr. Cooper, aka Nationstar Mortgage LLC. We went to our account profile page and were shocked to see that the recipient listed to receive our account information was the attorney for the opposing party in a lawsuit we filed over a construction dispute and lien action ( " Opposing Counsel '''' ). The last person in the world who should be receiving our confidential financial information that is a critical aspect of our law suit is Opposing Counsel. This is akin to giving the fox the keys to the Hen House ( ironically, Nationstar had previously locked me out of my own account due to pending legal proceedings ). My wife and I immediately spoke with a Nationstar representative and told her how Nationstar had shared our sensitive information with Opposing Counsel. The representative ''s first words were " oh my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. '''' That was the appropriate response to Nationstar ''s unconscionable breach of our privacy. First thing Monday morning, we contacted our attorney, who informed us Nationstar ''s conduct exposed them to potential civil and criminal liability. Our attorney confirmed that Nationstar actually mailed Opposing Counsel our [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] mortgage statement and he had received it. It gets worse. Nationstar is a named party in a related law suit. They have been working closely with Opposing Counsel against our interests. The fact Nationstar unilaterally changed our recipient information to Opposing Counsel just when critical motions were being heard by the court is no coincidence. Our confidential information was kryptonite to us and the success of our law suit. Nationstar knew this. Their actions are beyond disreputable and merit the most severe civil and criminal sanctions possible. We are tied up with our current law suit and need the CFPB to champion our cause in this matter. To date, Nationstar and their counsel have refused to offer any reasonable explanation for their unconscionable actions.','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',2.0,2.0,'our wife and I checked our online mortgage account with Mr. Cooper. the recipient listed to receive our account information was the attorney for the opposing party. the last person in the world');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(343,'12/14/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','We opened an additional checking account in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of this year at US Bank. This is one of many accounts we have there. At the time of opening, I specifically asked the rep if there would be any fees on this account, and she stated no fees, due to the " package '''' we are in. We have discovered they started charging us inappropriately since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and they only will reverse one month of fees, instead of at least 4 months of fees. This was not our fault, and we were lied to. 
I want all fees since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reversed.','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,2.0,'we opened an additional checking account in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of this year. we have found they started charging us inappropriately since [COMPTE_AN');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(344,'12/14/2018','Checking or savings account','Savings account','Managing an account','I signed up for new linked checking and savings accounts on XX/XX/18 in response to Citis advertised offer of {$400.00} to transfer {$15000.00} from my old bank and maintain that balance with Citi for 60 days. I did that and I confirmed with Citi by online chat on XX/XX/18 that i had met eligibility requirements as long as the funds remained in the account until XX/XX/18. Citi has deposited the promised funds to my account.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'i signed up for new linked checking and savings accounts on XX/XX/18. i was able to transfer $15000.00 from my old bank');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(345,'12/13/2018','Mortgage','Home equity loan or line of credit (HELOC)','Trouble during payment process','After submitting a complaint regarding an uncompleted loan modification that was ongoing for several months, I submitted a complaint through the CFPB. U.S. Bank finally responded and corrected the problem and we got corrected paperwork and the loan modification was completed in XX/XX/2018. They also changed my credit reporting to show that I am NOT behind on any payment. However, my statements are still reflecting the old balance and that I am several months behind payments. The loan modification balance and payments are not reflecting on my statements. I have asked several times about this and it has not been resolved. Because of this, I''m unable to see my current balance and how my payments are being applied.','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,2.0,'the loan modification balance and payments are not reflecting on my statements. the CFPB responded and corrected the problem.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(346,'12/13/2018','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','I enrolled in a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  program in fall 2018 ( XX/XX/18 ) and received an email on XX/XX/18 telling me that as I was enrolled, I now had a deferment on my account. The email includes a link to " remove this deferment, '''' which, when you click on it, takes you to an FAQ on deferment ; however, under " can I cancel my deferment or forbearance, '''' it says you CAN cancel the deferment, but doesn''t tell you HOW to do it. There is no place on the website to do this, so after contacting them by phone, they tell me I have to complete a School Deferment Waiver Form, which they must send to me to my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] inbox. The form is not available on the website. Another difficulty is that the only way, according to the form, to get this sent back to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is to either fax or mail it. Nothing indicates that it can be sent via the website, nor was I told this by several customer service reps over the next few months. I finally had the time to download, print, sign, scan, and fax it. But when I got yet another email about a deferment on my account on XX/XX/18, I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and asked why I had another deferment as I had sent in the form in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They said they only got the cover sheet, but not the form, which I completely don''t understand ( why would they get one and not the other? ). Additionally, after 3 months of calls, I was FINALLY told that I could upload this on the site. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] DOES have a file upload section, but this form is not one of the options given. I was told to upload to the " Other '''' section of the site, but again, how would I ever know this as a ) I was NEVER told this was an option for this form and b ) the form itself does not list this as an option? 

My question it, for people who do NOT have access to a printer, how in the world are they supposed to get this form to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]? It is completely ridiculous that while I can do every thing else on the website, I can''t just fill out this form online, NOR is there anywhere on the form that indicates that I can just upload to the website, as again, it only mentions I can fax or mail it. It is very clear to me that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] wants to make this process as difficult as possible, as they would rather the additional interest on these loans gets capitalized in order to make them more money.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'a deferment on my account was sent to me by email on XX/XX/18. the form is not available on the website. it says you CAN');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(347,'12/13/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I''m filing this complaint for you to reverse the late payments reporting on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the account is also reported duplicate. The account was not paid late. I always sent the payments a day before the due date so it''s impossible that the account is a past due','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the account was not paid late. the account was not paid late.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(348,'12/13/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','My ex husband left the apartment we were living in and sticking me with the only one paying the lease. We were 6 months into a 1 year lease. After he left i could no longer  afford to pay the lease so i worked out a deal with the rental company to get out of the lease. I left the apartment in great condition and had another person set to take over the lease after i moved out. However, I now have a collection company attempting to collect a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars. There is no way that i owed that much even if i hadn''t arranged everything. I''ve tried to call the company and also sent in things to the credit bureaus but nothing is working and they refuse to send me a breakdown of the bill.','I.Q. DATA INTERNATIONAL, INC.',2.0,2.0,'ex husband left the apartment we were living in and sticking me with the only one paying the lease. he left the apartment in great condition and had another person set to take over the lease');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(349,'12/13/2018','Debt collection','Federal student loan debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','According to the Fair Credit Reporting Act, you are required by federal law to verify - through the physical verification of the original signed consumer contract - any and all accounts you post on a credit report. Otherwise, anyone paying for your reporting services could fax, mail or email in a fraudulent account. I demand to see the Verifiable Proof ( an original Consumer Contract with my Signature on it ) you have on file of the accounts listed below. Your failure to positively verify these accounts has hurt my ability to obtain credit. Under the FCRA, unverified accounts must be removed and if you are unable to provide me a copy of verifiable proof, you must remove the accounts.','BB&T CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'the Fair Credit Reporting Act requires you to verify any accounts you post on a credit report. if you are unable to provide me a copy of verifiable proof');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(350,'12/13/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I was sent two letters from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] regarding end-of-lease fees. The first amount was {$1500.00} ( approx ). This was for minor scratches and dents. This amount was sent to the credit bureaus as a " new monthly payment amount '''' and dropped my score heavily. I called chase and disputed the amount. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I received a letter dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for {$320.00}. It was actually hard to read and took about 5-6 reads to understand. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I received an email from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that my score dropped, this time 70 points due to missing a payment. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  sent it to the credit bureaus. I paid it on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on the phone with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and began disputing it as late, considering the letter had no indication of paying within 30 days. A woman at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  stated " pay upon receipt '''' means due when they send out the letter, which means the count down starts XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. She also stated I should know better than to call on a Saturday to figure things out, as her department isn''t open on Saturdays. That means no extra time for it to go through the USPS and arrive at a person ''s house. It took 5 mailing days to arrive. I disputed with Transunion and they replied that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said it is indeed correct. I received a letter in the mail dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( received XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) also from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating it is Massachusetts law that I can appeal the {$320.00}. I think that is a little late to issue such a letter, given the damage done.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a letter from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was sent to the credit bureaus. it was sent to the credit bureaus as a " new monthly payment');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(351,'12/12/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','Equifax has failed to properly investigate the following issues on my credit report in accordance with the FCRA. Their claim to have investigated the issues is false since the creditors have attempted no contact with me resulting from said investigations. Please see items below ACCOUNTS [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never late COLLECTIONS [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/2017 {$410.00} not mine [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/2017 {$41.00} not mine','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'Equifax has failed to properly investigate the issues on my credit report. their claim to have investigated the issues is false since the creditors have attempted no contact with me resulting from said investigations ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(352,'12/12/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','This is an entry for collection for a debt that says I owe a debt of {$550.00} to this company called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This a place whom I have never done business with. I have never opened an account with them. I never signed any contract with them for anything either. So they have the wrong person and this is inaccurately being reported and reflecting bad on my credit report. I bet they can not show you anything that I bought with them bearing my signature or a contract that I signed that shows that I owe them anything.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'debt says I owe a debt of $550.00 to this company. this is a place that I have never done business with. they have the wrong');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(353,'12/12/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I am disputing all negative marks on my experian credit report due to the recent hack of account information in their system and their lack of informing me of this security breach.I had disputed these items but they came back verified, but are fraudulent accounts.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'experian credit report has been hacked by accounts. they came back verified but are fraudulent accounts.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(354,'12/12/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','The VA has overpaid me entitlements twice in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for {$160.00} and {$320.00}, the debt was official {$0.00} as of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they took payments of the overpayment out of my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but yet it is showing up as a collection that was paid. The first time and only time it was reported to the credit bureau was XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I am in the middle of purchasing a home so I was told by the VA that I need to get with the credit bureau for removal the credit bureau is telling me they can''t remove without the VA consent. VA says they don''t issue delete letters only letters stating the payment for the debt was received. Also, the VA says they don''t do third-party calls but refuse to give the credit bureaus any form of assistance. This has been really taking a toll on our family as its holding up our closing','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'the debt was official $0.00 as of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the debt was official $0.00 and');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(355,'12/12/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','False statements or representation','I Q Data International Inc dba [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  has attempted to collect an alleged debt from me. I Q Data International Inc dba [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   has placed negative information on my consumer reports and has caused me financial harm. I.Q Data International is not a licensed debt collector in my state ( State of Texas ) and has violated state statutes regarding debt collection.','I.Q. DATA INTERNATIONAL, INC.',2.0,2.0,'I Q Data International Inc dba has placed negative information on consumer reports. I.Q Data International is not a licensed debt collector in my state.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(356,'12/12/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I am an identity theft victim. I am writing to dispute the following items on my credit report. Each of the accounts and transactions I dispute were opened and made by the thief, not by me. I never authorized, used, or benefited from these accounts or transactions in any way. I''ve reach out to the credit bureaus several times, but I was not successful as I''ve now learned that all the disputes and letters I''ve sent in were just verified electronically, or sent overseas for processing. I am wanting to block these fraudulent accounts from my credit report, they have don''t so much harm, and cost me lots of money with the lenders that I now do business with. After consulting with my attorney and a mortgage broker, then informed me of my options in handling my situation. 
I initiated contact with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] through their online dispute database. I listed accounts, addresses, name variations, as well as two SSN ''S  on my report that are not mine. This accounts were verified. So I called and spoke to a representative who said these accounts were verified and updated using an electronic method. 
Also stating that no physical verification or validation was needed, and that I would have to file a id theft report, police report and to contact CFPB. I will include my credit report and ID Theft report in this complaint.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'id theft victim disputes accounts and transactions. thief never authorized, used, or benefited from them. dispute database has verified accounts, addresses, name variations.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(357,'12/11/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] incorrectly charged off my account. After contacting them they advised me to dispute the error with the credit bureaus. After disputing with the bureaus I was advised contact the original lender. The account is being negatively reported and both the lender and bureau Transunion and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  are not willing to correct the issue.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the account is being negatively reported and both the lender and bureau are not willing to correct the issue.');
