INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(364,'12/10/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers','On XX/XX/2018 I was going to buy a trampoline for {$80.00} on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When buying they advertised if you buy something for more then {$50.00} and apply for the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit card they will give me {$45.00}. So I applied for the credit card that same day and was approved for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] limit. I attempted to use the card online and it was impossible to use. I called Syncrony Financial and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and they were not able to help to buy the trampoline with the credit card I qualified for. I called multiple times that day, and no one was able to help. They said they would email me a link to make the purchase with the new credit card and nothing worked. Synchrony said they were not able to give me the credit card info for security reasons. They informed me once I receive credit card to make purchase and I will receive the promotion. When I got credit card almost 2 weeks after I went into [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Website and bought the trampoline, and called Synrony to ask when will credit be applied, and they are telling me because I did not buy the product with the credit card that same day they can not honor the promotion. Then I called a second time and they said they will put in a request and it should take two day. I called today and they told me they don''t see the credit and that they will put another request and to give it two more days. At this point I have lost confidence in synchrony and I just want them to give me the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollar credit promotion as they promised. I don''t need the credit card I could have bought this cash, but I wanted to take advantage of the card promotion and the points they offered. I am so upset at them that I don''t even want to use the credit card anymore and I just want the credit. I am asking for them to be ethical and to give me the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars they promised.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'a trampoline was going to be bought for $80.00 on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. when buying they advertised if you buy');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(365,'12/10/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','XX/XX/2018 I obtained [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as my mobile service provider however soon after I initiated service I was unhappy with there network and service that I canceled, switched providers, and mailed back equipment in envenlopes supplied by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was then contacted by collection companies trying to collect on a debt. I do not owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I returned equipment and they have charged off balance and collection agencies keep trying to collect. In turn, bring my score down and resulting in many financial issues','Diversified Adjustment Service, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/2018 I obtained [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as my mobile service provider. after service I was unhappy with there network and service that I');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(366,'12/10/2018','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Closing on a mortgage','my wife and I [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], call this company to Refinance, everything they ask forms paper they got it, they give us closing day, so they sent that person to signing the documents [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] days after the closing the titles personal call me above other finance documents that they needing, they had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] days to collect all the information to continue or to stop the Refinance process.','Global Equity Finance, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ and his wife call this company to Refinance. they sent the person to signing the documents. they had [COMPTE');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(367,'12/10/2018','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Closing on a mortgage','On XX/XX/2018 I signed a contract to sell my home at {$120000.00}. The settlement date was XX/XX/2018. TWO DAYS prior to settlement, Wells-Fargo, the buyer ''s lender, shut down the loan due to paperwork missed and poorly recorded on their end. They claimed this was due to the date of the buyer ''s second FHA mortgage being too soon to the sale date of my current home. Something that was either incorrectly recorded or something that should have been found long before XX/XX/2018. I was contingent on the sale and therefore could not purchase my new home later the day of settlement.

Since then, the home I was going to purchase was put back on the market and I had to put my home back on the market shortly before [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This is the slowest time of the year for real-estate and I have received significantly lower offers on the home since this incident started. Offers I can''t accept because of the purchase price of my new home.

Additionally, I had 1 business day to cancel all of the utility/service transfers as well as new accounts I set up for my new home. I had to intercept mail being sent to my new home, I had repairs I had paid for the buyers, and both of my cats got sick when being sheltered for more home showings. Not to mention all the stress and chaos I have had to endure over the past few weeks. I bought appliances for my new home that sit in a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] warehouse while my credit card gets hit for the purchase. I have had to add additional time to my storage needs and live out of boxes while I try to sell my home. I lost electricity for a day, which included my heat in the dead of winter, since it was such short notice and I was mis-routed to the wrong department the day prior.

My mental state is exhausted with the stress Wells Fargo put on me. Surely, the buyer ''s family is suffering as well. I have worked numerous hours on reversing the outcome of Wells Fargo ''s last minute decision and I am still feeling the affects of their clearly untrained or uncaring staff. My work-life has suffered and as a single owner and only occupant for this home, I am taking on all costs and time spent dealing with this issue alone. Soon I will lose the new home I was under contract to purchase as it has been too long for them to wait for me.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/2018 was the first time I''ve been to sell my home. the buyer''s lender shut down the loan due to paperwork missed. the buyer');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(368,'12/09/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I disputed the information that OneMain reported on my credit report. I sent a certified letter that they signed for on XX/XX/2018 requesting validation of the debt. After 30 days, I didn''t receive a response. So, I sent a follow up certified letter on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], signed for by them on XX/XX/2018. I still have not received a response from them but they updated my credit report. They changed my payment history and added in the remarks section " consumer disputes ''''. They missed the 30 day timer allotted to them per the FCRA & FDCPA. They had 30 days to respond and it wasn''t until after I sent a follow up letter that they made any adjustments to my credit report and they never sent me any communications. They have violated the Fair Credit Reporting Act, Section 623 ( a ) ( 3 ) and/or the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act Section 807 ( 8 ) by not placing the disclosure within the required 30-day period.','ONEMAIN FINANCIAL HOLDINGS, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'oneMain signed a follow up certified letter requesting validation of the debt. they updated my credit report and changed my payment history. they have violated the Fair Credit Reporting');
