INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(388,'12/05/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Other features, terms, or problems','This morning, I filed a follow-up complaint ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ) because the response to my initial complaint was a voicemail with return telephone information that did not work. I received a response to this with the exact same information - an 800 number and access code that took me to a call center where no one was able to connect me to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s extension. I tried three times without success and only increasing frustration. on the last attempt, I spoke to a woman named [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], who refused to even try to connect me to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s extension before I provided " verification '''' but when I persisted, she finally looked up the extension number and informed me that it " was not working. '''' I am not going to return any further phone calls from Capital One. This is beyond aggravating and a completely unacceptable way to treat customers who have already been on the receiving end of unfair and deceptive practices. A company of this size should be able to manage a process for returning phone calls. If Capital One wishes to respond to this THIRD complaint, use my email.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a follow-up complaint was filed this morning. the response was a voicemail with return telephone information that did not work. the response was an 800 number and access code that');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(389,'12/05/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','Originally in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my mortgage was paid by two banks : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. However, the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payments ( two of {$410.00} ) were never applied to the account. I have been trying to call and resolve this matter with Wells Fargo Home Mortgage since XX/XX/XXXXr but to no avail. I never get the same person. When I try to use an extension or an email was given to me, I don''t get a response, get a voicemail, and never get a callback. 

Finally last month, they figured out that the cash department had not received the payments I had made from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bank. You looked into the matter and told me you found the payments had been applied to the home projects account I had opened. You said this money would be moved and applied to my mortgage. 

Instead, however, I received a check in the mail cut for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] because they had to move the money that way because of tax ID purposes. However, when using that money to pay my mortgage, I was still charged a late fee. Therefore, I need to be credited a late fee from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to make up for the clerical errors on Wells Fargo ''s part. 

Similarly, this has now created ANOTHER issue with the home mortgage project account, as it is not showing an outstanding balance for the amount the check was cut for. I am not sure why this is ; I was told the cash department applied my payments to that account, NOT my mortgage. Therefore, where is the cash that I had sent that was said would be applied? 

I am growing increasingly concerned, as this was supposed to be rectified. Instead, there is now another [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] discrepancy, and multiple late fees involved. It is showing me I owe on that home project account now, one that has been at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance for over two years. I want to get that to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and close that account. 

This whole manner is very disconcerting and the amount of time/red tape involved in trying to get this handled. I got a letter from Wells Fargo company stating it had been taken care of and they were checking credit bureaus to make sure it had not been reported ; I felt relieved that everything was being dealt with. Then I got the check in the mail just before the holiday weekend, and it all started again. 

Since then, I have tried calling a whole team of people, and no one will return my calls or emails. 
[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - Team Lead [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - apparently out of the office until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I have also reached out to Wells Fargo on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], as well as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  of Community Banking and Lending. We live in Ohio, and despite the fact you own our mortgage, there is not a branch office in a reasonable distance we can walk into. 

The only payment I have missed is the current one because the account is saying there was unapplied funds. I have tried calling to talk about what this means and where they came from before more of my money gets misallocated.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'a cash department has not received the payments from a bank. the cash department has not received the payments from a bank. the cash department has now credited the payments to');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(390,'12/05/2018','Mortgage','Home equity loan or line of credit (HELOC)','Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage','I believe Wells Fargo should not collect a fee on an equity mortgage application until the credit has been approved as my wife and I are told we have to wait 30 to 45 days for a refund. We have some money, so we can wait but what about people who are broke and apply and are put in the same situation as the fee is over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars. The following is what happened : On XX/XX/2018 my wife and I applied for a home equity loan against our newly built fully paid for home. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loan with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] home value. After two weeks on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] were told to pay a fee of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to allow the process to continue and were told the loan should go through by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], which we paid.. I was told to call the bank the morning of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and found the loan had been declined. I would like the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] back, as I believe the bank should have told us prior to paying a fee, the loan was declined. No appraisal was ever performed. I believe the fee was requested just to collect money. The bank should not collect any fee until the loan is approved.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/2018 my wife and I applied for a home equity loan. they were told to pay a fee of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(391,'12/04/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','You, AGS Solutions, Inc must be a Third Party Debt Collector and I do not give you permission to interfere into My Commercial affairs. If you are assuming that you are representing Me, you are Hereby Fired and your Power of Attorney is Hereby Revoked. 
As proof of claim, complete the attached CREDITOR DISCLOSURE STATEMENT and return within 15 days. 
Failure to respond with the completed CREDITOR DISCLOSURE STATEMENT, thereby providing your verified Proof of Claim, signed under the Penalties of Perjury and verified by your affidavit, you, AGS Solutions, Inc are agreeing to your Commercial Dishonor, exhausting My Administrative Remedies. I will accept your Silence as an Acceptance, and your agreement that a Default be entered against you. You will also agree to a Full Tacit Contractual Agreement being a participant in Fraud and to forfeit all remedies under Administrative Law, Judicial Law, and / or MARITIME CLAIM RULES C ( 6 ). 
You should also be aware that sending unsubstantiated demands for payment through the United States Mail System might constitute mail fraud under federal and state law Your failure to satisfy this request within the requirements of the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act will be construed as your absolute waiver of any and all claims against me, and your tacit agreement to compensate me for costs and attorney fees. This is my notice to AGS Solutions , Inc to Cease and Desist 15 USC 1692c 805.  Communication in connection with debt collection. I have no paperwork or contract for business with AGS Solutions.','ASG Solutions LLC',2.0,4.0,'you, AGS Solutions, Inc must be a third party Debt Collector. if you are assuming that you are representing Me, you are Hereby Fired. ');
