INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(408,'11/30/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','Had difficulty contacting student loan grantor to submit forbearance/deferment request and representative at my college institution was not properly assisting me in getting the forbearance/deferment request submitted. I initially tried to contact school and loan grantor to set up arrangement in XX/XX/2018 and did not manage to get forbearance/deferment completed, accepted and posted until XX/XX/2018. Due to this the loan grantor reported on my credit that i was delinquent on each student loan debt as the full amount is currently broken up into parts on my credit report. The forbearance/deferment request was accepted and on my credit is says that i was late to make the payments however this was not due to my own negligence but rather was due to the loan grantor and school not assisting me in a timely manner to get the request processed.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'student loan grantor submitted forbearance/deferment request. school and loan grantor did not get forbearance/deferment completed. the full amount is');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(409,'11/30/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','Submitted a credit inquiry application without my permission','CORELOGIC INC',2.0,2.0,'Submitted a credit inquiry application without my permission.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(410,'11/30/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers','While shopping for new appliances on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at sears.com I was offered 10 % or up to 18 months interest free if I applied for and used a Sears store card. I used the provided apply and use now " button ''''. I completed the application process and was given a credit line of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] by Citi bank After doing so it asked me for the full account number, expiration and security code. None of witch were provided to me. I attempted to log into the credit card site it wanted the full account info, expiration and security code to proceed. 

I called Citi bank. They told me I would have to wait for the physical card to make a online purchase. I explained to them that I was offered a discount and applied to use the card now. They informed me that I had to wait for the physical card. I could use the account only in stores by having the cashier look up my account with my social security number. I asked to speak to a manager and was placed on hold and after 10 min was either hung up on or got disconnected. 

I called back and was told by this person that Sears online would have to deal with this and was transferred over to them..The person I talked to immediately transferred me back to Citi bank. I explained the situation to this poor rep and asked to be transferred back to Sears online customer  service and was hung up on or disconnected. 

I then called Sears Online and explained the situation to the rep and asked for a supervisor. The reason I gave was that I was offered 10 % or no interest for applying and using a Sears card. That I had been informed that I would not be able to use the account without the physical card. I wanted to know if I purchased the items would they be willing to give me a 10 % discount or would they be able to reverse the transaction and put it on the account when I did get the card. I was asked to hold, after 20 min I got a automated message in Spanish ( which I don''t speak ) and hung up on. 

I then called Citi bank again I told the rep that I wanted the account closed and it reported that it was opened under fraudulent circumstances. I explained to the rep that I was offed a substantial financial incentive to open the account. A incentive that was not honored. The rep stated that I willingly opened the account so it was not fraudulent and that it was not Citi bank ''s responsibility that the terms were not honored. They then closed the account, told me to have a nice day and hung up. 

All this took 4 hours of my day. I did order my items off Sears.com with  my debit card. 
Citi bank now has my complete info with wages etc.and I took a hit to my credit score. No parties feel obligated to honor the original promotion that started this mess.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,4.0,'a customer service rep told me that I would not be able to use the account without the physical card. the rep asked for a supervisor and asked for a supervisor.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(411,'11/30/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','On XX/XX/2018 ( 38 days before foreclosure ) we submitted by fax requested information of getting loan modified due to death in the family of primary mortgage holder ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) per conversation with Mr. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of State Home Mortgage. Mr. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] verified that he had received the docs on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On XX/XX/2018 Mr. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] needed more documents an asked for info on roommate and it was sent via email given by Mr. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. After two weeks had passed with no calls, emails or any other form of communication a call was made to Mr. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] concerning status and was told that a letter was sent out requesting documents ( to our suprise ). We waited another 3 days but still nothing came in the mail so another call was made and another representative unknown started inquiring about the loan and made reference to proof of residency after having provided the requested documents on XX/XX/2018. The file had been closed because information hadnt been received but nothing was ever asked. She then requested more documents and said that an email would be sent to detail everything. So on XX/XX/2018 ( Friday ) an email was sent requesting detail documents and those documents were sent back on XX/XX/2018 ( Monday ). After a 3 days a call was made but no answer, 4 days another call but no answer. Another call was made on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but no answer so an email was sent asking for updates but no response. After routinely calling everyday finally a voice picks up on XX/XX/2018 and Mr. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] informs us that file was turned down due to missing information not being turned in before the deadline on XX/XX/2018. I explained to him how can it be turned down for missing information that you just emailed us on XX/XX/2018 that was promptly given to you on next business day. Mr. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said the lady that was handling this was out an wouldn''t be back until after the foreclosure day. He said he would call back but we have yet to hear from him and I dont expect he will he hasnt been trustworthy in responding. While we had been going thru all this foreclosure proceeding was still proceeding. We have always provided the information that was needed in a timely manner, and have done as asked accordingly. We had thought to work something out but now given that it is 3 days before foreclosure and we havent resolved this we are forced to do the drastic measure of possibly filing bankruptcy. We are writing the consumer department because we thought this entity was in place to protect the consumer against bank actions such as these. Please help [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','State Home Mortgage',2.0,2.0,'on XX/XX/2018 we submitted by fax requested information of getting loan modified due to death in the family of primary mortgage holder. a call was made to Mr');
