INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(418,'11/29/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Opening an account','I opened a Citi checking and savings account on XX/XX/2018 through a special offer. The terms of the offer were : Open a new checking and savings account, deposit {$15000.00} in new-to-Citibank funds into the checking or savings accounts. Maintain that minimum balance for 60 consecutive calendar days. Then receive {$400.00} in your checking account! I had deposited {$8500.00} on XX/XX/2018 into my checking and {$7000.00} into my savings on XX/XX/2018. I maintained that balance for 60 days ( 60 days from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] would be XX/XX/2018 ). I called Citi customer service on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and they notified me that the bonus showed as linked to my account and would post within 90 days of maintaining the balance for 60 days ( 90 days from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] would be XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). I called again on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and the agent that if the bonus didn''t post by XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to call again. I called again on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and the agent explicitly confirmed that I was eligible and should have received the bonus. The agent put a ticket for investigation ( the case number is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and told me that I would be contacted by email within 2 business days. It is now XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I have not been contacted. I have attached my transaction histories so you can see when the accounts were funded and that the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance was maintained up until today XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Not once has Citi reached out to me despite not fulfilling their terms.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'I opened a Citi checking and savings account on XX/XX/2018. the terms of the offer were: open a new checking and savings account, deposit $');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(419,'11/28/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','have a public record & Child Support entry that was placed on my credit report and I have been trying for over 12 months to get this entry removed. I have spoken with numbers representatives, supervisors, and managers in regards to the erroneous public record and I have yet to get it resolved. This is my 14th dispute in which I am currently awaiting results. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I called and spoke with a representative and inquired how [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Experian verifies their public records. I want to know this information because the public record keeps coming back as mine. I had 20 representatives that told me that the request/dispute is sent as a message to the courthouse through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Once the court verifies it, the information is sent back to the credit bureau. I advised that I would like to cancel that dispute and they advised that because the dispute was already sent to the courthouse, I will need to contact them with my name and the case number. Being that I work for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I know the court system and their procedures, but decided to call anyway. 
Contacted the court and they advised that they do no disclose, release or verify any information with the credit bureaus or any 3rd parties. I decided to call [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  back, spoke with another rep this time and they advised that the information is verified by the runner who goes to the court house. I asked what information does the runner give to the courthouse, and how and what kind of physical information does the runner give back to the credit bureau. They could not answer that, and I requested to speak with the manager. Manager advised since this is a re-investigation, no runner is involved. She advised that they use a form that they send over to the courthouse. I asked what type of form and where is it sent because the courthouse confirmed that they do not verify any information with the bureaus. All 3 major bureaus refuses to give my physical documentation ( whether tangible or electronic ) that they use to verify this these accounts are mine.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'a public record & Child Support entry was placed on my credit report. the entry was placed on my credit report and I have yet to get it resolved. this is my 14');
