INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(441,'11/24/2018','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Personal line of credit','Getting a line of credit','I was offer a loan for US {$5000.00} ; gave to this so call bank US {$600.00}. 

Never got the loan and now they hang up the phone on me when I call them. 

I know, I have been scammed and probably never get my money back, but I would like to protect others from this kind of scam. 

Hi [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]! 

Good day and Congratulations!! 

It is our pleasure to inform you that the loan application we received from a partner online lender was processed and approved for a personal unsecured loan of {$5000.00} with flat 3.4 % interest rate and flexible repayment options. Please refer to the simple table below for more details. 


