INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(455,'11/20/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I am a victim of Identity Theft. This began in XX/XX/2015, after my wallet was stolen. Inside my wallet was my Drivers License, Social Security Card and email addresses. I didnt notice this was occurring until recent. I notified TransUnion of FRAUD that has been occurring on my credit report. I show two FRAUDULENT. Accounts that I am requesting to be blocked, as these were opened after my identity was stolen. TransUnion refuses to assist with the fraud, and continues to ignore the Identity Theft Affidavit that I have attached. Transunion is allowing two Fraudulent accounts listed in my Identity theft affidavit to be placed on my credit report knowing these accounts are fraudulent. I did not authorize these accounts to open in XX/XX/2015, Not only do the account credit limits appear incorrectly, Transunion has been notified that these are fraudulent and continue to allow the fraudulent accounts to appear on my credit reports. I did not open these accounts, I never received any credit cards from this institution. When the thief stole my wallet, they stole my social security card, Drivers License, and forwarded my mail. In addition the company has already been notified that I did not authorize these accounts. There are two [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts that Transunion knowingly allows. These accounts are fraudulent and are listed as such on my Identity theft affidavit which is a legal document I am attaching below again. I am requesting these accounts be blocked immediately as I never signed anything for this institution. Nor did I ever receive any information on these accounts. When I called the credit union, the agent advised me these had been opened at an address listed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Neither of these addresses are mine, nor did I ever live there. Since then the credit union, has verbally harassed me and threatened to show up at my door. These accounts are not mine these were opened as a result of Identity Theft, PER THE FCRA Law. I am reporting this crime to you, along with a Law Enforcement affidavit. Please block the Inquiries listed on the Affidavit along with these two [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  accounts. That I did not authorize. This is not a dispute. This is a statement that I am a VICTIM OF IDENTITY THEFT. Therefore please follow the proper laws in blocking the accounts that have been opened fraudulently.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'thief stole my wallet, stole my social security card and sent mail. he notified TransUnion of FRAUD that has been occurring on my credit report. ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(456,'11/20/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','On XX/XX/2018, I filed a complaint against LexisNexis with the CFPB, Case # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], about an erroneous reported bankruptcy appearing on my credit report. I requested they provide me with the original creditors name and telephone number, and who they spoke to that physically verified this account was indeed mine. 
On XX/XX/2018, I received a letter from LexisNexis stating they had indeed verified this account as accurate. I am writing this complaint to the CFPB to notify them that LexisNexis has violated my FCRA rights and I intend to pursue litigation against LexisNexis for monetary relief for this violation. 
In the letter sent to me, LexisNexis states they received verification of this erroneous verified bankruptcy from LexisNexis [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a company which they indicate sells public records to a variety of customers, including consumer reporting agencies such as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . LexisNexis [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has no role in determining what public records relate to which consumer.

This is a violation of FCRA 611 ( 6 ) ( iii ) which I have also included in my complaint. LexisNexis did NOT verify the accuracy of this erroneous account with the ORIGINAL CREDITOR, which would be the US BANKRUPTCY COURT, but instead received it from a third party wholesaler of public records, who by the way, retrieved it from the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] system, which is a public records reporting system which legally in court cases has been shown to be notorious for reporting wrong information. I demand this erroneous bankruptcy be removed from my LexisNexis credit report IMMEDIATELY or else litigation for violation of my FCRA rights will be swiftly forthcoming!','LEXISNEXIS',2.0,2.0,'a letter from LexisNexis stating they verified this account as accurate. the letter states they received verification of this erroneous verified bankruptcy. the CF');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(457,'11/20/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','attached is a copy of the complaint that has been sent to experian twice they refuse to do anything','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'experian experian has been sent a copy of the complaint. experians refuse to do anything.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(458,'11/20/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I recently found identity theft onXX/XX/2018 using an internet monitoring service. All accounts listed in this report are fraud, Wrong Spelling my name, Wrong Addresses.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'identity theft onXX/XX/2018.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(459,'11/20/2018','Student loan','Private student loan','Struggling to repay your loan','I graduated in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with a substantial amount of debt. I immediately enlisted in the military with hopes for additional repayment options, etc. I utilized the SCRA to help while [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], however AES/PHEAA/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] immediately began their scare tactics upon my discharge. 

The first straw was in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when the co-borrow called to make a payment on a past due loan that was through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They took the money, allocated wherever they wanted, neglecting the loan that actually needed to be paid. It defaulted. Once questioned as to why it wasn''t sent to the right accounts, the response was " he didn''t say he wanted it all allocated there ''''. COMMON SENSE SAYS TO PUT IT WHERE IT NEEDS TO BE- NOT WHERE IT ISN''T NEEDED. They conducted an " internal investigation '''', claiming they listened to the recordings and were not at fault. Yeah, right. I told them about his age ( and why he doesn''t do online payments ) and they said- " maybe he was just confused ''''. DISGUSTING! My father ended up using his entire savings to cover this loan once it was in default/collection. 

I have called countless times to make other payment arrangements, only to be told by one representative I had such and such options and getting my hopes up. But then I get notice that my loans are 90+ days past due and my good faith payments were for nothing. I then call back and get a representative saying things such as " I don''t know why the last person would have told you that '''' and escalating me to a " supervisor '''' who said that things just haven''t processed to reflect the amount owed. A week later, I see I''m 103 days past due. I call back yet again to be told : " you used all the options available ''''. 

In short, I want to pay! I just can''t pay the amount they want. I can''t get a consolidation loan somewhere else because [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/AES has ruined my credit beyond belief. I''m to the point that I ask myself why pay at all? If what I can give isn''t good enough, I may as well keep the money in my pocket to pay my rent and eat. 

The original cosigner for the loans is now [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and living on Social Security. WHY are options for repayment so limited? I''d sell a kidney just to be able to move my loans to another servicing company with actual legitimate repayment terms. They have done nothing short of ruining my credit and quality of life.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'a co-borrow called to make a payment on a past due loan. they took the money, allocated wherever they wanted, neglecting the loan. they said they');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(460,'11/19/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers','Dear sir or madam, I applied for an American Express credit card and was approved XX/XX/2018. The promotion was was that I receive [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] points after spending {$3000.00} in the first three months. Also, one free weekend stay after one year. I did not receive the card until XX/XX/2018.I had contacted AMEX by phone and online to tell them that I had not received the card. I could not register it on line because I did not have it. In my last call to AMEX on the subject of the missing card, the very nice young lady understood and send my card next day mail. I am being denied my bonus points because AMEX says that I did not spend the {$3000.00} in three months. They are using ( the fine print apparently says they can ) XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as my starting date. I surpassed the {$3000.00} before XX/XX/2018.I do not think that it is fair business practice to start my timeline when I had No Card. 
I have made multiple contacts with AMEX # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Initially, I was told there was no offer. Then it was a different offer. Then it would take 6 to 8 weeks to find out what had happened. Then a couple of days ago, I received a message on my account that I did not meet the qualifier.I called in to explain that I did not have the card until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. All of these interactions are a matter of record. Those dates are not in dispute. AMEX admits that I did not have the card until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].They don''t care. How is this fair business practice? It smacks of bait and switch. Switch from something to nothing. Thank you for your help. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'AMEX says that I did not have the card until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. a few days ago, ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(461,'11/19/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','On XX/XX/2018 I opened checking and savings Account with Citibank. I signed up online and was offer a {$400.00} promotional bonus. I have never had any checking accounts with Citibank before and I met all of their conditions, so there is no reason I should not have qualified for this bonus. These were the conditions of the bonus that I met. 

1. Open a new checking and savings account in the Citibank Account Package between XX/XX/18-XX/XX/18. ( Opened XX/XX/18 ) 2. Within 30 days of opening your account deposit {$15000.00} new-to-Citibank funds into the checking or savings account. A minimum of {$1500.00} must be in the checking account and a minimum of {$100.00} must be in the savings account. ( On XX/XX/18, 24 days after opening {$100.00} was deposited into savings and 28 days after opening {$15000.00} was deposited on XX/XX/18 ) 3. Maintain a minimum balance of {$15000.00} in your eligible linked checking and savings account for 60 days. ( 60 days was XX/XX/18, balance was maintained until XX/XX/18 ) 4. Get {$400.00} deposited to your account! ( This never happened ) I have made several contacts with Citibank, and am continually getting the run around. They keep saying they are processing my request and have submitted cases to get my bonus, but it never happens and they keep extending the date when it will be completed. Here is a log of my calls : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was told that I qualified for the bonus as of XX/XX/2018, but it can take up to 90 days to be credited to my account, so I need to wait until XX/XX/2018. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] No bonus. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] via chat said I had met the qualifications of the bonus and that he would submit an investigation for the promotional bonus and it would take up to 7 business days for it to be resolved. I found out on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], that he never did. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] via chat said that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] did not open a case for me regarding the missing bonus. She verified that I met the qualifications of the bonus, and created the case. She gave me case # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. She said allow 5-7 business days for it to be resolved. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] via chat said call [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] if I still didn''t have my bonus, because I should have my bonus by XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Called and asked to speak to a supervisor. Supervisor said it''s taking 30 days to post bonuses and there''s nothing she can do to speed this up. 

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Transferring to one-stop handle promotion deals Transferred to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]- ( # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) This is the first time anyone has given me any ID number. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said no one had been reviewed my case yet, and there''s nothing he can do other than maybe open another case or I could try speaking to a supervisor. 
Delight-supervisor, says 10 business days, contacting investigator. Decision with in 10 business. Need a supervisor to approve a supervisor, and this has been done and it''s on the final stage. Delight will be giving me a call back and will call by Friday XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]- supervisor said these investigations take 30 days. I told him that I''m continually getting brushed off and each time I call they give me new dates and excuses as to why I don''t have the bonus. I asked if I could speak to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. He said that he sent her an email for her to call me.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'on XX/XX/2018, I opened checking and savings account with Citibank. I signed up online and was offer a $400.00 promotional bonus.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(462,'11/19/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','Claim # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Amount : {$2700.00} On XX/XX/2018 I noticed activity on my account that I did not authorize. I contacted Bank of America immediately and reported all of the charges that I did not make and verified charges that I did make. I informed the fraud specialist I spoke with that I live in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Florida and did not visit [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I dont know how or why there are numerous charges occurring in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which I didnt authorize. The claims specialist started a claim in the amount of {$2700.00} with claim number of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was advised that I would need to wait ten business days for an answer to my claim. On XX/XX/2018 I was advised that my claim has been denied. I called in and spoke to a claims supervisor by the name of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who escalated my claim after she found discrepancies relating to research the analyst used to deny my claim. I was advised my claim is still open, but bank of America hasnt provided any temporary credit, nor documentation as to the current status of my claim. 

I personally reached out without Bank of America ''s help to the numerous merchants where my card was fraudulently used and ascertained as much information as I could. I also reached out the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] precincts of the NYPD in-regards to the fraud and was told by a detective [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that Bank of America will have to pursue it. 

The reason I am filing a claim with the CFPB is that Bank of America did not adhere to the ten-day investigation guidelines. My claim is still open and yet my account hasnt been temporarily credited and no other information has been given. I want my claim to be investigated and the Federal guidelines followed.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'claims specialist started a claim in the amount of $2700.00. he told me that my claim has been denied. he told me that my claim is still');
