Please help me. Thank you.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'credit reports were obtained by the creditors and the 3 credit bureaus. the CRA''s continue to report as verified, although they clearly did not verify these errors.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(464,'11/19/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','On XX/XX/2018, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ran a hard inquiry on my credit. The creation of my new joint checking account with the Bank was completed on XX/XX/2018. However, as I was signing up for the joint checking account there was no note that a hard inquiry would be ran in order to approve the creation of the account. This unauthorized inquiry into my credit has lowered my credit score. Additionally, I have attempted to fund my account and have started auto-deposits from one bank to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and have yet to see it be reflected in my account. To date I have funded the account with {$500.00} that appears as deducted from my origin bank account but does not appear in my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'the creation of my new joint checking account with the Bank was completed on XX/XX/2018. unauthorized inquiry into my credit has lowered my credit score.');
