I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with whom I have my credit cards and an auto loan. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stated that they have been sending my credit history to Equifax since 2014. I called Equifax back and they stated that they have no record of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and to call them back and make sure they are sending it to the correct person because my dad and I have the same name. I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] back and they stated they have the correct information and have been sending it to all three credit agencies. We have been going back and forth with Equifax for the last 10 days and may lose our down payment and home because of their negligence. 
I need Equifax to allow my mortgage company to pull my credit report with my credit history and provide my credit score as soon as possible so I do not lose my deposit on the home I want to purchase before the deadline.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'mortgage company ran credit report after agent refused access to account. mortgage company called me and gave me access to account. mortgage counselor instructed me to call them because they are responsible for credit scores');
