INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(505,'11/09/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','False statements or representation','XX/XX/18 I received notification from my credit bureaus [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my credit has been changed. I viewed the debt collector asking for approximately {$2300.00}. I am concerned because that is very incorrect and false information and furthermore I never received notice of a court date for allegations of a judgement. I know my security deposit was a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars and the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] apartments kept ALL of my security deposit. The day I vacated I asked the managers assistant and main manager for documentation providing I am leaving and everything as been satisfied. I was told yes and my security deposit will be sent to me by mail. I can leave now. I do have a video recording of this conversation because I am aware this apartment complex has commited fraudulent claims in the past. I also have a witness who was present during this conversation. I also have pictures to show the apartment was left as is and clean. This extremely high judgement is a false claim and detrimental to my credit history and character as a consumer. I want this information corrected immediately. I also would like to see the file of what was alleged for judgement so I can dispute in court if need be, as I have every proof needed to show this amount is false and incorrect information on my credit report.','COLLECTIONS USA, INC.',2.0,4.0,'credit bureaus notified me of my credit history. a judge has ruled that the judgment is false and false. the debt collector has never received notice of a court date');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(506,'11/08/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','( a ) BlockExcept as otherwise provided in this section, a consumer reporting agency shall block the reporting of any information in the file of a consumer that the consumer identifies as information that resulted from an alleged identity theft, not later than [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] business days after the date of receipt by such agency of ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) appropriate proof of the identity of the consumer ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a copy of an identity theft report ; ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) the identification of such information by the consumer ; and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a statement by the consumer that the information is not information relating to any transaction by the consumer. 
[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] b [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] consumer reporting agency shall promptly notify the furnisher of information identified by the consumer under subsection [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a ) ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) that the information [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] be a result of identity theft ; ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) that an identity theft report has been filed ; ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) that a block has been requested under this section ; and ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) of the effective dates of the block. 
[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to decline or rescind ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] consumer reporting agency [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] decline to block, or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] rescind any block, of information relating to a consumer under this section, if the consumer reporting agency reasonably determines that ( A ) the information was blocked in error or a block was requested by the consumer in error ; ( B ) the information was blocked, or a block was requested by the consumer, on the basis of a material misrepresentation of fact by the consumer relevant to the request to block ; or ( C ) the consumer obtained possession of goods, services, or money as a result of the blocked transaction or transactions. 
( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) Notification to consumer If a block of information is declined or rescinded under this subsection, the affected consumer shall be notified promptly, in the same manner as consumers are notified of the reinsertion of information under section [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( a ) ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) ( B ) of this title. 
( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) Significance of block For purposes of this subsection, if a consumer reporting agency rescinds a block, the presence of information in the file of a consumer prior to the blocking of such information is not evidence of whether the consumer knew or should have known that the consumer obtained possession of any goods, services, or money as a result of the block. 
( d ) Exception for resellers ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) No reseller fileThis section shall not apply to a consumer reporting agency, if the consumerreporting agency ( A ) is a reseller ; ( B ) is not, at the time of the request of the consumer under subsection ( a ), otherwise furnishing or reselling a consumer report concerning the information identified by the consumer ; and ( C ) informs the consumer, by any means, that the consumer [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] report the identity theft to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to obtain consumer information regarding identity theft. 
( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) Reseller with fileThe sole obligation of the consumer reporting agency under this section, with regard to any request of a consumer under this section, shall be to block the consumer report maintained by the consumer reporting agency from any subsequent use, if [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the consumer, in accordance with the provisions of subsection [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a ), identifies, to a consumerreporting agency, information in the file of the consumer that resulted from identity theft ; and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the consumer reporting agency is a reseller of the identified information. 
( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) Notice [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] carrying out its obligation under paragraph ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), the reseller shall promptly provide a notice to the consumer of the decision to block the file. Such notice shall contain the name, address, and telephone number of each consumer reporting agency from which the consumer information was obtained for resale. 
[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for verification companies The provisions of this section do not apply to a check services company, acting as such, which issues authorizations for the purpose of approving or processing negotiable instruments, electronic fund transfers, or similar methods of payments, except that, beginning [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] business days after receipt of information described in paragraphs ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) through ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) of subsection [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a ), a check services company shall not report to a national consumer reporting agency described in section [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( p ) of this title, any information identified in the subject identity theft report as resulting from identity theft. 
( f ) Access to blocked information by law enforcement agencies No provision of this section shall be construed as requiring a consumer reporting agency to prevent a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], or local law enforcement agency from accessing blocked information in a consumer file to which the agency could otherwise obtain access under this subchapter.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'consumer reporting agency blocks reporting of information in file of consumer. consumer reporting agency declines to block or rescinds. consumer reporting agency declines to block the reporting of information');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(507,'11/08/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','Written notification about debt','Midwest Recovery Systems is NOT licensed to collect debt in the state of Florida. Their license expired in XX/XX/2013. They have NOT renewed their license, and they have NOT notified me of any debt prior to reporting. According to the Fair Credit Debt Collection act, and the Fair Credit Reporting Act, I am supposed to be notified of a debt and given sufficient time to dispute or resolve the debt. This debt was reported without my acknowledgement and they are violating my HIPPA rights.','Midwest Recovery Systems',2.0,2.0,'Midwest Recovery Systems is NOT licensed to collect debt in the state of Florida. their license expired in XX/XX/2013. they have NOT renewed their license.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(508,'11/08/2018','Vehicle loan or lease','Loan','Managing the loan or lease','Thank you very much for your response. First of all, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] where I purchased the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] already called me on Sunday ( XX/XX/2018 ) and informed me that they had already sent the check amounting to {$2400.00} to Santander. However, Santander bank claims that they have not yet received this {$2400.00} dollar amount refunded and which should be deducted from my principal amount. Please can you find out who among these, either [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or Santander Bank is telling the truth about my {$2400.00} before the money disappears again? 
Secondly, the Santander Bank still does not clarify/verify the exact amount of Principal ( money ) I will owe them after this fraudulent warranty that was even voided before it could take effect amounting to ( {$2400.00} ) is returned and is deducted from my principal amount. Although Santander agrees to deduct this amount of {$2400.00} from my Principal amount of purchase of this [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. In the response letter from Santander Bank ; Santander bank explains that I am expected to pay the same amount of money ( {$470.00} per-month for this car loan ) over the next 60 months as was previously signed. This can not be the case because after the principal amount has been reduced, I can not still pay the same earlier bill for this car. And as per the laws in California, loans are charged with simple interest. Please can you prevail on Santander bank to ensure that they do trustworthy and fair business and that I am not illegally billed unfairly even after this illegally warranty by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is refunded ( which [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] claims to have already sent the check to Santander but Santander says they have NOT yet received the check of {$2400.00} ).  Thank you','SANTANDER CONSUMER USA HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,4.0,'Santander bank claims they have not yet received this $2400.00 dollar amount refunded. the bank says they have not yet received this $2400.00');
