INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(529,'11/04/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Struggling to pay your bill','I have been in the hospital for 21 days and have been unable to work due to this. I have been extremely ill for 3 months and have been falling behind financially. I was unable to make my payment on time to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], however they were not willing to work with me. It is now showing as late on my credit report which I have worked so hard on trying to fix. I do not want to file bankruptcy if I can help it.','Atlanticus Services Corporation',2.0,2.0,'i have been in the hospital for 21 days and have been unable to work due to this. i was unable to make my payment on time to [COMPTE_');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(530,'11/04/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','On XX/XX/2018, I opened an HSBC Advance checking account to take advantage of the attached {$350.00} Welcome Deposit bonus offer. I deposited {$10000.00} into the account, maintained the balance for 90 days and waited the additional 8 weeks for the bonus to credit. After the 8 weeks expired, I contacted HSBC several times through their live online chat, their 1-800 phone number and their website ''s secure mail. I was promised that they would open a case, contact the promotional team and get back to me. I never received a follow up and it''s been 2 months since I should have received the bonus at the latest and since I first was promised they would get back to me. I continue to maintain the {$10000.00} balance in the account.','HSBC NORTH AMERICA HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,2.0,'HSBC Advance deposited $350.00 Welcome Deposit bonus offer. waited 8 weeks for bonus to credit.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(531,'11/03/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I asked for validation from medical data systems complaint number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they they have not provided it according to the fdcpa and the are reporting incorrect information on my credit report according to the fcra. They stated they do not own the account nor the debt well if you look back at the complaint number listed above you will see if clearly states this communication is from a debt collector so they is giving false information out and they is not compliant with the fdcpa laws. They are a debt collector and i do not have to pay them anything regardless of who they work for and i do not owe them anything and they can not prove that i do. 

Under the Fair Debt Collections Practices Act ( FDCPA ), I have the right to request validation of the debt they say I owe them. I am requesting proof that I am indeed the party they are asking to pay this debt, the date of the alleged medical service, the name of the patient, and proof that there is some contractual obligation which is binding on me to pay this debt. 
I am asking theyPlease attach copies of : Any agreement with your client that grants them the authority to collect on this alleged debt, or proof of acquisition by purchase or assignment, and authorization under subtitle D of the ARRA, SEC. 13401. APPLICATION OF SECURITY PROVISIONS AND PENALTIES TO BUSINESS ASSOCIATES OF COVERED ENTITIES ; and SEC. 13407 ( 1 ) BREACH OF SECURITY.

The term breach of security means, with respect to unsecured PHR identifiable health information of an individual in a personal health record, acquisition of such information without the authorization of the individual. 
Please note that enforcement of penalties against them is covered under the penalty rules of the Omnibus Final Rule effective 09/23/2013 interpreting and implementing various provisions of the Health Information Technology for Economic and Clinical Health Act of 2009 ( HITECH Act ) as  issued 11/30/2009 and the penalty rules of the FCRA and FACTA including FACT Act changes final rules effective July 1, 2010.I want this inaccurate information deleted off my credit report and i will continue to file a complaint under my voice id heard my the cfpb and ftc.','Medical Data Systems, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'fdcpa says they have not provided the information on my credit report. they say they do not own the account or the debt well. they say they are giving false');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(532,'11/03/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','To Whom it may concern : On XX/XX/2018 we rented a compact car from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The rental fee amount for the duration of the rental ( 10 days ) was paid in cash, in order to get a lower rental rate. Per our contract attached to this document, there was a rental refundable deposit charged to our card in the amount of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] pesos, plus {$1300.00} added to cover rental fee difference, due to cash shortage at the time of the rental. 

