Today, we contact them again and were told that due to an internal government and bank fraud investigation all funds have been frozen pending an investigation. 

Citibank has closed the case on me twice and have not provided a credit to our account.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,4.0,'a refundable deposit was paid to our card in the amount of a rental fee. the vehicle was returned with no damages or fuel charges. the refund was due to be issued');
