INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(537,'11/02/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','On XX/XX/2018 I submitted an initial dispute to all three credit bureaus, specifically requesting the validation of debt that I was disputing on my credit report and the removal of such accounts is the proof was not produced. On XX/XX/2018, I sent a second dispute letter to all bureaus reminding them of the fair credit reporting act and their obligations as companies that furnish such information. I have yet to receive any proof of the debts/ accounts I am disputing. The 30 days for each letter has passed and the dispute has not been handled properly under the consumer laws of the FCRA. Each of these debts have been disputed and deleted in the past and keeps reappearing on my credit report, being either sold or charged off each time they are disputed. The specific accounts I am disputing have made it to the collections section of my credit report which is heavily damaging my credit score. The credit bureaus have failed me as a consumer by not ensuring that the information being reported by them is identified correctly. I am requesting that once and for all these accounts be deleted from my credit report.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'on XX/XX/2018, I submitted an initial dispute letter to all three credit bureaus. they asked for the validation of debt that I was disputing on my credit report');
