However, since the loan has been paid off, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has failed to release the brokerage account held as collateral. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 5 days after closing, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] informed me that it might be another 10-15 days before they can write the letter to release the collateral hold. All they have to do is write a letter, yet they feel no sense of urgency to release my account. 

