INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(553,'10/30/2018','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','My home was damaged by a massive tornado and hail in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have been very sick and out of work since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I used my mortgage payments to pay for removal of massive trees that were uprooted and thrown on my home due to safety concerns along with repairs to deck railings. The insurance company sent funds to mortgage company and mortgage company will not pay my arrearages nor will they return my funds to me to pay them. They keep giving me different stories and holding my funds. There are still Thousands of dollars in repairs to be done, but contractors will not even come out for estimates now because they know they will not get paid and they cant afford to wait 6 months for their money either. This is fraud on part of the mortgage and insurance company. 

