Our third conversation for the month of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a manager got on the phone and said there was nothing she could do. I find this unacceptable. I followed their instructions on waiting to pay in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] yet I kept getting harassed with dozens of phone calls. They could have just said " just pay in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' as was originally explained to me on a recorded line. 

