I went ahead and paid everything they asked me to ( plus a little extra ). I fixed things as they instructed, but I feel they need to make this right with me. I''m sure i''m not the only person they have done this to over the years.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'a manager called me to pay in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. he said he was harassed with ');
