INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(573,'10/26/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Getting a credit card','Card was sent to an old address by Best Buy. Have informed both the creditor and the debt collection agency that the debt was not mine. Sent reports to each informing them of identity theft and asked for the ORIGINAL PAPER APPLICATION. All they keep sending me are copies of the bills. I have shown proof that I was in another state and they still insist that the debt is mine without any proof. I have been denying this account for several years and they refuse to produce/show me the ORIGINAL PAPER APPLICATION. And according to Illinois law they have to validate the debt with an ACTUAL PAPER APPLICATION. This account is now charged off and is in a negative standing on my credit report.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'card was sent to an old address by Best Buy. have informed both the creditor and the debt collection agency. have shown proof that I was in another state.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(574,'10/25/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Other features, terms, or problems','I have had a wells Fargo secured credit card for over 2 years. Paid my Bill ''s over the amount requested and never received an upgrade. Their excuse is I haven''t updated my salary and I paid 2 days later than the time once. Everytime I call I update my salary. The manager I''ve spoken to is a completely rude and doesnt care about upgrading anything. I asked several times when the upgrade would happen and for 2 almost 3 years inXX/XX/2019will be 3 years. I have 2 cards that''s been upgraded to unsecured and close to $ 15k and I still have this measly little {$400.00} card. They lie about the entire upgrade process.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'wells Fargo secured credit card for 2 years. pay my bill''s over the amount requested and never received an upgrade. manager I''ve spoken to is a completely');
