If this issue is not resolved in a timely manner, my attorney will have to take legal action against Carrington Mortgage.','CARRINGTON MORTGAGE SERVICES, LLC',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] mortgage was transferred to Carrington Mortgage. XX/XX/[COMPTE_');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(588,'10/23/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I submitted a complaint # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] concerning Transunion stating a negative item was removed yet it was not. Transunion said on XX/XX/2018 that they would investigate this issue and give me a response. 

