INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(607,'10/19/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','I applied for a loan modification aproximately a year and a half ago. Citibank continually denies the loan modification. The reason Citi mortgage denies my loan modification, is because my income is unverified according to Citibank. My concern is that continually resubmit my application and I receive a vague answer from the company. I do not feel that Citibank is being cooperative with allowing to fix the problem. If there is a problem with the part of financial aspect of the application, I need them to be direct about problem. I continually go over the paper work and resubmit it. I have attempted to contact them and trouble shoot. I hired an attorney to speak on my behalf. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has tried to get clarification. In addition, he feels like Citibank is being very vague with him. Also, I am working with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] contacted Citibank to find where the errors are being made. They have not heard back from Citibank. The last response from Citibank is that the underwriter is on vacation. I do not feel that Citibank is being helpful. I am not trying to be fraudulent with Citibank in any way. My only going is to ave my largest investment. I have desire to file bankruptcy. If I do not qualify for the program based on the numbers, Citibank should be direct with me. Truly that is all I want. If I have to file bankruptcy as a last option, that is what I will do. Please assist me with getting a direct response from Citibank. Thank you','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,4.0,'a loan modification was denied by Citibank a year and a half ago. the company denies the loan modification. Citibank continually denies the loan modification.');
