Sincerely, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','RFNA, LP',2.0,2.0,'a student loan for XX/XX/XXXX8 is currently being paid by the loan institutions. they charge me 48 % and 79 % interest');
