INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(614,'10/18/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','opened an account with {$100.00} sign up bonus if you deposited {$100.00} and completed a bill payment of {$25.00} to a cell phone/internet service provider within 60 days. Confirmed details via secure message. I completed activities on XX/XX/18 and its been over 90 days and I have not received my money','BBVA COMPASS FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'if you deposited $100.00, you deposited $25.00 to a cell phone/internet service provider within 60 days. I completed activities');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(615,'10/17/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem when making payments','When looking over my credit report I was shocked to see a late payment on XX/XX/2015. Being that I always make my payments to you when I receive my statements, I don''t even know how this happened. My only thought is that it got lost in the mail somehow.','BARCLAYS BANK DELAWARE',4.0,4.0,'XX/XX/2015 was late on. XX/XX/2015.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(616,'10/17/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','Letter was written to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureau to remove incorrect information of my credit report about an account which is not mine. Has already been removed from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When another letter was sent to reinvestigate or to obtain all information that was found by the credit bureau, was denied that right which is illegal due to the FCRA and was told no reinvestigation would be done and no information was given to me.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'letter was written to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureau to remove incorrect information. letter was sent to reinvestigate or to obtain all information found by');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(617,'10/17/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with fraud alerts or security freezes','TransUnion, on their website has asked me for information in order to place a freeze on my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] year old dependent child ''s credit file. The website asks for certain identifying information, which I have provided, however they are asking for more identification which is not inline with the website. One of the items that they now need from me is a certified copy of my child ''s birth certificate their website asks for a copy of the birth certificate for proof that I have authority but not asking for a certified copy. I provided a copy, not certified as the law is clear that I should not have to pay for a credit freeze and this would cause me undue expense. Later on the page I am asked for identifying information for me and for my child one of the identifying pieces that I could give is my child ''s ssn, which I provided on the letter that they received for request for freeze. I also sent a copy of my driver ''s license as proof of my identification, which they asked for. I had sent the three items they asked for but now they are saying that they want more proof. I feel that they are not living up to the law and are attempting to not put a freeze on my child ''s file so that they can continue to sell his information. I am only requesting these freezes on my family ''s credit as to protect lenders from being ripped off as I am not afraid of identity theft, it''s not my responsibility to protect the banks, it''s their responsibility to not get defrauded. However, I am doing my best to be a good citizen and help the banks to not get ripped off and TransUnion is going out of their way to not honor the new law for a no-cost credit freeze. They are attempting to cost me undue expense for " certified '''' copies of documentation. Please do what you can to make sure that they provide no-cost credit freezes without undue expense. 
After speaking to a person at TransUnion, they made a note that I had provided what was asked on the website but I am now being asked for more information. I have offered to fax them more documentation and they handed me over to a supervisor. The supervisor was little help and said that I''d have to call back because they could not access my son ''s file at this time and that I should try again in a few hours. I am getting the run around on this and don''t want to waste too much of my valuable time. Again, please help in dealing with this bureaucracy, thank you.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',6.0,8.0,'a certified copy of my child''s birth certificate is asked for by the website. the website asks for a copy of my child''s ssn,');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(618,'10/17/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I disputed my loan with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They eventually sent a credit correction letter, which they do not honor when I dispute the info with the credit bureaus. I initiated litigation for wrongful repossession in Texas. We are in active litigation. This account was disputed multiple times prior to filing the lawsuit. Every month [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reports me late as if this is an open, active account. This means the report never goes away. They have sold my vehicle but have not corrected the initial issue that caused thre dispute. The sale was credited to the overall reported balance. We have finished arbitration and are awaiting the court date. When I dispute it will sometimes be removed by the credit bureaus only to reappear the next month. This has a very detrimental effect on my life. This is also inaccurate as I initiated the dispute prior to the credit reporting and the lawsuit. It should be removed until settled. Or marked as no info since it was disputed, and subsequently placed in litigation. Please have removed from credit reports, with caveat of reporting only if a court rules against me for the balance alleged owed. 

Supporting documents available upon request. Some are covered under attorney-client privilege. 

Thank you.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a credit correction letter was sent to the credit bureaus. the letter was disputed multiple times before filing the lawsuit. the report never goes away.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(619,'10/17/2018','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','I attempted to apply for a loan modification with Wells Fargo in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was told who my home preservation specialist was but I was never contacted by him nor did he answer any of my calls. Finally, after several attempts, I was able to speak with him and he stated that he didn''t know he was assigned to my case. I then, spoke with different agents at Wells Fargo and they gave me different instructions on what to do. However, the last agent told me that I had to have my application in within 7 days of my Foreclosure date. Which should have been XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I did so. Wells fargo called me on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating that they could not help me because turned my paperwork in too late. I called HUD and the escalation department at Wells fargo phoned me and stated that they would indeed review my case and attempt to delay the foreclosure. I did not hear from him until the Evening of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. He stated that he couldn''t stop the foreclosure, but, he would continue to review my case because they maintained ownership of the property. He kept sending letters extending the time frame to get back to me. Finally, I received a letter in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating that the foreclosure stands because they did not have verification of my employment start date. I expressed my disagreement with that response. I never heard from Wells Fargo again to this date. I received an eviction notice from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I also received a cash for keys letter from a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at the same time stating that they were a DBA for Wells Fargo and they are handling my loan. Neither of the companies knew the status or process that was going on from each company regarding my loan. It is my prayer that something is done to save my home from this wrongful foreclosure. I have been very ill and had a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] due to the situation. I would like to file a complaint against Wells Fargo for wrongful eviction. Also the paperwork noting the sheriff ''s sale which is attached to the eviction notice from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] does not appear to be signed by an individual. It appears to be cut & paste. I''m am attaching a notification regarding a class action lawsuit regarding [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for the manner in which they participate in foreclosures. I am also attaching other correspondence relating to my situation.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a home preservation specialist was assigned to my case by Wells Fargo. he said that they could not help me because turned my paperwork in too late. he said that');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(620,'10/17/2018','Mortgage','VA mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','I have been trying for over three years to resolve my situation with Citimortgage. I requested a shortsale 3 years ago. I have lost 3 buyers and now Citimortgage is countering an offer on a short sale property that is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] more than what was required 3 months ago with another buyer. I think they are trying to deny the offer and force this home into foreclosure.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'Citimortgage is trying to deny the offer and force this home into foreclosure. the short sale property is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] more than what');
