INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(633,'10/15/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','It is almost impossible to get hold of someone at Freedom Mortgage with an inordinatly long wait on the phone and an answering system that is unlike any other I have ever experienced. Almost every month the company waits until the last few days to cash my check causing me to feel very stressed out. Someone ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) just finally answered my call of today the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after I was cut-off the last time I was on hold. She said it''s the fault of the postal system but I have never had this problem with other mortgage companies ( at least three ) I have used since I purchased my home in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I also have found it easier to get hold of someone at my past mortgage companies. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] also said that because it is close to the payment deadline, they get many calls ; however, I have had problems reaching Freedom Mortgage even when it was not close to the mortgage payment deadline. 

