INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(634,'10/15/2018','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Personal line of credit','Problem with cash advance','We hired a contractor to reroof our house - the job was satisfactorily completed on XX/XX/2018. On XX/XX/2018, a loan was negotiated with a Florida bank at 0 % interest if repaid in 18 months. On XX/XX/2018 the bank issued a payment invoice : payment was due by XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], with a minimum payment of {$280.00}. Our check for {$700.00} was written on XX/XX/2018, and paid as an electronic check on XX/XX/2018. Meanwhile, the contractor notified us that they had not been paid the {$11000.00} on which we were making loan payments. In a telephone call, the bank said that the contractor ''s account was " under review '''' and might not be paid for up to 180 days. The bank insists that we must continue to make at least minimum payments or be in default, whether or not the {$11000.00} is disbursed to the contractor. 

