hin teo weeks due to Texas legal laws in place. As of last month [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   has had a collection agency ( ad astra recovery services ) flag my credit, bringing my score down tremendously. They show that i obtained the loan in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of this year ( which is false information ) and that i have only made one payment ever with the account ( which is also false ) i have sent in bank statements, i have sent payment confirmation reciepts via fax from my email, but the company persists on leaving the falsified information on my credit account as if it were truely an installment loan i just defaulted on, and did not pay them for when its not true. They refuse to remove it unless i pay them an additional 1000+ dollars.','Ad Astra Recovery Services Inc',2.0,2.0,'i received a total of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars due to hardship. i started paying the loan back in payments of [COMPTE_');
