INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(660,'10/09/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with fraud alerts or security freezes','Today ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) I attempted to freeze my credit report access at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Experian. The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  attempt went without a problem, but I was thwarted in my attempts at Experian and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. After filling out the credit freeze request form at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was received the following response : <p> " We are temporarily unable to complete your request. Looks like we are experiencing a problem on our end. 
We are sorry, but we are unable to fulfill your request at this time. 
What to do now : If the problem persists, please contact our Website Access Support team at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], available Monday through Thursday : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and Friday through Sunday : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Eastern Standard Time. '''' <p> In the case of Experian, it was clear to me that they were intent on making it as difficult as possible to obtain a free freeze. Their request form did not allow autofill, an easily implemented customer courtesy, and after having manually filled out the form and answered ID verification questions, I received a notification that for an unspecified reason they could not fulfill my request, and that I should send the request via USPS mail and include a long list of specific pieces of information, which I had just supplied in their online form. 

I believe if one of your agents attempts to use the free freeze request at the two services referred to above, they can confirm my experiences. Nevertheless, I will double check both of those services tomorrow, and if their response has been more compliant in fulfilling the requirements of the free freeze legislation ''s intent, I will so inform you via this complaint submission option. 

Sincerely yours, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], VA','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a credit report access request for free freezes went without a problem. the request form at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was not a problem.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(661,'10/09/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Other features, terms, or problems','I am writing to complain about my Citi [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  card. After receiving the card inXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I activated the card this summer and was using the card until Citi abruptly froze my account. When I called to check on why the account was frozen, I initially could not get a straight answer. It was only after several attempts that I finally learned that Citi froze my account in order to conduct a background check to make sure I am the appropriate card holder. The account was frozen in early XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].

At the time, I was on travel for work, so I tried to address the verification issues by phone, but was informed that Citi only verifies by mail. While this was inconvenient, I did go ahead and send in the form Citi sent over. I learned today that Citi still requires another paper form submission that I am yet to receive in the mail. Once again, I am set to travel for work and do not have an active Citi card.

This process and the customer service at Citi have been terrible. More problematic, though, is that they do not conduct these various checks before a card is issued. What happens if someone is using someone else ''s card. It appears from my experience that Citi allows use and only later conducts a verification. This is a troubling practice that should be investigated.

For now, I am once again without a card. I wish I hadn''t closed another account in order to open this account since Citi ''s service has been subpar.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'a card was frozen after Citi froze my account. it was only after several attempts that I learned that the card was frozen. Citi still requires another paper form submission that I');
