INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(668,'10/08/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','On XX/XX/2018 I wrote to Transunion explaining to them that I had inquiries on my report which I did not make. Transunion is aware that I am a victim of identity theft. Transunion also has a copy of my police report validating that I am a victim of identity theft and fraud, as well as my identity Theft affidavit from the FTC. Transunion is reluctant in removing these inquiries which are damaging my good name. Why am I being punished for what someone else has done to me? This whole experience has already been very emotional and traumatizing. Why isn''t Transunion willing to help me when I am the victim?','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'XX/XX/2018 I wrote to Transunion explaining that I had inquiries on my report which I did not make. Transunion is reluctant in removing these inquiries which are damaging');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(669,'10/07/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I am filing a complaint against Equifax, for continuing to report a Chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bankruptcy on my credit file. I have sent numerous letters to include the letter from the Bankruptcy court indicating that they do not provide information regarding bankruptcies to credit bureaus. I also included a letter from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating that case # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has been removed from my risk view report. Lastly, I sent a copy of my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  credit report showing that the bankruptcy was removed from my credit file XX/XX/2018. I am demanding that Equifax removes this public record immediately. I have sent viable evidence showing that they are reporting incorrect information that can not validate.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a letter from the Bankruptcy court indicating that they do not provide information regarding bankruptcies to credit bureaus. a copy of my credit report showing that the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(670,'10/07/2018','Student loan','Private student loan','Dealing with your lender or servicer','Before filing with you, I filed with the Washington State Attorney General ''s Office. They reviewed my complaint and began an informal complaint resolution process. Key Bank ''s Participation in the process was voluntary and they never responded. The WA State AG ''s office recommended I file my concerns with the CFPB. 

The Keybank National Association Recovery Department is engaged in unethical consumer practices and potentially fraud. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], after my bankruptcy was finished, my student loans were charged off from my servicer to the originator for collections. Keybank was the loan originator. 

In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I entered into a repayment plan with Key for {$300.00} per month on 4 separate student loan accounts. Three accounts each received $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payments, and a 4th account received $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I received my first billing statement on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], with a due date of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I made this payment on time. For every month through XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I made a {$300.00} payment. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I paid off the 4th account, at which point I began receiving only [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statements for payments totalling $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I mistakingly sent a payment without a stamp and it was returned to me. I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], to explain that and that my payment was on the way. In early [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I received a letter for each account stating that I was in default. I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to explain the circumstances about the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment and was told that I could " just burn or throw away '''' those letters, and that a statement would be sent to me. My XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statement never arrived. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I spoke with a Key representative who directed me to simply double my XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment to {$300.00} and indicate that the payment was for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I  mailed my payment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

