INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(684,'10/03/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','As of XX/XX/2018 after 4 rounds of credit repair, I received updated credit reports from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Equifax and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   stating that the accounts on my report have been updated and for me to personally contact the collectors for any information. My rights have been violated per the FCRA and the FCPDA. These Collection accounts have not been properly verified by the 3 credit bureaus per the FCRA nor have they been validated by the collectors per the FCDPA. There has been no original instrument of the debt such as a signed contract presented to me by either of the parties. I have personally reached out to the collectors over the past 2 months asking for validation of this debt and what I received was the copy of a bill. Anyone can create a bill and place my information on it. This is not 100 % Verification nor is it validation. My credit is being held hostage by this. Laws have been violated. I have certified receipts from the correspondence that I sent to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Equifax, and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as well as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that I''m attaching. These accounts are hurting my credit, im trying to buld a future for my children by purchasing a home and this has stagnated that process. Thank you for your assistance.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'credit reports have been updated and for me to personally contact the collectors for any information. my rights have been violated by the 3 credit bureaus per the FCRA.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(685,'10/03/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','upon looking at my Equifax credit file, I learned that an account which was deleted off has reappeared. When equifax update my report, by correcting my name, they added the collection account from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] back on. This account was deleted by the company. Secondly I never received any notification that this account was being put back on. I quite sure this is just an error on their behalf but I would like this to be rectified immediately. Also I have proof of the deletion that I will attach.','EQUIFAX, INC.',4.0,4.0,'equifax update report corrects my name and adds collection account back on. account was deleted by the company.');
