INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(707,'09/29/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','TransUnion [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], CA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], TX [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], GA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Dear Sir or Madam : The sole purpose of this letter is to inform you I have been a victim of identity theft. I am further requesting that you block the following fraudulent information from my credit reports so that I can proceed accordingly with my file. Once more, I want to emphasize none of the information stated below relates to any transaction that I have made. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XXXXeeds Attention Last reported : XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] {$9700.00} [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Days Late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Last reported : XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] {$5000.00} Good [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Last reported : XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] {$4900.00} GoodThe items listed are clearly fraudulent ; therefore, I am requesting that they are deleted /blocked by name of source. In addition, A CRA must block the fraudulent information and the victim must be identified within four business days after accepting his/her Identity Theft Report. When it accepts the Identity Theft Report, the CRA also must notify the furnishers of the fraudulent information that the victim has filed the Report, that the Report states that the information they furnished Resulted from identity theft, and that it is blocking the information that they furnished. FCRA 605B ( b ), 15 U.S.C. 1681c-2 ( b ) .III. A. Blocking Information in Credit Reports under Sections-605B and 623 ( a ) ( 6 ) Under section 605B of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), both the credit reporting agencies ( CRAs ) and the creditors, debt collectors, and other companies that reported the identity theft-related information to the CRA ( furnishers ) are responsible for blocking fraudulent information from appearing in victims credit reports, blocking fraudulent information from appearing in victims credit reports Please let me know if you need any other information from me to block this information on my credit report. 
Sincerely, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] SOC SEC # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] DOB XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ADDRESS [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], FL [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a CRA must block the fraudulent information from the credit reports. the victim must be identified within four business days after accepting his/her Identity Theft Report.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(708,'09/28/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is reporting that I am 30 days late for XX/XX/2018. I have never been 30 days late ever. I reported a dispute thru the credit agencies and it came back with no change. I then contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the representative said that they were very busy and would review my account and get back to me. I asked to have my payment history sent to me with a letter stating never 30 days late and they refused. They said to just file another dispute with the credit agencies and they would get to it when it was in for review. So I did submit another dispute and they still have not updated it. I have never been 30 days late. This is unacceptable and it is a defamation of character.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/2018: I have never been 30 days late ever. a dispute with the credit agencies came back with no change. a representative said that they were');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(709,'09/28/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Written notification about debt','On XX/XX/18 an alert appeared on my credit file with a collection in the amount of {$5000.00}. I immediately called Amsher as I didn''t recognize the debt. I had not received any notice of a debt before it being submitted to the credit agencies. When I reached someone at the company, I was told that the debt was a business debt, and was transferred to their business department. I was told it was a debt from a company I worked for. I explained that the company debt was not my own, and was immediately transferred to a man who stated he was the CEO. 

I asked why I never received a letter about a debt, and how they determined that I was liable for the corporate account? He stated that they are not obligated to send letters nor verify who is responsible. I then asked for his mailing address so that I could send my request in writing. He goes on to say that I needed to " care about my money, I''m responsible, I needed to be quiet and let him speak '''' and so on. He also stated that he wanted to make me an offer to settle the debt for approximately {$3000.00}, even though I told him the account did not belong to me, which the company was already well aware. 

Very upset, I kept insisting on his name and address for about 10 minutes. He then started to belittle me stating that " let me pull up [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and show you how easy it is to get our address ''''. The inappropriate exchange was at least 15 minutes before he finally gave me the address so that I could submit my request for a debt letter and verification in writing. I then hung up. 

All of this because I never received a debt letter so that I could verify the debt and dispute as necessary. When I attempted to dispute with the credit bureaus, Amsher still refused to research the account, even though I submitted my final bill from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] showing that I didn''t owe the debt. They also called other employees of the company stating that I owed this debt. This company is a scam who is only in the business to force anyone to pay a debt ( which they purchased ), even if not legally obligated to do so.','Amsher Collection Services, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'amsher was told the debt was a business debt. he said that they are not obligated to send letters or verify who is responsible. he said that ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(710,'09/28/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','Threatened to contact someone or share information improperly','DEAR CFPB : This matter is a continuation of the debt in reference to the same collection agency. in the 2 other accounts. I am asking the collection agency not to contact me any longer, to contact my attorney. this matter where already PAID to the collection agency. So please do not call me do not harras me and do not write me any more. Thank you Respectfully yours ...','CMRE Financial Services, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'this matter is a continuation of the debt in reference to the same collection agency. I am asking the collection agency not to contact me any longer, to contact my attorney.');
