INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(712,'09/28/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','RECEIVABLES PERFORMANCE inserted fraudulent accounts into my credit file. Not only are these accounts getting inserted Receivables Performance is failing to communicate to me that they hold any accounts under my name. I am not being given my right to dispute the validity of each account to inform Receivables performance that these accounts do not belong to me and are a direct result of identity theft. You are hereby notified that I am a victim of identity theft and the accounts listed below that appear on my credit file are a result of identity theft. I I did not open or authorize this account, and I request that it be closed immediately. Please send me written confirmation that I am not responsible for charges on this account, and take appropriate steps to remove information about this account from my credit files. I have enclosed a copy of my FTC Identity Theft Report. Because the information you are reporting is the result of identity theft, and inaccurate, I request that you stop reporting this information to the CRAs, as directed by section 623 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( B ) of the Fair Credit Reporting Act, 15 U.S.C. 1681s-2 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( B ). I ask that you take these steps as soon as possible.','Receivables Performance Management, LLC',2.0,4.0,'RECEIVABLES PERFORMANCE inserted fraudulent accounts into my credit file. I am not being given my right to dispute the validity of each account. I did not open');
