INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(737,'09/23/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Equifax, and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] are all reporting information that is incorrect. I have filed disputes but the information continues to be on my credit report. I have documentation that the information that they are reporting is not from the original source. The documentation that I am presenting comes directly from Bankruptcy federal court in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Kentucky.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Equifax, and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] are all reporting information that is incorrect. the documentation that I');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(738,'09/22/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','I have a mortgage loan that is being serviced by OCWEN and they are not providing me with an opportunity to save my home from foreclosure. Their representatives have made it absolutely impossible to have my loan reviewed for any form of assistance as I keep getting bounced around for person to person when I call them. I do not have an accoun tmanager who is assigned to my file because they keep switching out my single point of contact and this is making it impossible to get straight answers. Due to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I had some lost income which hurt us financially and we had to fall behind on our mortgage, but we are now back on our feet and want to work out our mortgage issues. However, OCWEN has other ideas and are restricting our ability to access obtain a loan modification that could help our situation. Our problems began even before I had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when we refinanced our loan. We needed to reduce our monthly mortgage payment and wanted some money for our sons college education. After we refinanced our payments kept going up and up. Apparently we were given an adjustable rate mortgage when we were told it would be a fixed mortgage. I believe we were conned into a toxic loan when we refinanced our mortgage. This hit us very hard since we expected our mortgage payment to stay at the newly reduced payment, but our mortgage payment continued to climb. The loan should have never been written and we were tricked into refinancing into a loan that had little benefit to us. My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] weakened us financially and we needed some help with our mortgage payment. When we contacted them our loan was current and they said they could not help us until we were delinquent on our mortgage. We were stopped making payments based on their advice, but this turned into a nightmare as we can not get OCWEN to complete a review for retention options on our property. OCWEN doesnt appear to be doing anything to move things forward and this has become incredibly frustrating. We feel that OCWEN has no interest in helping our family and that our request for assistance is going nowhere. We see that the United States Government fined them over {$2.00} billion for this type of activity and gave them billions more to help homeowners, but this apparently isnt enough for them to help us. We are hoping you can help us deal with the issues we are having with OCWEN.','OCWEN LOAN SERVICING LLC',2.0,2.0,'a mortgage loan is being serviced by OCWEN and is not providing me with an opportunity to save my home from foreclosure. they are not providing me with an opportunity to save my');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(739,'09/22/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I am a victim of identity theft. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] listed on my Equifax, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit report is a fraudulent and unauthorized account, and dont belong to me. I never applied for an auto loan account with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The account is fraudulent and a result of identity theft. I been receiving harassing phone calls at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and after [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at work and at home from representatives from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a debt thats fraudulent, the result of identity theft, and that dont belong to me. Representatives from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has threatened me with death threats, legal action and prison. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is in violation of federal law, The Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ). Its been a frightening and terrifying experience, the way [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] representatives has been calling my phone harassing me non-stop and on a consistent basis. Im in fear of my life. I have contacted the local media, law enforcement, and my U.S. Senator [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in regards to this matter.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a credit report is a fraudulent and unauthorized account. the account is fraudulent and a result of identity theft. a representative from [COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(740,'09/22/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I am a victim of identity theft and upon reviewing my credit file I have become aware of an account held by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that is a direct result of identity theft. I have never had any dealings with Convergent or the company [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that they represent. An amount of {$1300.00} that is listed on my account does not belong to me it is fraud. I have contacted Convergent credit regarding the account IN THE AMOUNT OF {$1300.00}, 4 thru certified mail asking to verify that I owe their company any funds and for what. Ive also ask for anything bearing my signature that verifies I have obligations to pay them or have had any business dealings with them. Yet they have failed to validate according to law. This collection company is damaging my credit file and cant provide legal proof. I have not had any dealing with convergent or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] whom they represent. This account is a result of identity theft.','Convergent Resources, Inc.',2.0,4.0,'a collection company is damaging my credit file and cant provide legal proof. a collection company is damaging my credit file.');
