The Citibank representative says that they successfully applied to my account, and the offer code is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
( See attachment : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Citibank flyer ). 

On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I contacted Citibank via Chat to ask them whether I have met the requirements of the bonus offer. The Citibank representative confirmed that I had met the requirements for the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] miles offer and that the AAdvantage bonus miles will be credited by Citibank to the AAdvantage account within 90 calendar days from the date when the client completed all offer requirements.

( See attachment : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Citi confirms [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] AA.pdf ). 

On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I received a letter from Citibank saying that the requirements for Promotion [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] were not met because this promotion was not available to existing Citibank customers. Their records indicate I have a existing checking account number ending in # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], which was opened on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This account was closed in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
( See attachment : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Citi letter denying requirements met.pdf ). 

On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I contacted Citibank via Chat to dispute the letter on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] denying that I had met the promotion requirements. They confirmed my checking account ending [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was closed in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. However, they said that I was not eligible for the requirement because I was not a " New-to-Citibank Client. " New-to-Citibank Client must not be have owned a Citibank checking account within the last 180 calendar days from the date of enrollment in the targeted offer. 
( See attachment : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Citi chat denying requirements met.pdf ). 

I am a raising a complaint because : 1 ) When I called Citibank in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to open the account, they did not tell me that I was not eligible for the promotion. They went ahead and opened the account for me and told me the Offer code was successfully applied to my account. 
2 ) When I contacted Citibank on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Citibank confirmed that I had met the requirements of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] miles offer and the Aadvantage miles would be credited to my account within 90 calendar days. Nothing was mentioned about me not being eligible.

3 ) I received an 8 page flyer from Citibank inviting me to apply for the promotion. Of the 8 pages there was only 1 sentence in the fine print that mentions the " New-to-Citibank Client definition. Also, this definition is not in line with the normal understanding of these words. Most people would think that if someone did not have an existing Citibank bank account then they would be a new banking client.

4 ) It is misleading for Citibank to send me a flyer with a targeted offer for this promotion, when they are now saying that I was disqualified from the very beginning.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'Citibank flyer says that I am invited to become a Citibank banking client. on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I');
