INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(804,'09/07/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I contacted Experian two times on XX/XX/18 and XX/XX/18 regarding unverified accounts : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Despite two written request, the unverified items listed still remain on my credit report in violation of Federal Law. Experian and other credit bureaus are required under the FCRA to have a copy of the original creditors documentation on file to verify that this information is mine and is correct. In the results of the first investigation and subsequent reinvestigations, they stated in writing that the items were " Verified '''' and they were being " Reported correctly and/or updated ''''. Who verified these accounts? Who did you talk to? What documentation was received to do accurate updates? What were the dates and times of these actions? What contract did you receive bearing my signature to confirm these accounts are indeed mine and not someone else with my same alias? They have failed to prove me with any original documentation as required under 609 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( a ) and section 611 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( 1 ). I want them to be advised under section 611 ( 5 ) ( 1 ) of the FCRA - they are required to " ... Promptly DELETE all information which can not be verified ''''. I demand the following items be verified accur