INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(815,'09/05/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','I have a home loan through NationStar Mr.Cooper.I signed a loan adjustment with them a few years ago and the numbers seem to be way in there favor.I did not chose this company, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] closed and signed over my loan and I had paperwork stating it was paid in full.I think they took advantage of me.I have been reading up on all the lawsuit activitiy with this company.My house was damaged by a small fire.I recived my insurance check and am worried about sending it to them to sign off.I have read many complaints about them keeping the money.I have paid for all the materials and made all the repairs out of pocket.I have a terrible feeling they are going to keep the check and pocket the money like they have with many other customers.Can you please help me?? Please, Im a good guy, never been in any trouble, no repos or foreclosures, very good credit, was a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and do a bunch of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Thank you.[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',2.0,2.0,'a home loan through NationStar Mr.Cooper is available for sale on a home loan. the company closed and signed over my loan and the paperwork was paid in full ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(816,'09/05/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is showing closed and I reopened the account a couple days after closing it. I closed it in error in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and reopened it in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I made payments in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. But the balance on my statements and being reported to all the bureaus is the balance from when I closed the account in error - {$900.00}. The balance of the account as of today XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is {$620.00}. I have made payments each month and the payments and balance is not being reported. Also the account is still being reported as closed. I received a letter from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] giving my balance on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of {$720.00} ( I have made another payment since then ). But that amount is not being reported or my new payment or that the account is open. I received a call from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating that they are reporting the proper information to all 3 credit bureaus and that they corrected any errors. But my reports still show the same information. Account closed and balance of {$900.00}','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'account closed and balance of $900.00 is $620.00. balance on statements is balance from when I closed account in error. account closed and balance of');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(817,'09/05/2018','Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service','International money transfer','Other transaction problem','On or about XX/XX/18 I opened a money transfer account with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Transfer at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I completed all the information on their form, including recipient personal and bank account information. Because I wanted to send the funds direct ; y through my account, I selected the ACH withdrawal option. My other option was to wire them the money, but that would have incurred bank fees I wished to avoid. I completed the information required to set up ACH. this included my personal information, bank name, account no. and pin no. The stated purpose was to verify I owned the account and there were funds present. My information was accepted, and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] set up the ACH option approximately 24 hours later. 

On XX/XX/2018 I made two transfers. The first was in the amount of {$28000.00} PHP to my realtor in order to pay for renovations to. Condominium I was purchasing in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The second was in the amount of {$23000.00} [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to my fianc for a medical condition. 

I received the online confirmation and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] immediately withdrew an equivalent mount in U.S. dollars from my bank account. ( Photo of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] trnscrion summry attached ). I also received Email confirmation that that the transfer was confirmed ; the money had been received by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the recipients would receive the funds no later than XX/XX/18. ( Confirmation emails attached ). 
Shortly after making this transaction, I also received a phone call from a man identifying himself as an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] representative. He stated the purpose of his phone call was to verify the purposes of the transaction including whether I personally knew the recipients. I told him I knew the recipients and explained the purpose of each transaction. He then stated he would put this information in his notes in the event the transaction was reviewed. 

On XX/XX/18 I learned that the recipients had not received the funds by the promised due date. I went online to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] website and confirmed the transaction had not been completed. I phoned [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and spoke with a representative. The person spoke with an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accent, and because it was after business hours, I assumed it was either a call center or another office overseas. I explained the situation. The man found my account and confirmed that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had withdrew the funds and had them in their possession., and the transfer had not been completed. He reviewed my notes and was at a loss as to an explanation why the funds had not been transferred by the due date. He reviewed the notes from my transfer and told me they were unclear and lost unreadble. He promised he would email the American branch handling, the transfer and a representative would be call ing me the next day to resolve the issue. I never received either a call or email. 

On XX/XX/18, I phoned and spoke with another representative. For the third time I explained the purposes of the transfer and for the second time explained the money had not been transferred. The woman said she looked at my notes and also confirmed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] held the funds. She could also not ascertain the reason for the delay and promised to take the matter to the resolution department personally, and call me back. I never received the promised phone call. 
Approximately five hours later, this time my account summary not only showed that the funds had not been sent to the recipient, but thatXXXX   never received the funds. I checked my bank account and confirmed the funds had been removed. I then phoned [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a third time. I spoke with another representative. For the fourth time I explained the purpose of the transaction, and for the third time explained the issue. He stated that the matter was being referred to the resolution department. I asked why did my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  transaction summary now showed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  did not withdraw my funds and that it was asking me for the names of the recipients again. He stated that this change happens every time a transaction was being reviewed. I skied why my transfer was being reviewed and he refused to tell me. Lasted ifwhen the funds would be returned to me if the transfer was rejected, and he refused to tell me. I asked if my funds would be returned, and he said he didnt know and that would be determined by the resolution department. He stated the review would take 24 hours  and I would receive an email of their decision. I was upset I was raining my voice. I asked to speak to a supervisor. He refused stating he was the supervisor. 

Approximately one hour after I hung up. I received an email from the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with the Verifiction Department. She stated that my transfer were rejected. There was no reason provided. She also stated that in order to receive my funds, I would have to work with my bank in order to receive them back. At which time my account would be closed. Again no reason was given. ( Email attached ). [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is still in possession of my funds.','RIA FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/18 I made two transfers on a yearly basis. the first was in the amount of $28000.00 PHP to my realtor.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(818,'09/05/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I have contacted the original creditor [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and spoke to several reps there. I was informed that Rhodes Kelly was not instructed to report this account to the credit bureau. Therefore it should be removed from my credit report immediately and sent back to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My second issue is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] provided an itemized bill to Rhodes Kelly, I did not authorize them to send my information to Rhodes Kelly Associates. This information should''ve been sent directly to me. There was no need for them to review this information this is PHI and is a HIPPAA violation. If they have some sort of agreement with Rhodes Kelly I was not made aware of it.','Rhodes, Kelly Assoc Inc',2.0,2.0,'creditor was not instructed to report account to credit bureau. he should be removed from credit report immediately. he did not authorize them to send information to Rhodes Kelly.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(819,'09/05/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I am have been currently active in reviewing my credit history and have found accounts in collections handled by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which are not accurate nor mine. I have tried asking for documented proof or other identifying proof and the company checks off their database but provides no transparency to myself. 
Ive yet to receive one call or even one letter, no notification has been made to me that I owe on outstanding debts held by them, and yet it is stated on my report. 
Under the FCRA laws I have petitioned documentation and verification of my data, I have petitioned that this be validated to me as well as the manner of such reporting. 

