o open an additional account for the same store, which has resulted in this poor score causing massive confusion ). 
I challenge the accuracy, compliance and report ability of this listing. 
Please validate this information with ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Capital One and provide me with copies of any documentation associated with this account bearing my signature. In the absence of any such documentation bearing my signature. I formally request that this information be immediately deleted from the credit file you maintain under my social security number. 
Please note that you have 30 days to complete this investigation, as per the fair credit reporting act section 611 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( A ), and I am keeping careful record of you actions, including your Method of Verification. I do not consent to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or any means of automated verification Failure to respond satisfactorily within 30 days of receipt of this certified letter may result in a small claims action against your company, seeking {$1000.00} per violations for : 1. ) Defamation 2. ) Negligent Enablement of Identity Fraud 3. )  Violations of the Fair Credit reporting act Please note : This notice is an attempt to correct your records, and any information received from you will be collected as evidence should any further action be necessary. This is a request for information only, and is not a statement, election, or waiver of status My contact information is as follows [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Last 4 ssn : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] P.S. Please be aware that dependent upon your response, I may be detailing any potential issues with your company via an oline public press release, including documentation of any potential small claims action. I am also including a copy of my complaint to the organizations below : Cc : Consumer Financial Protection Bureau Cc : Attorney Generals Office ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) Cc : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'capitalone has reported negative information about my account. a negative information is reported by capitalone. a negative information is reported by capitalone.');
