INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(851,'08/28/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2018 i noticed hard pulls appeared on my credit report that I didnot authorize. This is my third attempt at trying to get these inquiries removed from my report the companies have not sent any information verified I sent information to aquire these inquiries.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'i noticed hard pulls appeared on my credit report that I did not authorize. this is my third attempt at trying to get these inquiries removed from my report.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(852,'08/28/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Trouble using your card','Since XX/XX/2018, Citibank has locked my card ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] " for my protection ''''. After waiting a week for the letter that was repeatedly referenced through Citibank ''s secure messages and phone calls with me, I faxed it to Citibank. Over the next several days, I was told repeatedly I still needed to call in even though the requested information had been received by them ( faxed letter request from Citi as well as SSN verification form ). I called Citibank several times in response to their secure messages stating that the matter could not be resolved through secure message, and only by phone. I was told every time I called that my card would still not be unlocked with no reason given except to ''wait a little longer ''. If Citi only had to speak to me, why is the card not unlocked? Well as of 2 days ago, I was informed via secure message that Citi wanted me to resend the fax as it was not readable. This is over a week after the original fax was sent and confirmed received. Why was it confirmed as received if it was " unreadable ''''?','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'faxed a letter to Citibank stating that the matter could not be resolved through secure message. Citibank has locked my card ending in [COMPTE_ANON');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(853,'08/28/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Fees or interest','On or about XX/XX/2018 I was contacted by telephone from a representative from Care Credit ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ) about an account that I had opened. They advised that they have been getting the monthly bills returned to them as undeliverable, even though I previously was receiving them, and making monthly payments. Upon further investigation it was determined that the last bill sent to me was in the month of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of which I paid. The account was opened underneath a promotional interest deferred rate and I had plan on paying it off prior to the end of the promotional period which was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I inquired with the company why they did not try to contact me prior at the information I provided when the account was opened, and they claimed they tried but the number was not working. I asked them why they didn''t simply pull up my credit history and check the address that was on file since they already had this information. They couldn''t provide a response. I spoke with a supervisory representative today and explained the situation to her. She filed a complaint with the bank on my behalf that can take up to 30 days. Since the account was not paid prior to the promotional period ending it increased approximately {$1000.00}. To ensure a showing of good faith I paid the total amount due prior to the end of the promotional period on XX/XX/2018 when I was speaking with the supervisor, of which was {$870.00}. This really appears to be a sort of scam by the bank to ensure the collection of an increased interest rate by not allowing me the opportunity to pay it. They could have simply done their due diligence and looked into a multitude of databases to determine my correct address in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], or made contact with me by either home phone, cell phone or email. 
Unfortunately, I also checked and the bank has entered a negative report within my credit history. This could have a negative impact upon me when I have to conduct my background check, that occurs every five years for my security clearance. 

I have attempted to check the box allowing for publication on consumerfinance.gov, but it is not allowing the box to be checked. I give you permission to publish this description but please remove my personal information. 

I have asked for a bill to be sent to me on or about XX/XX/2018, but as of today ( XX/XX/2018 ) I have not received it. I also asked for a receipt of todays payment made, but they were not able to provide one. If and when I obtain any written information I will provide it. 

I am hopeful you can assist me with this unfortunate situation.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'a representative from Care Credit said that the account was opened under a promotional interest deferred rate. the bank has entered a negative report within my credit history. the bank');
