INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(859,'08/27/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Other personal consumer report','Identity theft protection or other monitoring services','My debit card was " duplicated '''' and used to place fraudulent charges on my bank account in both mine and another US state ( I have the original card in my possession ). In attempting to place a fraud alert on my accounts with the three credit bureaus, the following problems occurred : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] appears to use a third party to take sensitive, identifying information and report the information to them. One must input or say your social security number, name, date of birth and other sensitive, identifying information over the phone or online to an automated system. Experian and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] also require the same information, but the information appears to be handled by them. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   announced in XX/XX/2017 that its accounts were hacked. There does not appear to be ANY agency who has a live person available to help a consumer decipher the safety of its accounts. Secondly, why do these companies require a consumer to use their social security number as identification when it clearly states on MY social security card that this number is NOT to be used as identification? Who really protects the consumer with this wide-spread problem? And how do we know our information is secure when reporting online or by automated phone services?','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'a credit bureau appears to use a third party to take sensitive, identifying information. one must input or say your social security number, name, date of birth and other sensitive,');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(860,'08/27/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','I want to report the following mortgage investor and collection agency companies for unwilling to negotiate 2nd lien that was filed in a bankruptcy in XX/XX/2009 and they have bought this paper and forecing me to pay them by putting my home in foreclosure. my home is still underwater and currently is not behind on the 1st lien mortgage due to a loan modification completed in bk under the HARP program ; The two companies are the following : " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' and " Madison Mortgage '''' I filed BK [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in XX/XX/2009 and during that period the 2nd lien was with " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ''''. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] during the BK process was showing on credit report as the debt being charged off. For this reason this debt was not " reaffirmed '''' for the option to do a loan modification. Also due to the home severely under water. Since then this loan was sold to several investors and the latest investor ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' has bought loan and started to send out demand letters for me to pay them. Since the Lien is still tied to the property and never was Stripped my BK Attorney only option was to try and negotiate with the the investors. The investors is using : Madison Management '''' as the the third party collection agency to try and collect. we have tried to offer several amounts to pay this lien so they could remove it from title. All offers were denied.They want me to pay the full balance that was due at time of BK filing, all late fees and attorney fees. They also want me to pay a 9.50 % interest rate which is to me predatory.

I Have sense hired a different attorney who has been trying to negotiate this lien and have been very unsuccessful as well. They have denied every offer the attorney has offered.

The investor has scheduled my house to be foreclosed as a way to strong arm me into paying them what they want me to pay them.

this practice is unlawful and i know i have some sort of rights to protect and save my home.

Since filing BK i have been currently with the first lien with no late and do not want to file BK again just to stop them for foreclosing They have also violated my privacy by researching me online on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  to discover I have a business and is married. So the feel I have the means and capital to pay them what they want me to pay them.

This has been a very stressful situation and now is affecting my health as I need help stopping this investor from violating my rights','Madison Management Services, LLC',2.0,2.0,'the two companies have bought this paper and forecing me to pay them. the investors are using : Madison Management '''' as the third party collection agency to try and collect');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(861,'08/26/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I have been working on my credit for 6 years and trying to do the right thing.I have settled accounts with lenders to satisfy them but my credit report and score is suffering from it.It still shows accounts being potentially negative which shouldn''t be because I have done everything possible to keep all creditors happy.These potentially negative remarks should.be removed.Please help as I just apply ed for a home equity line of credit.Thank you.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'I have settled accounts with lenders to satisfy them but my credit report and score is suffering from it.I have done everything possible to keep all creditors happy.');
