INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(868,'08/24/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I sent in dispute letters to the credit reporting agencies ( equifax, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ) and a validation letter to the collection company ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) regarding two accounts ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I keep receiving responses back from the credit reporting agencies and the collector stating the accounts are verified, but they keep failing to accurately verify the accounts in their entirety. I first started disputing the accounts with the credit reporting agencies in XX/XX/2018 and they continue to report the negative marks on my reports. They send me responses of verified without any proper verification. I sent in a letter of validation to the collection company and they just sent an itemized list of alleged charges. This does not meet the Federal Trade Commissions guidelines of what constitutes proper debt validation. After continuous rounds of letters stating the section 609 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( A ), section 611 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( a ), section 611 ( a ) ( 7 ), section 611 ( 5 ) ( A ), and sections 616 & 617 these companies have continued to fail to comply with federal laws. The laws are very clear and my rights have been violated many times over now. Im sending in this complaint to you the CFPB because they have not followed proper guidelines and have violated the fair credit reporting act, the fair debt collection practices act, and have defamed my character.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'credit reporting agencies and collector continue to report negative marks on my reports. they send me responses of verified without proper verification. they have continued to fail to comply with federal laws.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(869,'08/24/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Other features, terms, or problems','COMMERCE BANK FINALLY CORRECTED OUR ON LINE ACCESS! WE WERE UNABLE TO MAKE ON LINE PAYMENTS AND AS A RESULT HAD TO PAY BY U.S. MAIL. ( SEE ATTACHED ). PLEASE CORRECT LATEPAYMENTS.','COMMERCE BANK',10.0,10.0,'COMMERCE BANK FINALLY CORRECTED ON LINE PAYMENTS. PLEASE CORRECT LATEPAYMENTS.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(870,'08/24/2018','Debt collection','Auto debt','False statements or representation','Dear Santander Consumer USA As of yet, I have not heard back from you in over 60 days regarding my notice of dispute : You have not supplied the demanded proof of the alleged debt, therefore under the doctrine of estoppel by silence, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] v [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( Mo ), I may presume that no proof of the alleged debt, nor therefore any such debt, in fact exists. 

You took my car involuntarily without any notice. Furthermore, You gave me a car that had a previous accident without notifying me as well which I''ve found out a week after when i took it to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to fix some issues I''ve got with it. I have the papers in hands to justify. Below, you''ll find the copy of what [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] revealed about The Car. 



In a good faith effort to resolve this matter amicably, I restate my demand for proof of the debt, specifically the alleged contract or other instrument bearing my signature, as well as proof of your authority in this matter. Absent such proof, you must terminate this collection action and correct any erroneous reports of this debt as mine. 

For the record, I state again that as I have no account with you, nor am I your customer, nor have I entered into a contract with you, I must ask for the following information : Please evidence your authorization under 15 USC 1692 ( e ) and 15 USC 1692 ( f ) in this alleged matter : 1. What is your authorization of law for your collection of information?

2. What is your authorization of law for your collection of this alleged debt?

3. Please evidence your authorization to do business or operate in the State 4. Please evidence proof of the alleged debt, including specifically the alleged contract or other instrument bearing my signature.

You have fifteen ( 15 ) days from receipt of this notice to respond. Your failure to respond, on point, in writing, hand signed, and in a timely manner, will work as a waiver to any and all of your claims in this matter, and will entitle me to presume that you sent your letter ( s ) in error, and that this matter is permanently closed.

Your continued silence is unacceptable. Either provide the proof or correct the record to remove the invalid debt from my credit files with the three primary credit-reporting agencies. You are currently in violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act and the Fair Debt Collection Act.

Failure to respond within 15 days of receipt of this registered letter will result in a small claims action against your company. I will be seeking at least {$5000.00} in damages for the following : - Defamation - Negligent Enablement of Identity Fraud - Violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act After obtaining the judgment against your company, I will obtain a Writ of Execution from the Sheriffs office in your county and I will begin the process of attaching property or funds to satisfy the judgment.

For the purposes of 15 USC 1692 et seq., this Notice has the same effect as a dispute to the validity of the alleged debt and a dispute to the validity of your claims. This Notice is an attempt to correct your records, and any information received from you will be collected as evidence should any further action be necessary. This is a request for information only, and is not a statement, election, or waiver of status.

Sincerely,','SANTANDER CONSUMER USA HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,4.0,'you have not supplied the demanded proof of the alleged debt. you may presume that no proof of the alleged debt exists. you took my car involuntarily without notice.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(871,'08/24/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Getting a credit card','On Monday,XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I telephoned American Express at the number on the back of my card ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) to redeem earned cash rewards. The person I spoke with credited my account for the earned cash rewards and encouraged me to upgrade my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  card ( no annual fee ) to their [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  card ( {$95.00} annual fee ).

I told the person I needed to confirm that the enhanced benefits on the new card would more than offset the annual fee. He told me for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] calendar year, I charged {$4900.00} at supermarkets, {$6000.00} at gas stations and {$180.00} at department stores. He did the math and confirmed the added benefits more than offset the new annual fee. In addition, I would be given a {$150.00} credit for {$1000.00} in purchases in the first 3 months. It all sounded pretty good, so I said sign me up.Later that night I thought his XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] spending figures sounded high so I checked my XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statements fromXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] through XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. For those 6 months, I averaged $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/month for groceries and $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/month for gas ( both typical for the year ). The figures that he provided to convince me to switch to the annual fee card were approximately 2.3 more for groceries and 2.8 more for gas than I spent in the 6 months of statements I reviewed, and I''m certain are typical of the entire year.','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a person who spoke with me credited my account for the earned cash rewards. he told me for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMIS');
