INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(878,'08/23/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','For almost two years I have made payments on time to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a vehicle financed through their company. In XX/XX/2018 I was taking out a refinance loan on my home and decided to pay off the vehicle. The refinance company cut a check to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in XX/XX/2018 but went over the payment deadline for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and advised us not to make another payment because they already cut the check. I notified [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that we were going to stop the payment from coming out of our bank account because the check was already cut and on its way to them. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] received and cashed it only to report us negatively to the credit bureaus TWICE dropping our credit score 100 points. They cashed the check two weeks ago and we have not received the vehicle title and after they cashed the check they reported to the credit bureaus negatively even after they were aware in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the situation. When we called at the beginning of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to resolve the issue they said it was policy to report it negatively to the credit bureaus per a policy that does not exist.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'refinance company cut a check to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in XX/XX/2018. the check was already cut and on its way');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(879,'08/22/2018','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','Naviant has a web portal for viewing loans. This information does not include what portion of the loan goes towards interest and principle. There is no statement provided that give this information either. The lack of transparency traps users into never knowing how much is actually going against the principle balance and is deceptive.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'Naviant has a web portal for viewing loans. this information does not include what portion of the loan goes towards interest and principle.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(880,'08/22/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','My loan was transferred to Rushmore Loan Management Services. I have a credit score over 800 and have never had a late payment. 
The website seems to be tailor made for people to make late payments. They say they have automatic payment scheduling, yet when I try to do that, I get a message saying " Not Available. '''' When I try to sign up for electronic reminders, there is no actual link : It is a bait-and-switch " We encourage you to also GO GREEN by signing up for paperless documents! Receive email notifications when your statements are ready to view, versus paper statements in the mail. Sign Up Today '''' no active link to actually sign up for reminders. 

They do not give information about when my payments are due. The website says my next payment is on XX/XX/18, but I''ve already made that payment and it does not show when the next payment is due. It''s XX/XX/18 already. 

This company should not be allowed to deal with servicing, they are not capable. Their business model appears to be to make it as hard as possible to pay your bill on time. I am financially literate and I find this difficult, I can only imagine how others navigate this. 

Rushmore ''s business practices verge on criminal.','RUSHMORE LOAN MANAGEMENT SERVICES LLC',2.0,2.0,'a credit score over 800 and have never had a late payment. the website seems to be tailor made for people to make late payments. when I try to sign up for electronic');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(881,'08/22/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] charged my credit card {$150.00} as a wire transfer which was not authorized. Capital one refuses to reverse these charges as a wire transfer when the purchase was a credit transaction. No signs posted or notified by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that any transactions will be considered wire transfers. Now I am being charged monthly interest charges by capital one for this. Capital One offered to credit one months interest charge but I would continue to collect interest charges until the balance of my account is paid.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] charged my credit card $150.00 as a wire transfer. no signs posted or');
