INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(944,'08/09/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I have contacted the CRA multiple times via Certified Mail and their online dispute system ( which seldom works ). There is an entry listed on my credit report in error, which I have tried to have removed repeatedly. It has come to my attention that someone with a similar name to mine filed bankruptcy in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] District of Florida U.S. Bankruptcy Court, and it has appeared on my credit report. Through your dispute system I recently filed a dispute stating that someone with a similar name had filed this public record and it was not mine. However, it remains. I searched the PACER system and I have contacted the Bankruptcy Court and they informed me that they do not provide anyone with a debtors full social security number, and they do not provide any credit bureau information relating to any bankruptcy cases, and that your information is from an online service such as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] & [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have searched PACER for information pertaining to this listed Public Record, and the address listed on the court filings is not my address, and I have never lived there. The address is located in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] County and I have been a resident of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] County for over 10 years. As you well know it is a violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act, 15 U.S.C. 1681 et seq. to report erroneous information on a credit report. I demand that Equifax expunge the reporting of a bankruptcy entirely, as it is a willful violation of the bankruptcy reporting requirements of 15U.S.C. 1681c ( d ) ( 1 ).','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a dispute has been filed in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] district of Florida. it has appeared on my credit report. it has come to my attention');
