INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1023,'07/24/2018','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Trouble during payment process','On XX/XX/2018, I filed complaint # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau. This matter was resolved by Dovenmuehle Mortgage Inc on XX/XX/2018. I was told via letter that all late charges associated with my account were waived and that my account was up-to-date. I also received a phone call from a representative from Dovenmuehle Mortgage Inc.that stated that my account was no longer past due. Soon after, the harassing phone calls resumed and I was being told that I missed the monthly payments. I waited to file this complaint because I thought that their system would need some time to update my account based on the " resolution '''' of my last complaint, however, the matter has not been resolved. According to the recent letter sent to me by mail on XX/XX/18, I am being accused of having a back balance of {$1600.00} for missed mortgage payments for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/2018 including {$230.00} for attorney and late fees. As of XX/XX/2018, Dovenmuehle Mortgage Inc. has cashed 8 checks from me this year via [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Those amounts include {$670.00} on XX/XX/18, {$670.00} on XX/XX/18, {$670.00} on XX/XX/18, {$670.00} on XX/XX/18, {$700.00} on XX/XX/18, {$680.00} on XX/XX/18, {$680.00} on XX/XX/18, and {$700.00} on XX/XX/18. I am not missing any mortgage payments and have proof from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  stating that Dovenmuehle Mortgage Inc. cashed 8 mortgages checks from me for XX/XX/2018 thus far.','Dovenmuehle Mortgage, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a complaint was filed on XX/XX/2018 by Dovenmuehle Mortgage Inc.. the matter was resolved by the consumer financial protection bureau. the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1024,'07/24/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Has been notified more then five times within the pass four months and I am just really tired of the poor work going on over there. I have NEVER in my life lived in AZ and they still show it on my report after I informed them of this. They are the ONLY credit bureau that deleted my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts that are still to this day in good standing. I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they have told me that every month they report to the three bureaus. I see them on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] each month and Experian but still NOT [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has also allowed a company that was charged off to come back and make their selves open and showing I am delinquent. But this isn''t correct. The account was charged off and sold and I make my payments to the new company monthly. The company name [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They are now on my report showing open and delinquent which has dropped my score. At this point I just want to cry because they have made such a mess of my account and refuse to correct it. I was told by three other credit card companies that were on my credit report that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] told them my credit report was the result of Identity theft and the accounts need to be closed and deleted and the companies did so, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] states they too received that letter but never closed my accounts and still report monthly. Please see my back up that shows that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is doing very CROOKED things by charging off and coming back and opening account after months of it being sold to another lender. 

I am writing to file a complaint on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I opened a loan account with them on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the loan was for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with a monthly payment of {$190.00}. I started to make payments then I lose my job at the same time I was going through a divorce and was unable to continue to make the payments I spoke with the supervisor over there and informed him of the situation I was in he stated he would do his best to hold off. He asked if there was any kind of payment that could be made I said not really as things were really bad for me. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Charged off my account for non-payment as I was unable to make the payments.I was hit with a heavy penalty from the Credit bureaus. I was notified by a company about them being the new account holder. At the time I was unable to make any arrangements so I waiting til I was able to. I called the company their name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . I sent up a payment agreement with them of {$100.00} to be taken out of my account monthly on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of each month. My first payment was to be a little more it was {$250.00} and there after {$100.00}. I made my first payment in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and have made a payment each month. Well on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I get an alert that I was hit with a serious delinquency on my credit reports when I called to check on what it was it was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they had changed the status from charged off/ closed/ transferred to OPEN status. Now I haven''t had any contact with them, only the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was now hit with another huge credit score drop. If my signed agreement is with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] how can [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] come back and change the status to OPEN with the credit bureaus? I have now been hit twice by the bureaus and my score has dropped tremendously. 

AT THIS POINT I FEEL THAT THIS IS MY ONLY WAY OF GETTING THE THREE BUREAUS TO LOOK AT MY FILE AND UNDERSTAND THAT SOMEONE DELETE AND ADDED INFORMATION THAT ISN''T MINE. IT IS EFFECTING MY LIFE THERE IS BACK UP TO SHOW THAT ONE MINUTE THEY ARE ON MY CREDIT AND THEN THE NEXT THEY ARE GONE .... NO EXPLANATION! I JUST WANT MY REPORTS CORRECTED ONCE AND FOR ALL. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] THE SAME REPORT YOU DELETED FROM MY ACCOUNT IS ON BOTH OF THE OTHER BUREAUS AND THEY HAVE BEEN UPDATED MONTHLY SO WHAT IS GOING ON OVER IN YOUR OFFICE? 
