INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1049,'07/19/2018','Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service','Domestic (US) money transfer','Confusing or missing disclosures','To BofA CEO [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : a call from yet another programmed BofA rep. The bottom line is that as q long-time BofA customer I accepted an offer for a money transfer under certain no charge conditions and it was NEVER disclosed that to ask for an increase I would to have to wait three months or effectively AFTER the offer had expired. Because they say Im not a long-time customer. Well, I have been such a customer for over 18 years. So this is NOT about my credit. This is a bait and switch which I will report to the consumer protection agency. You need to be reminded with all due respect, sir, of the original intentions of the Bank of America in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after the big fire at the turn of last century. To help people and be honest. The banks current rapacious scorched earth reputation is well deserved. A copy of this goes to the consumer protection agency. Please no more phone robot calls with various programmed individuals. Thank you.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'q long-time customer accepted an offer for a money transfer under certain no charge conditions. it was NEVER disclosed that to ask for an increase I would have to wait three months or');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1050,'07/18/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','This company keep reporting an account that doesn''t belong to me. It does belongs to my daughter. I don''t have any financial responsibility on these bill. I asked this company to provide me with any proof that I have signed any paper regarding this bill. They didn''t provide me with the documentation requested, but still reporting on my credit causing financial distress. This is a clear violation of FCRA.','The Outsource Group, Inc',2.0,2.0,'this company keep reporting an account that doesn''t belong to me. I asked this company to provide me with any proof that I have signed any paper. this is a clear violation');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1051,'07/18/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','False statements or representation','In my attempt to pay the amounts listed on my credit karma report, I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and spoke about the amounts owed. My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] indicates that I owe {$170.00}, {$140.00} and {$99.00}. According to the person I spoke to the agency has reported two amounts that are incorrect and it is the same account. The only amount that I owe is {$99.00} and the other two amounts are listed wrong and repeated on my credit report. I have called the collector agency ATG at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] today and left a message ext [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The account is listed to be opened on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and last time reported on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for the amount of {$140.00}. The other amount {$170.00} indicates to be opened on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and last reported on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
