INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1070,'07/14/2018','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','On XX/XX/2018, this debt for {$890.00} appeared on my credit report. I have no knowledge of this debt. I am requesting a signed confirmation with my signature that I opened this account. Under the Fair Credit Reporting Act, 15 U.S.C. 1681g I have the right to demand that you disclose to me all of the documents that you have recorded and retained in your file at the time of this request concerning the accounts that you are reporting on my credit report. Please don''t respond to my request by saying that this account has been verified. Send me copies of the documents that you have in your files that were used to verify this account. If you do not have any documentation in your files to verify the accuracy of this disputed account then please delete them immediately as required under Section 611 ( a ) ( 5 ) ( A ) ( i ). By publishing these inaccurate and unverified items on my credit report and distributing them to 3rd parties you are damaging my reputation and credit worthiness. Under the FCRA 15 U.S.C. 1681i, all unverified accounts must be promptly deleted. Therefore, if you are unable to provide me with a copy of the verifiable proof that you have on file for the account listed within 15 days of receipt of this then you must remove the account from my credit report.','Resurgent Capital Services L.P.',2.0,2.0,'a debt of $890.00 appeared on my credit report on XX/XX/2018. I have no knowledge of this debt. I have the right to demand that you');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1071,'07/14/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','Threatened to contact someone or share information improperly','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with Evergreen Professionals called one of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] offices about me to collect a debt.

1. I am not allowed to take calls at work as that is a misuse of state resources- I''ve shared this with him before yet he fails to comply 2. The deparrment he called I no longer work at. He made the lady who took the call very uncomfortable with there conversation 3. He announced he was attempting to collect a debt 4. He called my personal phone and left a message that he is collecting a debt- I don''t have my name listed on the voicemail. That message could have been left for anyone.','EVERGREEN PROFESSIONAL RECOVERIES, INC.',2.0,2.0,'he called one of the offices about me to collect a debt. he left a message that he is collecting a debt. he said he is not');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1072,'07/14/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','The Money Source has locked us out of online payments and requires payment by money order, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( their site states they don''t accept Money Source Payments ) or certified checks. 
The reason they say is because there were two NSF bounce backs. ( The paycheck deposit is the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; the bank withdrawal is the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and, so the two were not lining up. 

My complaint is that there was no advance notification that online payments would no longer be accepted so consequently we will have a late on our credit report as payment could not be made online and we had to rush to get payment out via overnight. The customer service staff said there is no policy in place to address the lock out from online payments nor is there an appeal process. They said it is a system lock out. 

So, for the next six months we are required to make payments via certified check and put it in the mail. How is this helpful? It just builds customer animosity. 

How is this helpful to the consumer? Why aren''t they required to provide advance notice to the customer? Why aren''t they required to have a policy in place to notify the customer, provide advance warning, and provide for an appeals process?','MONEY SOURCE, THE',2.0,2.0,'money order, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and certified checks are not accepted. the money source site states they don''t accept money source payments. the customer');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1073,'07/14/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','Hello Sir/Mam I have a problem with my credit file. I disputed an address on my file and a name. The address was already on my credit file and a duplicate incomplete was there also. The representative did not want to remove the incorrect address so I asked for a supervisor. The supervisor came on and stated he would take care of it. The incorrect address was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the name was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I received an update this morning which stated the name and my SOCIAL SECURITY NUMBER were DELETED!!!! THE INCORRECT ADDRESS IS STILL THERE!!! I am very upset!!! This is in retaliation of me asking for a supervisor and these actions will not be tolerated!! I want this corrected IMMMEDIATELY!! I want the calls pulled and reviewed. I am filing complaints with the CFPB, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and any other bureau I can find!!! It''s bad enough people have worry about FRAUD BUT WHEN YOU HAVE TO WORRY ABOUT THOSE WHO HAVE ACCEES TO YOUR PERSONAL RECORDS THAT''S NOT GOOD!!! And there is NO WAY A MISTAKE COULD BE USED AS AN EXCUSE!! Address, name and social security number do not sound alike in any way!!! Please correct this asap. I may be reached at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I want to file an official complaint against both the representative and supervisor who handled my call yesterday evening. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was the supervisor and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was the representative I spoke to first. 
Thank you. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'the name and address were incorrectly listed on my credit file. the representative did not want to remove the incorrect address. the supervisor came on and said he would take care of it');
