INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1077,'07/13/2018','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Installment loan','Getting the loan','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I applied for a personal loan through SoFi, and the application included my most recent paystub. I stated an income level of {$110000.00} gross ( before tax ), and showed them a weekly paystub of {$2200.00} ( before tax ). That night, a message appeared on their website that stated that a voided check must be submitted to verify my banking information. 

The next morning, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I attempted to upload this document and the website encountered an error. I contacted customer support, who was able to upload the document for me through a secure messaging system. Additionally, they asked me to provide a bank statement, and I did so. After providing these documents, they were verified, and I was able to sign paperwork for the loan. 

On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was sent an email stating there was " one last step : a quick call '''' and they would contact me, but the call never came. Five days later on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was sent another email stating that the application was denied. The website shows that they were " unable to verify income '''' despite having BOTH bank statements and my most recent paystub. Having contacted customer support through both email and phonecall, neither was able to provide any additional information on why they were unable to verify my income or the process they used to verify it. I have offered to put them in contact with my employer, but they refuse. 

I strongly believe that they are lying about being unable to verify my income level.','Social Finance, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] applied for a personal loan through SoFi. the application included my most recent paystub.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1078,'07/13/2018','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Trouble during payment process','On XX/XX/2018 I was notified by my Home insurance company that my home insurance premium of {$1600.00} has not been paid. After contacting my agent and calling the mortgage services : Carrington Mortgage Services, I request research on tracking the payment. Carrngton expressed that their system does not identify on the check a reference to my insurance policy nor does it list me name. They stated they send the check with a reference paper. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], my homeowner insurance company, stated they returned the check to Carrington due to lack of reference on the check on application of the funds. Carrington denied receiving these funds back from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My policy lapsed as of XX/XX/2018 and he lack of response from Carrington shows they are not concerned with rectifying the matter. I spoke with a manager named [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from Carrington Mortgage services who identified herself as a Manager with the firm.','CARRINGTON MORTGAGE SERVICES, LLC',2.0,2.0,'my home insurance premium of $1600.00 has not been paid. my agent called the mortgage services.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1079,'07/12/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','A website company [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with no phone number charged my account {$25.00} for merchandise I did not receive and another {$5.00} to ship it. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] denied the refill and said I had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to see my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Great, I''m fine with that but [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] isn''t accepting my explanation. THey haven''t even reached out to merchant. All they do is send it to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who do not understand [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as primary language. Sanctions and interest should be paid for withholding this dispute unfairly and illegally, not put me through a paper chase.','Alliance Data Card Services',2.0,2.0,'a website company charged my account $25.00 for merchandise I did not receive. another $5.00 to ship it. the company denied the refill and said');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1080,'07/12/2018','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage','I currently have a FHA mortgage with Chase Mortgage Mortgage with a balloon payment of {$22000.00} due XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].. home value {$140000.00} I would like to file a formal compliant with you regarding Chase Mortgage Mortgage their banking practices, their short sales and foreclosures in my area. These for homes or at lest mine seem to have a large amount of equity in them. 
Chase Mortgage manner and inconsistencies of their information to its consumers contradict there own web site, there agents and customer service agents about modification and home assistance help When I first tried to obtain a modified mortgage with Chase Mortgage I had a lot of problems, they kept denying me or sending me an offer for {$800.00} to {$900.00} a contract. My net income was around {$1600.00} a month from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I pleaded with Chase Mortgage to lower it I was only paying {$480.00} ( est ) a  month to begin with. I reminded them of the reason I was behind on payments due to medical bills and a long term hospital stay then rehab. I was assigned one counselor after another and the results were the same. Finally I made a call out of desperation to a  supervisor who looked at my file and asked if we could make a 3 way call with the IRS. 
Once we called the IRS. We found out I was the victim of ID theft, someone had been trying for the pass 3 years to obtain large amount of tax returns in my name. Because it was such a large amount, IRS had flagged the account, all the while trying to call me and send me letters. Well they where being sent to the bogus address and the bogus phone numbers. 
Chase Mortgage assumed tax was fudged hence the large amount for a modification Once Chase Mortgage receive this information I was offered a modification of {$370.00} but it came with a balloon payment due in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. ( EX. A ) I called Chase Mortgage to voice my concerns, Chase Mortgage assured me when the time came they would be able to help me with other programs they had or refinance the balance of the loan XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I  contacted Chase Mortgage to try and get a program to help me with this balloon payment. Chase Mortgage asked me to fill in the modification paper work and send it back. This took some time since they kept saying they didnt receive this or that document I was assigned a counselling Mr. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I never had much dealings with him it was always with his co worker. 
One day before a holiday weekend in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] around [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Mr [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] called me to say I had been denied and in a rough disgusted at me tone he was shouting we cant help you we, have no options for you, and dont send any payments in because we will send them back, By this time I was crying and pleading for help he shouted there is nothing we can do, I asked what about refinance, he yelled well you need to get yourself together and call them because they certainly are not going to help you sounding like that. 
I was able to call the refinance department the same day and based on my credit score [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( EX. C ) said he could not help me. I was distraught. Over the next few days I received lots of mail from all different people and Mr. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] denial letter. ( EX. B ) I  called the chase mortgage back after the holiday informing them about how I was treated and try to get some help. I was referred to the escalation department who opened a file into the dealings I had with Mr. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. All the while still receiving a monthly bill from Chase Mortgage and every time I called they said we cant accept your payment. 
I asked the supervisor why did they Deny me they said the group of investor ''s are not willing to modify and we as Chase Mortgage are just the service of the loan and the other 3 banks made the decision.They also advised me to fill out another modification application ( EX. D ).

In the meantime I called around to see if I could could get help else where, I got involved with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Mr [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I visited Mr [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] office we filled in the paper work and sent all back to Chase Mortgage. 
In the meantime I called the three banks listed on my denial letter since Chase Mortgage had told me it would have to be their decision. I found out that Chase Mortgage now own two of the three of those banks listed as investor. The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] would be willing to modify according to the mortgage department. ( EX. B p4 hand notes ) I called Chase Mortgage bank and ask to inform them that they in-fact owned the low and could make a decision if need be. 
On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I received a call around late afternoon form my Chase Mortgage counselling a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]., to advice me i had been refused once again. She went over the details of a thing called a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the investors I reminded her that Chase Mortgage was the investor and the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was willing to see reason. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] advised me that a letter would be coming explaining everything ( EX. B ) All the while my personal problems were crumbling around me, my service dog of 13yrs was schedule to be [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] it was a stressful time. After the procedure I was not taking it well and was prescribed sedative I was in bed for several days and was just coming around on Friday XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( EX. E ) I was jarred awake by someone pounding the fist on the front door. I was very disorientate and confused I rushed to the door to find and man with a huge camera shout out Chase Mortgage sent me you need to pay your mortgage, I asked him to wait so I could get dressed. I opened the door a little wider and he kept pointing to a form yelling I have to fill this out and can you make an payment today?, Chase Mortgage as asked me to fill in this worksheet and call them at this number right now, for the sake of my privacy I had to let him in. He said we need to call Chase Mortgage they can take your payment. I told him I was confused I just got a denial letter, he said yes but can you make a payment? I said yes if they take it. We called from my phone ( he left his in the car ) the lady on the phone ask him if he has filled in the finical work sheet she asked ifI could make a payment? I said yes. Then she must have pulled something up because she promptly said oh no we can not take a payment this loan has matured. I told her I am confuse why is chase mortgage sending people to my home forcefully I was put through to Mr [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at chase mortgage who advised me to call around to try for a refinance I called my counselor [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and left him a message he was out of town for the holiday on his return Monday he sent me a list of local lenders who might help. Most of the lenders could or would not refinance for that small amount, in-fact on told me why dont you put that on a couple of credit cards. I finally got through to a a lady at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we ran a credit report only to find out that Chase Mortgage has ruined my credit score by sending information of delinquent monthly payments.??? ask me to call Chase Mortgage to have them remove that or at least send a letter stating there is no monthly payment due at lest 3 payments of the regular amount [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
Called Chase Mortgage made a complaint, spoke [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for Chase Mortgage credit reporting he cant take it off or send out any letters unless he gets the okay from the bank put t Put through to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sent me through to escalation department Spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] @ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they would escalate this and file a complaint and get back with me within 24hrs. ( they did not call back ) Called FHA they referred me to CFB, HUD and a host of others a I took a look at the area for foreclose and it appears to be a trend of people within the {$200000.00} and below house price range, that seem to be foreclosed on. I owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the value of my home is {$140000.00} I have been advised by Chase Mortgage that foreclose is an option or a short sale. Either of those options are for the banks interest. A foreclosure would greatly benefit this bank and its investors (? ) a tidy investment for {$20000.00}. Please take a look at this banks practices and the trend of foreclosures homes in my area and statewide to see if this is indeed a trend to take peoples homes at a huge profit Regards','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,4.0,'a mortgage with Chase Mortgage Mortgage is currently with a balloon payment of $22000.00 due XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMIS');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1081,'07/12/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Other features, terms, or problems','Bank of American makes it effectively impossible for consumers to communicate with it without visiting a branch in person. Tonight, for example, I attempted to ask a question about my credit card account. BOA ''s website does not allow for email or chat. Instead, consumers must call or visit a branch. 

Yet calling is a dead end. I spent 10 minutes setting up an automated call from a BOA representative to be placed " in more than 30 minutes. '''' When the call came, I navigated through additional prompts and then .... it hung up on me. Moreover, I have tried to call again and have again been on hold for more than 10 minutes. If the last call suggests anything, it''s that the wait on this call will also exceed exceed 30 minutes and then the call will disconnect again - creating an embarrassingly time-consuming loop. 

If BOA cared about its customers, or about providing the service it promises, it would : ( 1 ) provide ways for consumers to reach BOA without visiting a branch ; and ( 2 ) remove the false claims that it can be reached by phone ( which waste its customers '' time ).','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'consumers must call or visit a branch without visiting a branch in person. if the last call suggests anything, it''s that wait on this call will also exceed 30 minutes ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1082,'07/12/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','Today XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I learned that a discharged judgment and foreclosed property from a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bankruptcy has appeared on our credit report after 7 years. Per the credit report the Debt is showing as XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank name [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -- No Data. Eviction is checked yes. Address is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( will disclose if requested ). 

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank name [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Trustee for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] then [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) - No Data. Eviction is checked yes Address is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( will further disclose if requested ). 

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank name [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - Eviction is checked no Address is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( will further disclose if requested ) Judgment Amount is {$35000.00}. 

Home at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was foreclosed in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], there was no eviction and was my husbands property. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was my property which was discharged in our joint bankruptcy in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. There was no eviction. Also [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was related to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and my name was not on that loan. It was a money judgment when the bankruptcy discharged it in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at {$35000.00}. 

These items were not on any credit report until around XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when I received a letter from Equifax saying that my current address was changed to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a place I had not lived at for 3 years. 

Both of these banks are in violation of the terms of the bankruptcy as both property and judgment were discharged in the bankruptcy. 

I want these items permanently removed from our credit reports as this is some sort of retaliation. I have not contacted the banks because we have worked very hard over the past 7 years to keep our credit clean. I do not wish to play a game of dispute where each time they fight the dispute it drops our scores. We had to file bankruptcy due to my failing health and subsequent permanent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but we did so according to the laws of the United States government. We did not underhandedly file false and misleading reports that are now compromising our character. What they have done is deceptive, unfair and they should be reprimanded as they had all records relating to our bankruptcy. These banks need to stop trying to ruin people with these types of tactics. 

It has been [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years since the bankruptcy discharge and at least 10 years to the judgment filing. 

I can''t even find an address for either bank to try to take care of this without damaging our credit files further. They are not listed in the creditor list on the credit report we just had pulled. So no way to contact them. 

We can provide whatever proof is necessary to get this handled including the court paperwork that dismissed any eviction case against us. 

We sincerely appreciate whatever you can do to stop these big banks from disobeying laws that were put into place to protect us. Thank you.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank name [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1083,'07/12/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','Written notification about debt','On XX/XX/2018 I sent out a debt validation letter not a verification letter to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] asking them for validation.The letter arrived on XX/XX/2018 at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the law states that collection agencies must provide proof the debt they seek to collect is accurate and they have the right to collect it.I simply stated This is NOT a request for verification or proof of my mailing address, but a request for VALIDATION.I insisted that they provide me with competent evidence that I have any legal obligation to pay them and Validation of the debt. Also stated If invalidated all references to this account must be deleted and completely removed from all 3 major credit bureaus of my credit file and a copy of such deletion request shall be sent to me immediately. Within 30 days of me sending the letter they responded with a letter but it did not validate the debt in no possible way to prove I owe it or them. Now I''m taking the next step to get this inaccurate and non validated collection from hindering my credit file.','HCFS Health Care Financial Services, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'debt validation letter arrived on XX/XX/2018 at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] collection agencies must provide proof the debt they seek to collect is accurate.');
