INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1088,'07/11/2018','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','From what I was told by the " escalation department rep '''', [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is the " administrative and secretarial assistant '''' for Great Lakes Guarantor. After repaying my loan in full in XX/XX/2018, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] continued wage garnishment for 3 consecutive pay periods. They finally sent a letter to my employer to stop garnishment two weeks ( another pay period ) after I called. When it comes to getting any question answered regarding the status of my account, or when I might be receiving reimbursement, the answers are generic and scripted. " The account is closed. The accounting department doesn''t have a contact number and is behind. We have no other information on your account. '''' After over 30 min speaking to both reps, I was given the number to Great Lakes. Mind you, the second rep, " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' kept cutting me off with " We don''t have information on your account ''''. Poor customer service, rude and unhelpful. I ended the conversation with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], letting him know that if Great Lakes was who I should speak with, he could''ve saved us both time by redirecting me there 15 min. prior.','GREAT LAKES',2.0,2.0,'escalation department rep '''' was told by the " administrative and secretarial assistant ''''. '''' escalation department rep '''' kept cutting');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1089,'07/11/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Struggling to pay your bill','Back in 2015 I had just opened a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit card account after a few months my mother got critically ill do to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my credit card was still opened but I had stopped payment the card company called I set up payment arrangements the agreement was I pay the account off and the account would be in good standings. I set up auto pay and they received all moneys owed at the last payment the card was closed by creditor and the account was placed on my report as closed by creditor and charge off. This was not agree upon nor was I promised this during payment arrangements.','TD BANK US HOLDING COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'in 2015 my mother got critically ill do to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my credit card was still opened. the card company called I set up payment arrangements ');
