INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1107,'07/07/2018','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','I originally applied for a mtg modification in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] due to a financial hardship that occurred on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was injured at work and was dismissed from work and placed on workers compensation. While on workers comp my total monthly income was {$2300.00} per month. I even had to file a chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bankruptcy which was discharged XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This application was denied with reason being " loan not seasoned enough ''''. I was told submit an appeal on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when my loan would be 12 months old. This appeal was denied because my income was only $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/m and because workers comp income is not considered permanent income. I then submitted my employment verification letter proving that I was going to begin working on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which would then produce a permanent increase in income as the job I started was was permanent. This was denied by my lender because " my income to debt ratio did would not meet poverty limit guidelines. '''' My income was {$3700.00} per month once I began working. This alerted me that the lender did not take into account that most of my debt was discharged in the  bankruptcy therefore, my monthly expenses had decreased.I then followed up with an email providing the loss mitigation department a copy of my chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] discharge with list of creditors whose debt was discharged which proved my decrease in monthly expenses. I also sent an updated income and expense form as well as current paystubs as I had began working. They denied again because " debt to income ratio did not meet the guidelines ''''. At that time my monthly income had increased because I had started to receive court ordered child support. I spoke to loss mit dept who then advised me to submit a new application. I submitted a new modification application packet with updated income showing the increase in my income. Did not hear back from the lender. I called the loss mit department to check the status of my application. It was then brought to my attention that my home was in foreclosure. Come to find out they overlooked my application. Once they realized this they paused the foreclosure and reviewed my app. I was denied because " my income was too high and which disqualified me from qualifying for assistance. I feel that the lender is coming up with reasons to deny me.','ON Q FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'mtg modification was made in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] due to financial hardship. I was dismissed from work and placed');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1108,'07/07/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','The following items are not authorized inquiries in which the company does not allow you to dispute the inquires online and when calling your turned away by the rep. the following items are not authorized : Factual Data [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the following items are not authorized inquiries in which the company does not allow you to dispute the inquires online. the following items are not authorized.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1109,'07/06/2018','Debt collection','Mortgage debt','Took or threatened to take negative or legal action','I settled with my mortgage company on the short sale of my home. An amount was agreed upon but no timeframe or monthly amount due was part of the agreement. Only that the debt will be paid in a reasonable time. Dyck Oneal purchased this debt and converted it into a monthly payment with a fixed term without my consent. If payment is considered late by them, a negative remark is placed on my credit report. Constant phone calls are made to my home and relatives asking when payment will be made. My credit is now damaged by this company and causing financial hardship.','Dyck-O''Neal, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'Dyck Oneal bought the debt and converted it into a monthly payment with a fixed term without my consent. if payment is considered late by them, a negative re');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1110,'07/06/2018','Student loan','Private student loan','Dealing with your lender or servicer','Navient refused to enter me into a secound income driven repayment plan. They allowed the plan to lapse and then charged my account [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in fees that I did not owe. They apologized but refused to reverse the charges. I am forced to wait 30 days to enter into a new program in which Im forced to agree to pay them money I can not afford','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'Navient refused to enter me into a secound income driven repayment plan. they allowed the plan to lapse and then charged my account in fees that I did not owe');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1111,'07/06/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','Written notification about debt','I was involved in a accident which wasn''t my fought. The Insurance company was responsibe for 100 % of the payment. I shouldnt have any dept on this particular account.','GOLD KEY CREDIT, INC.',2.0,4.0,'the insurance company was responsibe for 100 % of the payment.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1112,'07/06/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','FACTS : XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] received 3 letters for Summit Funding The Home Loan Experts Each of the three letters were dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and stated my Loan had be transferred effective XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and my auto pay would no longer work. 
Each of three letters had the wrong address. 
My previous lender was Summit Funding Inc. and my new Lender is Summit Funding Inc. 

They cancelled my auto pay on the effective date of the transfer which was 15 days prior to letter dated on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and 30 days before I received the letter in my hands. 

I called the numbers on the letter and I was transferred to collections [ I about died ], and they told me they have been calling me and sending me letters about my delinquency. I was absolutely floored. So I looked at their letters they sent in their new online portal and they were sending letter to an address I had prior to the address on the mortgage [ and address I had not lived at for over 6 years, and a different address from the letters received on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ]. I asked when they called me and when they left a voicemail and customer service at Summit Lending said no one left me a voicemail. 

So I registered on their new online portal, and there is absolutely NO other information in there except a new loan number, and a balance due. No history of what happened with my loan being transferred, No payment history. Nothing. I honestly thought it was a fraud. Looking on that new portal I discovered the other Communication that was sent and it was all sent to the wrong addresses, 2 different sets of wrong addresses.

Customer care at Summit was great, however I have a total issue with the communication being delivered. I didn''t receive anything from Summit Funding [ my original lender ] nor on their website that alerted me to a change in my mortgage, nothing ported me over and said on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] set up new payment on this site. Everything about this operation made me feel like they do not have their [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] together. Most major companies port you over to the website to log in. 

My other complaint is, to the laymen, selling your loan from Summit Funding to Summit  Funding is highly confusing. Again it feels like you are being shistered.','SUMMIT FUNDING, INC.',2.0,4.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] received 3 letters for Summit Funding The Home Loan Experts. each letter had the wrong address and');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1113,'07/06/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I am filing a complaint against TD Bank. I mailed my mortgage payment to my mortgage holder for the XX/XX/2018 mortgage payment for the amount of {$490.00}. The check was made to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] contacted me to ask me why I did not send the payment for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I told that it was sent had had been deposited at my bank, since I saw on my statement that it had been deposited. I then uploaded the check from my computer and noticed that the front of the check had been altered and that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   had been added in parenthesis next to his name and that the signature at the back was not [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] name but that someone else had signed the check. 
I then went to the TD Bank on the same day and filed an affidavit of fraud and gave them the number of the police report I made. The paperwork was notarized at the bank and my husband and I was told that the money would be refunded in the next four days. 
Since then I have contacted them multiple times, I have been told that the affidavit had been sent to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and that they can not be contacted by phone, then I was told that my case had not been assigned to anyone. They called me today and had me sign another affidavit telling me that they need to send it to New Jersey and restart the process. They are refusing to pay back for their mistake. 
Attached is all the paperwork that I have signed and provided them with. 

Sincerely, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','TD BANK US HOLDING COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'a mortgage payment was sent to my mortgage holder for the XX/XX/2018 mortgage payment. the payment was sent to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1114,'07/05/2018','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Trouble during payment process','Myself and My Wife are very confused at the way CHASE BANK is handling our mortgage transfer to another servicer. We recently received a letter from Chase stating that we should not send any more payments to them that they no longer service our mortgage, which we have no issues with what so ever. the thing that we have lost sleep over and confused us is the fact that the letter is signed by a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it says we will receive instructions from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but it also says we will be sending future payments to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at another entity when the same [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] signed the letter attesting to the fact that he is clearly an employee of Chase a managing director, where the letter says not to direct any payments to. So my wife asked how is he working at both banks isn''t that a conflict of interest. Which bank does he actually work for? and how isn''t this the most confusing mixed message ever?','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'myself and My Wife are very confused at the way CHASE BANK is handling our mortgage transfer to another servicer. the letter is signed by a [COMP');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1115,'07/05/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Fees or interest','The credit card company, Chase, closed my account and I can not longer use it. 
At the time is was closed the interest rate was 8.49 %. I have been making payments to pay off the balance that was due when they closed the account. 
Now I see they have raised my interest to 9.49 %. Now on this statement I see it has raised again to 9.74 %. Isn''t there a law that says if they close the account I can pay off the balance that I owe under the same terms? ( 8.49 % ) I called them and talked to them and they said they can raise my interest rate even tho they closed my account.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'the credit card company, Chase, closed my account and I can not longer use it. at the time is was closed the interest rate was 8.49 %. now I see it');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1116,'07/05/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Credit monitoring or identity theft protection services','I have been told by one of my creditors that somebody stole my information opened up a credit card fraudulently and they told me Im a victim of identity theft','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'credit cardholder told me that someone stole my information opened up a credit card fraudulently. they told me im a victim of identity theft.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1117,'07/05/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Took or threatened to take negative or legal action','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has attempted to take me to court for a wage garnishment from a debt I fell behind years ago ( Early-Mid [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) due to job loss./possibility of homelessness. 
