INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1120,'07/04/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','On XX/XX/2018, I was visiting family in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and went to a Chase ATM at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], NY [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was accompanied by my boyfriend and cousin. I attempted to deposit {$680.00} in cash at the ATM, but was given an error response and told to contact Chase immediately to resolve the issue. I called the number provided and spoke to a customer claim representative about my problem and gave her all of the details. I was told that it would be taken care of and was emailed an update regarding a " temporary credit '''' while Chase investigated my claim. 

I received a letter from Chase on XX/XX/2018 that my claim was denied and the " temporary credit '''' will be reversed. I called the Claim department at Chase to understand why my claim has been denied and how I can get my {$680.00} back. That money is an entire month ''s worth of rent for me. The representative was unhelpful and informed me that the Claim department ''s investigation allegedly showed that the ATM didn''t have the money that I deposited. I asked about any steps I could take to resolve the issue or appeal the decision, but the representative was not forthcoming.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'a customer claim representative gave me all of the details of my problem. I tried to deposit $680.00 in cash at the ATM. the customer claim representative was un');
