INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1122,'07/03/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','Written notification about debt','Eastern Account Systems got the collection item XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and neither they or the originator, ever invoiced me or gave me the opportunity to challenge the claim. 
I never hired or obligated in any fashion, to pay the amount that they are claiming in the collection. The collection came from a hospital visit on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which was paid to the hospital by insurance. 
The client of EAS collections has no claim against me for I never hired them, I never agreed to pay them any amount and I knew nothing of them at all until I found their collection item on my credit record at the end of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
EAS collections should have given me all my rights to challenge this prior to placing the collection item on my records. 
I herein challenge the account in it''s entirety and pray they provide written proof and documentation proving without question I owe this.','Eastern Account Systems of Connecticut, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'Eastern Account Systems got the collection item XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] neither they or the originator, ever invoiced me or gave me');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1123,'07/03/2018','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Trouble during payment process','I am paying my mortgage online through online bill pay. My payment is being rejected by the mortgage company, Loan Care, LLC. Unfortunately for me, I do not find this out until 20-25 days later when my bank finally refunds my on time payment. 

Timeline of events ( approximations on the hours ... the days are precise ) : XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - Payment was made XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - I hold my Payment for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] because I don''t know where my previous mortgage money went. I think I''m getting scammed at this point. 
Between XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - Over 25 hours of hold, >2 call back requests and 2 emails ... I can not get contact with a human. I would either get hung up on or the customer service center would close. 
Between XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the people who closed on my mortgage contacted someone to get in touch with me. They told me to try my payment again. I said I would wait to make sure I have my money back first since they rejected it. Their response, " We can not reject a payment. '''' I have proof that they do. I''ve sent it to them in email and I also have a second round of proof now that they rejected my payment again! They then tell me I don''t have enough funds in my bank account. This is also a complete farce. 
XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - Bank refund was received for mortgage payment XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - Refund cleared ; payment was sent again. Loan Care processed the payment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - I was reported to the credit bureaus for delinquency. 
XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - Able to get enough evidence to prove that delinquency wasn''t my fault. Sent proof to Loan Care. 
