INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1140,'06/29/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Fees or interest','I have had a credit card with Citibank since 1994 and my interest rate has only gone up and up. it used to be an employee account with a reduced rate. I currently carry close to $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in balances and the rate is prime plus 16.74 for a total of 21.74. I hold other cards at a credit union that charges 10 %, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( which is also through Citi ) that charges 16 % and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that charges 14 %. However with my old account they will not budge. 
They could not give me any basis for how prime was 5 % yet the 10-year treasury rate and fed funds rate have been below 3 % for years. It is also [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] points higher than the federal reserve reports for " consumer credit '''' https : //www.federalreserve.gov/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I asked to have my account reviewed for a reduction and they said they could not reduce. I asked when the last time the account was reviewed and the representative ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  - she would not provide an operator number or any additional identifier ) could not tell me. She said she has no history of the rate ever bring reduced only increases. I asked whether the account could be reviewed for a decrease and she said no program is currently available to do that. I asked how frequently it was reviewed and at first she said she did not know so I asked to speak with a supervisor. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( supervisor ) came on the line and said my account is reviewed in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and then said I should wait until XX/XX/XXXXto try again. My FICO has certainly increased and decreased in the last decade and at no time has my rate ever been adjusted downward and I believe I have paid an excess rate of about 7 % during that time period on balances between $ 15K- $ 20K I would like your help getting this overcharge corrected.','CITIBANK, N.A.',4.0,4.0,'a credit card with Citibank has been a credit card since 1994. the rate is prime plus 16.74 for a total of 21.74. the rate is prime plus');
