INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1161,'06/25/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Other personal consumer report','Incorrect information on your report','To Whom it May Concern, On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I received notification of a hard inquiry on my credit from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I immediately called Equifax after checking [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and found the date it was checked as being XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They related I would have to talk to the creditor to have it removed because hard inquiries are not disputable. I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the next day due to time and spent many hours on the phone and talked to many departments to find out that someone tried to open and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account in my name. I related that it was not me and I did not authorize it. I called back a few more times over the next few days and spent many more hours on the phone finally talking to someone who sounded like they knew something. I was directed to a webpage to fill out an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ID Theft Claim Packet and fax it back. I called back the next day to confirm receipt and was told it will take 30-60 days for this to be processed and you will hear from us.

