INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1201,'06/16/2018','Checking or savings account','Savings account','Closing an account','In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I submitted forms to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( divn of Webster Bank ) and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for my account balance with HSA Bank to be transferred to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in a trustee-to-trustee transfer. After waiting 8 weeks, I inquired with HSA bank why the transfer had not yet been executed, and was told the forms must have been lost. At that time, I re-submitted the forms to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and was told the forms would be forwarded to the Operations Department for immediate processing of the transfer. 

As of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], more than four months after originally requesting the transfer, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has not yet transferred the funds to my HSA with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','WEBSTER BANK, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] submitted forms to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_AN');
