INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1223,'06/12/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Fees or interest','I was one day late on a payment. The bill was due on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the rep said to call once the fee was applied and I can request it to be waved. I called today the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and asked if they could wave the fee. I explained how I have all my cards on automatic payment and this late payment was unintentional. I also explained I went online to set up automatic payments so it wont happen again. I was told by the rep that the fee was applied and is not eligible to be waved. Then I was told they have options on the mobile app to avoid this in be future. Their mobile app however, doesnt make it possible to set up automatic payment. You have to login on your PC. They do not send any notification to remind you of your upcoming payment. It seems like they set me up for a {$25.00} dollar fee and lied saying I can request it to be removed, knowing its not eligible according to their policy. In an era where everything is done on a smartphone they make it difficult to pay a bill. Then their fee is the same amount as what my monthly payment is. So I am being doubled charged.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'the bill was due on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the rep said to call once the fee was applied. the rep said to call once the fee was');
