INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1238,'06/08/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','This complaint references previously started [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loan number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The residence address is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] PA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The CFPB complaint number was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

1. This mortgage started with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. At a short time afterwards I fell behind and filed for bankruptcy protection. The loan was eventually sold to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Then [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], then to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the current mortgage holder. Bankruptcy payments to the trustee each month for 60 months totaled {$41000.00} sent directly by the trustee for mortgage purposes. I want [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to account for where this money was applied in full. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], when it purchased this loan, bought its history ( good and bad ) as well. No company would buy a mortgage that they couldn''t verify correct amounts owed thru past records. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has previously stated they " can not speak to the actions of the prior servicer ''''. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has access to records of this, and I have every email and chart from my bankruptcy attorney for 5 years regarding this. I''m asking because I''m still looking for the destination of {$41000.00} sent from the trustee specifically to the mortgage company. Where did it go? In full. 

2. Escrow is still a mess. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is still asking for an " escrow short payment '''' of an additional {$430.00} per month on top of the monthly {$600.00} set aside in each payment for escrow. Since the loan is now understood to be current as of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], only 24 months ago ... and I possess bank confirmation of every single monthly payment in full ( and on time ) for every month but one ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), how can escrow be short anymore than appx. {$600.00} total. Am I not correct in stating that escrow is only for taxes, and insurance? Specifically what, other than school and real estate taxes, and home insurance, has been paid or charged to escrow? Again, I was in bankruptcy protection. 

In an escrow statement from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], escrow was listed as having {$16000.00}. They listed a " required amount '''' as {$4100.00}. That means that only 17 months ago, escrow was OVERFUNDED by {$11000.00}. Since that time escrow has received monthly dispersements of over {$600.00} per month from monthly mortgage payments. Thats roughly {$10000.00} ( plus 2 months where I have now paid an additional {$430.00} ) plus the amount pf overfunding totals just shy of {$24000.00}. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has correctly listed needed escrow monthly at {$600.00}. At that rate, escrow currently would have been funded in whole for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ... and then some. Clearly money is being misappropriated out of escrow for other purposes. Rather than sending charts, I want a full accounting of specifically where every single dollar was paid out of escrow and for what purpose since the date of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Statement. Again, taxes and insurance only total a little over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  a year. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to explain the whereabouts. 

4. My bankruptcy attorney and I have been asking for 18 months for a proper accounting of monies paid in vs amounts credited for the calendar year [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Simply put, including the bulk payment made of {$27000.00} plus all 11 monthly mortgage payments made in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I have proof of payment for {$61000.00}. Mortgage reduction, taxes paid and interest paid only amount to {$51000.00}. Since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], about the same time as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] entered the picture, we have been asking where is the missing {$10000.00}? Please account for this. If it is in the records for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], then please obtain it from history. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has access to this history ... they would not have bought the loan without it. 

5. All monthly fees ( at least 3 separate {$1300.00} fees, plus a {$500.00} BKY fee, plus $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] late fees ) need to be reversed immediately. Many of these fees were assessed in bankruptcy, and all were assessed with the incorrect assumption that we were behind. We very well may not be behind at all, and may be in the back re current. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] continues to ignore this request and skips over it each time they reply. 

6. Since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] now agrees per their apology of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that " the total amount due was incorrect due to our system not being updated properly to reflect the bankruptcy filing '''' we still need the following. After explaining in full each of the questions from above, a new " total amount needed '''' in full ( with date ) to bring this matter to a close. There is no way that the loan is still 3 months behind since I have payment in full confirmation from every month ( sans one ), starting from Spring [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Based on # 2 above, there actually may not be any additional amount due, once all fees are deleted that have been randomly assesses without checking into the facts / history of this loan. We need a new total, with date, so this process can be brought to a conclusion.','Servis One, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'CFPB complaint number was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loan number. CFPB complaint number was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1239,'06/08/2018','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I have a loan with ALLY FINANCIAL. I have always made my payments on time. For some reason I realized that there was a late payment on my credit report. As you can see, I have always had a stellar payment record with this company. I tried contacting both [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and ALLY FINANCIAL with no successful resolution. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] are reporting me late. There was definitely an error on their part. I was never 30 days late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/2018.','ALLY FINANCIAL INC.',2.0,2.0,'I have a loan with ALLY FINANCIAL. I have always made my payments on time.');
