INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1248,'06/06/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] company will not have their company deleted from all 3 of my credit reports. These debts have been settled and closed. I was told after I settled they would be taking off my credit reports and they have not done so. I''ve tried calling and disputing to the company it self and the credit bureau ''s. Nothing has be done. These accounts are negative on my reports and its hurting my scores. They were placed on my reports on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] phone company ''s. I have tried everything I can to get these deleted any help would be appreciated.','ERC',2.0,2.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] company will not have their company deleted from all 3 of my credit reports. these debts have been settled and closed. I''');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1249,'06/06/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was routinely checking my credit score on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Much to my surprise my over 800 credit score had dropped by 45 points in a matter of 9 days due to a derogatory account on my credit report. Immediately I contacted TransUnion and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to have the account removed. I have also contacted the company, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], via phone without appropriate resolution. Now I have decided to send certified mail and requested receipt to the company demanding immediate action. Letter is as follows " I am contacting you in writing to address a collection placed on credit report in the last two weeks. I have not received a bill regarding this collection. Previously I had received bills for a visit for my daughter going to the ER and payments have been made. Please provide proof of the account and historical payment history to document account is 1. Delinquent 2. Length of Delinquency 3. Total balance owed. I would like to swiftly resolve this matter and requesting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to remove the debt, derogatory condition, from my credit report immediately as it has negatively impacted my over 800 credit score. '''' From my credit report the account was opened on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and reported to credit agencies on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. What are consumer rights to address collections? What about accounts making more than the minimum payment required?','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a derogatory account on my credit report has negatively impacted my over 800 credit score. a derogatory account on my credit report has dropped by 45 points in a');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1250,'06/06/2018','Debt collection','Private student loan debt','Written notification about debt','After interviewing twice for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] job at a local [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] hospital, I was told to call back if I ever decided to go to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] school. Upon acceptance into [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] school, I was awarded an " assistanceship '''' to cover my $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] tuition and help further my career in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I considered this opportunity to be a blessing as I was told that all I had to do was work for the organization where there was an open position. Unfortunately, there was no verbal or contractual mention of a time frame for a job offer to be made, a less than competitive salary or a bi-weekly undisclosed fee that would be taken as repayment. 

While in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] school, I reached out to my contacts several times to express my intention of working the organization. The correspondence generally resulted in implications that there would probably not be any open positions. Immediately after graduating in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and attaining licensure by XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I reached out to my contact and told them I was ready to work. After not receiving any correspondence for a few weeks and expenses climbing, I sought other employment. It was only after securing other jobs that I was offered a job within the organization with all the undisclosed stipulations and terms. I chose to go with another organization and to start repaying the organization starting XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

Though I was paying all that I could possible afford, the payments quickly became unmanageable. The loans were split into 2 separate payments with different maturity dates ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] )  and monthly payments that totaled over {$3500.00}. The terms were never presented to me in writing and seemed to change depending on who I could talk to at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The loan servicer representatives gave me a single contact [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] headquaters with whom I am supposed to discuss terms and agreements. After numerous requests, I have yet to receive a returned phone call or any written correspondence detailing terms and agreements other than a single letter sent in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] regarding the smaller loan. 

Two separate past due amounts were sent over to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] prior to their due date onXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Upon trying to submit a payment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I saw that the loan amount had already been sent over to a collections agency and no detailed information was available on the website. I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to ask why was it turned over to collections prior to its due date and was told it was due to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] falling on a Sunday ( non-business day ). I went on to question the amount that had been placed with collections and was told by an agent -- with whom I mysteriously always get to speak with -- that he could no longer access that information and I would have to speak with the collections agency or my lender. Again, the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] contact number I am always given has never been in operation as it is a random nurses '' desk who never picks up or returns my calls. I asked to speak with someone who was in contact with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was told they do not communicate with customers at all and only talk to the lender. I asked to speak with the manager and was told he/she was not present and it takes 7-10 business days for a returned call. To date I have not received a call back. 

I immediately called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and spoke with an agent to get more information regarding the amount turned over to collections. As of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and to date, they only have one past due amount for the smaller loan in house amounting to {$8800.00}. Yet when I call [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I am told that both loans were sent over to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at the same time on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they can no longer " see '''' any information regarding either loan. 

My questions are as follows : 1. Can a past due amount be turned over to collections prior to its due date? 
2. If both past due amounts were turned over to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], why are they only showing the smaller loan amount?

3. If there is no trace of the larger loan at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], am I still obligated to pay it blindly? 
4. If I was never given a legitimate contact at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to discuss the terms, how am I supposed to negotiate a more feasible payment option and stay out of collections?','HEARTLAND PAYMENT SYSTEMS INC',8.0,8.0,'a job in a local hospital was offered to me by a school. a job offered to me was offered to pay for the organization. the loans were split into two');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1251,'06/06/2018','Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service','Refund anticipation check','Lost or stolen check','I did my tax returns on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and accidentally typed one digit wrong for my account number since I chose direct deposit. Golden One Credit Union refuses to be of any assistance and did not check the social or other info to verify it was the correct account. I already contacted them and the irs to no avail. A letter of indemnity was sent 90 days ago. It was {$570.00}. The other account withdrew the money immediately and supposedly spent it. The money was deposited into the other account XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','GOLDEN 1 CREDIT UNION, THE',2.0,2.0,'Golden One Credit Union refuses to be of any assistance. the other account withdrew the money immediately and supposedly spent it.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1252,'06/06/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I placed a dispute with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] requesting that a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   negative item be removed from my credit report due to the first day of delinquency had exceeded 7 years. 
