My dispute was not about the most recent transactions dates - it was about the oldest transaction dates with exceeded years. 
[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  removed the older dates from my credit report - having it appear as if the 7 years had not been reached. 

Since I am making this complaint there is another item - A [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] debt that has also passed the 7 year DOFD. 
I want [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to follow the law & update my credit report with the removal of FDOD items. 

I placed the same dispute with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  - they removed both items that were beyond the FDOD reporting window. 
