INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1287,'05/30/2018','Debt collection','Credit card debt','False statements or representation','The creditor I owe ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. ) was called prior to charge off and told to cease and desist all phone calls but it was made very clear that I wanted letters. It was also made very clear that on both accounts the cease and desist must follow the account when it charges off. on approximately XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called the law office of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I talked to the collection department [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] explained that my wife took very il and will not be able to work for some time that''s why the accounts were not being paid. I offered to make a very small monthly payment of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a month on each account he told me " there is no way he will agree to terms like that " He placed me on hold came back to the phone and stated " if I have any request send them in writing " then he hung up on me. My complaint is that I never was given the opportunity to dispute the validity of the debts ( the amount owed ). IN the beginning og XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called again I was transferred to the department that handles my accounts when they realized it was me they immediately hung up on me. CLEARLY MY RIGHTS HAVE BEEN VIOLATED. I DID SEND IN WRITTING A REQUEST FOR VALADATION OF THE DEBT ''S NO ONE HAS SENT IN ANY VALADATION! I wish the CFPB would pull the tape recording for all my calls then you will see that I speak the truth.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'creditor I owe was called prior to charge off and told to cease and desist all phone calls. it was made very clear that I wanted letters. on both accounts the');
