INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1315,'05/23/2018','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','On or about XX/XX/2002 I tried to file a forbearance with then Sallie Mae ( Navient ). I had just had my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] child and had not found adequate work to pay my loans. The loans were near default when I called the provider. They promptly sent the paperwork out to complete and return. After doing so the provider let my loans default and when I heard from them again. They used pressure tactics to get me into a rehabilitation program which I signed on and then began to pay the payments to which I could not afford. I ended up having to sell my house and move which is when they were not able to find me and I let my loans slip into default again.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/2002 was near default when I called the provider. they sent the paperwork out to complete and return. they then let my loans slip into default again ');
