Therefore, I solicited assistance from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and/or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a payday debt consolidation program. However, I withdrew from the program because the cost of their services increased my debt, there was no reduction in my debt and the timeframe in which they expected to settle the debt was not reasonable. I have revoked and hereby revoke [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] power of attorney and they are no longer authorized to discuss this account on my behalf. 

At the time the loan was issued I resided in the State of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  where I still reside for more than 30 years. It have been made aware that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] law requires all payday lenders including internet payday lenders that make loans to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] residents to comply with its provisions, including licensure provisions and rate caps. Pursuant to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Code Com. Law 12-101 et. Seq, payday lending in all forms, including online loans are prohibited ; and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Law requires business and lenders be licensed in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dba [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is not and has never been a licensed business or lender in the State of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which makes the loan issued void and not legal or binding.','Crow Creek Sioux Tribe',2.0,4.0,'dba issued me an online payday loan in the amount of $750.00. the terms of this loan were laid out in fine print. dba');
