INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1327,'05/21/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','This company keeps reporting on my credit an account that I do not owe them on. I have contacted this company numerous times requesting information ( identification used, signatures, ect ) that was obtained in establishing this bogus account. This company has not removed this item from my credit, now have they provided any identification or signatures used to establish this account. The company is involved in illegal practices including re-aging credit. The company told me that they are not bound by the same fair credit reporting as any other agency and do not have to take false items off my credit report. I have disputed this item with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and they are not doing a thorough investigation because if they have, it would be removed from my credit as this item is false and this company is irrational, uses unfair practices against consumers, and thinks that they are above the law.','Omni Financial Group, Inc',2.0,4.0,'company has not removed this item from my credit report. company is involved in illegal practices including re-aging credit.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1328,'05/21/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','Written notification about debt','I have sent numerous debt validation notices and never received a response back from the creditor. As per the Fair Debt Collection Practice Act ( FDCPA ), a creditor is supposed to response and no attempt to collect until they have responded. However, this creditor has not responded and is still attempting to collect, which is in violation of the FDCPA.','Ability Recovery Services, LLC',2.0,2.0,'creditor has not responded and is still attempting to collect. the creditor has not responded.');
