Very Respectfully, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'bank of America has never had a checking account with Bank of America. a checking account that was opened fraudulently is still being reported as having belonged to me. if');
