INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1342,'05/18/2018','Mortgage','Other type of mortgage','Closing on a mortgage','My Closing Disclosure misrepresented the Mortgage Insurance payment, it was in fact a SFH Guaranteed Annual Fee which was never disclosed to me. 
1. The {$140.00} monthly payment is not Mortgage Insurance as listed on the Closing Disclosure, it is an SFH Guaranteed annual fee charged by the USDA to the lender who passes this fee on to me, for the life of the loan. 
2. The stated purpose of this annual fee is to allow the Agency to reduce the upfront guarantee in Sec. 3555.107g. 
3. In addition, the Payment letter issued by Envoy Mortgage LTD [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] lists the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment as PMI. See attached. 
4. Envoy mortgage LTD. Sold my mortgage to : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
5. This annual fee of {$1700.00} ( {$140.00} mo ) does not show in my escrow account with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
6. PMI can be removed once LTV is at 80 %, which I am at. The annual fee of {$140.00} is for the life of the loan which I did not agree to. 
7. I paid the Upfront Guarantee Fee of {$9600.00} thinking this was the only fee for the loan. 
8. The SFH Fee is an additional 8.9 % charge to my principal and interest. I was never informed of this and only discovered what this Fee was by requesting the PMI be removed from my monthly payment at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. See attached','Envoy Mortgage Ltd.',2.0,2.0,'the $140.00 monthly payment is not Mortgage Insurance as listed on the Closing Disclosure. the SFH Guaranteed Annual Fee is an additional 8.9 % charge');
