INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1349,'05/16/2018','Checking or savings account','Savings account','Problem with a lender or other company charging your account','I am the mother of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] children with savings accounts in your institution. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I went into a branch in Florida and opened [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] custodial accounts. I have been struggling since then to save money for their future as every month Bank of America takes {$5.00} monthly fee from each account. At times, putting me negative and I have to add more money to just have a positive balance. To my dismay, I just found out that this is something that was not supposed to happen and the account was opened in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] incorrectly by the financial representative. The person put my date of birth instead of my childrens date of births and due to the representatives error, my children have been financially affected. Bank of America has been stealing my childrens money for years. I have been trying to save for their future, college, etc and it is to the point where I had to open accounts elsewhere because I am fed up with the theft of my hard earned money. 

I called Bank of America and was told that they could not return my kids money for the years that your institution has stolen from me. They could only go back to XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. How is this possible? The money that was stolen was not BOA money but my childrens future funds. Bank of America has been robbing us blind for years and will not do the right thing by reimbursing the service maintenance fee since the accounts have been opened as well as any negative balance and overdraft balance paid. As a Bank of America customer since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I am appalled at how this institution can rob childrens accounts and do nothing to fix it. I even went to an actual branch today and was told they could only do an incident report and wait 14 business days to see IF it will be decided to refund money that WAS NOT YOURS TO BEGIN WITH. I hope that this email reaches someone that can do something to change this.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'bank of America has been stealing my childrens money for years. the money that was stolen was not BOA money but my childrens future funds.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1350,'05/16/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem when making payments','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I paid off a 0 % promotional loan from BANK OF AMERICA, paying early, before the 0 % credit card rate would have ended this coming XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I paid them {$2300.00} by check from my personal bank account. Today ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) I got an email from B.0.A. that my credit card account has a credit of {$170.00}. When I logged onto my account with them to find out why, I discovered that instead of {$2300.00}, they had given themselves {$2500.00} from my bank checking account, with no explanation. I phoned their customer service to ask why they did this, but none of what they said was applicable to my case, so their agent offered to send an eft refund check for the {$170.00} to my bank account, which he did, saying it will take 2 to 5 days to clear. However, he still had no explanation as to how this over-payment from my account occurred.

While my problem may now be resolved, my complaint remains : B.O.A. gave itself an interest-free loan of {$170.00} from my account, without my permission, not notifying me until today ''s email message, which could have caused my checking account to be overdrawn. I am notifying you of this scam in case you have other such reports, if you need to take action against such a practice by this and/or other banks.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'a 0 % promotional loan from BANK of AMERICA was paid off. today, a 0 % credit card rate would have ended. a');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1351,'05/16/2018','Student loan','Private student loan','Improper use of your report','I would like to register a complaint about Nelnet to protest most strongly and urgently the procedure Nelnet used to acquire my personal information and bank informations through, what I believe must be a third party. I am continuously having issue with identity fraud and to find out Nelnet has my personal bank information without my consent on their website database, is very disturbing. I believe this type of practice should be illegal and it a violating my privacy. This is unethical how they proceed to collect costumers personal information and sell it to other companies, without informing the consumer. I would like this issue to be investigated and verify if the way they got my account and personal information was kosher and through standard practice.','NELNET, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a complaint is being filed against Nelnet to protest the procedure. i believe this is unethical how they proceed to collect costumers personal information.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1352,'05/16/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','On my Equifax credit report # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] appeared a fraudulent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] opened on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and a new address, also fraudulent : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], PR.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] opened on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COM');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1353,'05/16/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I was not in the hospital at the time claimed by the collector, please show written proof that was me, a copy of any state or government issued ID.','Designed Receivable Solultions, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'i was not in the hospital at the time claimed by the collector. please show written proof that was me.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1354,'05/16/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','What I am requesting : 1 ) I want Wells Fargo Home Mortgage to set up an appointment to personally meet with one of their supervisors or attorney at the Customer Care and Recovery Group to go over my loan modification, robo signers from notaries, employess of trustee, attorneys, trustees, affidavits ( missing or defective ), false declarations, false recorded documents, wrongful foreclosure, inaccurate accounting history and over charges of my account. I can help them see how they violated the law. If any citizen of this country did what WELLS FARGO BANK, NA and their vendors have done, we would be spending years in prison. 

2 ) I want a payoff statement breakdown. I have requested for months a detail breakdown of who got paid and how much? what is the interest rate paid, late fees, BPOs, mortgage insurance, property taxes, and attorney fees and if there are other fees to specify the exact fee and what was paid. I really want to know how much it was paid to THE SERVICER, TRUSTEE, THE INVESTOR. 

3 ) My house was wrongfully foreclosed and I was wrongfully denied a loan modification and I want my house back. I am only using what WELLS FARGO BANK HOME MORTGAGE AND THEIR TRUSTEES HAVE SENT ME and what the law says The financial crisis and 10 years laters ... there is still no stop to fraud! 

In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I became late on my payments. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Wells Fargo Home Mortgage recorded a notice of Default approximately 25,000 dollars. I offered the servicer [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars to prevent further default and requested to have the rest of the money to be added to the principal or create a re-payment plan. The servicer customer representative told me not to pay the money that help was coming for homeowners like myself who had the pick a payment from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that there was some special arrangement for those type of loans. 

Little did I now that I was being pushed to further default and eventually to foreclosure. From [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], it was the non ending loan modification loan process. The application expired, the servicer did not receive a document, my copies were not clear ect. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Trustee recorded a notice of rescission of notice of default, which cancelled the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] notice of default. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a new foreclosure process started again with robo signers, no interview from the servicer, but yet they recorded a declaration of compliance on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it was signed on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The thirty 30 had not passed as it was now required by the new laws and California homeowner bill of rights. 

The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] pick a payment and the Assurance Agreement for the pick a payment were settled and a new Hamp Tier 1 an Tier 2 program was now introduced, but I was now denied for a loan modification based on NPV, a complex formula designed by the government and based on this formula I was denied for a loan modification. On paper they never said, you have equity on your property this is the reason we will never will give you a loan modification or any type of work out option. What I was told was sell your home you have equity in your house. There is not only document that has been recorded that does not show consistent fraud to the court, the documents pretend to be in compliance when they are not in compliance with the law or deed of trust. 

The over charges on fees and the lack of accuracy in the accounting is amazing hidden fees in the lump sum of interest rates and mortgage statements. The mortgage statements never show the principal loan balance. There is no way to calculate a monthly mortgage payment without knowing what loan balance the servicer is using. Over charges in escrow fees still, mortgage insurance, home inspections, late fees, BPOs as high as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars, miscellaneous fees and others. The undisclosed fees that you do not know what is paying, but you must pay because they are charging it to you. 

My house was wrongfully foreclosed on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The substitution of trustee was recorded on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and 6 days later the Notice of trustee sale was recorded XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] The sale date was schedule for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I had a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I was in the hospital for over 2 weeks. The foreclosure law, deed of trust and my legal due process were ignored by Wells FARGO HOME MORTGAGE. 

The trustee substituted itself as attorney in fact and recorded false documents as accurate documents. There is no recorded notice of default, they did not cause a notice of default and both the trustee and Wells Fargo Home Mortgage Executive office were made aware that there was no recorded notice of default. The wrongful foreclosure continue until the house was sold. The Trustee Deed Upon Sale recitals are not in compliance with the non-judicial laws and deed of trust. this document fraud. The foreclosure was irregular and the tile was not perfected. There was not reason for me to have been in default for these long when I was able to afford my payment and I was willing to offer them partial payments to accept the balance to be added to the loan amount or have a balloon payment at the end of the term of the original loan. 

No matter how much I tried to work with WELLS FARGO HOME MORTGAGE EXECUTIVE OFFICE, I found nobody who had integrity and were able to see the dishonesty, deceptive and fraud that was going on with my loan only because I had equity on my property. I lost my house due to my equity, WELLS FARGO target home owners who had equity and kept them in default until they were able to take their homes. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] target minorities who had equity in their homes and put them in the highest negative amortization principal cap rate of 125 % while most other banks use the max 110 % principal cap rate.

My loan file has been reviewed so many times and the interesting thing is that the executive office of WELLS FARGO HOME MORTGAGE the highest level of customer complaints has never found any wrongdoing and has not corrected any of their wrongdoing. I lost my only asset I had, my family purchase this home in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s with many sacrifices working 6 days per week and I lost my house to a bank that is lawless all because I had equity. I lost my health, my low property taxes and we lost safe place to live. This is a home that just it was passed to me, I wanted one of my children to have it. 

The bank continues claiming no wrongdoing and as long as they are claiming no wrongdoing ; their documents correspondence points to illegal violations, I will continue fighting for my house. I have sent them several documents showing what the law says regarding the laws they have violated. I also sent them a request of items that I would like to have since now I am a defendant to the surplus funds of the wrongful foreclosure of my house. The trustee wants to be released of any liability by the defendants. The trustee did not provide notification of the foreclosure to the defendants and foreclosed illegally and wants to be released from any liability??? There seems not be any justice. 

I am enclosing the documents that wells Fargo claims there is no wrongdoing and there is no violations found by the executive office. I have written on the recorded documents, which are public information for your review of the violations found that can not be denied by WELLS FARGO. As long as WELLS FARGO BANK, NA EXECUTIVES ARE NOT MADE accountable for the many crimes against their customers the millions and billions in fines is just like a license to continue growing their fraudulent enterprise.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'a payoff statement breakdown is requested by a supervisor or attorney. a payoff statement breakdown is requested for months. the servicer, TRUSTEE, the INVE');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1355,'05/16/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I received an invoice from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] saying I owed {$210.00} for an unpaid balance to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They did not say the date of the bill or what it was for, just the company. They immediately offered to drop the amount to {$150.00} if I called or paid it within 30 days of the invoice. I''ve been receiving a ton of calls recently as well that I have not answered because I didn''t know the number. 

After receiving this invoice, I immediately thought it to be a scam as I have not had a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  bill in I don''t know how long. Actually it could be over 10 years and it was for cable. I also know that everything has been paid and I owe nothing. So I did some research online and it looks like they try to collect on things that aren''t even owed. I called to let them know I didn''t have bill. 

When the lady answered she immediately asked if this was, ( said my name ). I said " This is she. '''' And then she said the reason I''m calling is because of a debt you are owed. This conversation is being recorded for collection purposes. I said, first of all, I called you. You didn''t call me and I don''t owe anything to this company. How did you get my name and this " supposed '''' debt amount. She then asked for my social security number. I refused and said I don''t give that out. She said I owed a bill and they are trying to collect and again asked for my social so they could verify the information and tell me what exactly it was for. I again said no. Then I said they should remove my name and number from their calling list and not to call again or I would notify the police. She then hung up on me. 

So far nothing has shown up on my credit report. Hopefully nothing will or I will be furious.','Convergent Resources, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a lady called me to tell me she didn''t have a bill. she asked me if this was, and she asked for my social security number. she said she');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1356,'05/15/2018','Student loan','Private student loan','Dealing with your lender or servicer','XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Sallie mae/Navients normal web page was down as far as making payments, and so the site redirected me to a seprate page, I made the payment, but apparently entered in an incorrect number for my account. I realized the mistakes days later when i saw no change in my balance. In realizing the potential problem I called to ask for verification that the payment went through, they told me they will put in a request and then never got back to me. 

Weeks later they call me with one of their automated systems telling me I was being sent to collections for not paying the amount due. At that moment i explain to them my having called previous to ask about it and then paid for both that month and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

During [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] weekend of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], i recieved atleast 3 calls from sallie mae/navient to tell me my loan payment for the prievious month is late for somewhere between 200-400 dollars. This Automated system did this through the weekend even though when you go through the process during at that time there is no one at debt collection. Meaning every time I was xalled through that weekend it was just to burdun me and leave me feeling harassed! It wasn''t till the week after that i was able to reach someone. And in trying to explain my situation to the operator on the phone, she was somewhat grough with me as i tried to explain the money was inappropiately allocated, and acted as if the issue was my fault. It took a second phone call to get someone to actually listen and see what their system did! 

During this time they also inconvenienced and harassed my Grandmother and Aunt who where my co-signers. 

When I called to ask about taking them off as co-signers they told me I would need to be in good standing of paying my loan for 2 years for that to happen, but at that time without the incident at hand that would have been the case. 

I have also had issue with there conduct as far as changing my loan payment schedule. Last year the loan payment due was well over 50 % of my monthly income, and in asking to lower it, they tell me I had no available opinions, and on one specific call to ask for assistance my call was dropped no less than 4 times, and sent to collections 3 times even though my account was upto date. And finally when I did get to finally talk to someone who actually took the time to talk to me.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'sallie mae/navients redirected me to a seprate page, but entered in an incorrect number for my account. she recieved at');
