INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1359,'05/15/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I ordered [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The original contract rate was for a year, which was paid, and I continued to pay it until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bought [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at the end of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] took over the service, they raised the rates somewhere around 70 % and the service was horrible, so I called them and told them to get their equipment, I DID NOT WANT THEIR SERVICE. They never picked up their equipment, and they continued to charge my account in spite of me calling to cancel. 

