INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1363,'05/14/2018','Checking or savings account','Other banking product or service','Managing an account','I talked with the benefits provider of my company to change the contact address to my current address. They did this and I received a letter from Vanguard stating this. 
Then on Thursday XX/XX/2018 I received a letter stating that my new address was my old adress ( it was showing my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. as my " new '''' address, with my current address of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. as my " old '''' address.

On XX/XX/2018 I called Vanguard and attempted to have them fix the problem. They said several times that I have to talk to my benefits provider in my company. I told them that I did, and that they correctly changed my address to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].

