INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1372,'05/12/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  popped up on my credit report on XX/XX/2018. Its says I have an account that was opened with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on the same day in the amount of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have tried to call the company to see where the account came from but all I have gotten since calling is only music playing. This has dropped all of my scores on my credit report by 42 points and I''m trying to by a home. I have never had an account with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Please help me. I have looked them up online and it says the company is a scam. Please help me. This has set my family back. Thank you.','Riverwalk Financial Corporation',2.0,2.0,'the account was opened with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on the same day. this has dropped all of my scores on my credit report by 42 points. this');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1373,'05/12/2018','Student loan','Private student loan','Dealing with your lender or servicer','Summary : Submitted a {$500.00} payment that was cashed by Navient but not applied to my loan. I tried calling, I tried chat, and I tried sending a letter. Navient has not addressed the problem. 

Details ( this is actual text ( " copy and paste '''' ) that was printed and sent via USPS to Navient, which Navient has not responded to early XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). : -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- Late XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I submitted a payment that was deposited by Navient on or about XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to loan ID [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], belonging to me, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. But the payment was not actually applied to my account ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). They payment was serviced by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

This payment was not applied to that loan, nor any other loan of mine. The check was deposited. The canceled deposited check is included in this package.. 

Please apply the {$500.00} payment to loan ID [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

If you have any questions, please contact me via email ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), phone ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), or a secure message via the Navient web interface. 

