INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1374,'05/11/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','My mother died on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have been using the joint account that she, my brother, and myself have shared while I was her [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for about 10 years. I have been on the account for 20 years. I have her will in probate court, but my attorney is lackadaisical about the matter. Over the course of the past 2 weeks Bank of America has frozen my checking account twice for no apparent reason.They seem to need information about my brother, but ... my brother has no interest in this account. He has not lived here for 27 years. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my account was frozen by BofA with NO notification because they needed some sort of information about my brother .... I was told it was rectified. This morning my account was frozen again. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Apparently, BofA needed some sort of info regarding my brother they never worried about for the past 30 years. I have spent 4.5 hours on the phone today just trying to figure out what BofA wants, called my brother and went to the bank ... The " financial center manager ... ... [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' sort of helped me but, he pretty much brushed me off. I deposited my mothers life insurance policy into this account last year, just to cover basic utilities. Gas, water, electric, and phone ... ..While I finish college and clean out the house. No one has needed any information about my brother or myself until this year. 30 years. The insurance check was to me. I find it morally reprehensible that a bank I have been dealing with for the past 10 years freezes my account due to information about my brother they never needed before. He hasn''t changed and he just spoke with them last week. Seems to me BofA just wants to steal money. 

Thank you very much, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'bank of America has frozen my checking account twice for no apparent reason. my brother has no interest in this account. he has not lived here for 27 years.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1375,'05/11/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I recently disputed an account on my credit file. I have now discovered new information about this credit account. The account is : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Credit Limit : {$500.00} This account has been " re-aged '''' and is now too old to remain on my credit file, per the Fair Credit Report Act. The last activity on this account is not being reported correctly. No payments or charges were made on this account in over 7 years. It has been longer than 7 years since the last account activity.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'account is re-aged and too old to remain on my credit file. last activity on this account is not being reported correctly.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1376,'05/11/2018','Debt collection','Payday loan debt','Threatened to contact someone or share information improperly','I have filed a complaint once. The companies response specifically stated they dont intend to disrupt the workplace and they noted the account and will stop calling my employer. They continue to do so MULTIPLE times a day.','GENTRY FINANCE CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'the companies response stated they dont intend to disrupt the workplace. they noted the account and will stop calling my employer.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1377,'05/11/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Incorrect information on your report','Chase Bank as of XX/XX/2018 is showing on my credit report as charged off with a high balance of {$690.00}. I understand there is a balance owed on this account but I currently working with collection agency attempting to settle debt. This account has been charged off and would like it removed.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'the account has been charged off with a high balance of $690.00. the account has been charged off and would like it removed.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1378,'05/11/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I paid the settlement offer on this account on XX/XX/2018. They will not close the account or updated the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance to the account.','Westlake Services, LLC',2.0,2.0,'settlement offer on this account will not close the account or update the balance to the account.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1379,'05/11/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','WE HAVE BANK OF AMERICA AND THEY HAVE PUT A CFPB REQUIREMENT ON OUR BILL, WE ARE NOT BEHIND IN PAYMENTS, WE HAVE BEEN MAKEING OUR PAYMENTS FOR 14 YEARS. WE FILED A BANKRUBTCY 10 YEARS AGO BUT B of A WAS NOT PART OF THAT! NOW WE ALL OF A SUDEN HAVE A THREATENING STATEMENT ON OUR BILL THAT MAKES IT SOUND LIKE WE ARE BEING FORCLOSED ON, BUT I HAVE BEEN TOLD BY B of A WE ARE FINE IT WAS REQUIRED BY CFPB FOR THEM TO PUT THIS THREAT ON OUR BILL DUE TO AN OLD BANKRUPTCY! 
I AM STILL SUSPICIOUS ABOUT THIS AND IT ALMOST MADE ME HAVE ANOTHER [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] SO I CALLED AND TALKED WITH B of A AND THEY SAID CFPD WONT LET THEM TAKE THIS OFF OUR MONTHLY STATEMENT, ARE THEY DOING THIS TO OTHERS OUT THERE OR ARE THEY JUST SELECTING PEOPLE THAT HAD TO TRY AND SAVE THEIR HOME BY FILING AGAINST CREDIT CARDS? I MY WIFE WILL HOLD B of A AND CFPD IF TTHIS SCTIONED OF STATEMENT IS NOT REMOVED AND I HAVE ANOTHER [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] OR [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] DUE TO THESE MALICIOUS THREATS! SOUNDS LIKE A CLASS ACTION IS IN ORDER, DO WE HAVE ANY LAWYERS OUT THERE?','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'WE FILED A BANKRUBTCY 10 YEARS AGO BUT B of A WAS NOT PART OF THAT! NOW WE ALL OF A SUDEN HAVE A');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1380,'05/10/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','XX/XX/2018 received letter saying verified account. The account is closed and charged off, but still reporting on my report. The company is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  which sold the account to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and ALL are reporting.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'verified account is closed and charged off. company sold account to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and ALL are reporting.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1381,'05/10/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I opened a checking account at Bank Of America on Saturday, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and deposited a check in the amount of {$15000.00}. BofA let me withdraw {$200.00} when I made the deposit which totaled {$14000.00}. They informed me that there would be a hold placed on the money until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Shortly thereafter, I noticed when I logged into my online banking account, that the hold was now only until Saturday, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

A few days later, I learned from the company who wrote me the check that the check had cleared their bank on Monday, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called the customer service number for BofA and asked them why they would hold my check if they have already been paid for the check? They informed me that due to check fraud, they hold checks for the allowed amount of time. I was frustrated and probably got more angry than necessary. You see, this {$15000.00} is ALL the money I have to my name! I have no other money and I need access to my money asap. I didn''t understand why the hold would continue when BofA has already collected the money to back-up my check. 

I called a few more times, requesting that they release {$100.00} to me so I could eat, and they denied me this. I continued to call and they finally released {$100.00} to me. 

I contacted the bank that the check was drawn on, asking if the check could be returned after the funds have already been paid? They told me no. If the money has already been debited to the account the check was written on, the originating bank could not recall it or deny payment of it. I called BofA again, and they told me that the check is subject to being returned by the paying bank up until the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], which is the day the hold would be released. I complained because this seems unethical. 

I called yet again ( I was very mad and was not satisfied with the responses I was getting from BofA ), and they informed me that my account is now closed, and that the funds would not be released until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at which time they will mail me a cashiers check to my home address! 

This morning ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) I walked into the branch I opened the account at and presented them with the front and back copy of the check, showing that BofA has been paid and also a statement from both the company and from the paying bank that this is a legitimate transaction and the check will not be recalled or returned for any reason. I was told by a customer service rep earlier in the day that if I bring these documents into the branch they will refund my money. 

When I was in the branch I was told to call the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] number for customer service. I called and was tossed back and forth between the account hold dept and the risk dept ;. I was told that because the check was hand-written, it was suspect, and they will not give me my money! If the check was fraudulent the originating bank would not have paid it! Bank of America refused to give me my money and now I have to wait until the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when they mail me a cashier ''s check? By the time I receive their mailed cashier ''s check it will be the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and then I have to deposit it into my other account and they will put a hold on it for a day or two. 

This is not acceptable! I realize that BofA ''s terms of agreement say they can place holds on checks, but when the check has been paid, and my account has been closed ( no reason was given to me as to why they closed my account. They just said it''s within their right to close it ), why in the world they will not release the money that is legally MINE??  Why wouldn''t BofA do the right thing and reimburse me the money that they have had since the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]? Everyone I''ve spoken to on the phone has been unwilling to assist me and they refuse to even give me their last name! 

I have no desire to bank with Bank of America and I am not mad that they closed my account. The ONLY reason they are doing this is because I told them I was filing a complaint with you and because I got angry and probably said some things I shouldn''t have said. This is MY money and I can prove that BofA has received the money from the bank the check is written on. Regardless of the terms of their agreement, they should do the right thing and return MY money that they have been withholding from me for 5 days now. The customer service reps I''ve spoken to are obviously reading from a script and have no interest in helping their customers. 

I am livid. As I said this is the ONLY money I have! I can not pay my bills, eat or put gas in my car until I receive MY money from BofA. There is no reason for them to suspect fraud especially since they have already been paid by the bank for the check I deposited. Bank of America is the worst bank I have ever dealt with. The fact that they refuse to give me my money is not right and should be illegal. I am not a customer of theirs yet they are going to hold my money for another week? How can this be legal? 

In addition, before I was informed that my account was closed, they told me that since I '''' m a new customer I must wait to receive my money. What other company penalizes a new customer? THEY WERE PAID FOR THE CHECK I DEPOSITED AND HAVE NO RIGHT TO REFUSE TO GIVE ME MY MONEY! They should do the right thing, and refund my money. They are using it to their advantage and I can''t use it at all. It''s MY money, not theirs. They need to do the right thing.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'a check was deposited at bank of America on a checking account. the company told me that the check had cleared their bank. the company said it had already collected the money');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1382,'05/10/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','TODAYS DATE : XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] SOC SEC # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] DOB XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ADDRESS [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], FL [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ATTENTION DISPUTE DEPARTMENT FRANKLIN COLLECTION SERV To Whom It May Concern : This letter is being sent to you in response to a notice a couple entries by your company on mycredit reports. Be advised that this is not a refusal to pay, but a notice sent pursuant to the Fair DebtCollection Practices Act, 15 USC 1692g Sec. 809 ( b ) that your claim is disputed and validation isrequested.This is NOT a request for verification or proof of my mailing address, but a request for VALIDATION made pursuant to the above named Title and Section. I respectfully request that your offices provide me with competent evidence that I have any legal obligation to pay you What do I need you to provide as the debt validation. 
What the money you say I owe is for Explain and show me how you calculated what you say I owe Provide me with copies of any papers that show I agreed to pay what you say I owe Provide a verification or copy of any judgment if applicable Identify the original creditor Prove the Statute of Limitations has not expired on this account Show me that you are licensed to collect in my state Provide me with your license numbers and Registered Agent Proof that the collection company owns the debt/or has been assigned the debt. ( You are legallyentitled to collect this particular debt from me. ) This is basic contract law. 
Complete payment history, starting with the original creditor. ( I need to have proof of my payment history with original Creditor, what the amount of the debt was when the creditor assigned the debt to your company, and what fees/interest has been tacked on to this debt andhow you/they determined these fees. ) This requirement was established by the case [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].. 
Copy of the credit card application. ( My contract with theoriginal creditor establishing the debt between us. ) This is also basic contract law. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] SOC SEC # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] DOB XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ADDRESS [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], FL [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','Franklin Collection Service, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a notice sent to you that your claim is disputed and validation isrequested. this is not a request for verification or proof of my mailing address. a letter');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1383,'05/10/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] SOC SEC # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] DOB XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ADDRESS [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] To Whom it May Concern : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I recently pulled a copy of my credit report and noticed the following information are in error : Inquires The FCRA states that the only permissible purpose for pulling someone''s credit report is a ) firm offer of credit b ) insurance c ) employment or d ) a court order. 
