INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1388,'05/09/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','Equifax is not accurately verifying accounts or investigating disputes ... I have asked via letter for information of which they are using to verify my debt through original and 3rd party debt collectors .... I have received no original letters of authorization from the following listed accounts : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .... Moreover, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account is listed multiple times with status or paid closed, derogatory closed, and card lost or stolen. Which indicates that after multiple disputes that the practices of this bureau are not following the rules under the FRCA ... Everything is currently under reinvestigation ... This is harming my reputation as a consumer .... I have placed a fraud alert on my credit report as well as with the FTC ... .I want all signed consent to inquiries be made available to me or asked that all inquiries that do not have authorized proof of documentation of my consent to be removed ....','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'Equifax is not accurately verifying accounts or investigating disputes. I have asked via letter for information of which they are using to verify my debt through original and 3rd party debt collectors');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1389,'05/09/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I had a home lender pull my credit report and transunion has mine and my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] brothers student loans in together. I called to dispute it 8 times and they still didnt get that I was the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] disputing this to get my brother off my report. I received a letter from transunion Monday addressed to my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   brother who doesn''t live anywhere close to this state.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'transunion has my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] brothers student loans together. I called to dispute it 8 times and they still didn''t get that I was the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1390,'05/09/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I transferred a total of {$6000.00} from my joint savings into my personal checking. 
This had been discussed between both account holders. 
The following day the person I shared my joint checking and savings account with filed a fraud claim and closed both accounts. Shortly after Bank of America put a {$880000.00} freeze on my personal account. When I spoke to their customer service department I was told an investigation would be held and could take up to 10 business days. 

The 10 business days are now over and I have been told that a hold will be placed on my account for up to 45 days which would make my account active on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

My credit score has gone down by 12 points since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I  have creditors calling my phone non stop. 

I have taken my birth certificate, social, and id into a branch to prove my identity. I have faxed over documents stating where I work and verification that I am authorized on this account. 

Page 7 in their disclosure proves my rights and is being broken with no solid answer as to why.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'a person I shared my savings account with filed a fraud claim. the following day the person filed a fraud claim and closed both accounts. the bank of America put a');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1391,'05/09/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Closing your account','Synchrony closed my credit account with out any notification. I just received a statement with a due date XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I pay every month for unemployment protection. I recently switched jobs and fell behind 60 days now. They closed out my account and sent it to a collection. I would like to know why I was not sent anything showing that there was going to be a significant change to my account such as closing it, according to the card act of XX/XX/2009 they are suppose to send a 45 day notice of such a change? Why am I not able to use the protection I''ve been paying monthly for over a year now that I was unemployed. They are deceiving their customers and closing out accounts without helping customers!','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'synchrony closed my credit account with out any notification. I recently switched jobs and fell behind 60 days. they are deceiving their customers and closing out accounts without helping');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1392,'05/08/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','My credit score has tanked since banking with this Bank. I started the administrator process to valid the alleged debt that I supposedly owe to this Bank. Theirs response had been flooded by generic letters without providing the original contract bearing my wet ink signature ( promissory note ). According to the Fair Debt Collection Practice Act ( FDCPA ), I have the right to validate any debt I owe. This Bank had since left tons of calls, voicemails and letters trying to correspond with me and ruined my credit score with late payments and delinquent accounts. This Bank have committed fraud for reporting unvalidated information to the 3 major credit bureaus. Im not hesitant to bring a suit against this Bank for violating Fair Debt Collection Practice Act ( FDCPA ), Tax fraud and defamation of Character! These banks must remember that WITHOUT the consumers, theres no business! Ask yourself : Whats a Debt? Legal tender was no longer required for payment of debt on XX/XX/1977! 
According Social Security Number, Im classified as a minor. A minor can not be a party to a contract ( HJR 192 )!

Banks can not loan money. They are in business to buying securities. The consumers signature CREATES the security! And since this Bank have submitted my account ( s ) to collections, they have committed a felony for unlawful use of my Social Security Number. This is grounds for identity theft and distortion. BY LAW, all 3 major credit bureaus must remove these accounts from my credit report. *BOOM* ( Ending Note ) The consumers are the original creditors but was misled by these greedy banks into thinking were the debtor!','NAVY FEDERAL CREDIT UNION',2.0,4.0,'credit score has tanked since banking with this Bank. this bank has committed fraud for reporting unvalidated information to 3 major credit bureaus.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1393,'05/08/2018','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Installment loan','Charged fees or interest you didn''t expect','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I made calls to multiple banks requesting quotes to lower the interest rate on our US Bank boat loan # ... ... ... ... [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] paying {$1200.00} monthly at a rate of 8.49 % since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) from US Bank offered us the best quote of 5.21 % if we made a {$40000.00} payment that we were offering to make, along with opening a savings account with their bank. We agreed over the phone and passed by other bank offers that were very close to US Banks offer. He immediately requested the wired payment of {$40000.00} from our personal bank, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], WI and applied it directly to our current loan. We also opened the savings account at this time. He told us that the monthly payment would now be {$710.00}. The confirmation for this transaction was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], we received a letter dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. stating that US Bank was now unable to offer the credit terms that we had agreed upon. They now wanted to charge us an interest rate of $ 5.95 %. 

Clearly we were upset that they did not hold up their end of our bargain so we immediately called our local US Bank branch and spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. He told us at this point that it''s never necessarily that rate when they give quotes over the phone. Some of the reasons they decided to charge us more was because it was a used boat and that when they quoted us, we didn''t have an account with them. At this point, he agreed to take off .25 % because we had opened the savings account as requested. As far as the used boat, we stated that they knew it was a used boat because they had the initial loan from when we bought it as a used boat. Also, none of this was discussed in our initial phone conversation. He said that he would see what he could do and then on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], we received another letter stating that now they wanted a marine survey. I personally delivered them our marine survey from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. A few days later he called me and said that this marine survey was too old and now I needed to invest $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] {$800.00} for an updated marine survey and that the survey would have to be done once the boat was in the water. At this point, it''s still winter in Wisconsin and not possible. We said again, " this was not the condition on what we agreed to '''', but if the bank wanted to get a survey, they were welcome to get one and cover that cost. They refused. 

Even more frustrated, we now looked for someone in the support area of US Bank that could help us and eventually spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). We asked her to listen to the recording of the initial conversation and agreement that was made. She called back after she listened to the recorded conversation and confirmed that he never spoke of contingencies with the agreed upon new note. She said that she would look more into this and try to help. After a few separate conversations over a span of a month, she then said there really was nothing she could do. 
So here we are, three months later with our {$40000.00} gone and still paying 8.49 %.

Please, this can''t be acceptable. We would appreciate you looking into this. We would like to have them honor the agreement that was made and recorded. This was their mistake, which they agreed it was, and they should honor it - retroactive to the date they took our {$40000.00}. We''ve attached support documents to this claim. 

Thank you for any guidance and resolution to this matter. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,2.0,'a letter from a bank asking for quotes from us bank offered us a $1200.00 quote. he asked us to make a $4000');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1394,'05/08/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I applied for a used automobile loan with my bank, the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], New York. During this process, the bank noted my credit rating had dropped from the 800s to the 700s due to one past due account. I immediately contacted all 3 credit  bureaus. On the first site, I quickly located the problem, which was a credit card listed as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( translated as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). Since I did not open this account, I filed disputes with the 3 bureaus. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s on-line process was completed in minutes, as well as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. However, Equifax proved to be impossible. After two attempts at filing an on-line dispute, I was unable to tell if my request had been processed. The other bureaus gave me a file or confirmation #. This one did not. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], attempts to reach Equifax by phone ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) were met with continuous instructions to use the website, with no option to reach a person. After a while, I finally located a different number ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), and reached a person. This representative was difficult ( and at times impossible ) to understand, asked most questions twice after they had been answered and was generally robotic and unhelpful. I had to twice ask her to spell words that she could not pronounce. After 10 minutes of answering security questions over and over again, she advised me my answers were wrong ( they weren''t ) and I will need to fax my license, a copy of my SS card and a letter to them. 

My credit rating has remained above 800 for decades. This fraudulent credit card was opened in my name and I want it corrected. Two of the three companies were able to do their jobs. I am filing this complaint against Equifax because I am very concerned about the level of professionalism and their inability to perform a basic function of their mission. My credit rating still remains very good, and this did not prevent me from getting a loan, but it did raise the interest rate I was offered for the loan. This obviously needs to be rectified and Equifax seems to be unable to help me. Thank you for your anticipated help.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a credit card listed as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was found on the first site. the bank noted my credit rating had dropped from the 800s to the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1395,'05/08/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has reported open accounts in collections on my credit report that should have not been. All bills from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] where on hold by my attorney pending a lawsuit and all have been paid in full.','CHS, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has reported open accounts in collections. all bills from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] where on hold by my attorney');
