dated the debt. they claimed again that they validated the debt by receipt of nothing more than a billing statement from the company who');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1397,'05/08/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Unable to get your credit report or credit score','I called Equifax to add my phone number to my personal credit file, faxed a request also and I was told it had been taken care of and as of today it is still not listed. I believe this is not a hard task','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'faxed a request to Equifax and it was taken care of. it is still not listed.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1398,'05/08/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Incorrect information on your report','We filed Ch [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bankruptcy in 2013 and included our Wells Fargo credit card in the bankruptcy. They are reporting it in the notes as a bankruptcy but are also illegally reporting a {$12000.00} balance which should be [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after the discharge of the bankruptcy. SEE ATTACHED DOCUMENT','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'we filed a bankruptcy in 2013 and included our credit card in the bankruptcy. they are also illegally reporting a $12000.00 balance which should be [COMP');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1399,'05/07/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','During XX/XX/XXXXwas out of school for 7-8 months. Was unable to pay ~ {$600.00} amount that had left deferment in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Went back to school a month after I was notified of amount needing payment ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and loans all re-entered deferred status. 

