INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1408,'05/05/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I have tirelessly tried to resolve this matter with this collection company but to no avail. I found this company had reported an account to my credit report which I believed was an invalid debt not belonging to me. I sent them by certified return receipt mail a debt validation letter dated XX/XX/2018, which they conveniently ignored. Concurrently when I disputed the item with the credit repositories, I was told that the debt collection company responded back to them affirming that this account was valid. I am appalled that this company continues to violates my rights and refuses to delete the account despite not being able to provide the original debt instrument.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'debt collection company reported an account to my credit report. they quickly ignored the item.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1409,'05/05/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Equifax and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] are reporting a Bankruptcy as a public record falsely. File date XX/XX/2017. I have contacted the United States Bankruptcy Court and they have sent me a letter verifying that they do not verify with any third parties such as credit bureaus. These credit bureaus are reporting this on my credit reports and I would like it removed because it is not verifiable.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a bankruptcy is reported as a public record falsely. the bankruptcy is a public record.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1410,'05/05/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Opening an account','Good Evening, I was unabled to open a Bank Account with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. A few weeks later received a letter saying I have things in revolving credit and charges in collection. I received my credit report and it says I owe Bank of America [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from XX/XX/18. I do not recall this overdraft of this account.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'a few weeks later, I received a credit report saying I owe Bank of America. I do not recall this overdraft of this account.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1411,'05/04/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Fees or interest','I had account with Capital One for over 15 years, and I always paid my balance in full at the end of the month This year my family member was in the hospital and I missed the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment. Next month, my daughter promised to pay but forgot to do so, so there was a late fee and interest on the statement. I paid it all in full, and even pay extra, so the balance went to a negative number, however, at the end of the month I received another statement with more interest charge! When I called, the representative told me that it takes " few months '''' to clear the interest even when the balance went back to 0. Is this even legal? He refused to cooperate and I had to go through the trouble of reassigning the automatic payments to a different card, and closed the account through the automatic system. However, I still believe that the extra interest shall be refunded to me.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a representative told me that it takes '''' few months'' to clear the interest even when the balance went back to 0. Is this even legal?');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1412,'05/04/2018','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Written notification about debt','Security Finance has violated 15 USC 1692 by continuing collection activity after a cease and desist and 15 USC 1681 by failing to report complete and accurate information to credit reporting bureaus.','SECURITY FINANCE CORP',2.0,2.0,'security finance has violated 15 USC 1692 by continuing collection activity. 15 USC 1681 by failing to report complete and accurate information to credit reporting bureaus.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1413,'05/04/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I have received several written " Demand for Payment '''' from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] beginning XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Re :  Unpaid Toll Invoices from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The amounts are always different from $ 250- {$300.00}. I live in another state far from Texas and called to report that this was mailed to the wrong person. I was told the toll balance was a total of {$1100.00}. I was advised to contact the DOT to make sure this vehicle was not registered in my name. The form has a license plate number, the DOT would only tell me the make of the car. I placed a fraud alert with the credit agencies, although I did not notice any suspicious activity. After I received another notice for payment of {$300.00}, I sent a certified letter on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], to notify them, they are trying to collect from the wrong person, and requesting proof of why they believe I am the person responsible for this debt. I received another notice on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], called to find out if my letter was received and it was, I was told this was under investigation. Today XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I have received yet another notice for {$270.00}, without any explanation. I have a very common name, never drove in Texas, and want these people to stop sending me collection notices.','Duncan Solutions, lnc.',2.0,4.0,'a letter from a DOT official has been sent to the wrong person. the DOT would only tell me the make of the car. the DOT would only tell me');
