INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1415,'05/04/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','I sent in a request to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] asking them to delete a medical collection debt because I never had any knowledge of this account and any medical services that are rendered to me I sign a HIPAA of 1996 notice which does not allow any release of any medical information or medical account information. This form states that my medical information or medical account information should only be discussed with the person that I have given access. I have never given [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] access to my medical information or medical account information. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is in direct violation of this federal law and I am requesting the debt to be deleted immediately from my credit file. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] did not get any permission from me to access any medical information or medical account information.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a medical collection debt is in violation of this federal law. I signed a notice which does not allow any release of medical information or medical account information.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1416,'05/04/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I contacted Transunion credit, and ask why the reported a 91 point drop in my credit score. In talking with Transunion they would not provide me with a reason why my score was changed. Transunion did state that I had no negative reports on my credit that nothing had changed. My score was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and went to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  in less than a month. I can not get an answer from none of the credit bureau about my drop in scores.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'91 points drop in my credit score was reported by Transunion credit. the credit bureau did not provide me with a reason why my score was changed.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1417,'05/04/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Closing your account','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sent me an email on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s credit card was closed due to inactivity as of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called immediately on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], to discuss re-opening my account. I fully understand creditors can close accounts due to inactivity. I plead my case, stated positive credit history/payment history with the one purchase I made. 
I advised that I was working very hard to bring my credit score up  due to wanting to buy a home over the next few years. I also pointed out how this will affect my DTI, and my positive credit history. 
This is for a specialty card, for beds. How am I supposed to make a purchase when it''s for a type of merchandise that isn''t bought monthly or yearly? It makes no logical sense from a consumer standpoint to tell them that they need to make a purchase to keep it active when it''s for an item that''s meant to last long periods of time. 
The reps at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] were very nonchalant, dismissive and rude to say the least. I have learned my lesson, I''ll stick to the major credit cards and use them responsibly going forward.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sent me an email on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMIS');
