One is a requirement for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] form and SSN authorization. The first letter said that I have to offer these two files before XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], or my account will be closed. So I fax these two forms XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

The second mail told me my account has been closed since I did not offer these two forms. 

How ridiculous it is! The first mail is mailed by XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and the second mail is mailed by XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I received them at the same time. Although I have made efforts to follow instructions to prevent my account being closed, but Chase closed my account ( mail 2 ) before require forms ( mail 1 ) Chase made at least 2 mistakes. First, the banker did not let me fill [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] form and did not take SSN authorization form, which later I found it at the files about this opened checking account, I have signed it but the banker did not bring, he just gave me will many other files. 

Second, Chase closed my account by mistake before the last date XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].  Although I tried to offer the missing forms, faxed them the next day, Chase refuse to reopen my checking account. 

I made many official complain by making phone calls to Chase, the stuffs did nothing but say sorry. They told me if I want I can drive back to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and open a new checking account. I did nothing wrong, it is totally Chase ''s mistake, why it is me to do all the thing? 

I spent a lot for the whole thing, including driving there to open account, making many calls to try to solve the problem, faxing the forms, but received nothing but sorry. My research sponsor was linked to the new Chase checking account, and it is late when I found this account was closed, so I have to change to another bank to receive it. This sponsor was about 1month later. 

This new open Chase checking account was with {$300.00} bonus for qualified direct deposit, so I can not receive it after the account closed. Is not willing pay {$300.00} the reason for closing my checking account? 
I tried to upload some images of relative files but failed.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'Chase closed my account by mistake before the last date XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Chase closed my account by mistake before the last date ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1428,'05/02/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I sent certified mail to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Equifax credit bureau ''s to have credit inquiries removed from my credit report. These inquiries were made without my persmission and should have to be investigated. I never received word back from the credit bureau ''s after 30 days, which means they should be removed from my credit report. I also read that a tax lien should be removed from my credit report which was filed in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. According to several web sites, starting on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] consumer credit reports were to have all tax liens removed from their reports. I am asking for 6 credit inquiries to be removed of the 8 showing on my credit report. The only two inquiries which were authorized were, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. These are correct and should be on my credit report. The others I did not authorize and should not have ever been allowed access to my credit report. Could you help me with this problem?','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a tax lien should be removed from my credit report. the only two inquiries authorized were, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANON');
