Defamation, willful injuryFCRA Section 623 [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], v. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] US Court of Appeals for the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Case 115 F.3d 220 XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Filed ( D.C. No. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) .Extent of damages incurred by the wronged party, as deemed by the courts.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a letter to experian to pursue my rights to request information on the method used by the wronged party. it is my right to receive proof of the verification and if');
