INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1474,'04/24/2018','Debt collection','Mortgage debt','False statements or representation','I made three biweekly mortgage payments ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) to Selene Finance in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The last loan payment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was deducted from my bank account, but it was not deducted from the principal balance like it should have been. They will not resolve or even reply to the matter after 23 days now. 

I have attached screenshots of the current Selene Finance payment history and the payments made from my bank statement. The Principal Balance displays a {$220000.00} amount on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The payment reversal on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is the problem because the funds were in fact deducted from my bank account and never returned. 

That payment reduces the principal because its the third payment of the month and Selene should never have had a " Payment Reversal ''''. Therefore, the current amount in Suspense should be half the mortgage payment and the Principal Balance {$220000.00} as ofXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].

On a side note to eliminate any confusion. Due to the lack of information Selene Finance provided me, I made a manual payment onXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Unknowingly, two payments were then deducted from my bank account. One deduction was turned back for insufficient funds, but the other payment was accepted.','Selene Finance LP',2.0,2.0,'the last loan payment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was deducted from my bank account. the principal balance displays a ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1475,'04/24/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I notified my local law enforcement about an identity theft where a long time ( former ) friend had used my information to fraudulently obtain a large student loan in my name, when she was supposed to be helping me through a medical crisis. During that time, a separate fraudulent account opened with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was also discovered. The original account that resulted in the initial police report has since then resolved and cleared from my credit. However, during the past two years, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has made it extremely difficult to have the fraud removed from my credit reports and there are still fraud based negative reports on two credit reports that they are still refusing to remove. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has been provided copies of the original police report through US mail, which they claim they have not received, and email correspondence. I have made several phone calls to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] fraud, the most recent dated today, and additionally XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( three phone calls ) to resolve the issue. This doesn''t include the numerous previous phone calls. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] claims that they have not deemed the account as fraudulent because, based on their policy, their company is not listed on the original police report. However, my credit reports state otherwise, with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] collection accounts having been removed on all three credit reporting agencies, and the original [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account removed with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. However, during my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] PST phone call with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] fraud this [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], their representative advised me that the remaining original accounts will not be removed from Equifax and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] until the police report is amended or a new one is made to reflect their name specifically on the report. I am in contact with my local law enforcement and waiting for a reply from a deputy, although their dispatch is absolutely in agreement that the level of care that has been taken in the matter is not only greatly lacking but, basically, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have also been in contact with the credit agencies and was advised by Equifax representatives, on Thursday, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], that I have to contact law enforcement to find out the outcome of the fraud investigation to have the credit company remove it from my report. I asked how that is possible when the report was forwarded to another state and becomes confidential information and was told, basically, that was their policy and my problem to figure out.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] fraud has been resolved and cleared. the original account that resulted in the initial police report has');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1476,'04/24/2018','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Took or threatened to take negative or legal action','Creditor ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ) hired lawyer ( Green & Cooper, Georgia ) to garnish bank acct. for payment of credit card debt. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] They had court order due to winning suit. They took everything, leaving me {$0.00} to live on. Frozen acct. I have made repeated calls explaining I am unemployed since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], am a senior citizen, needed to purchase My medications desperately., and all monies in bank were from IRRA! Please help me! I have been without meds, gas, or one cent for one week! All attempts to call attorneys and My bank have been wasted time. No one cares..Please help me! I have had 2 borrow 5 days worth of medication, and can not pay my pharmacy back,! Please, please help me. I am confused, and feel like I''m taking one step forward and 3 steps back! I can not neglect My health any longer.Greene & Cooper does not return calls. 1 of the Agents I spoke with Told me, " it''s a done deal '''', nothing can be done about it ''''! [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) When asked for administrative contact name and telephone, she hesitantly gave it, but added, " She is NOT going 2 do anything about this ''''! Called many times, left message that matter was EXTREMELY important on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and/or XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].No response!! The " hold '''' button at this law firm is unbelievable!

I have spent many hours of what I feel has been wasted time. I need someone who cares about humanity! Do your job, but show empathy. I try to remain calm, but My heart races and I cry uncontrollably! I have no one to help. I am not asking for pity, just help in attaining My IRRA money.i WILL find a job, and pay debts owed, but I NEED medications desperately. Please help!','Greene & Cooper Collections LLC',2.0,2.0,'a creditor hired a lawyer to garnish bank acct. for payment of credit card debt. he says he has been without meds, gas, or one');
