INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1484,'04/23/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','On XX/XX/2018, I submitted a credit application to US Bank to obtain a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit card. A credit inquiry was done and I was approved for the credit. On XX/XX/2018, I requested a credit line increase for the card and was advise by their rep. that they would consider the request and contact me soon with a decision. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I reviewed my credit report and found that another credit inquiry had been executed by US Bank. This action was taken without my knowledge or consent. I would not have agreed to another hard inquiry on my credit report given that stays there for 2 years. 

On XX/XX/2018, I called the bank to complain and ask that the inquiry be removed. I was told by the rep. that the bank has the freedom to initiate a credit inquiry without a consumers consent if it so chooses. I stated that I believe this action violated my consumer rights and should not be allowed. 

To that end, I am filing this complaint in an effort to have this credit inquiry removed from all my credit reports. Your attention to this matter is appreciated.','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,2.0,'on XX/XX/2018, I submitted a credit application to US Bank. a credit inquiry was done and I was approved for the card. on XX');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1485,'04/23/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','Despite 3 written request, the unverified items listed below still remain on my credit report In the results of their first investigation and subsequent reinvestigation, they stated in writing that these items were " verified '''' and " reported correctly '''' They are required under the FCRA to have a copy of the original creditors documentation on file to verify this information is mine and correct. They refuse to give me any documentation to show my signature on any contract as it is required under Section 609 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( A ) & 611 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( A ). Under Section 611 ( 5 ) ( A ) of the FCRA, they are required to to promptly DELETE all information which can not be verified. The law is very clear as to the Civil liability and remedy available to me ( Section 616 & 617 ) if you fail to comply with Federal Law. 

I have contacted the bureau on multiple occasions with receipt certifications that they have received my letter and concern. Now, I demand the following accounts be deleted immediately. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( I RECENTLY RECEIVED A LETTER ASKING FOR ME TO VERIFY MY PREVIOUS ADDRESS AND SOCIAL SECURITY NUMBER FROM THIS COMPANY )','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the unified items listed below remain on my credit report. they are required under the FCRA to have a copy of the original creditors documentation on file to verify this information is mine and');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1486,'04/22/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Closing your account','I tried to use my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Master Card issued by Synchrony Bank at the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] gas station in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], NY on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and after waiting for 15 minutes in line and getting to the pump my card kept coming up as inactive. I called the customer service line to find out that the company had close the card on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I asked why it was closed and was told by the Supervisor that my card was inactive for 2 years and that it was in the terms when I signed up for the card and there was nothing they could to do to reopen my account because it was closed. I insisted that the it has not been 2 years and it was a mistake on their behalf. She couldn''t look up the exact date when asked when the card was last used, just insisted it was in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it was 2 years. The last payment I had made on the card, according to my bank statement, was on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and I am never late on my payments. They refused to do anything about it. The only thing that could be done is file a dispute with the credit agency, and now I have to wait at least 30 days to hear anything. It is wrong what they do. They don''t even send a notice that the card is going to be closed or is in jeopardy of being closed. Now my credit will be effected by this closure, and I have an Exceptional credit score in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This company is not right in what they do to their clients.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'the company closed the card on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it was closed. the company refused to do anything about it,');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1487,'04/22/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Ga [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/2018 [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], IL [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : Account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] To Whom It May Concern : This letter is being sent to you in response to notices sent to me from your company and more importantly, due to your erroneous reporting to the Credit Bureau { s }, the highly negative impact on my personal credit report. Please be advised that this is not a refusal to pay, but a notice sent pursuant to the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act, 15 USC 1692g Sec. 809 { b } that your claim is disputed and validation is requested. 

This is NOT a request for verification or proof of my mailing address, but a request for VALIDATION made pursuant to the above-named Title and Section. I respectfully request that your offices provide me with competent evidence that I have any legal obligation to pay you. 

Please provide me with the following : What the money you say I owe is for : Explain and show me how you calculated what you say I owe : Provide me with copies of any papers that show I agreed to pay what you say I owe : Provide a verification or copy of any judgment if applicable : Identify the original creditor : Prove the Statute of Limitations has not expired on this account : Show me the you are licensed to collect in my state : Provide me with your license numbers and Registered Agent or Agent of Service : At this time, I will also inform you that if your offices have reported invalidated information to any of the 3 major Credit Bureaus { [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] } this action might constitute fraud under both Federal and State Laws. Due to this fact, if any negative mark is found on any of my credit reports by your company or the company that you represent, I will not hesitate to bring legal action against you for the following : Violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act Violation of the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act Defamation of Character If your offices can provide proper documentation as requested in the following Declaration, I will require at least 30 days to investigate this information and during such time all collection activity must cease and desist. 

Also, during this validation period, if any action is taken which could be considered detrimental to any of my credit reports, I will consult with my legal counsel for suit. This includes listing any information with a credit reporting repository that could be inaccurate or invalidated or verifying an account as accurate, when in fact there is no provided proof that it is accurate. 

If your company fails to respond to this validation request within 30 days from the date of your receipt, all references to this account must be deleted and completely removed from my credit report and a copy of such deletion { to any/all of the 3 major credit reporting bureaus : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] } request shall be sent to me immediately. 

I would also like to request, in writing, that no telephone contact be made by your company to my home or my place of employment. If your offices attempt telephone communication with me, including but not limited to computer generated calls and calls or correspondence sent to or with any third parties, it will be considered harassment and I will have no choice but to file suit. All future communications with me MUST be done in writing and sent to the address noted in this letter by USPS. 

It would be advisable that you assure your records are in order before I am forced to take legal action against your company and your client. This is an attempt to correct your records, any information obtained shall be used for that purpose. 


Best Regards, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','AFNI INC.',2.0,4.0,'this letter is being sent to you in response to notices sent to me from your company. this is not a refusal to pay, but a notice sent to you from your company');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1488,'04/22/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I DID AN ONLINE TRANSFER FROM MY SAVING ACCOUNT TO MY CHECKING ACCOUNT IN THE AMOUNT OF {$300.00}.

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I SPENT THE {$300.00} ON A CAR REPAIR. i CHECKED MY ACCOUNT AFTER THE REPAIRS AND FOUND THAT MY {$300.00} TRANSFER HAD NOT OCCURRED. I CHECKED THE ONLINE BANKING PAGE AND FOUND THAT THE TRANSACTION HAD OCCURRED BUT HAD NOT BEEN CREDITED TO MY CHECKING ACCOUNT. I SPOKE TO SOMEONE AT ARVEST ABOUT IT AND WAS TOLD THAT THEY WOULD EMAIL THE SERVICE DESK. IN THE PROCESS OF THIS I HAD TO MAKE A SECOND {$300.00} TRANSFER TO COVER THE {$300.00} DEBIT CARD I HAD USED EARLIER. I WANT TO KNOW WHERE MY TRANSFER OF {$300.00} WAS CREDITED.','ARVEST BANK GROUP, INC.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I CHECKED MY ACCOUNT AFTER THE REPAIRS AND FOUND');
