INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1490,'04/21/2018','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','Received a summons to appear in court for a credit card that was never opened by me which can be verified by my credit report. Never received notices just went straight to a summons. The summons only included the last 4 numbers of the account and no transactions except a {$25.00} payment. I am going to send a certified letter to collections company regarding validation of debt and a letter to the credit card company.','FIRST NATIONAL BANK OF OMAHA',2.0,2.0,'summons to appear in court for a credit card that was never opened by me. the summons only included the last 4 numbers of the account.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1491,'04/21/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','All three credit bureaus are reporting few information on my credit report that are either over 7 years old or incorrect. 

I have written to all three credit bureaus about this and demanded that they provided me with the evidence and supporting documents that they, during their investigation must have asked the credit reporting company. But they ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], exuifax, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) have informed me that they have completed their investigation without sending me any documents from the original creditor. But the issues were not corrected. They failed to send me the documents, I have asked to show me that the accounts are reported correctly as they claim. 
For example, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is reporting two accounts ( {$830.00} and {$2400.00} something ). These accounts are reported incorrectly. I have asked them to show me the documents with proof. They have not. 
Similarly, I have an old account ( more than 7 years old ) for the amount of {$84.00}, originally from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bank. This account is still showing on my report ( all three bureau ). They have not removed it despite my demanding to remove it. 
