The senior family members simple share my last name.

How is it acceptable to harass seniors because they share my last name?

Calling 4 to 6 times a day, for no reason.','Alliance Data Card Services',2.0,2.0,'compte_ANONYMISÉ has completed an illegal search of my family members. the family members are NOT listed on my accounts, anywhere. the family members phone');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1521,'04/16/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','In the month of XX/XX/2018 I paid off two credit card balances, didn''t close the accounts just paid the balances and the next day my credit score dropped 32pts. I emailed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] right away when I first saw my credit score had dropped.[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I went back and forth between 8 emails and no one could tell me why my score drastically dropped. I proceeded to call all credit bureaus TransUnion, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and I visited [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] still no one can tell me why my credit drastically dropped. Every factor each credit bureau ask me to consider or look at dose not apply to me. One factor was incorrect they said I have only had credit for 2yrs in fact I have had credit for 5 yrs. I have never had a derogatory complaint on my credit report, I have never missed a payment or paid a late payment on my credit report.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'in the month of XX/XX/2018 I paid off two credit card balances. the next day my credit score dropped 32pts. no one can tell me');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1522,'04/16/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Closing your account','My complaint is with TD Credit Card. My husband [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] closed his credit cart out on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] over the phone. We asked for the balance we paid {$1300.00} by check over the phone. Well it hasn''t stopped since they keep telling us there is a payment of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars due. This has been going on for over 2 years. We have not had the credit card since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] however even after we closed the account new charges have been appearing. It is harassment at this point ... Every time they say the credit card is closed out a new bill with a different amount shows up. If we closed out the account in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and paid out the full amount in XX/XX/XXXXit should be done. They are ruining my husbands credit. I have a reference # of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which we paid on that day for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] even though we had closed the account in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The call was taken by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. She said the credit card was closed but it was not!!!!! 
XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I got a letter saying it was closed. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] should not have been charged! 
XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they say I owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we pay it. They say it is now closed. 
XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they say it is closed and we get a conformation letter XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they say I owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they say now I owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars A complaint was filed to you and you handled it and it was done. Now more than a year later ... 
XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I get another one saying I owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars!!!!!!! I want the harassment to stop!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!','TD BANK US HOLDING COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'TD credit card has been closed out for 2 years. a new bill with a different amount shows up. a new bill shows up if the credit card is closed');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1523,'04/16/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I have tried three times to get the payment lates on my account removed however instead of investing each time all they do is change info on late and not remove. I have submitted two different investigations and neither are correct there for all the agency is doing is guessing and submitting to credit bureaus','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'I have tried to get payment lates removed. but instead of investing each time all they do is change info on late and not remove.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1524,'04/16/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has put a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on my credit report that is not mines, back in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I had lost my social security card and identification card and a few other things out of my wallet, Well back in XX/XX/XXXXI found out that someone had put a car in my name, not only did they put a car in my name put got into an accident along the highway back in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I found out when I got arrested for driving while suspended, on my BMV it says i drove a car without insurance which is associated with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I had reached out to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] several times, I have disputed the information, I have called and spoke to many representatives, the last rep she claimed to be a manager her name was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], she told me she would look into it and keep in touch with me, I sent over all the proper documentation she asked for, I explained to her the situation, meanwhile their doing this investigation I am being punished by the Indiana Department of Transportation, in the amount of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( starting off ) current balance [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , I dont know what else to do at this point. Its gotten my license suspended so i cant even get MY drivers license, then they want a police report, but i was not at the scene nor did i know until almost 2 years later so there was no police report filed just security freezes on all 3rd party consumers and credit bureaus. I want to get this resolved immediately, I truly do not want to file bankruptcy, I want them to remove this from my credit report because it is not mines and it is causing me nothing but [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].The car was fraudently opened, I have even contacted the dealership and they all redirect me to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a car in my name was put into an accident along the highway in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the driver was suspended');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1525,'04/16/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers','I have a Best Buy store credit card, and was enrolled in the debt protection plan on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have a letter sent to me by Best Buy Credit Services that also confirms that date. 

Over the past 6 years they have collect $ 800+ from me for this " protection plan ''''. 

I called and cancelled the service in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of this year and applied for a full refund of the funds. I was sent a letter back declining my application for a refund due to : " Account was protected by the program benefits through the end of the billing cycle in the month in which you cancelled, any previously billed fees are valid and non-refundable. '''' I''ve never once received any assistance from this program, and the above language makes absolutely zero sense. 

I found the document file number : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that is a consent order given to Citibank outlining the exact thing that I was hit with. Page 4, section c states : " ''Affected debt protection customer '' is any person who on or after XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] enrolled in : Credit protection at point-of-sale terminals or balance protector at point-of-sale terminals at specialty services desks, except for such customers who submitted a claim for benefits pursuant to the respective product ''s terms and conditions and were paid a benefit, or who signed and returned to respondent an acknowledgment of membership form after enrollment '''' I do not ever remember accepting into the program, and I certainly didn''t fill out a membership form. I NEVER received any letters or emails from Citi regarding the {$700.00}  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they were ordered to pay back to their customers. 

I was a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] college student, who had to buy a computer in order to finish my education. Of course having a 0 % APR for 2 years is extremely appealing when that''s the exact time frame of you getting out and getting a real job. In the 10 years I''ve had their card, I''ve never missed a single payment. It disgusts me to find that I''m only one of millions that got scammed out of cash just so a corporation could make a few extra . 

I would give an exact amount, but I can''t seem to get a complete lists of all my statements since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from Best Buy. 

Any help in this situation would be extremely helpful. I''ve called their customer service number many times, but without fail I''m put into a never ending loop of forwarding to departments. 

Regards, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'a credit card is enrolled in the debt protection plan on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the card is a consent');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1526,'04/15/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I requested Validation for a Bankruptcy that isn''t mine, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was verifying it was verified I contacted the court was told they don''t have or provide any information to the credit bureaus, I was notified this was removed by my credit monitoring the inaccurate bankruptcy was removed between XX/XX/18-XX/XX/18 & without notice from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was placed right back on the same day with no notification or reason why? this is a violation of the FDCPA & FCRA I am requesting this removed immediately or my next recourse will be legal assistance, This information isn''t accurate.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a bankruptcy that isn''t mine was removed by my credit monitoring. the court was told they don''t have or provide any information to the credit bureaus ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1527,'04/15/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','DiTech Mortgage is improperly placing a 30 day late on my mortgage trade line. I make extra payments nearly every month, just in case a payment isn''t received by mail, or if payment changes and I haven''t been warned ( See attached Payment History ). I received a notice that showed an account number different than the one I have on my ACH payments from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. There are 2 accounts with DiTech that are in my name, but one of them is managed by my ex-wife and has been for over 10 years. So, I thought it might be hers. I would have been able to take care of this notice of short payment if the letter had the property address on it, but it didn''t. I found that really odd. So, by the time I was able to hear back from my ex-wife, we were at the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and a bit over {$100.00} was due. Since I was not at home or had bank routing information when speaking with a diTech representative, I had no choice but to send an ACH payment THAT DAY from my mobile phone ( See attached DiTech Supp Pmt ). My bank shows to have executed a payment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. DiTech is noting they didn''t receive the electronic payment until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( See Payment History ). DiTech also is not applying my money payments WHEN RECEIVED. They claim to keep money " in suspense '''' until the full amount is paid. My note ( See attached ) makes no mention of lender being allowed to hold payment and not apply it to the balance immediately. They are also not sharing with me where the money is being held, if it is collecting interest, and who is entitled to that interest. I ask that DiTech and ALL OTHER lenders CEASE and DESIST from this business practice of holding money in suspense. 

So, the bottom line is that I am paid well in advance of my amortization schedule, I pay extra every month so that nobody may report me as not being credit worthy, or paying back on time. I feel they are trying alternative ways to make money. I want late fees credited, the 30 day late removed from my credit, and a letter from DiTech stating their apologies for improperly handling this matter.','Ditech Financial LLC',2.0,2.0,'diTech Mortgage is not applying my money payments until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is not applying my money payments. the bank says');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1528,'04/15/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','Took or threatened to take negative or legal action','NEW CITY FUNDING KEEPS PUTTING THIS ON MY REPORT WHEN THIS WAS MY MOTHERS CAR. At the time she got this car I had my permit, and I never agreed to be a co signer I agreed on being someone they will call if she doesnt pay her bill. I just got my liscense in XX/XX/2018 this car was taking out a year before that, Ive contacted them multiple times telling them this and they tell me theirs nothing I can do but take my mom to court and Im telling them I never signed any documents and even so I didnt have my liscense so how could I be a co buyer. What further action can I take now becaus this isnt my responsibility and its affecting my credit!','NEW CITY FUNDING CORP.',2.0,2.0,'a year ago this car was taking out a year before that. I had my permit and never agreed to be a co signer. contacted them multiple times telling me');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1529,'04/14/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Equifax Credit Reporting Agencies are reporting late payments on my student loans with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], when these loans were place on deferred status during this period and also on forbearance for other periods of time. I have over six student loans and I have never been late with these loans. I have disputed the information for the last two years, with no success. These late payments are impacting my credit and I can''t seem to receive any help from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or Equifax. 

Equifax is also reporting a collection account for a physician bill that was recently added after I filed bankruptcy with the original creditor. I have disputed with Equifax several times, with the information still remaining on my credit report.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Equifax Credit Reporting Agencies are reporting late payments on my student loans. they were placed on deferred status during this');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1530,'04/14/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','I sent a list of inquiries that may have been made fraudulently without my consent or bearing my signature. I also sent a copy of a police report made showing that my identity was stolen and that these inquiries may have been a result of my information being stolen.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'a police report showed that my identity was stolen. the list of inquiries may have been made fraudulently without my consent.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1531,'04/14/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','I have tried to resolve this with Transunion on numerous occasions through their own dispute process. I only received " canned '''' responses that an inquiry is a factual record of of a company pulling my credit.This is to notify you that I contacted the following inquiry creditors and they responded that the inquires SHOULD BE REMOVED. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has even stated they have submitted disputes to Transunion on two separate occasions. I have attached the letters as proof. If these UNAUTHORIZED inquires are not removed immediately my next step will be filing suit for monetary damages. Transunion is in direct violation of the FCRA. Remove inquires : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] IMMEDIATELY. Do not tell me it will take 30-60 days because I know it does not take that long. I expect it done upon receipt of this complaint. If you respond that they are a " factual record '''' I will file suit immediately. I have already contacted a consumer protection lawyer.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'if these inquiries are not removed immediately my next step will be filing suit for monetary damages. I have attached the letters as proof.');
