INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1533,'04/13/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I reported the accounts below as being opened as a result of identity theft. The accounts were then blocked/removed from the report and the fraudulent address associated with them was also blocked/removed. I recently noticed the accounts and the address has re-appeared and without any notification that it is was going to re-report. These accounts are a result of identity theft and I never opened them. I have tried to resolve with the bureau but with no response at all. They continue to report this information after initially removing/blocking it after receiving the identity theft packet in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and now re-reporting it in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],, and refusing to respond to my dispute regarding these accounts. The bureau is also reporting that I filed for bankruptcy when I have not filed. Then removing it and re-reporting that I filed a day later. 

Chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bankruptcy [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - Account Closed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - {$18000.00} Due [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -Account Closed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] {$300.00} Due Fraudulent Address : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], VA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I reported the accounts as being opened as a result of identity theft. the accounts were then blocked/removed from');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1534,'04/13/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','Experian Report # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : Experian Dispute Filed XX/XX/XXXXAccount : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I filed a dispute directly with Experian on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was notified of the dispute results on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The dispute results indicated that the information in question had been " updated '''', however, the information was not updated, nor was it corrected. 

