INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1548,'04/11/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I am a victim of identity theft i have noticed inquires on my credit reports that i did not do. I filed a police report to file a complaint to report it. I have inquires on my credit reports that wasnt by me. I wrote called, sent certified letters & copies of my police report disputing the inquires. & they still Have not been removed it have been more the 4 months. The following inquires are : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Discover XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','DISCOVER BANK',2.0,2.0,'i have noticed inquires on my credit reports that i did not do. i wrote called, sent certified letters & copies of my police report disputing the inquires ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1549,'04/11/2018','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','Navient has unrightfully denied my attempts to join an income-based payment plan. I have submitted the necessary paperwork 6 times. I have been denied, for various and illegitimate reasons, all 6 times. 

I called Navient Customer service the last time my application has been denied. I was told that the reason I am being denied was because I did not add the words " Gross Income '''' to my written Income Statement ( the statement that accompanies the proof of income. ) I was told that after fixing this issue, all my paperwork would be acceptable. Thus, I fixed the issue, yet I was still denied. 

Navient is seems determined to continue to deny my attempts at an Income-Based Repayment Plan, despite the fact that a W.V. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CAN NOT afford the high, standard payments.

I have been forced into forbearance, until the matter can be resolved.

The only email I have ever received : " We''ve received your request for an Income-Driven Repayment plan ; however, we''re unable to process your request at this time because the proof of income you submitted did not clearly indicate the pay frequency ( i.e., weekly, bi-weekly, monthly, etc. ). In the meantime, please continue making your payments as scheduled. '''' ***My last Income Statement is included. Along with this written statement, I have submitted a pay stub from XX/XX/2017, and an application for Income-based Repayment. ***','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'I have submitted the necessary paperwork 6 times. I have been denied all 6 times. I have submitted the necessary paperwork.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1550,'04/11/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','We have lived in and made our house payment for 20 years. 10 years ago we filed bankruptcy but kept our home. Since then we have gotten ourselves back on track and rebuilding our credit. We set up automatic draft so our payment would never be late or overlooked. The mortgage company we had was awesome throughout the process. Last year, our mortgage was sold to Specialized Loan Servicing LLC. As we had before, we called to set up automatic draft. We were told because we had bankruptcy their company did not allow us to participate in automatic draft. It doesnt hardly seem fair that just because we fell on hard times in the past we should be punished 10 years later! Meanwhile, we mail payments which they now want to say are late and one time even returned our check cut completely and perfectly in half with a note stating they received it damaged when clearly they had sliced it in opening the envelope. I just want to know how they can prohibit people who have filed bankruptcy from being set up on automatic draft. Seems like discrimination to me and I dont appreciate it one bit!!','Specialized Loan Servicing LLC',10.0,10.0,'10 years ago we filed bankruptcy but kept our home. we have gotten ourselves back on track and rebuilding our credit.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1551,'04/11/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','My small business phone receives messages from RSI Enterprises at least twice a month stating that they are calling about dept collection. I am trying to conduct my business and these messages are being relayed to my employees that answer the phone continuously.','RSI Enterprises, Inc.',10.0,10.0,'RSI Enterprises sends messages from my small business phone twice a month. they are calling about dept collection.');
