INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1562,'04/09/2018','Mortgage','Other type of mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','I was coerced into a hard money loan on my primary home that I had paid off ( I found out this is illegal in the state of Md ), with he idea of getting on track and getting my credit score up. I missed a payment and they would not let me send in a payment. They said that they only debit money from a person ''s account. My payments were $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/month. By the time they were going to make the next deduction it was over {$5000.00}. I was expecting somewhere around {$4500.00}. After that it was stop gap measure here and there trying to stopdelay them foreclosing on my primary home. They sold the loan to another loan company which eventually foreclosed. The sale was held and the primary company I got the loan in the first place bought my home. I have received a eviction notice. This was done by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] agent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Title agent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I doubt I am the only person they got caught up in this scam. I got an email from him on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] about the appraisal, to make sure I told the appraiser that the home was not owner occupied. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I got an eviction notice taped to my door.','Visio Financial Services Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a loan on my primary home was illegal in the state of Md. the lender sold the loan to another loan company which eventually foreclosed. the sale was held and');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1563,'04/09/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','I have been disputing two charges with CapitalOne since last XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. ( CapitalOne [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Utah [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   ) The dispute regards two Charges : One made XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for {$1300.00} and the other made XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the amount of {$1200.00}, Totaling {$2500.00}. The merchant was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] The first charge was made XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the amount of {$1300.00} to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to purchase a treatment given that day, and future treatments. I disputed this charge because the merchant did not get back to me despite my repeated efforts to schedule future appointments.

The second charge was made XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] because the merchant called in such a fury that I was intimidated into giving her my credit card again. This time the amount was {$1200.00} because I had sent a check in the amount of {$100.00} to cover the treatment that I had received on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( {$75.00} plus a {$25.00} tip. ) I provided 30+ pages of emails and letters CapitalOne showing my efforts to either be reimbursed or to receive gift certificates from the merchant. The owner [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] even alluded to bringing the certificates for treatments to me in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. There was always a strange excuse for why they were not brought to me, including that she did not know where the place I was working was, despite the fact that this is a very small town and the place was just 3 blocks from her salon, on the same street. Since then, the business is closed and I can not locate the merchant.

I also sent certified letters to the merchant, which were returned, and contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ( they received no reply from the merchant ), and sent a friend to the place where I received the treatments ( the business is no longer there. ) During this time I have made every effort with CapitalOne to remove the two charges, but I have had no success. Each time I called, I had to rehash the same story to a different person. I received no services for the two charges which total {$2500.00}.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'dispute regards two charges with capitalOne since last XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. one made XX/XX/[');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1564,'04/09/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','I started to get billed from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a card I did not open. The bills started coming in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called them and told them I did not apply for, receive, or use the card. They investigated and I received a call, in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], stating that they were able to close the investigation and remove it from my credit score.

