INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1572,'04/06/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','I made a purchase from Nordstrom.com on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they sent the merchandise to my old address. The merchandise was delivered XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was stolen before I could retrieve the items. I contacted Nordstrom multiple times and they refused to help me. It was even confirmed by a Nordstrom Customer Service Rep that the package was signed for by someone else. Now they are holding me accountable for the charges and I never got the merchandise I ordered. I also filed a police report regarding this incident.','TD BANK US HOLDING COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'the merchandise was delivered XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was stolen before I could retrieve the items. the merchandise was stolen before I');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1573,'04/06/2018','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','I am contacting your organization to file a formal complaint against Freedom Mortgage. I bought my home with an FHA loan that is now held by Freedom Mortgage. After a bad injury on the job I went through some hard times and missed some payments. My hardship is over and I am trying to work things out with Freedom Mortgage. At first they were very helpful and told me that I would qualify for an assistance program. Several months later I am still waiting as they continue to misplace my documents, tell me they have not received paperwork that I send to them via certified mail ( so I know they have received it ) and tell me that I have no options. When I offered to make a large lump sum payment in order to fix this problem they tell me that the amount I owe has increased several thousand dollars due to late fees, Attorney fees, inspection fees and junk fees and that I can only pay the full amount. they have now set a foreclosure sale date for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I make a good living and have the means to pay my mortgage -- I am certain that I would qualify for one of the government programs such as modification, repayment plan, partial claim or special forbearance but Freedom won''t even give me a chance. 

I bought my house almost one year ago. I have a large family ( wife and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] kids between the ages of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  months ) and we were excited to have our own place. I had a good paying job working with the state of Idaho for the last 20 years and there was no reason to think that there would be any problems with making the monthly payment. About 4 months later I was injured on the job -- I [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and all of my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was in extreme pain. Due to doctor visits and the pain my working hours were limited. I had to go from doctor to doctor to figure out exactly what the problem was ( my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  had been [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and how to fix it and finally an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was done and I went in for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I missed a few weeks of work after the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they put me on some heavy pain medication. This led to additional problems and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which also cut into my ability to work. 

I contacted Freedom Mortgage shortly after I defaulted and explained my situation and was assured that there were programs available and that I qualified. I then began the process of sending in the application documents and began a vicious cycle because Freedom continually lost the documents. I got sick of faxing and began sending the documents through the USPS with tracking numbers in order to ensure that Freedom received the documents. I would get the receipt showing it was received, and then when I would follow up their loss mitigation department would say that they never received the documents. I was eventually told that I did not qualify for any programs, although no specific details were given relating to what programs I was reviewed for, what income was used in the calculation etc. or if a full review was even conducted. 

I then discussed a large lump sum payment of {$6000.00} in order to get me back into good standing. Their agents told me that this was not good enough, because when they added in the late fees and Attorney fees and the junk fees the total amount owed was closer to {$10000.00}. I am contacted often by their agents now, but it is not to offer help or to conduct a review of my current and correct financial circumstances. It is to harass me and to tell me that if I don''t make a lump sum payment of {$10000.00} that they are going to take my home away from me. A sale date has been scheduled for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

My hardship is over, and I make more than enough income to qualify for these homeowner assistance programs. The issue is that Freedom won''t give me a seat at the table. This is wrong, and I believe they are violating FHA and HUD guidelines.','FREEDOM MORTGAGE COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a foreclosure sale date has been set for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the amount I owe has increased several thousand');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1574,'04/06/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','Threatened to contact someone or share information improperly','On XX/XX/2018 the HR representative at my workplace notified me they received an employment verification request from a representative at RNNGroup. On the form they submitted to my company ''s HR department they had the correct last four digits of my social security number. They also had the correct work location and correct email address for my work location ''s HR representative.

They asked my employer to verify I was employed with them, if I was part time, full time or seasonal and for them to confirm the company name and address.

At no point did RNNGroup say this was in regards to a debt, but when I went on to their website, it certainly looks like a debt collection business - even though they don''t say they are a debt collection company. When I spoke to the representative from RNNGroup, they told me I was on a recorded line. They also told me they couldn''t divulge the client for whom they were seeking this information for - only their " executive team '''' could do that. Their website says they do data collection, but it is all very vague.','RNN Group, Inc',2.0,2.0,'a representative at my workplace notified me they received an employment verification request. they had the correct last four digits of my social security number. they asked my employer to verify');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1575,'04/06/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem when making payments','On XX/XX/2018 I logged on to my Wells Fargo account portal to schedule the monthly payment. I followed the same steps as always, scheduling a full balance payment to be transferred from my saved checking account. Wells Fargo acknowledges that I logged on that day but did not record my payment. They suggested that I may not have hit submit to finalize the payment. I am 100 % positive that I scheduled the payment in the same way I have for many years now. After a couple calls about this matter, Wells Fargo agreed to waive the late fee of {$25.00}, however the charged interest remains and presumably a negative remark on my credit report for a late payment. Perhaps they are correct and the error was on my part. Or perhaps the matter is not so uncommon and other customers have had similar situations? My confidence in Wells Fargo has been shaken by past behavior and my experience with this matter. I report this matter in case this has happened to others and document the prevalence.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/2018 i logged on to my account portal to schedule the monthly payment. I am 100 % positive that I scheduled the payment in the same way I');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1576,'04/05/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','I have several inquiries of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I would like for them to be removed as per my ex boyfriend was trying to get a vehicle and had my information but I never authorized the dealerships to run my credit. I tried to contact them and dispute but they didnt do a thing. So I would need these hard inquiries to be removed from my credit report.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'i have several inquiries of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I would like them to be removed as per my');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1577,'04/05/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Closing an account','I was on a lunch break and went through a drive thru when I found out my card was declined so I checked my online banking and it says access suspended so I called and chase gave very little information. I was stunned this all happened and would like to know why so the problem could be fixed','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'my card was declined so I checked my online banking and it says access suspended so I called and chase gave very little information.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1578,'04/05/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I have my payments set on auto-pay so that I know I can pay on time. The loan company published on my credit report that I was 30 days late on payments. They didn''t call me in a timely manner and it wasn''t until after it was reported on my credit that I was late on a payment. I called and told them it was wrong information and that I had recently move. They didn''t attempt to assist me by giving me a late forgiveness since I''ve always paid on time. I would like to continue with this company, I just feel I''m not currently being treated fairly. The payments are due on the first so I have my accounts to pay on time. for some reason they had issues pulling money but didn''t tell or contact me till after I was late. Whenever I check the account, I always see their withdrawal. Then they didn''t even tell me that I had another payment due, then called me once it was past due and late. They even tried withdrawing money from both accounts. Why was I not notified that there was an issue until it was too late? I could at least get an email. Please remove the late payment from the report.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',4.0,4.0,'the loan company published on my credit report that I was 30 days late on payments. they didn''t call me in a timely manner and it wasn''t until after it was reported');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1579,'04/05/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I have disputed this debt online with the credit bureau and requesting validation of this account. Company failed to respond or send any proof of validation. I have no contract with the agency. This is the second time this debt has showed up on my credit report under a new collection agency. I have not been notified and will be referring this to an FDCPA attorney for review.','ONLINE Information Services, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'disputed debt online with credit bureau. company failed to respond or send proof of validation.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1580,'04/05/2018','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Written notification about debt','Capital One has violated x 15 USC 1692 by continuing collection activity after a cease and desist and 15 USC 1681 by failing to report complete and accurate information to credit reporting bureaus.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'capital one has violated x 15 USC 1692 by continuing collection activity. capital one has failed to report complete and accurate information to credit reporting bureaus.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1581,'04/05/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I have been dealing with the credit bureaus for over 6 months now in regards to a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] financial account that is reporting inaccurately on my credit report. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I sent a couple letters asking to look into the accuracy of what was reporting and 30 days had passed without an answer on their investigation and description of the procedure. Additionally, in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I mailed a lack of response letter asking why nothing had been corrected or deleted to no avail. I''ve also reached out to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the only response I got was a letter sent from a " convergent outsourcing '''' which is a different company. 

I know the bureaus get paid money from the creditors to report negative and positive accounts as a business product. It''s extremely unfair because it allows the creditor to report whatever they want and the bureaus claim they verified the accuracy without showing how they reached their conclusion. 

Attached are some of the most recent letters that have gone out. My complaint is against [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and Experian. Hope this can help me move on so my family can prequalify for a new home. Thank you','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a credit bureau is reporting inaccurately on a financial account. the credit bureaus claim they verified the accuracy without showing how they reached their conclusion. a lack of response letter');
