INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1583,'04/04/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','Its been well over 6 month and I have been battling [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to review my letters and and remove the remaining collection accounts. The accounts in question have been updated to 3 collections. They changed the accounts to show that they are recent collections of a month ago when I solicited your help in the matter. All they did was close them, and updated the acoounts to a recent collection/late status when they are not even my accounts. 

The accounts are not mine, and my score has now decreased because of their change of status to closed collection. 

The accounts are as follows [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( recently added ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] act # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] These accounts are not mine. Experian has spitefully added them as a collection late-closed status due to my request that you investigate this on my behalf. Like I said, my credit score has gone down to my request to you to investigage. Please help. Experian is clearly retaliating against me.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',4.0,4.0,'accounts in question have been updated to 3 collections. they changed the accounts to show that they are recent collections. accounts are not mine, and my score has now decreased.');
