INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1587,'04/04/2018','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Personal line of credit','Charged fees or interest you didn''t expect','on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. i was reviewing my credit rating ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].i saw the add for loans at reasonable rates. i can not remember if i applied on line or by phone. i received a loan packet 3 days later, with loan documents that were routine, asking personal info, and loan amount requested. i faxed the app to a office in indiana. they returned questions to me over about 7 days, and after i faxed the completed questions to indiana i was told by a phone call i was approved, but had to speak to a loan officer. i spoke to the loan officer, and he told me i was approved for {$3800.00} and not {$5500.00}. he also told me i would pay payments of {$170.00} per month, and the months were not discussed, and the interest would be 25 %, is what i heard, but over the phone, was not the rate! it was 35 %, of which i would find out later and would have refused! also the loan officer asked if i would do auto payments, to which i said ok. the money was deposited in my account on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].since that date i have requested the loan papers, and later found out the interest rate at 35 %, and since then i have call one main, and spoke to many people for help. i have been told that they will not change the rate, but was told to pay off the loan to fix the issue, among many other suggestions. i did receive the loan papers after many calls to them on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],1 1/2 months after the loan was given. i have a problem with the disclosure of the loan! they were not upfront with the info of the loan, and didnt want me to have it! because i was persistent, i finally receive the documents! i have no issue with paying back the money, but the interest is almost as much as the loan! this to me is predatory, and not fair. thank you [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','ONEMAIN FINANCIAL HOLDINGS, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'i received a loan packet 3 days later, with loan documents that were routine. i faxed the app to a office in indiana, and was told');
