INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1590,'04/03/2018','Mortgage','VA mortgage','Closing on a mortgage','I had financed my house in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and my house payments were [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] per month. This was a VA loan, which requires that all taxes be included in the loan. At the end of XX/XX/XXXXI got a large Tax Bill from the MUD and the Independent School District totally around {$6000.00}. At that time I refinanced to pay the taxes and stipulated that the taxes needed to be in the payment. I got a quote with a lower interest rate and the payment was raised to {$1900.00}. I didn''t pay much attention until the end of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I got another tax bill for {$2800.00} and {$3300.00} = [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was shocked to see it but I was really surprised that they didn''t pay the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] tax for the MUD however [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who bought the loan from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] charged me for it. 

In essence I had paid the tax twice by refinancing. The hit is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which should have been paid at closing ... in fact you can not close until all taxes are paid. And then I was charged that much by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] {$5500.00} Has evaporated and talking to first integrity they say the bill hadn''t come in before closing, but I had the bill in hand and it was the sole reason I refinanced. 

Their good faith estimate was for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a month and at the end of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had moved a fixed mortage payment to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with the tax payment for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] added in. I would have never bought the house if I knew the MUD and ISD were so high. I definitely wouldn''t have refinanced to pay it. 

The companies involved are : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Closing Date XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] They closed without paying the tax from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] They then sold the loan to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] The Title Insurance Company may be [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I have talked to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] many times, the last few times they stopped returning my phone calls. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], which is their agent or title insurance told me they paid the ISD but they didn''t have the MUD bill and assumed it had been paid. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said they cant help me. 

For me this loan was turned over twice without paying the taxes. The VA says that taxes must be included in the payment. The taxes must be paid to close a loan. So I have been defrauded in two different ways and had to sell the house.','INTEGRITY FIRST FINANCIAL GROUP',2.0,4.0,'a loan from the VA requires that all taxes be included in the loan. at the end of XX/XX/XXXXXI I got a large');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1591,'04/03/2018','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Communication tactics','They are reporting I owe over {$2000.00} for a bill that is not mine. I have received many phone calls from different agents and they have all made threatening comments and have cursed at me. I have asked them to stop calling and they do not. I have asked them to remove this from my credit reports and they refuse to. I have sent them the attached letter and have had no response from them, so they are also in violation of the " Fair Credit Reporting Act. ''''','GC Services Limited Partnership',2.0,2.0,'they are reporting I owe over $2000.00 for a bill that is not mine. they have received calls from different agents and have cursed at me. they');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1592,'04/03/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I had three accounts with Navy Federal Credit Union, and due to financial hardship in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I fell behind on my payments. A settlement was paid in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on all three accounts and the remaining balances were charged off.

I reached out to NFCU in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], because my accounts are still being reported to the credit bureaus as still owing the balances that were charged off. I was assured by the Collection Department representative I spoke with that I no longer owe NFCU on these accounts or these balances, and they resent me letters in the mail dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], stating the payments made in the settlement of these accounts and that no further collection activity will occur.

I attempted to dispute the incorrect information on my credit reports ( that there is a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance as a settlement was paid ), but it is still being reported on my credit report that I owe the charged off balances.','NAVY FEDERAL CREDIT UNION',2.0,2.0,'a settlement was paid in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on all three accounts. the remaining balances were charged off.');
