INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1597,'04/02/2018','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','I started attending [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in XX/XX/2009. I went a year without any problems. Then I went through some life changing problems and had to stop schooling for a short time, about a month or two. When I went to re-enroll they had canceled my program, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and could no longer get a associates in that area of study. So I switched programs but they just were not for me. Now I have all this debt, no degree and credits that nobody wants. I''m stuck and very upset about it. No one wants to work with me on figuring out a solution other than asking for the loan payback. 

While attending the college, they were unprofessional and it seemed like they just wanted you to just cruise through the courses. What I mean is it seemed like they just passed you no matter if you learned the studies or not just to get you out of there. I feel like I learned nothing from this college other than how to spend a ton of money while getting absolutely nothing in return. I was trapped.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'a year ago, a college student went through life changing problems. he switched programs but they were not for me. now he has all this debt, no degree and');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1598,'04/02/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Other personal consumer report','Incorrect information on your report','The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] This company ran a criminal background check on for employer [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( FL ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( BILLCODE : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). However, there are some incorrect information was on background. The report also contain information on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], which is not me and is not connect with me in anyway. The review following information below that is incorrect : Report requested on : XX/XX/2018 Report completed on : XX/XX/2018 Case Comments : Limitations on the DOJ 50 State [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] search. 1.  NEVADA : This search does not provide results from the State of Nevada, as by both statute and regulation, information from the Nevada [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Registry web site can not be used for employment purposes and can not be distributed commercially. 
