I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as Citibank would not speak with me to get a resolution. I asked about settlement because I wanted to purchase a home. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] failed to tell me if I did that it would impact my credit report negatively. I made a {$830.00} payment directly to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and still continued my monthly payment. I contacted my real estate agent to get advise about what [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] told me and she advised me not to do so I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] same day and told him I did not want to settle that I would continue making payments. He said okay no problem but advised me incorrectly and said there was nothing he could do. 
Citibank sent me this letter I will attach on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating information I sent was wrong. The payment history from my bank account I will attach.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'Citibank closed my credit card for 2 years. I disputed my account for 2 years. he gave up and then sent my account into collection.');
