INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1654,'03/22/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Other features, terms, or problems','Citi is trying to force and shape how individual businesses sell products to customers.

No one wants financial institutions deciding which legal products you may purchase.

Citi has no place determining who and what legal items can be purchased by legal citizens. Citi is a corporation who was helped by the people of the United States, they have no business telling its citizens in what fashion they can use credit to make legal purchases. Our government has systems in place to determine what is legal and what isn''t, Citi is not a governing body.

I am currently working to divert all personal business away from Citi and to other credit corporations.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'Citi is trying to force and shape how individual businesses sell products to customers. no one wants financial institutions deciding which legal products you may purchase.');
