the amount had gone up again to {$590.00}, an increase of {$28.00} and stated in this court document that it this was the agreement between the firm and myself, which is not true. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is not dealing in reasonably or in good faith with me regarding the payment of this alleged debt. There have been no award of fees of any kind ordered by the court in this matter and at this present time, there is no court date for the lawsuit. 
