INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1695,'03/15/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','I Purchased a new roof for my home from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/2017. I received several estimates prior to going with Lowe ''s. I went with Lowe ''s because I trusted they would likely stand behind their product and services and additionally they provided a 10 % discount to veterans which I fall in that category. My original estimate was approximately {$9000.00}. After speaking with the Pro Desk salesman, and talking about the decking that is common for houses in my neighborhood at the age of my house 50 years, I was told that Lowe ''s would not be able to do my job without continuous plywood decking. That added an additional {$10000.00} to my job. My new quote totaled out to {$19000.00}. This is with an estimated 46 squares of shingles. After discounting was applied at {$3600.00}, I walked out with a total of {$17000.00}. 
I ended up calling my local county building code inspector who verified with Lowe ''s that the additional decking was not needed or required. I informed the salesman from Lowe ''s that I did not want or need that additional decking and was told that it would be returned with all the unused product. Every other roofing company including Lowe ''s included 400sq.feet of additional wood for repairs when the old shingles were removed. Lowe ''s used 400 sq. feet of decking on my garage roof area with the job. At completion, I returned 125 sheets of plywood decking out of 140 sheets. I returned 25 packs of shingles, 2 rolles of 4 synthetic roofing felt and several ridge vents. I was told it ended being 40 squares used. That was 2 squares over what other roofers estimated. After returns, my total ended at {$12000.00}. This is a 30 % markup over every other estimate. I got a total of 6 estimates before settling on Lowe ''s. This should''ve been a {$9000.00} project.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'lowe''s offered a 10% discount to veterans which I fall in that category. my original estimate was approximately $9000.00.');
