XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - I called citi again and they still have not unlocked my card.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'Citi cards locked my credit card and sent me an payment verification notice. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - I called citi card');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1700,'03/14/2018','Debt collection','Mortgage debt','False statements or representation','I recently responded to the company ''s response to my original complaint ( complaint # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), but I''m still unclear the charges because of several things and want this matter further investigated. 

1. My rent was nowhere near {$1700.00} so why does the statement show that amount? My rent was around {$1100.00}, no more than {$1200.00}. 
2. How were the late fees calculated? I gave notice of my move out the end of XX/XX/2014 when I lost my job. I started my new job XX/XX/2014 and moved out the middle of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My 60 day notice was given so what are the late fees and what are the dates of those late fees? I didn''t get evicted because i left after my notice was given. 
3. Please explain the reletting fee and how it was calculated and why. It should be calculated only if the landlord was unable to lease the apartment and i know [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is an extremely popular community, even with waiting lists at times, so i doubt leasing the apartment was an issue. When was it re-leased and was the landlord actively trying to rent the apartment? 
4. Please send me a copy of the lease I signed.

5. The water and sewer fees are different. At the top of the statement it shows {$50.00} for each utility but at the bottom it shows a different, lesser amount for the same dates of service. 

I''m not at all satisfied with this statement that " randomly '''' appeared after 4 years AND only after i filed a complaint with Consumer Finance 3 days ago! 

I''m also distraught at the fact that I''ve disputed the {$12000.00} amount for the last few years with all 3 credit bureaus with no resolution from the collection company or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] other than it showing on my credit report as " correct '''' when it wasn''t and this was proven today. 

I knew the amount was incorrect which is why I''ve disputed it so many times over the last few years but only until i filed complaint # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was anything done to prove what I''ve known the whole time. 

I''ve missed opportunities on potential homes due to the incorrect info on my credit report and feel that the false information that has been showing for years is a direct reflection of the mishandling of this account and complete disregard for me as a consumer! 

This has stressed me out and I''m utterly disgusted at the way I''ve been treated and the countless times my requests have been disregarded. 

I''m not disputing the fact that i owe something but I''m not sure what i truly owe and this situation clearly shows that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and RS  Clark don''t know either. If they did know then the {$12000.00} that has been on my credit report would have been found as incorrect a long time ago and NOT randomly today after the complaint was filed! 

I''m willing to pay what i owe and feel is fair but the {$12000.00} falsely reported on my credit report the last 3 years wasn''t fair, the {$6000.00} RS Clark tried to bully me into paying last month when I called them wasn''t fair and the {$5700.00} you all have " randomly '''' come up with is also unfair! Nor was the ONE missed payment fair that was reported on my credit report last month after i was bullied into paying {$6000.00} to RS Clark ( but refused to do so because i wasn''t given a statement even after i asked ) that DROPPED my credit score 40 points!!!!! 

I want this removed from my credit report due to the inaccuracies then and now!!!! You all can even keep my deposit, I don''t want it. I just want this off my credit, a letter saying it''s been removed from my credit and my life back. That''s it, that''s all.','RS Clark and Associates, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'i''m still unclear the charges because of several things. my rent was nowhere near $1700.00. the company has disputed the amount for the last few years');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1701,'03/14/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I logged in on my TD account on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], because I was preparing to pay a bill. I noticed the funds are very low, and checked the history of the account. There was a checked made out in the amount of {$3100.00}. On the check, the name is wrong, the signature is wrong, and the funds was already drawn. I immediately called TD bank, after over an hour of wait, I finally get to speak with their fraud department, who informed me that the account needs to be closed, and there ''ll be an investigation, with time window between 60 to 180 days. And the money may never come back. This is outrageous, since this is a clear case of fraud, and it''s the bank ''s fault that the fund were withdrawn. Please help to get this resolved as soon as possible, I rely on this account for bill payment.','TD BANK US HOLDING COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'a check made out in the amount of $3100.00 was made out. the money was already drawn. a fraud department called the bank, after over an hour');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1702,'03/14/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Problem caused by your funds being low','BMO Harris Bank ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) XX/XX/2018 : There is a pending charge of {$150.00} on my checking account. At the time of the charge pending there was only about {$6.00} in the checking account. To avoid fees and returned items the bank advises to make a deposit before [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CST. I make a deposit of {$140.00} cash with a receipt time stamp of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/2018 ; I go on to deposit {$160.00} in a check from a local bank with a time stamp of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/2018. The next morning about XX/XX/2018 about [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I check my account online and see that the only deposit showing is the check deposit of {$160.00} ; the cash deposit is no where in sight. I contact the BMO Harris 24 hour customer service line and I speak with a representative who informs me that she also is not showing a cash deposit and advises me to launch an investigation. I do so by providing the deposited amount and the ATM location. My main focus at this time is to ensure that the pending item is paid. I am advised to contact the ACH department before [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CST to request the item to paid. I do so and am denied with the bank citing no available funds to honor payment of the {$150.00} item ( my account was still reading a negative balance of - {$140.00} at close of business XX/XX/2018 ) and I was charged a {$35.00} returned item fee from BMO Harris and later a {$25.00} returned check fee from the merchant. I stayed on the phone with this bank from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] until close of business XX/XX/2018 ; to no avail my item was returned. On XX/XX/2018 the {$160.00} check deposit was made available, the {$140.00} cash deposit was made available, and {$140.00} provisional credit ( for the missing deposit ) was made available, there was a reversal of a provisional credit of {$500.00} leaving my account negative $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I made a deposit of {$840.00} ; however XX/XX/2018 is a weekend day and I was charged an overdraft fee of {$36.00}. On XX/XX/2018 the provisional credit of {$140.00} was reversed and debited back to my account ; I requested the bank to credit my returned check fee of {$35.00} and {$25.00} as well as the overdraft fee of {$36.00}. BMO Harris denied my request citing previous reversal of fees as if they were doing me a favor and all of this was not contributed due to a bank error. I have spent over 14 hours trying to resolve this matter ; no one listens and no one seems to care.. Please note the morning in which I opened the investigation I did not have my receipt from the deposit as I had thrown it away ; to aid the investigation ; I left home at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to go through trash at a laundry mat where I had thrown the receipt away, on the way home I have a car accident ; I call BMO Harris to inform them I now have the receipt to add to the claim and the representative says she doesn''t need it, the investigation was already sent! Horrible service a perfect example of why companies need to use uniform customer service.','BMO HARRIS BANK NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'pending charge of $150.00 on checking account. at the time of charge pending there was only about $6.00 in the checking account. to');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1703,'03/14/2018','Debt collection','Credit card debt','False statements or representation','I have been receiving bills from both the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Transworld Systems Inc. regarding debts on a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Credit Card and a " Take it home Today '''' Joint Loan with my spouse. Correspondence started in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2017, and both companies have conflicting amounts listed as owed. It almost seems as if they are both trying to collect different amounts for the same debt. 

In addition, I sent them written correspondence in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2017 requesting validation and proof of the debts as I had paid significantly more than what they were listing as owed. I received no response, only continued collection letters from BOTH companies. They recently took both my wife and my tax return from this past year ( in excess of {$9000.00} ) yet, there is still significant balance owed according to their website ( $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). They only show the payment from my tax return on their site, but show no application of that tax return towards the balance of either debt. They also sent a letter of intent to garnish my wife ''s wages for a debt of $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

I am a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] veteran who has been unemployed for over a year now. I have not been successful in obtaining any employment over the past year. My family and I rely on food stamps and school assistance to fee our children and my wife ''s income is well below the federal poverty level. We can''t get double food stamps when these crooked companies garnish my wife wages and she makes less than minimum wage ( which ill be the result of any wage garnishment. ) I would hire a lawyer, but they cost money, and that is obviously something that we do not have at the moment. Any assistance would be greatly appreciated.','TRANSWORLD SYSTEMS INC',2.0,2.0,'a credit card and a joint loan are listed as owed. the debts are listed as owed by both companies. the company has not received any response.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1704,'03/14/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','Hello and first thank you so much for helping assist me with this matter. 

