I humbly am asking that someone please help me get them to either remove the file all together off my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit report or Please say its Paid and or closed =- ( I done this challenge process maybe 3 times with them from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as well as them ( Wells Fargo ) directly.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/2017 was the 2nd or 3rd time I challenged this which I have the certified receipt when I mailed them the letter about this matter. it was');
