INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1706,'03/13/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','XX/XX/2018 [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] FL [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] TransUnion [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Re : Fraudulent Credit Inquiry To whom it may concern : Recently i received a copy of my credit report which showed Inquiries i didnt not authorize. I understand and aware that you should not put an inquiry on my file unless i have approved it. I have provided you with a police report and i am currently working with an investigator to stop the use of my name by someone who has stolen my identity. Please have the following inquiries removed off my credit file immediately because i did not authorized them and they are fraudulent. 

