Sincerely [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a copy of my credit report showed inquiries i didnt authorize. i understand and aware that you should not put an inquiry on my file unless i have approved');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1707,'03/13/2018','Debt collection','I do not know','Communication tactics','XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Frontline Asset Strategies has called my number daily looking for an individual that is not connected to this phone number. I tell them they have the wrong number and they have continued to call even though I told them not to call again. Yesterday I was asked if I knew the person they are trying to contact. They are harassing me for what reason? I am not the person they want to talk to. Furthermore they do not identify themselves.','Frontline Asset Strategies, LLC',2.0,2.0,'frontline asset strategies has called my number daily looking for an individual that is not connected to this phone number. they have the wrong number and they have continued to call even though I told them');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1708,'03/13/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','There was a collection account reporting on my credit file with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I contacted the company and agreed to settle the debt. I spoke with the Floor Manager [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and he was the one that approved the settlement. Once I completed the payments they were suppose to zero  out the remaining balance and remove it from my credit report, because again it was a settlement agreement. I watch my credit through a credit monitoring site and when I checked to make sure the account was reporting properly I was floored to see that what they did was take the money they agreed to settle the account and actually just applied it to the balance. On XX/XX/2018 I called the company ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was transferred several times before I was able to speak with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] again the Floor Manager, at first he too seemed confused and said that there was money still owed. He did finally remember the agreement and said that the accounts were settled and that he would send me a letter showing they were settled with no money owed and that they would delete them from the credit report. I still have not received that letter nor has it been removed off my credit report.','Radius Global Solutions LLC',2.0,2.0,'the floor manager agreed to settle the debt. he was the one who approved the settlement. the company agreed to zero out the remaining balance and remove it from my credit report.');
