INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1725,'03/10/2018','Vehicle loan or lease','Loan','Managing the loan or lease','My name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] last 4 of my SSN are [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my address is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] TX [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I made a payment through the online system for my car payment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This payment was returned because I submitted through savings instead of checking. I only authorized a ONE TIME PAYMENT. On XX/XX/ Ally bank resubmitted the payment through without my authorization causing my bank to charge me [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called in and spoke with a manager named [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who told me that they did not need my authorization to process this payment since I already gave it onXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. She claimed that by me making that payment I gave authorization for the to go in and draft my account again if the payment was returned. She stated this was and agreement I made before submitting the payment. Well I went back and check what the online system stated when making a payment. " I authorize Ally to debit a one-time payment from my designated account in the amount and on the date i have selected and this authorization will be in effect until the payment is paid or until I cancel ''''. No where does it state if my payment comes back I authorize Ally to draft my account again. I believe this practice is unfair and deceptive.','ALLY FINANCIAL INC.',2.0,2.0,'a manager says that by making a payment I gave authorization for the payment. the payment was returned because I submitted through savings instead of checking. the manager says that by making the');
