I called and emailed coinbase and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 15 times so far over the past 18 days. I am only told my account is under specialist review and they are busy, the specialist will try to review your account but no time frame when it may happen. 

In my calls and emails I specifically request coinbase/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  to release my funds since they have no right to freeze it and they responded with same point that the specialist will review account. 

I have used coinbase since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I have submitted all documents to verify my ID and income sources, including my bank and credit card information. I submitted my driver license, my USA passport and every required information coinbase requested. 

