INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1736,'03/08/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage','I applied for a mortgage with Loan Depot in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and after working with them for six months, they finally declined me in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Loan Depot did not treat me fairly, did not use appropriate underwriting methodology, and failed to include all of the verifiable income that my wife and I make. In addition to the unfair underwriting practices, I was also left in the dark about my approval for a very long time. I have evidence that they decline me on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but I did not receive the decline letter until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( I have the postmarked envelope ). The Lender wasted the time of my tenants, my wife, and tax accountant, and myself through 120 hours of communication for underwriting, prepping for the appraisal ( which they ordered and completed ), and preparation for multiple stages of the loan. Lastly, they also discriminated against my wife and I due to my wife ''s line of work and the disparaging comments the Loan Officer ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) made to me in which he at one point said " do you know who you''re dealing with '''' while on the phone with me and was threatening. I wrote various statements of explanation to them, provided numerous reports of income, but they did not reflect all my income and refused to use the correct income for my wife.','loanDepot.com, LLC',2.0,2.0,'loan Depot declined me in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the lender failed to include all of my income and the correct income ');
