XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Called to check the status of the short sale application. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Answered. They still have not reviewed the documents as they are still requesting the same ones sent on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I asked him to escalate it and he said he would. I re-sent via email and fax. 

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : Called to check the status of the short sale application. They are just now reviewing the docs I sent on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They said it was uploaded on Sat., and it can take 48 hours to review. I requested a supervisor since the application should be complete and they have had over 48 hours to review. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is the supervisor and she said they had 48 hours to upload it and 5 b/d to review. She said if it''s not reviewed by tomorrow, I can call back and have it escalated. If she does it now, they will reject it saying they are within their timeline. 

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : Called to check the status of the short sale application. An automated machine said we are closed for the holiday?!? What holiday? XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s Day. 

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : Called to check the status of the short sale application. I entered [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s extension and it said thank you for calling, goodbye and hung-up. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] answered and said they are missing the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], which I confirmed I sent on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], she found it and it''s not the right one. M & T XXXXorrower ''s financial report, which is labeled the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but also sent in., and the 30 days of paystubs. Transferred to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the supervisor who said sometimes the faxes fail and emails are too big and to resend them. I requested 2 more paystubs to go with it.','M&T BANK CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] answered. he said they call me on XX/XX/[COMPTE');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1738,'03/07/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I just got a copy of my credit report and noticed this bill from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for {$1200.00}. Dated for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but It wasn''t assigned to my credit until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I had already moved to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] paid my bill in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it had to be paid in full. How could I owe {$1200.00} in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]? XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I came to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to find a job and residence before I moved here the end of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I don''t have the receipts from The Department of Human Services, but I don''t owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] No more than {$100.00} for final bill.','LJ Ross Associates',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] paid my bill in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it had to be paid');
