INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1752,'03/05/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','False statements or representation','I have some delinquent taxes owed and they were placed with a collection agency Keith D Weiner and associates. I asked for a printout of the balances owed for the years I owe back taxes to. I requested it on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and received it about 4 days later.I looked over the documents and found that they basically doubled what I owed. Tax year XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I owed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] then after everything was said and done It went to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. It says court costs, attorney fees and even pre placement interest. This is the same for tax years XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This is outrageous. For tax year XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I had the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] down to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and then it went up to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they claim court costs at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] times 2 .... They tried to garnish my wages 3 times and they were unsuccessful due to me not making enough money. I don''t know why they are charging attorney fees when I only talked to their attorney once and that was back in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This company is a scam and their collecting practices are ridiculous. I will scan the papers I have to document that what im saying is true. I would like to add that they are charging interest instead of 30 % right off the top its charging every month','Keith D. Weiner & Associates Co., L.P.A.',2.0,2.0,'tax year XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I owed the balances owed to collection agency. they say court costs, attorney');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1753,'03/05/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','Strictly for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. PLEASE REMOVE ANY OTHER ADDRESS LISTED OTHER THAN THE LISTED ADDRESS THANK YOU. Here is a final letter and the final attempt to reach out to you. I would like for you to know that all letters and conversations between us have been previously recorded. I have sent in previous certified letter since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I havent gotten a response on my case. Your company has violated my rights within The Fair Credit Reporting Act within sections 609, 611, 612, 623, and several others. I am seeking a total of {$3000.00} for damages and the detriment to my personal credit file. Your company is reporting erroneous information and I am unaware of it. This is the final good will letter and will contact the attorney generals office in Florida, make sure your company is placed on public records file. If you think that youre going to get away with this you are wrong and I know all of my rights. I asked for several documents in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of last year. I asked for original contracts with my signature, by law if you didnt respond within 30 days the erroneous accounts listed were to be removed and you continuously report it. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] THANK YOU [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] FL [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','HCFS Health Care Financial Services, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a letter from a company that violated my rights is written. a letter from a company that has violated my rights is written. a letter from a');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1754,'03/05/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','Unfortunately back XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I fell behind 2 months on my mortgage. I attempted to get caught up but the lender refused to take my payments and wanted a full repayment which I did not have at the time. So instead of getting back on track, I was forced to fall further and further behind. I have been submitting documents to Amerihome since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for loss mitigation and foreclosure alternatives. I have supplied endless amount of documents and requested information all in timely manner. I have been told several times my file is in underwriting only to be told additional information is needed. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a representative informed me that the sale has been placed on hold and my file again was in underwriting. When calling back Friday XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I am now told that the file was never being reviewed and the sale is now in fact active again for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] although a bankruptcy was filed on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Not only did Amerihome Mortgage acquire the debt of my loan AFTER I was already in default, they proceeded to file a Notice of Trustee sale while I have been in an active loan modification review since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The notice was filed in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], clearly violating HBOR laws and dual tracking. I am now facing a foreclosure and forced with no other options because I am repeatedly lied to by this company.','AmeriHome Mortgage Company, LLC',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was in default on a mortgage. the lender refused to take my payments and wanted a full');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1755,'03/05/2018','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Trouble during payment process','This confusion on 5/3rd Bank part began when I requested from 5/3rd bank to enter  into their Forbearance Plan to postpone 3 monthly payments until the end of my Mortgage due to Hurricane Irma and Florida declaring it was in a State of Emergency. The mortgage payments that were going to be postponed were XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called 5/3rd Bank and declined the Forbearance Plan.  During the months of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I made separate Escrow payments by check. When I declined the plan I made a lump sum payment for the 3 above months for the Principal and Interest due. Because I had to stop my auto payment during the 3 months that I was entered into the Forbearance Plan I called 5/3rd bank and made an additional phone payment for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Mortgage payment. 

