I am now receiving phone calls from the 5/3rd collections department about being delinquent on my XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Mortgage payment which was made on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have canceled checks and letter from 5/3rd bank for phone payments which total the amount due for the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], & XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Mortgage payments. I can prove that all the funds for these 4 months have been sent into 5/3rd bank and they have acknowledged that they have received them. See list of payments made to bank. 

