INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1775,'03/01/2018','Mortgage','Home equity loan or line of credit (HELOC)','Struggling to pay mortgage','I took out a loan to remodel my parents home for the comfort of my elderly mom, I always paid the first two companies timely, and had no issues. However, once Nation Star took over, they didn''t inform me as my old Co told me that they would, once I found out, they had already started placing the house into foreclosure. I have been fighting with them. I did call them and advised them of my information. Still, they kept being scammers as they are. I tried to set up a modification with them, they took out all of payments with the exception of the last one and stated the payment was a NSF and that I had to start all over.Well, I fell into their trap, started all over, and they stated on this one the same and that the bank blocked them. The monies sat in the account. They have all of these fees, NSF fees charged to me and the only way to keep my home is to file bankruptcy and soon. They have my beacon score very low. They are my old bad creditor. When I asked them send me information, they lie and dont.','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',4.0,4.0,'a loan was made to remodel my parents home for the comfort of my elderly mom. they didn''t inform me as my old Co told me that they would, once I found out');
