INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1781,'02/28/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Closing on a mortgage','Wells Fargo altered the Title Vesting and put a Cloud on the chain of Ownership by FRAUD and refuse to correct their fraudulent behavior. 

1 ) XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Refinance Documents : All Documents were Initialed, Signed, and Notarized by Borrowers ( Customers ) and Notary and accepted by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They included the preliminary ( approved on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) Loan Information and Vesting Instructions of Title as required for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Documents requested Vesting of Title Change by Borrowers ( Customers ) for 1 ) Estate Reasons 2 ) Title Requirements ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Deed was an accommodation Deed and could not be re-used ) Customers were myself, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ( over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) Parents. Wells Fargo was aware of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Elder situation and appears to have been abusive by taking advantage of the situation, 2 ) Upon completion of documents, yet prior to Recording Documents with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Recorder, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sent said documents to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of Wells Fargo in an out of state location ( Arizona ) 3 )  Wells Fargo sent Documents they ALTERED to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Recorder. The Alterations do not agree with the referenced documents in the Notarized and Recorded Document, They do not agree with what was approved by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They put a cloud on Ownership chain and on title. 
4 ) TO COVER UP THEIR FRAUD, Wells Fargo sent the Recorded Documents to themselves in Minnesota, rather than the Buyer and left all documents regarding the transaction in the two names that would have been vested on Title. The also sent, when the loan was paid in full, the reconveyance letter to Florida where It did not belong. ( I received a Reconveyence for a Florida Home and I do not have Florida property ) When I discovered the error ( Taxes and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ) I contacted Wells Fargo and noted their error and they stated, they didnt care if they serviced the loan incorrectly since I paid it off. 
Eventually they reviewed it and stated they always pocket the money for a Title Change and leave the Title the way it is since Title only matters to the Owner. 
They review documents and refer to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Documents that they can not use, yet Wells Fargo has a new and more bizarre excuse each time. 

The fact : I paid to have the Title Vested one way. My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Parents and I Signed the Documents, had them notarized and submitted them to vest it that way. The Loan was contingent on the home being Vested ( Title Held ) the way the Customers signed and had it notarized by Federal Law. 

Wells Fargo altered the Vesting that was used to obtain funds. Wells Fargo broke Federal Banking Laws. Wells Fargo also altered Notarized Legal Documents and they have no signed nor referenced documentation as to why in the documents they Recorded with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They also have no signed, acknowledged, notarized, or initialed documents allowing their alterations. 

Wells Fargo altered the Title Vesting and put a Cloud on Ownership Chain by FRAUD and they refuse to correct their fraud.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'Wells Fargo altered the Title Vesting and put a Cloud on the chain of Ownership by FRAUD. all documents were initialed, Signed, and not');
