Therefore, the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], AND [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] inquiries need to be removed from my credit file. 

