I would like to be provided proof ( via wet ink signature on the documents ) that I consented to these inquiries via FCRA section 609 and 605 as well as the accuracy of this inquiry via FCRA section 623. I do not consent to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for means of verification.

I do not recall authorizing these inquiries and demand they be removed from my credit file from Equifax.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'Equifax refuses to provide proof that I authorized the companies listed to receive my credit report. the company says everything they use to verify is electronic and no physical documentation is used for proof ');
