I am trying to pay you money. I am trying to get a payoff amount so that I can pay you approximately {$150000.00} and sell my house. Why is this so difficult? I notified your company of this on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], in advance of the scheduled closing and in advance of your taking on of the servicing. I can not believe that there is no-one in your agency that can make this happen today, as promised. 





