I need someone from your executive branch to produce a written payoff letter to my attorney today in order to close this sale and payoff the mortgage. Please review the call logs and hopefully you actually record the calls and can listen to what your customers are getting from your staff. 

My name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the property address is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], MA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The loan number may or may not be [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], depending on who at SLS is answering the phone. 

