Finally, the listing agent and senior escrow agent for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] told us in a conference call that ( 1 ) the seller did not have the legal right to sell the house or enter into a contract to sell it, ( 2 ) the $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] first mortgage was sold to another bank and was having it serviced by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and ( 3 ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was canceling its contract as the sellers agent. 

