This house was to be for my son and his family who were moving back to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] so my baby grandchildren would have a stable home. 

My son and his family were on their way to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when we had the conference call and they had to live in a motel, extend the time on their moving truck. They have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] small children and two dogs, so it was a nightmare.','OCWEN LOAN SERVICING LLC',2.0,2.0,'seller, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] used [COMP');
