XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They also had tried to lie to me by telling me that there was only one account after they had already told me that there was 2. I know that Walmart knew that the credit card would be intercepted after they had sent that card out to me, they are involved in this fraud.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,4.0,'a credit card was sent out to a Walmart. the card was cancelled on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the');
