INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1878,'02/12/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','False statements or representation','Amsher called many times. I told them my insurance company was resubmitting the claim, because the insurance company had made a mistake. They didn''t care. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] were rude and belligerent to the point of bullying. I am a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] veteran and it took me a long time to get over the phone call. I then called my insurance company and found out the bill had been paid to the provider. Something has to be done to stop these people. They are out of control.','Amsher Collection Services, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'amsher called many times because insurance company had made a mistake. they were rude and belligerent to the point of bullying.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1879,'02/12/2018','Debt collection','Payday loan debt','Took or threatened to take negative or legal action','I received a call from this woman who claimed to be serving me papers, I saved the VM on my phone, she was beyond rude and told me she was going to call my place of employment, in which she did and spoke with my boss XX/XX/2018 how embarrasing over a payday debt in which I tried to resolve payments with the actual company since this woman is calling from a private number saying she was a third party collector for her client [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], this was for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payday loan, I immediately called this number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that they told my boss they were coming to my work to serve me papers. Like a fool, they got me, I called back and spoke to a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who said we were being recorded which I was okay with. He said his client would settle for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and then I proceeded to give him my debit number and agreed to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] month per month to make good, then I received an email confirmation showing that they were settling for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]??? I called back and this woman, probably same one was very rude, I told her I agreed to a different amount and that I was being recorded I told her good replay it back so I can show them. This document they sent me doesn''t even look legit, how do I know if they are real????','BlueChip Financial',2.0,2.0,'a woman called her and said she was serving me papers. she called her and she was beyond rude and told her she was going to call her place of employment. she called her');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1880,'02/12/2018','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Title loan','Problem with the payoff process at the end of the loan','About 3 week ago I applied for a loan for a used car ( {$25000.00} ) with USAA. I paid ( {$2500.00} as a down payment for this car ). When speaking with the loan agent before I had taken the loan I inquired ( twice ) if I would be able to pay off this loan by using my Credit Card. Twice the USAA agent assured me that I would absolutely able to pay off my USAA loan by using my credit card. So with that information I proceeded to get the loan. Today, XX/XX/2018 I called USAA to pay on my used car loan by using my credit card. The USAA agent said that I was unable to use my credit card to pay from my loan! So I asked to speak with the manager, which I did. The manger again stated I was unable to use my credit card and that the loan agent would be trained on policy of payments. I stated to the USAA manger that I was sold a fraudulent with bait and switch information to get  me to sign off on the loan. Today I posted on USAA ''s [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] page about my experience as I am looking for USAA to follow through on their promise so that I may proceed on making loan payments ASAP','UNITED SERVICES AUTOMOBILE ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'3 week ago, I applied for a loan for a used car with USAA. I paid ( $2500.00 as a down payment for this car.');
