INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1882,'02/12/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','Please help. I am so frustrated that this continues to occur and Equifax/TrustedID indicates they can''t help me. They refer me to call [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] tells me they sent my information to the fraud dept. I called three times to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] over time and a new rep told me to write [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in SD and request deletion of the items on my credit report. I did that in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and still no change. I have two alerts on my credit report that are not mine. 

Both from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Box [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] SD, business type " na '''' and account status/type is " Consumer Disputes after Resolution ''''. One on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the amount of {$2900.00} and one on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the amount of $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-neith of these are mine! Someone is trying to use my information and I can''t get this off of my report. I ask for your assistance. PLEASE..I have/had outstanding credit for my entire life. I do not want this fraudulent activity reflected on my account.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a new rep told me to write [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in SD. a new rep told me to request deletion of the items on my credit report');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1883,'02/11/2018','Mortgage','Other type of mortgage','Trouble during payment process','I purchased my home in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] where Nationstar became my service provider, now Mr. Cooper with the name change. There was a payment of {$4600.00} for the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] property taxes from my escrow account when in the closing costs, that was to be paid for by the seller. This caused for a shortage in my escrow when the Escrow Disclosure provided at closings have me at a surplus, especially since my taxes in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] went down to {$4100.00}. According to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] County records, they received the payment for the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] taxes from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( the sellers lender ) on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. There were some transfers between the County, Nationstar, and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], then Nationstar paid the county {$4600.00} on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] resulting on an overpayment. There were more transfers between the 3 parties with the final transfer on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was eventually refunded the overpayment because it looks like Nationstar did not accept or appropriate those funds to my account when they should not have made the payment to begin. Based on closing documents and loan termsNationstar should not have paid those XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] taxes. I believe that I am entitled to a refund of funds in my escrow account, and I have not received them. I placed multiple phone calls to Mr. Cooper and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a manager based in Texas, said she was going to provide that refund by contacting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in a conversation I had with her on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at approximately at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( CT ). I called on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to for an update on that only to have the customer representative, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] also based in Texas, that they did not follow up with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Instead, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] just put in a request for more " investigative research ''''. A new escrow analysis is required after correcting the escrow accounting error since my property taxes went down from {$4600.00} in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to {$4100.00} in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], while my mortgage payment increased by almost {$400.00}. It makes no sense that my payment increased while my taxes went down. Every time I call I get the same answer from Nationstar ( Mr. Cooper ), that I should contact [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for the refund. I have done that and the response from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is that they can not give me information about that property because the loan was not under my name, it was under the seller ''s. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] did say they are more than willing to talk to Nationstar ( Mr. Cooper ) about those funds and when I tell Nationstar ''s ( Mr. Cooper ) representatives, they say that they can not contact PennyMac, so it''s a revolving door of not getting the answers or any action on my case.','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',2.0,4.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was paid for by the seller. the county received the payment for the XX/XX');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1884,'02/11/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','TO WHOM IT MAY CONCERN : My name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I am hoping filing this complaint through the CFPB will help resolve the disputes Ive previously made with Citi Bank regarding my CitiBusiness Platinum Select World Mastercard ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. To specify, I am disputing a {$490.00} charge for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which I did NOT initiate or authorize. As Ive previously told Citi, this credit card was stolen and used to make unauthorized/fraudulent charges between XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( dates provided by Citis online statement ) for almost {$3000.00}. I also have a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account which was hacked ( date unknown to me ) and the Citi card was used to make purchases on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which I, in no way whatsoever, ever authorized. I reported this card as stolen to Citi as soon as I found out. Citi was supposed to investigate the charges, but I have not received any substantive investigation results and Citi is now demanding I pay the charges. Nothing Citi provided me showed how these charges could possibly have been made by me. This scenario seems to be a nationwide problem due to all the hacking and poor security measures put in place by those entities which store our information. I have experience in IT and know that Citi could easily figure out where these charges originated by a simple IP check or other various means that would point them in the right direction. Citi has, instead, chosen to try and collect this debt from me. I am assuming because that is easier for them than actually investigating the charges. This is unethical and violates our agreement. I should not be held responsible for charges that I did not initiate. Citis investigation stated ( by no explanation or means of how they reached their decision ) the charges are reversed back to me, even though I did not make them and even though they can not show how I could possibly be responsible. Citi is responsible for the cards activities. Citis own security system should have detected the spending pattern on the card was highly irregular and contacted me at that point. I know this is commonly used by CC companies because I have had to verify purchases which seemed out of place in the past. There were 18-charges within 8-days totalling almost {$3000.00} and Citi didnt contact me once during this time to verify they were legit. This card wasnt a go-to card for me, I typically used it a few times per month ( 3-4 times ) which my account history shows and which should have alerted Citi to possible fraud or at least suspicion of, on their part ( please see XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] vs. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statements attached ). I am requesting all documentation, such as any signatures that were recorded when the stolen card was used, and any other documentation which Citi used to come to this incorrect decision. I realize investigating charges can be timely, but this is their responsibility and they have the means to do so, and the cost should not come down on me because the bank has deemed it cheaper or not worth to get to the bottom of. I have dealt with the situation as Citi requests when your card is used without your permission : I promptly reported the card stolen as soon as I found out. Citi should have known sooner, but thats neither here nor there, at this point. Thank you for your time and ( I hope ) prompt attention to this issue. If there is anything I have failed to do to meet my burden to Citi, please let me know. I would like to have this resolved as soon as possible. Again, thank you.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,4.0,'a credit card was stolen and used to make unauthorized/fraudulent charges. the card was used to make purchases on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1885,'02/11/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','IN REGARDS TO : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], ADDRESS : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], DE [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I HAVE SENT A CERTIFIED LETTER BACK IN XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] AND XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] AND I HAVE NEVER RECEIVED A RESPONSE OF THE PROOF I ASKED FOR. THE AGENT THAT RECEIVED THE LETTERS HER NAME IS [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. THEY ARE REPORTING ME LATE WITH A MAXIMUM DELINQUENCY OF 120 DAYS FROM XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 90 DAYS LATE, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 120 DAYS LATE, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 120 DAYS LATE, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 120 DAYS LATE AND XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 120 DAYS LATE. I HAVE NEVER BEEN LATE ON Y STUDENT LOAN DUE TO THE FACT THAT I HAVE ALWAYS HAD THE ACCOUNT IN FOREBEARANCE OR ON A DEFERRED PAYMENT. IN MY DETAILED LETTERS I REQUESTED FOR [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  WHO IS REPORTING ME LATE MULTIPLE TIMES TO THE CREDIT BUREAUS TO SHOW THEIR PROCEDURES PUT IN PLACE TO VERIFY THESE LATE LISTINGS FOR MY ACCOUNT? I ALSO AKED THAT THEY PROVIDE ME WITH A COPY OF THE ORIGINAL CONTRACT/APPLICATION WITH MY SIGNATURE? ALSO INCLUDED IN MY LETTER I REQUESTED THAT THEY SEND ME DOCUMENTS SHOWING THAT WHAT THEY ARE REPORTING TO THE CREDIT BUREAS IS ACCURATE? IF YOU CAN NOT PROVIDE ME WITH THIS INFORMATION THEN YOU MUST REMOVE THESE INACCURATE LATE PAYMENT LISTINGS AT ONCE. I''M NOT ASKING FOR A BILLING STATEMENT EITHER!!! BUT IM ASKING FOR HARDCORE PROOF I WAS LATE AND BASED ON MY RESEARCH ON THE FTC WEBSITE, I KNOW THAT THEY HAVE STRICT POLICIES WHEN IT COMES TO YOU ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) REPORTING CONSUMER DATA. I KNOW FOR A FACT THAT [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] BEING THE FURNISHER REPORTING MUST BE 100 % ACCURATE. PLEASE SHOW ME PROOF THAT YOUR REPORTINGS IS 100 % ACCURATE? I WOULD LIKE TO SEE A COMPLETE BREAKDOWN SHOWING THAT MY RIGHTS ARE NOT BEING VIOLATED? ALSO ACORDING TO THE FAIR CREDIT REPORTING ACT ANY FURNISHER THAT WILLFULLY REPORTS INACCURATE INFORMATION WITHOUT TAKING THE NECESSARY STEPS TO FIX THE ISSUE COULD BE IN VIOLATION OF THE ACT WHICH CARRIES A FINE OF {$1000.00} PER VIOLATION. STOP REPORTING THIS WRONG INFORMATION TO ALL THREE CREDIT BUREAUS BECAUSE I AHVE NEVER BEEN LATE AT ANY POINT IN TIME I HAVE HAD STUDENT LOANS.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'LETTERS I REQUESTED FOR [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I HAVE SENT A CERTIFIED LETTER BACK IN');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1886,'02/11/2018','Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service','Domestic (US) money transfer','Money was not available when promised','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I went to my bank to transfer [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] USD to my Coinbase account. Prior to transferring the account, Coinbase was claiming to transfer incoming wire within 1-2 days. So, I proceeded to transfer to my account in Coinbase. I waited 2 business days and no funds were  available, so I submitted a ticket to support. Since Coinbase does not have a support number for wire transfer I could not speak to anyone about my case. After a couple of days I got a generic email saying they apologize for the delay, they were behind on wire transfer and all transfers should be completed. I replied back to the email explaining that my account does not have my funds transferred. Again after a few days, I get no response so I continue to ask for updates. Coinbase only replies with a generic message but no indication that my funds are available or what the delays maybe. Ive sent over 30 emails with no resolution.','Coinbase, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a few days ago, I got a generic email saying they apologized for the delay. I replied back to the email explaining that my account does not have my funds transferred.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1887,'02/10/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','state laws changed in XX/XX/2017 regarding child support reporting and I have requested to have information removed from all three credit bureaus child support is not a contractual debt, no services or products were given and amounts are not determined as such and should be removed from credit files. All 3 bureaus refuse to remove account ; they are using a computer system to verify debt which is invalid I have receive documents from Dept of Human Services and Courts stating that they do not report public records to credit bureaus so if the information isn''t getting verified from the source who or how is it getting verified. Along with Illinios DCFS these account are invalid for same reason I do not have contract and these items do not belong to me : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'state laws changed in XX/XX/2017 regarding child support reporting. all 3 credit bureaus refuse to remove account. they are using a computer system to verify debt which');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1888,'02/10/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','I have recently obtained a copy of my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit report. it showed a credit inquiry by your company that i do not recall authorizing. it is my understanding that you are not allowed to put an inquiry on my file unless i have given you express authorization to do so. Please have this inquiry removed from my credit report because it is affecting my loan applications and making it very difficult for me to acquire credit.','ALLY FINANCIAL INC.',2.0,2.0,'a copy of my credit report shows a credit inquiry by your company. it shows a credit inquiry by your company that i do not recall authorizing. please have this');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1889,'02/10/2018','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is attempting to collect a debt in the amount of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] without validation. I received a bill that I have no knowledge of. I believe this could be identity fraud. 

I decided to go and do research through the secretary of state ( Texas ) as of XX/XX/2018 ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] does NOT have an " ACTIVE '''' BOND to collect debt in the state of TEXAS. This is a huge violation. 

Section 392.101 of the Texas Finance Code prohibits a third-party debt collector or credit bureau from engaging in debt collection in Texas unless the third-party debt collector has obtained a surety bond and filed a copy of the bond with the Office of the Secretary of State.','ENCORE CAPITAL GROUP INC.',2.0,4.0,'a bill that I have no knowledge of could be identity fraud. a third-party debt collector or credit bureau cannot collect debt in TEXAS. the bill is ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1890,'02/10/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','This all started on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], when someone hacked into my online account and deposited a fraudulent check into my account for the amount of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They then changed my contact information and enrolled me into [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They made three online transfers from my savings to my checkings. The first amount was for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars and the last two transfers were in the amount of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] each. For a total of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my whole life savings. Then they proceed to make cash withdrawals from ATMs, stores, and online purchases as well. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I called Wells Fargo bank to report a claim of fraud on my account. The claim was taken over the phone but the information was incorrect and lost along the way with so many transfers between the departments. On the phone call, my account had a stop hold/ stolen place on my account. They said to close that account and open a new account that was still linked to that account. Over the phone, they changed my username and password for my online baking and even added a verbal password to my account. The agent told me that I would need to go into the branch to pick up my temporary card for my new account. I went into the bank that evening to pick up my new card but they were unable to help me. Once again I had to call the bank on the phone and they had to reset my account once again. A few days later I called to check on the status of my claim no new information was available. I received a survey in my email asking how I felt about my recent call to Wells Fargo. I was unhappy with my experience with Wells Fargo, so someone called me from my local branch and they set up an appointment to talk to a banker. I spent over two hours at this appointment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The original information for the claim was incorrect and things were missing from the claim. The banker also noticed that whoever it was still had access to my account because they were still ordering checks even with the stop hold/ stolen in place on my account.The banker told me that I needed to close out that new account completely and open a new account that had no connection to my original account. I opened a new account. While I was at the bank I spoke to someone who said he was going to start my investigation. He asked me questions, but it was hard to understand him and communicate with him. He told me that the person who would complete my investigation would call me within 24-48 hours but that never happened. A week later or so I received a phone call from the banker who had been helping me. He informed me that my claim had been closed and he asked me what happened. This was news to me so he gave me the investigator name and number and told me to call him. So I did just that I left voicemails with no replies.He never got in contact with me at all. After this whole ordeal on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I went into the bank to close my account. with no resolution to my situation.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'a banker deposited a fraudulent check into my account for the amount of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. they made three online transfers from my savings to');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1891,'02/09/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','A number of years ago, I paid my mortgage {$20000.00} in advance. This was supposed to take care of payments for a number of years. Unfortunately, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] continued to mark payments as late even though they had already been paid. I just went ahead and continued to send payments, as that helped. Most recently, I tried to make my payment on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s website on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], as I always do. This went as usual with no issues, or so I thought. When I returned to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] vacation, I had a late notice from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in my mail. I went to their website, saw that the payment had not been made, and immediately made the payment for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I reported this to them, but most don''t even understand English in their customer service department. They have marked me 30 days late 3 or 4 times even though my account was and is paid over {$20000.00} in advance. Now, I''m having trouble getting business credit due to this unethical company. I have hired a credit attorney and my next step will be to take action if they refuse to correct this error.','EQUIFAX, INC.',4.0,4.0,'a number of years ago, I paid my mortgage $20000.00 in advance. this was supposed to take care of payments for a number of years. a');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1892,'02/09/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Problem caused by your funds being low','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I checked my Arvest checking account online and had two transactions pending but these did not overdraw my account. They were both automatic withdrawals and I''d received emails from both companies stating that they had successfully withdrawn from my account on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I shopped at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and overdrew my account. HOWEVER, Arvest waited till XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. to post all 3 transactions so that I had 3 overdraft charges. This is not the first time they have done this to me and therefore they get as many overdraft charges as they can. I''ve tried to talk to customer service about this but they tell me it all depends on when the companies state they want their money. None of that makes any sense to me. PLEASE HELP','ARVEST BANK GROUP, INC.',2.0,2.0,'Arvest waited till XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to post all 3 transactions so that I had 3 overdraft charges.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1893,'02/09/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I have attached a letter in the attachments area below. I have sent more than 3 certified letters notarized and your company remains to bare inaccurate information on my credit without my consent and continue reporting inaccurate information basically tells me that no one is doing their job. This is my final attempt, if you could provide me with an original contract document showing my signature. If you cant provide me with an original contract it is a violation of FCRA section 609 and I demand that the inaccurate accounts removed immediately within 24 hours.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a letter has been sent notarized and your company remains to bare inaccurate information on my credit without my consent. this is my final attempt, if you could provide me with');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1894,'02/09/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','We''ve had this credit card since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. We got the card as newlyweds to start building credit to buy a home. We always paid our bills and had nearly perfect credit. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we used the card to help our son open a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Six months later, he unexpectedly passed away in a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. We lived 5 hours away from the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and hired a new manager who ran the business into the ground. We kept it going until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but finally had to close. Our income was low, and we just couldn''t continue paying the credit card payments. We called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and tried to see if we could work something out to settle our balance. They had already closed the account. However, it continued to show up on our credit report and dinging our account in the years since.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'we used the card to help our son open a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] six months later, he unexpectedly passed away in a [COMPTE');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1895,'02/09/2018','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','This company has an account listed on my credit report, not once but TWICE for the same amount. I''ve had an account in good standing with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for YEARS. I just recently closed my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account and went to a prepaid service, in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Meanwhile, this fraudulent company has a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account listed for {$1100.00} twice on my credit report. I''ve already sent in a letter and proof that this is not my account. I have not heard back and this is hindering my credit report. 

One account was last reported on last reported XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the other on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','Diversified Consultants, Inc.',2.0,4.0,'a fraudulent company has an account listed on my credit report. the company has a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account listed for $1100.00');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1896,'02/09/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Other features, terms, or problems','I called in to American Express in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to inquire about my Annual spending on my Delta Reserve card. The purpose was to see how close I was to my annual {$60000.00} required spend to receive an additional [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] delta MQM ''s which would have taken me to the next medallion tier with Delta. I spoke to a US Based representative who informed me that I had met the required spend in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and would receive my MQM ''s aprox XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and assured me that I didn''t need to do anything else. When those MQM ''s never came from Delta, I called in again in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to inquire. I was informed at that point that I was previously misinformed and that the card spend was on different AMEX cards ( I changed in Q1 from a business reserve to a personal reserve ) and for that reason I did not qualify BUT since the damage was done and I was led astray by AMEX, they would open an investigation and pull the call logs from my XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] call. If they could confirm ( which they did ) that I was told what I claimed ( which I was ) that AMEX would without doubt honor their mistake. I was told that would take 3 days and then AMEX would call me back. After 3 days I called again and was told that in fact it could take up to 60 days. When I advised that the time frame was unacceptable they escalated my compliant and I was told I would hear back in 14 days. After 14 days and no call from AMEX, I called and and spoke to US based supervisor [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] )  who assured me she would get to the bottom of things and would call me 3 days later on a Monday.. On Wednesday/Thursday I called in again and spoke to US based supervisor [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) who assured me that I would get a call back from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] right away. That never happened and I''ve since talked to 2 more supervisors who promised they would help and of course I never heard back. Several times I''ve been assured that AMEX would do the right thing and honor what they told me but no one there seems to care or have an ounce of accountability. I need help please!','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a representative told me that I had met the required spend in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and would receive my MQM ');
