INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1916,'02/06/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','Payroll card','Unexpected or other fees','I I have a checking account US Bank and my account was beached on XX/XX/18. I submitted all the required documentation to US Bank on XX/XX/18. On XX/XX/18 I was informed that I would not be reimbursed for my losses. When US Bank contacted me on XX/XX/18 I verified that I did not make the transactions and still my debit card was in my possession. 
