INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1968,'01/27/2018','Debt collection','Payday loan debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','There is a company that keeps pulling my credit. These credit inquires are hard hits that have dropped my score dramatically. I have not requested a payday loan but every year they keep pulling it. Last year they told me I owed them money which I did not. They then changed there story a few months later saying I applied which I have advised them I never attempted to do so.I would like them to stop pulling my credit without my permission. They most recently pulled my credit stating I requested it but I did not. 
I have asked them to never do business with my social security number or contact me prior to trying to establish a new loan they have refused.','DFC GLOBAL CORP',2.0,2.0,'a company that keeps pulling my credit is pulling my credit. they have not requested a payday loan but every year they keep pulling it. last year they told me I owed');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1969,'01/27/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose prepaid card','Problem getting a card or closing an account','On XX/XX/2017, I spent {$100.00} on a NetSpend Prepaid Debit Card. {$100.00} of that was to be credited onto the balance of the prepaid card, while {$2.00} of that was paid towards the activation fee of the card. 

After purchasing the card, I called NetSpend customer support to activate the card, so that I may use it. They presented me with too many hoops and hassles to use a simple prepaid card product, so I instead requested a refund for my purchase. The customer service representative obliged my refund request, and voided my card. The balance on my card was deleted and my card was rendered unusable. He told me that a check would arrive in the mail for {$100.00}, as my refund. 

About three months later, I called in again to ask about the status of my check, because I had still not received it. They told me they would send it again, but still did not. 

Now, it has been over 7 months since they were supposed to send me my refund check, and they still have not. When I call them, they purposely make the process as hard for me as possible. They ask me to send in all sorts of documents to them, to prove my identity and address, when all I want is a refund of my own money. 

But anyhow, I oblige them and send them the documents they request. Most recently, they requested proof of address in the form of a utility bill or bank statement. I sent them said document to the email address they provided. 

Then, I get a response in the email saying that this isn''t the proper procedure, because I have no reference number. Yet, I was never ever given a reference number. 

Nobody at NetSpend is willing to resolve my issues. They only bounce my issue back and forth between departments, so that nobody is ever going to help me. I only want my refund check of a {$100.00}. They have already voided the prepaid card I purchased, so it is only right that they refund me the money. I have received nothing for my {$100.00} purchase.','NETSPEND CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a refund request was made for a prepaid card. the balance on my card was deleted and my card was rendered unusable. the customer service representative obliged my refund');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1970,'01/27/2018','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','I am trying to payoff my loan. I have made two attempts. Both attempts they are rejecting my payoff. This is causing hardship on purchasing my next home.','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',2.0,2.0,'I have made two attempts to pay off my loan. both attempts are rejected. this is causing hardship on buying my next home.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1971,'01/27/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I used my debit card at a chain Auto Service Station, I paid for a service they said they could do but were unable to do. To avoid any further damage to my vehicle I took it to the actual dealer to fix the other merchants mistakes. 

I called Bank of America ( my bank at the time ) to explain what happened in great detail ( and probably 20 mins ) and asked if I have any recourse since I now just had to pay twice for the same service. The CSR explained that I could filed a debit card dispute since the merchant didn''t provide the expected service etc. The dispute was filed. Within days Bank of America put the disputed amount back into my bank account. A few months later I was traveling out of the country, and see that my account is negative! Also, pending transactions were charged overdraft fees or declined etc. ( Thank [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I had some cash with me ). I see that the disputed amount was reversed, so I called Bank of America and they told me my claim was denied because I had in fact made the purchase?? What?! I know, that was never part of the dispute. I believe the way the CSR entered the dispute was incorrect causing me to lose the dispute. I asked to appeal the decision. They told me that I should get an expert opinion regarding the work done. Perfect, so I went to the dealer ( who actually makes this vehicle ) they wrote a statement on company letterhead on my behalf. Appeal denied. Meanwhile over the course of this lengthy process, and Bank of America reversed the disputed amount causing my account to go negative, I explained that i will NOT deposit anymore money with them until this is resolved, to which they responded by closing my account that I had for about 15 years! Recently I went to open an account at another bank and was denied an account, and I learned it was because Bank of America put me in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] siting " ACCOUNT ABUSE '''' as the reason?! That is lie! I did nothing wrong. Bank of America was supposed to protect me from fraudulent merchants, or not mislead me into thinking they were going to dispute a charge then change their mind. They let a merchant scam me and then the bank abused me. 

I have been denied credit and the ability to open checking accounts because of the information Bank of America has inaccurately posted with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'bank of America reversed the disputed amount causing my account to go negative. the disputed amount was reversed, and the bank denied it. the bank said it was ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(1972,'01/27/2018','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Getting a credit card','Netspend credit card company obtained information on my underage kid and issued her a credit card in her name solely based on the fact she purchased something online ... they have her address and full name on the card and all we have to do is activate it. Im extremely bothered by how this company was so nonchalant about the future repercussions this could have caused. I called the company and they were very limited by the amount of information they gave me ... now Im worried about identity theft for her in the future! WE NEVER GAVE THEM THE RIGHT TO SEND THIS CREDIT CARD TO HER IN HER NAME! Please investigate their practices its NOT RIGHT and are dangerous to our youth! And to be clear I have not provided her name on any of this paperwork nor do I intend to in order to protect her from further issues ... I believe if you call them you will find out very fast they send out randomly issued credit cards regardless of age!','NETSPEND CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'netspend credit card company obtained information on my underage kid. they issued her a credit card in her name solely based on the fact she purchased something online. they have');
