INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2035,'01/16/2018','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I rented a room for {$770.00} on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the agreement I had with the landlord was that once I was offered housing in my university, I will be receiving my deposit back to me. However, that has not happened since I moved out on mid-XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. He constantly assured me that I would getting my money back starting the beginning of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Then he said he was having a financial issue and told me that the latest would be XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have attempted to contact him multiple times in order to resolve this issue. He has completely ignored all the messages and even pretended to not know who I was. Recently, I have filed claims with Chase and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Chase told me that they were reversing money back to him and I find that unjust. I do not feel as if there was any investigation done with this fraudulent claim. I was deceived by the landlord making this a fraud. Chase told me to contact [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and ask for their help. I have contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they will be getting back to me within the next 24 - 48 hours to see if they will be able to file a chargeback. I would appreciate any help from your department in this matter. 

Thank You, I look forward to your response.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,4.0,'a landlord told me that he would get my money back. he said he was having a financial issue and told me that the latest would be XX/X');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2036,'01/16/2018','Debt collection','Medical debt','Communication tactics','A few weeks ago, this agency called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] contacted me about some medical debt I owed. I told them I was invoking FDCPA, that they could not call me going forward, and to send the information. They stated I had to put the request in writing. I told them that FDCPA can be invoked by phone or in writing. They supposedly relented and agreed to send the information. I did get that information.

