INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2045,'01/15/2018','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], PA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] RE : Social Security Number:[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] To Whom It May Concern : I have recently been informed that there is negative information reported by lending Club in the file you maintain under my Social Security number. Upon reviewing a copy of my credit report, I see an entry listing chargeoff/collection/late on XX/XX/2017. 
I challenge the accuracy, compliance and reportability of this listing. 
Please validate this information with lending Club and provide me with copies of any documentation associated with this account, bearing my signature. In the absence of any such documentation bearing my signature, I formally request that this information be immediately deleted from the credit file you maintain under my Social Security number. 
