( 4 ) Have tried calling the help center [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( 5 ) Requested and submitted a form escalation ( 6 ) Sent multiple emails with minimal communication I do n''t think its right for coinbase to tie up funds like this. There are numerous other cases like this where people have their funds tied up for weeks with no direct communication. People deserve to know whats happened with their hard earned money. 

