INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2089,'01/07/2018','Student loan','Private student loan','Dealing with your lender or servicer','This company appears to be incredibly corrupt. When I was in high school, my parents unknowingly used this company for the majority of my loans, probably believing they were connected to the state itself ( as indicated by the company ''s title ). When I graduated and did not have a job within my career, they did not allow any income based repayment or deferment, so I was forced to pay $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] monthly from about a month after I graduated ( this does n''t include federal loans I also owed ). I graduated almost 7 years ago, and my payment has only moved down to {$490.00} after consistent monthly payments since then. Roughly, I have already paid them over {$40000.00} with no late payments, and my balance is still somehow greater than {$40000.00}. I feel completely entrenched by this company, and there is no end in sight because they are a private loan provider. Their website is horrific, their customer service nonexistent, and I ca n''t find any information about the company ''s " acting director '''' except that he provided incentives for students to write 5 star reviews on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I just believe something needs to be done about these business practices, and the source of their income needs to be investigated.','HIGHER EDUCATION STUDENT ASSISTANCE AUTHORITY (HESAA)',2.0,2.0,'a private loan provider is a private loan provider. the company is incredibly corrupt and has no customer service. the company is a private loan provider.');
