I ''m at a loss as to what is going on here and because it ''s impossible to interact with Coinbase, i ''m here to file a complaint.','Coinbase, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'''''We couldn''t complete one of your buys due to an issue with your payment method'''' '''' " '''' " " " " " " "');
