Hi [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]: Third request for information. Is there anyone else I need to speak to? 

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]: From [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]
Hi [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],
This is still under investigation. We spoke with them yesterday evening. They are researching the info provided. I should have some more info for you today or Monday.
