After much escalation and research, we have determined that the checks have in fact been escheated to the state.  Most states require compliance with the Uniform Disposition of Unclaimed Property Acts of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Uniform Unclaimed Property Act or laws similar to these Acts.  Accounts are escheated to the state of the customer''s last known address. If the address is unknown or foreign, the account would be escheated to South Dakota (the state where Citibank, N.A. is headquartered).

