INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2106,'01/04/2018','Mortgage','VA mortgage','Trouble during payment process','I have a mortgage loan with Pacific Union Financial LLC. This was a VA loan that I closed on in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] customer service that following year in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to ask them to increase my escrow amount given that the first years taxes were on my land value only and did not include my improvements ( my property ). I had an estimated bill from my county that showed the new escrow amount but they would not allow the increase. I then asked if I could send them extra funds so that there would be a sufficietn amount in escrow to pay taxes at which time they stated that any extra money would be applied to principal only. Given this outcome, I was forced to wait until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] paid my taxes at which time my account is now in the negative {$3000.00}. 

