INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2113,'01/03/2018','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','Starting in the summer of 2015 I had wanted to consolidate all my student loans so i could have one single manageable payment. When I found a consolidation company [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I gave them my information and I was told they were going to work diligently to gather all my loan information and come up with a reasonable payment plan. Three months later after calling once a week every week i finally saw progress on my payments and plans. As i looked at my credit score recently i noticed that i have a high impact rate during this time from apparent missed payments that i did not now i missed. Yet during this time i was waiting on a third party to complete my consolidation process.','Student Services',10.0,10.0,'i was trying to consolidate all my student loans so i could have one single manageable payment. when i found a consolidation company, i gave them my information and');
