INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2197,'12/15/2017','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Installment loan','Struggling to pay your loan','Requesting help regarding my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loan. Since the very beginning I been making my payments on time But lately due a serious hardship and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the family I requested their help and see if they can do something about the interest fees, rates and other charges and even forbearance programs to help out with the monthly payments of {$260.00} [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] will like me to default so they can add all the fees and charges and make my debt go from {$6000.00} to {$10000.00}. I called BXXXX [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] looking for help me another forbearance plan or deferment programs available but no help so far! instead I got transferred from department to department where nobody is willing to listen. The lack of professionalism is big and only inspire distrust to customers. This loan highly negatively impacted my lifestyle and got me in debt now i owed more than i borrow. 

