I am a victim of ID theft and two fo the three credit reports are now locked. Yet, I am still getting hard inquiries. 

I am also a VERIFIED victim of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] breach. 

I have TWO valid inquires. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] investors. THATS IT OVER THE PAST YEAR','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'credit reporting bureaus have received 60 to 80 credit inquiries. a credit report has been locked and is still getting hard inquiries.');
