INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2202,'12/14/2017','Student loan','Private student loan','Dealing with your lender or servicer','I initiated a student loan refinance through Sofi in early XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the loan was approved and finalized on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This was also to take over payment of a student loan that my mother had opened while I was attending school. I would be refinancing her loans to my name. She has been unable to make the payments on her loan so I have been paying them. I will refer to her [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account as my own since I have been making the payments. Sofi sent the payoff check in the amount of {$16000.00} to the wrong department at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which I found out after waiting two weeks for my balance at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to be paid off. After notifying Sofi, they found that the dept of education would need to issue a check from the US treasury and that it would take 4-6 weeks for that to occur. Because my old loan was never paid off, I was forced to make a payment to my old lender [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to stay current on that loan. However, with the 4-6 week lead time on the US treasury check and the reprocessing, I would end up needing to make another payment to my old lender [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as well as my first payment to Sofi in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I requested that Sofi move my first payment date out another month to accommodate their mistake, to which they denied. I tried working through the escalation team and was met with the same answer : they can not and will not move my due date. Not only was this not my fault, I currently have two student loans collecting interest, my original [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loan as well as my new Sofi loan ( which has been accruing interest since the check was cashed by the wrong department ). Currently I am waiting to hear back from Sofi when they receive the check back from the US treasury. In the meantime, I have my Sofi payment due on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment due on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','Social Finance, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'sofi sent a payoff check to the wrong department at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the dept of education would need to issue a');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2203,'12/14/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','IN XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I RECEIVED A FIRST MORTGAGE FROM [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] FOR A NO DOC LOAN TO PURCHASE A CONDOMINIUM IN [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] FLORIDA. I MADE REGULAR PAYMENTS UNTIL THE REAL ESTATE CRISIS OCCURRED IN XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] AND THEN BEING IN THE REAL ESTATE BUSINESS MY INCOME FELL TO NOTHING. I COULD NO LONGER MAKE PAYMENTS. AS SOON AS THEY ACCELERATED THE LOAN I APPLIED FOR A MODIFICATION AT THEIR INVITATION. THAT PROCESS TOOK TWO YEARS AND I WAS DENIED. 

THE BANK THEN AGREED TO A SHORT SALE AND WHEN I RECEIVED AN OFFER THE BANK CHANGED THEIR MIND AND REFUSED TO SELL THE CONDO ON A SHORT SALE. THIS TOOK A COUPLE OF YEARS TO PLAY OUT. 

I THEN WENT TO MEDIATION WITH THE BANK AND THEY AGREED TO A DEED IN LIEU OF FORECLOSURE. MY ATTORNEY PREPARED AND SUBMITTED THEIR APPLICATION AND THEN THEY CHANGED THEIR MIND AND DID NOT ALLOW IT. 
I THEN SUED THE BANK FOR PREDATORY LENDING AND RECEIVED A DEFAULT JUDGEMENT BECAUSE THEY DID NOT APPEAR IN COURT. THE JUDGE SET THE FORECLOSURE ACTION ASIDE. 
FIVE YEARS LATER I SUED TO SET THE MORTGAGE ASIDE AFTER THE 5 YEAR STATUTE OF LIMITATIONS EXPIRED WHILE THERE WAS NO FORECLOSURE ACTION IN PLACE BY THE BANK. THE JUDGE RULED IN MY FAVOR AND THE MORTGAGE WAS SET ASIDE AND CANCELLED. 
THE BANK THEN APPEALED TO THE FEDERAL COURT TO HAVE THAT DECISION SET ASIDE. THE FEDERAL COURT JUDGE REVERSED THE STATE COURT RULING. WHILE THAT ACTION WAS PENDING THE SUPREME COURT OF FLORIDA RULED THAT ALL SUCH ACTIONS WERE TO BE PUT ON HOLD UNTIL THEY RULED ON THE 5 YEAR STATUTE OF LIMITATION. TWO YEARS LATER THEY CHANGED THE LAW IN FAVOR OF THE BANKS AND RULED THE 5 YEAR STATUTE DID NOT APPLY BECAUSE THE MORTGAGES WERE STILL ON RECORD THEY COULD FORECLOSE A SECOND TIME. 
IN XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] EIGHT YEARS AFTER I STOPPED PAYING ON THE MORTGAGE, I REAPPLIED FOR A MODIFICATION WITH THE MORTGAGE SERVICER, SHELLPOINT MORTGAGE SERVICING, AT THEIR INVITATION. I HAVE SUBMITTED EVERY DOCUMENT THEY REQUESTED OVER AND OVER AND AFTER MONTHS GO BY THEY AS FOR THE DOCUMENTS AGAIN BECAUSE THE DATES ARE TOO OLD. THEY HAVE DONE THIS SEVERAL TIMES THIS YEAR. THEY NEVER GO TO LOAN COMMITTEE. 
I HAVE REQUESTED THEY REDUCE THE MORTGAGE BALANCE TO AN AMOUNT THAT I HAVE THE ABILITY TO PAY DUE TO THEIR MAKING THIS NO DOC LOAN TO ME WHEN THERE WAS NO WAY I COULD HAVE QUALIFIED WITH NORMAL DOCUMENTATION. I AM PREPARED TO BEGIN PAYING THE MORTGAGE WHEN AND IF THEY SETTLE WITH ME ON A REDUCED MORTGAGE AMOUNT.','Shellpoint Partners, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a DOC LOAN LOOKED IN FLORIDA, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. a ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2204,'12/14/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','Written notification about debt','I have been getting telephone calls from someone who identifies herself as " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' who claims she is a debt collector but refused to give the name of the company with which is was supposedly associated. She said that in order to stop further action on this issue I needed to call [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

