I have n''t done any business with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for about a decade. I was provided with NO PROOF of any debt owed. 

I looked up True Accord online and found that : " TrueAccord Corp has been sued for using debt collection practices that allegedly violate the FDCPA. '''' Since they came back to back, I ''m assuming that the bogus telephone call ( which obviously violated debt collections rules ), and the bogus email which claimed I owed money I do not owe for an account that is over a decade old ( also in violation of debt collections rules ) were from the same company/individual.','TrueAccord Corp.',2.0,2.0,'a debt collector claims she owed money for an account that is over a decade old. she says she refused to give the name of the company with which is supposedly associated ');
