ey was applied to my Sears Credit Card. This despite the fact that, I do not own a Sears credit card, have not shopped there in at least a decade and have certainly never received any correspondence from Sears concerning any account! I also asked why was my check even applied to this [ non-existent/fraudulent ] account when the check expressly said that it was to be used for the secured card application. He did not have an answer and simply said he doesnt know what goes on in the mailroom but will now ask for a check to be issued/mailed to me and will personally call me to confirm once this is done. I asked, what about the Insufficient Funds charge which was entirely the fault of Citibank? He said he can not guarantee this but will try. 

