The perception EQUIFAX Credit Reporting indicates that I filed Bankruptcy three different era when I fact only I file Bankruptcy once in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], not three times as being indicated on EQUIFAX Credit File! 
If my claim above is disputed by the Bankruptcy Court, please provide me with a copy of any viable evidence s ( submitted by the Court ) so that I may elevate this matter with Consumer Financial Protection Bureau ( CFPB ). Otherwise, please delete all three very old account from my Credit File ( beyond Seven Years Limit ). 
I trust [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] will avoid perceptions of acting in bad faith, and will continue to comply with the Federal Trade Commission ( see 15 USC 41, et seq. ).','EQUIFAX, INC.',8.0,10.0,'if this is the case, I''m sure you ''ll want to handle this matter as soon as possible''. a copy of my original request, the dated');
