As of writing this the results of the investigation page from experian is down, and I can not provide the reports','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'experian claims to have investigated account that was reaged by debt collection agency. experian said the document was not used, even though it is the original statement. ex');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2219,'12/11/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','I own a condominium with a mortgage from Wells Fargo. I have been uploading my insurance certificate repeatedly to their website at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for several months, faxing the info to the number I was given, and have made two telephone calls to them. Yet I keep getting notices saying that they do not have my current insurance information. Now i just received notice that they have purchased insurance for me, despite my already having insurance. No matter what I do I ca n''t seem to get this resolved, and if feels like they just want to charge me for insurance. It ''s very frustrating because I ''ve wasted a lot of time trying to fix this. My insurance agent has confirmed that Wells Fargo has all of the property information and that my own coverage is in place. Wells Fargo is not easy to work with.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',4.0,4.0,'insurance agent confirms that wells Fargo has all of the property information. he has been uploading my insurance certificate to their website for several months. he has made two');
