To this day, my credit report states that my account is somehow still open, but that it was also closed on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My credit report also inaccurately shows that my account was 120 days late between XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was on a payment plan at that time, made every payment on time, and met all the requirements of that payment plan by XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], so there is no reason for that to be on my credit report.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was ill and had to take a leave of absence from work. he had automatic payments');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2269,'11/30/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','On XXXX16 at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . We reached a settlement agreement and he promised my debt will be deleted from my report after payment. Auth # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for payment. The account is still on my credit report as a negative item.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'XXX16 at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we reached a settlement agreement and he promised my debt will be deleted from my report after payment.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2270,'11/30/2017','Vehicle loan or lease','Lease','Managing the loan or lease','I have lease 2 Vehicles with GM Financial, they are both electric and qualify for no sales tax in Washington state. Both my contracts show the correct payment but GM Financial is reporting to all the credit reports my payment with Tax included and also the payments listed online and on my statements are not correct. They are showing my payment with Tax which is not correct.

I have called Gm Financial about this multiple times and nothing has been done','GENERAL MOTORS FINANCIAL COMPANY, INC.',2.0,2.0,'GM Financial is reporting to all the credit reports my payment with Tax included and also the payments listed online and on my statements are not correct.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2271,'11/30/2017','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','I have been trying to reach my mortgage company and have sat on the phone for hours with no answer multiple times. I have also authorized someone to speak on my behalf and they sat on hold for hours as well with no response. I have emailed with no response and submitted for modification. I started working for a company that works with HUD and they need to know status of my modification or I could face termination. My mortgage company has had my modification paperwork since the beginning of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and still can not give me a response. I emailed one last email and FINALLY received a response from someone in their client liaison department and he has been very kind BUT still do not have an answer. I do not wish to lose my job or my house ... below are just a few things that have happened since I have owned my home. I do not know what to do. I was told by HUD that my lender is not a HUD approved lender also ... so I am confused as to why they would be managing my loan and if that is why my first modification was approved and then rejected? Is that not against regulations?? I will be contacting an attorney and also someone with HUD for guidance. Please if you can help me at all it would be appreciated.. see below for more information ... 

When I purchased my home in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my fiance and I moved in together and got married a year later. My then husband lost his job and it became harder to pay all the bills solely on my income. He then took a job out of state and was making decent money and contributing more soon after that in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we separated and divorced and it was back to just me paying for everything. I then fell so behind that I almost lost my house as I had to take money out from my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and ask for help from others to be able to save my house. The payments kept adding up and the attorney ''s fees were piling on, it was terrifying. I do not want to go through this again. After I got the house out of the pending foreclosure last year I then filed for a modification, it was granted a trial period for 3 months to see if it could be fully modified. I was so happy and paid the first trial payment, when I called to make the 2nd payment I was told that I was no longer on the plan and that they needed further information and the modification trial period had cancelled. The payment could not be accepted and I now owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] full payments which I did not have. I was told that the trial amount would be mailed to my address in the following few weeks, I waited and waited but it never came. I called to speak with a manager at CMG to see if they could tell me where it was it took [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] business days and they let me know once I called back that it was sent back to the checking account it was drafted from. I had no access to that account as it was my ex-husbands who had made that payment for me and therefore no longer had that payment to give to CMG. Then the snowball effect started and I have been behind 2 months ever since. I was let go from my job in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that job paid me [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] plus overtime, it took me about a month to find a new job. I did find another job but it only paid [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with hardly any overtime. My ex-husband and I were going to mend things in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and he was going to pay the bills while I went back to school to get my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and that was only going to be for a year, I quit my job and went to school full time. That only lasted a few months then he left me again, with nothing. I got back on my feet and got a job but it only paid [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with overtime, I was not even making enough to support my household but at least I had a job. I then found a better job, the one I have now that pays me [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with the possibility of overtime in the future months. lam able to support my household on my own, I just need to get caught up. I have asked to make one and a half payments a month to catch up but I was told by CMG customer service agents that that is not possible and that per the Investor they have to have so much ( it changes monthly ) upfront or they can not help me in a re-payment plan. I do not have anything in savings as I used it last year to get myself out of this very predicament. If I had it to give I would not be behind, all I want is to be caught up and this worry to go away. I am very stressed, this is honestly why I go to work every day. I am proud of my house and what I have accomplished, I do not want to lose it because I am a few months behind and no one will help me. lam trying to get my credit back on track also but honestly, I only care about my home at this point. Hopefully I will be approved for a modification and can get a handle on this and can start re-building my life. Life is full of circumstances and it is not what happens to you but how you come back from it. I am just asking for a chance and some help, please help me get this under control so I can get my life back together. 

Thank you,','CMG MORTGAGE, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a mortgage company has had my modification paperwork since the beginning of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and still can not give me a response. my mortgage company has');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2272,'11/30/2017','Debt collection','I do not know','Threatened to contact someone or share information improperly','I have been receiving calls from these people for about a week but I never answer because my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  has there number filtered as a scam number ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) but today XX/XX/17 a rep named [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] left a voicemail stating there is a case naming as a defendant and they will pursue unless I call them at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. So I call the number and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] an account [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] answers the phone giving the companies name as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. He wants me to verify DOB and SS # which I did not do because these people are clearly scammers. He refused to give me any information and he stated that since I would not verify my personal information he will be calling a bunch of random people and just giving them the ss # and DOB they have on file and then hung up in my face. I called back and got [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who immediately hung up when I asked for their address. I called back again and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] answers and he said he is not providing me with their address or a mailing address and hung up in m face again. These collection practices are not only illegal but they violate ALL consumer credit debit collection laws. If these people continue to harass me and break the law I will file a law suit. I have them recorded!!!!!!!!!!','Integrated Recovery Services',2.0,2.0,'a rep called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] left a voicemail stating there is a case naming as a defendant. he wants me');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2273,'11/29/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers','Capital one told me that if i opened a spark business card It would help me build business credit and it would report to my business credit report. They marketed the card to me as a Spark Business credit card. I specifically asked them during the application process would the card report to my personal credit report because I was working on my personal credit and opening new debt hurts my report. They told me that it wouldnt. Well thats not true. I found out that it did in fact report to my personal credit report. Its been hurting me ever since as I started using the card daily to run my business. Then the balance got so high from Interest rates and fees that Ive been struggling to pay it. When I called them to close it down and complain that it was ruining my personal credit report they told me that they cant close it with a balance. So I disputed the card with the credit bureaus as improper reporting. i lost the dispute. They allowed them to continue to report this to my personal credit. IT IS ruining my life to this current day.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'i disputed the card with the credit bureaus as improper reporting. they allowed them to continue to report this to my personal credit.');
