INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2283,'11/28/2017','Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service','Mobile or digital wallet','Confusing or missing disclosures','I closed my business Paypal account in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with a zero balance which Paypal says it has to be to even close an account. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Paypal linked to my new account with {$560.00} in it and froze it without warning. 

Apparently their was credit card chargebacks on my old account that I had previously closed. There was 11 customers who received their luggage and they chargeback on my account that was closed. If I was alerted to this problem and showed Paypal my tracking numbers these customers would not have been able to chargeback on my closed account because it would have showed that the luggage was delivered in good working order. But since I was not notified by mail or email which Paypal had and did not notify me, a amount of {$600.00} was charged back on my old closed account. 

When I closed the account, Paypal assured me that nothing can be done to me account if it was closed. 

They linked my account which they have in the past and it was fine with notifications and I had alway been notified. 

This time no notification, no alerting me, no emails, phone calls, no mail to my address all of which they have on file. 

I had to use this money for my child support payment which they froze without warning. 

Now I am out of the {$560.00} which I had in my account and I will never see again. Now I understand if they would have alerted me I would have had ample of enough time to fight the chargebacks and my so called mysterious balance. I am out my luggage that these folks still have and never returned and I am out {$600.00} from Paypal. 

This is freud and I also know they are not a bank and apparently unregulated. I am surprised that there is nothing I can do in this case and feel like an am robbed of my money with Paypal. 

There are folks who have this happen to all the time. But my case is a closed account. This is new and never has happened with Paypal. It just happens to be a new thing fro them to do what they want without cause or warning. 

Please help. I can be reached at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','PAYPAL HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,2.0,'a total of $560.00 was charged back on my old closed account. the account was closed with 11 customers who received their luggage. the chargebacks were not');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2284,'11/28/2017','Debt collection','I do not know','Communication tactics','I keep getting on a daily bases sometimes a few times a day calls from a number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] saying I need to call [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I work in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] so it is very hard for me to call back during the same business hours i work. I had time to call back to to figure out why am i getting so many calls daily. i called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a man picked up asked me if I was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and verify SSN. I told the man I would not be giving any info can he give me the name of the company so i may know if the collect was a fraud or not. He said I need to verify information. I tired to explain to the man my rights as a consumer he started to over talk me yelling and than just he hung up the phone. I called back a female answered this time I stated my name and i had already been treated rudely by the previous rep and than that lady became quickly loud and rude. I explain i still am not sure what you business is calling me for no is telling what this debit is for. She began to over talk me while i was trying to speak. I keep asking the ma''am to please allow me to finish my statement she also got loud to over talk me and hung up. called third time is the charm to figure why are they calling so much and this time i asked for a supervisor to explain to her the treatment by call reps. I spoke with a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] now i am recording the call my self i let [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] know the call was recorded for my own protection based on the previous treatment. As i started to explain to her how the reps hung up start yelling saying so you not going to pay your debit, yet i do n''t even what they want to pay.','Atlantic Recovery Solutions LLC',4.0,6.0,'i call back to figure out why am i getting so many calls daily. i called a woman who said her name and hung up the phone. she was ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2285,'11/28/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers','I received a promotional offer addressed to me personally from Chase Bank for their [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] card that offered [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bonus miles into my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] frequent flyer account if I applied for a card and spent {$3000.00} in the first 3 months of use, and an additional [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] miles if I added an authorized user. I applied for and received the card, but was told that the promotion would only give me [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] miles. I complained to Chase Bank at the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] # on the back of the card and received a letter dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017 from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Customer Service Specialist saying they could n''t fix the problem and I can only receive [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] miles. I called again and spoke to a supervisor and was told the same thing. This is simple bait and switch. They offered me [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] miles, I accepted the offer and they will now only give me [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] miles. I called twice to let them know of the error and they said they could do nothing about it.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'a promotional offer from Chase Bank was sent to me personally. I applied for and received the card, but was told the promotion would only give me [COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2286,'11/28/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Fees or interest','In early XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I initiated a balance transfer of {$10000.00} on a Chase Slate credit card. The online form I filled out indicated that the fees generated from this transfer would be {$0.00} because I was initiating the transfer within a promotional window that allowed by free balance transfers. 

However, after the transfer went through on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was charged a fee of {$520.00}. Chase indicated that even though I submitted the transfer before my promotional window closed, the transfer did not go through until AFTER the deadline, and so I was charged the fee. 

I argued with Chase about this since I had no power over how long the transfer would take and I feel like they lengthened the transfer time specifically so they could charge me a fee. 

I sent numerous messages and made phone calls to the company to recoup my fees but was rebuffed.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'a balance transfer was initiated on a Chase Slate credit card. the online form indicated that the fees generated from this transfer would be $0.00. however, after');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2287,'11/27/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Struggling to pay your bill','Citi/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] cards is 6 months past due and according to company the debt has been charged off. The last statement received had a due date of XX/X/17. I called the company before the due date to request a payment solution as stated on the statement. The company representative stated during the call that there was nothing they can do with the account since it was under review. Apparently, during a review Citibank will not discuss payment solutions or even take a payoff over the phone or web. My only option was to send a check to a company address and hope for the best. I escalated to a manager to speak with internal contacts. They refused to provide contacts to assist with a payoff plan in order to have the issue settled before the due date. I can provide the statement as backup to this complaint. I do not think an account should be locked out and possibly sent to an collection agency if the customer is seeking to resolve the issue at hand.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'the debt has been charged off. the last statement received had a due date of XX/X/17.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2288,'11/27/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Closing your account','I received a Lowes ( Synchrony ) card in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2017 with a limit of {$3000.00}. I purchased a hot water heater and a few other items and paid it off before the 6 months interest rate promotion was over. In the Summer I attempted to purchase a few more items and was denied because my credit limit was reduced significantly to {$100.00}, I was in the store, spoke to customer service and they called to see what was going on. I was told that they did a credit check and decided to reduce my credit limit. I was livid and they said there was nothing they could do and maybe in 6 months I could see if the credit limit could be increased. I proceeded to purchase the items with the credit I had available and immediately paid that off when the bill came. Fast forward to last week, I received a letter stating the account has been closed because of a credit check. Please note, I do n''t have a balance on this card. I believe this credit card company has ruined my credit. I have other store cards and credit card companies increasing my limit while Lowes/Synchrony is decreasing my limit and closing my account.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'lowes card was issued in 2017 with a limit of $3000.00. I tried to purchase a few more items and was denied because my credit limit was reduced significantly');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2289,'11/27/2017','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Closing an account','I was told over the phone with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that my  accounts were closed. His company lied to me about services that would be available to me repeatedly in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Rather than close my accounts they quietly collected all of my remaining funds ( FRAUDULENTLY ) and then charged for 3 months more " service '''' in the accounts. Now they have HARASSED me repeatedly, REFUSED TO ANSWER MY COMPLAINTS, and FRAUDULENTLY STOLEN MY FUNDS SINCE XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The company allegedly records all phone calls and will not allow you to record them, but can not disprove my consistent and documented story. They have not responded satisfactorily to my complaints and are rude and unintelligent ( or perhaps poorly trained ) in my communications with them. This CORPORATE ENTITY is taking advantage of me, A HUMAN, AMERICAN, CITIZEN, and I demand that they and the CFPB resolve this issue promptly by immediately returning all funds in my account as of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and ceasing and desisting any and all attempts to collect the fraudulent {$60.00}. CHASE LIED AND NEEDS TO BE HELD ACCOUNTABLE!','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,4.0,'a company allegedly records all phone calls and will not allow you to record them. the company allegedly records all calls and will not allow you to record them. they have not');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2290,'11/27/2017','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Installment loan','Charged fees or interest you didn''t expect','I applied for this loan with Wells Fargo. I asked for a fixed rate for 4 years. It was a {$35000.00} personal loan at 10 % fixed rate. My current balance as I am writing this is {$12000.00}. While viewing my account I noticed a payment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that I made ( my payment is {$640.00} monthly ). Principal payment was {$570.00} and interest was {$77.00} ( 647.98 ). The following month I made a payment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], {$640.00} : Principal payment {$420.00}, Interest payment {$210.00}! I called Wells Fargo and asked how could the interest payment go from {$77.00} to {$210.00} on fixed interest rate? First I was told my payment was a fixed amount but my interest was n''t. I specifically ask for a fixed rate which I was told I had, but now you are telling it ''s adjustable. Then Wells Fargo came back to say that the interest rate is fixed but the payment is due on the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and if I make the payment after the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], it affects the interest payment. I countered that the two payment I ''m referring to were made on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When you amortize interest it goes down every month base on the principal balance. Will you please look into this.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'I applied for a loan with Wells Fargo. it was a $35000.00 personal loan at 10 % fixed rate. my current balance as I');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2291,'11/27/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','False statements or representation','In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a debt collector for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] claimed I owed a " ULT '''' student loan at University [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). The debt collector claimed to be working for the government institution [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but then they directed me to pay the commercial company ACS. I asked for promissory note and any other documentation. They said they do not have a promissory note and sent me computer screen print outs. In a letter was threatened that if I challenge their claim they would raise my interest rate to 18 %. I then contacted the Department of Education and The National Student Loan Database asking about the loan and the agency ACS. I have found that there is no record of any " ULT '''' student loan. I have done my own research and have never found a such loan called " ULT ''''. I have printed my entire student loan history. I have receipts showing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance on student loans at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I tried to access my transcripts and discovered there was a hold. This hold on my transcripts was my cause to sue and I filed a lawsuit for fraud on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have since discovered a trail of fraud including a XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] tax intercept and that they ( ACS and or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) were debt collecting concealed under a different name in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on my credit report. When I did a debt of validation on my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit report to dispute a unknown claim I won that debt of validation and their claim was removed. At that time I had no cause to sue due to the concealment I was not able to make the connection that ACS was in fact [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] frauduently attempting to collect a non existent debt. After I filed the lawsuit I was contacted by an attorney for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] asking me to sign something and they will give me my transcripts. I of course refused to sign anything. This is 100 % fraud and I have collected a great deal of documentation to prove it. I have since been to 3 court dates where the attorney for ACS still has not provided any documentation of any debt instead has continually tried to delay the proceedings by not sending me notices and filing motions to dismiss. The next court date is XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','ACS Education Services',2.0,4.0,'debt collector claimed to be working for the government institution. he then directed me to pay the commercial company ACS. he threatened to raise my interest rate to 18 % ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2292,'11/27/2017','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','UNEXPLAINED AND INEXPLICABLE CHECKING ACCOUNT CLOSURE Dear Recipients, I am alerting you as well as giving you the opportunity to correct a mistake before it becomes a Media or Legal problem for Chase. 

Last night while at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], CA, my purchase was declined. Embarrassing and also Alarming I left the store without my Purchase. 

I proceeded to log into my account via my phone and the Chase App, on my phone. The App denied me access to my account, so I decided to call the Customer Service phone number to find out what had happened. 

This what I was met with, : '''' Sir we have decided to end our Banking Relationship with you after Internal Review the Decision was made '''' " What information was used or what decisions had been reached, using what data, to make that decision '''' I asked. 

The response was that they have no responsibility to tell me or explain the Decision. 

Pretty Incredulous RESPONSE to a simple inquiry. 

As a Politically Active [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Man who is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and uses my account for the primary purpose of Receiving Federal Funds from the US Treasury and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Benefits, I can only surmise that Chase Bank engages in Discriminatory Practices, for people such as myself. 

I would have to assume this based on the lack of reason being provided. I know that Social Media as well as Stories of Interest, can be a powerful tool to bring about change. I also have no problem involving Media, Politicians and using full weight of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Community to bring about an instant response. 

Why do I need to do that? 

I activevely suggest and require a response immediately to mitigate any further action on my part. 

Sincerely. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Show quoted text','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,4.0,'''''I am alerting you as well as giving you the opportunity to correct a mistake before it becomes a Media or Legal problem for Chase. ''''I am not');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2293,'11/26/2017','Checking or savings account','Savings account','Closing an account','A person owns me some money and she paid me with a check, I deposit that check in my Bank of America saving account but the check bounced ... In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank of America decid to close my saving account and they do not refund my balance of {$2000.00} Back in XX/XX/XXXXI was fraud victim and I think they are relating and retaliate agains me because of the bounced check ... it is unfair, I been customer for more than 11 years and I never have problem and I done nothing wrong ... They ban me for 5 years from their institution and they make feel like criminal.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'bank of America decid to close my saving account and they do not refund my balance of $2000.00 Back in XX/XX/XXXXI was');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2294,'11/26/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','There seems to be a problem with the Credit Reporting Agencies. I submitted a complaint because they we ''re not reporting my balances and accounts as they should. Now they have added the accounts that I have paid my balances to zero, and my credit score has n''t increased. I have gotten my balances way below 30 % and my credit score has stayed the exact way. I have paid off 4 credit cards to zero  balance, and my score has n''t changed. I am beginning to feel that there is some sort of discrimination going on with the reporting agencies. I had 4 credit cards that are now zero balance why has n''t my score changed. When I was over my 30 %, my score dropped almost 85 points. Now that I have those balances below 30 % my score is still showing no increase. I need this investigated, this is becoming very frustrating. I do n''t trust this system what so ever, I have done my part, and this system is not doing it ''s part. It is very disappointing, especially if I am working very hard to keep my debt balances low. I will be finding a lawyer, according to the Fair Credit Reporting Act. I will sue [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Experian, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and whoever. This is causing so many problems on every level. I am going to be purchasing a home, and they are not fairly reporting and increasing my score as it should My score should be increased to almost 80 points. I ''m tired of what ''s going on, and I will be seeking legal representation on this. Please help me, CFPB. If you see my attached document, my score was at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] before they added all of my accounts that I paid down to zero, and when they added these accounts, my score has n''t changed it is still the same. Also for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] it has n''t gone up hardly any points after paying 4 credit cards to zero, and experian this is so frustrating.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a complaint was filed by the credit reporting agencies. the agency added 4 credit cards to zero balance. my score hasn''t changed since I paid 4 credit cards to zero');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2295,'11/26/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','I have been making payments on my loan for 5 years. The numbers do not add up when I do the math and I tried calling them many times in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I spoke to multiple people over the phone and then tried to chat and still no help. We just went around and around. I told them I was going to have a company look into how much they were charging me and they quit responding to me. I just kept making my payments until this month when they charged me over {$200.00} in interest. I have a pretty good log on payments and balance and just want a clear and transparent explanation of why I am being charged so much. Please help! Thank you.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'i have been making payments on my loan for 5 years. I tried calling them many times in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2296,'11/25/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I became delinquent with a business credit card account with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reported my delinquency with the three major credit bureaus ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Transunion ). They also hired a collection agency to collect the debt. I reached a settlement agreement with the agency and paid the agreed amount in full per the contract. As soon as I paid the full settlement amount, that is when all my problems began. It has been a nightmare of process that is still ongoing and has severely hindered my ability to get credit and financing ... things that I rely on and need both personally and for my business. In short, as soon as the settlement was paid, all three bureaus reported incorrect dates on my personal reports essentially " re-aging '''' my debt. The issue solely stems from the DOFD or " Date of First Delinquency ''''. The correct date of the First Delinquency is XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Currently, all three of the credit bureaus have different dates listed for that delinquency. The most damaging is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], who has the First Delinquency date of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They also removed all the history of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account with an exception of one date ... that being XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Please note that I personally contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they have CONFIRMED the First Date of Delinquency as XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Now, after the confirmation with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I sent registered letters to all three bureaus TWICE to dispute the incorrect information. The first was in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( as soon as the saw the drastic change in my report and massive drop in my credit score ). All three bureaus responded with letters stating that the account was " updated ''''. However, nothing was updated in all three reports. I then sent the SECOND set of registered letters to all three bureaus in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating the information I provided to them was verified by the creditor ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). Additionally, I asked them all to please tell me how they were able to " update '''' or " verify '''' the account. I also stated that because they all have the information incorrectly reported, even after my disputes, BY LAW and the FCRA, they must delete the entire account since they can not get it correct. Unfortunately, I received the SAME EXACT RESPONSES from ALL THREE OF THE BUREAUS with no change to my report. They just sent me generic letters with absolutely no answers whatsoever. As it stands today, my personal report is still incorrect and even more frustrating, all three bureaus have different information for the same [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account. The entire process has been a nightmare and has wrecked me both financially and mentally. I DO NOT know what to do at this point. I hope that the government will assist me in this matter.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a credit card account was reported by the three major credit bureaus. they hired a collection agency to collect the debt. the issue stems from the DOFD or " Date');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2297,'11/25/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose prepaid card','Problem with a purchase or transfer','American Express Blue Bird is unlawfully holding a cancelled cruise ticket as a " merchant review ''''. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has physically sent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the proper amount of money to return to my card account. In the card holder agreement it reads as this under " merchandise returning merchandise '''' : " If you wish to return any merchandise purchased with a Bluebird Account, Bluebird Card, Family Account or Family Account Card, you will be subject to the merchant ''s return policies. If the merchant agrees to issue a credit, such credit may take as long as seven ( 7 ) days or longer to post and be reflected as Available Funds. In the event credit is issued on a return of merchandise not originally purchased with your Bluebird Account, Bluebird Card, Family Account or Family Account Card, such credit ( s ) may be treated as an invalid transaction and can result in suspension and/or closure of your Bluebird Account, Bluebird Card, Family Account or Family Account Card, as well as such credit ( s ) being deducted from your Bluebird Account, Bluebird Card, Family Account or Family Account Card and sent back to the merchant of record. If you return merchandise that, when originally purchased, was subject to an offer or other promotion that resulted in a credit to your Bluebird Account or Family Account, any return of such merchandise will result in the credits being deducted from your Account or Family Account. '''' On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I cancelled a cruise ticket through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] line. The refund was {$120.00}. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I made the same payment amount to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. In the card holder agreement listed above, it references " merchandise ''''. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] line sent me no " merchandise '''' on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or any time there after previous to the cancellation. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] claims in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] plus calls I have made to their customer service line since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], that the policy is strictly enforced as stated in the agreement. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has failed to provide me with a list of " merchandise '''' that was purchased on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Lines. Further more the card holder agreement states : " The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Card ( and each Family Account Card ) is a prepaid payment device which, among other uses, may be used to pay for goods and services at bricks-and-mortar and online retailers and other merchants that accept American Express Cards, both within and outside the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and to obtain cash from ATMs that permit American Express transactions within the United States and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], in each case subject to the terms and conditions of this Agreement. Transactions conducted using a Bluebird Card will be funded from and to the extent of Available Funds in your Bluebird Account, and transactions conducted using a Family Account Card will be funded from and to the extent of Available Funds in the relevant Family Account or as otherwise provided in this Agreement. Where applicable, present the Card to the merchant at the time of payment and sign the merchant ''s receipt with the same signature you used when you signed the back of the Card. The Card can also be used to make purchases over the internet, by mail order, or by telephone. If you experience any difficulty making a purchase with the Card, please call Customer Service for assistance. You agree to use the Card only at merchants that accept American Express Cards in accordance with the terms and conditions of this Agreement and only for lawful purposes. The Card may be used to make a final payment in respect of a car or other rental, but may not be able to be used to make a car rental reservation, a hotel reservation, or other reservation or deposit. Merchant categories are determined by merchants and other parties, and you agree to hold us harmless for any transactions that occur as a result of inaccuracies in merchant classification. Cards may not be used for any type of illegal activity or prohibited sale or gambling or as otherwise prohibited by this Agreement, and you agree not to engage in any such illegal or prohibited activity when you use ( or allow others to use [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] your Account or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Account with a Card. See Section 19 for a list of activities which are prohibited under this Agreement. '''' Note where it states : '''' The Card may be used to make a final payment in respect of a car or " other rental '''', but may not be able to be used to make a car rental reservation, a hotel reservation, or other reservation or deposit. " ( the words " other reservation '''' do not specify that a dinner reservation, airline reservation, or cruise reservation can not be made. " Other '''' has no clear definition, but car and hotel are " specified ''''. ) On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the CS rep stated that a cruise is considered a " commodity '''' ( Paying for services ) The agreement allows for a card holder to pay on " other rentals ''''. On a cruise a room is paid for or " rented '''' as a service. Cancellation on this type of transaction is not considered a " merchandise return ''''. The card holder agreement does not reflect the word " commodity '''' anywhere within it. Conclusion : American Express stated that ALL refund transactions are subject to a 7 day hold no matter what via the phone conversations. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I had 4 actual " merchandise '''' returns ranging from {$1.00} up to {$89.00} that were NOT held for 7 days or longer for review. In reviewing the card holder agreement it is not expressly written that it " will '''' take 7 days to make funds available. It clearly states on " merchandise returns '''' only that it " MAY '''' take up to 7 days or longer. In this case " merchandise '''' was NOT returned. A cancellation of a service occurred which [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] allows under its agreement. No reference is made in conjunction with this type of return anywhere in the card holder agreement. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] does not list any " reasonable '''' reason that any " merchandise return [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) '''' are subject to " holding ''''. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has illegally withheld monies from my access against its own cardholder agreement. I have requested that the funds be made at the conclusion of the business day [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. American Express has failed to release the {$120.00} as of the date of this complaint.','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'american Express Blue Bird is unlawfully holding a cruise ticket as a " merchant review ''''. the merchant agrees to issue a credit, such credit may take as long');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2298,'11/25/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is reporting a negative report on an account that is outside of the 7 years statute. According to the report the original delinquency was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2010. 
