INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2348,'11/14/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Closing your account','I have had a credit card account with Capital One for almost 10 years. For the last several years ( 4-5 years ) there has been a {$0.00} balance on my card. I get my statements every month to my email and look at my account to make sure there is no activity on the card. I have the app download and use it regularly. Yesterday, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I received an email : " It ''s been over four years since you ''ve used your credit card account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. As a result, your account has been restricted as of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], which means you no longer have charging privileges, and it will be closed due to inactivity. Your account will remain restricted, and it can not be taken out of restriction prior to closure or reopened once it is closed ''''. 
I called Capital One and spoke to 4 representatives on the phone trying to clear up this obvious misunderstanding since I did not receive any notification my account was in danger of being closed prior to the account being shut down. I spoke with 4 representatives including 2 managers ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) who told me the decision was final. I asked to speak to their managers or someone who would be able to assist with this issue and they told me I could hang up and call back to talk to someone else or I could write a letter. There was no one in the company that could reverse this decision. I asked both [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] if I could get a copy of the signed agreement that Capital One had that said that they had the rights to close my account without noticed. Both " managers '''' denied my request. They did both tell me that could rerun my credit and I could open a new account. 
This issue hurts my credit due closing a line of credit and reducing my available credit and closing my longest revolving account.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'a credit card account has been restricted for almost 10 years. the account will be closed due to inactivity. the issue hurts my credit due closing a line of credit ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2349,'11/13/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Fees or interest','I called USAA consumer service on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to question the continued interest on a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] cash advance and was told nothing could be done to rectify to matter. 

