The bank told me that it was too late to do anything about it, because the check was from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], however I told them as soon as I found out about the fraud, which was after the landlord told me he was not the one who cashed the check. There was no way for me to know earlier that a thief had cashed the check and not my landlord. 

