INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2362,'11/10/2017','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Title loan','Problem with the payoff process at the end of the loan','I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], AZ on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] today, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017 to pay off my title loan in full because the car no longer runs & I dont use it, so need to junk car. Last statement amount is {$510.00} but they charge interest daily. Im changing bank accounts & had debit card from my joint account instead of account they have on file. Was told I could not pay off my loan in full except with card on file over the phone, only make a 1 time installment payment for the minimum amount. I told them I couldnt come into the store because I moved out of area. True. The location is in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], AZ & I live over an hour away in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], AZ. They wouldnt take money from me/let me pay off loan. I told them repeatedly I found it odd they didnt want to take my money & it seemed like they didnt want the money & if they wanted their money they needed to let me pay off the loan or they could just have the car. They refused both. I asked to speak to a manager. First woman claimed to be a manager, so I requested to speak to someone above her. She finally agreed after I insisted & put me on hold for several minutes. Then another woman got on the line & claimed to be a manager. Im not convinced either employees were really managers. She told me I couldnt pay loan off or give them the car & they had a lien on the car so I had to make payments. It made no sense. I want to pay loan so I did something Im not proud of, I lied & said I moved to California & couldnt come to location. She still wouldnt let me pay the loan off. I asked to speak to her boss. She told me she was the boss. I told her she must have a boss. She told me to call corporate [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] number & leave a message. I went to website where theres zero information on paying off loans, only information on taking out title loans. I filled out a contact form asking why it was impossible to pay off loan & telling them if they wouldnt allow me to pay off the loan, I was having car towed to their [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] location this weekend & that the account they have on file is being closed.','AAA Auto Title Loans, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a manager refused to take money from me. she told me she must have a boss. she told me she must have a boss.');
