INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2395,'11/04/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','False statements or representation','I am writing this letter to file a formal complaint. I was contacted by a representative for this account. As I explained to the representative the case was dismissed in court. However, even though it was dismissed in court, without me owing a debt, I did legally live in the unit and paid the rent. I went to the bank, and did research on the check. I found out the cashiers check was never cashed. I had the check reissued, the representative explained that there was an amount owed for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I explained to the representative, I was not in the unit, and was not paying. A collection agency can not take over from a court of law, I sent in a vacate notice in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. We were in court in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I am not paying for a month in which I was not there. I asked to speak to a supervisor and spoke to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] informed me, it did not matter what the court ruled, and the company sent this account for collection. I explained to him I am not willing to pay when I was not there and I am not legally responsible. You can not overrule a judge, he told me to check my lease. I again stated what occurred in court, and explained that I would file a bk before I pay for something that I did n''t live in. He told me keep the cashiers check, and keep my money. He then hung up. Since that call, I have continued to be harassed by him and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] threatning to sue me. I finally gave them the name of the BK attorney. I know it is illegal and a debt collection company can not override a judge','I.Q. DATA INTERNATIONAL, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a collection agency can not take over from a court of law. a collection agency can not take over from a court of law. a collection agency can not take');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2396,'11/03/2017','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Payday loan','Can''t contact lender or servicer','I received a call today trying to verify my personal info. they refused to say what for so i refused to provide them with the info. then they said it was for a debt from Cashnet for a payday loan in 2006. i have never heard of Cashnet nor did i receive any loan from any payday loan services. I contacted Cashnet directly, they first tried to tell me i needed to provide a police report from 2006. Which I will not due because my ID was n''t stolen and it ''s been 11 years since this supposed loan which they are just now contacting me about. I asked for what they said my ID was stolen and used for a loan. Which referred me to another company " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as the phone number. I called this number and they tried to tell me i won a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] gift card. I told them i did n''t care about the gift card and wanted to speak to someone about this alleged loan then i was hung up on.','ENOVA INTERNATIONAL, INC.',2.0,4.0,'i received a call trying to verify my personal info. they refused to say what for so i refused to provide the info. they said it was for a debt from');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2397,'11/03/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had recently filed a judgement against me in 2015 and by the time it had reached me it had went to an attorney and they had issued a writ against me. I tried on numerous occasions to rectify the situation and I took my case took court and the attorney admitted this was not my account so the attorney and the court located in the state of Michigan vacated the judgement but yet and still [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has refused to delete this item from my credit report.I would also like to recieve a deletion report within 24 hours of the resolution.','Meyer & Njus, P.A.',2.0,2.0,'a judgement was filed against me in 2015 and the judge had issued a writ against me. the judgment was vacated by the attorney and the court located in the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2398,'11/03/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','I have 9 inquiries reporting on my credit file that was unauthorized I had no knowledge of them some are from 2016 the unauthorized inquiries was removed in past all of a sudden after this equifax breach the same inquiries reappeared.I sent letters to all 3 credit bureaus asking these inquiries be removed because I have n''t applied for anything.I also had a fraud alert added to my accounts with the bureaus.I sent out letters to each company directly it ''s been over 60days I received no response.To my knowledge all consumer reports should be true of what ''s it is being reported.These bureaus have allowed many fraud accounts to report in my report for years that have already effected me negatively. For instance I ''ve attached a letter from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which was a account that was opened when I was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years old.I sent letters for years asking them to investigate and remove account explaining to them I was only [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years old when accounts was openeded which made it impossible for me to have .They sent back letters saying verified for years and did n''t remove it until I contacted you last month now the accounts are gone .Under the fair credit act these bureaus must provide Validation if asked I ''ve told them these inquiries was fraudulent and I ''ve asked them to send me a copy of what information they used to verify these inquiries was accurate and if they could n''t verify and validate the inquiries listed with company they must be removed within 30.I sent two more certified letters and received no response. .All 3 bureaus refused to send me anything in return other than verified on credit report.This is a Violation .unverified accounts listed below that remain on my credit report in violation of 15 U.S.C. 1681. You are required under the FCRA to have properly verified the accuracy of an account listed on my credit report. In the results of your the bureaus investigation, they stated in writing that they verified that these items are beingreported correctly. Where are the documents that they used to verify these accounts? What is the name of the person in your company who verified these accounts? What documents did they use to verify them? Im still asking the 3 bureaus please provide me with the name of that individual, their business address, and telephone number. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Law Dictionary, 9th Edition, 2009, defines Verify as, 1 ) " To prove to be true ; to confirm or establish the truth or truthfulness of ; to authenticate. '''' 2 ) to confirm or substantiate by oath or affidavit ; to swear to the truth of. '''' and Verification as, Confirmation of correctness, truth or authenticity, by affidavit, oath, or deposition. Affidavit of truth of a matter stated and object of verification is to assure good faith in averments or statements of a party.
What this means is that your company must be willing and able to produce a document in your files that proves the account ( s ) in dispute belong to me and the information being reported is accurate and you must be able to do this in a court of law if I file a lawsuit against you. Someone in your company must authenticate the documents in your files that were used to verify the disputed accounts and to do this they must have 1st hand knowledge of the alleged account ( s ) and all that has ever transpired for the alleged account ( s ), under oath and under the penalty of perjury.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'9 inquiries reporting on my credit file that was unauthorized were removed in past all of a sudden. they were removed in past all of a sudden after this equifax breach');
