Deceptive advertising has no place in the financial marketplace, said CFPB Director [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Todays action is delivering relief for consumers deceived by Paymap and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and sending a clear message that these practices will not be tolerated. 

