INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2416,'10/31/2017','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage','XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] applied for an online quote and lock in mortgage rate for an FHA 30 year fixed loan with J. G. Wentworth Home Lending, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], FL with agent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].. Agent said she needed an authorization to pull my credit to lock in a rate. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I gave authorization. Loan agent said she locked in 3.625 rate for an FHA loan for me on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a 60 day lock and said she would send me confirmation of the lock. She asked me to provide all my financial information on their site which I did. She asked me to send in all supporting financial documents which I did. I called numerous times without response asking for the lock in quote she promised. No positive response. I emailed her after about 20 days of not receiving it. No response. The following day I gave her an ultimatum to send the lock in quote she promised and that J.G.Wentworth advertises that you can get the same day, and if I did not receive it I would file complaints. No response the next day but the following day I received a rubber stamped introduction letter from her stating to fill out a computer based questionaire which obviously been tampered with. No matter what figures I submitted in the 6 question format, it stated I did not qualify unless iI had excellent credit and a whopping 70 % down payment. Only under these terms would she be able to get me 3.875 %. Its obvious this was a passive/aggressive way to attempt to humiliate me by fraudulently tampering with the system she submitted to me. These are foolish qualifications which indicate to me she did not lock in the 3.625 as promised. I had already been pre qualified by two other lenders and was seeking this company because they advertised lower rates. She wasted my time, and now that my escrow is getting ready to close, my new lender wants to charge me {$5000.00} in points to bring down the current rate of 3.875 % to 3.625 %. I am accusing J. G.Wentworth of 1. false advertising, 2. false promises, 3.misleading, 4. misrepresentation, 5. improper lending practices, 6. possible mortgage license violations, 7. fraud, 8. personal financial damage, 9. improper use of my personal financial information.','The J. G. Wentworth Company',2.0,4.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] applied for an online quote and lock in mortgage rate for an FHA 30 year fixed loan. agent');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2417,'10/30/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I used a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to buy books for college classes I was taking off of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. After using the account to make the stated purchases, I discontinued using [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for any future purchases. The Credit Card linked to the account expired and was not renewed. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was contacted by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to discuss possible fraudulent activity on my account. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] representative stated a Laptop was purchased [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] using my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and shipped to an address in California. I was asked if I made this purchase. I stated that I did not make this purchase. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] recognized that my account had been dormant with no use since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They stated that this would be investigated and stated they would contact me with any further information. I was contacted a second time by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating they confirmed this was possible fraudulent activity and would cancel this attempted charge and apologized to me. I stated in both phone conversations to please ensure my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account was closed so that no charges could be placed on that account. This was recognized and further communication was given to me stating that all charges would be removed and the account closed. I completed all phone conversations with them to process the charge for investigation of fraudulent activity. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was contacted by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating that I owed charges for a purchase in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the stated laptop above. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stated they attempted to contact me for dispute of the purchase, but was unable to reach me. I stated the charge and activities were inaccurate. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stated they understood this, but I was still responsible for the charges. Please help','Convergent Resources, Inc.',2.0,4.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] used a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account to buy books. the account expired and was not renewed ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2418,'10/30/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','I purchased a vehicle through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I authorized them to run my credit once. I now have several hard inquiries [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] called me in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to notify me that I needed to call the lender because the lender needed to conduct a survey because [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is having issues with the lender until I do the survey. I contacted the lender and did the survey, however now I see that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ran my credit through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] more times without my authorization. I have my loan through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The unauthorized inquiries that are reflected on my credit report are through TD Auto Financing, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and COAF.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'unauthorized inquiries are through TD Auto Financing, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the lender');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2419,'10/30/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Fees or interest','I received my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2017 credit card statement from Synchrony and on that statement I am being charged interest. Instead of following my instructions of paying {$70.00} on the promotion charge and the rest on my other auto charges they are reducing the full amount of my payment toward only the promotion amount and not deducting from my other expenses as instructed causing me to incur interest charges.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'I received my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2017 credit card statement from Synchrony. instead of paying $70.00 on the promotion charge and');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2420,'10/30/2017','Vehicle loan or lease','Loan','Managing the loan or lease','I have been attempting to make my car payment with Chase bank for over A month now. First I ran the payment through my bank, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and Chase never pulled the payment. Chase informed me that they were not able to get the payment to run through correctly. I then attempted to give them my debit card number over the phone to pull the money, which in the past I have always been able to do this with Chase if necessary. The chase representative advised that they will no longer use debit card transactions to take payments because it cost them too much money. After they were unable to pull from my bank I transferred the car payment funds to my husband ''s bank account with our local credit union. We contacted Chase and provided them my husband ''s bank account information to pull the payment and a week later the payment had still not been posted. We contacted Chase numerous times and they have gave us multiple reasons why they had not pulled the payment first they tried to tell us that it was because my husband ''s bank rejected the payment request when they posted it we contacted my husband ''s credit union and they advised that Chase has never made any attempts to pull that payment from his account. We call Chase back and then they say that perhaps they had the wrong account number my husband again confirmed for them the correct account number to pull the payment we waited again for another week and again no payment was a palled we called back they tried to tell us that the credit union advised there was no account for that number we again confirmed with Chase that they had the proper number and they assured us that they would try to pull it again. After another week went by we received a letter from Chase that stated they were unable to pull my car payment from the credit union again because the credit union refused their request. We contacted the credit union who again assured us that no request from Chase had been made and that they would even show us the reporting to show proof that Chase has never attempted to collect my bill. We called Chase back again and Chase confirmed that they did not know why the payment was not pulling from that credit union account. So We pulled the money from my husbands account at the credit union and transferred it back over to my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account. We contacted Chase last week to have the payment ran through my checking account again it did not pull again We called Chase back at the end of last week the representative treated us like it was our fault the payment has been late and like we were doing something wrong they advised that we needed to perhaps open a Chase account to ensure the payment could be made or to visit a local Chase branch. We advise them that we do not have any chase banks in our area and that I do not have any other problems paying my bills through both the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the credit union account. Chase stated that for some reason they are not able to pull billing requests through GoBank to make payments I question how this is possible because I have had my GoBank account for two years now and in that two years I have made payments for my car through Chase. I advised Chase that I need to make my payment as I now have another monthly payment that is due and I am going to be going up against a 60 day late if they are not pulling my payments they assured me would be pulled. They told me I would need to send a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment to them to avoid re-possession of my vehicle really Chase I now have to pay a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] fee because you can not pull my payment from my bank account or my husband ''s credit union account? I have been MORE THEN WILLING AND TRYING TO MAKE MY PAYMENTS!!! Additionally they charge me daily fees for being late and fees because they are unable to pull money from my account which have not even happened. I want any late fees removed from my Chase account immediately and any negative reporting removed from my credit. I want the CFPB to look into why Chase is not pulling payments from consumers bank accounts and then instead advising that the other financial institutions are not providing them access to pull those funds. This is an incorrect and in accurate statement by Chase they are using this to collect additional fees and to damage my credit I do not appreciate this and this is becoming financially devastating to me and my family.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'the car payment funds were transferred to my husband''s bank account. the credit union refused to pull the payment and contacted the credit union. the credit union said they were unable');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2421,'10/30/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Credit monitoring or identity theft protection services','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I filled out a form on the Experian website to receive a " free '''' credit report. Once I had submitted my information, it only shows certain reporting information for " free '''' and says if you want your credit SCORE, you have to pay {$1.00}. So, I paid the {$1.00} to get my credit score. What the website does a VERY poor job of explaining is that in paying that {$1.00}, you are signed up for some sort of " membership '''' program that costs {$21.00} per month. If you do n''t call and cancel the membership within 7 days, your membership automatically renews for eternity. I was unaware that I was being signed up for this program, and when checking my credit card statement today ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), I saw that I had been charged {$21.00} on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and another {$21.00} on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. It should also be noted that in going back through my junk email folder I noticed several emails from Experian, NONE of which were receipts or notices of being billed for the membership. I found a very generic " Welcome to Experian '''' email, that had I seen at the time, I still would not have known that I had signed up for any sort of membership. Reading the email, it seemed like typical follow-up marketing when you give out your email address. No mention of the cancellation period, no mention of being charged for anything, it does n''t even mention the word membership until the very BOTTOM of the email. When I called Experian to dispute the charges, explaining that I was unaware of being signed up for any sort of membership, they were only willing to refund one of the charges. I even spoke with a supervisor and no one was willing to help. The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] charge has not even gone through on my credit ( still pending ), yet Experian told me there was nothing they could do to refund the charge and that I would have the membership benefits through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Thanks Experian, that ''s so helpful! I get another month of a membership that I did not sign up for, I do not want, need, or find helpful, and there ''s nothing you can do about it. These types of practices are extremely deceitful and should be stopped!! I am certain that I am not the only person who has been tricked by this process. This needs to end, and the victims compensated justly.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a credit report shows that you are signed up for a " membership '''' program. if you don''t call and cancel the membership within 7 days, your');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2422,'10/29/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Trans Union are not responding to any of my many requests to investigate, verify and remove accounts from my credit reports/files that were opened fraudulently.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Trans Union are not responding to any of my many requests to investigate, verify and remove accounts that were opened fraudulently.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2423,'10/29/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','Im victim of identity theft are contacting your credit bureau ( EQUIFAX ) to inform you of my lawsuit against your credit bureau. Currently, the Pretrial Conference is scheduled for ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). The lawsuit was filed due to the utter lack of response from your company. When someone is the victim of identity theft, it is simply a nightmare trying to get false information removed from a credit file. Im also suing Equifax for being negligent regarding my credit files being affected by the cybersecurity incident, and breach with ( EQUIFAX ). This credit bureau had a enormous security failure, and it has affected millions of consumers worldwide. I am one of those consumers that have been affected, and Im seeking justice regarding fraudulent accounts that are being reported on my credit files at this time. My social security number, drivers license, birthdate, and personal information was COMPROMISED/AFFECTED by the cybersecurity incident. I have filled out my information online under the website : equifaxsecurity2017 and it clearly shows that my ( PERSONAL INFORMATON WAS AFFECTED BY THE BREACH ). The consumers as myself that have been affected should not have to deal with having fraudulent accounts reporting on their credit files. Due to this incident all consumers that where affected should have their credit files, and personal information updated/restored. If fraudulent accounts where opened in their name, and their information was compromised it is your credit bureau department to have those accounts REMOVED/DELETED off of the consumers credit files. I should not have to suffer, or battle with fraud accounts that where opened in my name due to the negligence of your credit bureau. This breach has caused me so much grief, has put me in a financial bind, have made me have to go through the emotional/financial stress of dealing with creditors that are trying to validate ( FRAUDULENT ACCOUNTS ), because my ssn was compromised. I have contacted the false creditors listed on my credit file with the companies who have reported fraudulent accounts on my credit file by the name of : ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). I have challenged all of the false listings on my credit file. Over 90 days ago I wrote this creditor, and your credit bureau as well in question and demanded proof that I am their customer. I asked for proof of the alleged debt, including specifically the alleged contract or other instrument bearing my signature. So far none of them has been able to provide such proof to me. I have sent follow-up letters to each of them and there is still no proof. I have attempted by phone contact, but I simply get transferred around and nothing ever gets accomplished. I have fully investigated my rights in this matter. Under the doctrine of estoppel by silence, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] v [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( Mo ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I may presume that no proof of the alleged debt, nor therefore any such debt, in fact exists. I have copies of the letters, several police reports stating that this is a fraudulent account, and dates prepared to bring to court on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Also, under the Fair Credit Reporting Act, these disputed items may not appear on my credit report if they can not be supported by any evidence. Under the Fair Credit Reporting Act, if they can not verify the debt within 30 days, then it must be removed. Your letters to me claim to have " VERIFIED '''' the debt, but this is in fact not true under law. Simply contacting the alleged creditor and asking them to match up numbers in their database is no sufficient verification for identity theft. Someone has stolen my identity and used my information without my authorization. Now I am suing your credit bureau EQUIFAX for reporting falsified debt on my credit files without proper verification that this fraudulent account belongs to me. I have provided more than sufficient evidence to have these fraudulent accounts REMOVED/BLOCKED off of my credit files. I also had 3 other fraudulent accounts that where opened last year around the same time this fraudulent account was opened. I have the letters from those creditors whereas they DEEMED all 3 accounts ( FRAUDULENT ACCOUNTS ) in which they REMOVED/BLOCKED those accounts from reporting on my credit files. Im attaching my latest police report to show that these are fraudulent accounts giving more proof of my fraud claim at this current time. Your fraud department also have prior police reports that show that these accounts are fraudulent accounts as well. I have also filed a identity theft report with the ( FEDERAL TRADE COMMISSION ) with the government regarding these fraudulent accounts on my credit files with your credit bureau ( EQUIFAX ). Im attaching that document as well which shows even more proof of these fraudulent accounts, and your credit bureau reporting false information still. You may contact me before ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) via mail before the court date to begin the lawsuit process to rectify this situation at hand. This matter can be settled simply by your agreement to remove the false information from my credit file PERMANENTLY. I require a response in a timely manner regarding your credit bureau deleting this falsified information off of my credit file. If I get another pointless letter from you saying that it has already been " VERIFIED '''' then there will be no more opportunity for negotiation. This will proceed in court until I have successfully proven to a judge that this false information must be removed from my credit file. I will also be aggressively pursuing the full judgment that I can get against Equifax for violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act and Defamation. I have already won a similar lawsuit against [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Credit Bureau. I will agree to a similar settlement with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], if you contact me before ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). If you accept the same terms as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] did, then I will dismiss my lawsuit against Equifax and you will NOT need to appear in ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], GEORGIA ). The items to be removed from my credit report are listed as states : ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). Please take in consideration my concerns regarding this matter and I hope to hear from you in a timely manner. ATTENTION : Your fraud department have ( 2 ) police reports on file that clearly state that both of these accounts are fraudulent accounts in which, I shouldnt be held liable for. Your department have more than enough proof, and documents to DELETE/REMOVE this account off of my credit files immediately!','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'the lawsuit was filed due to the utter lack of response from your company. a credit bureau breach has affected millions of consumers worldwide. a credit bureau breach has caused me so');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2424,'10/29/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I have contacted this company on 3 separate occasions attempting to get a validation on an inaccurate account they continually furnish. My letters have been unanswered. I filed a complaint with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  requesting this company provide me with a contract or documentation bearing my signature specifying the terms and conditions of this account. Despite my very specific and yet legal request this company has refused to provide any information. In response to my previous request a representative from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stated their only obligation is to identify the original creditor, the date opened, and the current balance. Clearly they are idiots to put it nicely! If you think that as consumer any company or collection agency can just say you owe without and proof is merely ridiculous. By the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a documentation must be provided. You as a company can NOT just say you owe and that it it, do you know how much fraudulent activity would occur if this was the case. I am seeking assistance in someone educating and inform this company of the law. I was told hat the loan had been recalled from collections [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] not sure what that mean ) I think that was an attempt to misled me. I was also told that debt validation was " on its way '' however I still have n''t received anything','2288984 Ontario Inc.',2.0,4.0,'a company has refused to provide a validation on an inaccurate account. a representative from the company stated their only obligation is to identify the original creditor. a documentation');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2425,'10/28/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Other features, terms, or problems','I used chat to explain the issue to Capitol One on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] (I have a log to attach). In short, I was unable to log into the credit card online account because the password that I had was no longer correct. BEFORE I contacted the company, I was able to reset the password and gain access. I was troubled because I was sure that neither me nor my wife changed the password. Moreover, when the password is changed, an email is sent that tells me that it was changed. I had not received such an email, which further raised my concerns. I contacted Capitol One through a ''chat-agent''. I requested the date of the last password change. I am NOT the primary account holder, that is my wife.They refused to tell me the date of the last password change (prior to the one I just did a day before-XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]). I then explained to them why I still needed to know more. You see, I change the password the day before using: Her SS#, her DOB, and the Zip code. These items would be readily available to anyone who had the date from the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  breach. I am concerned that ANYONE using this company''s credit cards would now be at risk, as their security questions are too weak. They did assure me that they did not have a general failure in their system that would have lost/invalidated user passwords, so either: (1) The data field in their Database holding the password was corrupted; (2) Someone broke through their limited security to reset the password AND intercepted the email confirming the change (quite a trick);  (3) We inadvertently changed the password earlier in the month and just plain forgot. In that I use a password manager (1Password) even the 3rd possibility is unlikely. In any event, this is potentially an extremely important problem that can threaten the credit card accounts of any user of the Capital One scheme for resetting passwords.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a ''chat-agent'' contacted Capitol One on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. he asked the date');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2426,'10/28/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CHASE BANK offered me a Loan Modification of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] per month  which were paid on time.  Someone caused funds that I paid to be funneled to a different account (as identified by Attorney [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] )  That amount of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. created a computer missed payment triggering a foreclosure (I wonder who did that?) , and difficult to discover.   Then, I was foreclosed on by publication from Chase attorneys [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with no prior indication there was an issue. (I discovered today that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] were indited committing an elaborate schemes changing signatures, modifying and inserting documents to fit their plans to deceitfully acquire my property, Which they did.    The final hearing is XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]!  1700 foreclosures in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] were put on hold due to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]!
Thanks for alerting after I lost my house, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],  It would almost seem like you were in on it.   I wonder if the judge knew also?


Learning from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], my defense Attorney yesterday, that there appeared in my file a turn down letter denying me a loan modification which I have never seen and I believe that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] may have fabricated this document, and other documents and placed them in my file.  Causing the deterioration of my ability to negotiate with my bankers.

Evidence of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and collusion is that when asked in front of Judge [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] (in the records) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Judge, by my Attorney [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], on my 
behalf for the documents and payment history of the loan modification   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] claimed that a LOAN MODIFICATION WAS NEVER ISSUED.

We then filed a motion for an affidavit of payment history.   I continued to ask [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for that accounting but [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] would not provide them until this loan was sold by CHASE until it wound up in the hands of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].

By this time [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] just gave up.   Then I found another Attorney ([COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was my 3rd Attorney)  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was on NOLO and after speaking to many attorneys I found him to be very analytical and determined illegal activities had taken place and would like to reopen the class action, because again CHASE denied any payment history took place because there was no LOAN MODIFICATION,  which is now in our hands and verified by 2 CHASE EMPLOYEES.

Now is the time to present this to Judge [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] gets the evidence to Judge [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],  this is what Judge [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said:   


[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],

Traditionally, the arguments are credited to the party (you) rather than his advocate (attorney).  Essentially the thought is the party had a chance to present this evidence, and must not have for some good reason.  I was asked why you didn''t present this evidence previously, and I stated that it was present in an earlier construction of the file, but not orally argued.  I said I couldn''t state why it wasn''t orally argued because it wasn''t me who argued it.  I believe I said "I can''t know previous counsel''s mind." Most judges are willing to let an attorney come in and at least give it a good try with a new argument, but I expect you faced some prejudice due to the age of the file.

With that said, I stand by my statement on the appeal.  Your evidence presented meets the standards for a motion to vacate and it should have been set aside with a new hearing on the merits.  If I were a judge, I would have vacated based on this evidence, because it goes directly to your liability.

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]
Attorney at Law

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]
