INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2435,'10/26/2017','Debt collection','Payday loan debt','Took or threatened to take negative or legal action','One main was disputed by all credit bureaus in the month of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. A letter of debt validation was never received in response to any of the disputes. The account was removed from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] report ( I have provided the screen shot displaying this information ) but came back verified on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( I am also attaching the documentation from Experian showing verified status as of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the company One main reached out to me in the form of a letter ( attaching a copy of that as well ) not to provide documentation or any contractual agreements for this alleged debt but a letter willing to reduce the debt amount significantly up to 90 % in hopes that I would contact them and settle and I did not. The letter stated this was the ''Final Opportunity '''' and that I had to respond before XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On today XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit score took a 96 point  decrease which is detrimental making it very difficult almost impossible to acquire credit especially when you were looking to buy a house in the next couple of months due the account jumping from a closed status to open without my knowledge or any documentation in writing saying an account that has been closed since XX/XX/XXXXis now open and not only open but has a missed payment causing my payment history to decrease from 100 % to 96 % and my credit age history to drop because it is now factoring this account. I have attached screenshots for all this information. I need this information reviewed and corrected and removed immediately. I am beyond upset and frustrated the amount of ways and things a company go about affecting a consumer ''s everyday life.','ONEMAIN FINANCIAL HOLDINGS, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'one main was disputed by all credit bureaus in the month of [COMP