INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2447,'10/24/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','Last year I attempted to set up automatic payments during a phone call with Capital One. Several months later it came to my attention that this did not happen and because of this Capital One has placed several extremely derogatory marks on my credit reports with all 3 bureaus. I have tried to rectify this with Capital One and even with taking some fault myself for not following up during a dark period in my life to make sure the expected minimums were being deducted Capital One has continually refused to make any type of compromise and offer the slightest goodwill adjustment in my favor. I have even provided my phone bill to the executive office team where a 9 minute call was highlighted that was when I recall activating a card and then transferring to customer service to set up these automatic payments. After several weeks of waiting not only does Capital One refuse to make any adjustments they also refuses to provide any transcript of the call to show that these 9 minutes were spent differently than I recall. Any assistance in reaching a compromise in this matter would be highly appreciated.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'last year, a phone call with capital one was made during a call. it came to my attention that this did not happen and because of this, Capital One has placed several extremely');
