INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2458,'10/22/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I ''m including all of my CFPB complaints, my AG complaint, my proof that substantiates the fact that I never received a breakdown of the amount they are claiming that I owe, my identification and all other communication. 

Reason for complaint : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Simon ''s Agency have failed to provide me anything that substantiates the amount that is listed on my credit report for a collection account. I am tired of going back and forth and it is my RIGHT to have the proof that backs up the amount I allegedly owe. Section 609 protects me against false reporting. Section 1681 guarantees me an investigation into this and for the bureaus to investigate independently. I ''ve provided the proof directly from the collection agency that I did not receive a breakdown and only received an invoice with a total amount. 

I refuse to pay an amount listed on an invoice without the breakdown showing where that amount came from, the receipts that back it up and it must be within federal limits. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] provided court testimony and was paid the federal fee of {[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I stated that I would pay for the expenses but wanted a breakdown, and this was the understanding. As you can see from the attachment, the only thing that I ever received was an invoice with the heading " itemized statement '''' with 1 line that says " court testimony and prep [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''''. Where did this amount come from? Where are the receipts for this amount? Where ''s the breakdown that lists the mileage, gas, and anything else allowed by law? When I call, I get hung up on. When I dispute this with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they state that this has been verified. 

This is willful negligence on part of both parties and this could have been easily solved by providing me what I had requested, what I had been promised and what is my right to have. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is now in violation of sections 623, 609, 1681 and 603. Simon ''s Agency is purposely not providing me this information because THEY DO NOT HAVE IT. If I take them to court, they will need to provide this information during the discovery process. This means that the office of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] does not have, nor did they ever have, the required information to verify this alleged debt. 

This MUST be removed from my credit report because over and over again, I have proven that this is a violation of my rights and that there ''s no proof substantiating the claim that I owe this amount. Once again, I am not refusing to pay the actual amount that I owe. I am, however, refusing to pay a debt that was not legally verified, nor do I have to.','Simon’s Agency, Inc',2.0,2.0,'CFPB complaint: ''i''m tired of going back and forth''. ''i''m RIGHT to have the proof that backs up the amount that is listed');
