INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2507,'10/12/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Getting a credit card','I visited Commerce Bank in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Missouri [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I have been a customer there for several years and someone was fraudulently using ach debits on my personal checking account to make payments for their own account. This was the second time within 2 weeks this matter occurred, to speed up the process in order to get my money back I had to go there in person to sign an affidavit. During my visit with the bank manager [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] he claimed there was nothing the bank could do and this is what I have to do each time this happens. I explained my income is Social Security money and I was worried if this kept happening that my money could all be tied up and I would start bouncing auto payments or missing payments I have due. He said they had a good deal on a credit card with the bank that had no interest for a year and could payoff another credit card and be charged only 5 % interest on that and on overdrafts, it was better than having the standard overdraft protection the bank offers although there is a fee of {$20.00} each time instead of the {$37.00}. He said, I can you an answer in no time and it will only take a few minutes if that. I agreed to start the process and decided I would payoff my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and close it out as a result. During the application process this manager just up and asked me " how long have you been [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]? '''' I was stunned, no one ever from a business stand point had ever asked such a question ... very personal and unrelated to finance or my ability to finance I thought. Almost simultaneously following that very disturbing and inappropriate question question, the process which I was assured would only take a few minutes changed to .... '''' they ''re going to have to review your credit and consider a limit, I ''ll have to get back to you later today maybe ''''. I was in complete shut down, stunned that I was being singled out for being [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], asked questions unrelated to business, and more or less spinning with rejection from this perception as it was being created in front of my face over being on fixed income for being [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], simply put " not worthy ''''. 

I called to complain about this by asking for the Managers supervisor to return my call. I explained what was going on and this person chose to defend and put words in place for his manager, stating " I do n''t know what happened and there are two sides to every story, maybe he was just making conversation ''''? 

You mean prying, filtering, screening, and discriminating against me for being [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]? 

First I ''m told it only takes a few minutes to get an answer, the discovery that I ''m on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is made and then it ''s delayed and now they are unsure. 

