It ''s [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] am [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] now, no one from Commerce Bank as contacted me or attempted to contact me. I ''m giving him 24 hours before I call him to point out it ''s been 24 hours .... 

I suggest no one who is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] use this institution, it ''s pretty clear how they practice their craft at Commerce Bank and it includes finding ways to NOT serve those of us all in the same boat, the boat of denial [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has created for the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who bank there','COMMERCE BANK',2.0,4.0,'a customer in the state of st. louis''s was a customer at the Commerce Bank in a''stupid'' situation. he said');
