INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2522,'10/09/2017','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Problem with a lender or other company charging your account','I am not satisfied with the response : re-open [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] YOUR COMPLAINT I am writing to request an investigation be done on Wells Fargo Bank. It is my confirmed belief that I have been victimized financially by unethical banking practice contrary to consumer protection laws and electronic account manipulation. I opened account [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for sole purpose of paying my mortgage and mortgage related escrow only. Wells illegally crosslinked my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account to this Wells checking account without my knowledge or consent to generate enormous fees for themselves and cause my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account to be closed. I had never authorized the Wells checking account to be linked with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] neither to Wells or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] At that time I was utilizing my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] checking account with my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I had discovered the problem between [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] while making a small purchase at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] card. The cashier informed me my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] card was declined because of insufficient funds to my complete surprise. The date of this illegal crosslinking according to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  representative I spoke to from their corporate headquarters was on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] The result of this action by Wells generated fees in the amount of {$530.00} and nine letters being sent in one day to my address. I believe this also had 