INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2523,'10/09/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','On my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Credit Report it shows an account with Capital One Auto Finance in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] TX. Because this was not actually my debt, it was my oldest daughter, who hoodwinked me into being primary on her account when I thought I was just co-signer. I was not paying the loan. The entire payment history on this account is bad and eventually they repossessed the car from her. Regardless off all of that as I was reading today I understand it is better to have an account status of PAID-CHARGED OFF than to just say CHARGED OFF. In this particular accounts Comments it says : Account paid for less than full balance Paid charge off Contact CAPITAL ONE AUTO FINANCE [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] But the account STATUS is just listed as CHARGED OFF at the top of the account summary. Should n''t it say PAID-CHARGED OFF, since she did settle with the car company and not a collection agency?','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'account paid for less than full balance Paid charge off Contact CAPITAL ONE AUTO FINANCE [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANON');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2524,'10/09/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with fraud alerts or security freezes','I went to Experian website and tried to freeze my credit info approximately 4 weeks ago. I received an email back from them with a PIN number to be used to access my account online. The day after I froze my account I tried to access my account to verify that it was in fact frozen. I could not access my account, I kept getting messages that my email address or PIN was incorrect. I started calling the phone number listed on their website for help that day, and I have tried at least 8 different times at various times of the day and waited on hold each time anywhere between 35 minutes to 75 minutes. I WAS NEVER, EVER ABLE TO REACH ANYONE. The company obviously does not wish to assist consumers or they would employ more people to answer the phones. They have no email address to file complaints or to seek help listed on their website.. Their on line freeze program obviously has a design flaw as even when I enter my email and social security number I get an error message that they can not find me ... .. but yet they were able to charge me for supposedly freezing my account.
Why ca n''t Congress and Federal Agencies such as yours hold these companies to standard business ethics?? Is everyone in D.C. controlled by the criminal LOBBYISTS??
I am very disappointed in the way these companies are allowed to operate. They should be held to a much higher standard in protecting our financial data. The recent Congressional hearings aired on TV were a complete joke and I ''m sure no true consumer protection will be forthcoming.
A VERY DISAPPOINTED TAXPAYER','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a VERY DISAPPOINTED TAXPAYER is disappointed in the way these companies are allowed to operate. the company has no email address to file complaints or');
