INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2554,'10/03/2017','Debt collection','Credit card debt','False statements or representation','Citibank/CBNA has re-aged my accounts. They should no longer be on my credit report due to the statute of limitations in Texas. Instead of removing them they have been reporting that I have been making payments in order to re-age both of my accounts with them. For one ( starting with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) they reported a payment as recent as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2017 with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have tried to dispute the accounts with each of the credit bureaus and was not successful due to Citibank stating false payment information. I have also faxed Citibank asking that they no longer re-age my accounts and delete them from all three bureaus.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'Citibank/CBNA has re-aged my accounts. they should no longer be on my credit report due to the statute of limitations in Texas. instead of removing them');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2555,'10/03/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','On my credit report it states that I had opened a student loan on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the date was updated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with a past due balance of {$[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]}, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have been disputing this entry for well over a year because this is an old loan that was paid off on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the was originally opened [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is reporting to the bureaus when I no longer owe this long in which is was already pre-paid because they could not produce the original promissory note with my wet blue signature, but instead sent a copy of what they thought was my signature and it did not match. I have asked each credit bureau in a dispute to remove the negative entries from my credit report repeatedly. 

No exchange of original signed application documents ever takes place between me the creditor and the Credit Bureau ( CRA ). The CRA just reports the information provided by me the creditor and falsely assumes that it is valid and correct simply because it is being reported to them. And when asked to VERIFY the information the CRA will simply send an electronic communication to the creditor asking is this information correct and the creditor will usually respond yes this information is correct. Then the CRA will send you a letter or a copy of your credit report with a notation that will say, We have researched the credit account. The results are : we have verified that this item belongs to you. 

TRUTH IS, NO ONE AT THE CREDIT BUREAU EVER ACTUALLY VERIFIES THE ACTUAL CREDIT APPLICATION OR ANY OTHER DOCUMENTATION. This is the dirty little secret that all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureaus do n''t want you to know about, instead they use the XXXXr system to handle disputes. 

How do I know that this is the way they deal with disputes? I know this because I have read the transcripts where employees for various credit bureaus have admitted under oath that this is how it is done when they testified under oath in various lawsuits pertaining to the FCRA. 

Was I aware of this? No! Most consumers like myself HAVE NO IDEA that this is how credit items are verified. The Credit Reporting Agencies are in violation of Federal Law when they do this and they know they are but since 99.9 % of consumers do not know their rights they dont do anything about it. Why should they go to all that expense when they dont have to? 

Not only that, to make matters worse the FTC ( Federal Trade Commission ), which is supposed to regulate the Credit Bureaus and enforce the Fair Credit Reporting Act, refuses to step in when you file a complaint with them or complain that the credit bureau refuses to send me copies of the verification. 

Today, if you file a complaint with the FTC they will send you a form letter that states, We can not act as your lawyer or intervene in a dispute between a consumer and a credit bureau or between a consumer and a creditor or furnisher of information. The private enforcement provisions of the FCRA permit the consumer to bring a civil lawsuit for willful noncompliance with the Act. 

Under the FCRA, Credit Reporting Agencies [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Credit Bureaus [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] must provide a copy of the verifiable original creditor documentation if it is requested properly by you the consumer. Since they can not provide proof of verification to you in the form of a physical contract document per your written request to do so the account is classified as UNVERIFIED and under the FCRA. Whether the account is correct or not makes no difference. If the CRA can not provide you physical verification of the account it is an UNVERIFIED account and MUST BE DELETED.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'credit report says that I had opened a student loan on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the date was updated');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2556,'10/03/2017','Debt collection','Medical debt','Written notification about debt','Constant phone calls, when you answer the line hangs up! they keep calling my cell, my wife ''s cell, plus my home phone!. They never leave a message!. So my wife called back the phone number, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was told that she was calling First Choice Assets. Then they asked to speak too [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Which is me. So my wife hands me the phone, and the person on the other end was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], i cant remember his last name. It started out that he needed me to verify that i was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] by giving him the last 4 of my social security number, which i am sorry i did!! Then i ask [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] what is this call about? He starts telling me that he is a dept collector, that i owe a balance from a medical bill which my insurance paid, and i am responsible too pay the balance owed.He tells me this is back in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the name of my insurance company was commercial medical ins. Now it gets better!, because he lets me know that this phone call is being monitored then tells me that i owe {$250.00}. I told [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that i have no idea what he is talking about, just send me papers and i will look at them. Then he goes into the next phase of his tactic ''s asking me am i refusing too pay the balance owed?. Well by now i have reached my boiling point and lost it, i told [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] yes i am!! especially to you! I might have cursed at him, because he raised his voice, which he did not intimidate me at all!! I told him to do whatever he has to due, and hung up! Also be advised that i did not have a Commercial medical insurance policy, and i do n''t think they Exist.This phone conversation was on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the evening between [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','First Choice Assets LLC.',2.0,2.0,'i have reached my boiling point and lost it, i told [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] yes i am!! especially to you! i might have curse');
