INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2598,'09/25/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I have received several notifications from ERC regarding an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account I never obtained with the company. Each time I received a letter from them I sent them a letter asking them to validate not verify that this account, in fact, belongs to me. All they send is a copy of one bill with no signature, no contract, no validation that this is my debt. In the letters I sent to them I have sent them this statement that shows that they ca n''t just supply a bill and say that it is mine. Anyone can send a bill but can they validate it? As per FTC opinion letter from Attorney [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they should be aware that a printout of a bill or itemized document does not constitute verification. I am again formally requesting a copy of any documents, bearing my signature, showing that I have a legally binding contractual obligation to pay you the alleged amount. I have mailed them the last letter dated for X/XX/2017 requesting this information once again. If they fail to produce the contract with my signature then I will take the next steps as they are in non-compliance with federal laws under the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act, the Fair Credit Reporting Act, and the corresponding local state laws.','ERC',2.0,2.0,'a letter from the company requesting verification of an account is not valid. the company has a legal obligation to pay you the alleged amount. the company has a legal');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2599,'09/25/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','On XX/XX/2017 Receivable Performance re-inserted an old debt onto my credit report and failed to notify me within 5 business days afterwards and wo n''t remove this previously Deleted item.','Receivables Performance Management, LLC',2.0,2.0,'Receivable Performance re-inserted an old debt onto my credit report. it failed to notify me within 5 business days.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2600,'09/24/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','Over the summer, I had two packages of " beauty serum '''' mailed to my house using a name very similar to mine. The envelopes had no return address and the packing slip had only a phone number that no one answered. They also began charging my credit card {$89.00}, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and then [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I disputed the charges. My credit card disagreed and said not only was I liable for the charges, they would not stop these fraudulent charges on my account unless I closed the account. My credit card company also informed that they could not tell me any information on the company charging my card. Eventually, my credit card company sent me the address of the fraudulent company, and I returned all of the merchandise to them via certified mail. I then asked my credit card company for a refund, and they told me I am liable for all charges because I did not return the merchandise in a timely matter. I had to close this credit card to prevent any more charges, hence closing an account I had open for over 17 years.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,4.0,'a credit card company sent me the address of the fraudulent company. the company told me I am liable for all charges because I did not return the merchandise in a timely matter ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2601,'09/24/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Getting a credit card','Our clotheswasher broke so went to Sears to shop this was the Wednesday after XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). Very knowledgeable salesman helped us and convinced us that we should open a Sears Account to get free delivery and installation, and other benefits that an " ordinary '''' customer would not get. Reluctantly agreed since we have very few credit cards and do n''t want any more. 

Took an hour to do the transaction and answered invasive questions such as annual income and SSN ; started getting nervous. Salesman said we ''re done, hit a button, and a message printed saying that our credit could not be approved and we would receive a letter within 10 days explaining why. 

Salesman apologized ; said it had been happening a lot lately so if we wanted to use our own credit card, he would give us the same deal we would have gotten with Sears credit card. We said no way : CANCEL EVERYTHING, INCLUDING THE CREDIT CARD APPLICATION. He did it while we watched.

The next day, I started receiving emails from Sears
welcoming me to its Rewards Program. I unsubscribed and deleted them.

A few days later, I received a letter welcoming me to Sears and providing a Sears Account Number. I called the toll-free number and followed instructions to CLOSE the account. It said : ARE YOU SURE?? And I said " YES!!! '''' Today, I received a Sears [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from Citibank. That is the final straw. I recently applied for a credit card for my small business and was told by my bank that the credit limit was being reduced because I had too much credit outstanding. I now realize it was this UNWANTED, UNAUTHORIZED Sears/Citibank Credit Card that has now impaired my credit capacity. 

This is OUTRAGEOUS : we only filled out the application in order to get our clotheswasher. We then WERE REJECTED by Citibank while at the store so we CANCELLED EVERYTHING : clotheswasher AND Credit Card. Then I get unwanted Sears Rewards membership, unwanted Sears Account #, and now, unwanted Sears/Citibank [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

By searching the internet, I know others have been scammed in exactly the same way. It is unacceptable scammy behavior!! They need to be disciplined ; I hope your agency can do it.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,4.0,'a customer who has not received a credit card would not get a refund. a customer would not get a refund. a customer would not get a refund');
