[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : No, I do n''t think overdraft protection is necessary. I [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : I ''m not sure I would really need the account open then if I am left with an overdraft of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], does n''t see worth it to me. I opened it up under a promotion and was going to test drive the account before we switched over ... 
