INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2618,'09/20/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Other personal consumer report','Incorrect information on your report','Hi, There is incorrect family relationship information being reported both privately ( including to my Bank, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - and publicly ), that is associating my identify to that of my ex-husband. We divorced in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The information being randomly selected by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], to verify my identify has to do with my ex-husband and his extended family. This has been an ongoing problem that I am unable to resolve or get additional information as to how this is association is being made / by who. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] insists that they are unaware of how the association is being made, therefor they can not disclose or report back in order to have the information updated, even by me directly. I have tried in the past, to no avail, to directly contact individual credit reporting agencies to see if the linkage is being made through the individual agencies, but have been unsuccessful. I have looked through credit reports and called to core companies of which we may still have an association and no luck there either. 

