INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2619,'09/20/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2017 I reluctantly called experian and told them the collection company was n''t able to provide me legitimate validation of the debt so it needed to be removed from my report. I was told they could n''t delete information but would dispute it again. Two weeks later I got a letter saying the item was verified. I then asked what information did they get to verify this of which I was told they could n''t tell me. They said the debt collector told them " to the best of their knowledge the debt was verified ''''. Experian refused to show me their proof and all experian did was parrot the information which is n''t right or legal.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'experian called me on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2017. he told them the collection company wasn''t able to provide me legitimate validation');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2620,'09/20/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Fees or interest','Wells Fargo is charging nusisance fees on my interest free card marketed as a balance transfer card. I am still within the zero interest period. BTW the bank places the onus on me to recall what the period is and DO NOT issue timely reminders. Oh " great '''' customer service, right? 

