INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2637,'09/17/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','Apparently there has been a miscommunication regarding the status of active litigation between myself and Bank of America. To the best of my knowledge, there is no active litigation, mediation or arbitration between myself and Bank of America. Bank of America has not provided a case number for any active adversarial legal proceedings between myself and Bank of America that would necessitate the referral of this matter to their legal counsel. There is however a Notice of Error Case No. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( attached ) that is still pending. As entitled by law, I requested a concise written explanation and all documents utilized by Bank of America to make its determination as to the first date of delinquency on my loan. To date I have not received an adequate response to my inquiry.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'there is no active litigation, mediation or arbitration between myself and Bank of America. there is no active adversarial legal proceedings between myself and Bank of America.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2638,'09/17/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','I recently went to purchase a new car. When the process was over I found out that I had up to 10 hard inquires in to my credit. I am a young man trying to make it on my own and build my credit. However, when I go to buy a car and allow them to run my credit I am aware that it will affect my credit so negatively. What bothers me is the fact that they ran my credit so many times that it has major effects on my credit report. What I am not understanding is, why do they have to pull so many hard inquires? Why do they not just pull my credit report ONE time and then share that report with possible financial institutions? At what point does it become cruel, unusual, and excessive? Not to mention I would like to know why there are not limits placed on how many times a car dealership can run my credit. When I go to buy a car and they tell me, " We are going to pull you credit report to get you financing ", I figure they would pull it once or twice max! At no point does the dealership tell me that they are going to let as many people as possible pull my report.The fact that so many different companies are pulling my credit report obviously hurts my score. Not to mention, I know that those inquiries stay on my report for years. I know that many Americans do not like credit. It is reasons like this that credit is so hard to keep good and maintain.','EQUIFAX, INC.',4.0,4.0,'a car dealership pulls my credit report ONE time and then shares it with financial institutions. a car dealership pulls my report. a car dealership pulls my report');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2639,'09/17/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','At the time I went to pay my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] mortgage payment online ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), I inadvertently failed to hit the last " Submit Payment '''' button, which meant I did not make the payment. 

Later I received a letter from my mortgage company, Freedom Mortgage indicating I had not made the payment. I think I checked that I had a saved PDF for the payment, but either did not open it or did not see it was not a confirmation screen. 

We left town in mid [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and were away from physical mail until mid [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

When I went to make my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment online ( while away ), there was no indication that I was now indeed late. I also was unable to download my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statements at this time to verify what had happened. I made the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment. 

When I got home in mid-[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] there was another you are late letter. I was still unable to see [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statements. When I went to make my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment it was finally indicating I was late as the required payment was now double my normal payment. I checked my checking account from which I make the payments and could see the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment did not happen. 

I contacted Freedom Mortgage, and they seemed to understand the problem and would be happy to reverse one late payment ( maximum of their policy ), which they did. The person I spoke to sounded positive on the idea I would be able to have them repair my credit report, but I would need to submit a case via e-mail. 

I submitted a case by e-mail, but the declined to repair my credit report. I am unable to pursue this matter further with their [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Department, as they would not provide me with a phone number for this department. 

My credit reports with at least two of the three agencies now reflect two late payments on the mortgage, which seems unfair, as I feel I only missed one payment ; it just took me two months to address. There is also no distinction for a payment missed inadvertently, versus missed due to financial hardship or other issue. 

I was only able to see my statements for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This made it impossible to verify from Freedom Mortgage ''s records what had happened. It is even possible I did actually submit my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment, but their system failed. Their on-line payment system is frequently offline, and fails when I submit. I will attach a screenshot of an example of this. 

I also do not know how to add or update a contact telephone number on Freedom Mortgage ''s website. They may have tried contacting me regarding the issue, but they may have been trying my home number while I was away. 

I would like Freedom Mortgage to be forced to repair my credit report, to improve their website so that contact phone numbers can be seen, added and updated, and that their website be modified to make it OBVIOUS that a payment is about to be or is late.','FREEDOM MORTGAGE COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a letter from my mortgage company, Freedom Mortgage, indicating I had not made the payment. when I went to make my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2640,'09/16/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with fraud alerts or security freezes','I have attempted several times in past week - [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to freeze my credit with equifax continuous ERRORS after several screens others [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] also want to charge me even though [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] million of us were hacked time to step up and make them FREEZE OUR ACCOUNTS NOW - cost {$0.00}','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'equifax continues ERRORS has been a problem for me. equifax continues ERRORS has been a problem for me.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2641,'09/16/2017','Student loan','Private student loan','Dealing with your lender or servicer','I have written to Navient requesting a single contact in which to send payments for Unpaid interest of {$4400.00} only. I do not want these payments to be considered as " overpayments '''' because my debt will not be cleared as timely as I would like. This account has existed since 2005, over 15 years. Navient wants the debt to continue for another 17 years with monthly interest exceeding {$250.00} monthly. 

According to their instructions " you can instruct us to allocate payments differently. Clearly write your instructions on a separate piece of paper included with your check. We can not process instructions written on the check or remittance slip. '''' Navient has chosen to not respond directly to me ; therefore, I must ask for the CFPB ''s assistance. This account is paid without a remittance slip or paper check. It is paid via electronic transfer. I am acting in good faith with this request for a single point of contact to work with.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'a single contact is requested to send payments for unpaid interest of $4400.00. the account has existed since 2005, over 15 years.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2642,'09/16/2017','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Trouble during payment process','I received my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank of America Home Loan Account Information Statement and it is wrong. Bank of America is saying that I must pay {$980.00} which includes my Ground Lease Rent Payments, but there is an overage of {$54.00}. At no time did I request for insurance to cover this loan. 
Please see below for my own calculation : Mortgage is {$670.00} which includes escrow. 
Ground Lease Rent Payment is {$760.00} each quarter. This is {$250.00} per month. Again, I pay {$760.00} each quarter. 
