OnXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], we received a notice from Chase saying that they were denying our credit and were going to take out the total {$[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]}. When asked what the reason behind this was, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said that it was because after the transactions took place our account was logged into multiple times, and it was a chip to chip transaction. We did not take the money out, nor were we in the city of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on either of those days. 

