Until that system is in place these agencies should be barred from charging these fees, and they should be forced to make the freezing process accessible and not hidden behind a series of attempts to sell credit monitoring. 

Additionally, I have tried to freeze my report with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the site was down. This is completely unacceptable when half of the population just had their financial information compromised.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reporting agencies are trying to charge consumers for a credit freeze. a system is needed to allow consumers to freeze their report');
