INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2673,'09/13/2017','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I do n''t know which family member First Tennessee Bank allowed to use a power of attorney. Because of this I was denied freedom of information by First Tennessee Bank. My birth certificate, driver ''s license and social security card was stolen and copied by family members. A background check was n''t done on the family members. First Tennessee Bank even stated the circumstances were unique. I need copies of all deposits and payments on account number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My father [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], he was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when he [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. His social security number is still active in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. His name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My mother name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and she [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],  her social security number is still being used by the family members. 

