I was under wage earner in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when I began with depositions. The bankruptcy attorney filed the law sue as workman ''s compensation. This caused my personal information to become public record. This is how they were able to access my records. All are in violation of my HIPPA rights, civil liberties, civil rights. 

