INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2675,'09/12/2017','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Installment loan','Charged fees or interest you didn''t expect','Unable to repay back loan because of the high interest that I didnt, understand','ENOVA INTERNATIONAL, INC.',2.0,2.0,'unable to repay back loan because of the high interest that I didnt, understand.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2676,'09/12/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','The purpose of this letter is concerning an adverse credit report. This issue raises an extraordinary interest that compels me to direct to your attention immediately. The absence of any articulated response suggests a holding principle not to remedy the issue. Any silence only rubber-stamps the issue and deeply supports the principle of your established business. 

When there is a failure it moves a customer to think differently. This issue raises an extraordinary interest that compels me to direct your attention immediately. There is an acknowledged constitutional right to be recognized and make an argument. I realize that no organization is error-free however, it is expected that employees render a level of professionalism that reflects the organization or business goal.. 

It is a moral order in our society that has been established by business owners and that is to take care of their customers. When there is a failure it moves a customer to think differently. The right to be recognized is part of the fundamental principles of the constitution. On the other hand there is a general right that will clearly show a customers concerns. 

As with any public servant quality services are expected and vital. There is no valued and deeply cherished right than to be employed and provide that level of service. However, in some instances an employee or company can abuse their position of authority. It must be said on the onset of this statement and with clarity that is exactly what has happen with Synovus [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], GA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

The real danger of this issue is the lies and the troubling aspects that are in the implication of discretionary power that could have been prevented. Is seems as if they imposed created rule spokes with authority and a right that a principle could be established for a rational basis but when it rises to a level of a fundamental intention to damage a customer credit rating. 

Bank submitted two adverse thirty ( 30 ) day delinquent reports against my credit score. The fraudulent business transaction practices that governs their claim was due to lack of a correct address. This issue could have been avoided had they contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of for any additional information. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] representative was informed by via email of my concern about the payments and stated he would investigate but never replied afterwards. 

I contacted the bank due to the fact of not receiving an invoice. During my conversation they openly admitted that they had incorrect data pertaining to my mailing address and all correspondences had been returned. Accordingly, four months lapsed that they grossly failed in their unprofessionalism in the obtaining the correct mailing address. 

The bank specifically stated that the financial documents would be mailed during the conversation. Their supreme disservice continued. I was alerted to an adverse credit report alert less than a week after my conversation with them concerning the documents. The failure and unwillingness to face reality or accept the facts is a part and parcel of the problem. 

From the onset, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had provided the revenant information that establish the line of credit that they accepted. The validation was excurted by means of my signature that showed a compelling interest in establishing a good faith effort to repay any debtors. To date, my line of credit has been flawless with an excellent credit score rating. 

I was recommended to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] by means of the brotherhood of veterans being that I am veteran and the surrounding area are retirement areas. The representative a veteran whom I relied upon as an employee exchanged various emails, telephone calls, and faxed documents to finalize the transaction failed to complete the project. I discovered that short cuts had been implemented that lead to addition damages to the structural dwelling. Therefore, the company had to return to correct the flaws. 

Upon my walk through to ensure customer satisfaction other elements of workmanship was discovered. Due to the discoveries was management officials was notified of the issues. Management officials was unable to answer numerous official legal questions. They base the lack of response on the basis of the absences of legal counselors onset. I was assured they would cooperate in good faith should any issues arose to that level of dissatisfaction. 

The bank and company has shown a compelling interest in rendering an adverse credit report not an exercise.','Synovus Bank',10.0,10.0,'a letter expressing an adverse credit report raises an extraordinary interest. the absence of any articulated response suggests a holding principle not to remedy the issue. there is an acknowledged');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2677,'09/12/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Fees or interest','I received a credit card from Capital One back in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I needed this card due to a divorce due to being put in a Domestic [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] situation I only had a small pension and needed money to get my divorce started and get away from him as he left me broke ... .then I ended up needing to take {$100.00} in cash from the credit card in early [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and after I did this my monthly payment went from about {$25.00} up to {$300.00} a month, I have called Capital One numerous times asking them to lower my credit card payment and they refuse to do it since I borrowed {$100.00} in cash from them, and each time I do call about it they will give me a {$75.00} credit, my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statement came out and it said that I did not need to make a payment so now that my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statement is out they are now saying I need to make a payment of {$410.00}, I have never once been late with my payments and I have never missed a payment so all of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and now [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I have been paying a monthly payment of {$300.00} to {$410.00} a month all because I took out a cash payment of {$100.00} back in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Capital One is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] me ... ... I need help with this credit card company because of the high monthly payment I am making I am so broke that I need to keep using my credit card and I have paid well over {$7000.00} and I still owe {$10000.00} on this card!!!!','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a credit card from Capital One came out and it said that I need to make a payment of $410.00. the credit card company is now saying that I need');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2678,'09/12/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with fraud alerts or security freezes','On Tuesday, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I attempted to put a freeze on my credit reports as urgently recommended by nearly everyone after the hacking of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was able to accomplish this easily in a few minutes online with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

TransUnion was a different story. An hour on their website was utterly useless. The process kept freezing up in the middle, and often it would not accept entries that met their criteria for those entries. I tried calling, filling out pages of confidential information repeatedly to have the line cut off as soon as I complete all the entered data. 

I can find not way to contact this company except that they say I can request a freeze by mail. But the site gives only an address to do that and no information what is required to do it or how long it will take. 

This is an urgent issue in light the hacking, and I am quit upset that a company for which I have no is allowed to hold my information without even permitting me to contact them for a freeze.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a company for which I have no is allowed to hold my information without even permitting me to contact them for a freeze. the site gives only an address to do that and gives no');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2679,'09/12/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','Hi. I started the process to change my repayment plan inXX/XX/XXXXwith My Fed Loan .ORG ( I am in the public service forgiveness program and was forced to have them as a loan servicer ). I submitted all required paperwork to leave my current repayment plan and enter in a new repayment plan ( both were income based ). At the time the customer service representative stated that I could request a forbearance to pay less then the full amount on my loan. In order to enter a new repayment plan you are required to make one " regular '''' loan payment. For me this amount was approx. {$510.00} and the forbearance amount would be {$5.00}. I made the payment onXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when I received the a bill for the full amount. By the original loan processor I was told that I should expect to receive a full bill and to not pay this bill but wait to receive a bill for the {$5.00}. I paid the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] onXX/XX/XXXXand expressed relief that I would not have to worry about making the {$510.00} payment. The My Fed Loan.org Customer Service Representative agreed and stated I was all set. However what I was not told was that in order to ensure that the payment for {$510.00} to not be processed I would have to suspend direct debit. I had a payment for {$510.00} removed from my banking account onXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called My Fed Loan .ORG to see why this payment was processed and was told that the payment is processed regardless of any other statuses on my account as the Public Service Forgiveness Program does not allow for them to stop payments. When I asked why I was not told that I would need to suspend direct debit I was told that they are not allowed to provide this information and I have to ask for it. I asked to have the payment reversed as I did not authorize this payment. This was not allowable according to the representative who I spoke with unless there was an error on their part. They stated I would need to go through my bank to dispute the charge. I also asked if at this point ( approx. 5 months after I had started this process [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] if the paperwork had been processed. It was still waiting to be processed so in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I would potentially be forced to make another payment for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was escalated at this point to a supervisor who " as a favor '''' finished processing my paperwork in order to enter me into the new repayment plan. When I questioned why the process took so long it was stated that my request for a forbearance meant that it would take additional repayment cycles to process through this request however I would still be required to make payments under my old repayment plan. Had I been provided this information in the beginning I would have simply made a " regular '''' payment since the 3 extra payments I made in the old plan meant that essentially paid that anyway. The processor also stated that they were " backed up '''' due to the millions of loans that they service. At this point I asked if my direct debit had been suspended ( thinking that my clear desire to not make these direct payments had been stated in this call ) I was told that since I had n''t asked for it yet the direct payment was still on the account. At this point I asked to have direct debit suspended and asked for a copy of the recording and all other recordings from the phone calls I had with My Fed Loan.org be sent to me. I was told that this was not possible as that was " confidential '''' information that I did not have a right too. 

I have since reached out to my bank to ensure that My Fed Loan payment for {$510.00} is disputed ( this will require a trip to the bank to sign the paperwork in person ) and that My Fed Loan is blocked from accessing my account.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'my repayment plan was changed inXX/XX/XXXX with my Fed Loan.ORG. the public service forgiveness program does not allow for them to stop payments');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2680,'09/12/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','Equifax Inc. said its systems were struck by a cyberattack that may have affected about 143 million U.S. customers of the credit reporting agency. Based on their instructions I was able to confirm that my information, to include personal identifiable information, was included in the breach. My identity is no longer reasonably considered to be " secure ''''. Equifax was unable to safeguard the information. 
I understand that Equifax is a victim here as well, however, my entire identity is open to theft.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'Equifax Inc. said its systems were struck by a cyberattack. my identity is no longer reasonably considered to be "secure"');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2681,'09/12/2017','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','To Whom It Concern, I recently received a copy of my credit report ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). In conformance to my rights under the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ), I am requesting you to provide me with a validation of the debt, Please note, this is not a refusal to pay, rather a statement that your claim is disputed and validation is demanded. ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Sec. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] b ) ) I do hereby request that your office provide me with complete documentation to verify that I owe the said debt and have any legal obligation to pay you. 

Please provide me with the following : Agreement with the creditor that authorizes you to collect on this alleged debt The agreement bearing my signature stating that I have agreed to assume the debt Valid copies of the debt agreement stating the amount of the debt and interest charges Proof that the Statute of Limitations has not expired Complete payment history on this account along with an accounting of all additional charges being assessed Show me that you are licensed to collect in my state ; and your license numbers and Registered Agent If your office fails to reply to this debt validation letter within 30 days from the date of your receipt, all instances related to this account must be immediately deleted and completely removed from my credit file. Moreover, all future attempts to collect on the said debt must be ceased. 

Your non-compliance with my request will also be construed as an absolute waiver of all claims to enforce the debt against me and your implied agreement to compensate me for court costs and attorney fees if I am forced to bring this matter before a judge. 

Thanking you, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','PORTFOLIO RECOVERY ASSOCIATES INC',2.0,2.0,'a copy of my credit report is pending. the credit report is a proof that you have a legal obligation to pay you. the creditor must provide me with ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2682,'09/12/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I have contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reporting a few times requesting that they please report my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account onto my credit report. This credit card has a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance on it and will help my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit score. I was told I need to contact [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and have them report it to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was told they do report to all 3 credit reporting agency ''s. I explained that this account is not reporting to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I could not get any help. I called back [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and explained what [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] told me and they could n''t help. I am submitting this complaint because I want this account to report on my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit report.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'credit reporting agency''s report to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and asked them to report');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2683,'09/11/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','I might be one of the 150 million victims of 2017 Equifax Security Breach, and I feel really vulnerable since there is nothing I can do to improve the situation.','EQUIFAX, INC.',4.0,4.0,'I feel really vulnerable since there is nothing I can do to improve the situation.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2684,'09/11/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','Equifax did not properly secure my protected personal information from intrusion, such as through appropriate patching, 2-factor authentication at the point of service, segmentation of data, etc. As such, it appears my full name, Social Security numbers, birth date, addresses, and possibly driver license number is cross-matched to each other and in the hands of criminals who can use this data to breach any number of accounts in perpetuity such as my banking and financial data, medical data, legal complaints, political data, and any other number of sensitive accounts.
Further, I am unable to secure these accounts because they ask for the very personal information that is breached in order to verify my identity and approve a change.
Equifax is currently offering a limited credit monitoring service, which does n''t even activate immediately. Even this had to be sought out by those who see the news reports, follow the news links to the Equifax page, which in turn link to a shady third-party website asking for 2/3 of one ''s social security number plus last name and a waiver of all class action recourse in order to discover if one is among the breached accounts, only changed to waive class action recourse from the third party site if it too is breached with the sensitive data it is querying once the news of this spread. This is insufficient to the need created by their negligent protection of my information, which I did not give them myself, but which they curated as their business from other businesses.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a third-party website asked for 2/3 of one''s social security number plus last name. a waiver of class action recourse was only changed to waive class action recourse');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2685,'09/11/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','loans show up on my report and its not mine, i have police report # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Id theft','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'id theft is a crime.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2686,'09/11/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','My information was leaked in the Equifax hack. Not only was it leaked in a bank that could be accessed in bulk ( Security was far too lax in this regard ) but the company steered me off after I found out that I was affected in their check by getting me to enroll in something that makes it so I ca n''t be a part of the lawsuit ensuing. 

I get that the company is a victim as well, that is unfortunate, but it should own up to it ''s mistakes. Not try and exacerbate the issues people have.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the company steered me off after finding out that I was affected in their check by getting me to enroll in something that makes it so I can''t be a part of the lawsuit');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2687,'09/11/2017','Checking or savings account','Other banking product or service','Managing an account','My husband has [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts with Ally Bank. They are IRA ''s. He passed away on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I contacted Ally Bank for the first time on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was the sole beneficiary of these accounts. I faxed a copy of the death certificate and my drivers license on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to the IRA department at Ally Bank. The money from his IRA ''s were supposed to be put into a new account under my name. I mailed the new account information on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have repeatedly called Ally Bank since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and have been told something different every time. Every time I ask what is going on I am told that I will receive an email in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] days with the correct form. The email has never arrived. I called today and asked to speak to a supervisor and was put on hold and no one ever picked up. I have asked to speak to a supervisor several times and have been told that the IRA specialists are too busy.','ALLY FINANCIAL INC.',2.0,2.0,'husband has IRA accounts with ally bank. he passed away on january 1, 2013. he was the sole beneficiary of these accounts.');
