INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2734,'09/08/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','Equifax, during [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2017, exposed PII including my Social Security number, to an undisclosed third party through improper security protocols. As a result, my information has been stolen and is available to one or more parties looking to use this information improperly.
My SSN ( as you may know ) is perhaps the most valuable number associated with me as a person, financially at least. As a direct consequence of the mishandling of my information by Equifax, and their decision to delay notifying me of this incident, my identity is at an unacceptable risk of being stolen. 

Coupled with information like my drivers license number, birthday, full name, address, etc. Equifax has put me in a position where I have no choice but to monitor my credit constantly for the rest of my life, and also enact a security freeze, permanently.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a third party has been exposed to a PII and my Social Security number. my identity is at an unacceptable risk of being stolen.');
