For more information visit the FAQ page.
THIS is NOT GOOD SERVICE AND SHOULD BE STOPPED! I should not have to come back to protect my information. AND in the State of Washington there is a fee to block your credit report! 

This is crazy! 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'trustedID Premier is a trusted provider of cybersecurity information. the company is a trusted provider of information. the company is a trusted provider of information.');
