I ''ll also be filing a police report, as well as IRS Form [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a data breach of personal and financial credit reporting information was reported. the report was held by the Equifax credit reporting agency.');
