mit a negative credit report, which I have since confirmed.','Professional Debt Mediation, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sales representatives stopped by my apartment. they offered to provide utilities at a cheaper rate than our current');
