INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2789,'08/29/2017','Debt collection','Payday loan debt','Took or threatened to take negative or legal action','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I filed a Chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] through the US Bankruptcy Court. Notice of the filing was sent to AD Astra Recovery Service and their client [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] After receiving notice, they violated the immediate " automatic stay '''' by reporting the debt to the Credit Bureaus. They have each month continue to collect the debt by reporting the delinquency each month. The last update was on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I spoke to a team lead and then to the Collections Supervisor, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. In a recorded call, she affirmed receipt of the " NOTICE OF BANKRUPTCY '''' and that " they will continue to collections process until the debt is discharged ''''. I advised her that her collections activities were in violation of the Bankruptcy laws. She advised that they will continue the process.','Ad Astra Recovery Services Inc',2.0,2.0,'a Chapter of the Chapter was filed through the US Bankruptcy Court. the debt was reported to the Credit Bureaus each month. the debt is collected by reporting the de');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2790,'08/29/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I began making Income Based Repayments on my Federal Student Loans through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Each month since then I have made on time payments and renewed my payment plan eligibility. During this time I was regularly assured by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] customer service that the payments I was making were counting towards the Public Service Loan Forgiveness program.
