However, I recently began certifying my employment with the NGOs I have continuously worked for since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was told by FedLoan Servicing that none of my payments before XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] count towards the calculation of my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Payments for PSLF. 

