To Learn more please visit : http : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'this [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Veteran ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2792,'08/29/2017','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I received a copy of my credit report, in detailed it showed a collection from a third party company called Fair Collections and Out. This debt collector reported that I owe {$3300.00}. Consequently, this is a false attempt to collect a debt that was stolen from the original company- [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who did not solicit or file with Fair Collections and Out. When I spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the leasing agent from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] he stated, " He was not aware that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had filed any actions against the account. '''' In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], myself and my roommate moved out of the apartment due to a fraudulent check that was written on the account. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stated, " if we left before [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and did not leave the place in disarray he would not file an eviction against us. Now a year later there is an attempt to collect a debt from an account that is reported as a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance. According to the last printout, myself and said roommate does not have any monetary obligations to this property. 

I have sent emails, letters to each credit bureau, and a formal letter to Fair Collections and Out asking that this debt be removed. I have not received any responses from the either company. I have not received any documents stating that this account is validated by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

Please look at the bottom of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and you will see that the balance is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','FAIR COLLECTIONS & OUTSOURCING, INC.',2.0,4.0,'debt collector reported that I owe $3300.00. this is a false attempt to collect a debt that was stolen from the original company. a year');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2793,'08/28/2017','Mortgage','Home equity loan or line of credit (HELOC)','Trouble during payment process','X/XX/2017 went to Chase Bank to request amount of HELOC full payoff. Bank employee called as I waited and gave me amount of payoff, {$90000.00}. Paid that amount in full at that time. Was subsequently charged an additional {$470.00} as " interest and fees ''''. They can not adequately explain this. I wonder if they do this to everyone paying off a HELOC hoping customers are confused. How can I be charged " interest and fees '''' if I pay the loan off in full?','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'X/XX/2017 went to Chase Bank to request amount of HELOC full payoff. was charged an additional $470.00 as " interest and fees ''');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2794,'08/28/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','Called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to dispute a hard inquiry on my credit file. I was informed by rep that they do n''t delete inquiries without something from creditor listed authorization and I needed to contact creditor. I contacted 1st National Bank of Omaha on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who explained that I could n''t call and request anything to send to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] regarding this matter. He stated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] would have to contact them and request or demand positive proof from creditor rather I have an account or inquired about [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. And that there is nothing they have to acknowledge that there is such an account','FIRST NATIONAL BANK OF OMAHA',2.0,2.0,'rep called 1st national bank of Omaha to dispute a hard inquiry. rep said they don''t delete inquiries without creditor listed authorization. rep said they would have');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2795,'08/28/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2017 I wrote to Equifax, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] asking them to verify several accounts that were unbeknownst to me and I have yet to see a response nor a change in my report. The accounts are as follows : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Equifax -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2017 wrote to Equifax, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMIS');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2796,'08/28/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] To whom it may concern, I would like to see the accounting records on the loans that you are accusing me of owing. Are you aware that ''s it ''s illegal to give out a loan if interest is being charged without having an insurance policy against the loan. I am aware of my rights and the statue of limitations in my state as a borrower. According to The Consumer Credit Act of 1974, it gives the credit consumer a legal process by which to proceed if he/she feels as if their rights have been or are being violated! gives the credit consumer a legal process by which to proceed if he/she feels as if their rights have been or are being violated! the courts had historically misinterpreted the laws, falsely deeming student debts as student loans under the bankruptcy code. At this point I feel that you are accusing me to be the owner of the loan accounts listed on my credit file. I feel that my rights are violated in several ways. Accusing a consumer of an unknown debt and misuse of ones credit can turn into a big problem. It is impossible for a creditor to verify a consumers debt attempting to verbally verifying the debt with a credit bureau. The debt was deleted several months ago and it was reinstated back on my credit file just recently. 

P.S. Please be aware that dependent upon your response, I may be detailing any potential issues with your company via an online public press release, including documentation of any potential small claims action. Cc : Consumer Financial Protection Bureau Cc : Attorney General ''s Office Cc : Better Business Bureau','GREAT LAKES',2.0,2.0,'''s it''s illegal to give out a loan if interest is being charged without having an insurance policy against the loan?''s it''s illegal to give');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2797,'08/28/2017','Mortgage','Other type of mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','Select Portfolio Servicing ( SPS ) has continued to not resolve the dispute that had led to the filing of complaint numbers [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] against SPS and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] against [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with the CFPB.
In my last five complaints filed against SPS I have continually asked for proof that the foreclosure is judicial. They have constantly answered that the foreclosure is judicial. They went as far as sending me a copy of a letter dated XX/XX/XXXXfrom [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that states the foreclosure is judicial. In their last response to complaint number 5 ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) they state the foreclosure is non-judicial. This is the exact problem I am having with SPS. They keep lying to both the CFPB and to me. It took five complaints to get the right answer on this one issue. This makes the other issues listed in all the complaints vital to determining the truth and SPS has still not resolved these other issues. They are again repeated below. It is SPSs and the note holders responsibility to get all of the information that concerns this mortgage from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they can not just pick and choose what to get and what not to get. It is their responsibility to get these recordings from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and to address all the issues. After five complaints I have finally been proved right about the foreclosure being non-judicial and it has never been converted. SPS must be compelled to adequately answer all the issues that they have continually lied about. They say they asked [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] about the Disaster Relief program I was enrolled in and they have taken [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] word over mine that there is no evidence that I was told that the payments I missed were to be added to the back end of the loan in the form of a workout ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] representatives word not mine ). SPS has taken the word of a bank that has been fined billions of dollars by the U.S. Government for their illegal activities. Now that it has been proven that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has lied on the foreclosure process why does SPS think they havent lied about the conversations I had with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] representatives and the agreement that they offered to me and I accepted? Below is a list of all the issues still needing to be answered. SPS must adequately answer every issue in these complaints.
1 ) SPS has not provided any evidence that the mortgage originator and mortgage broker were licensed in Hawaii at the time I received my mortgage. If they were not, then the mortgage is void and unenforceable, a precedent set by a Hawaii Supreme Court decision inXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].
2 ) They have not investigated my claim of an agreement I had with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] prior to SPS taking over the servicing of the mortgage that is detailed on recordings that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] owns. SPS states that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] does not have any evidence of the agreement. The agreement is stated on the recordings and without hearing the recordings, which is the evidence [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is suppressing, then my complaints will continue until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and SPS comply.
3 ) SPS continues to mislead the CFPB by stating that they have tried to reach me by telephone but fail to acknowledge that I have returned their phone calls when they leave messages. I reviewed my caller ID this morning and found more recent phone calls from SPS were made but there werent any messages left on my voice mail. This is another deception by SPS to attempt to deceive the CFPB into thinking that I am unreachable and do not return phone calls. If a voice message was left I have always returned the call. I can not see caller ID when I access messages from a remote location. If a voice message was not left I have no knowledge of the call. As of this morning there are ten calls shown on caller I.D . since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that were from SPS, with no messages left on voice mail.
On XX/XX/XXXXat [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] HST I received a call from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at SPS. He left a voice message and I returned the call nine minutes later at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] HST. I spoke to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XXXXs and asked for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. She told me that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] would give me a call on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I never received a call. This is what SPS does, they dont follow through with what they say they are going to do and then they say that I am unreachable.
4 ) SPS continues to state in their correspondence that they are committed to helping people retain their homes. I have given them every opportunity to honor the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  agreement, which is listed in all of my CFPB complaints. Once they honor the agreement I will gladly resume my payments. They also must fix my credit report because I would have resumed my payments as agreed onXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] if the agreement I had with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was honored at that time. As stated in previous complaints, I am continuing to get punished by negative reports on my credit report because I do not have another option to defend myself in this dispute. As previously stated numerous times over the last few years, I can resume my payments at any time, but SPS can still foreclose and will continue to designate 180-day late notices on my credit reports. Also, SPS and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  do not have offices in Hawaii so I can not subpoena the recordings. I am confident that if a foreclosure is filed, and the mortgage is not void and unenforceable, that the Judge will order the recordings I have continually requested, delivered to the court. I have made every effort to keep a foreclosure from proceeding but SPSs continuing refusal to demand [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] turn over the recordings, and their repeated statements that the matter has been resolved, has led to these drastic actions.','SELECT PORTFOLIO SERVICING, INC.',2.0,2.0,'SPS has not resolved the dispute that led to the filing of complaint numbers. they have continually asked for proof that the foreclosure is judicial. they have always answered that the foreclosure is');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2798,'08/28/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','This is a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loan. According to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] guidelines, a streamlined loan modification is supposed to offered at the 90th day of delinquency. No loan modification was offered and instead foreclosure proceedings have begun','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a streamlined loan modification is supposed to offer at the 90th day of delinquency. no loan modification was offered and foreclosure proceedings have begun.');
