INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2813,'08/24/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','While reviewing my credit report, I saw multiple unauthorized credit inquiries displaying that I have no recognition or knowledge of. I made numerous means of contact via writing and by phone to all companies requesting to them to investigate the unauthorized inquiries and for them to contact the 3 Credit Bureaus to have them permanently delete/remove these inaccuracies from my credit report. I was informed over the phone that they have no way of getting those unauthorized inquiries deleted and for me to make direct contact to the credit bureaus to start the disputing process. Many of these companies, initially gave an issue with verifying any of my information because they wouldnt accept the given information found on my credit report, they wanted my full/ last four digits of my Social Security Number which I refused to provide due to my rights under the FCRA laws. I contacted Experian several times by via phone and mail requesting for these unauthorized inquires to be removed from my credit report because either them or any of these companies listed were unable to provide me with any signed statements or contracts to indicate the origin of this collection debt/inquiry, to resolve this matter, since I have never had any dealings at any of these companies at the date of these unauthorized inquiries. As you probably know, Credit Reporting Agencies treat inquiries as a statement of fact and will not allow a consumer to dispute them. Since it is against federal law ( Fair Credit Reporting Act -- 15 USC 1681n ( a ) ( 1 ) ( B ) for an entity to view a consumers credit report without a " permissible purpose, '''' so performing a " hard inquiry '''' on my credit file ( s ) without my permission is a willful violation of the law. Please remove the following inquiries from my report as pursuant to 15 U.S.C. 1681b section 604 ( c ) ( 3 ) of the Fair Credit Reporting Act whereby a consumer reporting agency shall not furnish to any person a record of inquiries in connection with a credit or insurance transaction that is not initiated by a consumer. Also, I will like to have a new copy of my credit report to reflect these changes/ removal of the unauthorized inquiries. Here are the unauthorized inquiries that needs to be removed/deleted from my credit report : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] onXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] onXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] onXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] onXX/XX/XXXXand [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] onXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'unauthorized inquiries show that I have no recognition or knowledge of. unauthorized inquiries must be removed from my credit report. unauthorized inquiries must be removed from my report.');
