INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2819,'08/23/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I SENT THE CREDIT BUREAUS MY POLICE REPORT ON THE FRAUDULENT ACCOUNTS, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], AND [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. THEY HAVE NOT REMOVE THESE FRAUDULENT ACCOUNTS FROM MY NAME. THIS IS A VIOLATION OF MY RIGHTS FOR ME TO PROVE THE FRAUD AND FOR THE CREDIT BUREAUS NOT TO DO ANYTHING ABOUT IT.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'CREDIT BUREAUS SENT THE CREDIT BUREAUS MY POLICE REPORT ON THE FRAUDULENT ACCOUNTS. THEY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2820,'08/23/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I have been a customer with SteinMart for several years. Recently, they issued a new " card '''' which I did not realize had a different account number that my old account. I have financial software that I use to pay bills through my bank. When receiving bills in the mail, I have dutifully sent payment in full for each statement - unfortunately, to the old account number. The account is managed by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in Georgia. When I began receiving threatening phone calls from people said to represent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I began to look into the problem and realized that the payments I had been making were not to the account number on the card. I provided documentation to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that the debt was, in fact, paid. Just this week I received a check in the mail for over {$970.00} from them and a statement saying that there was a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance on the account. Nonetheless, the phone calls keep coming and today, I was threatened with being reported unless I provided {$25.00} by XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I explained the above to the person on the phone ( receiving a check - which I have not yet cashed - and a statement showing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance ) but was told that did n''t matter. I needed to come up with {$25.00} or else. I can easily afford to send them {$25.00}, but I feel like there is no coordination between the " debt collectors '''' and others at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who agree with me that I have paid my debt.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'a new " card '''' has been issued by SteinMart for several years. the account is managed by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMP');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2821,'08/22/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Struggling to repay your loan','I have had Navient since they took over my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loans a few years ago. They have pushed forbearance sand deferment on me and caused my repayment to double. I now owe over {$80000.00}. Also, they have reported me as delinquent to the credit report bereaus when they had told me I was in deferment status and they had never processed the paperwork I sent in to them. This caused me to also be denied loans.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'Navient took over my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loans a few years ago. they have pushed forbearance sand deferment on');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2822,'08/22/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','Our house burned down in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My insurance company sent the checks to cover the rebuilding of our house payable to me and to the mortgage company. The mortgage company is still holding on to {$7800.00} and refuse to give it to me. I need this money to finish paying my builder. They sent an inspector to my house to verify that it was rebuilt on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The inspector and I both signed the inspection report wherein she stated that the work was 100 % done. You will see that the mortgage company very obviously altered the signed document stating that rather than 100 % completed, the house is only 28 % completed! How on earth can you determine such a precise number - 28 %? The mortgage company has deliberately committed fraud and should be held accountable for altering a signed document. In any event I want the mortgage company to release the remaining funds. This is MY money, not theirs. We received a Certificate of Occupancy, has been occupied since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. There is no legal reason for them to illegally and arbitrarily refuse to release MY money to ME. I was instructed by a representative of the mortgage company to send my complaint to their customer relations department which I did on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. As of this date they have not even had the courtesy to respond to my complaint. Copies of the documents and my last correspondence to them are attached.','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',2.0,4.0,'mortgage company sent checks to rebuild house payable to me and to mortgage company. inspector and I both signed inspection report stating work was 100 % done. mortgage company deliberately committed fraud and');
