INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2833,'08/20/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Fees or interest','Capital One extorts money from elderly clients. My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] year-old father who has [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never requested a new card. Captial One sent him a new credit card after his old card ( ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) had expired in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Along with the new credit card ( ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), Capital One charged a membership fee of {$39.00}. Capital One sent the new GM credit card AFTER I called, faxed, and mailed POA documents. Despite all the documents I have submitted, Capital One refuses to add me as POA. They insist I must provide them with my annual income and social security number. I have requested Capital One to provide a copy of their policy that verifies they will not share personal POA information with affiliates. As of yet, Capital One has not provided any such proof. Meanwhile, the initial {$39.00} charge has now become {$110.00}. Capital One began calling my elderly   father ''s residence to collect payment on charges he never made. Captial One invented all the charges. Whenever I answer their calls, I explain the situation. Nothing is resolved. And on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],  my father answered the phone and allowed Capital One to deduct payment from his bank account. ( My parents have also been the victims of prior financial abuse. They are {$450000.00} in debt. They have little money to spare! ) On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I wrote and sent ANOTHER letter to Capital One with POA and all required paperwork, ( save my annual income and social security number ). Capital One ''s response was to send a form letter with an entirely DIFFERENT ACCOUNT NUMBER THAT WE HAVE NEVER SEEN BEFORE!!!','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'my father, who has [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]''s, never requested a new card. he sent the new GM credit card AF')