omplaint department and again, no response from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have depleted all of my options and I am very frustrated. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is hurting my credit and scores tremendously when they are collecting their timely payment each time. How can I possibly be late when they collect their money each month? I have proof of payment by providing a Bank statement for each month they claim the payment is late.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'5 private student loans with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] became active this year. they electronically withdraw their payment each month from my [COMPTE_ANONY');
