INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2922,'08/03/2017','Vehicle loan or lease','Loan','Managing the loan or lease','My vehicle loan was taken out in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2014 with Wells Fargo. I provided proof of insurance at the time of purchase. Almost 3 years later, Wells Fargo contacted me to inform me that they never received insurance proof, had charged me their insurance premium, and charged fees for delinquencies on my account. My credit report shows that I was late on my vehicle payment, which I never was. I provided proof of insurance at that time through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They still charged me for their insurance and late fees and it remains on my credit.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'my loan was taken out in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2014. I provided proof of insurance at the time of purchase. they charged me their insurance premium');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2923,'08/03/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I have balances with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it was turned over to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] collection agency. The agency has listed each account individually on my and my husbands credit report. We have total Balance of {$15000.00} from datesXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. That is owed to both [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] hospital and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I Have disputed the amount of accounts listed on my credit report as many companies have advised me that this does not seem ethical to have 132 medical accounts listed individually. These accounts range from {$11.00} to {$2400.00}. I can understand putting the collection balances on my credit report but not listing it 132 times each individually. I have contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] multiple times to ask them to combine the balances into 1 or 2 balances they have responded that they will not remove the multiple listed accounts, they also advised that if I paid the balance to {$0.00} they will still be listed individually. My credit report is 30 pages long due to 132 medical accounts listed individually.
This should not be legal, it is legal to add collections to someone credit report but not list it individually like that. I have had so many people tell me that this is not legal or ethical.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'balances with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] collection agency have been listed. the balances are owed to both [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2924,'08/02/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Credit monitoring or identity theft protection services','This school is complete fraudulent I attended the school without a high school diploma and they offer me job replacement I was unable to do anything with the degree offered because no one honors the school. When I started school I asked them if I would be able to use my credit to go to another institution to further my education no school accepted the credit from this school and yes I now have my GED so that was n''t the problem moving forward.i wrote them I disputed because im willing to take legal actions to get my money back so I could receive a loan to go to another school','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'this school is complete fraudulent I attended the school without a high school diploma. when I started school they offered me job replacement. they offered me job replacement and they offered me job replacement');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2925,'08/02/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers','I recently applied to Discover for a credit card. It has into APR of 0 % and after that the APR can vary from 11.99 to 23.99 As advertised, it reads : * Intro purchase APR is 0 % for 14 months from date of account opening ; then the standard purchase APR applies. Intro Balance Transfer APR is 0 % for 14 months from date of first transfer, for transfers under this offer that post to your account by   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  , 2017 ; then the standard purchase APR applies. Standard purchase APR : 11.99 % variable to 23.99 % variable, based on your creditworthiness.
I have FICO score of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . I received a 23.99 APR! This is VERY misleading when it specifically says " based on your creditworthiness ''''. How is it I received the HIGHEST APR with an excellent FICO score. I called the company and they said after a year they could look at possibly lowering it. I talked to the Manager and he said he could close the account. I told him if I close it, it affects my credit score and he said " I do n''t know anything about that '''' ... and he is a manager?!?!?! I feel this company is very misleading! It is a way of tricking you into thinking you will get a good APR, and when you get it, you do n''t ... in hopes that you are not able to pay off your balance and the APR will skyrocket to 23.99!','DISCOVER BANK',2.0,2.0,'I recently applied to Discover for a credit card. it has into APR of 0 % and then the standard purchase APR applies. I received a 23.99 A');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2926,'08/02/2017','Mortgage','Home equity loan or line of credit (HELOC)','Struggling to pay mortgage','It has now been 2 years since our house o has foreclosed. We continue to work hard to improve our credit and save money so that one day we will be able to purchase another home for our family. US Bank was the the second lien on my house. I continue to get statements from them that I owe {$47000.00} and my minimum payment {$15000.00}. During the foreclosure process in 2015 we had several conversations with US Bank and tried a short sale that did not go through. They stated if that did not go through then with the FHA Loan we had the foreclosure monies would be divided with the first and second lien holder. A lot of communication short falls and lack of follow thru with US bank has resulted. I have called and spoke with US Bank over 50 times in the last year and a half. I have told Us Bank several times I needed to know how and why I owe this amount. No one seems to know and they send me to several different departs with in US Bank. They have stated to me that they would contact me when they had a answer. This has not happened and I still have no answers. Well that has been the case since the foreclosure. We have contacted them multiple times and they never get back to us. They continue to send a statement every month with a past amount due and that is it. The overdue payment shows up on our credit report. It has been 2 years and US bank is very difficult to work with. They have not gone as far as demanding any payment or anything like that, they just send a monthly statement? This has hurt my credit report and has put very much stress on my family and I. Thanks','U.S. BANCORP',4.0,4.0,'a lot of communication short falls and lack of follow thru with us bank has resulted. a lot of communication short falls and lack of follow thru with us bank has resulte');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2927,'08/02/2017','Debt collection','Medical debt','Written notification about debt','A collection showed up on my credit report. Prior to this I received no notice of a debt owed, explanation of what it is for your the dispute process. The amount was just added to a previous bill already with the same collection company.','United Consumers Inc',2.0,2.0,'a collection showed up on my credit report. the amount was just added to a previous bill already with the same collection company.');
