INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2929,'08/02/2017','Vehicle loan or lease','Loan','Struggling to pay your loan','got a car loan from navy federal [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].2014 for about [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. beginning payments were [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a month. got the opportunity to secure a personal loan through the same bank a year later. used to loan to " pay off '''' my car ( i have my title so it cant be repoed ) payments increased to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a month. been paying on this car for 3 years and still owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. ca n''t tell me something is n''t wrong with this picture. I can do math and I ''ve paid about 13k so far. I ''m paying dbl and it ''s not right. I make half the money I did 3 years ago and the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a month is too much. I ''ve tried to get the interest rate lowered several times with no success. All the bank offers is payment deferal and that comes with a price. I do n''t mind paying what I owe, but I ''ve basically paid for this car already and still have 2 years of payments left. This is what ''s wrong with this country now and why families ca n''t stay afloat. No matter how they try to justify this it ''s wrong.','NAVY FEDERAL CREDIT UNION',2.0,2.0,'navy federal loaned a car for about $400,000. a year later, the car was a month and a month. the car was a month old and');
