INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2953,'07/28/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','There is a account in collection on my Experian Credit report that is incomplete information and can not be verified and it still remains on my credit file. I have provided documents of the account and what missing and inaccurate information is on my file. I have also provided a letterhead document from the original furnisher of the account stating what I am disputing. This account must be deleted from my credit file immediately.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a credit report is in collection on my Experian Credit report. it is incomplete information and can not be verified. this account must be deleted immediately.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2954,'07/28/2017','Vehicle loan or lease','Loan','Managing the loan or lease','We just received a bill stating that we have not paid them in four months ( false ). We have been paying our agreed loan payments, and we have also notified them when we have had to make repairs ( for example : replace steering column ( purchased for {$85.00} at salvage yard. I also had to spend {$84.00} on renting a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] track to transport the part from the salvage yard to the repair facility, and {$200.00} for the mechanic ''s labor ). In addition, I have also had to replace the starter ( {$45.00} for a part from an online parts house ... .a delivery that was delaved for two weeks, plus {$100.00} labor ). On the latter, I lost two weeks of work as a result ). Along with that, I had to pay {$150.00} to install a horn to bring the car up to state standards. We want our bill readjusted to reflect payments made.','Innovate Managed Holdings, LLC',2.0,2.0,'bill stating that we have not paid them in four months. we have also notified them when we have had to make repairs.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2955,'07/28/2017','Debt collection','Medical debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','At the time this debt was incurred, I was on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and also State of Georgia [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Medicaid. The original creditor must not have filed a claim with Medicaid for payment. A medicaid patient is NOT liable to pay out of pocket, can not be billed balances, and can not be turned over to collections or held responsible for balances. My Medicaid number at the time was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','WAKEFIELD & ASSOCIATES, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a medicaid patient is NOT liable to pay out of pocket, can not be billed balances. a medicaid patient is NOT liable to pay out of pocket,');
