INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2962,'07/27/2017','Debt collection','Payday loan debt','False statements or representation','The complaint I have is about Kahrs Law Offices P.A. located in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Ks. They were handling the debt that my wife owed to a payday loan company. We were served by a sheriff and given paperwork for a court date but could pay the amount of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] before then and not go to court. I continuously tried to contact the office to pay off the debt and left all the information that they stated on their answering machine to have them call me back. No one ever answers the phone or bothers to call me back. The day of court my wife could not make it and still no one had called me back. Their office opened at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] so i tried as soon as they opened to contact them. It was at this time that a the woman who ''s office it was finally answered the phone, i stated that it was my wife ''s account and all I wanted to do was pay the debt of {$600.00} to pay it off. She then told me she could not talk to me, because i was not on the account. I told her my wife was at work and being that she works for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] it would be hard for her to get time to call her to pay it or put me on the account, and that the time for us to be in court was at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] so i just wanted to pay it to insure that we did not accumulate any other fees. She again informed that she could not talk to me because i was not on the account. So after getting off the phone with her I tried to get ahold of my wife at work and to try and have her give the lady a call for fix it. By that time it was a little past [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when my wife finally got the chance to call her. My wife did not have a lot of time so she put me on the account so i could pay it. When i called back to pay the debt that lady informed me that since it was now after [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that we would now owe them [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars. So i paid the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars while one the phone with them. After about a month we received paperwork saying my wife ''s check would be garnished for the remainder. As check after check was garnished i immediately noticing that more than 400 dollars had been garnished. So I called back to Kahrs Law Offices to see what had happened. After yet again continuously calling getting nothing but answering machines, i finally got ahold of someone. I was then told by this lady that the amount that we owed after missing court was not [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars in fact it was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I asked her why the other lady told me it was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and she was rude and said I could not tell you why the other lady told you that you only owed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars.','KAHRS LAW OFFICES, PA',2.0,2.0,'a sheriff was called to the office to pay off the debt. she told her she could not talk to her because she was not on the account. she told her she could');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2963,'07/26/2017','Debt collection','Auto debt','False statements or representation','I voluntary surrendered the vehicle in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. At that time I requested a copy of my entire file with the company including the amount that the vehicle was sold for. I was told by the manager [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that I could not have any documentation relating to the vehicle. I called the office again and this time spoke to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who managed the payments at the front office and was told that I would have to speak to a manager who should be able to get me the information. I was informed again that I could not have any paperwork including the resale price. I no longer had any contact with the company. As I am repairing my credit I reached back out to the company XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and this time I believe that I spoke to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who informed me that he could not produce any paperwork since the account was so old and his exact words to me were " dispute this item on your credit report. '''' I disputed this item XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after no activity since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they have misrepresented on my credit report. 1st error - it is stating repossession and it should have stated voluntary surrender. 2nd error - they have stated that a payment of {$240.00} was made - I have not made any payments on this account. 3rd error - they stated that the vehicle was refinanced/renewed which is simply not true. This bank/creditor is known for their deceptive practices. Please investigate and remove from my credit as they are not providing correct or accurate information. Thank you kindly','Byrider Franchising, LLC',2.0,4.0,'a manager told me that I could not have documentation relating to the vehicle. he told me that I would have to speak to a manager who should be able to get');
