ut to me until Tuesday after I called and left two voicemails. She did tell me that if she could find the original recorded phone call where I ordered the certified check, it would be simple to stop payment on it and return the money to my checking account. She also said if she could n''t find it and the check was lost, I would have to wait another 90 days.
Thank you in advance for your time. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','UNITED SERVICES AUTOMOBILE ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'a personal loan was going to be used to pay off a different loan at another bank. my husband and I are both police officers and he is a former [COMP');
