INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2975,'07/25/2017','Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service','Domestic (US) money transfer','Other transaction problem','I received a limited time special rate to take advantage of a 2.99 promotional rate through XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] billing cycle by using People ''s checks ( which were attached ) or performing balance transfers. On the morning of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I performed an online balance transfer from People ''s United Bank to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the amount of {$1100.00}. In the afternoon of the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I contacted People ''s to cancel balance transfer. At that time I spoke to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who informed me that he was unable to see balance transfer. I advised that I had confirmation of the transfer but he was adamant that he could n''t see it and that it would take up to 2 business days to process. He suggested that I call back on Monday XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at which time People ''s would note on the account that the wrong information was submitted and the transfer would be canceled. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I received an email from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] thanking me for my payment of {$1100.00}. I then contacted People ''s and asked how the transfer had processed when [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had informed me the day before that there was no record of a transfer. The customer service rep ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) said I needed to contact [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and ask them to refuse the payment. I then contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and spoke with a customer service rep ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) who informed me that he could not cancel the payment as the payment was coming in from a third party. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] indicated that only Peoples would be able to cancel transfer so I again contacted People ''s and spoke with another customer service rep ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) who advised that once People ''s received notification of the transfer from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Peoples would stop balance transfer and waive fee, which would take up to 3 business days. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I again contacted People ''s and spoke with customer service rep ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and advised him that not only is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] still showing a payment of {$1100.00} but People ''s now shows an additional {$1100.00} on my balance ( the {$1100.00} transfer amount and {$44.00} transfer fee ). [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] advised that he is unable to have money refunded from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and that it is my responsibility to contact [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and have returned to Peoples. He further advised that once this has been done Peoples will gladly refund the {$44.00} transfer fee. Of course Peoples would refund the transfer fee if there is no transfer then there is no fee. The fact that Peoples advises that it takes up to 5 business days to process a balance transfer and the fact that they processed this transfer overnight speaks volumes as to how unethical this entire process has been. It appears that Peoples did everything in its power to lock me into this balance transfer and did very little if anything to stop it even though I attempted to stop it within the same day, which is unconscionable and appears to violate my right to rescind their offer within a reasonable amount of time, saddling me with their {$44.00} transfer fee.','PEOPLE''S UNITED BANK, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] received a limited time special rate. I performed an online balance transfer from People''s United');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2976,'07/24/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Credit monitoring or identity theft protection services','X/XX/17  : C apital One credit card email states someone tried to access accoun t. Spok  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  with Capital One representative and online access wa s disabled. Was directed  to re-enroll the card and access   to credit card would be restored.
 X/XX/17  :   Have not received a statement and billing is due soon. Attempt to re-enroll in online services but only brings back error messages.  Two phone calls are placed ( one for 4 mins, and one for 84 mins ).   End result is there is an error on their end and it would tak e two weeks to fix.        X/XX/17  : No state ment received.  Again attempt to re-enroll online to access my account. Again same error message is received. ( 4 ) calls are made to Capital One to resolve this 5 mins, 6 mins, and 70 mins. Again no resolution, no stateme nts provided and the bill paid over they phone not knowing what I am paying for.       X/XX/17  : No  statement provide and bill was due. Again, attempt to log on only to be stoppe  d. Two phone calls are made 12 mins and 85 mins. No resolution had. No statement provided.
Today as it stands : There has been ( 3 ) billing cycles without a billing statement. While I can access their credit tracker I ca n''t access my actual account. Because of this lack of information I have h  ad to report all transactions since   XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  as  fraud. I can not verify the balance and I do not have access to my account online to verify charges. I have been more than patient and done my do diligence trying to resolve this issue. My account has been in good standings ( no late payments, balances in full, no delinquencies ) through this painful process. This is beyond repair. It should be noted that o n  XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  I request a paper statement as those were not being provided as well. You would think once they shut yo ur online access down that they would provide those. That is unfortunately not the case. I was told it would be anoth er 1-3 months before that change would take effect. I can not wait 4-6 months total to see what is being ch arged to my account. This is completely unacceptable and I believe there are legal ramifications for my time and charges. Call records and case numbers are assigned to account. The company has plenty of documentation to confirm this case.       Sincerely,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'X/XX/17 : No statement provided and bill was due. Attempt to re-enroll in online services but only brings back error messages. two phone');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(2977,'07/24/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017 I sent a certified letter to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], TransUnion, and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on behalf of myself and my husband regarding a Bankruptcy listed on our accounts. Per the FCRA 623 ( a ) ( 5 ) requesting validation with the original creditor. I have contacted the Bankruptcy courts and requested policy information regarding the validation of the Bankruptcy court records, as the information appearing on our files is inaccurate and inconsistent. Per the Bankruptcy court they have not only not received any requests to validate this information, they do not validate this information and they only provide the case number and name on a bankruptcy. As such there is another couple within the same county we live with the same names as my husband and I and our information is frequently confused when we have gone to assess our personal property and have received mail for the other couple from the Tax assessors office in the past. I have requested copies of the documentation used to validate this information and it has been returned to me again as verified without providing documentation. Per the FCRA 609 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( a ) I am now turning to you for assistance in this matter. And request that unless physical verification can be provided to me all information obtained in these listings which is inaccurate, inconsistent and erroneous be removed from our credit files. Instead, I am in receipt of letters stating that unless I provide new information to support my claim they will not be re investigating this matter again. The investigation never took place to begin with.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a certified letter to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], TransUnion, and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on behalf of myself and my husband ');
