INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3020,'07/16/2017','Student loan','Private student loan','Struggling to repay your loan','This company has called and they ''ve also written requesting that I pay the loan in full. I ''ve had situations in life arise where it left me in a financial ditch. Whenever a representative contacts me, I ''ve tried explaining that I ca n''t pay the balance but I ''m willing to send in small payments at least by making some contribution towards decreasing this loan, but they ''re never willing to make payment arrangements with me. Now it ''s on my credit affecting my score and showing as delinquent when I did try to maintain a positive status with the company. It has gone to another debt collector. No luck with them and the representatives are very rude and unprofessional.','Lincoln Educational Services Corporation',2.0,2.0,'a representative has called the company and they have written requesting that I pay the loan in full. the company has called and they have written requesting that I pay the loan in full');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3021,'07/16/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','Under CFPB case  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   informed me that they would initiate an identity theft fraud investigation and informed me of the results after 60 days. The 60 days has passed, and I have yet to receive the findings of the investigation. I have provided   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   a copy of a police report filed with the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  Texas police department and a identity theft report from the Federal Trade Commission.   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   informed me of the fraud investigation on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , 2017. I provide them the police report and identity theft report via certified mail (   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    ) which was received by   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , 2017.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'CFPB case [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] informed me of the fraud investigation. the 60 days have passed, and I have yet to receive the findings.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3022,'07/15/2017','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I filed a homeowner insurance claim with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ) Insurance Company due to a flooded and thereby destroyed kitchen. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] issued to me a check on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017 for {$7900.00} payable to me and to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the holder of my mortgage and therefore, the singular lien holder on my home. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] endorsed the check and forwarded the check to me. I endorsed the check and deposited the check into my checking account at Bank of America ( BOA ) on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017. BOA placed a 10 day hold on the check, for unexplained reasons. On day 1XXXX [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the 10 day hold, the funds were still not made available to me. I called BOA, and after being placed on and off of hold for two hours, I was told that the check was rejected because [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had not endorsed the check. When I requested that they again look at the back of the check, they discovered that the check had indeed been endorsed by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. After being placed on hold for another 45 minutes, I was told that the check had been rejected because [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was not listed on my checking account, much like a spouse would be listed as an authorized person on my checking account. In addition to the absolute absurdity of the explanations offered by BOA in trying to cover-up their arbitrary and capricious reasoning for rejecting the insurance check, I explained to BOA that I was nevertheless responsible, beginning on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017, for making payments for my mortgage, my automobile loans as well as " auto payment withdrawals '''' for my car insurance, my life insurance policies for my grandchildren and certain other credit cards. Knowing that since my insurance check was rejected, that I would be unable to pay my mortgage and my automobile payment. I was also aware that once the " auto payments '''' were withdrawn for my automobile insurance, life insurance payments for my grandchildren and certain other credit card payments, that there would be insufficient funds to pay these creditors. I asked BOA how they would handle the punitive charges of {$35.00} assessed by BOA for each payment made using non sufficient funds ( NSF ). I also asked about the consequences of the fees charged by my creditors due to NSF ''s. I was told, " I hear you, but there is nothing we can do to help you ''''. On my call to BOA on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was told that my rejected check would arrive to my home possibly on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but no later than [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. With the arrival of no check, I called BOA daily, requesting the escalation of each call to a higher level of management withing BOA. Today, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], BOA told me that the check was rejected in order to protect me, in case the payer, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Insurance Company, did not have sufficient funds. Really? The largest insurer in the State of NJ not having sufficient funds to cover a payment to me for {$7900.00}? Meanwhile, in BOA ''s efforts to protect me from financial predators, I am unable to pay my bills.
<P/>
Today, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was told by BOA that by law they did not have to deliver the rejected check to me until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. How refreshing that BOA is more concerned about their rights under the law than helping their customer to avoid delinquencies in payments to creditors. This, in addition, to causing permanent damage to my credit ratings and credit report.
<P/>
Shame on you Bank of America. You bully your customers in order to protect your profits. If you choose to continue with this arrogant attitude, there will be no need for you to concern yourself with profits. Without customers, there will not be any profits. And, sadly, as you alienate more and more customers, there will come a time where you can no longer cost shift by continuing to add more and more punitive policies. This is not rocket science. With virtual currencies becoming more mainstream, who will need the non-services of Bank of America.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'insurance company issued a check on a mortgage and auto loans. the check was rejected because of a flooded kitchen. the check was deposited into my checking account at bank');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3023,'07/15/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , I owed   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   for a credit line of {$1400.00}. By  XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , I paid the amount off in full as my last payment was {$250.00}. After making all payments, The   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   sold account number  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  to Midland Credit Management, Inc  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .  XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,    [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   obtained a judgment against me in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  County, Kansas court  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . During that time, I made additional payments by check not aware this was regarding my   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   Account ending in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .  XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , I sold my home and the {$2300.00} judgement was held back fr om my profit of sale. I found out recently in the process of searching through old paperwork and notice I ''ve been scammed. I over paid Midland as they also collected money on an account they never should had purchased from   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  . I ''ve been writing and requesting for the return and interest as   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and Midland refuse to resolve my claim.
<P/>
