INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3024,'07/15/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','To Whom It May Concern, Thank you for taking the time out of your day to read this letter. I just pulled my credit report, and discovered that a late payment was reported on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  2017 for my account.
In the month of   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   2017, my uncle had a   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and was admitted to the hospital due to my uncle being wrongfully laid off from work. As a result of his age, he did not have insurance. My uncle has been a father to me as my father passed away when I was young. In that same month, the car was involved in an accident. In   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    2017, It had been brought to my attention that I fell victim to identity theft. I filed a police report for the identity theft to which put a severe hindrance on my finances. I also fell victim to a {$2500.00} IRS scam. In that same month, my CPA of 20 years died from   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    which prevented me from filing my taxes correctly and so my company was audited. In   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   my wife had a  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . In that same month, my mother was notified that she had   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   to which I had to leave my work and care for her. I fell on very rough times these past several months, which is why I and was unable to make car payments on time.
I realize I made a mistake in falling behind, but up until that point, my payment history with you had been spotless. I have regained my footing and will pay in full the amount owed on   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  , 2017 and set up automatic payments moving forward.
I ''m not proud of this black mark on my record, but it ''s the only one I have, and I would be extremely grateful if you could honor this request to remove the lateness from my credit report. It would help me immensely in securing other lines of credit so that I can further improve my credit score.
If the lateness can not be removed entirely, I would still be appreciative if you could make a goodwill adjustment.
Thank You.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'in the month of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2017, my uncle had a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANON');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3025,'07/14/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I sent in several certified letters to all   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   credit bureaus notifying them that there was incorrect information on my credit report as inaccurate accounts, inquiries and personal information. I only received bogus verified letters from all   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    bureaus. I recently checked my credit confidently knowing that the inaccurate accounts, inquiries, and personal information we ''re removed from my credit report. I also gave an ample amount of time for the creditors and credit bureaus to correct themselves. I ''ve given the credit bureaus ample amount of months to correct the errors but yet I still see there was no progression or any attempts made to correct this errored information off of my credit report. Both the credit bureau and creditors broke the law without getting any consent from myself, and I have n''t received any documents with my signature verified. Many of the FCRA laws we ''re broken in this incident, my next move is to file a lawsuit against all  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  credit bureaus.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'credit bureaus broke the law without getting any consent from myself. a lawsuit is filed against all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureaus.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3026,'07/14/2017','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I opened a new Checking account with Key Bank. I had recently moved upstate NY from the city. Two weeks later, the same branch manager that opened my account closed it with no type of notice. I found out my account was closed when I was trying to take money out of my account at an ATM. <P/> XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is the day my account was closed and a check was sent to my address with the remaining funds. Customer service over the phone told me there was no reason why my account was closed and I ''d have to ask who opened it for me. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I called the bank and the branch manager had me come in to file a declaration of loss. He said he ''d send out a second check now that I ''ve stopped the first one. On that same day, I clarified if I did not get this second check, what would be the next step? He told me at that point he ''d be able to " emergency release the funds. '''' Each time I visit this location I learn something new about my account. When I went to the branch on the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a representative said my account was closed because I did n''t give proof of residence via mail. I was never told this information nor did I get this letter requesting my new address. On the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the representative told me I had to wait 90 days after my first check was dispersed. Why then did I have to go in and sign a declaration of loss if it did n''t speed up ANY process? <P/> It is now XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and this check is still nowhere to be found and I continue to get the run-around. I plan on going back to the branch this weekend in hopes the manager is there since he was n''t both days I went in this week.','KEYCORP',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] opened a new checking account with key bank. the branch manager that opened my account closed it');
