INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3036,'07/13/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','Took or threatened to take negative or legal action','I have contact  National Credit  Systems on several occasions in regards to comments on all  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  of my credit files that I want removed. After being told several times that someone would call me back I finally spoke with  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  at ext  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  today,   XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]     who put her  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , who identified herself as a supervisor. When I explained to her that I have asked all  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  credit bureaus to remove the comments " consumer disputes this information '''' from my file since I am no longer disputing this debt and they informed me that every time they remove the comments  National Credit Systems  add the comments back on.  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  informed me that the only way the would remove the comments is if I paid the debt. I told her I was no longer disputing it and want the comments removed, she again repeated that the only way they would remove the comments is if I paid the debt right now and did I have a credit card handy. I told her I was not paying this debt, but am no longer disputing it. That I ''m trying to obtain a mortgage and need the comments removed and since I was the one the initiated the dispute and am no longer disputing it, I am requesting that they stop put the comments back on when I have them removed, she told me that this is n''t going to happen, and again the only way they would remove the comments is if I paid this debt in full right no.','National Credit Systems,Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a supervisor has asked all credit bureaus to remove comments on all my credit files. she said the only way they would remove the comments is if I paid the debt. she');
