INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3042,'07/12/2017','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I was expecting 2 reimbursement checks to arrive from my employer, I contacted my employer on X/XX/17 because I had not received the checks in the mail. My employer advised me that the checks had been deposited in someones account, and my employer sent me an image of the fronts and backs of the checks, which showed a forgery of my name and the statement to deposit the funds to the account of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and a signature indicating the name [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I drove to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to inquired since the checks were issued on a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account. While at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we discovered the checks indicated they were cashed at a Wells Fargo. I went to Wells Fargo and they told me they would not file a claim for the theft and would not be looking into the issue, they would not take any information on the issue eventhough I was offering them the images of both sides showing them the account number the checks were deposited to. So as the victim of theft and forgery I filed a police report and have provided the check images to the police department as Wells Fargo clearly will do nothing. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] branch, the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Fraud Department, and the police department all indicated Wells Fargo is difficult to work with and that they do not respond in a timely fashion.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'the checks were issued on a Wells Fargo account. the checks indicated they were cashed at a Wells Fargo. the fraud department and the police department indicated Well');
