INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3063,'07/08/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Unable to get your credit report or credit score','I have been trying to get a credit card open with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I was denied, cause of a credit score. After calling [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was told something was in collections and to call experian. After calling experian multiple times I was unable actually get a hold of someone to tell me what is in collections. Experian even gave me the option on the automated message for the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I hit that button and experian hung up on me saying " we are unable to help you, goodbye ''''. Then I am calling [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to try to get an actual phone number for this credit company and they refused to help me saying I have to call this credit companies there is nothing else they can do to help me. I even have it on my record of me calling them three times to try to get a different phone number or get somewhere where I can find out where my collection is that I have no idea about. No one has been able to answer any of my questions and the credit company is refusing to help me as well and just hangs up the phone on me because there is no one even able to speak to. And now [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] refuses to reveal what is in collections and will not give me my credit report that I am lawfully owed for free.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a credit card is in collections and a credit score is denied. the credit company refuses to help me and will not give me my credit report.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3064,'07/07/2017','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Threatened to contact someone or share information improperly','Has contacted my husband repeatedly after my request for them not to/ and my husbands request to them not to contact him Portfolio Recovery offered a debt settlement and I accepted via mail and sent two checks to them post dated for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Portfolio Recovery attempted to cash one check on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which resulted in a overdraft fee to my checking account / on Friday of the same week Portfolio Recovery returned my other check and stated then that they do not accept post dated checks. A stipulation not in the original agreement. The second check and both payments for the two accounts were rejected by Portfolio Recovery. They resended the debt settlement offer. They have insisted to have direct access to my checking account upon which I have refused. In turn I asked to set up a payment plan in writing asa formal agreement from them to me so I could settle my debt. They rejected my offer to pay them via an agreement that did not include my permission to them to access my checking account. They would not take any other form of payment other than a direct bank draft.','PORTFOLIO RECOVERY ASSOCIATES INC',2.0,2.0,'portfolio Recovery offered a debt settlement. they rejected my offer to pay them via an agreement that did not include my permission to access my checking account.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3065,'07/07/2017','Debt collection','I do not know','Written notification about debt','I received a copy of my credit report a few months ago and saw that there were some questionable items on my report. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I sent a letter to the credit bureaus asking for verification on this account - no verification provided. I sent a second letter to the credit bureaus i received the contact information for this creditor from the bureaus. I contacted the creditor asking for details on what this filing on my report is for. I have not received any answer for this except from the credit bureaus saying that this item is " verified. '''' I have given this company over 30 days from when i sent the 2nd letter and almost 6 months since i sent the first letter. i am frustrated to see that in addition to receiving NO RESPONSE this item continues to show up negatively on my report. please investigate.','Merchants and Professional Bureau, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a copy of my credit report was sent to the credit bureaus. the credit bureaus have not provided verification.');
