INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3068,'07/07/2017','Debt collection','Medical debt','Took or threatened to take negative or legal action','I had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] completed in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], PA. Unfortunately, a few of the billing codes were wrong and some payment was denied. I called the insurance company and received the codes that they will pay this bill under. The hospital told me to have the doctor send a new script to the lab for the purpose of rebilling. <P/>My doctor sent the new script to the lab on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and confirmed receipt of the new script. As far as we knew they rebilled the insurance company. The. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I received a call from Medical Data Systems stating that the bill went to them for collections. I told them what was going on and gave them  the new codes to have the hospital bill under. I had n''t heard that anything was n''t paid or done by the company. <P/>On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I checked my credit report because we are a victim of fraudulent use of our social security numbers ( caused by a breach at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). I saw that Medical Data Systems is now on my credit report. I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] billing and they tell me they have never rebilled the insurance company, never received codes from the collection agency and that they do n''t have the new script. I told them I will fax a copy of it over to them. And will do so later today. Unfortunately, they wo n''t pull this from the collection agency. <P/>I then called Medical Data Systems, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], FL to find out what is going on and why they never forwarded the correct information to the hospital. They told me that they they personally rebilled the insurance company and 48 hours later the insurance company told them that three of the codes were unbillable. I gave them five codes. They also billed a year after the second script was sent to the hospital so the codes may have changed. That is not my problem. This should have been done right from the beginning. <P/>The hospital billing dept. has been reported to the insurance various times for fraudulent billing resulting in us supposedly owing them money. The insurance company has been able to fix those " errors '''' but ca n''t this time because of it being an issue with coding. This company is single handily ruining my credit for issues that are really their own fault.','Medical Data Systems, Inc.',2.0,4.0,'medical data systems rebilled insurance company for collections. they gave me new codes to have the hospital bill under. they say they have never rebilled the insurance company.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3069,'07/07/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017 I sent a letter to Capital One/ Neiman Marcus  asking to investigate and remove the incorrect reporting of an account of mine. It currently reports as " Past due 30 days, two times. '''' I sent my letter to the address that was listed on my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit report, which is the following : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], IL [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2017, that letter was returned as undeliverable. This means that the address furnished by the original creditor Capital One/ Neiman Marcus is reporting inaccurately. According to the Fair Credit Reporting Act, only ACCURATE and VERIFIABLE information may be reported on a consumer credit report and if it does not meet any of the aforementioned criteria, by law, it must be removed. Therefore, I am requesting that not only the negative remarks be removed from the reporting of this account from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but that they also furnish said reporting agencies with the correct address information to be reported.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a letter to capital One/ Neiman Marcus asking to investigate and remove the incorrect reporting of an account of mine. it currently reports as " Past due 30 days, two times.');
