INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3075,'07/05/2017','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Payday loan','Charged fees or interest you didn''t expect','After accepting my loan and made my first payment, I attempt to track my interest rate on my great plain account by accessing their website, I noticed that the bi-weekly payments went to interest. The charges became excessive and amounted to only fees outside of the agreed upon amount. I borrowed {$500.00} and have paid back over {$900.00}. The company continues to harass me claiming that I owe them an additional {$2200.00}. for a above the amount that I have already paid back for a {$500.00} loan. Prior to receiving the loan I was not allowed to view the full agreement I ''ve tried to view the loan agreement at the company ''s website but they will not allow me to see agreement I can only view the payment history which. I wish to be released from this fraudulent agreement. I can not phantom that an {$500.00} loan will cost {$2000.00} to repay. This is not a fair deal and I ''ve been scammed. Since I have already paid more than the amount I originally borrowed I would like them to consider my account paid in full and close my account. I would also like them to make ... corrections to my credit report saying the loan was paid satisfactory.','GVA Holdings, LLC',2.0,4.0,'the company continues to harass me claiming that I owe them an additional $2200.00. the company will not allow me to view the full agreement.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3076,'07/05/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Account Ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] This card reflects delinquency in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. However, this account has payment protection on it. First, the card had been  attempting to collect on the delinquent payment and knew it was due to a job loss, but never applied the credit protection program that I had been paying for ( a subsequent bill is attached showing the charge for credit protection ). <P/>Specifically, please pay attention to pay 5 of the attached where it reflects the charge for the credit protection as : XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] {$1.00}, I have had this protection program since the accepting the card. <P/>Additionally, once the payment protection program was contacted they were to make all back payments, as well as remove the negative marks as it was an essential part of acceptance of the credit card as I had a reasonable expectation under the UCC section 2-201, that the minimum monthly payments would be made during the time of my job loss, and no derogatory marks be reported at inception and as a result of the promises made by the credit protection team. Further, the fact that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] attempted to collect on the debt knowing I had lost my job and not applying the credit protection program during our first communication in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is a violation of UCC section 1-304, as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was acting without good faith and with unclean hands.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'account reflects delinquency in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3077,'07/05/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','Store credit card','Fees or interest','I was charged more than {$6.00} in interest while still bring within my {$0.00} APR period, additional the {$6.00} that I was wrongfully charged was reported as my balance on my credit profile. The {$6.00} has since been refunded however I believe this inaccurate reporting of a balance I should have never been charged with is a violation of the FCRA. <P/>It is important that financial institutions ensure they are not wrongfully charging consumers.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'$6.00 was charged in interest while still bring within my $0.00 APR period. the $6.00 was reported as my balance on my');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3078,'07/05/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','Written notification about debt','We ''re retired senior citizens and we own a paid in full time share at " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. A 25yrs lease with about 8 yrs used, which requires an annual maintenance fee billed in advance for the up coming year. They have assigned the collection of these fees to a service agent naming them on their Website For Accounts & Financial Services " Conrad Acceptance Corporation ''''. We have never been delinquent since we purchased the timeshare and have always paid on time until now. <P/>
Enclosed is the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' s assessment notice of the first Dues Statement dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] describing an itemized list of fees due in total of {$930.00} with a partial payment due XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of {$280.00}. <P/>No where on this document is there a notice of possible or probable additional collection action after any prescribe dates or time limits. <P/>I have also enclosed a second Dues Statement ... dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], with one line which notes a due date of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the billing amount of {$600.00}, Past/due, {$930.00}, Late Charge Due, {$0.00}, Vat Tax 7.5 % of {$45.00} and Total Due {$930.00}. Again no where on this document is there a notice of possible or probable additional collection action after any prescribe dates or time limits. Consequently, as a result of financial difficulty and a lack of any written penalty warnings we choose to delayed our payment. <P/>I was contacted by phone in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] by the Conrad Acceptance Corporation and a message left on my phone requested I call a number. I did at which time I was informed that my account had been referred to their collection department, whom I was speaking to at that moment and informed I had been assessed a collection fees of ~ 1/3 the total amount due, which they were entitled to do, this amounted to {$310.00} additional. The reason given was because I was more than 90 days over due on my maintenance fee assessment. <P/>The Service does not, I repeat, does not advance the fee for me. <P/>I insisted there was no written notice of any of these now verbalized policies. I was told, what she was now verbalizing to me was the companies long standing policy. <P/>Reluctantly I agreed to send partial pay of {$960.00} before XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].
<P/>During this phone communication with Conrad Acceptance Corporation ''s collection department I was given the option by the agent " only because our time share was ''Paid in Full '''' and they had been moved it to their collection department, we were eligible to be offered a walkway deal, to with, we would relinquish our time share rights for a forgiveness of the collection fee, while paying the original dues with late fees off and henceforth have no more obligation nor claim with this ( our ) time share and NO other compensation was offered. This alerted me to a possible fraudulent situation. <P/>I asked again " without written notice how is that possible and why would I be obligated to that policy? I am late in fulfilling my obligation to the RESORT that is no reason to without injury to the Conrad Acceptance Corporation to be assessed an injury fee. Who is being injured here? <P/>XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called the Resort, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and complained about the lack of written information from there agents about these policies from them to their customers and they told me after an account goes to there agents collection proceedings they have no more control and would not be able to help us, she went on to say, had we called the resort before their agent put our account into this status they could have done something. <P/><P/>I am confused how does any company get to Willie Nellie assess an unwritten, verbally announced, after the fact penalty, when the only injury to them is for them to move an account from one draw to another with a reassignment of an account number. ( They are already the collection agent. ) I thought Late fees assessments after a date were to be noted on a request for payment along with any collection actions to be taken after a certain date. In this case the last late fee noted on the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Statement was {$0.00} with no written warning about collection proceedings. <P/>We want to meet our obligation but feel we are being put upon without legal notice and punished again for circumstances beyond our control. We find ourselves between a rock and a hard place.','CONRAD CREDIT CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'a 25yr lease with about 8 yrs used, which requires an annual maintenance fee billed in advance for the up coming year. the fee is billed in advance');
