INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3085,'07/03/2017','Student loan','Private student loan','Dealing with your lender or servicer','I pay more then the current payment Due on my Private Student Loan every month. However, the amount of interest satisfied each month gets higher and at the same time the principal satisfied lower. So, even if I pay more on my loan than is due or more then my normal payment amount, my principle balance does not decrease for that amount. <P/>I have tracked this activity for several years and I am very concerned that my payment is not accurately being applied to principal each month. <P/>I have called the company and they have not been able to answer my questions. I have even been told by a representative that it is " not worth paying extra on your loan '''' and that it will not help you pay the loan off earlier.','AES/PHEAA',4.0,4.0,'if I pay more than the current payment Due on my Private Student Loan every month, my principle balance does not decrease for that amount. P/>I have tracked this activity');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3086,'07/03/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','There are 8 inaccurate late payments being erroneously reported by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on my credit reports. For three years I have repeatedly challenged this inaccurate reporting directly through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Customer Service, the Credit Bureaus, and utilized a Credit Repair Service to no  avail. I submitted documentation two times to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] directly, proving I was enrolled in school during the time their derogatory information was inaccurately reported. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has refused to acknowledge receipt of the documentation or remove this extremely damaging late payment status from my credit reports. <P/>I also informed Navient I never received any letters or notice that I was going out of deferment and into re-payment status although I have had the same address for over fifteen years. I also had over a 6 year pristine record with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] prior to this incident and clearly extremely responsible regarding my loans. <P/>As a result of their inaccurate reporting and refusal to address their mistake, I transferred all of my student loans to another [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. So [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] no longer services any of these loans, yet continue to negatively report to the bureaus. <P/>On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I spoke yet again to another [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] supervisor. She instructed me to email the documentation and clearly stated she would take care of the mistake. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I emailed the documentation again as per her request and to her attention. There was no response. Over the course of the next three weeks, I followed up with additional emails and had to place six more phone calls to reach someone in the same department, ( although I ''m unsure it was the same dept. as they refused to transfer me to the original person I had spoken to. ) They proceeded to inform me they had not received the document I emailed on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. However they admitted to receiving the follow-up emails I had sent ( which ironically were part of the same email conversation ( linked ) that contained the document they refuse to acknowledge receiving. ) When I pointed this out, they refused to respond. <P/>[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] appears to maliciously ignore proof of their error and continues to report derogatory late payment status on my credit reports. Their erroneous reporting has caused great harm and an enormous time investment which has proven futile to resolve. Their inaccurate reporting has also destroyed multiple opportunities for housing, purchases and extension of credit.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'8 late payments reported by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] are erroneously reported. the credit bureaus have refused to acknowledge receipt of the documentation.');
