INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3091,'07/02/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit repair services','Problem with customer service','I have contacted Portfolio Recovery Associates, LLC several times starting 2 weeks ago requesting a letter for proof that I paid my debt off in full, I have a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance, and the date it was paid off. When I paid it they told me they would mail a letter with all of the infor.ation on it and I have never received mail from them other than when they wanted my money. At first I was told they can not email it. I then asked to speak with someone different and they said within 24 hours ill habe a consent email and after I " sign '''' that consent they will email me what I need. 2 days later I called back because I have not received a consent email. They had n''t even sent it, I then asked for a manager who sent me the consent and then i once again had to call back and get angry to receive the email i need however all that letter said is amount settled. I have called everyday this week XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and still have not received what I need. Gone through 3 different managers and every time it is some kind of excuse as to why and none of them are the same. I need a letter stating i have laid my debt in full, I have a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance, and the date I paid it on.','PORTFOLIO RECOVERY ASSOCIATES INC',2.0,2.0,'portfolio recovery Associates, LLC has contacted me several times since 2 weeks ago. they asked me to send a letter with all of the infor.ation on it. after ');
