<P/>
This was two weeks ago ... .This morning I woke up to a Freeze on both of my accounts. I have been to branches and made numerous calls and every one is saying they are unable to help me until I pay the remaining balance of the of the closed account off. This was not the agreement and they now taken what little money I now have and put a hold/freeze until I make all accounts a {$0.00} balance. I feel like the only people I have on my side are now taking advantage of me. <P/>PLEASE HELP!','PNC Bank N.A.',2.0,4.0,'a new account was opened with all of my further deposits going. the money was refunded but none of my personal money was recovered. if my money was not recovered we');
