INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3121,'06/25/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','My Chase Visa was charged {$420.00} via the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Website on XXXX2017. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] did some redirect when I hit submit and the charge was increased and made by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I chose a 2 BR, Premium, Beachfront, Beachview, twin beds in the 2nd BR Condo. I have presented evidence to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] showing them that I got a 1.5 BR condo with bunkbeds shoved into a tight Alcove. It is a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Condo with no updates and is very definitely not Premium. There were no twin beds and it was a 1/2 mile hike to the beach. <P/>Chase. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], DE [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] replies to my dispute with a general statement that I received the product for which I was billed. <P/>There seems to be a deception going on in that the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Website removes itself from the process when you hit submit. When you hit submit you get charged a higher rate and eventually you see the product is not as described by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. <P/>Chase is negligent in not properly investigating this and protecting my purchases from this deceptive fraud.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,4.0,'my Chase Visa was charged $420.00 via the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Website. the charge was increased and made by [COMPTE_');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3122,'06/25/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','Contacted Equifax regarding validation of debt by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Texas. Received correspondence that the account was validated. However, when contacting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for additional information by certified mail on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017 ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), the company stated that they were unable to locate the referenced account. I provided them sufficient information regarding the account. How is it possible for Equifax to validate an account if the organization can not locate my account? Also [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] per their correspondence and the Texas Finance Code 392.101 does not have " Active '''' status to engage in debt collection in the State of Texas. The law specifically state that ( a ) A third-party debt collector or credit bureau may not engage in debt collection unless the third-party debt collector or credit bureau has obtained a surety bond issued by a surety company authorized to do business in this state as prescribed by this section. A copy of the bond must be filed with the secretary of state. ( b ) the bond must be in favor of : ( 1 ) any person who is damaged by a violation of this chapter ; and ( 2 ) this state for the benefit of any person who is damaged by a violation of this chapter. The bond must be in the amount of {$10000.00}. During this time period [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has not been in a " Active '''' but rather a " Cancelled '''' status which removes the company from pursuing any alleged debt in Texas thus making Equifax in violation of Metro 2 compliance by validating a debt that is not collectible in the first place. I ''m requested that the five derogatory accounts be deleted from my credit report.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'Equifax received correspondence that the account was validated. the company stated that they were unable to locate the referenced account. the company said that they were unable to locate the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3123,'06/24/2017','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I DO NOT have a signed contract with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I am not liable for the debt that this company claims I owe. My name is missing my middle initial on the correspondence sent to me. I always use my middle initial. My name as it appears ok my credit report has my middle initial.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'i have a signed contract with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. my name is missing my middle initial');
