INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3158,'06/18/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit repair services','Fraud or scam','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I search the internet trying to find a mortgage company that would finances someone with a low credit score. And I came across a website that was set up like the federal government. That stated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had a program that would help consumer with a low credit score buy a house. But, you had to fill out their form so that they could run your credit report to see which of their plans would work best. Will I fill out the form and was DENIED. Then less then 10 minutes later I received a call from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] representing their self as been afflicted with the Federal government ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] department assistant consumer with getting approved for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] housing program. They promise me after reviewing my credit that they could get my credit score repair to at lest 80 to 100 point from what it was. I asked what was their process and how long should I expect to see any changes. And I was inform that base on my credit it should n''t take them no longer then 3 to 4 months. I question them about a judgment for past due rent. And they told me that I did n''t have to pay it that they could get it removed. After all their gran promise the total me that their fee was {$500.00}. and it was refundable if I was n''t satisfied. I have tried emailing and calling to request my refund with no reply. All they did was mess my credit up worse then when I was.','Park View Credit',2.0,2.0,'a mortgage company would help a low credit score buy a house. the company was set up like the federal government. the company promised to help consumers with a low credit');
