INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3161,'06/16/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','In  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , I repeatedly asked for a bill so that I can get caught up on payments of my mortgage fr om Fay Servicing in voicemails and also by talking to different representatives. At one point, I w as told that I would receive a bill in the mail but this was not received. On  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , I spoke with a representative and for the first time, was told I needed to request this type of information via email, which I have done. In the meantim e, Fay Servicing has b een racking up fees at a ridiculous rate. For instance, on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  the bill was {$6600.00}. On  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  the bill I was told the bill is {$9600.00}, according to the conversations with the  Fay repres entatives. However, I have n''t so far received in writing an amount and what date that bill will be good through. In addition, I submitted a loan mitigation application in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  that I have n''t heard a recent status on.  Fay S  ervicing is responding or not responding timely to voicemails I ''ve left in the past month, while they continue to rack up their high fees. I ''m aware of my rights as a loan mitigation applicant and potential federal RESPA violations that are occurring. In particular Fay is not resp onding timely to my requests for a bill so I can become current with payments. I am in contact with legal counsel on potential federal RESPA violations that have occurred.','Fay Servicing, LLC',2.0,2.0,'om Fay Servicing has racked up fees at a ridiculous rate. on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the bill was $');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3162,'06/16/2017','Debt collection','Private student loan debt','Took or threatened to take negative or legal action','Last year Nathan and Nathan filed a lawsuit against me for loans that I had cosigned for my nephew. They indicated since he lives in NY they have to sue me and ca n''t sue him. We made a payment arrangement of {$200.00} a month. They stopped taking the money at the beginning of the year do n''t know why but I got a notice Monday X/XX/17 that they had filed a garnishment claim against me for 25 % of my pay. I wasnt given any notice and took 25 % of my check that I received yesterday. I cant afford that much money to come out of my check I live paycheck to paycheck and will be bankrupt in a month. My nephew understands that he messed up earlier with these loans and wants to do the right thing but these tactics are unreasonable and threatening.','Nathan & Nathan, P.C.',2.0,2.0,'last year, they filed a lawsuit against me for loans that I had cosigned for my nephew. they indicated since he lives in NY they have to sue me and ca ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3163,'06/16/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers','RE : CITIBANK  CARD  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  I saw, online, a promotion that would return {$300.00} if one spent {$1000.00} in 90 days. I received the card and spent {$1000.00} in 30 days. CITI tells me that that offer was only valid if CITI solicited for you to take it. Advertising something online sounds like a solicitation to me. CITI says it will give me {$300.00} if I spend {$3000.00} in 90 days. Pompous, hostile and unacceptable is this  50o0 LB Gorillas  stance. I wrote t o CITI and received, about 2 we eks ago, a call from the Exec office telling me they would deal with the problem by the  XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . Unsurprisingly, I have not heard from them. It would appear that I must have made this offer up from CITI ''s viewpoint.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'CITI says it will give me $300.00 if I spend $3000.00 in 90 days. a promotion would return $300.00');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3164,'06/16/2017','Debt collection','Payday loan debt','Communication tactics','Contacted me again after I advised that I am being represented by an attorney to reorganize my debts. I advised  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  to not contact me again by phone and to refer all inquires to my attorney.','Cottonwood Financial Ltd.',2.0,2.0,'contacted me again after I advised that I am being represented by an attorney to reorganize my debts.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3165,'06/16/2017','Debt collection','Medical debt','Written notification about debt','I do not have a contract with MDS. I am not liable for the collection of this debt nor am I responsible. I have never done business with this company. In fact, I have never heard of this company until receiving a copy of my credit report. MDS has failed to provide me with legal supporting documents. I requested the signed contract between me and this company and they neglected to provide it. Instead they sent me " ER  Admission papers ''''. I requested an original itemized bill and they neglected to provide it. Instead they sent me a statement with a balance for " ER services ''''. I requested a HIPAA release form signed by me allowing MDS to access my medical files they have neglected to provide that form all together. Not only are my HIPAA rights being violated by this company but so are my consumer rights. I attempted to disput this invalid debt via the bbb but to no avail. They continue to ignore my requests. It is my contention that MDS KNOWS they can not tie me to this account otherwise they would have done so when I made my initial request. MDS is BLANTLY disregarding the law.','Medical Data Systems, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'i have never done business with this company. i have never heard of this company until receiving a copy of my credit report.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3166,'06/15/2017','Debt collection','Private student loan debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I have been paying monthly installments to a debt that I had let go to collections. For the past year and a half I have been paying {$300.00} to  TransWorld Systems Incorporated to pay off a debt of ~ {$16000.00}. I set up  automatic withdrawals with  TSI  and I had received monthly invoices giving me notice of adjusted balance. This month  (   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  2017  ) I looked at my credit report and it noted that specific debt had been closed out  ( a total of ~  {$12000.00} at this point ). I also noted that I had not received notice of automatic withdrawal. The regular amount of {$300.00} was still withdrawn from my account. I want to inquire as to why I am still having money removed from my account when the debt has been closed on my credit reports, and I want to inquire if it is reasonable that I have not received notice of the most recent automatic withdraw?','TRANSWORLD SYSTEMS INC',2.0,2.0,'I set up automatic withdrawals with TSI and received monthly invoices. I had not received notice of automatic withdrawal.');
