INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3184,'06/12/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers','I have been lied to numerous times by this company. I lost my job and feel a bit behind. When I was contacted by collections they said I would be put on the Fresh Start program, which was a program, where I paid {$90.00} for 3 months and the account would be re-activated.     When I called in to make my payment, the collections rep said  Well  your account is only behind {$120.00} or some weird amount, and said if I was to pay that my credit line would be unfrozen. I paid that, and the account remained frozen.     Then I was told that if I paid all the collection accounts on my credit bureau, the account would be unfrozen. To date, I have paid every debt I have with the exception of  Discover  Card, who I have been current with for months, but they refuse to unlock my credit line dispute my complying with everything they have asked for me to do to unlock my credit line. I even provided them with copies of the letters from my supposed Bad debts from the data-furnisher themselves, and copy of the certified checks sent to them, but they wont unlock the credit line.     This company has lied me to at leas t seven  times, and their internal collections department will do anything to make you pay more and wont keep up their end of the bargain.     These are a bunch of lying thieves who do nothing more than pray off of sub-prime borrowers.','DISCOVER BANK',2.0,2.0,'collections rep said if I paid all the collection accounts on my credit bureau, the account would be unfrozen. if I paid all the collection accounts on my credit bureau, the');
