INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3187,'06/12/2017','Debt collection','Federal student loan debt','False statements or representation','Today on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  I used  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  app to view my credit on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  report. I discovered I had some negative action from missed payments t o Dept of Ed for s tudent loans. I contacted the phone number provided t o Dept of Ed on   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and was ask for my social, dob, email, etc. To access my student aid account. The rep pulled up all my student debt info and then tried to convince me to apply for forgiveness. Once she offered to have {$4000.00} removed as forgiveness from my loan I ask why we had n''t addressed the matter for my call about the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  negative actions on my report. At that time I felt her response was dancing around the question and asked if they were in fact a government entity with DOE. She stated they were and the company is calle d Student Loan Help Center.  While on the call I searched them on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and realized this was a scam.  <P/> Not sure how this company received my call or has their number listed for DOE with  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .  <P/> I ''m filing this complaint because the took my personal info and I ''m worried they will attempt to use it. Also, I would like to understand why their phone number is the one provided for the DOE with  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , they misguide you to believe you are speaking with DOE.','Brelvis Consulting, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a rep pulled up all my student debt info and tried to convince me to apply for forgiveness. he then tried to convince me to apply for forgiveness. he said they were');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3188,'06/11/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','I was billed in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for the months of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was attending school during the time of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] full time qualifying as in school deferment. Somehow I was n''t reported being in school at time that led up to fed loan billing me for those months. I did n''t realize it until I checked my credit score to make sure it was good enough to apply for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] considering that ''s what I majored in. Fed loan had reported to the credit bureau as having 2 late/missed 90 day payments which damaged my credit report substantially. I been going back and forth with fed loan for about 3 months now and filing disputes with all 3 credit bureau to please remove the 2 late/missed payments due to an error, misunderstanding or late communication threw fed loan and the school. I have been denied 2wice with credit bureau and this 3rd time I mailed all my school documents and proof of school enrollment and an explanation that caused this error with fed loan, I still was not granted my removal from the credit bureau and at the same time when I was disputing this error I was going back in fourth with fed loan agencies.XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I spoke to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] his id # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on a recorded line, after going over my account he assured me that within 7-10 days my account would be corrected and I should have not been billed for those months.. ( no change accurred ) XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called back and spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I ''d # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on a recorded line same process again, she said she do n''t know why my account was n''t updated, she said she will send it to review and tell them to update and removal the late payments and that I should see the changes by the end of the month when they do their reporting to the credit bureau. Still no removal of the late payments but instead fed loan removed my forbearance and deferments from my account and granted me an in school deferment for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Fed loan took deleted a lot of my pay as agreeds and still did n''t remove the late payments and when fed loan deleted my previous pay as agreed it dropped my score by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] more points making it fall from fair to bad.. So my score was affected twice due to errors and I do n''t think that right and they should not be able to control people credit report like that. So now fed loan is saying I was under half time. I took 4 classes in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] -XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] putting me at 12 hours full time, I dropped one of my classes making it 9 hours and at the end of the semester the school reported I was half time but I did n''t return to school the next semester so therefore they trying to say I was half time. I did n''t register for the next semester so they do n''t know if I was registering for full time hours or half time hours. Fed loan is so difficult to deal with and want try to help you in at all. They want admitt to their mistakes and keep giving you the run around and making excuses to fix their mess up. I have all my documents and can prove my request.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'fed loan had reported to the credit bureau as having 2 late/missed 90 day payments which damaged my credit report substantially. i was billed in XX/XX');
