INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3205,'06/07/2017','Vehicle loan or lease','Loan','Getting a loan or lease','I HAVE BEEN PRE-APPROVED WITH CAPITAL ONE FINANCE ON XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ME AND MYHUSBAND COMPLETED THE PAPERWORK WITH [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] IN [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] GEORGIA. <P/>WE SUBMITTED ALL PAPERWORK TO [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] WHO IN EXCHANGE SENT THE PAPERWORK TO CAPITAL ONE. <P/>I HAD TO SPEAK TO CAPITAL ONE FINANCE ON SEVERAL OCCASSIONS ABOUT ACCURACY OF INFO PROVIDED VIA THE CAR SALES PERSON [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. <P/>I HAD FOUND WITH OUR PROVIDED PRE-APPROVAL INFO THE ACCURACY NEVER MATCH UP WITH WHOM THE DEALER WAS SPEAKING TO AT CAPITAL ONE FINANCE. <P/>PER THE FINANCE MANAGER [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] AT [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], PER MY PHONE INTERVIEW ON XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] WITH CAPITAL ONE REP MY CAR HAS TO BE RETURN TO THE DEALER BECUASE OF ADDRESS. <P/>PER CAPITAL ONE SUPPORT THEY STATED THAT THE PRIMARY ADDRESS WAS LISTED AS [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] GA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], AND STILL AS OF TODAY IT IS STILL MY PRIMARY ADDRESS. <P/>AS I STATED ON THE ONE CALL AND VERIFYING THE CONFUSION OF ADDRESS IN WHICH THE REP HAD INIDCATED I LIVED INTEXAS. <P/>I TOLD HIM AND STILL TODAY OF AS OF XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I WORK AS A [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] AND I TRAVEL FOR WORK FOR SHORT TERM STAY. I PROVIDED THEM THE ADDRESS IN WHICH I WAS NOW HAVING THE CAR AT AS OF THE DATE WHENALL THE PAPERWORK WAS SUBMITTED, MY JOB ASSIGNMENT WAS CHANGED. <P/>I NEVER KNEW YOU CAN BE DENIED OF THIS LOAN, I HAVE HAD HTE CAR SINCEXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] WHEN I WAS IN GEORGIA AND STILL TODAY. <P/>CAN CAPITAL ONE DENY A LOAN TO SOMEONE BECUASE THERE ADDRESS OF CHANGE AFTER THE SUBMISSION OF PAPERWORK. <P/>MY ADDRESS IS SHORT TERM. I AM NOT A RESIDENT OF TEXAS, I AM RESIDENT OF THE STATE OF GEORGIA, I AM WORKING