NONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  to  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . Finally, after making trial modification payments f or nine mon ths, Between  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  to  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and the month of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  we paid at least {$1900.00}. From  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  to  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  we did n''t m ake trial modification payments only after being told multiple times by Bayview Loan Servicing LLC e mployees not to make payments we didnt make payments for the month of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  . Bayview Loan Servicing then  started foreclosure on our home. We did start making payments again in the month of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .','BAYVIEW LOAN SERVICING, LLC',2.0,4.0,'Bayview Loan Servicing h failed to provide Requests for mortgage A ssistance ( RMA). the company has chosen to dual track our home. the');
