INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3215,'06/06/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','We are in the processing of taking out a home loan for a customer. On  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] / [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] / [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , our customers credit was pulled and there was a collection company listed on their credit report that should n''t be listed. On all  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  bureaus, the account is showing as being disputed. On  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , an attorney had sent a cease and desist to the collection company as this account had no legal bearing being placed on the customers credit report as well as filing a dispute to all  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  bureaus.     On  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , the customer contacted  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and Equifax to ask them when the account was placed in dispute. Each bureau stated that the account was not in dispute or never in dispute. The customer then asked when such comments were placed on her credit file and was told they do not have that information.     This collection account is affecting the customer ability to secure financing.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'customer''s credit was pulled and a collection company listed on their credit report shouldn''t be listed. the account was not in dispute or never in dispute. the customer');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3216,'06/06/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I am writing to dispute the Account or File Number being charged as BAD DEBT/CHARGE OFF AND OR COLLECTIONS that appears on all 3 of my Credit Reports. I have circled the information as it appears on my credit report for a visual that this account is being reported inaccurately.
I previously was told by a representative at Automobile Acceptance that the accounts would be updated with the Credit Bureaus to reflect accurate information. That information has not been updated on my credit report correctly it has been reported as BAD DEBT/CHARGE OFF AND OR COLLECTIONS which is not TRUE/ACCURATE reporting of this account to the Credit Bureaus.
Im having a hard time comprehending why this account is still being reported to the Credit Bureaus when the account was Paid in Full on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Per the Fair Credit Reporting Act I have the right to dispute all inaccurate information contained in my file. Therefore I will need documentation on a Company Letter Head that the account will be deleted from my report or further action will be taken.
Enclosed are copies of my credit report from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] & [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have circled the information that is INACCURATE. I have also enclosed letters from Automobile Acceptance that states that the account should be 1 ) Paid or Closed Account/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Balance 2 ) Payment Rating of Current.
To resolve the problem, I am requesting that the account be removed from my credit report because this is causing major harm to my credit. This can be done and will be done because this matter should have been resolved when I received the letter from the Employee [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating that the account was Paid in Full ; as well as a letter from Employee [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dated XX/XX/XXXXstating that the account would be updated with the Credit Bureaus. This is NO JOKING MATTER because this unresolved account is hindering my life and causing harm to me.
I need this issue expedited so that the issue will be resolve once and for all.','Automobile Acceptance Corporation',2.0,2.0,'I have circled the information as it appears on my credit report. a representative at Automobile Acceptance said the accounts would be updated with the Credit Bureaus to reflect accurate information ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3217,'06/05/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','On   X/X/2017 ,  Equifax received my certified request dated   XX/XX/2017 .  The request was to investigated several inaccuracies appearing on my credit file. In addition, pursuant to Fair Credit Reporting Act , 15 U.S.C. 1681g, I   requested disclosure of documents recorded and retaine d in their file ( s )  at the time of this request concerning the accounts being reported in my credit report.    Three  additional certified request were made regarding their investigation. It has now been more than FORTY days since that initial request. I have received NO updates, documents or any other information regarding the inaccuracies. To date, the items still remain in my credit file.   I have sent a fifth request via certified mail advising Equifax of their willful violations of the law yet they continue to ignore or be willfully negligent of my request and the law.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'Equifax received my certified request dated XX/XX/2017. the request was to investigate several inaccuracies appearing on my credit file. it has now been');
