INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3220,'06/05/2017','Payday loan, title loan, or personal loan','Installment loan','Getting the loan','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017- After an extensive amount of research, I went to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] obtain a debt consolidation loan to payoff credit card debt. I was rejected in the bank and started searching for another bank that offered debt consolidation loans. I applied for loan at TD bank the same day. <P/>[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017- I spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at TD Bank , who said I was approved for the loan and requested additional documentation ( recent credit card billing statements ) to process the request. She explained she would be out and referred me to another contact in her department. I faxed the information to her and the next day. I received a call about going to my local branch located in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], PA and set up an appointment scheduled for Saturday [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I arrived at the Bank, waited for a very long time. The bank has a container of dog biscuits at the counter but no lollipops at the counter. ( Animals get better treatment than customers or parents with children? ) I was waited on by a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. She printed up the closing documents, I signed for them and said that I would have to return on Monday [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017 because she did not know how to cut the checks for the creditors and the remaining check which was disbursed to me. I rearranged my work schedule and returned to the Bank as soon as it opened. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was there and her response was " Oh, you came back. The manager is not here who know how to print the checks. '''' She called a number who provided instructions. Checks were sent to 3 creditors and I received a check. It took over an hour. I asked when my first [ payment was due, she said XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I never received a billing statement and was unable to set up online account because my loan was entered into the system. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ],2017-I went to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], PA branch to pay my bill and spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] since I had not received my billing statement. She stated that my account was not loaded in the system, there was no way I could pay. There was nothing she could do except speak with the Branch Manager [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I left three telephone numbers : My mobile, my work number and my home number. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said I would receive a call Monday XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the branch manager. I checked my phone throughout the day. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never called and my loan was not in the system. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017-[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never called. I called TD Bank while at work. I spent 45 minutes on hold before speaking to someone. Afterwork, I called from home and spent two hours on the phone. Most hold times were about 30 minutes to get from one department to the next one. When I was connected to loans, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] assisted me and sent emails to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], PA Branch. She confirmed that my account was not in the system, it was never loaded and no billing statements were generated. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said I would receive a confirmation call from the Bank once everything was loaded into the system. <P/>[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017- I called Customer Service to follow up on the status of my request. Spoke with a Customer Service Representative who referred me to a Manager. Both were very nice and helpful. The manger explained that the loan would be loaded in the system it would take a few days, possibly longer due to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] weekend. My due date was scheduled for the end toXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I would receive a bill in the mail. I never received a follow up call from anybody. <P/>[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017-Received a call from a collections call from an agent telling me that my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017 payment was fourteen days late and how would I like to pay. It was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I became very upset since I did not have a bill or account number. I was furious since I had been patient since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. It was XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I was considered late ( by no fault of my own ). I told him I never received a bill and asked him, profanity included what king of operation they were running? I went online, could not access my account and called the collections area back and told them where to go. I was blown away by their insensitivity and callousness. There was no interest in resolving the situation. Completely lost my patience and became very angry. This has gone over a month. <P/>[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017-In tears at this point, I called the 24/7 number and spent another hour waiting. Explained my situation to the loan department. She could not explain why I did receive a bill or a follow up call from the Bank but I could open a checking account if I wanted to. I was not exactly thrilled by the offer. I declined, since I already have a checking account. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017-Filed a complaint with the State of Pennsylvania who referred on Monday XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] me to consumerfinance.gov.','TD BANK US HOLDING COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a TD bank approved me for a debt consolidation loan. she asked me to complete the paperwork and faxed the information. she said she was approved for the loan');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3221,'06/04/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Fees or interest','I made a mail charge and it was not applied to the right account. My account was charged a late fee and I need it switched to the right account. Please call me at  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'mail charge was not applied to the right account.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3222,'06/04/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Fees or interest','After attempting to close a Chase Amazon credit card account I noticed that I had been charged over {$2000.00} in fees. Keep in mind that the credit card limit was only {$1000.00}. I have disputed the charges but I did not receive any results. It does not surprise me after leaving the military I had a auto loan that was automatically deducted each month. The problem was after I left the military the deductions continued after monthly deposits stopped. The account was overdrawn and before I noticed the account was sent to collections. I paid the day it was supposed to transfer to the collections company but Chase still reported the account to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My point being that Chase has a past of not talking care of even long time customers.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'the credit card limit was only $1000.00. the problem was after I left the military the deductions continued.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3223,'06/04/2017','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','after getting behind 1 payment to wells fargo back in 2011 i  contacted them about a loan mod and givin a person to work with after a year went by got loan mod myself and sister sigined and had noterized they only sent me a copy to sigin she lives in a diff state and instructions saidit had to be sigined on same day.i called fargo about that chould not get any hlp about how we were to sign on same day living 1200  miles apart. so afternot hearing from them left a message with my person who was helping me.I sigined noteryized overnight mail to sister she did same thing and sent in with a {$480.00} fee.got back same paperwork three weeks later. called fargo person and she said because both sigs werent in county home was in they could n''t use.that was neverstated in instructionsi i had.she siad she wouldget suppervisior to help get it put through a year later got notice to appear in court fargo keptrunning me to diff people after asking them for new loan mod. igot a limited power of attotney to hlp with sigs but still no help so i went to a lawyer and hes trying to help but still may loose home .this company is the worst run ive erver seen im a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] year old vet and feel i have no rights agianst this company.ty','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'wells fargo contacted them about a loan mod and givin a person to work with after a year went by got loan mod myself and sister sigined');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3224,'06/03/2017','Debt collection','Medical debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','My son and I were both seen in the emergency room at different times last summer and fall. The hospital did not take our copay of {$75.00} at the time of service. We received bills from the hospital and paid them in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2016. Those debts were paid directly to the hospital.
<P/>
We have been contacted by this agency repeatedly, and I have told them that the debts were already paid. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I faxed them copies of the cancelled checks and referenced the account numbers related to the charges. A representative from the agency had informed me that the letters and phone calls would stop once they received that information. We then received an invoice, dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], asking for payment of this charge. I informed them prior to sending the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] fax that further communication from them after I sent the fax would result in my filing a complaint, but they sent the invoice anyway.','Community Health Investment Company, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'the hospital did not take our copay of $75.00 at the time of service. we received bills from the hospital and paid them in [COMPTE_ANON');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3225,'06/03/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  2017  I received an alert this morning from  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  that my complaints agains t American Credit Acceptance had been resolved yet it has not. American Credit Acceptance is reporting a higher Balance than I owe and updated the credit bureaus with the false information thus impacting my credit score a violations of the FCRA. American Credit Acceptance reported that I have balance of {$28000.00}. My balance on the attached statement clearly shows a balance of {$28000.00}, the information on my credit report is false information causing my balance to increase and my credit score to be i mpacted.','American Credit Acceptance, LLC',2.0,2.0,'American Credit Acceptance reported that I have balance of $28000.00. the information on my credit report is false information causing my balance to increase.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3226,'06/03/2017','Debt collection','Medical debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','Ability Recovery Se rvices is reporting accounts on my credit report that do not belong to me. After checking my credit reports I noticed several invalid accounts being reported. I immediate disputed the accounts.  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  fraudulent accounts reported by Ability were removed however they continue to report on another account. I filed a complaint with the Better Business Bureau and they responded requesting i submit a document confirming my identity. I submitted the document but company has not responded. They are continuing to report this erroneous account on my credit report.','Ability Recovery Services, LLC',2.0,4.0,'Ability Recovery Se rvices is reporting accounts on my credit report that do not belong to me. after checking my credit reports I noticed several invalid accounts being reported.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3227,'06/02/2017','Debt collection','I do not know','Attempts to collect debt not owed','Security Credit Services (   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   ) is on my credit report. I have disputed this several times as I do not know what this is. I have asked them to send me proof that I was the person who created this account but nothing was sent. I have NEVER received any mail correspondence from this creditor. I am requesting that this be removed from my credit file.','Security Credit Services, LLC',2.0,2.0,'security credit services is on my credit report. I have asked them to send me proof that I was the person who created this account.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3228,'06/02/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','Government benefit card','Trouble using the card','At around  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  PDT on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,    2017, I logged into my online account associated with a Bank of America prepaid VISA debit card ( California unemployment benefits ). When I attempted to transfer funds from the prepaid card to my person al bank account ( in order to cover my monthly rent check ), I received a message that said that money transfers were " temporarily '''' unavailable. The website did not indicate if and when users next could transfer funds.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'logged into my online account associated with a prepaid card. a message said that money transfers were " temporarily '''' unavailable''');
