INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3231,'06/02/2017','Debt collection','Payday loan debt','Threatened to contact someone or share information improperly','First of they call back to back numerous times. Finally I said let ''s break of in payment and send it for me to go over and sign. Then I emailed and said dates are not right. They can call but they wo n''t talk threw email or letter and with me I like things in writing. So they called back to back again 2 days straight so today I finally answered but when they started talking I had to hang up because my boss walked in. So they called numerous time after that then called a relative telling them all my information and that to me is unprofessional. My relative called me upset asking why they telling her all my business. I ''m so upset right now because this is unprofessional','Check Security Associates, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a relative called me upset asking why they told her all my business. they called back to back several times and said that to me is unprofessional.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3232,'06/01/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','I mailed a Multip le Inquiry Removal Letter o n  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  by certified mail to dispute information, in regards to the hard inquiries that was being reported on my credit report. They received the letter  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and they completed the request on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . The request that I submitted included hard inquiries that were not factual and I received the same response for all the inquires, which was " inquires are a factual record of file access. If you believe this was unauthorized, please contact the creditor. '''' According to the FCRA rules, FCR A 623 ( b ) ( 2 ) and 611 ( a ) ( 1 ), it  states that any information can be disputed and MUST be investigated and it you do not investigate AND respond, FCRA must must delete the disputed information from its files. The fact that I received a response less than a week after the receipt of the certified letter, one can assume that there was no investigation into the matter. I plan to purchase a home this year and having this many hard inquires on my credit report display a sign of financial trouble, when it is not in this case. I am submitting my complaint due to the lack if investigation into my original dispute for hard inquires that does not belong to me. I did not sign for anything. This is unfair practices by a credit reporting agency with no concern for the credit worthiness of a consumer.     The following credit inquiries are related to none of the aforementioned permissible  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  Credit Unions   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [C