INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3233,'06/01/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Struggling to repay your loan','I applied for consolidation of my PLUS loans. I got a letter on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,    2017  stating the new monthly payment would be {$160.00} On  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  2017  I then got a statement saying the monthly payment was {$220.00}.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'I applied for consolidation of my PLUS loans. I got a letter on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017 stating the new monthly payment would be ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3234,'06/01/2017','Debt collection','I do not know','Communication tactics','My family, and our neighbors, have received repeated calls from a collection agency ( I think it is Pioneer Credit Recovery ) whose number they gave for call back is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. However, the last number I received a call from is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Apparently they are trying to collect a student load debt from a gentleman in our neighborhood and have resorted to calling this man ''s neighbors about the debt and asking us if we can get a message through to that owes the debt. They have even gotten the cell phone numbers for my family members including my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] year old daughter and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of my sons. They called my son at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Mountain time this week and he told then to contact me. They did contact me at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I proceeded to tell the woman that what she was doing is harassment and that the man ''s neighbors have nothing to do with the man ''s debt and no responsibility to help them collect that debt. Even more so, I think it is totally inappropriate for them to be letting the man ''s neighbors know that he has uncollected debt! I asked the woman to take us off of her list and hopefully they will do so but wanted to alert you of these harassing practices. Thanks,','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'my family and neighbors have received repeated calls from a collection agency. they have gotten the cell phone numbers for my family members. they have even gotten the numbers for my daughter');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3235,'06/01/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','Written notification about debt','I sent certified letter to Account Control Bureau, which they received on XX/XX/2017. I have tried and tried to collect data from this company with no response. I requested validation of this account, bearing my signature. It has passed their 30 day mark, I then sent them a second letter, and again, I have gotten no response from them. They also did NOT mark my credit report disputed.','Account Control Bureau',2.0,2.0,'I sent certified letter to Account Control Bureau. they did not mark credit report disputed.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3236,'06/01/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','status of my account is showing that it was written off for {$610.00} dollars and the account was paid in full and the status is not showing paid in full on my credit report','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'status of my account is showing that it was written off for $610.00 dollars and the account was paid in full. the status of my account is not showing paid in full');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3237,'06/01/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage','I received a direct mail piece  from Quicken st ating I might be able to refinance my mortgage for a rate as low as 3.625 %. I know my credit is quite good, so I applied, fully expecting to receive the advertised rate.  <P/> Upon applying, I was told that I must sign an " intent to proceed '''' form before they would give me an estimate showing closing costs and rate. I read the document and saw nothing that said I could not back out after viewing the documents, so I signed and looked at the documents. They also charged my credit card {$500.00}, to be refunded upon closing.  <P/> I looked at the documents and saw that the rate they gave me was 4.25 %. I asked why the rate was so much higher than the advertised rate. I was told that I could buy down my rate with origination points, except that in Texas, closing costs were capped at 3 %, so even with A+ credit, there was NO WAY that I could get the advertised rate of 3.625 %. They should n''t advertise the rate in Texas if it ''s unobtainable.  <P/> At that point, I decided that I did not want to proceed and I wanted to withdraw my loan application. They said had to be notified in writing. I notified them in writing within  1 business day. Multiple phone calls and written correspondences later, YES, I STILL WANT TO WITHDRAW MY APPLICATION. They drew it out over two weeks. Finally they agree and say they will withdraw my app.  The next day, I receive a letter that THEY have denied my application because I could n''t provide the necessary paperwork.  <P/> Oh, but they still charged my credit card {$500.00}. For what? No appraisal, no paperwork, nothing was done because as soon as I saw the rate I immediately STOPPED the process. After 24 days they finally refunded the {$500 .00}, MINUS {$27.00 } - a credit report fee! They charged me to pull my credit.','QUICKEN LOANS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'Quicken st ating asked me to sign an " intent to proceed '''' form. they charged my credit card $500.00, to be refunded');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3238,'05/31/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','SOMEONE APPARENTLY TRYING TO GET SOMETHING AND USING MY SS # DUE TO THE AMOUNT OF INQUIRIES ON MY REPORTS I DID NOT AUTHORIZE THESE INQUIRIES','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'SOMEONE APPARENTLY TRYING TO GET SOMETHING AND USING MY SS # DUE TO THE AMOUNT OF INQUIRIES ON');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3239,'05/31/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Credit monitoring or identity theft protection services','i have several collections for services i never received or authorized. from the southern credit recovery for {$830.00}, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for {$6600.00}, {$1400.00}. also, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for {$130.00} and i never signed or authorized any of these charges. Also child support is showing {$8200.00} and i never went to court and proved any paternity or took any blood test to prove myn relations. would you please assist me in removing these unauthorized accounts. thanks','Southern Credit Recovery, Inc.',2.0,4.0,'i have several collections for services i never received or authorized. from the southern credit recovery for $830.00, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3240,'05/31/2017','Mortgage','Reverse mortgage','Trouble during payment process','In 2016 in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I found that due to circumstances beyond my control that I would be unable to pay the county taxes. Being in a Reverse Mortgage situation, I knew that this was part of the contract and before it became critical I called Reverse Mortgage Solutions ( RMS ) to get advice. While on the phone I was told no problem that they would pay the remainder of my taxes that week. For me this was a big relief since I knew that I was going to be on a long road with the medical issues I was/am still having. <P/>The taxes were not paid until the end ofXX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The next thing I know I am put on notice that I must pay back the borrowed money or I could lose my home. <P/>I went through a legal aide at a local University. Thanks to two other resources they paid RMS back. <P/>My complaint is this RMS never would put you through to a supervisor and the communication was difficult. Every person you spoke with gave a slight difference in what was going on with my case. <P/>When RMS paid the taxes part of that money was from the last draw I had. They are now charging me an interest fee and administrative fees. <P/>My financial counselor tried talking to a person on the phone and got nowhere and then asked for a supervisor to call and to date no response. <P/>RMS through this whole process has been difficult to work with. Some examples telling us to talk to a certain person and that person never materializes. Sending back checks that were to pay them for they had to come in on the same day. Miscommunication on verbal and written statements, such as you have a draw you do not have a draw and my signature does not match. <P/>I would appreciate you looking into this matter so I can get closure. I will be enclosing the last statement and the one that shows I had a draw. <P/>I am going to be in a very difficult situation come [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the taxes for I am going back in the hospital and do not know what to do as far as my RM. <P/>RMS charged fees in the amount of {$790.00} for inspections and appraisal that will need to be paid eventually. They are telling me they had no choice due to HUD regulations but to move quickly on the inspection and appraisal once they paid my taxes. However, they never communicated clearly that by paying my taxes my loan would go into default. I never would have asked them to pay the taxes if I knew this would happen. I do not feel I should have to pay these fees. <P/>Additionally, I now have a negative " Net Principal Limit '''' which they can not clearly define what this means for me and I would like clarity around this.','REVERSE MORTGAGE SOLUTIONS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'in 2016 in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I found that due to circumstances beyond my control that I would be unable to pay the taxes. after a call');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3241,'05/31/2017','Mortgage','Other type of mortgage','Struggling to pay mortgage','I am writing to ask you to intervene on my behalf. After years of fighting with  Select Portfolio Servicing, LLC, they h ave finally agreed to offer me a modification. I h ave completed the 3 trial pay ments as directed, and they have provided me what appears to be a reasonable arrangement to allow me to keep my property.  <P/> However, the principal balance they have established is approximately {$130000.00} over the current market value of my property. That balance also includes nearly {$9000.00} of overcharges or fraudulent charges assess ed by SPS or a predecessor servicer ( likely   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   ) for things such as force-placed insuranc e when I have proof that I had paid the premium myself for this insurance, and " Property Preservation '''' charges when I was maintaining the property continually, and even hired a property management firm to assist in that endeavor. During the foreclosure case, I also discovered nearly {$4000.00} of phantom and unexplained/unjustified charges assessed to my account in the earliest years of the loan. During this time, I was paying extra funds toward the principal of the loan, but these fees, that I had no way of knowing were being assessed, robbed me of a good bit of those payments toward principal, as well as cost me additional interest that should have decreased as a result of these additional principal payments. So the actual overcharge/fraudulent charges would well exceed {$10000.00} if that interest were also calculated. Since the stated principal balance that I would be agreeing to pay with the modified loan includes these overcharges, I  believe SPS must c orrect these errors, as I have provided proof that they are in error, and decrease the principal balance owed and recalculate the modification payments and/or balloon payment as a result.  <P/> I have entered a request for  SPS to resol ve the errors and this dispute ( copy attached here ), but I have only u ntil   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    2017  to accept their modification offer. From past abuses at the hands of this c ompany, I feel that they will likely delay correcting these overcharges so that I risk not being able to take advantage of this modification I have fought for now for nearly 2 years. Make no mistake about it -- the other terms of their offer are reasonable and I want to take advantage of it. However, paying an additional $  10,000+ d ue to errors made by a previous servicer that have never been corrected, is not attractive to me at all, given the loan to value ratio of the current modification offer.  <P/> So I am asking you to contact SPS to urge them to remove these additional charges and recalculate the principal balance on the modified loan in time so that I can accept their offer by   XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . I w ould also ask that you ensure that they have, in fact, done what is necessary to cancel the foreclosure sale set for   XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , and  to eliminate the foreclosure case from the dockets in a manner that will not require me to have to spend additional legal fees to see that this is done.  <P/> Also, the loan modification offer states that the principal balance owed is {$400000.00} with an additional forbearance amount of {$57000.00}. However, their website lists my remaining principal balance as of today as {$300 000.00} ( see  attached screenshot from their website taken earlier today ). Why such a large discrepancy between just over {$300000.00} and the new amount I have to pay of roughly {$470000.00}?','SELECT PORTFOLIO SERVICING, INC.',6.0,8.0,'a modified loan is a modified loan for select portfolio Servicing, LLC. the principal balance is approximately $130000.00 over the current market value of my property');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3242,'05/31/2017','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I am [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Have health issues. Provided my son a list of creditors, banks, a brokerage house. When I die, he ''ll be able to communicate ; close accounts. Receive in return, outstanding investments. <P/>I created this policy at least a year ago. From time to time, contact creditors and such, to verify that the information I provided my son is accurate. <P/>[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I entered Fifth Third Bank, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], FL [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Ph. # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Communicated with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Personal Banker II. <P/>Ask that he update procedures ; what my son most provide / accomplish, to close my checking account when I die. <P/>Was informed, ''''-Send a copy of the death certificate. '''' I was astounded. Asked if it need be a copy or an original death certificate. '''' The response, ''''-A copy is fine. '''' [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] indicated that my son is the designated beneficiary.. Mentioned, ''''-we do n''t have his social security number. We ''ll need that. '''' Was told to come back after lunch as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s lunch hour approached .... some 30 to 40 minutes later. ( For the record, I am a seven minute ride, give or take from this office. ) Upon arriving home I reviewed my documents ; Fifth Third Bank ; Policies/Procedures. Discovered when I opened the account I was instructed, when my son contacts the bank to close the account, he must provide an Original Death Certificate, a copy of his drivers license and a notarized letter indicating he is the beneficiary. What he wants the bank to do to fulfill his requests. <P/>Upon returning to the desk of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I mentioned my discovery, as mentioned above. He replied, ''''-well, yeah. That would be useful as well. '''' When I asked why the person who opened the account did n''t request my son ''s social security number, he simply could not explain why. <P/>Upon leaving this bank, I went to a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] location. Shared with a representative what I mentioned to you. <P/>The Representative stated, ''''-there is no reason why you would have to surrender your son ''s social security number to him. '''' Woa! <P/>I realized that my notes ; Policies and Procedures, concerning clearing the account, that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] did NOT indicate that my son must present his Soc. Secur. Card. <P/>THERE IS LEGITIMATE REASON WHY [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] DEMANDED THE SOCIAL SECURITY NUMBER OF MY SON! <P/>I phoned Fifth Third Bank-HQ this morning. No one provided Policy & Procedures. Demanded that my son ''s Soc. Secur. number be purged from 5th 3rd. computer. Was told I ''d be contacted within 24-48 hours. <P/>I stated that I receive a letter indicating my son ''s Soc. Secur. number was purged. <P/>I AM horrified. Dejected. Believe I put my son ''s security / life and his family ''s in HARMS WAY! <P/>Help me! I believe I have been intentionally deceived. Do what must be accomplished. <P/>Thank you. <P/>[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , FL [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Ph # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Screen name ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','FIFTH THIRD FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'P/>I created this policy at least a year ago. from time to time, contact creditors and such, to verify that the information I provided my son is accurate ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3243,'05/31/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','Bank Of America reports MONTHLY on all  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  credit bureaus for an account with a balance of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  it appeas to have started as  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and possibly connected t o (   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   ).  I have tried for a few years to figure out what is going on. I have disputed this with all  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  bureaus at least 18 times to no avail. Bank of America shows on the report with the telephone  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and address of Bank of America  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , FL  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . When i call the number it is the home loans ans not student loans. The representatives ALL state that I do not have nay student loans with them and the student loans center is closed indefinitely. yet the credit reporting is monthly and renews monthly which lowers my credit report score. I was able to call  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and the number sends me to the website : nslds.ed.gov. Again I am unble to locate information. I can not get ANY info from bank of America Yet they report monthly. I do have info saying that no payments has ever been made meaning the date of last payment was older than 7 years ago ( per FCRA any account that has not had a payment in 7 years should not show on my reports  ).  The credit bureaus were able to give me that information as well as date opened i n 2004. I woul d not have been  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  in  2004. This  account  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and Bank of America need to be removed for many reasons ans the most obvious is the age of the alleged accounts and date of last payment. They are illegally reporting monthly and renewing the debt monthly/.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'bank of America reports MONTHLY on all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureaus. they report monthly and renew monthly which lowers my credit report score');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3244,'05/30/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I ''ve written Equifax twice to remove a tax lien on my credit report and my spouse ''s credit report which inaccurately reflects a paid tax lien of {$1900.00}. I explained to them numerous times with certified documentation that the lien was filed in error and should be removed. Nothing was ever paid on that tax lien. A subsequent  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  filed for that tax year removed the {$1900.00} debt.     Instead of Equifax actually conducting a debt, they kept sending letters stating, " Investigation Complete ''''. And I know that is incorrect.     I ''ve emailed them copies of emails from the State of Georgia back in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  that show that lien was filed, then removed but that no monies were ever paid. In fact, the lien was reversed and we got a refund instead.     I ''ve explained all this to Equifax in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , and now this month, and they insist on ignoring it, by sending me correspondence stating " Investigation Complete ''''. I know my rights. I sent them a letter demanding a thorough investigation under the Fair Credit Reporting Act, Section 609, and they sent me an " Investigation Request Form '''', with no acknowledgment of the investigation.     Equifax has caused mu family undue denials and high-interest rates because they failed to follow the Fair Credit Reporting Act and actually VERIFY the accuracy of information prior to reporting it. Instead of simply verifying whether it was filed and released.     As a side note,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  immediately removed it once they discovered the financial impact to our scores. Equifax does n''t seem to want to remove it.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a subsequent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] filed for that tax year removed the $1900.00 debt. the lien was filed, then removed but no');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3245,'05/30/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose prepaid card','Problem with a purchase or transfer','On  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  of    2017  I was double charged {$660.00} for an enterprise purchase in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . I alerted discover card and they investigated the issue only to investigate it as fraud instead of a double charge. I have now been charged the money twice for over 2 months with no resolution from discover besides " pay my bill ''''','DISCOVER BANK',2.0,4.0,'discover card investigated the issue only to investigate it as fraud. i was double charged $660.00 for an enterprise purchase in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3246,'05/30/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  I took subscription for  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .Account number  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  On  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  equipment was shipped by  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .   On  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  send cancellation email.   On  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  confirmation email received of returned equipment Now I see on my credit report there is a collection filed on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  by  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  for {$460.00}','ERC',2.0,2.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] equipment was shipped by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on [');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3247,'05/30/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Other features, terms, or problems','Capita l One Closed my accou nt and started reporting negative credit information on me. All of this was done while they were telling me to pay the card. They charge me an exorbitant amount of fees that I disagreed with because they mailed invoices and notices to incorrect address but penalized me for there mistake. Moreover, their fees pushed my card over the limit repeatedly. Additionally they made me personally responsible for the card when it was a corporate card. Thereby, causing great harm to my credit profile, causing it to drop more than  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  points.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'capita l One Closed my accou nt and started reporting negative credit information on me. they charge me an exorbitant amount of fees that I disagree');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3248,'05/30/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I am writing to dispute  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  on credit r eport number  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . The balance listed on the account is incorrect. Please delete the account.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the balance listed on the account is incorrect. please delete the account.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3249,'05/29/2017','Debt collection','Credit card debt','False statements or representation','I had  a walmart cred it card through synchrony bank. I was behind on payments and they sent it to  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  for collection. I called them on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]     [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    2016  and made payment arrangements to pay off the balance of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  I arranged post dated payments which were made by direct debit of my checking account. I was given the impression that this would pay off the balance and that would be the end of it. I received my next statement and the balance was almost the same and I saw a late charge had been added which was more than my payment. I called   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   back for an explanation. they explained that the charges were added into the 6 month payment plan. I finished the payment plan and now  Walmart is  calling me for the remaining balance of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . They show no record of payment arrangements.No one can give me a copy of what I was told over the phone. I feel I have been scammed by   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and Synchrony/Walmart. I have other  Synchrony ac counts and none of them have done this or offered to.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'walmart sent me a cred it card to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for collection. I called them on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3250,'05/29/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','I reported to Great Lakes Borrowers Services, multiple times that I fraudulently received my federal financial aid, which is a felony. I documented the issues, wrote & called, called back, emailed, asked the information be added to my file, requested that they act on the information. They have done nothing to date to assist me for almost two years.','GREAT LAKES',2.0,4.0,'a felony is a felony. a felony.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3251,'05/29/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I just have a problem, with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] report still showing a court report, there ''s no longer a court issue because I been paying on it through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], please remove that off my credit report, it makes my credit look bad, and I ''m really trying to improve my credit, I have been in good standing with paying my bills and will continue to do so, please remove that court mis information from my report, I have mobed on to doing better','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'the court report still shows a court report, but there''s no court issue. please remove that from my credit report, it makes my credit look bad. I have mobed');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3252,'05/28/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','This is a follow-up to complaint # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Since my first complaint on this matter related to cancelling PMI, I have had communication with Wells Fargo. Apparently the original BPO prepared never made it to the Bank. As a result, a second real estate professional was scheduled to prepare a brokers price opinion. The broker came on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to perform the property inspection. I followed up with a call to the Bank a few days later to determine if the valuation report had been received and to inquire if the value opinion reached was sufficient to permit the cancellation of PMI. During our call on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at Wells Fargo advised that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] now required a full appraisal instead of just a value opinion derived from a BPO. Though I am a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I researched the servicing rules established by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as they are a matter of public record. The servicing guidelines advise in no uncertain terms that the servicer, not [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  determines the appropriate approach to establish the current value of the subject property. Why would [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] blame [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when this is n''t true? She further advised that she would have an appraiser contact me to set up an appointment for an inspection. As of today, I have not received a call from anyone attempting to perform an appraisal on the property.
As a reminder, the check for the {$200.00} fee was negotiated by Wells Fargo on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and still here we are no closer to resolution. I ca n''t imagine that I am the only mortgage borrower being subjected to these games by Wells Fargo. I strongly recommend that your agency take a closer look at the PMI cancellation practices at Wells Fargo.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',8.0,8.0,'a second real estate professional was scheduled to prepare a brokers price opinion. the broker came on to perform the property inspection. the broker then asked the bank if the valuation report');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3253,'05/28/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','The loan account with BSI Financial Services does not belong to me it is not my account. This loan account belongs to my ex-husband/significant other. I was never on the loan account. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from BSI Financial Services fraudulently added me to the loan account in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - before that I was never on the loan account because I am not a borrower/co-borrower. The account was opened in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as a result of a refinance and my name has never been on the loan account until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] added it in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This loan account has never been reported on my credit report by the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] major credit bureaus since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when it was opened it has only recently started being reported to the credit bureaus ( and on my credit report ) as of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( yet the credit bureaus now indicate I had this account from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to present ). In order to ask questions about the account, my significant other had to add me as an authorized person ; when applying for a loan modification my significant other had to use my income as a household contributor these are just several examples that clearly show I was not on the loan as a borrower/co-borrower. Also prior to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], correspondence from BSI Financial Services was always sent to my significant other ; after [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], for the first  time, my name was added to any correspondence from BSI Financial Services. At the closing for this loan, BSI Financial Services indicated that I could not be on the loan because of my credit - my name was on the original set of loan documents but when it was decided that my credit was not good enough to be on the loan, BSI Financial Services then sent over a duplicate set of loan documents but with only my significant others name on them for him to sign my name was not on any of the loan documents. The first set that had my name/signature were to be discarded by BSI Financial Services ; the second set only contained the name of my significant other on the loan as the loan is only in his name. I am attaching the documents indicating that my significant other is the only borrower on the loan. <P/>At the time my name was added to the account, my significant other was applying for a loan modification and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was the single point of contact. When I submitted my financial information as a household contributor and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] saw that it had increased from prior months, I believe that is when he decided to fraudulently add my name to the loan account. When I discovered this and addressed this issue with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], he pretended that he would investigate the issue and get back to me I never heard back from him regarding this. In fact, the loan had been transferred to another Loan Servicing agency the very next month. BSI Financial Services continues to report and verify that this account belongs to me after several disputes with credit agencies. If you were to follow the paper trail and review the loan documents recorded with the state and/or title company, you will find that my name is not on any of the loan documents and that I did not sign as a borrower/co-borrower. I ask that BSI Financial Services do their due diligence and remove this account from my credit and correct this with the credit reporting bureaus as soon as possible as this has caused much pain and suffering with regards to attaining life goals. Please see attached documents to support my complaint. <P/>Best Regards','Servis One, Inc.',2.0,4.0,'account was opened in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as a result of a refinance. my name was added to any correspondence from BSI Financial');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3254,'05/27/2017','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','Since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was a victim of identity theft. A bill showed up on my credit report about almost three years ago. I have requested and advised over and over that proof of validation be sent to me for the alleged debt. I disputed this account because I never opened the account no proof of validation was ever sent per my request. I have lived at the same address for over 15 years and still no proof of validation of the alleged debt has ever been sent but continues to report on my credit I have asked both Portfolio Recovery and the three reporting agencies to provide me with documents of the alleged debt. I never signed any contracts nor am I in debt to Portfolio Recovery Group they are impacting my credit and life in a major way. I sent the office a request for debt validation and requested a copy of any agreements that I signed stating that I am in a contract with Portfolio Recovery Group for the alleged debt to date there has never been anything sent to my address again where I have resided for years. I recently provided a copy of my current ID AND SOCIAL SECURITY number to this company asking that all original documents be sent showing that my name and birthdate and social match the opening of this alleged account.','PORTFOLIO RECOVERY ASSOCIATES INC',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was a victim of identity theft. a bill showed up on my credit report about almost three');
