INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3274,'05/23/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Problem with a credit reporting company''s investigation into an existing problem','I mailed a letter on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  by certified mail in order to dispute information in regards to a negative debt that is reporting on my credit report that I have absolutely no knowledge about. Experian received the letter on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and they completed the request on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . This is the 3rd time I have sent certified letters to Experian in regards to this account. According to the FCRA Rules, FCRA 623 ( b )  ( 2 ) and 611 ( a ) ( 1 ), i t states that any information can be disputed and MUST be investigated and if you do not investigate AND respond, the CRA must delete the disputed information from its files. You are required under the FCRA to have properly verified the accuracy of an account listed on my credit report and provide documents. The fact that I received a response in 8 days after the receipt of my certified letter, one can assume that there was no investigation into this matter. I am in the process of purchasing a home and having this negative account reporting on my credit report display as a sign of financial trouble when this is not the case. I am submitting this complaint due to the lack of investigation into my original dispute for this negative account that does not belong to me. I did not sign anything. This is unfair practices by a credit reporting agency with no concern for the credit worthiness of a consumer. The fact that they said the account was verified means the company had to provide documentation.  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  Edition,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , defines  Verify as, 1 ) " To  prove to be true ; to confirm or establish the truth or truthfulness of ; to authenticate. ''''  2 ) To  confirm or substantiate by oath or affidavit ; to swear to the truth of. '''' and Verification as, Confirmation of correctness, truth or authenticity, by affidavit, oath, or deposition. Affidavit of truth of a matter stated and object of verification is to assure good faith in averments or statements of a party.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'experian received the letter on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. it is the 3rd time I have sent certified letters to experian. the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3275,'05/23/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','Today  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,2017, I attempted to call the customer service line listed on my bill in order to pay my mortgage over the phone. What I got instead was some sort of scam with regard to a free gift requesting credit card information. Repeatedly I asked to be put throug h to SPS S ervicing located in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , Utah. I was told this was a marketing tool used to advertise for the company, and despite my objection due to a waste of my time. The perso n (   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   ) p robably not his real name, continued to ask questions. When he got to the portion about me submitting money for the free gift I was due and I said no repeatedly. He hung up and aft er 15 r eturn calls was not able to get Customer Service in order to pay my  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  Mortgage. This is more than just shady dealings. This is mis-representation, false advertising, and poor customer service. While I do agree that business has a right to advertising, this is not the way to do it. I feel that I have no way to contact the company that has the most important purchase made by me.     Please Help  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .','SELECT PORTFOLIO SERVICING, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a free gift requesting credit card information was a scam. a scam was made to pay my mortgage over the phone. the perso n ( [COMP');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3276,'05/23/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','I have been enrolled in public service loan forgiveness for years, through 3 different servicers since this program was made available in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I am an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] working in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This program has allowed me to stay and not go work for a private firm which would pay more. It allows me to plan for retirement. These servicers fail to give me credit for payments made ( some full payments made during a forbearance reps suggest while we wait for recertification or verification or new beneficial regulations to go into effect are not counted - they need to give credit for these payments ). I have asked many times for a supervisor to call me, to address the problem, for an analysis of my payments, for them to update the number of payments I have made, to correct the ongoing errors. They do not respond and they refuse to share contact info. I have spent countless hours on the phone trying to get answers and credit for payments made. I have sacrificed many many months and even now, years, when payments could have been made but we needed to wait for these service providers to implement a new program or process documents or especially while transferring to new providers ( especially waiting fr XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which was date fo 10 % cap implementation - it took until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to actually have them do it - so I lost a year and a half. Bottom line is I am entitled to additional credit for payments made. I request and am entitled to credit for EVERY payment I have made. Errors in the past decade where plans were incorrectly assigned to me or employees of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] failed to process applications and documents I have submitted, all need correction so that I can RETIRE. This is the worst administered program I have ever encountered. And I work in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. It is not fair to the borrower. We need to be able to talk to the same person and not rehash the issues with multiple people, many of whom lack the knowledge to address the issues correctly. I did get a few corrected recently but I can not understand why some were fixed and not others. I have large files full of documents.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'a ''compte_ANONYMISÉ'' servicer has failed to give me credit for payments made. he has been enrolled in public service loan forgiveness');
