INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3278,'05/23/2017','Vehicle loan or lease','Lease','Managing the loan or lease','My lease is throu gh GM Financial. I t ook it out in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . All payments have been made on time. At the end of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  i discovered a payment made on  XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  for  XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  due date was missing. I contacte d GM Financial an d they stated to fax in a copy of the cancelled check and remittance coupon which i did on  XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . I had n''t heard back so on  XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  i called and was on hold for ove r 30  minutes. They said further research was required and would call me back. As  of 24 hou rs later I have n''t heard back so I called again. As soon as i called the lady indicated rep yesterday was supposed to escalate this and she did n''t so she will need to put me on hold and escalate this. I have {$75.00} in late fees that should be waived and I really hope this is not reported to my credit as late since i ''ve never made a late payment. I call them again and just put on hold. They cashed the check the day they received it, but getting them to apply to my account is much more difficult. There was a remittance coupon attached which showed my account #.','GENERAL MOTORS FINANCIAL COMPANY, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a payment made on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3279,'05/22/2017','Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service','Virtual currency','Fraud or scam','On  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]     2017 PayPal d ecided to please limitations on my account and place a holding on {$1600.00} on my money for a period of 180 days. With out giving me a reason why after numerous emails and phone calls all I was told is it ''s there policy and in the user agreement. When I asked to review what has caused them to do this I was told I would need a court order or subpoena to do this. After days of research I have found that this is common practice for them. They have had  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  class action lawsuit they have settled over this and still continue to do it. After filing a complaint with the Better Business Bureau,  PayPal response was they cleam fraudulent activity and for fear of  charge backs on my account, I have had zero complaints against my account. After reviewing there user agreement, it  States that any buyer protection is only good for 45 days, so why are they holding my funds for 180 days? When  I asked if I would be received an interest for six months I want to hold my money The customer ''s service agent I was speaking to on the phone just laughed and said no. They are collecting interest on my money for their profit and they stayed this in the user agreement. This is completely illegal.','PAYPAL HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,4.0,'PayPal d ecided to please limitations on my account and place a holding on $1600.00 on my money for a period of 180 days. after');
