INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3303,'05/17/2017','Debt collection','Auto debt','Took or threatened to take negative or legal action','I owed a debt for a motorcycle t o Midland Credit Management,  acct #  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  that they acquired fro m   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   se veral years ago. 10 months ago, the account was settled and I requested the title for the motorcycle. They would not send it. After a couple months, they informed me I only needed to fax a letter requesting the title with the motorcycle VIN # and that I would get my title in 30 days. I did so on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  , and supplied a copy of the initial registration as well. I also had them change the address to send the title as well because I moved recently. After not receiving the title, I called about it and was told I did not send the letter. The story hanged several times while on the phone. Initially, they said they had received the letter, then I was told it was illegible, and finally that they never received it at all. They did, however, change my address on file to the one I requested in the letter, so obviously they received it and it was legible. They are still refusing to send me my title even though they have not held a lien on the vehicle in almost a year.','ENCORE CAPITAL GROUP INC.',2.0,2.0,'a motorcycle t o Midland Credit Management acquired a debt for a motorcycle. 10 months ago, the account was settled and I requested the title. they told me that');
