loan and being responsible I have attempted to pay the loan off but have been told I will not be able to get a letter so that I can take the tax advantage write off as a cosigner. Your employee states that it is law that only [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] can receive this letter and take the tax write offs. If this is correct than how is it that you can effect my credit report as well as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s. It [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] died would I be responsible I am [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and on Social Security [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. You ca n''t get blood from a stone. Other than this negative credit report my credit is impeccable. Both [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Navient are predatory loan companies that the federal government should put out of business. At no time should this ngative information been placed on my or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s credit report.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'the dispute is between the company and the new servitor Navient. the company has sent in a reply and the dispute is closed. the company is now claiming my son');
