INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3366,'05/04/2017','Debt collection','Credit card debt','Written notification about debt','I have a  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  credit card. It has been delinquent and I received several voicemails asking me to call or to go online and make payment arrangements on or before end of   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]     or the account would be charged off. I made a payment plan arrangement online before the deadline. When I went online this week ( week pf    [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    ) to check on status, I was unable to login as my account was in " special status '''' and I was instructed to call  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , which I did. After a run around, I was told my account had been transferred to another division of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and told to contact them at  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , but also told they were closed at  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  cst ( it was  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  cst when I first called  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ). Meanwhile, my father had received a call from a debt collector at  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  cst today - we presume a debt collector as they did n''t identify themselves, but a reverse phone check of the number (  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ) revealed them to be a firm called Northstar Companies - a firm neither my father or I had ever heard of before. I mentioned this name and number to the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  rep and they were n''t aware of the cos or if the management of my account has been transferred from  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  to Northstar.','Northstar Location Services, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a debt collector at a firm called Northstar Companies. a reverse phone check revealed the company was a firm. the company wasn''t aware of the co');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3367,'05/04/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Other features, terms, or problems','On   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]     I went to redeem some points to purchase an   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   tablet . By mistake I entered it twice. There is no page before submitting order to check for correctness or edit anything so I did not realize I had ordered  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  in error. Withi n 5 mi nutes I called the company & they stated it is their policy not to allow returns or refunds & they could not cancel the second order. Now I am out  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  points & receiving  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  when I only want & need one. The credit card company is Elan Financial Services','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,2.0,'credit card company is Elan Financial Services. it is their policy not to allow returns or refunds.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3368,'05/04/2017','Checking or savings account','Other banking product or service','Managing an account','I am a   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   in   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   to   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  . Today (  XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ) they sent out a generic email stating there was an account update and to log in to see it. Upon login, a small window opened saying that they had made an unspecified error in calculating returns and that our account should now show correct information. When I closed the window there was no way to view the message again and no further explanation to be found anywhere on the site.      Prosper  does not provide return calculations on their statements, so I have no way to show what the provided return was at any given point in time. However, I texted my father on  XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  that my return was 16.81 % as provided by  Prosper. Upon logging in today, my return is shown as 9.42 % Prosper has been routi nely, and I suspect knowingly, overstating returns for years. At no point since I first invested in the platform in   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   has my return been stated at or below 9.42 %, whereas  Prosper ''s   restated returns show many years with a return under that amount. I follow the peer to peer investor community forums and I am not the only person experiencing this today, virtually everybody is reported returns restated to lower values.     Finally, becaus e Prosper has r ecently removed the ability to sell notes on a secondary market, there is no way to liquidate my investments with them. I simply have to accept my new, lower returns and slowly pull money from the platform as time goes by.','Prosper Marketplace, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a small window opened today saying that they had made an unspecified error in calculating returns. Upon logging in, my return is shown as 9.42 %.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3369,'05/04/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Improper use of your report','I recently received a copy of my   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   credit report and I notice there is an unauthorized credit inquiry made by each of these creditors. I do not recall authorizing this credit inquiry and I understand you should n''t be allowed to put an inquiry on my file unless I have authorized it. I am requesting you initiate an investigation into each creditor inquiry to determine who requested this credit inquiry.   If you find I was not the one who authorized this inquiry, I ask that it be removed immediately from my credit file. Please be so kind as to forward me documentation that you have had the unauthorized inquiry removed.   If you find that I am in error, then please send me proof of this.   Thank you in advance,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','REGIONS FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'unauthorized credit inquiry made by each of these creditors. I do not recall authorizing this credit inquiry. I am requesting you initiate an investigation into each creditor inquiry.');
