INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3394,'04/29/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with your lender or servicer','This is very simple. My payments were set to draw every  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  of the month -- been paying it on time every month for about 7 years. My wife and I decided that we were finally in a position to get aggressive paying off our loans. The one problem we had was that payments were drawn on the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , and  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  of each month. I realized we had a chance to pay off in full everything on the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and then if we could move the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  payment to the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  or  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  -- all ACS loans -- we would know how much surplus we had each month and would make additional payments simpler for us to make. So I first called all  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  of our credit card providers to synchronize those payments to the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  week of the month. No problem, this was easily completed in less than  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  hour. Then I called ACS in early   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   They said on the phone the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  or  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  were simply NOT options. The best they could do was the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . But I had to send them a email, they simply could NOT start the change based on my phone call to them. Ok, I complied. Their bounce back email said a response said : " We will respond to your message in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  -  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  business days ''''. This statement is false. Probably a delay tactic by ACS. I waited for over a week before they replied on the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  that they had to wait until the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  payment processed and then they would " ask '''' the lender if it was possible. I do n''t understand how I can make every payment on time, even at times when my wife and I were actually losing money month over month and then make a very simple request and yet get treated so terribly. If they ca n''t do it, fine -- tell me that when I call in!!  ACS  is a deplorable institution engaged in fraud and deceit and they should be held accountable, as I would be if I failed to make those monthly payments.','ACS Education Services',8.0,10.0,'ACS has a bounce back email saying the payments were simply NOT options. ACS has a bounce back email that says the payments were not a problem. a ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3395,'04/29/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Unable to get your credit report or credit score','I had reached out to Transunion to get an updated copy of my credit report to go over it after my ex had moved out.     I found out that he had take some of of my files and there were some credit reports that were missing. So when i went online to get my free reports, which i have not done in years to look them over and dispute them, i was given an error at transunion advising me that the information provided could not be verified. WHAT INFORMATION? I did n''t enter anything.     so when i called and spoke with th e Fraud department, they stated that there was not any issues on their end, and that i should be able to order my report. So I tried again, and to avail, NOTHING. the same error. I asked to be to transferred to a supervisor in the dispute department to verify my account, but no one would help me there either. She gave me the run around, about the usual 24-48 hr bit, knowing that i was just being thrown to the wolves. I am also having this issue with  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  where i can not get any of my free credit reports with some type of error stating that my information cou ld not be verified and i would have to phone in my issues. THAT IS UBSURED. All of this drama did not start until someone decided that they would add a fraud alert to all my reports back in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  of   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  .     All I would like to do is to be able to sign into my accounts, and do what i need to do, and not have disrespectful people talking to me in a rude manner and asking me rude questions. if there is anyone that will investigate this matter and follow up with me I would appreciate it greatly.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'i had reached out to transunion to get an updated copy of my credit report. i was given an error at transunion advising me that the information provided could not be verified');
