ntative, and myself to explain the check was presented twice to  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .     I have spoken with  13 represe ntatives of Bank of America and one representative of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .     Bank of America has refused to credit my account back and leaving me in the negative {$2400.00}.     Please help me','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'a check was paid on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the check was presented to them twice by Bank');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3411,'04/26/2017','Debt collection','Medical debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','I ''ve tried disputing a fraudulent collection account on my credit report. I ''ve sent letters to the agency and have gotten little response. My official complaint is against NATIONAL RECOVERY AGENT for reporting credit information to the credit reporting agencies that was a result of Identity Theft Ive asked in my letter that the negative reporting ceases and the information be removed from my credit report.','NRA Group, LLC',2.0,4.0,'NATIONAL RECOVERY AGENT has a complaint against the agency. the agency asked that the negative reporting ceases and the information be removed from my credit report.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3412,'04/26/2017','Checking or savings account','Other banking product or service','Managing an account','The  Huntington  Bank bill pay recorded a payment to our condo association of {$220.00} on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  . They tell me they sent a check that was never cashed. Apparently that is the extent of their responsibility to me as they stated they are not responsible for the late fee we have incurred or so I was informed by a CSR supervisor this evening,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .     But what really concerns me is that on that date they wash the funds from our checking account into a  Huntington Bank account and debit my account that time. It is now nearly 24 days later and the money is gone from my account but still resides in the Huntington bank account where I assume they accrue additional float on the funds not available to me. Prior to Huntington  bank purchasing  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  bill pay sent checks from our account and did not record the payment until the check was cashed thus providing us the ability to know that a check was not cashed in a timely fashion and to inquire as to why.     They tell me I agreed to this process in the transition from  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  to  Huntington  as it was likely in the " fine print ''''.     I am certain what they do is quite legal if not moral. Our monies are our monies until a creditor decides to cash a check we have sent time or that the bank, through its bill pay service, sends them.     Shame on you Huntington.','HUNTINGTON NATIONAL BANK, THE',2.0,2.0,'the ''compte_ANONYMISÉ'' bill pay recorded a payment of $220.00'' on a check we have sent time. they say');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3413,'04/26/2017','Student loan','Private student loan','Dealing with your lender or servicer','I think it is Very unfair that I am not able to apply EXTRA payments to my principle balance. I emailed asking how I can do this and this is the emailed response : Dear  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  : Thank you for contacting   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  .         The interest on your loa  n ( s ) is calculated using the daily simple interest method. Your interest accrues at a daily rate based on the principal balance and interest rate of your loan ( s ). Each payment will be applied the same. First, it will be applied to any interest that has accrued since the last payment, and then it will be applied to principle.
We do allow due dates to advance one month. We can place a note on your account that will prevent additional payments from advancing th  e due date. If you would like this applied to your account, please respond with this request.         We appreciate the opportunity to serve you as a valued customer. If you have any other questions, please respond to this e-mail or visit our website at  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .         Sincerely,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  Customer Service This should be illegal. How come I am not able to apply towards JUST the principle on top of my monthly balance that goes to interest and principle. I should have that option.','NELNET, INC.',2.0,2.0,'interest on your loa n ( s) is calculated using the daily simple interest method. each payment will be applied the same. first, it will be applied to any interest');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3414,'04/26/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage','I applied for a jumbo mortgage  with Wells Fargo to refinan ce a first mortgage on an apartment located in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  jointly owned by me and my domestic partner.   After a lengthy and inquisitive proc ess, Wells Fargo app roved the loan and send us a commitment lette r. ( atta ched ) In the meantime, I had filed a refi application with another bank and was approved very quickly, with better terms than the one offered  by Wells. So I told Wells that  we would not close the loan with them, which I had every right to do since I had not signed the commitment letter accepting the loan.     We than both received what I would call a retaliation letter, stating that the bank had rejected our applicatio n ( the ver y same that I had accepted earlier ) and enumerating a lot of vague arguments and phony reason s ( payments incident, bad credit score etc ... ) to justif y the rejection. They knew perfectly well that those were pure fabricated falsehoods, since they had all our financial background in the initial application.     I am very concerned that the disparaging comments about our finances  ( wh ich we can prove are a pure lie and fabrication ) will somehow be leaked to other financial institution or used for scoring purposes. What if I ever apply for another loan that asks whether you have been previously rejected? How am I going to answer that question?      Bottomline is that WELLS FARGO, which has already been haunted by numerous scandals, is simply trying to retaliate by tarnishing with falsehoods my financial reputation Thank you for your help, I hope Wells wo n''t be allo wed to continue spreading deliberately false information to retaliate against clients','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a mortgage application for a first mortgage was approved by Wells. the loan was approved by Wells and was approved very quickly. the bank rejected our applicatio ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3415,'04/26/2017','Debt collection','Medical debt','False statements or representation','The collection is not bonded in Texas and can not legally collect debt. Please remove accounts from my credit report and confirm that the debt is not owed.','HCFS Health Care Financial Services, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'the collection is not bonded in Texas and can not legally collect debt. please remove accounts from my credit report and confirm that the debt is not owed.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3416,'04/25/2017','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Managing an account','I opened a Checking ''s account With citizens and waited for my card to come in the mail for about a week and a half. When i finally received it i called and activated it, it said it was successful. However when i went to use it I got declined so i called customer service they told me they fixed t and my card should work. so i head back to the store,  Again declined. so again i call customer service they said i never activated my card i told them i did twice now and they said no problem and the card should work not. So now for the third time i head to the store, the only difference this time was when my card got declined the cashier told me t came up expired. so now again calling customer service i asked to speak with a supervisor and after being on hold for 43 minutes i got someone saying all the supervisors were busy and that she could help me. She explained that the mailed out the card had then ordered a replacement card. I asked why they ordered a replacement card they could n''t tell me why. Then told me it would go to my new address ( which i had to call 4 times just to get them to change before actually having to go in the branch for them to actually do it ) it did not in fac t it went to an address i never lived at coincidentally it was a friends house thank  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  for that or someone else would have had my bank information. but even worse is now that i finally got my new card after a months wait i go to use it and guess what. You ''re right DECLINED. so now I ''m getting late fees because citizens screwed up and wont let me access my money!!!!','CITIZENS FINANCIAL GROUP, INC.',2.0,2.0,'i opened a Checking''s account with citizens and waited for my card to come in the mail for about a week and a half. when i finally');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3417,'04/25/2017','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Problem caused by your funds being low','From  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  We have a working relationship now. However, I was asked to file this report.    Wells Fargo  kept charging me {$30.00} a month for each business account when it was supposed to be free. The accounts were opened in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , NV where I had my  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  . I live in California. No matter where I called to straighten it out and get credited, it did not fix. First of all they claim they can only credit back 3 months. I first noticed it after {$800.00} was dwindled down to nothing.     I dro ve t  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  hours round trip to  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  to get this problem fixed, same result. When I asked for help in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , California on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , they said we have to close the account and make a new account to fix the problem. Of course each checking account comes with a separate savings account. So they changed it to {$20.00} a month fee but told me it was free. Later in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  I asked for help. I went to the   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  locations. The same thing happened reopen another account and another and another. I dont even know how many times this went on. For sure more tha n 4 ac count changes for  my two business checking and two required  business saving accounts in just the city of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . Now I have a free account only I have {$150.00} Tranfer into savings and the next day transferred back {$150.00} to checking and I have to have bill pay active or they will have a fee. Another option is to have a huge daily average in the account at all times. I am not doing that. Last week I asked a couple questions and they gave me wrong information.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a new account was opened in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the account was opened in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3418,'04/25/2017','Mortgage','Home equity loan or line of credit (HELOC)','Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage','I have a home equity line of credit from  Bank of America. It was a ten year pla n and then you had to pay it off. When it matured in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  of   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   I was in the process of getting a new line of credit and they charg ed me 5 percent l ate fee on the balloon balance. This charge was about {$7400.00}. I told them I was in the process of getting a new line and they said they would remove the fee when the account was paid in full. I said I needed to have it removed so I could determine the correct pay off amount. They would n''t budge, I did n''t trust the company to remove it at loan closing time. The contract says nothing about charging a late fee for the balloon balance. It says a late fee will be charged for any monthly payment received late, but nothing for the balloon balance. 27 months went by and I faithfully sent my payment of the interest charge and some of the principal. In 13 years I had never missed a payment or had a payment received  late. My credit score  was excellent. Even though I paid the interest each month from the monthly statements I received from BOA, they still reported my account as delinquent because the line of credit had matured. I had written several letters asking for the amounts to be removed and got no response. The first week in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  of this year a Foreclosure Notice was duct taped to my front door. I was shocked, disgusted, and embarrassed. I have always paid my bills or gone without and now my house was going to be sold at auction on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . I now have a weakened credit record and I am trying to get a new line and I am still unable to get BOA to remove the charges.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'a line of credit from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] matured in a ten year pla n. it was a 5 percent l ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3419,'04/25/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Trouble during payment process','First, this is not a live-or-die matter.     I have a mortgage  with Ocwen Financial. I have  always paid on time.   The specific matter here is a payment they say was received on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ( a Mond ay ).   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  , which sent the payment via my online bill payment account, says it was received on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ( a Fr iday ). The { $98.00} penalty   Ocwen assessed itself is not a " federal case '''' and is hardly with bothering you. I took pains to ensure the payment would arrive before a penalty was assessed, though. What I did want to do is weigh in on Ocwen and my overall experience with them.
I inherited Ocwen when my loan was sold to them, without my approval, obviously. My only experiences with them have had to do with an inquiry about refinancing at a more current rate ( at the time, they were of no help - now they are pushing refinancing ). They got my inquiry so screwed up, misunderstanding that I was only asking so that I might lower my monthly payment. They interpreted the request as my being in financial trouble and I kept getting remediation packets - six in total! - after I had disabused the  m of that idea when I first spoke to them. After weeks of calls and mailings, they finally relented. My conclusion : these people are really, really stupid.      Re : my current issue and their alleging I paid them a day late. I called my " customer service representative ( which is what Ocwen calls anyone who answers the phone ). He was an outsourced person ( which is OK by me, as long as they are qualified to be of help ). It turns out, not surprisingly, that he was incapable of doing anything but reading a script. Ocwen gives its customer-contact people absolutely no authority to mitigate, ameliorate or otherwise help whatsoever. Ocwen ma kes  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  look like emissaries of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .     Anyway, of all the mortgage companies and servicing firms I have experienced in my 40 years as a mortgagee, I have never experienced the rank incompetence and unhelpfulne ss of Ocwen. Ever . I have held this in until now, but reading about their downgrading by  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , I was prompted to speak out.','OCWEN LOAN SERVICING LLC',2.0,2.0,'a mortgage lender says it received a payment on a mond ay. the penalty Ocwen assessed itself is not a " federal case '''' and');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3420,'04/25/2017','Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service','Domestic (US) money transfer','Fraud or scam','this is  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  who used MoneyGram on-line service on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] / [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] / 2017  for the first time to transfer money in the amount of {$320.00} +  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   ( f ee ) for the on-line purchase and found out that was scam. When I contacted th  e MoneyGram and was told that the money already picked up by receiver and they are not responsible for any causes, I was refer to the website link regarding to all potential fraud.
My concern is that MoneyGram should be compliance by provide that info before consumers press the " SENT '''' or any verification process between the sender and receiver before the transaction finalized. By this method which will eliminates the fraud transactions made by the scam artist since they are continuing use this services    as a tool to take advantage of all citizens  like myself.','MONEYGRAM PAYMENT SYSTEMS WORLDWIDE INC',2.0,4.0,'money was transferred in the amount of $320.00 + [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for the on-line purchase. money was already picked up by');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3421,'04/25/2017','Credit card or prepaid card','General-purpose credit card or charge card','Problem with a purchase shown on your statement','On   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    , my friend and I were passengers on  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  flight #  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . This flight was from  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  to  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and was booked through  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . We purchased  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  seats and once on the airplane, we inquired as to availability and the cost of upgrading to  Business se ats. The flight attendant told us there was available seating and the cost would be  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . We verified the price again, and the broken English speaking flight attendant assured us the cost was  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  Dollars. We gave our credit cards and moved into the upgraded seats.     Several hours later, after meal service, the lights were dimmed for resting passengers. At this time the flight attendant presented the credit card slip for me to sign. The receipt was for {$300.00}, which appeared to be for both myself and my friend who was sleeping. I asked about my friends credit card and the attendant, who spoke terrible  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , indicated she would return with it later.     While I was away from my seat, my friend awoke and was presented with her credit card and slip for signature. She also thought the {$300.00} was for both of us. When I returned to the seat, we discussed that we had both been charged for  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  upgrades and asked the flight attendant for an explanation. A different flight attendant came to us and explained that there was a miscommunication and the charge was not {$150.00}, but {$1500.00}! We were very upset as the original attendant stated the charge was  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , never did she say anything remotely resembling  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  or    [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  ,    [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  . After much back and forth discussion with the flight attendants, we were assured it was their error and we would not be charged. Several weeks later, both my credit card bill my friends arrived, each with a charge of {$1400.00} for the upgrade.     This flight was booked on a domestic airline, leaving from a  US l ocation. All flight attendants should have full command of the English language and be capable of properly explaining to passengers all policies, procedures and pricing. Additionally, all charges shou ld be in US Dollars  unless clearly explained. To expect otherwise would be unethical and unsafe.','BARCLAYS BANK DELAWARE',2.0,2.0,'flight was from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the flight was booked through [COMPTE_AN');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3422,'04/25/2017','Checking or savings account','Checking account','Problem caused by your funds being low','I opened several accounts wit h Wells Fargo afte r filing a Chapter  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  Reorganization Plan.     Every time, I deposit a check, they place unreasonable hold on my funds.     Each time I deposit checks into my account,  Wells Fargo has a different reasoning for placing a hold on my funds.      If the check exceeds   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  , there is a hold If the check exceeds {$5000.00}, there is a hold Meanwhile my funds are on hold, they are charging me overdraft fees for my automatic withdrawls.     I do NOT think it is fair at all, they have my money and are holding it unreasonably.      [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , from Pennsylvania and her  Supervisor   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , no last names NOR employee numbers were available.     They further went to explain how the  Federal is HO LDING a portion of my check for Further Verification and Processing.     They claim that  Wells Fargo has N OT been given the funds even though the issuing bank has released all of the funds.     This is troubling to me in that i paid over {$200.00} in Bank fees last month. This type of practice is jeopardizing my  Reorganization Plan.      Please ask  Wells Fargo for  their side of this story.     Thank You,','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'h Wells Fargo afte r filing a Chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Reorganization Plan. if the check exceed');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3423,'04/25/2017','Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service','International money transfer','Other transaction problem','We were sending money through  Western Union and mixed up the maternal and paternal surname on the form fields. When our daughter tried to pick up the money, she was denied because the names were reverse. Fine. We contacted WU to h ave them change the names. They could not do that so we had to cancel the transaction. Then they would not cancel the transaction. We went online ( the same way we placed the order ). We were verified and the chat person said they wanted to call us on the phone. We have no reason to give them a phone number, and we were verified online. They refused to cancel the order. We had to call our credit card company and report fraud because of their actions.','WESTERN UNION COMPANY, THE',2.0,4.0,'we mixed up the surname on the form fields. when our daughter tried to pick up the money, she was denied because the names were reverse. they refused to cancel the transaction ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3424,'04/24/2017','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  is my client. This is attorney  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . He is married with  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  children. He has  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  people living in his house. It is a very humble house in a very old neighborhood. It is way  upside d own. I have applied for  three  modifications for this man with  US Bank,  and he has been turned down each time.   This time, he was turned down and the letter says he was turned down because of " discrepencies in his application. '''' Then it says, if you want to know what the discrepancies are, you have to GET A SUBPOENA. This is an auto mechanic with  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  children. He obviously can not afford to hire an attorney to file a lawsuit and obtain a subpoena.   Also, when you cal l US Bank, ev en if you are an attorney such as myself, and even after they verify you with the client ''s home address, social security number, date of birth, and confirm that they have a signed, notarize d Power of A ttorney from the client authorizing the attorney to handle their modification, the bank insists on getting the attorney ''s personal social security number or taxpayer ID number. If you do not give them your private information, which they have absolutely no need for, they hang up on you.   Help me save this man ''s house and get answers to the modification effort.    [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  is the borrower, I,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , am his attorney.','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,2.0,'he is an auto mechanic with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] children. he has three modifications for his house, and he has been turned down.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3425,'04/24/2017','Debt collection','Auto debt','Written notification about debt','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  I filed a complaint with the BBB and CFPD agains t NCB Management services, Inc. I n their response to my complaint they stated they would send validation of the debt owed. They have not done so. All they have done was state they would send the required information. I am requesting the original contract, complete financial transaction history, and a copy of the letter they stated was sent in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . With out this information in a timely manne r. NCB Management serv ice is deliberately violating Fair Credit Reporting Ac t, 15 U.S.C & 1681. Under that  act all unverified accounts must be deleted. Without validation of this debt and continue reporting to the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  credit bureaus, will result in me seeking damages.','NCB MANAGEMENT SERVICES INC',2.0,2.0,'a complaint was filed with the BBB and CFPD agains t NCB Management services, Inc.. they stated they would send validation of the debt owed.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3426,'04/24/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','Attempts to collect debt not owed','Back around  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , I learned that I had an account with  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]     [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  for which {$300.00} was due. I understand that   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   placed the account for collection with  Credit Protection Associates. App arently, part of this collection effort included reporting it as a collection to several consumer credit reporting agencies.     I contacted   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   directly, explained I did not get any final bill or other notification, and paid   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   the {$300.00} they said was due.   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]    said they could contact  CPA and in struct them to delete the tradelin e CPA had   previously reported, not just mark it as paid.     As of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , the tradeline is still being reported to the major credit bureaus, such as  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  and  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . I have disputed this accoun t three times , requesting they delete it. Each time they have simply updated the report as paid, and as such it remains a negative on my credit as a collection. Moreover, neither dispute has resulted in the account being reported as disputed, which I am fairly certain the law requires.','Credit Protection Association, L.P.',2.0,2.0,'account was reported to major credit bureaus, such as credit protection. account was reported as a collection. a third time, the account is being reported as disputed.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3427,'04/24/2017','Debt collection','Other debt','Written notification about debt','Recently while conducting a monitor of my credit report I discovered that CHOICE RECOVERYINC. #  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , #  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , #  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , #  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , #  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , #  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , #  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  information. I believe under th e Fair Debt Collections Practices Act, I have the right to request that you allow me to validate the alleged debt. I am aware that there is a debt from   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   . but I am   unaware of the amount due and your bill does not include a breakdown of any fees.   Additionally, I am allowed under th e HIPAA law [ HEALTH INSURANCE PORTABILITY AND ACCOUNTABILITY ACT OF 1996 ], to protect my privacy and medical records from third parties. I do not recall giving permi ssion to CHOICE  RECOVERY INC. to  release my medical information to a third party. I am aware that HIPPAA does allow for limited information about me but anything more than that is to only be revealed with the patients authorization, therefore my request   is two fold and as follows, Validation of Debt, and HIPAA authorization.
1.Please provide breakdown of fees including any collection costs and medical charges 2.Provide a copy of my signature with the provider of service to release my medical information to you.
3.Cease any credit bureau reporting until debt has been validated by me.
4.Please send this information to my address listed above and accept this form  al complaint as my formal debt validation request, which I am allowed under the FDCPA.   Please note that falsification of the information you received from any medical provider can be percieved as  a HIPAA comp liance violation as well as a violation of the FDCPA because you will be deceiving me after my written request of debt validation. I request full documentation of what you received from the provider of service in connection with this alleged debt.   Additionally, any reporting of this debt to the credit bureaus prior to allowing me to validate it  may be a vio lation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act, which can allow me to seek damages from a collection agency.','Choice Recovery, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'CHOICE RECOVERY INC. has the right to request that you allow me to validate the alleged debt. I am aware that there is a debt from [COMPTE');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3428,'04/24/2017','Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports','Credit reporting','Incorrect information on your report','I have a debt on my credit report that has been paid. But it has not been removed from my credit report. The debt collector  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  has sent the proper information in to remove the debt but it has not been removed from my credit report. I would like for this debt to come off my credit report. I am going to provide the proper information for this debt to be removed off my credit report.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'debt collector has sent proper information to remove the debt. it has not been removed from my credit report.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3429,'04/24/2017','Mortgage','Conventional home mortgage','Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage','We are current customers of  Santander Bank with a HARP mortgage. We have an adjustable credit rate so we wanted to refinance to get a lower, locked in rate. We began the process with Santander because they are already our mortgage holders so we do n''t need to go through as many steps. We began the process. We are having an issue current  ly with our credit score. We check our own credit scores and they are in the   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   and   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  , ( wife and husband, respectively ). However, when Santander pulls out credit they are showing a median credit score  of  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . When asked what bureau they are pulling from, they answered that they have a third party who gives them a different number. This is completely and totally unfair. With their number, we have to pay a higher interest rate, so they make more money over the course of the loan.  With the   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   numbers,  we would be in the highest tier, thus lowering their overall payout on the loan. This should be illegal. Consumers who are careful with their credit, who monitor their credit scores, and still end up getting the shaft because of a made up system by a bank. Please help.','SANTANDER BANK, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',8.0,8.0,'Santander has an adjustable credit rate so we wanted to refinance to get a lower, locked in rate. we started the process with Santander because they are already our');
