INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3443,'04/19/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Can''t repay my loan','My student loan servicer is  Navient . I have submitted all appropriate documentation for ym income based re-payment plan since my graduation in   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  . I have submitted twice and spoke with several different people since this time. I am receiving emails stating there are documents in my inbox on their website but can not find any documents. I have brought this issue up and the representative pushes the issue aside and never address it. As of today  X/XX/XX  I have not been approved, denied, or placed on any kind of repayment plan. I keep having to forbearance my loans or make partial payments. I feel that I am stuck and helpless in trying to pay back my student loans. I am trying to repay my loans but  Navient is  not helping or working with me to resolve. I feel whats in the best interest of the customer/student repaying is not a priority.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'my student loan servicer is Navient. I have submitted all appropriate documentation for ym income based re-payment plan since my graduation in [COMPTE_ANON');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3444,'04/19/2017','Payday loan',NULL,'Charged fees or interest I didn''t expect','To whom  it may con cern, I ''d like to make a complain abo ut RISE Credit. W e originally signed up for a {$3000.00} with an interest rate of 208 %. I have been paying {$520.00} every month and paid a total of {$5500.00} and they want me to pay them  until 2018. This  has been a burden for me and my family. As an  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  military member i have reached out to my chain of command regarding this issue. I have been advised by financial counselors that in accordance w ith Military Lending  Act says that you ca n''t be charged an interest rate higher than 36 % on most types of consumer loans and provides other significant rights. I am currently working with my loca l Judge Advocate General ''s Office to g et some help with legal issues.','Risecredit, LLC',2.0,2.0,'w ith military Lending Act says that you can''t be charged an interest rate higher than 36 % on most types of consumer loans. w ith military');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3445,'04/19/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Other','I was a member of  Citibank Visa f or 20 years. In  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  I was making purchases using my credit card that were then put on another credit card # which I did n''t actually own. The credit card that I was using did n''t expire until  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . I inquired about this and never got an answer. I also had pending charges that never carried over to the next month and there was n''t any real way of knowing what had carried over since my balance was zero yet my purchases did n''t add up to the total balance. I also inquired about this. I had to keep tracing things each month and it was frustrating. This pending situation was irritating but the charging  two  card # ''s when I only owned  one credit card just did n''t seem ethical. I canceled my membership with Citibank Visa  as a result.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'pending charges never carried over to the next month. the charging two card #''s when I only owned one credit card just didn''t seem ethical''');
