INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3449,'04/18/2017','Debt collection','Medical','Disclosure verification of debt','Through a credit monitoring service I received notice of a collection account appearing on my credit report. On my credit report the account was reported by the collection agency  Medical Data Systems , Inc., h aving originated with  G  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   Hospital.  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  Hospital  had provided me a service in the Summer of   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  .     I contacted the hospital and found that they and the collection agency both had an incorrect address on record.     My address is  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  in  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , VA. They recorded  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . The first     [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]     in my address was transposed to a  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . I did not provide them with an incorrect address to my own home. Any mail sent to  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]   [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]  would have been returned to the sender.     I paid the bill immediately and received a receipt that memorializes the address error. It also has my name partially misspelled. I have included this receipt here, along with other documentation recording my correct address and name.     When I contac ted Medical Data Systems t  hey insisted that this was a valid debt and refused to remove it from my credit reports. Nothing  resulted from disputes I filed with the  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ,  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] , and  [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . It now appears that the wrong address has been added to my credit reports.     I paid the bill as soon as I was made aware of it.     Prior to seeing the collection reported on my credit report, I received no notifications of the balance due.     I do n''t think my credit should suffer because of a billing error.','Medical Data Systems, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'medical data systems, Inc., h aving received notice of a collection account. the account was reported by the collection agency Medical Data Systems. it was reported by');
