INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3459,'04/15/2017','Bank account or service','Checking account','Using a debit or ATM card','I used my BB & T issued debit card to get [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from an ATM at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] airport in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/2017. The ATM machine did not work. After I entered my information and selected the amount of money I wanted to retrieve the ATM screen turned white and after a couple minutes it said that the transaction did not go through and that the machine was out of order. 
When I came back to the US I was surprised that BB & T charged my account {$210.00} for money that I had not received. I complained to my account manager on XX/XX/2017. She initially told me that I needed to contact the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bank who operated the ATM machine and that she was not there to know what exactly happened. After pressing back and pointing out that her customer service approach did not make sense, she placed me on hold to looked further into a resolution. She eventually told me to stop by a BB & T branch to file a complaint. I complied and filed a complaint and the charge was provisionally reversed on the same day. To my surprise and without further communication from BB & T the charge was reversed and my checking account was charges {$200.00} dollars on XX/XX/2017.','BB&T CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'BB & T issued debit card to get [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from an ATM. the machine did not work and the transaction did not go through ');
