INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3461,'04/15/2017','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','The debt for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] college through the collections agency williams and fudge has never been validated. This account has been removed and readded TWICE without any notice to me, as well as no validation of the account sent to me at all. The collection agency has my phone number, home address and email address and has never notified me of readding this account. I want this account removed for good and blocked from ever being readded as they have broken FCRA laws while trying to collect an unverified debt and ruining my credit worthyness under false and inaccurate information.','Williams & Fudge, Inc',2.0,2.0,'debt for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] college through collections agency. account has been readded and removed without notice. collection agency has my phone number, home');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3462,'04/14/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','I disputed the Chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bankruptcy that is on my credit report with Equifax and they did an investigation and after 1 days time I received a response from Equifax stating the investigation was complete and the report was accurate. I called the Federal Bankruptcy Court in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I was advised that once they report it to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reporting agencies they do not report it again or ever update it. I was told by Equifax that the info was obtained from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called them and they removed all information from their database. I again filed another dispute and received the exact information from Equifax that the information was verified through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but I never told Equifax that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had removed all the info on the bankruptcy a moth prior to me filing the second dispute. I asked them to remove it from my file since it could not be verified through their contact [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they refused to remove it so they are reporting this under false pretenses.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'i disputed the Chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bankruptcy that is on my credit report with Equifax. I called the Federal Bankruptc');
