INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3465,'04/14/2017','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Improper contact or sharing of info','Submitted a BBB Complaint on XX/XX/2017 for Debt Validation to J.H. Portfolio Debt Equities LLC and was forwarded to the business the same day on XX/XX/2017. The company did not respond until XX/XX/2017 and the company did not submit all information pursuant to my requests for debt validation. Including their license information allowing them the ability to collect within my state. Pursuant to the Fair Debt Collection practices Act, 15 USC 1692g Sec. 809 ( b ), the company can not report my account to credit reporting agencies until the debt validation is provided. J.H. reported this account to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/2017. The company indicates to BBB that they report monthly and did not receive the BBB complaint until after they reported the account. Company did not provide proof of when they received the BBB complaint nor when they submitted their monthly reporting to credit bureaus.','JH Portfolio Debt Equities, LLC',2.0,2.0,'the company did not respond until XX/XX/2017. the company did not submit all information pursuant to my requests for debt validation.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3466,'04/14/2017','Debt collection','Payday loan','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I saw an entry on my credit report from Ad Astra Recovery for a loan they alleged I took out in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I sent a request for information proving the debt was indeed mine because I am certain I have never had any business dealings with this company. The first response was a generic response with just my personal information such as date of birth and last four of my social. ( which can be obtained through public records ) See attachment. I then submitted a dispute through the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureaus because according to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] what they provided was not proper validation so I requested that the information be removed from my credit file. The debt came back as " verified ''''. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Ad Astra sent me a settlement offer stating that I can make bi-weekly payments of {$220.00} to settle the debt however I refuse to settle a debt that has not been proven to be mine. See Attachment. I reached out to Ad Astra in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], again requesting proper validation according to FCRA and Texas Finance Code, This time they responded with a " contract ''''. I combed through all pages of documents NONE of which had my signature agreeing to the terms of this alleged contract with the original company nor did it include any documentation agreeing to a contract of terms of payment in which I have defaulted with Ad Astra. I believe this company is trying to take advantage of me as a consumer as if I do not know my rights. They have ignored my multiple request to validate this debt according to federal and Texas state law. So far what I have received in generic documentation that can not be used to conclude I indeed owe this debt. Again I do not have a contract with Ad Astra and the documentation showing a contract with the original company does not include my signature. It is obviously a typed fill in the blank contract. I want this removed from all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bureaus immediately and all collection attempts ceased.','Ad Astra Recovery Services Inc',2.0,2.0,'a debt was not proven to be mine, but a settlement offer was sent. the debt came back as " verified ''''. the debt came back as " verified ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3467,'04/13/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Credit line increase/decrease','XX/XX/2017 I called Wells Fargo Card Services to ask for a credit card increase. During this time I also applied with other banks and credit union. Those other company gave me credit and a personal credit. Wells Fargo declined my application. I have been customer of Wells Fargo for over 2 years only had one late payment have been paying my credit card on time. I ask for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] increase because my credit score is way higher than two years ago. That how I know I can get the credit increase.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'I ask for a credit card increase because my credit score is way higher than two years ago. I have been customer of Wells Fargo for over 2 years only had one late payment');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3468,'04/13/2017','Debt collection','Credit card','Communication tactics','I have been receiving multiple phone calls a day, from Sears / Citibank. I ''ve reported them a couple of months ago, but they still call me from a different number. The phone calls are extremely stressful and keep kicking my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] into full gear. The calls are roughly 2 - 3 hours apart, and are all robo calls. Per the Federal Trade Commission, debt collectors are to not " repeatedly use the phone to annoy someone '''' as this is harassment. I ''m getting extremely sick of Sears / Citibank ''s collection practices. I understand I owe a debt, but I definitely do n''t need to be reminded of it multiple times a day, every M-F! I ''ve attached the phone call log from mid XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to yesterday. I ''ve also attached a snippet from the FTC stating collectors may not use the phone for repeated phone calls.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'debt collectors are to not use the phone for repeated calls. the calls are roughly 2 - 3 hours apart, and are all robo calls.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3469,'04/13/2017','Mortgage','Home equity loan or line of credit','Application, originator, mortgage broker','Began applying for a small home equity line of credit on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with Wells Fargo. I was told it would take 30 days. We have provided all documentation within 24 hours of request. It has now been 77 days and my application is still pending. We have several hundred thousands of dollars of paid equity in the mortgage ( not appreciation value ) and excellent credit as well as high verified income.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'77 days of application for small home equity line of credit. 77 days and my application is still pending.');
