INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3484,'04/10/2017','Consumer Loan','Vehicle loan','Taking out the loan or lease','My daughter goes to school at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], HI ; she is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years old. She wanted to buy a car so I told her I would co-sign on a loan for her. I received and filed out a credit application form from Pentagon Federal Credit Union ( PENFED ). Some time later I learned from her that she had gone in to the dealer and signed the load papers and left with the car. They had not sent the promissory note to me to sign. I was, in fact, not going to sign the load until we negotiated the price down. I believe she paid about {$1500.00} to much for the car. I talked to one [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( spelling? ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at PENFED and he told me he found the promissory note and he could see my daughters signature and where I was supposed to sign it was blank. I then contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and their records indicate that I am on the loan with PENFED as sole owner of the loan. I also filled a dispute with them. Basically it seems to me that I am an owner of a loan that I did not sign for. This seems like fraud to me.','PENTAGON FEDERAL CREDIT UNION',2.0,4.0,'a credit application form from PENFED was sent to me to sign the promissory note. she was not going to sign the load until we negotiated the price down');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3485,'04/10/2017','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','I have paid [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the amount I owed them twice already of {$310.00}, each time to a different collection agency. Now, three years after i paid off the last collection agency I received another collection letter that I owe them another {$310.00} and this is a third different collection agency. I do not owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] any more money.','ERC',2.0,2.0,'i have paid off the last collection agency. i owe them twice already of $310.00.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3486,'04/10/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','There is a collection account on my Experian and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit file from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in which I ''ve never had any account with. I ''ve disputed this account for a very long time with attached police identity theft report and have even contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] regarding the account. They recently told me on XX/XX/2017 that they did n''t know why it was on my credit file because they were no longer reporting or updating the account with any of the bureaus. Also, it was a fraudulent application in which the card was issued to some address that isnt mine and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] acknowledged that. A proper investigation would clearly demonstrate that it was never my account. I requested that Experian and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] remove it at once and I ''m still demanding so. Experian I ''ve contacted by certified mail dated XX/XX/2017 and sent at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that day. They claim they verified with a letter sent to me dated XX/XX/2017. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] says they have not validated, reported, or updated. How is it that these agencies ( Experian & [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) continue to report this account?','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'experian and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit file has never had any account with. they have disputed this account for a very long time with attached');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3487,'04/09/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I initially sent a dispute as the info on my Experian Credit Report is inaccurate as it related to a Chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bankruptcy. I received notice back they the information was verified and it listed it as being verified through the courts. I knew the filing dates were inaccurate so I pulled my file and sent supporting information and sent to the bureaus. They still sent me back " Item Verified '''' Therefore, they claimed to have gotten the information from the Courts and when I reached out to them ( the Courts ) they advised that they do NOT supply information to Credit Bureaus or 3rd party agencies. To better assist you guys in your research I have attached supporting documentation as it related to the bankrupty listed on my report ( s ) showing a filing date of XX/XX/2016 not XX/XX/2016 as reported to the credit bureaus. With that being said, it is my understanding since they are reporting inaccurate information this MUST BE DELETED as per FCRA 623 ( a ) ( 5 ) : " If the Credit Bureau can not VALIDATE the information with the ORIGINAL CREDITOR, they must remove said information from the consumer credit file ''''. If you look at the attachment I have attached you will see clearly that the filing was completed on XX/XX/2016.. This items should be removed. 

Thanks in advance for your help in resolving this matter.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'the information on my Experian Credit Report is inaccurate as it related to a Chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bankruptcy. I received notice back');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3488,'04/09/2017','Money transfers','International money transfer','Other service issues','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) to make a dress for my brother ''s wedding, I have all email and IM correspondances which she clearly stated she would make a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] copy so we can ensure fit. My mother placed an order with her as well under the same assumptions and she stated again that she could do the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My mother sent her measurements within 24 hours of paying for the dress but never received the dress by the deadline, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When the dress arrived the quality of sewing was poor and unfinished. The material had oil stain. My outfit arrived the evening before the wedding ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) not allowing time for alterations. Both items did not fit and were not quality made items and not as previously designed/discussed. I have pictures to document these concerns. When contacting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], she refuses to come to a resolution saying the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was an extra charge despite not disclosing this prior to payment or previous emails. She refuses to meet us halfway in resolving this issues. She took our money total of {$480.00} and is hiding behind NO REFUND POLICY despite poor craftmanship and lack of timely deliver as promised.','PAYPAL HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,2.0,'a dress for my brother''s wedding was made by my mother. she sent her measurements within 24 hours of paying for the dress. the quality of sewing was poor and un');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3489,'04/09/2017','Credit card',NULL,'APR or interest rate','Ordered card from Barclay MasterCard being told that the $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] annual fee would be waived for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Just received a letter that next month they will charge the fee despite being told that they would waive it. I would n''t have an issue if they gave a year from the notice or would charge when the card was up for renewal but less than two months to pay off the balance or be forced to pay something that I was originally waived? Does n''t seem right to me.','BARCLAYS BANK DELAWARE',2.0,2.0,'barclay MasterCard will waive the $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] annual fee. they will charge the fee despite being told they would waive it.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3490,'04/08/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Unable to get credit report/credit score','In XX/XX/2017 I requested my free annual report from all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reporting companies. Equifax and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] refused to issue the report stating they could not verify me. I had moved and also I have not had any debt on my report in years. I could not answer any of the questions Equifax asked- none of them. Both [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Equifax sent letters to my current address requesting additional proof of identity, which I did and sent by certified, return receipt mail. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] processed my request, however Equifax has not replied. It has now been over 2 months since the request was made and proof of identity submitted. I have the return receipt stamped as received by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/2017 I requested my free annual report from all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reporting companies. Equifax and [COMPTE_AN');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3491,'04/08/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Customer service / Customer relations','MasterCard Barclays offered me 0 % interest with no annual fee as a military member and I use their card exclusively for all my purchases, up until I received a letter dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017. In this letter they stated that going forward they would no longer honor my annual fee waiver and that they would charge my account on the next month billing period. This loop hole that is being used to get out of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is not very honorable. They recover funds every time I swipe my card. I understand that the card at 0 % is a great opportunity and I wish that they would not go to the extreme on service members to charge them this fee. I used this card everyday and now I face a {$990.00} charge or close the card and pay off the balance. Most members would be in a predicament under that constraint.','BARCLAYS BANK DELAWARE',2.0,2.0,'card was offered 0 % interest with no annual fee as a military member. card was offered to me by the card''s owner. card was offered to me by the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3492,'04/07/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','resurgent capital services sent me only a summary of debt. I requested from them according to the FCRA section 609 the original documentation with my signature on it about the negative item which was reported on my credit report. They must delete this item by law.','Resurgent Capital Services L.P.',2.0,2.0,'resurgent capital services sent me only a summary of debt. they must delete the negative item by law.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3493,'04/07/2017','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','CONVERGENT is trying to collect a debt that is not mine. According to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] this acct was not opened with no date of birth or social under their no credit check program. my name is a common and and I also have a cousin with the same exact first middle and last name. I am requesting this to be removed because this is not my debt.','Convergent Resources, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'CONVERGENT is trying to collect a debt that is not mine. the acct was not opened with no date of birth or social under their no credit check program.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3494,'04/07/2017','Prepaid card','General purpose card','Unauthorized transactions/trans. issues','My name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My social security number is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My Rush Card was lost on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2017 after I transferred {$2000.00} to my daughter. I noticed the card was missing on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/17 after I searched for it to pay my rent. I called Rush Card immediately to report the loss and noticed several unauthorized transactions on my account as well. RushCard replaced my card, but would not allow me to dispute the charges until after they posted. They also would not send me the dispute form so I wrote a letter of dispute instead. RushCard received it via email on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/17 ( assigned ticket code [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and US Mail on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/17 ( assigned ticket code [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) with US Mail tracking number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. RushCard ''s cardholder agreement clearly states that cardholders will receive a provisional credit for disputed transactions within 10 business days from the initial dispute. However, today I called their customer service after the 10 days had expired and no credit had been received. I was informed that they will not issue a provisional credit until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( which is 30 days from the dispute date ). When I reminded them of the cardholder agreement, they had no response except to repeat that the credit would not appear until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The outsourced international representative would not allow me to speak to the dispute department nor a supervisor. I reminded them that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had recently been sued for defrauding their customers this way and RushCard would likely face the same fate if they failed to honor their cardholder agreement. They disconnected the call. My rent is past due and