INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3501,'04/06/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Other','When I received my pay check on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] there was a garnishment so I called my payroll department to find out where it came from and how much it was for and the only information they could provide me with was to contact the general session court and provided me with a phone number to call. I called and was told it was from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was told I could contact [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] so I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the rep stated she could not help me and I needed to contact Garner and Conner so I called Garner and Conner and spoke with someone name [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I asked her what this was pertaining to and at first she stated it was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and that there was several things on there and I told her there was no way that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] could be on there as I currently have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and my vehicle is paid for that was financed through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and she then asked if she place me on hold while she researched the account and then she stated it was for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I asked her what was the original amount of this so called loan/credit card as I have never taken out a loan with this bank and said she did not know what the original amount was but stated they received a judgement in the amount of {$12000.00} back in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. She went on to tell me that they had re-filled the garnishment 6 months later as they had not received a payment but stated that they received a garnishment in the amount of {$87.00} on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], she stated that I made two {$50.00} payments via money orders in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and that I had paid a total of {$3200.00} and I asked her how could that be if I only made 2 {$50.00} payments plus the one garnishment for {$87.00} plus the one the just took for {$330.00} clearly that does n''t equal out to be {$3200.00}. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stated that I had faxed them a copy of my pay stub and car payment and a medical bill as well as my cable bill back in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and had agreed to pay {$50.00} a month. I think that something needs to be done about all of these debt collection agency ''s that go around buying up old debts and harassing consumers over time barred debts and on top of it can not even provide you with the original amount needless to say I thought you can not be sued on a time barred debt. Something needs to be done to protect the consumer especially when they go in and obtain a garnishment on a time barred debt. I would like my money returned and the garnishment STOPPED!! Otherwise I will have to seek the advise of an attorney.','Garner & Conner, PLLC',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was garnished. she called the general session court and was told it was from XX');
