INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3558,'03/23/2017','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','I made several attempts to correct this matter with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called and wrote email. I was told on several occasions that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] do n''t make adjustment customer bills. The service was not working but I was still billed. I was charged for equipment that I had returned. I wrote several letter to corporate and never received a response.','Stellar Recovery, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'i called and wrote email to corporate and never received a response. i was told that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] don''t make adjustment');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3559,'03/23/2017','Debt collection','Non-federal student loan','Communication tactics','They are told to contact the primary contact, myself, and called my cosigner 8 times over a Saturday ; then when I spoke to them on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they said I was off the call list until my payment processed. Since then they have called multiple times every day, and every time I answer they tell me the calls will stop, only to get another call 2 hours later. On top of this they include future payments in the total amount due at this time and have threatened my mom with statements such as " this will be on your credit report if you do n''t pay {$1400.00} today '''' when realistically we had 30+ days before it would be reported, and only had to make a payment of {$700.00} to get the delinquency reduced by 30 days. I called this week and they told me what was due as of today, but when I did the math that is what I owed through an XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] due date.','DISCOVER BANK',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has called multiple times every day. they include future payments in the total amount due at this time ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3560,'03/23/2017','Consumer Loan','Installment loan','Problems when you are unable to pay','Please note that I was rudely contacted as was my family by someone who would not give their name, fooled me into providing my personal information ( last 4 digits of my social security number ) and stated I have an account for an internet loan. I am [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years old. I did not take out an internet loan, and they will not stop harassing me by phone or my family members. I have requested a cease and desist, but they continue to call, make threats, wo n''t provide any documentation, and over disclosure my personal details that they have.','NCB MANAGEMENT SERVICES INC',2.0,2.0,'a friend who would not give their name fooled me into providing my personal information. he said he has an account for an internet loan. he has requested ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3561,'03/23/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I found on Equifax credit report [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] " Derogatory Mark ''''. I have never had any of my accounts go to the collectors. I am always on time or maybe late a day or two. All my credit cards received payments and I am keen not to have a late payment. This must be a mistake.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a credit card collector has never had any accounts go to the collectors. all my credit cards received payments and I am keen not to have a late payment.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3562,'03/23/2017','Consumer Loan','Installment loan','Managing the loan or lease','I applied for a line of credit with Fortiva based on the fact that the product I was purchasing qualified for 12 months of interest-free payment. At no time did I receive communication from Fortiva informing me of the conditions of the approval. Nor does [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) website state that not getting the interest-free promotional period is a possibility. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] website concentrates on the 12-month interest-free financing, and once you are approved for a line of credit with Fortiva, it automatically goes back to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] website at no time showing the terms of the financing nor is written communication sent after approval. First communication received from Fortiva was my statement. 

I became aware that I had not qualified for the promotion of either 6 or 12 months interest-free payments when I contacted Fortiva after receiving my second statement to inform them that they had made an error in charging me interest. Had I been made aware that I would be charged 29.99 % APR, I would have used another form of payment or not gone through with the purchase.','Atlanticus Services Corporation',2.0,2.0,'a line of credit with Fortiva was approved for 12 months of interest-free payment. the product I was purchasing qualified for 12 months of interest-free payment. the company says');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3563,'03/22/2017','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Disclosure verification of debt','Received a letter months after moving ... never heard from the original creditor which was a landlord ... I have written notice advising I was vacating premises at end of Lease','I.Q. DATA INTERNATIONAL, INC.',2.0,2.0,'vacated premises at end of Lease. received letter months after moving. never heard from original landlord.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3564,'03/22/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','original case # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was resolved except for the credit reporting. because I was considered for the trial payment plan, bofa considered this to be a credit problem and entered a seriously delinquent report to the bureaus. I have never been late and always paid on time I need this rectified. it is damaging my ability to borrow money or get a loan. thank you PS thank you for assisting me in getting the modification approved through Bank of America. That was n''t going to happen either without your help.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'original case # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was resolved except for the credit reporting. bofa considered this to be a credit problem and entered a seriously');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3565,'03/22/2017','Debt collection','Medical','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','Debt was paid directly to the medical provider ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Account was noted with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that it should have never been sent to collections and that I would pay [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] directly via their online bill pay. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was notified of this by me several times. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] would not let me send them receipts for paid bills and started to verbally harass me more than once. They have reported me as being in collections as of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','TRINITY HOPE ASSOCIATES',2.0,2.0,'account was noted with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that it should have never been sent to collections. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] would not');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3566,'03/22/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Unable to get credit report/credit score','I used the annual credit report site, entered all required data, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and TransUnion both said they could not confirm identity, did not even offer an chance to access [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and there were no options to find out why they could not confirm identity, the only option was to back out and then wait a year to try again. I used the phone to request the reports and they needed less info than online, but said it would take 3 weeks before I got it when I needed it for a legal matter right now. All I can say is that this site is about as useful as your other one, the ''Do Not Call Registry '', and that is sarcasm, not praise.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'i used the annual credit report site, entered all required data, and ids. the site was not available, but it was not available. it was a ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3567,'03/22/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I received a credit report alert from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that a public record is being reported on my Equifax report.Equifax removed the bankruptcy on my credit file in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Called the Equifax Consumer Affairs Directly @ ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and spoke with a woman by the name [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] she was very pleasant, after explaining the incident I was told to fax all documents in supporting my claim. I explained to her that all that was on file to only be told to fax again. Called back because I misplaced the fax number and spoke with an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was told by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that she could n''t speak with me because I was being presented by an attorney and I explained to her that that was n''t true. After going back and forth she said she could dispute the item and when I said ok she placed me on hold and then said she ca n''t because she does n''t have to because it ''s within a " 10 day '''' period. I explained that I was never notified that the bankruptcy was going to be placed on my credit prior to this being put back on my credit file Per the FCRA " If a previously negative item is reinserted the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) requires the credit reporting agency to notify you no later than five days after the date of reinsertion. '''' I was told that the investigation was just concluded in which it was 90 days later. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] could ''ve been new to her role because she did n''t know what [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] she was talking about she kept placing me on hold. Their customer service is horrible and that ''s why they ''re getting sued. Basically, My call was based on a previous complaint I filed with CFPB # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] against Equifax they were reporting another deleted account on my credit file and they should n''t. After their investigation, they responded with a letter stating that they deleted this item. Today Equifax has put it back on my credit bureau without notifying me prior that it ''ll be back on there. Here is the supporting documentation notice on the last document it states contact [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but the document before that one is from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a credit report alert from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was removed. a public record is being reported on my credit file. a credit report alert');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3568,'03/22/2017','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','The debt they are adding to my credit report is my mother ''s account. I never agreed to this account the only way they are linking me to it is because I let her use my debit card to pay but I was not the account holder. I have never received any billing or notifications from them just one day the charges appeared on my credit. I have disputed the charges twice. It will get removed then a different credit collections company will add it back on my credit. First it was under Round two credit recovery that was removed and now it was readded back by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Also the date on it is incorrect the account she made with them is at least 5 years old or older and they are reporting it as if its new.','Round Two Recovery',2.0,2.0,'the debt they are adding to my credit report is my mother''s account. I have never agreed to this account because she let her use my debit card to pay but I was not the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3569,'03/21/2017','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Can''t repay my loan','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was hit by a car and sustained [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] done. I have been unable to work. I provided documentation to Navient and qualified for the income-contigent plan on the federal loans. For the private loans I was told I used my all my forbearance time but my recollection is that I did NOT use it all. I had no way to contest this and was offered no other option but to pay for the private loans in spite of my explaining my situation. I have no sick pay while I am out and not working. When they call me, it ''s several times a day and sometimes a voice message telling me to call them so I can speak to a specialist that will offer me options. However I am NEVER offered options and instead told I must pay, in spite of my situation. I feel harassed by these calls as they will take place several times in one day, and in some cases the people have been rude. One occasion they asked me how am I able to pay other bills and this is really none of their business how I am managing. I was then told ''okay so you refuse to answer ''. Their wording of my questions is that I am solely to blame. Furthermore, I have been paying off these loans diligently and have obeyed all their rules since I took these loans out in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Repayment began in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I have been paying regularly since then with more than % 8 interest. I am trapped in this interest rate and it is extremely difficult for me. I have been offered no other options and I do no know what to do.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'a car hit me and sustained [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] done. a friend of mine');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3570,'03/21/2017','Debt collection','Medical','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','I had an outstanding medical bill to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) which I paid. I am continuously receiving harassing phone calls during work hours and after work hours from TransWorld Systems ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) a debt collection agency hired by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Transworld is also constantly sending me mail as well and now they are adding on interest fees. I have explained to TransWorld on several occasions that this has been paid and have given them the date it was paid. I also told them it was paid through the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] website as well and that I had a confirmation number for the payment. They continue to contact me. Today I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I first spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who told me that there was no balance on my account, this I know, so I explained to her what has been happening and she said I needed to speak with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and transferred me to her. I explained to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] what has been going on and that I have told TransWorld several times that this bill has been paid in full yet they continue to harass me. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] hung up on me, apparently this was her professional solution.','TRANSWORLD SYSTEMS INC',2.0,2.0,'a debt collection agency hired by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has paid me a medical bill. a debt collection agency has been hired by the company ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3571,'03/21/2017','Debt collection','Credit card','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','Here is the deal ... I do n''t owe a debt collector as this issue is with Collins Asset Group and they have refused to put down the proper information on this, so it makes it look like I have an account in collections which is inaccurate ... You ca n''t have a debt in collection, when it was closed due to a bankruptcy ... This is impacting my life and has caused me to be turned down for a loan and a credit card as I am trying to rebuild my credit score ... I have been working hard on getting things in order and this has put up a road block ... It ''s being reported to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureau ... I currently have an attorney who is ready to move on this if it does n''t change and get reported as " closed '''' due to Bankruptcy ... 
Thank You','Collins & Hilton Asset Group, LLC',10.0,10.0,'a debt collector is unable to owe a debt collector. this issue is with Collins Asset Group and they have refused to put down the proper information on this. this');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3572,'03/21/2017','Consumer Loan','Installment loan','Managing the loan or lease','I was NOT told that I retest accrues daily, I was not informed that there is no help in catching up should we fall behind, save for deferring a payment and then doubling up on payments he next month. Because of this, my payments have increased to $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/mo. I only bring home $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/check, so how am I supposed to pay this off? I have NEVER done business with a company that allows credit to be increased without considering monthly income. If they had limited my credit usage, I would n''t be in this situation. They prey vulnerable and the financially unstable and have no means of recovering. This is insane ; I originally borrowed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and now my balance is over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/mo payments and very little of that going to the principal. This is a trap, and they need to be sued immediately. I inquired about closing the account and paying it off, and I ca n''t even do that to try to get this under control.','Harpeth Financial Services, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a company that allows credit to be increased without considering monthly income wouldn''t be in this situation. if they had limited my credit usage, I wouldn''t');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3573,'03/21/2017','Bank account or service','Checking account','Using a debit or ATM card','A thief reproduced a copy of our Bank of America Mastercard/debit card and used it in multiple instances. On XX/XX/2016 the thief used the card at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Georgia once for {$730.00}, then for {$380.00} the same day. The funds in the account were exhausted and the thief continued to attempt to use the card 8 more times unsuccessfully. Bank of America is claiming that this was not a case of fraud, implying that we did this ourselves. They are refusing to pay us back the amount of {$1100.00}. We obtained a police report.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'thief used the card at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] once for $730.00');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3574,'03/20/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Other fee','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Mo. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Re : Capital One-Committing Fraud I owe Capital One {$170.00}. I asked Capital One to close account because I do n''t Trust Them. They keep adding Bogus Charges to make Balance Higher. 

