INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3577,'03/20/2017','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Can''t repay my loan','In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I had to take out a {$10000.00} loan with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. While I was in school, I was told that I had to make payments, even though I opted out of the option to repay while I was in school. My mother had to pay $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] monthly, because I could not afford the payment, due to me being a college student. Around XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was told that my loan was going to transition from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to Navient. My mother still continued to make payments and I occasionally made payments as well, due to me having a summer job. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], my loan payments jumped from {$80.00} to {$190.00}. I continuously called Navient, begging them to lower my payments because I can not afford to pay {$190.00}. Representative after representative refused to lower my payments. I have asked for income-driven repayments, Navient told me no. Later that year, Navient cause my credit score to drop [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] points. I could not get an apartment, because Navient caused a hard inquiry on my credit score. I have recently begged them to lower my payments to {$50.00}, because that ''s all I can afford and they still told me no. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], after calling, harassing and leaving 15 voicemails on my phone, I decided to pick up. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the representative told me that I need to make a payment or my name was going to go to collections. After I told him that I could not afford to make a payment, he rudely said, " If you work full-time, I do n''t understand why you ca n''t make a payment. You must make only {$200.00} huh? '''' Navient harasses me [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have blocked over 14 different phone numbers from them, but they still call me from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. It ''s exhausting. All I want is for payments to be lower, that ''s it. They refuse to work with me and I will be grateful if I can get any help. Thank you.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loan payments jumped from $80.00 to $190.00. my');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3578,'03/20/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I found out about late payments on my loans '' histories, and called to challenge their legitimacy. I spoke with a woman named " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' ( ID [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) from Fedloan Customer Service, who advised me to file a Credit Dispute Form. I faxed this form directly to Fedloan, and uploaded an additional Goodwill Adjustment request online. Essentially, I pursued both formal, and informal, requests for Fedloan to " hear me out '''', as I did not believe they failed to provide any proper notice. " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' reviewed my account and disclosed the address that one letter, over the lifetime of my 20+ late payments, was not listed. In addition, the email address was invalid, and no records of a phone call existed in regards to the late status of my account. 

Later in this complaint I will attach the PDFs of both the Dispute Form, and the Goodwill Request, the latter of which contains the record of my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Credit Report to verify the listing of the late accounts. These were submitted on XX/XX/2017, and I have not received any contact, via email, phone, or letter in regards to these claims. With this being day 31 since the dispute was filed, I would like to report Fedloan ''s inaction to the CFPB.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'a woman called me to file a credit Dispute Form. she faxed the form directly to Fedloan. she posted an additional Goodwill Adjustment');
