I am disputing any arrearages that SPS is now claiming from me because they have not addressed my past claim against [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Please see enclosed letter dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] wherein I have stated that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] capitalized our mortgage balance by {$170000.00} since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which outlines the basis of my claim. My past claim number with CFPB was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it was not resolved with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have substantiated these amounts with bank statements and escrow statements from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and submitted them to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. It was my understanding that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] submitted the documents to SPS when SPS assumed loan servicing of my loan in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. According to my records, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and SPS owed my mortgage account the amount of {$100000.00} for capitalization of erroneous amounts from payments not credited, excessive interest charged, and excessive escrow charges to the account. 
I have another dispute with SPS in that they have sent me a Cancellation of Debt Notice for {$210000.00} for the year XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have received a letter from SPS regarding [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on my loan for which I did not qualify and for which SPS granted the amount of {$71000.00} and not {$210000.00}. I have requested them to correct the debt forgiveness amount and so far I have no cooperation from them. 
Please see enclosed documents substantiating my claim against SPS. 
They have been submitted to your office in the form of a scan. 
I am requesting SPS to immediately correct the debt forgiveness form and to credit my mortgage account with the amount I am claiming since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when I first contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] regarding this matter. My former CFPB claim number was # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
Respectfully submitted, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','SELECT PORTFOLIO SERVICING, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a mortgage was signed with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and with SPS Loan Servicing Inc. my previous claim number with CFPB was [COM');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3581,'03/18/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Billing disputes','According to the Consumer Protection Federal Agency and the Department of Conciliation Services for Foreign Residents ( CARE ) there is a term of 5 working days to cancel a timeshare without penalization. I sent an email within the 5 days to have cancel with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This was done through a 3rd party. I have followed all suggestion since then and NO funds have been returned to me. A representative from the company spoke to me and an executive at CitiBank about the refund and was supposed to get back with us after the last conversation that was over a week ago and although CitiBank was unable to get back in touch with said company I am still held responsible for this bill although I have not been able to get any of the services that they promised without making additional payments even when the contract states that the service is a " free '''' service.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'a timeshare cancellation is a term of 5 working days. the company has not received any money from the company. the company has not received any of the services promised.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3582,'03/18/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','Years ago, I had phone service with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. While living in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], my account was charged for bills incurred by someone in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] according to conversations I had with customer service. The issue was never rectified. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reported that I owed {$440.00} ; which I dispute because I do not owe them. They reported it to the credit reporting agencies. I had disputed there, and they did not to change it citing that the account was in my name. It sat for years in my credit report, and I could not get it removed. My score just went down 11 points because [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] just reported the account as a new account again as they have done in the past. This is deceptive. Please see attached. I got the alert from Experian yesterday. Had I not have this credit monitoring account with Experian, I would not even be aware. Please help me.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'account was charged for bills incurred by someone in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. account was charged for bills incurred by someone in [COMPTE_AN');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3583,'03/17/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','I was in the process of putting my student loans in In-School Forbearance. During that period my student loans went into 90 days late payment. I did not realize this! I would have paid during that time, but received no notification at the address I lived. I did not know. I have disputed this twice with my student loan provider and with the credit bureaus, but they have not taken it off of my credit report. It has negatively impacted my credit, but they have made no adjustment or had no mercy though I have no previous record of late payment, or any following this incident. Thank you for your help!','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'i was in the process of putting my student loans in In-school Forbearance. my student loans went into 90 days late payment. I did not realize this!');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3584,'03/17/2017','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Making/receiving payments, sending money','On Friday XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I received a credit from Wells Fargo of {$200.00} on Account # that ended up being a temporary account and then I received a bill for another account # supposedly new account. I pulled my last bill and it had a different Account which was my original account number. 
I walked to the Wells Fargo downtown [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], NC on Monday XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Personal Banker called Wells Fargo Home Projects and spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] around [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] He advised that Wells Fargo had closed my original account because they wanted to remove the Visa portion of the credit card and opened a temporary account in error as my Home Project account. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] could see my credit and they advised it would be moved to my new account. 
Since my newest bill was for {$340.00}, I deducted {$200.00} credit and did not pay late fee of {$27.00} as I was not late and Wells Fargo put on temporary account. I should not be penalized, so I mailed a check for {$120.00} as that was the balance and put credit remittance, bill remittance, explanation of deducting {$27.00} late fee and copy of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s card. 
I then received a letter dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from Wells Fargo explaining a Temporary account was generated in error and it appeared everything was straightened out. However, I received a call at my work on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] saying they want to know how I plan to clear up my past due balance. I was so upset as I had already spent an hour personal time from my work the first time straightening this out. I told them I would have to get all my documents from home and return call as the person was saying I missed a payment and I knew I had n''t. 
I pulled all my history for a little over a year and I have paid every payment a few days to a week before the due date and have been paying extra and I usually pay at a Wells Fargo. My regular payment was {$160.00} and in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I paid 2 months ( {$320.00} ) and then after that all except for 2 months I paid {$200.00} a month. 
I now have next months bill saying I am past due {$40.00} and there is a {$37.00} late fee. I would gladly pay if I was truly was late and truly past due however if you take {$120.00} + {$200.00} credit = {$320.00}. My newest bill even shows payments {$320.00} other credit {$27.00} late fee so this should have been settled. However when I look on the right side of my bill it say past due {$40.00} and {$37.00} Fees charged. 
I was told my case has been turned over to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it may take up to 10 days, in the mean time my account gets more and more complicated. 
I have been paying extra to resolve this account and now I feel they are also messing with my credit as they can report me as late but I am not.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'I received a credit from Wells Fargo of $200.00 on Account # that ended up being a temporary account. I received a bill for another account #');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3585,'03/17/2017','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','On XX/XX/2016, at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] p.m. I submitted a Request for Mortgage Assistance to Select Portfolio Servicing for a HAMP Tier II loan modification. To date I have not received any correspondence from SPS regarding the status of my loan modification. For over 3 months, my loan application was not processed in a timely manner, if at all. This is a direct violation of the Federal Mortgage Servicing, National Mortgage Settlement and a direct violation of the California Homeowners Bill Of Rights. I was not given due process as my application was never reviewed and the results were never communicated to me.','SELECT PORTFOLIO SERVICING, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a request for mortgage assistance to select portfolio Servicing was submitted. the loan modification was not processed in a timely manner. the results were never communicated to me.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3586,'03/17/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Can''t repay my loan','I graduated from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2015 Navient was after me the entire time for payments while i was a student im sure the interest was piling up ... .i contacted them sent in payment stubs and gave my info to get on the income driven repayment plan ... .they said it would be {$0.00} but said if anything change let them know ... .they still sent emails to me saying payments were due even though i was suppose to be on this plan ... .now im in default and i was suppose to be on that plan ... .i did what they ask now i cant qualify for any grants because of this default and i want to return to school ... .i thought as long as you were a student you didnt have to make student loan payments ... .what do i do i got a lot of emails from them with all kinds of different payment amounts that were due ... .i tried attaching them but no luck give me an address and i will happily print them out and mail them or fax them in','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'i graduated from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2015 Navient. contacted them sent in payment stubs and gave my info to get on the income');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3587,'03/17/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I recently pulled a free credit report from freecreditscore.com. It outlined some erroneous information was previously deleted from my consumer report. It is the same game that that these credit bureaus continue to play. It is fraud and some one needs to actually stop them dead in there tracks! It has a very negative effect on my score and personal life and future endeavors. They continue to sell the derivatives over and over, which effects the sovereignty of the people of this nation and have no honor or accountability in dong so!','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'free credit report outlined some erroneous information was previously deleted from my consumer report. it has a very negative effect on my score and personal life and future endeavors ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3588,'03/16/2017','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Using a debit or ATM card','I was given a Visa debit card as a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] gift by my employees. When I attempted to use the card I learned that it had a zero balance. Following a little more investigation I learned that several transactions had been made using the card number and had exhausted the cash value. I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but could not talk to a person. I left my phone number with a request for a phone call I received nothing. A few days later I called again but was still unable to speak with anyone so I faxed all the information to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017. I was assigned [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] case numbers [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] via a letter sent to me on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017. Yesterday a representative called my home phone and left a message stating that I needed to start the whole process over. I called again today and waited on the phone line for 30 minutes just hoping that I would get to talk with a real person. No luck. Please help me.','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,2.0,'a representative called me and left a message stating that I needed to start the whole process over. a representative called me and left a message stating that I needed to');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3589,'03/16/2017','Consumer Loan','Pawn loan','Charged fees or interest I didn''t expect','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Home Loans Manager Vice President NMLS ID : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], WA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Direct [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Fax [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Dear [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : RE : loan no : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] At the end of year XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I misled to refinance when I inquired home equity of my condo and paid appraisal fee and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] did not disclose a hidden fee of condo questionnaire fee at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] branch and I kept getting statements from BOA about closing fee about {$4000.00} more than {$1100.00} [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] promised on day one and I was really disappointed to cancel the loan. I complained to you on the phone and you understood that and told me you did not have power to make a decision. Would you please direct me to the decision maker? After that, when ever I followed up by email or phone, you never responded. I am disappointed because I should not be responsible for appraisal fee at all when I clearly requested home equity without any cost and the hidden fee of condo questionnaire, {$330.00} was not disclosed clearly. It is obviously against TILA and CPA. 
To resolve the problem, I would appreciate your effort. 
I look forward to your reply and a resolution to my problem and will wait until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] before seeking help from a consumer protection agency or the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] consumer reporter or filing a claim to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] county bar association ''s consumer division. Please contact me at the above address or by phone at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
Sincerely, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'a buyer''s lawyer has been contacted by the lender''s office. the lender has been contacted by the consumer division. the lender has been contacted by the consumer');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3590,'03/16/2017','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I attended the University [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I applied for loans from this company for only one year. My requested loan amount from that time has ballooned to over {$60000.00} due to fraudulent applications that were completed in my name and my co-signer ''s names. Over the years, I have been harassed, lied to and threatened by this company. I ''m also one of the military veterans who was denied benefits that were supposed to be afforded to me while [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This company has tried to play my co-signer and myself against one another telling him that I committed fraud, which is in direct violation of FDC 807. False or misleading representations clause ( 7 ) " The false representation or implication that the consumer committed any crime or other conduct in order to disgrace the consumer ''''. They repeatedly told my dad to file fraud charges against me and me against my father. When myself and/or my father requested all of the documentation in my file, they would take 2-3 weeks to get the information to us. They also denied to respond to my father ''s lawyer because they did not want to be held responsible for breaking the law again as they would have had to have contact only with the lawyer. When I received the packet with all of the documentation from my file, the total amount verified by letters of disbursement, does not come close to the amount on the account. There was no paperwork for one of the accounts listed on my total account. I requested by letter that the account be removed, however it was not. After trying to work with Navient, I sent them a settlement letter with a check. They cashed the check, and denied the offer. The harassing phone calls have started again.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,4.0,'a company tried to play my co-signer and myself against each other. the company has repeatedly told my dad to file fraud charges against me and me against my father. the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3591,'03/16/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I do not owe such a debt this is a mistake my insurance paid this, remove this account listed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] FOR [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] INACCURATE DATA','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'i do not owe such a debt this is a mistake my insurance paid this, remove this account listed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] FOR [COM');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3592,'03/16/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Closing/Cancelling account','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2017 charges were declined on my Capital One Venture card. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2017 contacted Capital one and was told that the account was closed but had no explanation other than to say the card holder agreement allowed them to do this for business reasons. They stated that I should receive a notice in the mail soon. As of today, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I have not yet received this notice. What I did receive today is a notice from Kohl ''s indicating that my Kohl ''s credit card account was being closed. It just so happens that my Kohl ''s card is issued by Capital One. This notice states ... '''' The reason ( s ) for our decision is as follows. We have observed activity on a past or present Capital One account that is not consistent with our expectations of usage for personal, family, or household purposes. '''' We only use this card for personal, family, and household purposes so I have no idea what they are suggesting. They have never notified me of any issues in the past. We always pay our bill on time and in full. Capital One ''s own credit reporting indicates a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit score.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a notice from Kohl''s indicating my Kohl''s card was being closed. the notice states that my Kohl''s card is issued by Capital One.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3593,'03/15/2017','Bank account or service','Checking account','Deposits and withdrawals','My father deceased on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was appointed Personal Representative/Executor of his estate on or about [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. A review of his assets that a woman who maintain that she had been a care giver to my father was found on his PNC Checking Account. Further review and discovery revealed that the joint account had been created through repeated forgery of his signature. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] issued a refund check to his estate on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The woman then took the check from his mailbox unit. Signed the check, once again forging his name to deposit and cash the check in another PNC Account. PNC Bank was altered to the matter, and sent proof of the forgery [ See Attached [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] check in the amount of {$490.00} dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ]. However, they are refusing to take any action as other evidencing documents obtained show that a PNC Bank Manager may have assisted the woman in creating the fraudulent the account. Therefore, an investigation is being requested in this matter. With a forensic handwriting analysis report obtain, available for investigation review.','PNC Bank N.A.',2.0,4.0,'a woman who maintains she had been a care giver to my father was found on his PNC Checking Account. a review of his assets found that a woman');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3594,'03/15/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Billing disputes','Was not receiving statements in the mail. Payments were being sent with statement. I had called to see about reversing late charges and offered to pay the initial purchases but was told only half could be taken off. I have since paid the balance in full including all the late fees and fincance charges and interest. I want it cleared from my credit history.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'payment was sent with statement. was not receiving statements in the mail.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3595,'03/15/2017','Debt collection','Medical','Disclosure verification of debt','I just viewed my credit report and there is an account from a company I have never heard of. This company never contacted me, by first class mail or certified mail. 

This company name is Credit Control Corp from XX/XX/2011. I have never did business with this company. I never received any letters from this company. They just put an account on my credit reports and left it. No right to dispute the validity of the alleged debt letter was sent. They have violated the FDCPA and the FCRA. 

If I did n''t check my credit today, I would have never knew that this account was on there. This company has violated the FDCPA and the FCRA. 

I want this account removed from my credit reports. I have never heard of Credit Control Corp, Acct # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','R & B Corporation of Virginia',2.0,2.0,'credit control has never received letters from this company. they put an account on my credit reports and left it. no right to dispute the validity of the alleged debt letter was sent ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3596,'03/15/2017','Bank account or service','Checking account','Deposits and withdrawals','A counterfeit check ( written XX/XX/2016 and cashed XX/XX/2016 made payable to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the amount of {$1300.00} - A copy will be attached ), using our account number and routing number was created, cashed and deposited at an unknown branch of Wells Fargo Bank. We have contacted a local police detective who has left messages to investigate this incident that have not been returned. This check shut our main account down and then we subsequently had an internal thief in our office take FULL advantage of our account being mandated to be shut down. We have reached out to Wells Fargo MANY times and they are ignoring us and continue to recuse themselves from having to abide by laws ( that i hope you enforce ). They will not tell us which branch it was cashed at so we can get a search warranty from the detective we are working with. We are VERY upset that a BIG bank thinks they are above the law and we are NEVER going to accept that answer. Wells Fargo is the bank that made us aware that we are victims of fraud and then disappeared. They also initially reimbursed us for our lost money ( due to a KNOWN false, illegal, not cool, dishonest, check ) and then took back the money and claimed they were innocent and never even cashed the check ( which they actually told the detective that ). I promise you that every institution we contact about this situation will be held to doing their job. We are NOT going away! We firmly believe this was an inside job at Wells Fargo and they do not want the bad publicity and that is not going to deter us.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'a counterfeit check was created, cashed and deposited at an unknown branch of Wells Fargo Bank. the bank made us aware that we are victims of fraud and then disappeared ');
