INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3599,'03/14/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','Transunion is required by FCRA to report accurate and complete information on my credit report or delete reporting the inaccurate items after investigation.VA DEPT SOCIAL SVS DCSE, ACCOUNT NO. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ... .WAS reporting an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance owed for 5 years 7 months after it was paid until this week ... ... for these 5 plus years it was false and damaging to me, entitling me to seek court redress against the furnisher.Transunion has allowed the furnisher to update the record partially and not completely.Transunion allowed the furnisher to backdate their error, to hide the fact of the injury to me to allow the furnisher to say in writing that the error was corrected in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] instead of last week.THE DATE OF LAST REPORTING MUST SAY [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] NOT XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].ITS TRUE THE FURNISHER CORRECTED THE BALANCE TO [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] BUT THAT SHOULD HAVE BEEN DONE 5 YEARS AGO.TRANSUNION AND THE FURNISHER HAVE PUBLISHED THAT THE CORRECTION WAS MADE IN [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] WHICH IS FALSE INFORMATION. 
