ncluded on the loan modification papers. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] tells me I will have to write a letter to the Bankruptcy department but send to his attention regarding my credits not showing. I asked why do I have to write ANOTHER letter when I have been waiting since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for these credits to appear and for Bayview to rectify this entire mess. I said I have written 3 letters regarding my credits as it is. I asked if I could please talk to the bankruptcy department. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said he can not put me through to that department but that we have time and sarcastically ( as he usually is! ) said you said that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said the foreclosure is on hold, did n''t you? Why do n''t you have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] call me ( this is the realtor that I was trying to see about selling my home that said he would help me with my loan modification to make sure it goes smooth, he would have to charge me [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and took a check for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from me - all he has done is had me sign a paper stating I am allowing him to talk to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and has called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] about three times - NOT HAPPY WITH " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''''. continued on # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of this form on " My Information ''''','BAYVIEW LOAN SERVICING, LLC',2.0,2.0,'CFPB approved loan adjustment agreement. CFPB''s [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ');
