INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3611,'03/11/2017','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','On today, Friday, XX/XX/2017. I went into the 5/3 bank to open myself a bank account. I bought in my two paychecks. At first I was told by the representative that I could not cash the checks because the signature from the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], my boss, looked different. So, I called the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Then, I was told by your representative that because I called from my cellular phone it could not be used as a verification. So, I had them talk directly to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from the bank phone. 
I was simply just trying to open a basic account. I am now working a very good job. I need a bank account. My son [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] need direct deposit. I need a bank account. I am thinking, wow, finally my life is coming together. But, then, not only did your mean, disrespectful, harassing, and bullying representative hold one of MY checks and refuse to return it, but said that I would be opening two accounts that would incur ME fees. And, when I refused and said I simply wanted a basic account, I was told that it was too late because the paper work was already done and I was n''t getting my check back. I could have ranted and raved, but in public, that would have been distasteful, and I was n''t going to take a chance on being escorted out by security. This person had both MY checks. I decided to contact 5/3 corporate, because I want this matter solved. I have decided that I want to change banks. After this incident, I do n''t think 5/3 is for me. I would like all my money back. Also, if there is a problem handling this matter then my Attorney will contact you. I am outraged. I am really outraged, but I am also trying to hold my disposition. Let ''s try to resolve this matter as quietly and as quickly as possible. Please contact me at the email or number noted above. Also, as far as the representative is concerned I am hoping that some sort of discipline would suffice. I refuse to allow my sons [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to be handled by your bank. He would probably never receive his [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] waiting on the HIS funds to be released.','FIFTH THIRD FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a representative of 5/3 corporate said that he would open a bank account. he said that he would open two accounts that would incur ME fees. he said');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3612,'03/11/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Customer service / Customer relations','I spoke with Lowes Credit [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].2017 about raising my credit limit to {$1000.00}. I asked them to run a soft inquiry only because I am applying for a mortgage on Monday and do not want any hard inquiries to affect my credit score. I specifically asked for only A SOFT INQUIRY AND TOLD THEM NOT TO RUN A HARD INQUIRY. My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] score was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2017. 
