INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3625,'03/08/2017','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','My mortgage loan was sold by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to Carrington Mortgage Service LLC in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I never got any statements from Carrington Mortgage until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When I talk to them and I have done so about 10 times they tell me fax us a letter that you want your statements as you had a Bankruptcy discharge in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and we Can Not send anything. I told them I never had any issues with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they advised me your are we Carrington now and we have different rules. I just want my past [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statements from them so I cab Refi my house with someone else. also my credit union fax them a Verification of loan so I can Refi and they do n''t want to answer that either. Carrington Mortgage should NOT be in business and checking the BBB they have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] active complains due to the way they do business.','CARRINGTON MORTGAGE SERVICES, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a mortgage loan was sold by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to Carrington Mortgage Service LLC. I never got any statements from Carrington until [COMPTE');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3626,'03/08/2017','Mortgage','Home equity loan or line of credit','Credit decision / Underwriting','I ''m applying for HELOC. The bank gave me three reasons why I was not approved. I satisfied all the reasons and they are still giving me the run around. The last time I applied for a loan it took them 5-6 months to approve and only after I reached out to this office.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',8.0,8.0,'the bank gave me three reasons why I was not approved. the last time I applied for a loan it took them 5-6 months to approve.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3627,'03/07/2017','Debt collection','Medical','Disclosure verification of debt','Central Financial Control did not give proper notice either in writing nor phone call before reporting this to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CRA ''s. I ''ve been making monthly payment and had no idea this account was in collections. The hospital itself did n''t notify me when making my monthly payment that this account was in collections. The way I found out was when making my monthly payments in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I see my FICO score drop [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] point. I then pulled my credit reports from the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reporting agencies which showed a collection from Central Financial Control ( SYNDICATED OFFICE SYSTEMS ). My next step was to send a validation letter since I had no idea why this account was in collections. The validation they sent me was a itemized statement not a physical contract between Central Financial Control and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].I feel central financial control is practicing in unfair collection practices by not giving proper notice. It takes a long time to reach an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] score on your credit and for them to knock it down [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] point is unfair. I feel [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is a wonderful hospital but their BILLING is unacceptable.','TENET HEALTHCARE CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'central financial control did not give proper notice before reporting this to the CRA. the hospital did not notify me when making my monthly payments. the validation letter was sent because I had no');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3628,'03/07/2017','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Disclosure verification of debt','We moved out of our apartment in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. We left the apartment immaculate, even cleaning behind the oven and vacuuming our way out of the apartment. 

Several weeks later the apartment management presented us with a bill for "repairs" that was full of mistakes and most of the items included were false and/or in violation of the Texas Property Code. In other words, almost all the charges were for things we either didn''t owe or were for things that they could not charge for by law.

We attempted to resolve with the apartment management, but they refused to remove the wrong / illegal items. Instead they sent it to collections.

This is causing us serious financial and emotional distress. We are in the process of closing on a house and the closing is held up because of the disputed collection on our credit report. Additionally, this is causing us to incur higher interest rates and fees and will cost us thousands of dollars.

The collections agency filed a collection on our credit reports. We have attempted to resolve via the proper channels:

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]: we sent letters to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureaus per the FCRA to dispute the information and request them to validate the data. All [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] responded that they investigated and that the creditor says it was valid. When called to discuss, the credit bureaus said "you need to have the collection agency remove. We just ask them if it is valid."

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]: we sent a letter to the collection agency per the FCRA and FDCPA asking them to validate the data. They replied that the creditor said it was valid and sent us copies of the lease and the form showing the illegal/wrong charges. They provided no proof.

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]: we sent a letter to the collection agency per the FCRA and FDCPA stating that what they provided was not proof. It also clearly stated what was incorrect or illegally reported, and requested they remove the improper charges and remove the collection from my credit reports. They replied on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that the creditor contends the charges were valid and resent the same information from their previous letter. No proof was supplied.

XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]: we sent a letter to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureaus per the FCRA to inform them that we asked the collection agency to validate the debt and remove if incorrect, and that the collection agency could not do this. We requested they remove the collection or we would file a complaint with the FTC and/or pursue legal action.','ProCollect, Inc',2.0,2.0,'apartment management refused to remove wrong / illegal items. they sent it to collections. this is causing us serious financial and emotional distress.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3629,'03/07/2017','Debt collection','I do not know','Taking/threatening an illegal action','A Debt Collector called ''National Judgement Recovery Center , L.P '' has levied several of my accounts including my children ''s checking and savings. However the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a debt is not mine, it belongs to another person with a similar name ( except that I am a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. ). The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was rendered in county where I currently reside in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and I was not a resident of this county until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and did not have any financial dealings in this county prior to moving here. This has caused me great distress, as I am not able to pay my bills or go to my doctors appointments.','National Judgment Recovery Center, L.P.',2.0,2.0,'a debt collector called ''National Judgement Recovery Center, L.P'' has levied several of my accounts including my children''s checking and savings. the [');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3630,'03/07/2017','Bank account or service','Checking account','Problems caused by my funds being low','We checked our account today to find that it was OverDrafted after PNC decided to submit ODF fees into our account before processing our deposit that was made Saturday night and did n''t process until Monday evening. 

We called them to try and get them to reverse it and they advised our account does n''t qualify for that. Mainly because something like this happened back in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they were nice enough to do so then. 

I asked the rep how you qualify and he advised that they do n''t have a set time frame for when you would or if you would again. 

I do n''t know what else there is to do, it seems like PNC does n''t care about their customers or the fact that their Virtual Wallet does n''t update or process in real time. 

It does n''t even keep a running balance when certain transactions process.','PNC Bank N.A.',2.0,2.0,'we checked our account today to find that it was OverDrafted. we called them to try and get them to reverse it and they advised our account doesn''t qualify');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3631,'03/07/2017','Mortgage','VA mortgage','Application, originator, mortgage broker','In the process for applying for a mortgage loan, USAA pre-filled items in the loan disclosure packet that were factually inaccurate and material to the process. After four ( 4 ) requests to update the information, they simply said they would take care of it, but the debt to loan ratio they quoted when denying the mortgage loan means they did not actually update the packet with accurate information. 
Furthermore, when they called stating that the loan was denied, I asked what information the underwriter used ( because the ratio they quoted was not possible under multiple scenarios ). They refused to respond and simply said that there was an appeals process, but appeals " always get denied anyway. '''' Following the call, I logged-in to our USAA account and noticed they had already deleted all application information. 
I reached out to the loan processors '' management team, who stated they would look into it and get back to me within 1 business day. Two ( 2 ) weeks later, I contacted them again, and a third time a few days later, but have received no response to date. 
It is clear that USAA ''s processes and lack of communication allowed factually inaccurate information to go to the underwriter, and their team did not allow for any further communication.','UNITED SERVICES AUTOMOBILE ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'the information was not updated with accurate information. the underwriters''management team'' refused to respond.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3632,'03/07/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Can''t repay my loan','I have Federal and Private Student Loans I repeatedly have been given wrong and different info depending on who you talk to. 
