I get different info every single time I call. 
Can anyone help? 
Tonight i spent 2 1/2 hours on the phone, they kept putting me on hold for 5 minutes, transferring me to different dept ''s. They told me the person who changed the address this week was in the " Back Office Team '''' and they do n''t take phone calls. 
They have created multiple obstacles. 
Everything that I believed was taken care of by the " Supervisor '''' was not taken care of and they made matters worse. 
Can I get any portion of this loan forgiven by the Dept. of Education? 
Thank You [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'i have federal and private student loans I repeatedly have been given wrong info. I needed to release my cosigner as she has [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3633,'03/06/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I had a case of credit fraud in 2015 on several accounts and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is the only company that will not remove the report from my credit. I have sent them all of the information that I have available and that was not enough for them, but was ample for all other companies.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a case of credit fraud in 2015 was reported on several accounts. the report was not enough for the company.');
