INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3638,'03/05/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with my lender or servicer','A third party had called to consolidate my student loans Fedloan Help, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], CA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Email : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
They said my loans would be forgiven after 10 year making a payment of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] per month. I had them set up taking the payments out of my checking account starting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
I receive\d a notice [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating my I needed to start making payments. I called the Fed loans discovering there has not been any payment made to my loan. I called Fedloan help and they informed me that they collect the money for a year then start making payments. I told them that I wanted to discontinue there assistance and will pay my loan back myself. They told me I would receive a refund. Soon I received this e-mail. 

Refund Hold Letter Hello, This letter is to advise you that your refund is approved ; however your refund is on hold temporarily. 
Unfortunately all outgoing refunds will have a 15 to 30 day delay due to lack of funds and donations to the organization. Upon receiving our next round of funding, any refund that we are holding will be issued immediately to the address we have on file. 
We apologize for the delay and we appreciate your understanding in this matter. Thank you again for your continued support in our organization and we look forward to resolving this temporary issue as soon as possible. 
Best Regards. 
Fedloan Help Team','Fedloan Help',2.0,2.0,'a third party called to consolidate my student loans Fedloan Help, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], CA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3639,'03/04/2017','Consumer Loan','Installment loan','Shopping for a loan or lease','Hi. I used [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to find the best rate for a personal loan to make some repairs on my home. Netcredit was one of the first people to contact me so I started an application with them. And regret every second of it. I have contacted them several times cancel the application because when you get to the end of the application it asks for your user name and bank password. In this day and age I am not confortable with that especially when the fine print says that the third party agency is my accounts POA and they can monitor and access my accounts anytime. I let them know they can call to my bank and get the records straight from them or I can fax them. I had a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and now its a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Who gives someone with that score 65 % interest rate on a loan? Let alone a non authorized hard inquiry. These car title loans and high interest loans should be shutdown because they are all profit base to the company and put strain on the borrower. I am not going to stop here with this issue. I will be writing several state officials and local government in my state to stop this robbery that is allowed to happen everyday. The only reason I am so adamant about this is a couple years ago my credit was n''t so good and I had to take a title loan. I almost lost my car and job trying to pay the loan back. I had to take money out of my 401k to pay off the amount. I payed it off in 1 year and none of the history on the account shows in my credit report. The Netcredit acoount # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was never authorized to go through and should have never been a hard inquiry because I did not agree with their terms for the loan and they refused to call my bank saying the only way to complete the loan is to put your bank login and password and pray. Please if there is anything on my end that can speed this process up just let me know and I will make sure it ''s taken care of within 24hrs. Thank you and I hppe we can resolve this.','ENOVA INTERNATIONAL, INC.',2.0,2.0,'netcredit was one of the first people to contact me so I started an application with them. when you get to the end of the application it asks for your user name and bank password');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3640,'03/04/2017','Debt collection','Medical','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','Debt was paid by the department of veterans affairs, I ''m on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the VA set up and paid for this, they need to get in touch with the department of veterans affairs.','Midstate Collection Solutions, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'the VA set up and paid for the debt. the department of veterans affairs needs to get in touch with the department.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3641,'03/04/2017','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Application, originator, mortgage broker','My wife just received a promotion w/the Feds to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], DC. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( relocation dept for FDIC ) performed a pre-qualification app on Friday XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], to find out that our current mortgage holder, Wells Fargo Mortgage, showed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] lates on our credit report. The pre-qual process stopped by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] until we call WF to see what has happened. Calling into the mortgage company we find that a few years back my wife and I did a remodification loan to our mortgage - as a matter fact back to back contracts until we could get refinanced. WF says that remod ( lower note from 1700/mth down to $ 1100/mth - a contracted lower note ) each month showed less than the normal mortgage, therefore every payment is showing late. 
We were not informed that the lower payment would reflect as less-than the original monthly payment - netting late payments. AGAIN NO ONE EXPLAINED THAT THIS WOULD HAPPENED. With this in mind, we feel that we were not properly informed about the negative side to a remodification loan ( unless this is an isolated Wells Fargo Mortgage rule only. ) We have sent a letter to WF Written Correspendence Unit. We have also sent dispute into each credit report agency, so we can clear these [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] lates from our credit reports. So in the meantime [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] can not go any further therefore interrupting the Gov''t employee relocation program','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] performed pre-qualification app on friday. it stopped by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] until we call');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3642,'03/03/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','I originally disputed this on XX/XX/2016 case number : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and no resolution. It ''s been reporting on my reports stating reinvestigation since then. Now the same credit card is showing up as a collection account on all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bureaus. It is now listed as Midland credit management. I submitted a copy of my identity theft affidavit with police reports. This is really affecting my livelihood and also my children ''s.','ENCORE CAPITAL GROUP INC.',2.0,2.0,'a credit card is now listed as Midland credit management. it is listed as a collection account on all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bureaus.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3643,'03/03/2017','Consumer Loan','Installment loan','Problems when you are unable to pay','In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I tool out a payday loan with Check n go, some time has passed and I was making bi weekly payments fell on hard times and was not able to make the payment, the last time check n go attempted to collect a payment was XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which was returned. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Check n go out out of the blue without contacting me or giving them authorization took [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] out of my bank account making it negative and resulting in overdraft fees from my bank. How can they skip XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and not attempt but on a random thurs ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) not even a fri as scheduled randomly attempt without even contacting me? I am well aware of the consequences of defaulting on my loan [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit hit, lawsuit ) but if they had not received payment in over 2 months how legally can they just try a random day to withdraw the money? I believe this is illegal and should be looked into!','CNG FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'check n go attempted to collect a payment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the last time check n go attempted');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3644,'03/03/2017','Debt collection','Medical','Disclosure verification of debt','I was challenging a bill with my insurance company, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and had an escalation in place. I received a phone call stating that the " escalation had been resolved '''' and the company was sending me a letter of resolution. However, I never received the letter, therefore I was unaware the insurance company had decided that my request to dismiss the charge was denied. I received no further communication from the company regarding this debt until I got a letter from a collections company 6 months later. I have contacted the insurance company about this issue and even though the representative confirmed that the resolution department had the wrong address on file, the billing department wo n''t pull my debt from collects until I pay. All I want is my bill removed from collections, so it does n''t negatively affect my credit.','The Receivable Management Services Corporation',2.0,2.0,'insurance company sent me a letter of resolution to escalate my debt. the company had a wrong address on file, but the billing department didn''t pull my debt from');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3645,'03/03/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Closing/Cancelling account','American Express cancelled my card with them after being a member since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The representative I spoke to because of a return payment ( 2 ) times stated I needed a review and had to send documents in to prove my income. I had fraud on my personal checking account and it caused two payments to be returned I was in contact with American Express, but due to the fact that I am a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] elderly man, this representative abused his authority and took this review to levels not necessary, he was rude, and had his mind made up about closing the account before I even sent the required information, I feel discriminated against and I lost a very important card valuable to my business operation. Now since canceling the card I receive collection calls a week before the due date everyday automatic call telling me my card is past due, I made a payment today the due date and had to speak to a representative because my payment could not be done automatically because they placed the account in collections even though the due date was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and not past due. For the past 6 days I have received calls in the early am and late at night outside the collection law boundaries and the account is not late. I feel that American Express has egregiously treated me and discriminated against me because I am a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] elderly male.','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'a representative who has been a member since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has abused his authority. he was rude and took this review to levels not');
