never made any payments to these entities in those years. I am unclear as to the happenings in sale, apparently it went back to the bank on sale date [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and then sold [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to us bank trust na, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Dates here to conflict. I believe sale postponements and other actions taken were attempt to get me to walk away from my home so abandonment could be claimed, or time needed to establish another scheme. I still do not know what or which bank actually existed when, what got paid who got paid. It is obvious that Chase never did have a proper or legal title, faked a loan which I can prove, is in collaboration somehow with successors and assigns','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'jpmorgan chase appointed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to foreclose. then [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is grantor with');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3680,'02/22/2017','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I originally took out a loan for my my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] degree through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. For reasons unknown my loan was sold to Navient, and now my interest rate is variable, and 11.5 %. I can not get any answers about how this change happened. In addition, when I have tried to work with Navient to get forbearance, they have repeatedly played games with me, made commitments they did not keep, and negatively impacted my credit.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'my loan was sold to Navient, and now my interest rate is variable. when I have tried to work with Navient to get forbearance, they have repeatedly played games with');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3681,'02/22/2017','Debt collection','Medical','Disclosure verification of debt','I never received any notice to verify I owed or am responsible for this debt. I noticed this debt was in collections from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] only once I reviewed my credit report on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I contacted the debt collector via phone, requesting verification and notifying the debt collector that I dispute all claims that I owed the debt reported on my credit report. The collector viciously argued with me and hung up on me twice, the first time when I was disputing the claim that owed the debt and the second time when I called to inquire the contact information of the original creditor and claims. The debt collector mentioned I did not receive bills or other information in regards to the debt because they did not have my information. The only information that the collector had was my name, date of birth, and SSN, which makes no sense and is not sufficient proof that I owe this debt or why I had not been contacted in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], if I am so responsible for this debt. I have been denied of my rights to promptly, adequately, and sufficiently defend myself from such illegal, and inappropriate tactics used by this debt collector in recovering a debt that does not prove to be mine. I had never received any notice of this debt prior to me investigating my credit report on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and is when I found this debt on my credit report. I have never received any communications in regards to this debt, which has been illegally reported and misrepresents any debt in which I owe or am responsible for.','Road Runner Collection Services, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'debt collector argued with me and hung up on me twice. he contacted me and asked me to verify I owed the debt. he contacted me via phone');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3682,'02/22/2017','Debt collection','Credit card','Communication tactics','I owe a past due to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the credit collector, Credit Management, calls me 2 to three times a day. They r calling my cell number and never have verified if I am the correct person they seek.','The CMI Group, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'credit collector calls me 2 to 3 times a day. they never have verified if I am the correct person they seek.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3683,'02/22/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','Out of nowhere American Express added [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts to my credit history, proof attached in original dispute/ complaint. My request was that they remove [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of these accounts as I did not personally guarantee them. They stated I did but to date have not sent me signed original applications for this supposed credit. All I want is original applications for credit showing that I personally guaranteed them, which I know they ca n''t provide. That said I also want these accounts removed from credit history.','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'American Express added [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts to my credit history. the accounts were proof attached in original dispute/ complaint.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3684,'02/21/2017','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','On numerous occasions I have had to escalate my calls several times to get any assistance with getting Bank of America to release my insurance funds held on a property claim. Not only am I having to deal with the stress of the tornado damage destroying my home, insurance process and rebuilding process, but when it comes to getting my money release to pay for repairs I should not have to be put threw the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] degree and have to call back a minimum of 3 times to get a payment released. I am told it only takes 2-3 days to get a check issued, but I have yet to get a check within a min. of 3weeks. 
In short, I can not solve the problem myself, and I do not want to continue to be provided the unacceptable service I have been provided. 
The last request for a draw on funds to pay the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was submitted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and no check has been issued and the bank could not give me a reason why. I need to bank to release the remaining funds being held so that I can finish rebuilding my home.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'a check issued for me has not been issued within a min. of 3 weeks. the last request for a draw on funds to pay was submitted. the bank could not');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3685,'02/21/2017','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','Purchased a home in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for {$390000.00} the height of the inflated prices of the housing boom after taking a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] job. So, moved myself from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with no assistance from the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Left [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and moved to private industry for 5 years. Rejoined [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to move to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with no housing assistance. Was able to get the house rented but it did not cover the mortgage costs. The market value never returned to the amount that I paid for the house. 
About [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or so, the huge retaining wall needed a {$20000.00} repair which we could not afford, so we were unable to rent it any longer or sell it. So, we decided to try a short sell finally getting it sold for {$250000.00} in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. However, Ditech, the largest of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] company ''s holding the Mortgage would not allow a short sale to go through until I was 90 days past due. By the time the final transaction was completed, they were able to state that I was 6 months passed due, seriously degrading my credit rating. Also, they posted to the credit companies that the loan was closed, but not paid in full. 
1 ) Is there anything that can be done with my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] employer to force them to provide some financial assistance that was never provided? 
2 ) Is there anything that can be done to fix my credit history? 
Seems like the system is rigged against individuals.','Ditech Financial LLC',2.0,2.0,'a house in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was sold for $390000.00. the house was rented but it did not cover the mortgage costs');
