INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3701,'02/16/2017','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','My mortgage servicer, PNC Mortgage, has been, and continues, to charge me a 6 % interest rate. I have made numerous attempts for over one ( 1 ) year by contacting them both on the telephone and by submitting requests for mortgage modification. They refuse to address my requests. They refuse to provide reasons why my mortgage modifications requests are being denied. They also refuse to offer any assistance in resolving the HIGH interest rate. They do provide non-specific, vague answers. They do NOT have the correct information about my income and debts. They will be forcing me into possible bankruptcy, possible foreclosure and possible loss of my home.','PNC Bank N.A.',2.0,2.0,'mortgage servicer, PNC Mortgage, has been charged a 6 % interest rate. they refuse to address my requests, and refuse to provide reasons why my modifications requests are denied ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3702,'02/16/2017','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','Bank of Ametica knew, or should have known, the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Modified Deed of Trust was defective and, therefore, void and voidable. Bank of America failed to tell me of the circumstances surrounding the modification and the resulting Deed of Trust. Bank of America continued to accept monthly installment payments from me while failing to correct or otherwise mitigate the defective XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] modification including, but not limited to, offering a subsequent modification and informing me of the defects associated with the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] modification process and Deed of Trust. The first default occurred in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have not made a monthly installment under the terms of the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Deed of Trust since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which resulted in the first default on this account and mortgage. 
Furthermore, I have been granted a modification in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. However, Bank of America failed to inform me of this to date and have never offered any modification based on the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Appeals Report granting of a MHA HAMP TPP on appeal. I have never reapplied or applied for any modification since being granted MHA HAMP and directed to be placed in a MHA HAMP TPP, but Bank of America insists on making such misrepresentations to me and others just to mislead and deceive in support of their intention to wrongly and unlawfully separate me from my home and property through an improper nonjudicial foreclosure and foreclosure sale.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'Bank of Ametica knew, or should have known, the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Modified Deed of Trust was');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3703,'02/16/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Billing statement','I opened an account with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a Walmart credit card and made one large purchase in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2015. I called around the end of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/ beginning of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to say that I do n''t believe that I have received a bill. The person took my checking account info on the phone and ran the account and I set up auto pay. I thereafter found out that the checking account number that was entered was wrong and attempted to correct. I have made payments every month and have attached payment history.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'i opened an account with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a Walmart credit card. I made one large purchase in [COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3704,'02/16/2017','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','About 10 years ago I established a home equity line through Citibank. To get a reduced interest rate I linked a Citibank checking account to the line of equity. There were no service charges to be incurred for the checking account. Around [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016 the bank started taking out {$30.00} for monthly service charge. It took a lot of time and effort, but eventually the bank reversed six months worth of the service charges. However, they refused to give me back the {$30.00} that have been charged in the months previously. They had failed to send me my bank statements except you in the mail. They did send me my line of equity statements in the mail. I am requesting that the CFBP tell Citibank to give me back the {$30.00} for each month it was taken out of my checking account. I am thanking you in advance for your efforts on my behalf. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'Citibank started taking out $30.00 for monthly service charge. the bank reversed six months worth of service charges.');
