INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3706,'02/16/2017','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I have been working in getting a loan modification for over a year with Bay view. Going back and forth on getting documents to them with no responses from the Specialist they say are designated to my file. Recently, they asked for a documents ( a P & L ) which was provided to them within hours. I called to confirm receipt with the Asset Manager [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and unfortunately he was not available. Another Rude Representative within his department [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], took the call. When i asked whether they had received the document she said i had to speak with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and rudely and adamantly advised that i was wasting my time and the sale date of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/17 would not be stopped. When i asked her why, she just went on to say that because we provided the documents were provide 7 days prior to a sale date.. She even verified in her system that the documents were requested on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/17 and they were provided the same day. How can they do such a thing and pull my home from under me in that way? Request documents and then say no we cant help you? I need your help! I have a sale date approaching [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/17 next week Wednesday.','BAYVIEW LOAN SERVICING, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a loan modification is being made with a loan modification. the documents were provided to them within hours. the documents were provided 7 days prior to a sale date.');
