As a result of Freedom ''s actions we have lost 4 months of earnings on nearly {$5000.00} in retirement savings.','FREEDOM MORTGAGE COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'Freedom Mortgage withdrew $4900.00 from our escrow account for property taxes. we were scheduled to refinance on [COMPTE_ANON');
