INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3743,'02/07/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Credit line increase/decrease','I ''m Filing This Complaint Against Wells Fargo AFTER Being Denied A Third Time, I REPEAT A Third Time For A C.L.I. On A Card I ''ve Had For 3 Years. I ''ve Been A WF Customer For OVER 4 Years, My Card Began As A Secured Card, And I Was Told That When It Became UN-Secured, I Would Receive A Limit Increase, because My Payments Were Automated ; And It NEVER Happened. My Card Has Now Been UN-Secured For OVER A Year Now, And In The Time Since, I ''ve Gotten [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] OTHER Cards, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] With TWICE The Limit Of My WF Card, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Of Which Has A Limit 7x The Limit Of My WF Card. The Other Of Which Has Received [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Limit Increases AND Is Currently OVER THREE TIMES The Limit Of My WF Card. ONLY [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Of The Cards Has A Utilization Of More Than 30 %, And My WF Card Has Carried A [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Balance For Approximately 3 Months & Counted. I Also Purchased A Car with NO MONEY Down, NO INTEREST, NO PAYMENT For 60 Days AT 5 % APR. My Take Home In 2016 Exceeded My Expenses by Over {$1100.00} Monthly, And I ''ve NEVER Missed A Single Payment, On ANY Of My Accounts. Wells Fargo DOES NOT CARE ABOUT THEIR CUSTOMERS AT ALL. They Have ZERO INTEREST IN HELPING THEIR CUSTOMERS DEVELOP A FINANCIAL FOUNDATION, Retaining Current Customers OR Gaining Future Business. I Had EVERY Intention On Opening A Business Account With WF, But That Is NO MORE. I ONLY Bank w/ Wells Fargo Out Of SHEER Convenience, because Both Of My Little Sisters Have Accounts, And It ''s Easy To Transfer Funds. However, AS SOON AS I Restructure My Business, We Will ALL Be Moving Over To [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] BANK. WF Has THE WORST Customer Service I ''ve EVER Experienced, And Some Of The MOST ill-advised People I ''ve Ever Had The Dis-Pleasure Of Speaking With Inside Their Branches. I CAN NOT Wait To Change Banks.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'I''ve Been a WF Customer For 4 Years, My Card Began as a Secured Card, And I was Told That When It Became UN-');
