of this much money I would have never enrolled.I have paid into this loan for the past few years and the lender has not reduced the principal at all. I need to know why the school enrolled me into 3 years worth of schooling after only attending 1 semester? I need to know why am I being charged for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after only attending 1 semester? How does [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] give loans to a school with a copy of an old promissory note?','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,4.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was a newly single mom working a waitress job. he said this would cover everything');
