INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3813,'01/24/2017','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','At the time the loans were in repayment. Navient did not inform us regarding payment of the loans. In addition, the loans continued to grow due to interest. After a year of interest being added to the loan, we were notified that we needed to pay the accrued interest as well as late fees that were added to the unpaid months. As indicated earlier, we were not notified regarding the payments ( statements did not come to the home ) however we did receive the statement requesting the payment for the late fees and accrued interest. In addition, we have been in contact with Navient informing them that those payments are not possible and if we are able to obtain payment options. We were told we would receive the necessary paperwork however ; we have not gotten them. 

The loans were not paid for several years and as the person ( s ) responsible for the repayment we were not notified of the capitalized interest on the loans and late fees. In addition, the owners of the loans did not notify us about the possibility of sending the loans into default of options to resolve the payments for the loans.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',4.0,4.0,'the loans were not paid for several years. the owners of the loans did not notify us about the possibility of sending the loans into default of options.');
