The company this time is Weltman, Weinberg and Reis, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] OH [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','Weltman, Weinberg & Reis Co., L.P.A.',2.0,2.0,'debt collector has contacted third debt collector regarding a loan discharged in bankruptcy. debt collector has disputed claims and sent the letters to creditors. debt was discharged in 2012 and');
