INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3843,'01/19/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Can''t repay my loan','I was conned into consolidating my loans at a higher interest rate. I was not aware of the significance of this. My payback is much more than desired. Its a rip off.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',4.0,4.0,'i was conned into consolidating my loans at a higher interest rate. my payback is much more than desired.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3844,'01/19/2017','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Can''t repay my loan','We set up payment for interest payment only for one loan and paid over every month. The extra money paid to the loan was not applied to the principal, it was applied to the monthly payment. We also called to get the two loans consolidated so that the payment would be lower. They said that we could not do that. I also asked about reducing the payments and they also said that they could not do that either.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'we set up payment for interest payment only for one loan and paid over every month. the extra money paid to the loan was not applied to the principal, it was applied to the monthly payment');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3845,'01/19/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Can''t repay my loan','I am one of the people that was encourage to go into forbearance, but not told there was a limit to forbearance. My loan has ballooned to over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and I am being charged interest on the interest. And now, being told I have used up deferment and forbearance. I can not even begin to make this payment at this point, but only have hardship option which I do not meet. I am now being harassed with calls daily, and not helped by them at all. I have tried to consolidate but can not get anyone on the phone for this- I was given a phone and told to register but there it stopped. I do not know what else I can possibly do. Help! Please! I am being harassed.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'i am being harassed with calls daily, and not helped by them at all. I am being harassed with calls daily, and not helped by them at all.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3846,'01/19/2017','Bank account or service','Checking account','Deposits and withdrawals','I deposited a check for {$800.00} on XX/XX/2017, I did not know until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2017 that a charge-back was going to happen with that check on XX/XX/2017. Since I had used some of the {$800.00} against ( what I did not know was a negative balance ) On XX/XX/2017 I deposited {$800.00} in cash from my personal funds to cover everything that was pending, but an administrative hold was put on THAT {$800.00}. Overdraft fees were charged while transactions were pending instead of when they posted. That caused a domino effect for several other legitimate transactions to be returned unpaid and more OD fees. As a veteran-owned, and woman-owned Small Business solely supporting my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with my personal funds, this has caused irreparable, unfair, and unnecessary harm to me, my business, and my family. 
The action BB & T took, placing an Administrative Hold my small business checking account, was unfair. It may not be against Federal Reserve policies, but the reason I feel that this is a dire situation is because there are other scenarios that could easily happen that could very easily permanently cripple a small business like mine. Examples of other instances were this could happen : 1. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] does an account verification by making [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] small deposits ( approx. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] cents ) and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] withdrawal of those [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] amounts. That [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] small withdrawal can cause an avalanche of fees starting with just that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] small withdrawal costing {$36.00}. 
2. I stop for gasoline while on a trip to deliver a quilt. The gas station places a {$1.00} hold on my debit card. If I do not know that there has been a charge-back and I am in the negative with my available balance - that {$1.00} hold has just cost me {$36.00} and then the actual amount for the gas will cost me another {$36.00} plus everything else I have paid for with my debit card that day. 
Those are just two examples of how this practice can cause us harm.','BB&T CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a charge-back was going to happen on XX/XX/2017. a small business can be crippled by a charge-back. a small');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3847,'01/19/2017','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I have been paying my student loans regularly and recently decided to go back to graduate school for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I did not request or take out an additional loan for the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] program. I recently received a letter from the loan company that my loans were being deferred but if I " did not want this entitlement, I may request that this deferment period be removed. '''' Deferment means additional accrued interest while in non-payment status. I never requested a deferment, never authorized a deferment, and never wanted to defer my loans. Not sure how the company could just automatically do that without my knowledge, consent or permission.','ACS Education Services',2.0,2.0,'a loan company letter says my loans were being deferred. if I did not want this entitlement, I may request that this deferment period be removed.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3848,'01/19/2017','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','My mortgage is with Benchmark Mortgage. I purchased the home, approximately, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. School taxes came out XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I mailed a copy of taxes to the mortgage company. I received a call from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] tax collector stating that the taxes were not paid. When I called the mortgage company I was told there were comments in my account XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Taxes Paid - no check was ever dispersed. I am now going into the 4th week with trying to get these taxes paid. Benchmark Mortgage has {$2600.00} in my escrow and will not release the funds. I keep being told will be resolved within 24 hours. That never happens. I went back to the broker who represents Benchmark Mortgage and am being told they are working on it with a manager of the processing department. I ca n''t seem to get resolution and am risk of being sent to tax claim.','Ark-La-Tex Financial Services, LLC',2.0,2.0,'mortgage company has $2600.00 in my escrow and will not release funds. I am now going into the 4th week with trying to get these taxes paid.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3849,'01/19/2017','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','I applied for a trial modification and after succesfully completing my trial payments I had an issue where I could not get the final paperwork notarized because my id did not have my middle initial even thou original loan paperwork did not have it. I told my lender about issue I was having, I was told to go apply for a new id that had my middle initial on it. When I tried the dmv said I had outstanding tickets in a different state and had to clear that before I could get a new id issued. I informed my lender about this and was told not to worry, to just keep them informed and keep trying to get issue resolved. I called the state agency I was referred to to clear this issue and got issue resolved and just had to wait for the states to clear up the misunderstanding. When I called lender to give them an update they had already began foreclosure process when they said I didnt have to worry about that. My original loan paperwork did not have my middle name so I dont know why they could not isuue me paperwork without my middle name. Also The fact that I could not get a new id was not my fault as it turns out I had never set foot in other state claiming I owed tickets so I feel I should not be punished for it.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'dmv said I had outstanding tickets in a different state. id was not my middle name, so I didn''t know why they could not isuue');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3850,'01/19/2017','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','Today, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] people came to my home and refused to leave after I informed them they were trespassing and loitering. Not only did they not immediately remove themselves from my property, the adult male proceeded to walk around the exterior of my house and peek through my windows, a classic peeping tom move, and contined to jiggle my door knob trying to open my front door. These are the same [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] people who came to my home on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I told these [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to leave and not to come back. After the adult male told me I have to leave ( meaning I must vacate the property ), I told him if they believe they have a right to place themselves on this property to take the matter up in California [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Court, but to cease and desist bothering me about it by coming to my home harassing me. I have made it clear to these people I have nothing more to say to them and anything they may have to say to me is most appropriately said in court, not on my porch. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) Invasion of Privacy. 

Bank of America has caused all manner of folk to come onto my property since the unlawful recording of the Notice of Default of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as dual tracking is prohibited since the modification process has not yet been completed. And now I am being told to get out of my own home. 

All previously mentioned resolutions are desired and mandatory.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'a male walked around my house and peeked through windows. he told me to leave and not to come back. he told them to leave and not to come');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3851,'01/19/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Can''t repay my loan','I have been trying to re-new my income-based payment plan for almost six months. My old plan expired. Six months ago, I mailed in the application with a signed letter claiming my income as instructed. When I never heard back after a few weeks, I called them and they said that I had " checked off the wrong box '''' so my new plan could n''t be processed. They told me to check off the right box and re-send the plan in. But, when they transferred me to another department, that department said that I had checked off the right box, but that they needed better proof of income ( which I could n''t provide since I was an independent contractor at the time ). They said they could n''t help me further, and I was really confused. Flash forward to three months after that, I got a new job with an offer letter that I could use as proof of income. My loans were in deferment this whole time ( as they hand out deferments like candy because it only means more money for them ). I decided to try to fill out the online income based application on the federalstudentloans.gov website. I fill out the form then get a series of conflicting emails saying that I both was and was n''t approved, and that the next step should be to upload the proof of income. So i decide to upload the offer letter responding to the latest email, but it ''s been like crickets since then, I have n''t heard from them and this was over one month ago. I do n''t know what to do because my hope that my plan will get processed is completely gone at this point. Why do they seem to have so many problems?','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'a new job is being offered to a federalstudentloans.gov job. the new job is a new job with an offer letter that I could use as proof');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3852,'01/19/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Cash advance','On my Chevron Texaco card I have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balances, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for purchases and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for cash advances at a higher interest rate. I called because I wanted to pay my minimum and to make an additional payment to pay off my cash advance and was told I ca n''t do that. In order to pay off my cash advance I have to pay off the purchases portion first. This seems wrong to me. I would never have used the cash advance feature if I had known this.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',4.0,4.0,'a cash advance feature is used to pay off my cash advance. the cash advance feature is not available on the card.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3853,'01/19/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Can''t repay my loan','I have tried multiple times to get my monthly amount reduced. I ca n''t afford the monthly payments that Navient is asking. I have called several times a year but nothing changes.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',4.0,4.0,'I have tried multiple times to get my monthly amount reduced. I have called several times a year but nothing changes.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3854,'01/19/2017','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I was living with my parents and overpaying my loan by {$200.00} a month. Combined with my federal loans and another private loan, I was paying about {$800.00} a month. When I wanted to move out, I called Navient to change my loan payment back down to the minimum that I was paying before so I would only have to pay {$600.00} a month. They told me that I could n''t do that and I was stuck with the higher payment. With my budget, this left me unable to move. I had to borrow money to pay off the loan in full so I could refinance and make my monthly payments lower.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'i was living with my parents and overpaying my loan by $200.00 a month. when I wanted to move out, I called Navient to change my');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3855,'01/19/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Bankruptcy','I had a bankruptcy and had a judgement taken care of within the BK, now Bank of America is refusing to release the lien they placed against my house for this judgment.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'bank of America is refusing to release lien they placed against house.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3856,'01/19/2017','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Can''t repay my loan','Said my loan was in forbearance and charged me huge interest fees','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'loan was in forbearance and charged me huge interest fees.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3857,'01/19/2017','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Can''t repay my loan','I have been making my monthly payments and the beginning of this year the payment has almost doubled. I have other loans and tried explaining that to Navient. I am a single mother of a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] year old so well im at work I pay for him to be at daycare not including bills which I explained to the Representive at Navient. The man took all my info and said yes your in the negative with your income and bills if I have to pay what they were asking. He said there was nothing he could do but would transfer me that it was out of his hands. I was transferred and the person did the same thing she took my info and this time asked to speak to my co signer. Well my co signer is now unemployed and my income has not changed yet there was nothing they could do for me. I do n''t want to default I just want something reasonable. I understand I have to pay back. When I got these loans I was told that they would work with me. I did n''t even get a job with what I went to school for I am just asking for them to be lowered. Navient does not work with you or try and understand. I am a person who is willing to make payments and not default yet they can not accommodate or be reasonable.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'I have been making my monthly payments and the beginning of this year the payment has almost doubled. I am a single mother of a [COMPTE_ANONYMIS');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3858,'01/19/2017','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I made a request to Wells Fargo Home Mortgage to close an escrow account on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017. At that time I was informed by Wells Fargo that it takes them 7-10 business days to close an escrow account. Due to an issue with Wells Fargo applying funds to my account, the actual account closing was n''t processed until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017. The account was actually closed by Wells Fargo on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] business days later. According to Wells Fargo a check was cut on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017. Since I had not received the check from Wells Fargo by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017 I called them back to inquire as to why I had not received the disbursement. The representative informed me that a check was cut on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017. However, after inquiring further and after the representative dug further, apparently the check was not actually sent until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2017, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] days later or 3 full business days. I believe that this is a intentional effort by Wells Fargo to delay sending funds to their customers in order for them to take advantage of interest earned on balances held during the float period.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a check was cut on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3859,'01/18/2017','Debt collection','Medical','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016 I took my son [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] department in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], GA. At the time I paid {$150.00} in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] department. We later received the bill from the hospital claiming that we had not made any payments to the at time of service. I paid the remainder of the bill ( {$100.00} ) and contacted the hospital sort out the missing {$150.00}. I sent them the receipts, backdraft copies where the payment was cleared by my bank. I received another 2 bills from the hospital claiming I owed {$150.00}, the hospital claimed the had not received the documents I had faxed them. This happened 4 times over the time of 3 month. The hospital then handed the matter over to Central Financial Control Debt Collector. Again I faxed tem the documents showing I had paid at the time of service. The first 3 times they claimed they had not received the documents, so on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016 I faxed 20 copies from 3 different fax machines and 3 copies by regular mail. Central Financial Control then acknowledged that they had received the information and it had been handed over to their disputed claims department. Since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I have been told that my claim is under review and they will get back to me shortly. However, I have had no information about my claim, the person in charge of my claim ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) have not returned any of my calls.','TENET HEALTHCARE CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016 I took my son to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] department. at the time I paid ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3860,'01/18/2017','Credit card',NULL,'APR or interest rate','I have been a Discover Card member since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I used my Discover Card to make a couple of purchases in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and four purchases between XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have not used my Discover Card during the years of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and most of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; I did not start using my Discover Card again until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I recently attempted to do a Cash Advance and noticed that I did not have funds to transfer from my Discover Card to my checking account. This caused me to look through my Discover Card statement and I found that I have been charged interests every month regardless if I made a purchase or cash advance with my card. My statements reflect that I was charged {$1100.00} in interest and {$550.00} in fees for the year [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was charged {$1200.00} in interest and {$420.00} in fees ; and in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was charged {$1200.00} in interest. Please note, I did not make a single purchase or cash advance using my Discover Card during these three years but was still charged over {$1000.00} each year in interest. I have also noticed that my credit line has increased from {$5000.00} to now {$8600.00} without my consent. I believe the increase was done to add interest charges and fees. I have contacted Discover Card company via Live Chat in hopes to reach an amicable resolution but all they do is ''copy and paste '' text from their disclosure documents. I am seeking aid from a regulatory agency as I find this practice unjust to consumers.','DISCOVER BANK',2.0,2.0,'I have been a Discover Card member since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have not used my Discover Card during the years');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3861,'01/18/2017','Mortgage','Home equity loan or line of credit','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I obtained a HELOC from PNC Bank in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I filed bankruptcy in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with a statement of Intent to keep the property and reinstate the loan. I continued making payments throughout the bankruptcy. The bank continued to send monthly statements until the bankruptcy was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. According to my intent filed with the bankruptcy, I continued making payments without periodic statements for a year. During that time I requested in writing to PNC Bank to resume sending statements for several reasons : 1. ) I could n''t see if the payments were credited to my accounts, 2. ) I could n''t see if errors or extra charges were added to my account, 3. ) The HELOC contained two indices and interest rates varied on those indices. 4. ) I could n''t see if the bank was guilty of conversion, 5. ) I was unsure if the monthly payment amount had changed, 6. ) I had no record of accounting on my payments, due dates, penalties, etc. and 7. ) I was n''t sure if in a settlement with the government whether this loan was relieved ( as my sister ''s loan was relieved ). I wrote and called the bank several times asking for statements. I received no answer. Finally I stopped paying for reasons of impracticability. I was able, willing, and had the money to pay, but for the reasons above was barred from paying. I finally got through to the bank in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I asked for a settlement in lieu of statements they would n''t send. They refused to settle and sent me a payroll statement saying that 0.00 % interest would be charged on the loan until paid in full. I because totally [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When the bank would call which was frequently, I was mostly incapable of answering. When I did speak to the bank, they refused to give me statements and they said they did not know the monthly payment amount. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was having a particularly bad day cognitively. I told PNC Bank that at the moment I had no [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] income which was because I had to fight with Worker ''s Comp to send money due to me. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], without due diligence, the bank recorded a Notice of Default with the county although they had never informed me that I was late or that they were going to record this. My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] symptoms including [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I asked my family if this was legal. My sister told me to sue. With great difficulty and not much clarity, I filed suit in federal court on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was told that the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in California favored sending monthly statements and that Bankruptcy code protected banks that had secured liens so that it was lawful to send monthly statements. I was also told that a new TILA law required banks to send monthly statements in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. However, then I was told this did n''t cover the section for HELOCs. However, a reading of the Federal Register Final Rule shows that the intent was only to exclude coupon books loans and small servicers. I ca n''t afford an attorney as a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] person. I also want to save money won under Worker ''s Comp to give to PNC Bank to save my home of 22 years. My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] parents have been living with me for over a year. My dad is a veteran who fought in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and he had his leg amputated in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My son lives with me and he is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have not seen even one case where a pro se plaintiff wins against any of the largest [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollar banks. I feel no hope and i think [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My doctors know this. I am on many medications. I need help and I ''m helpless. I ask the CFPB to fix the law regarding HELOCs that are secured by home. The bank should be made to send periodic statements. This is a second junior mortgage, but they are foreclosing all the same. Please help [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] people from being evicted from their homes, when all they wanted to do was pay and were prevented by not receiving statements.','PNC Bank N.A.',2.0,2.0,'a statement of intent filed with the bankruptcy in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. a statement of intent filed with the bankruptcy, I continued making payments without periodic');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3862,'01/18/2017','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I had sent a notice to Navient on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] regarding private school loans they are showing these loans as open and past due even though they had charged them off and last year had sent them out for collections and were harassing me about them. I am including a copy of that last notice, but want them to remove these from their system and stop requesting payments : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Navient [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], PA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Re : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - Account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] To whom it may concern : I am writing to inform your company that I will not make any further payments on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the loans that your company is servicing and claiming still open. These loans should have been discharged in my Chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bankruptcy, however even though no representative from your company or any other attended the creditor ''s meeting your company still determined these were collectable debts afterwards. 
Under duress of legal action against me I was pressured to make the last payments on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] towards each of the loans. 
Since then I have informed your company and debt collection agencies you have employed that I will not be making further payment on these private loans. Under the California Civil Code the statute of limitations of four years from the last payment has expired and they have become legally uncollectable. 

Therefore under this law I am demanding no further action should be taken to obtain payments or settlements of the below noted loans including notices, solicitations or requests of any type including Navient ''s website which continues to show these as late and is demanding payments to be made. 
I have worked to resolve the federally insured loans having consolidated the debt and will continue to pay on those consolidated loans. 

I am also demanding an acknowledgment from your company of this matter and that these should no longer be reported as open debts on your website or any other records of your company. 

The loan numbers are as follows : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Sincerely, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], CA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] They did not respond to my letter in any way and continue to show these as delinquent on their website and any time I try to make payments on loans that I have put into a modified loan their system still asks for payment.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'a notice was sent to Navient on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. they are showing these loans as open and past due. they were harassing me');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3863,'01/18/2017','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Account opening, closing, or management','I have a line of credit with BBVA Compass for Overdraft Protection. Although this is an open/active credit account, BBVA does not report it to my credit report. I have raised this issue with them, and they tell me that I need to contact the credit bureau. I contacted the bureau, however it is only possible to file disputes for existing information inside of the credit report already. I can not locate an option to ''add '' a tradeline to my credit report- really it is the financial institution that needs to do this. Additionally, I have to say the service at BBVA is not well. Their is frequently a language barrier, the bankers do not know the products or services. Additionally, they do not give consumers all of the available options to avoid fees- that is to say they retain control in order that they can charge fees. Ex : If I forsee needing my OD line, I can not advance it ahead of time. The bank advances it for me, and then charges me {$12.00}. As such, I never use the line because they do n''t see fit for me to control my own money. It seems to me they have this practice to charge more fees to consumers. I guess the 22 % APR is n''t enough.','BBVA COMPASS FINANCIAL CORPORATION',4.0,4.0,'BBVA Compass for overdraft protection is an open/active credit account. a line of credit is not available to the credit bureau. a tradeline is not');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3864,'01/18/2017','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','I had opened a new checking account with Bank of America in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Upon opening the account, I was advised that I would receive a bonus of {$300.00} if I met the requirement of a total of {$4500.00} in direct deposits made to the account within the first 90 days of opening the account. I met the requirements and did not receive the promotion after approximately 60 days after meeting the requirements. I reached out to Bank of America ''s customer service and was advised that they saw I met the requirements, and it would just take a little more time to receive the promotion. After about another 4 weeks I called back and was advised that I would receive the promotion, I would just need to wait more time. 

After several contacts with Bank of America, and ample time to receive the promotion, I contacted customer service on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was advised that I will not be receiving the {$300.00} promotion, regardless of being advised previously that I met all qualifications.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'Upon opening the account, I was advised that I would receive a bonus of $300.00 if I met the requirement of a total of $4500.00');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3865,'01/17/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I have filed no less than four ( 4 ) disputes pertaining to the above-referenced accounts held by the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] hereinafter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( hereinafter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). TransUnion refuses to conduct an reasonable investigation so as to have this inaccurate information removed from my credit file. Originally, there were [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of these accounts reflected in my credit file. After filing a Sworn Fraud Statement of Dispute and providing documentary evidence in support thereof, TransUnion removed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts ( i.e. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and left the remaining [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) that I am currently disputing. I have demonstrated to TransUnion that the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], has provided false and fraudulent information in stating that, " client agreed to pay for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for legal representation, '''' in absence of verification of a verbal and/or written agreement/understanding. After I disputed said accounts based upon a lack of an agreement/understanding between the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I to pay for legal representation, the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] then submitted an altered/modified document other than what was previously submitted for verification dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016 reflecting, " ... did not have to sign anything in order to receive services. '''' This was brought to the attention of TransUnion and yet they allow the [COMPTE_ANON