INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3866,'01/17/2017','Debt collection','Credit card','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','We completed a previous dispute under [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
Complaint is about fraudulent debt [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that was taken out fraudulently and owed to USAA. Here are the facts of the case. We completed a fraud packet, provided police report, proof of address, identification and a complete history that we had about the fraudster and their address history from a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] report and continued fraud claims in victims name. Consumer has been disputing this with USAA since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stepped in with POA to try to resolve. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] resubmitted all documents certified mail for consumer. USAA has acknowledged the proof of the fraudster and their history and and are aware that someone else is using their identification. USAA fraud has had file from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has been contacted 15-20 times by consumer and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to try to resolve matter, to which their only response is, someone will look into this and call back. You are never provided any point of contact and often they leave you on hold for an hour. They never call back. They dont investigate and resolve the matter and the debt has been sold/resold to collection agencies. We had one collection agency dismiss debt, but USAA has failed to do so. USAA has had the details of identity theft and alll pertinent documents for more than a year and are violating consumer protection laws. They have failed to discharge the debt. Consumer is getting new calls from new collection agency about debt as of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. USAA is failing to comply with Fair Debt Collection Practices and continuing to try to collect on a fraudulent debt they are supossed to be investigating. The debt remains on victims credit report and from what we can tell no investigation been completed. When the last CFPB complaint was last filled out they sent a Consumer Report Dispute form and we resent all the documents certified on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. It has now been over 60 days and they still continue to report this debt and collect on it. This is not the first case [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has had with victims and attempting to work with USAA and the treatment has been the same on the cases.','UNITED SERVICES AUTOMOBILE ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'consumer has been disputing this with USAA since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the debt has been sold/resold');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3867,'01/17/2017','Mortgage','VA mortgage','Application, originator, mortgage broker','I am trying to refi my home with a VA loan from Loan Depot. They are telling me that I am not the Title holder based on their search. I have checked with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] County and they confirmed that I am official Title holder. Loan Depot ''s representative, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] told me they will not allow me to to contact the Title search company that is in error What can I do?','loanDepot.com, LLC',2.0,2.0,'loan company says I am not the Title holder. loan depot representative says they will not allow me to contact the Title search company.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3868,'01/17/2017','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Credit decision / Underwriting','I applied for and completed a home modification program ( Home Affordable ). My mortgage was sold from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to Di-Tech. Upon completion of the modification program, I received a letter from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] explaining to me that since I completed the program in good standing without missing a payment, they were awarding me {$4000.00} to be applied to the principal of my mortgage loan. Once Di-Tech bought the mortgage loan from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they ( Di-tech ) decided that I did NOT qualify for the {$4000.00} and advised me in a letter that they were taking that money and that I was no longer eligible for it. I called Ditech to inquire how they came up with their reason that I did not qualify for the {$4000.00}. They said I had missed a payment back XX/XX/2012, therefore rendering me unqualified. After speaking to Ditech, I immediately called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who in fact verified that there has never been a payment missed or even late. I have NEVER missed or been late on a mortgage payment in 49 years of owning my home. My daughter wrote a letter to Ditech along with the proof that the payments were all made and all I ''m getting is " we need more time '''' explaining that they can not find a discrepancy. If I can get that {$4000.00} applied back to the principal of my home, I will be able to refinance and bring my payments back down to where I can afford them. Since Ditech took my mortgage from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], my payments have steadily gone from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I am [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] yrs old and a widow, and live on a fixed income. I feel strongly that they are scamming me in order to keep the money that was issued to me by the Dept of U.S. Treasury. I have the letter from them awarding me the money. Please help me get the money back that I have coming to me.','Ditech Financial LLC',2.0,2.0,'di-tech bought mortgage loan from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. they gave me $4000.00');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3869,'01/16/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Other','Ordered a product from a company with my American Express card. The account was closed about a month or 2 later. About 6 months later the product stopped working and the company issued me a refund to the original card. Called American Express and they said they had the credit. They were holding it. And when I had asked they said they would issue a check. It has been almost 4 weeks and still no check. I called them, they said they mailed it. Said they would send another one, but I asked them to send it via a method that was trackable and they would not. They are holding my money hostage and will not release the funds.','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'the account was closed about a month or 2 later. the product stopped working and the company issued me a refund. it has been almost 4 weeks and still no check.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3870,'01/16/2017','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','Billing complaint - overcharged, then the outstanding bill was sent to collections agency and hurt my credit. Had a vet check up in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for my dog. Paid bill in full during time of visit as required with debit card. Later on, I got a bill for {$130.00} and I disputed it with the clinic. The clinic claimed I had not paid my bill in full ; despite me doing so before I left the clinic during the time of my visit. They then sent the overcharged, outstanding bill, to a collections agency and hurt my credit score. I was forced to then pay the outstanding amount to alleviate the damage to my credit score. I did not owe this money, I had already paid my bill in full on the day of my appointment.','Receivables Management Partners, LLC',2.0,2.0,'bill was overcharged, then outstanding bill was sent to collections agency. clinic claimed I had not paid bill in full during time of visit.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3871,'01/16/2017','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','False statements or representation','my name at the time of this occurance was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2012 I typed up and hand delivered a notice to vacate my apartment before the lease term was up and listed the reasons why in this letter, and gave it to the Manager of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], chapel [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] failed to provide a safe environment for my children and I so I gave them 30 days written notice and moved my children and myself outta that apartment complex, people in the stairwells doing and selling drugs offering them to my children when they come home, gunshots all the time I recall calling the police several times, unruly children and the list goes on and on ... the manager ignored all reports by doing nothing to prevent these things from happening. She did n''t even live on the premises ... [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] did not abide by the lease terms of providing a safe environment for tenants and they should not be coming after me for the remaining lease and ruining my credit, I had no choice but to move for the safety of my family!','I.Q. DATA INTERNATIONAL, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the manager of the chapel failed to provide a safe environment for my children. she gave them 30 days written notice and gave it to the manager of the chapel. she ignored all reports');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3872,'01/15/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Credit card protection / Debt protection','Someone was able to hack into my Kohl ''s charge account and change the shipping address. They then used [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different old credit cards to charge [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] items and have them shipped to the bogus address during the month of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016. When I received the bill I immediately called Kohl ''s. Kohl ''s is currently working on the fraud case however I feel the practice of Kohl ''s not deactivating the old card when a new [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is sent sets up the consumer for fraud. I was told to either not activate the new card or call and cancel the old card. The only thing that changes is the last [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] numbers it is still the same account. I had them close every thing and they are supposed to send a new card. They also said they would not report anything to the credit bureau until the investigation was complete which could take up to 60 days. Kohl ''s is aware that there is a Kohl ''s Cash scam going on and they continue to keep old cards active. I also never received an email that my email and shipping address were changed on my account. This is unacceptable.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'Kohl''s is working on the fraud case but I feel the practice of Kohl''s not deactivating the old card sets up the consumer for fraud. the only thing that');
