INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3875,'01/13/2017','Debt collection','Mortgage','False statements or representation','Dear CFPB, I am a Veteran and I have filed a complaint that requires me to send documents explaining the case to the veteran ''s military division of the CFPB, but I ca n''t find the address for military complaints, I have 140 pages of evidence and statements, and I am worried that my complaint did not go to the military division. Please provide me a paper mail address at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]///the Complaint number is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Currently Carrington Collection Agency who is impersonating mortgage servicers is using the 60 day continuation they asked for to commit additional debt collector harassment. I will attemp to attach some documents.','CARRINGTON MORTGAGE SERVICES, LLC',2.0,2.0,'CFPB is a veteran and has filed a complaint. the complaint requires me to send documents explaining the case to the veteran. the complaint is not to the military division ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3876,'01/13/2017','Consumer Loan','Vehicle lease','Problems when you are unable to pay','I financed a car On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with Westlake financial along with a co-signer. I fell behind on car payments in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I then caught up on my payments and due to switching jobs I then fell behind again being off work for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] weeks and I went from getting paid bi-weekly to weekly. I fell behind and I have been trying to make small payments here and there. the finance company had told me that everything was okay and I was going to catch up on my payments. I called today XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to make my regular payment and the finance company had told me that my account was locked and someone else had to handle it, at that point I did not know what this meant. I was transferred to a male attendant and he had told me my account was locked due to being behind on payments. I then commented I was calling to make a payment. After I had explained the situation that I had fell behind he proceeded to tell me there was nothing he can do he was locking my account to no longer accept payments from me then the attendant continued to mock me and belittle me in a rude tone. such as saying " theres nothing I can do im not going to wait for you, you cant even afford the car, and also mocked me saying " all your saying is ugh, ugh, ugh is there anything else I can do when I already told you [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] times no '''' I then commented that there is no reason to belittle me or mock me in this situation. and he said " I am stating facts okay I repeated myself 4 times, so make sure you take your personal belongings out of the car so they can pick it up [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different companies have been looking for you and if your hiding we will find you '''' I then told him " if I was hiding would n''t have called you to make my car payment today. He proceeded to say " well im not going to say no to your money im going to take it but that is not going to help its too late '''' I got upset and told him his tone and the way he handled customer service was not right and he made the comment of " I am not customer service I am collections '''' so I mentioned regardless of him being customer service or collections he should allow the customer to talk or state the concern. I then hung up due to the rude mannerism and now they are telling me they are sending tow trucks to my job and home. URGENT.','Westlake Services, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a co-signer financed a car with westlake financial. he then caught up on my payments and fell behind again being off work. he told me that');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3877,'01/13/2017','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I live in California and my mortgage company is located on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I regularly make my mortgage payment on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the last day before a late fee is charged. The remittance coupon clearly states that " If payment is received after [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] late fee will be charged. '''' The coupon does not state that the payment needs to be made according to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called my payment in prior to mid-night [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was charged a late fee. If the payment is reflected as the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on my statement the next month, should I be charged a late fee?','SUNTRUST BANKS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'mortgage company is located on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the remittance coupon does not');
