INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3884,'01/11/2017','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in student loans, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which are private loans from Navient. I am having medical issues, and require [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] this month. I called Navient to see if they have a medical deferment or medical hardship deferment plan. They do not offer any interest free deferment plans - only plans that will lower my payment but I will have higher monthly payments more in the future. I also asked to speak with the Office of the Customer Advocate and the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] representatives I spoke with all told me that they did n''t have the number, or they can not give me the number. The last person I spoke to said that it was Navient ''s policy to not give out the Office of the Advocate ''s contact information.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'I have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in student loans. they are private loans from Navient. they do not offer interest free deferment plans.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3885,'01/11/2017','Credit card',NULL,'Other','Summary : Had a credit card, was paying debt. Became unemployed and unable to pay ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), account went to collections. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], got a temporary part-time job and made arrangements with the creditor - [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to pay $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/month. Started XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( I ''m told ), the account was charged-off. I have been making $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] monthly payments to creditor since then. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I wrote to them to tell them to " STOP CALLING ME. '''' I said nothing about them not doing anything else. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they replied they " received [ my ] your request to close the above referenced account. '''' WHAT??? And then later in the letter : " If you would like to may payment arrangements to resolve this issue, please contact us at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. '''' Huh??? I already made payment arrangements with them when it was discussed and I agreed to do $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/month - all I could do ; and notified them in the letter that I ''d let them know if/when my situation changed. 

So, my question is this : If the creditor talked with me, stated/negotiated ( almost begging ) an amount and accepted the payment amount I could make, AND has been accepting ( and acknowledging - receipt of ) those payments every month - for a debt that was Charged Off XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; do they then have any right to refuse current payments I make, in an attempt to say I was not " paying as agreed, '''' or to make it seem as if I have not been paying? What is my right as a consumer? What is their right as a creditor? 

I have another letter to write to them, accompanying the next payment I ''ll be sending, to let them know they did not follow my letter, or misinterpreted it, and further - they did not acknowledge receipt/crediting the payment ( per letter as they have done for over a year - prior to my letter of request ). What else do you suggest I do at this point? Please advise, thanks.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'creditor ''''s'' account went to collections. ''''I''m not paying as agreed,'''' '''' '''' '''' '''' ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3886,'01/11/2017','Consumer Loan','Vehicle loan','Managing the loan or lease','I have been making timely payments on my auto loan. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I made my regular monthly payment, due on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I then made my XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I paid the bill timely. No principal was deducted from my loan balance with the full payment being applied to interest. I was told that I have no penalties for early payment but this is penalizing me.','CONSUMER PORTFOLIO SERVICES, INC.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] made monthly payment on my auto loan. no principal was deducted from my loan balance.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3887,'01/11/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I contacted Transunion XX/XX/2012 about removing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] tax liens from my credit report. I was a victim of identity theft and a business was opened in my name. The business then failed to pay State Sales Tax resulting in tax liens filed against me. I was told I had to provide a police report which I have multiple times to get these removed from my credit report. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was able to remove them with no issue YEARS ago from my credit report. Every time I speak with Transunion I am told the exact same story, that the documents have not been received and they ''re unable to remove anything without them. Despite multiple faxed copies, that show as being received by the fax receipt and mailing multiple copies including certified copies, the company still claims they have not gotten the needed information from me. The company refuses to provide me with a direct contact or direct email address of where I can send this information. This issue has been on going for FOUR years doing damage to my credit and is not expected to be removed for another 2-3 years. This is completely unacceptable. I have sent in the requested documents multiple times only for them to be " not received ''''.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a business was opened in my name and failed to pay State Sales Tax. a police report was able to remove the liens with no issue YEARS ago. the company');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3888,'01/11/2017','Debt collection','Payday loan','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','I received a loan of {$400.00} from Advance America. I am a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] person and had a hardship and could not pay the loan myself. I had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] pay the loan. On XX/XX/2016 a Settlement Agreement was reached with Advance America / [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for {$250.00}. Yet I continue to be contacted by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] claiming that I owe over {$300.00}. I have stated to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that this debt has been paid in full. I have offered to present her with the documentation but she refuse to accept any documentation. She asked for an account number, I obtained the documents and account number but she again refused because she said the amount was inaccurate. I have requested that she send me some validation of debt but she refuses and instead threatens to take to court for the amount, which I do not owe, and have me pay court costs also.','Advance America, Cash Advance Centers, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'I received a loan of $400.00 from Advance America. I had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] pay the loan. on XX');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3889,'01/10/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','I have been disputing hard inquiries on my credit report that posted in XX/XX/2015. I have sent several letters and called to have inquiries removed for reason that I did not apply for credit with these companies. I have been told that my information was not in there system because an account was never opened but the inquiry is there on report. if they do n''t have an account they have no way of investigating and of course they will not take my word.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a credit report posted in XX/XX/2015 has been disputed by many. the inquiry is there on report.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3890,'01/10/2017','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I tool out a private loan with ASFG when starting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] college. They closed their doors before I finished school. I do n''t believe I should have to repay when I have n''t finished my education. I am getting harassing calls. It needs to be stopped. Of other students are getting their loans wiped, I believe money should be tok.','Express Aviation',2.0,2.0,'a private loan with ASFG is a tool for starting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] college. it is not enough to repay when I have n''');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3891,'01/10/2017','Mortgage','Conventional adjustable mortgage (ARM)','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','I have been attempting to get a loan modification from Select Portfolio Services for 9 months. They have continually delayed this process by asking for the same items over and over again. 
In the last 2 months they have set a sale date of my home in violation of California and Federal law specifically the dual tracking law as a part of the homeowner bill of rights.','SELECT PORTFOLIO SERVICING, INC.',2.0,2.0,'select Portfolio Services have been attempting to get a loan modification for 9 months. they have set a sale date of my home in violation of federal law.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3892,'01/10/2017','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Settlement process and costs','I refinanced my mortgage with Wells Fargo and closed in early [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016. Soon afterwards I applied for a HELOC with Wells Fargo and was advised that I could not close until the county had recorded the paperwork from the refi. Throughout [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016 I repeatedly inquired about the county recording and was told it should be " any day ''''. Today I found out the title company did not submit the paperwork to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16, 74 days after the closing. In the meantime the rate lock expired, rates have gone up, and my paperwork is still unprocessed. Wells Fargo neglected to ensure the refi documents were filed in a timely manner, and I am worse off due to the HELOC rate increase.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'mortgage lender refinanced with Wells Fargo and closed in early 2016. the title company did not submit the paperwork until the closing. the rate lock expired, rates have gone up');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3893,'01/10/2017','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I ''ve disputed this information with Equifax numerous times and have proven that they have this information invalid and that it does n''t match any record whatsoever and they failed to remove these from my reports as well as provide the court docs that prove they have it accurately listed. I require that these are removed immediately. I am including the public records pate of my credit report as well as my dispute letters.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'i have disputed this information with Equifax numerous times. they failed to remove these from my reports and provide court docs.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3894,'01/09/2017','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Credit decision / Underwriting','I worked with a lender from prime lending and everything was going wonderfully until about 2 week before closing. I had not heard from her in quite some time when one day, about 3 days before our closing should have been, she called and " made me promise not to get upset '''' she went on to tell me that my FHA loan had been denied, after previously switching from conventional due to debt-to-income-ratio issues. So, she asked if I had any more money to give to help us go back to conventional. I said no. Flat out no. I had saved {$11000.00} to someday use to purchase a house. I knew fully well that ALL of my savings would be going into my house, and my realtor and lender both knew this. She later called back and stated that she had already put my husband on the loan, EVEN though I was never asked if this was ok. Apparently her supervisor told her to include him because of his credit. Well, this then made it to where all his finances would be legally necessary to use for the house. To get us to 5 % down, we would need {$3500.00} of my husbands {$5000.00} in savings. That would mean that to by our new home would be financially crippling ourselves ; draining my entire savings, and 70 % of my husbands. This was not ok, considering my husband had just quit his job and had ZERO income. Another fact my lender knew. It was never my decision. Our lender took complete advantage of us. AND this was after she had to award us hundreds of dollars in waived fees to make the loan go through. It was clear that we were not a priority, we were a paycheck. Now my husband and I are still trying to make ends meet with no money to fall back on, because of a decision that was made for us.','PRIMELENDING, A PLAINSCAPITAL COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'prime lending''s lender had to award us hundreds of dollars in waived fees. she had to give us hundreds of dollars in waived fees to make the loan go through. she');
