INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3897,'01/09/2017','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Disclosure verification of debt','An account with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was sent to collections and is now reporting to my credit report. Convergent Outsourcing Inc . This is the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] collection agency. At the time that I ended my services with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I canceled my service and was n''t under a contact. So there was n''t an early termination fee. After the collection reported I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to inquire about the charges. The nice representative was n''t able to give me much information and unable to send me a bill that stated what these charges were for. She did tell me that my account was now being handled by Convergent. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was not able to verify this debt and the accrued charges AFTER I canceled my services. The Federal Trade Commision alleges that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was billing and Cramming bogus charges to its customers. I believe I am a victim of this unfair practice. 

Without proper verification of debt and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] not being able to tell me exactly what these charges are for I am requesting that they remove stop all collection activity.','Convergent Resources, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a credit report is now being sent to collections. the ftc alleges that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was billing and Cramming ');
