INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3907,'01/05/2017','Debt collection','Medical','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','In regards to account number ******* with Texas [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : Payment to Texas [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was paid and accepted in full from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. After speaking with several representatives, I have been getting nothing short of the " run around ''''. In my most recent call, I was told to contact the insurance company directly to verify the payment was made. I informed the representative that this had already been done, the check was sent to Texas [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and is showing as cashed. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], my account was placed in collections with CMRE Financial Services. They are now attempting to collect a debt that does not exist. Neither company will directly contact each other to resolve this in a timely manner. As of now, I have been assured by Texas [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that they would take me out of collections effective [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but this withdrawal from collections is temporary until this issue is completely resolved. I have had multiple conversations with Texas [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] where they have promised to take care of this situation, but so far have failed to do so.','CMRE Financial Services, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'payment to Texas was paid and accepted in full from CMRE Financial Services. a check was sent to Texas and is showing as cashed. a debt that does not exist');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3908,'01/05/2017','Debt collection','Credit card','Communication tactics','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016, I was informed by my father I received a letter at his home from the referenced collection agency. Upon calling on the same date, I spoke with a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who stated my account was in a " Pre-legal state. '''' I immediately asked to speak with a Supervisor and was connected with a " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' who said that they state that on all of their calls for this credit card because the creditor makes a decision if they will close the account and have their in-house attorney sue on them. 
