INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3911,'01/04/2017','Debt collection','Credit card','Taking/threatening an illegal action','My business failed and my partnership dissolved. BB & T, after being notified that I am looking into bankruptcy options and am working on all my debt starting withdrawing money out of my personal account for the business credit card. They did this until I was over drawn and left with nothing. After complaining they stopped but now are steadily calling and harassing me and I am in fear of them draining my account again leaving me with nothing and no ability to pay any bills. I am committed to doing the right thing but I think it is an atrocity that they can take money directly out of your personal account for a business debt without notice and then allow your account to be in default to other creditors and then charge your account fees on top of that. It ''s insanity.','BB&T CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'BB & T, a business credit card company, is working on all my debt. they did this until I was over drawn and left with nothing. they stopped but now');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3912,'01/04/2017','Debt collection','Credit card','Disclosure verification of debt','The debtor is currently in the process of short selling her home. During the preliminary Title review, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] abstracts of judgments were found by FIA card services. Title contacted Attorney that file the Judgment and was informed that they no longer represent the client and that is now been serviced by Bank of America. We contacted Bank of America requesting a demand to settle this judgment and obtain a release. As a response we received a demand letter for {$6400.00}, however, in that demand there is not sufficient information to verify the following : 1 ) that this debt, in fact, is the ones mentioned on the judgements attached to the property 2 ) that in fact this amount will settle the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] judgments attached to the property. 3 ) that upon receipt of payment this company will send to debtor Acknowledgement and Satisfaction of Judgments 4 ) that Bank of America is the representative for FIA Card services. 
Since XX/XX/XXXX2016 we have been attempting to obtain the above clarification. Again and again, we have been informed to fax our request to the Legal Department handling this account. We have done so on multiple occasions. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I received a voicemail from the legal operations department stating that the demand we received is the only demand they use and that once they obtain payment they will further follow up on my request. As my supporting documents will show I have done everything I can to give this servicer the opportunity to resolve this case. Unfortunately, after over 2 months I need more assistance to resolve this issue. I also requested if they can not provide the information requested to provide me a release of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] judgments in question. Today when I called and spoke to the Collections department ''s manager and informed him that I need more assistance and will be forced to seek alternative assistance his reply was " do that ''''.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'debtor is currently short selling her home. a debtor is currently in the process of short selling her home. a call from the legal operations department was sent to the legal');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3913,'01/04/2017','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','occasionsSwitched cell phone carriers from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The final [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bill was brought to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they mailed us [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] pre-paid [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] cards with the early termination and fees total. We sent everything to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and paid the outstanding balance so that we had a zero balance. The following month we received another bill from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating we owed another month of service totaling approximately {$280.00}. 

