INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3918,'01/03/2017','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','Bank of America is guilty of conducting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] without the authority to do so. In this instance, Bank of America has failed to properly execute and record any mortgage related document by associating the document with my private property and home. Specifically, only [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] properly executed and recorded document has been associated with the assigned assessors '' property number ( APN ) of the subject property. Therefore, no default can be had or may be claimed on the recorded XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Deed of Trust. 

