FEDLOAN approved my application for PSLF and was allowed to have access to my account prior to their original review process. They did not provide an opportunity to pay my loan, causing a overdue debt ; and mislead their ability to operate the PSFL program. 

I wish to have my overdue debt removed and placed on the PSLF, as previously promised. 

Thank you.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'a public service forgiveness loan program was approved by the program. the program was approved by the program. the program did not provide an opportunity to pay my loan.');
