INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3928,'12/29/2016','Payday loan',NULL,'Charged bank acct wrong day or amt','I contacted Check-n-go to extend my payment out to an additional week because I would n''t have the money to pay my monthly payment on the scheduled day. The first person I spoke to was a male who assured me that he can extend my due date for another week. This was around the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I received a call from a woman that worked in the same office a few days later claiming that my due date was never changed and that the man that claimed to have changed it, could n''t do that without me refinancing so she recommended that if I wanted to change my due date I would have to come in and refinance. So I went in on the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to refinance but could n''t because they had to wait for the payment that was already ACH from my account to return as paid or unpaid in order to refinance. She informed me that they could not debit or ACH my account again until they call me first. She also informed me to check back with her on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and everything should be returned and situated by then. I returned on the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] only to find that someone had sent the payment back out. They violated their own policy when they sent the payment back out because they were supposed to contact me first and they did n''t. They ended up terminating the man that assisted me and I received another overdraft fee but that was n''t the real issue. the issue was that they violated their own policy and they made it seem as if it was n''t a big issue at all but it was to me because I felt that I was being treated poorly and unfair. At that point I did n''t want any part of their business. I am not saying that I should n''t pay anything but I should n''t have to pay what they expect me to.','CNG FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a woman in the same office said that my due date was never changed. she said that the man that claimed to have changed it couldn''t do that without me refin');
