INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3930,'12/29/2016','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I have been paying [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for two years on a student loan debt that is owned by Navient. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has been miscalculating my payments and not applying my payments correctly to the alleged balance which is a flagrant violation of the Fair Debt Collections Practices Act. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has been adding interest to the balance which is also a violation of the Fair Debt Collections Practices Act. 

I would be willing to settle the student loan debt for {$5000.00}. Navient had offered a settlement agreement of about {$10000.00} more than 6 months ago. I have been making monthly payments throughout this time to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], including after Navient offered that settlement agreement. I would be willing to settle the debt for {$5000.00} as I have already paid Navient [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of dollars over the past two years. 
During the past 4 years I have filed multiple written complaints and have copies of, against Navient and their debt collectors for flagrant violations of the Fair Debt Collections Practices Act. 

I would be willing to settle the debt for {$5000.00}. I have been making payments to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for two years each month even while experiencing tremendous financial difficulties. I would need the settlement confirmation in writing from Navient. In addition, before FAMS I also paid another debt collector that Navient had hired to collect on the debt, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of dollars. The only reason Navient switched from the old debt collector to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was because the old debt collector flagrantly violated the Fair Debt Collections Practices Act, which is something that FAMS has also done. I would be willing to settle the debt for {$5000.00}.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has been paying on student loan debt. he has been adding interest to the balance which is a violation of the Fair Debt');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3931,'12/29/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','I have account with Citi bank for almost 10 years. I was trying to login to my account but it was asking me about my new debit card that i supposed to received, i never received so i called the customer service, the citi bank representative trying to send me the replacement when she verified my address she said that there was some problem in your address, we sent to the different address. I explained her that I receive all my citi bank mail on this address for the last 2 years and never had any mailing issue. when i asked can you tell me what is my current address and when this got changed. she said she ca n''t share these info. i request to talk to supervisor, she said we have the same mailing address and she came with another story that your account has been closed few days ago due to overdrawn., I told her that citi bank closed all their location in my sate ( Pennsylvania ) long time ago. the only way to access my account is online or through ATM. i did n''t have access to it. i asked for solution. she said no solution to it.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'i have account with Citi bank for almost 10 years. i was trying to login to my account but it was asking me about my new debit card. i never received so');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3932,'12/28/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I have disputed a account with all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureaus for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The first time it was deleted. Then it appeared again under another company. I have been disputing it since and I have requested documentation with my signature to verify the account and to this day I have received nothing but somehow it keeps coming back verified when I dispute it. I would like this item deleted off my credit report.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a credit bureau has deleted a account for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the first time it was deleted. then it appeared again under another company');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3933,'12/28/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Advertising and marketing','1. Have very strong credit history and payment history with all credit cards 2. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I applied Amex Delta card for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] miles + statement credit, which I did n''t receive after 4-5 calls ( every time being assured and waiting few weeks ). Finally, was told wo n''t receive miles, so had to cancel the card. 
3. I kept getting similar offers from Delta & Amex, which I ignored 4. While booking my Delta airlines for Alaska, I once again got offered as part of the booking, which I confirmed to receive before applying as part of ticket booking 5. I met criteria in less than a week to be sure 6. After not seeing miles or credit, I called. Was assured after lengthy discussion and informed to get call in a week. 
7. Same thing happened 4-5 times, but there was no follow-up call & each time getting to know " by mistake case has been closed, but will be taken care in a week this time for sure '''', only for me to call after a month to be again given false assurance. 
8. Finally after few months, I am being told wo n''t get any miles or credit, ''I was given wrong information earlier and nothing can be done ''. Underlying message was read terms & conditions, all other assurances were just sales gimmick. 
