INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3938,'12/27/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','Caliber Home Loans has engaged in the prohibited pattern and practice of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Foreclosures. The new and old lenders have colluded and conspired to do a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Foreclosure. Caliber Home Loans is effectively acting as servicing arm for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a private equity vehicle packaging up [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of dollars worth of troubled mortgages. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has packaged lots of funds, but the most recent significant ones are [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Master Participation Trust and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Master Participation Trust. Based upon the information that I ''ve gathered, it appears [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sold its interest to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Master Participation Trust while the loan was subject to a foreclosure lawsuit originated by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Instead of discontinuing the lawsuit, or substituting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Master Trust as a plaintiff, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has continued the Foreclose lawsuit under the representation that it is the owner of the loan without notifying the court that the ownership has changed. 
