On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the Securities and Exchange Commission ( " Commission '''' ) issued an Order Instituting Cease-and-Desist Proceedings Pursuant to Section 8A of the Securities Act of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Section 21C of the Securities Exchange Act of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Making Findings, and Imposing a Cease-and-Desist Order ( " Order '''' ) against [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' ), [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]., [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( collectively, " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' or " Respondents '''' ). 
