INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3940,'12/26/2016','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I was sold a predatory loan at the University of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] via their bursary office and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which then was bought by Wells Fargo ( specs avail ). I was never told that I would pay interest only first, also encouraged to pay the minimum payment ( see billing ), was told I could not refinance 8.5 % locked rate and that they would capitalize the interest during hardship! Moreover, minorities were given higher rates and the loan was sold to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loan servicing so you could not refinance with them ( not a bank ; brilliant move by all parties involved ). I ''ve paid more than {$47000.00} for a {$30000.00} loan and still owe {$42000.00}! I was finally able to move the loan to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years later which offered reasonable terms but still a high rate of interest. Many of us were taken advantage of by CU/Norwest/WellsFargo/Nelnet combo [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I have spoken with the FTC and they told me to take it up with the Dept of Education and Congress, they make the rules. No question universities and banks colluded to offer horrible terms in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to tens of thousands of people. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said she would fight for us that were taken advantage of by Big Banks and she has done nothing. So let me get this straight, the US government bailed out wrecked banks, gave them money at 0 % to help consumers with bad loan terms and to boost the economy, yet it never trickled down to us that actually pay student loan debt ; in fact, you offered loan forgiveness to many except for those that actually pay their loans. I ''m working with a lawyer to put this whole University of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Wells Fargo [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] story out there and how the CFPC has done absolutely nothing since my first complaint. I pay my debts and a reasonable rate and terms I ''m willing to do, but what happened to many in the late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] early [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is shameful ; the US government lends banks money for almost free and they turn around and crush citizens with horrible rates and terms. Why have n''t you helped us? I ''m still paying a high rate of interest at 6 % ... The government should cram down rates for all high rate student loans and actually protect us from predatory bank practices that continue today. That would help the economy and not just the investor class.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'a loan was sold to the university of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_AN');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3941,'12/26/2016','Consumer Loan','Installment loan','Taking out the loan or lease','While reviewing my credit report, I see a credit inquiry from barclaycard made on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I sent a letter to the bank on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] requesting that they remove the inquiry because it was NOT made by myself nor given the authorization to do so and also asking for documentation supporting this inquiry. I received a response on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating that it was submitted electronically online and that they verified that it was made by myself because the social security number, DOB, contact number and mailing address was correct but none of that information was providing showing that it was. I ''m [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sure that I did not inquiry about a credit account with this bank. With all the different kinds of identify fraud being used on computers. Anyone can try to obtain credit in someone else ''s name especially in the event it ''s not done in person with proof of them saying who they say they are. For a company not able to provide me with proof is very alarming and violates my Credit Reporting Act. Being that I ''ve been a victim of identify theft in the past, I ''m aware of my rights to receive this information but was not provided with any information.','BARCLAYS BANK DELAWARE',2.0,4.0,'a credit inquiry from barclaycard was made on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMP');
