INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3991,'12/10/2016','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Account opening, closing, or management','I had Synchrony bank credit card/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance of {$60.00}. I thought I closed this account and forgot this remaining balance. When I tried to pay a few days later, it was charged {$29.00} late fee. I called a few times ( up to 5 times ) and explained to the representative, the staff in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] gave me the attitude " I got you to pay or .... '''' and would not be willing of reasoning. It was almost [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % penalty for a few days late. This Synchrony bank/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had more than [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] complaints since they are predatory in " every way '''' to " out get '''' customers. Then I tried to resolve with them, they just would not barge. It is now accumulated to more than {$290.00} out of original balance of {$60.00}. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] predatory actions are notorious. They caused me more than numerous long time calls for resolution which reached no where. I would NEVER EVER to deal with this Synchrony Bank. I believe it is Synchrony business strategy to break their credit card business into ALL DIFFERENT INDUSTRIES, so the complaints due to their employee trained " predatory practices '''' would be diversified and look smaller than it actually is. I am demanding Synchrony / [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] write off this {$60.00} balance to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for all the resource/time they caused me.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'a % penalty was applied for a few days after the bank was charged. it is now accumulated to more than $290.00 out of original balance of ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3992,'12/10/2016','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Can''t repay my loan','After entering some basic information into the University [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] website, I had received several calls in a few days '' time. An enrollment counselor contacted me to ask about my interest and aggressively pursued my enrollment in coursework for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Degree in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] University [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] forum, explaining a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] degree would boost my chances of getting a high-paying job in the field of my choice. The format and cost were explained and the first course started the following Tuesday. I began the coursework expecting preparatory instruction for the beginning of a career. I was, in fact, given little guidance toward a secure, high-paying job in the field and I believe the education i received in this coursework has not expanded my opportunities for a career in the way I was led to believe.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',8.0,8.0,'a student contacted me to ask about my interest and aggressively pursued my enrollment in coursework for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] degree. the format');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3993,'12/09/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sold me a prepaid phone plan. I called to cancel the service, but they continued my service and continued to bill me. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is aware of the problem. 

