INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(3994,'12/09/2016','Other financial service','Credit repair','Unexpected/Other fees','I went to annualcreditreport.com to help my step-son get his credit reports. Experian indicated I needed to pay a small fee to obtain some detailed information for him. I used my credit card to pay the small fee. Experian has since, enrolled me in a membership service for {$2100.00} per month. I did not realize this, I did not want the membership. I think they were deceptive in their membership enrollment. I called them and asked for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] charges to be reversed. I said I ''d pay for the initial fee since I must have made a mistake and not read their " fine print ''''. They canceled the " membership '''', but refused to remove the other fee. Luckily for me, I can afford the unnecessary fee ; however, I think there are thousands of people being duped by this practice and then Experian is not willing to refund fees for services no one wants or even realizes they ''ve signed up for. The supervisor at Experian I spoke with was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and her employee ID is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I actually work for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I no longer trust Experian or their business practices. I will work within my company to limit our business dealings with them. Experian is dishonest and has deceptive practices. None of the other [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureau agencies attempted to enroll me in a membership I did not want or need.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'experian has enrolled me in a membership service for $2100.00 per month. he has since enrolled me in a membership service for $');
