INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4005,'12/06/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Disclosure verification of debt','To never get a respond back from them. i sent a Debt validation letter to this company, Rent Recovery sol, LLC about a debt Im supposely owed them to never get an answer back from, them or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Please sent me an respond back about this debt.','Rent Recovery Solutions',2.0,2.0,'a debt validation letter sent to Rent Recovery sol, LLC. the letter was sent about a debt that they owed to never get an answer back.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4006,'12/06/2016','Consumer Loan','Personal line of credit','Managing the line of credit','This was a revolving account in which I paid Wells Fargo National Bank. There fore I am requesting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] be totally removed. As far as Wells Fargo goes, I never missed a payment, but was late on one. But paid the agreed upon contract amount. Instead of calling me as the cosignor, they called my daughter who is a college student. I thought they were offers of credit increases when she told me they called, because they had called before. When I pulled my credit report and realized the account was closed, I called them and asked, how can you close an account in which you are receiving an on time monthly payment on, and they said, it was several months where I did n''t pay the full amount and they called the cosigner, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I told them I was the cosigner. And then I asked, since they knew I was an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], why did n''t they call me? They told me they could only call one person on the account and they chose to call her. I asked them, Where was that law? Needless to say they did n''t have an answer. I informed them that all it took was a simple phone call to me to could have resolved this before they went to the extreme. I told them that I was legally entitled to receive a phone call especially before they closed the account. I informed them that I was paying the account off shortly and I did. I opened this account to assist my daughter in building credit and this is ruining her start on life. I made 13 consecutive payments and this account was closed because of negligent policies and personnel being lazy.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'a cosignor called me after she told me they called her because they had called before. they called me and asked, why didn''t they call me? they told');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4007,'12/06/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit monitoring or identity protection','Equifax Issue - spoke with a salesperson to understand their credit monitoring services. Hung up, did more research and signed up online. When specific feature I was promised was not available, I called Equifax back. They indicated I needed to signup for a more expensive service to get the feature I wanted. I agreed, then Equifax '' system went down and they could not upgrade me. I asked to speak to a supervisor. I spoke with supervisor on my signup challenges and in the discussion found out Equifax solution did not have the specific feature I wanted. Supervisor agreed to give me a refund. Never received refund. Called back and was told that my credit had been rejected because I signed up on line. If I had signed up by talking to a salesperson they could have processed my credit. In other words they do not stand behind their product or salesforce or they are calling me a liar. Hard to understand how a credit bureau who reports on others integrity does n''t have the integrity to stand behind their sales team - and by the way I had the salesperson ''s name.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a salesperson spoke with a salesperson to understand their credit monitoring services. he called the company back and said they didn''t have the integrity to stand behind their sales team');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4008,'12/06/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Making/receiving payments, sending money','I received a certified letter last Tuesday, XX/XX/2016 that my savings and checking accounts and my son ''s savings and checking accounts, which I am a co-signer, were being closed on XX/XX/2016 and that our ATM cards were being closed on XX/XX/2016. I called the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] number on the letter and left a message that someone would call me back. When they called back, they said it was a business decision, no other reason was offered. I stopped at my local bank to see if they had an answer and they could not find anything. After running around to get all my direct deposits changed to a new bank and making sure all my bills were covered, I called the number again asking for a supervisor, manager or someone who does not just answer the phone with a book of basic, obscure answers call me back. After two unsuccessful messages, someone called me back and gave me the same answer, " it ''s a business decision. ''''','HUNTINGTON NATIONAL BANK, THE',2.0,2.0,'a certified letter from XX/XX/2016 says my savings and checking accounts and my son''s savings and checking accounts were being closed on XX/XX/2016');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4009,'12/06/2016','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Account opening, closing, or management','I have been a loyal customer to Capital 360 since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], we established a Trust, and per our Attorney, ALL of our assets are in the name of our Trust, including our bank accounts at Capital 360. Capital 360 has recently offered a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account. We were informed that although our current status are ALL Trust accounts, we are not able to open a money market in the name of our Trust. I asked to speak with a manager and was directed to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( Employee # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] confirmed they were unwilling/unable to open a money market under our already established Trust accounts. I asked to speak with his manager, as we are already established customers with established Trust accounts and he declared that there was no one else for me to speak to regarding the matter and that I could periodically check back for changes in their policy. This refusal to open a money market account in the name of our Trust, considering we already have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] other accounts in the name of our Trust, appears to be random and discriminatory towards people who elect to have their financial affairs in order. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] insistence that he has the final say in the discussion of this inane policy was ridiculous, and this matter needs to addressed ensure inclusivity -- especially to established customers!','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'capital 360 has offered a trust, and per our Attorney, all of our assets are in the name of our Trust. the company has recently offered a [COMPTE_AN');
