Using Citi ''s own documentation, this charge was clearly not made by an authorized cardholder. 
Neither I nor anyone authorized by me made this charge. 

Supplemental Information : The Citi letter sent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] including the charge copy are included in this complaint.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,4.0,'unauthorized charge for $200.00 posted to my account on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I immediately disputed the charge via telephone and requested ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4018,'12/02/2016','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we got a payoff figure from Navient for our son ''s [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] student loans and sent that amount to pay off the loans. First they applied all the money to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loan giving it a negative balance of thousands of dollars while the other [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loans went unpaid. After calling they took that balance and paid it on the other loan but not as a payoff. They made monthly payments with it, paying the loan up through XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and telling us the next payment was owed at that time! This type of action continued for months. Despite our calling ( each time talking to different people who said they would fix it ) nothing happened and we continued to get bills. Finally my husband sat down with the manager of our bank and called. She knew the amount that was paid and all information concerning the check. She demanded to talk to the accounting department ( something we had not been permitted to do ). After 20 minutes they admitted to her that our loan was indeed paid off. After months, we even got a check for a reimbursement for overpaying. Six months later the bills started coming again. For the last year we have gotten weekly bills. Now we ( and our son ) get MANY phone calls as well. Six to eight calls a day to be exact. Starting at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and going through the evening. We explain to the caller, ask for a print out of our last three years of transactions, get confirmation that will happen and then never receive such a print out. We are at the point of suing this company for harassment. We just found out about this website and hope you can help us.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loan was paid off. the loan was paid off by the bank manager. the bank manager admitted');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4019,'12/02/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Improper use of my credit report','I used to live at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Tx [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and i [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].I had to vacate my apartment and break my lease because i have to go for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] started XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and ended XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].I then proceeded to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I got out of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].I relocated to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Texas XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].I got an apartment in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Texas and during background check, they discovered i was owing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].I called the manager at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and she told me that, I incurred a debt of {$110.00} because they spent it to clean my apartment unit after i moved out.I asked her about my security deposit and she told me that, i have forfeited that because i moved out without completing my lease agreement.I explained to her that i broke the lease because i had to go for my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and i submitted all necessary papers.The apartment manager said she is aware of that but it was their policies to hold on to the security deposit.She then told me that my debt has been given to an external creditor.I called the external creditor instantly and paid the debt.The external creditor ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( Phone Number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) closed my account after payment but the left it on my record.My problem is that this debt appears on my credit report anytime my rental history is pulled up and prevent me from getting an apartment unit.I was on a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and i should not incur this debt in the first place.I will be grateful if this particular record is removed from my credit report.I dispute the validity of the debt a