I feel robbed. I feel as if he is trying to intimidate me with the threat of an IRS audit to get around doing the right thing. I feel as if he ''s trying to be a smooth talker but it ''s very transparent his intention is to side step this error by manipulating me. Also, I asked another firm to look over my statements and have verified the rate never changed from 2 % to 1 % going all the way back to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
