Ocwen confirmed they received my appeal, and in a letter dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016 ( attached ) they said they would send me a written response. 

Since then, my niece has called Ocwen to check if anything more is needed. My niece has been authorized to talk to Ocwen for me since I am [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it is also hard for me to communicate in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Ocwen has told my niece again and again that no more papers are needed for my appeal. They even told her the file was in the " under writing '''' department. 

But we never got an answer or any update about the appeal. Instead, Ocwen scheduled a foreclosure sale for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016 ( letter attached ). 

Please have Ocwen postpone the foreclosure sale so there is time to give a fair consideration of my application and the appeal.','OCWEN LOAN SERVICING LLC',2.0,2.0,'a foreclosure is scheduled for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Ocwen''s error''');
