INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4052,'11/21/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Other','Sam ''s Club Synchrony Bank is my creditor and I have a credit card with them. The issue with them is that my account is not being reported to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reporting. I have requested on several occassions for about a month now if the would please re-report or re-insert my credit information to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] because it some how was removed. As of today that has yet been completed and it is very irritating and harming my credit','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'the issue with them is that my account is not being reported to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reporting. the issue with them is that my account is not being');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4053,'11/21/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Deposits and withdrawals','I deposited a personal check into my checking account on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/2016. The check cleared the bank it was drawn on the next day, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/2016. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called my bank branch and inquired as to why the funds have not been released to my account and was told there was a hold on it and it would not be available until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/2016. When I questioned why I was told that I had an overdraft in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and that is why. I have since got my statement from another business and they are scheduled to withdraw funds from my account. This will cause me an overdraft. The funds should be there as soon as that check cleared. Why should I have to pay a overdraft fee? They want to hold funds siting an overdraft from the month prior and cause me to have another possible overdraft??? Where does that make sense? The money is mine and should be in my account. The bank is Key Bank and the location is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], PA','KEYCORP',2.0,2.0,'check cleared the bank it was drawn on the next day. it was not released to my account until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/2016');
