INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4055,'11/20/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Other','Was offered a best buy credit card ( citibank ) in 2014 to purchase a TV for {$1200.00}. Signed up for the 24 month interest free path. I was told if I paid this balance off in 24 months, it would be interest free. However, they did not tell me that if I bought anything else on the card, they would pay that before my interest free balance. So, here I am thinking I am paying off my TV by making monthly payments on time of at least {$100.00} for 24 months. I have just learned that I still have a balance of {$930.00} on that TV plus a pending interest charge of {$700.00} in 26 days. I know that this is my fault as I should have spent more time on tracking my payments, but I feel that best buy should have been more diligent in making sure the consumer understands the rules and that Citibank should be liable for yet another scam.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'best buy credit card offered to buy a TV for $1200.00. was told if I paid this balance off in 24 months, it would be interest free. but');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4056,'11/20/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Billing disputes','I purchased several thousand dollars worth of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] gift cards starting from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-XX/XX/2016 and started purchasing them again this week ( XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I noticed that my gift cards have all been closed. I am the card holder / authorized purchaser on all of the gift cards. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] closed ALL of my gift cards dating back all the way since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-XX/XX/2016 this year without contacting me prior to the closures nor are they issuing refunds. I have called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] times in the past week and they have not given me any refunds or resolution to the issue. I am now out thousands of dollars because they decided to unlawfully cancel thousands of dollars in gift cards that are n''t supposed to expire and are transferable by law and no refunds are in sight. I have called Citibank ( the card issuer ) used in most of these transactions three times now and they have not been of assistance in helping me recover the funds from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - as I ''ve essentially lost thousands for nothing. The first call to Citibank, the representative said she would help me dispute all of them - that never happened. The second call representative told me they could n''t be disputed since they ''re gift cards. The third representative told me she would dispute all of them and issue me a new card and that never happened either. This week ''s purchases ( before I noticed ) - I never even received the gift cards I paid for and after this week I noticed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] literally cancelled all of my gift card purchases and never refunded any payment. Both parties do not want to help me and I am out thousands of dollars paying for literally nothing. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] quite literally stole from me.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,4.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] purchased several thousand dollars worth of gift cards. I started buying them again this week. I am');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4057,'11/19/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Billing disputes','on or around [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016, I CONTACTED CITI CARDS AUTOMATED SYSTEM TO MAKE A PAYMENT, BUT THEIR AUTOMATED SYSTEM REFUSED MY CHECKING ACCOUNT INFORMATION AND CONTINUED TO DO SO, DESPITE HAVING TO CALL BACK SEVERAL TIMES AND INPUTTING THE CORRECT INFORMATION AGAIN AND AGAIN. I FORCEDTO SPEAK DIRECTLY WITH A CUSTOMER SERVICE REP., IN ORDER TO MAKE A PAYMENT, EXPOSING MY PERSONAL ACCOUNT INFORMATION. THE REP ENTERED INTO THE SYSTEM, THE WRONG CHECKING ACCOUNT INFORMATION AND CAUSED SEVERAL FINANCIAL ISSUES INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO A REFUND OF THE PAYMENT OF {$35.00} ; A RETURN CHECK FEE OF {$27.00}, ; INTEREST OF {$23.00} ; AND THE COST AND TIME OF CONTACTING THE COMPANY ABOUT ALL THE COST INCURRED. I SPOKE TO A SUPERVISOR, ON OR AROUND XX/XX/2016, AND HAD TO REQUEST THAT THE INTEREST AND FEES BE REFUNDED TO MY ACCOUNT DUE TO THE COMPANY ''S ERRORS. I WAS TOLD THAT THE FEES WOULD BE RETURNED TO MY ACCOUNT, HOWEVER SHE SAID I WOULD ONLY GET ONLY [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CENTS OF THE {$23.00} CHARGED IN INTEREST RETURNED TO ME. UPON ASKING HOW SHE CALCULATED ONLY [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CENTS WITHIN LESS THAN 2 MINUTE OF SPEAKING WITH ME, SHE LAUGHED AND SAID SHE HAD A CALCULATOR IN FRONT OF HER. I HAD TO REQUEST A CREDIT TO THE ACCOUNT COST FOR THE ERROR ; THE TROUBLE AND INCONVENIENCE AND ALL OTHER COST I SUFFERED FROM, SHE STATED SHE WOULD AND THAT SHE WROTE IT ON HER CALENDAR AND THAT SHE COULD NOT PUT IT INTO THE SYSTEM, BUT SHE REFUSED TO SAY ANY AMOUNT BEING REFUNDED. THERFORE ON AOR AROUND XX/XX/2016, I CALLED CITI CARDS FOR MY ACCOUNT BALANCE TO PAY OFF MY BALANCE, I WAS TOLD THAT THERE IS NO PAYMENT DUE. I WAS TOLD NOT TO MAKE A PAYMENT. THEREFORE, NO PAYMENT WAS MADE DESPITE WANTING MAKING A PAYMENT TO CLEAR MY ACCOUNT OF ANY AMOUNT POSSIBLY DUE. I WAS TOLD NO. ON OR AROUND XX/XX/2016, I JUST RECEIVED MY NEXT STATEMENT WITH NO CREDIT FOR THE TROUBLE, CALLS AND INCONVENIENCE OF WHAT I HAVE HAD TO INCUR PRIOR TO THIS STATEMENT. BUT, THE STATEMENT SHOWED AN INTEREST REFUND OF [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CENTS FROM CUSTOMER SERVICE ERROR .. ( NOT WHAT THE SUPERVISOR STATED ) AND NOT THE CORRECT INTEREST AMOUNT. IN ADDITION, I WAS CHARGED INTEREST OF [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CENTS OF A BALANCE OF {$23.00}. AN INTEREST CHARGE I NEVER SHOULD HAVE HAD TO INCUR HAD I BEEN GIVEN MY BALANCE ON XX/XX/2016, WHEN I CONTACTED CITI CARDS TO PAY OFF MY ACCOUNT BALANCE IN TOTAL. ONCE AGAIN I HAD TO CONTACT THE COMPANY AND SPENT OVER 40 MINUTES ON THE PHONE TO BE TOLD THAT I WOULD ONLY RECEIVE A CREDIT OF [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CENTS OF THE INTERESTED CHARGED ON THE NEW STATEMENT BALANCE AND FURTHERMORE, THAT THEY WILL NOT CREDIT MY ACCOUNT FOR THE MISCOMMUNICATION ON MY ACCOUNT, MISINFORMATION ABOUT MY ACCOUNT BALANCE, ERRORS, AND REFUSAL OF PAYMENT TO PAY OFF MY BALANCE, ALL DUE TO COMPANY ERROR.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'CITI CARDS AUTOMATED SYSTEM REFUSED MY CHECKING ACCOUNT INFORMATION. I FORCEDTO SPEAK DIRECTLY WITH');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4058,'11/19/2016','Consumer Loan','Vehicle loan','Taking out the loan or lease','A couple years after I noticed a car loan on my credit report that I never signed for. In the last 3 months I ''ve disputed this account multiple times and can provide certified copies if needed and nothing has happened. I just keep getting " verified new information below ''''. I found your site from a friend that had similar experiences with the credit bureaus. I want this item off of my credit reports immediately. They are seriously affecting my credit score.','CREDIT ACCEPTANCE CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'in the last 3 months I disputed this account multiple times. I want this item off of my credit reports immediately.');
