I called ERC, again who posed as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the initial call made [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016, and advised them of the issue. They were still unable to provide any form verification of the debt and advised they do not have any original information for the debt, just the amount. I ''ve requested ERC provide the audio/media from the initial call received [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016, stating they are from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. At which point, the representative hung up. I ''ve called them numerous times requesting more information for the debt they are claiming I owe and have been addressed in a VERY unprofessional manor and hung up on. 

Please assist as this has affected my credit report and ERC is unwilling and unable to provide any verification of the amount they are stating I owe.','ERC',2.0,4.0,'caller advised they were a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] representative. the representative was unable to provide');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4066,'11/16/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Identity theft / Fraud / Embezzlement','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], According to the Fair Credit Reporting Act, Section 609 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( A ), you are required by federal law to verify - through the physical verification of the original signed consumer contract - any and all accounts you post on a credit report. Otherwise, anyone paying for your reporting services could fax, mail or email in a fraudulent account. I demand to see Verifiable Proof ( an original Consumer Contract with my Signature on it ) you have on file of the accounts listed below. Your failure to positively verify these accounts has hurt my ability to obtain credit. Under the FCRA, unverified accounts must be removed and if you are unable to provide me a copy of verifiable proof, you must remove the accounts listed below. Navy Federal Credit Union damaged my Credit report. Even duplicating account information to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
I demand the following accounts be verified or removed immediately. Account Number Provide Physical Verification. 
1. NAVY FCU Account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2. NAVY FCU Account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Unverified 3. NAVY FCU Account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Unverified 4. NAVY FCU Account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Unverified I hereby authorized NAVY FEDERAL CREDIT UNION TO RELEASE INFORMATION TO THE CONSUMER FINANCIAL PROTECTION BUREAU.. 
Thank You, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','NAVY FEDERAL CREDIT UNION',2.0,4.0,'if you are unable to provide me a copy of verifiable proof, you must remove the accounts listed below. the fCRA requires verification of any and all accounts');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4067,'11/16/2016','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I have been investigating my loan since before my school closed I filed a police report for fraud and Navient still is charging me for this. I have provided information to both them and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] re this private loan. Non of them are helping and I still have to pay it since its effecting my credit','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,4.0,'I have been investigating my loan since before my school closed. I filed a police report for fraud and Navient still is charging me for this.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4068,'11/16/2016','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Can''t repay my loan','I was forced into a loan situation using Peaks Loans instead of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loans i wanted to use while attending [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I would like to get out of these loans but i can not get a loan to consolidate the payments at a lower rate than the 11 % i am being charged now. This company has alos reported that my loans were past due at times that they were n''t and would randomly report that i was 90 days past due and then the next month state that i was current. This would bounce around like this for a while and i could not get anyone to discuss with me about the amounts and why they were the way they were.','First Associates Loan Servicing LLC',2.0,2.0,'i was forced into a loan situation using Peaks Loans instead of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loans. i wanted to use the loans while');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4069,'11/16/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I had a student loan from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This loan is paid off and closed on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. There was no late on this account. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] never reported any late for this account.But on Equifax file a 150 days late showing XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].The previous 4 months starting from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]- XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], it shows no late.All of of sudden a late of 150 days showing for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].If a student loan is late for more than 120 day, it goes into default status but in this case there was no default reported.If previous 4 months showing no late or payment made on time then how would it be 150 days late in just one month. Equifax has no answer for that and every time I dispute the account, they report back as verified.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'student loan from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is paid off and closed on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] there');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4070,'11/16/2016','Debt collection','I do not know','Improper contact or sharing of info','A company called United Recovery services has been continually harassing me with repeatedly phone calls daily about debt they can not provide full information on. I ''ve called and asked for how they obtained my information, and they hang up. Today, they contacted a family member that they obtained his phone number illegally and without his or my permission, then they proceeded to harass him on the phone, claiming his was lying about his identity. When he asked who they were and what they were calling about, they refused to give any information. This is absurd that a company is allowed to do this and to illegally obtain other people ''s contact information and then lie about it.','URS Holding, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a company called United Recovery services has been harassing me with repeatedly phone calls about debt they can not provide full information on. they contacted a family member that they obtained his phone');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4071,'11/15/2016','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I have an open case against Citibank # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Today [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called Citi because the monthly ACH of {$70.00} which is deducted from my bank the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of each month had not occurred. I was told it was and should show up tomorrow. In addition I was also informed the balance was {$620.00} a far increase from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when it was {$540.00}. 

The case # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was open because Citi stated the account was 169 days past due which was ludicras! The account has been closed since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I also received a message from CFPB recently that Citi is now researching and will take 60 days.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'the case was open because Citi stated the account was 169 days past due which was ludicras! the account has been closed since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4072,'11/15/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Application, originator, mortgage broker','I sent in my payment for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 10 days ago and it has NOT cleared my checking acct as of this writing. This is very strange as I have never been late nor missed a payment in over 10 years.I believe they are sitting on it to make me look bad because I have NOT accepted their offer for a loan mod with a new lower payment. I have NOT accepted their offer because they refuse to explain the amounts involved and because they are mad at me for contacting the CFPB with a complaint. This is my second complaint to you. 
In my opinion, Ocwen is shady and unethical at best and a scam at worst. This is my opinion. They provide NO information to me after repeated requests. They stonewall and obfuscate. I do NOT understand why they will NOT provide me specific information on the loan mod they offered which I have NOT accepted as of yet. Please assist me in obtaining the required info or at least investigate them for unethical business practices.','OCWEN LOAN SERVICING LLC',2.0,4.0,'a loan mod has not cleared my checking acct as of this writing. I have never been late nor missed a payment in over 10 years. they are sitting on it');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4073,'11/15/2016','Debt collection','I do not know','Improper contact or sharing of info','This number had been contacting me for some time now. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The first couple of calls I received the person on the other line seemed to be immediately fishing for personal information. Asking immediatetly for my date of birth to confirm my identity to discuss " personal business. '''' I absent mindedly confirmed my birth date. Realizing my mistake, I asked what they were calling in reference to. The person responded by saying they would need to " confirm '''' my social security number to give that information. I asked the question again. The woman on the line asked for my social security number. This went back and forth a few times with her getting more and more belligerent. I asked her to remove me from whatever list she had me on. She hung up on me. 

I have received multiple calls from this number and they always go the same way. They demand personal information, namely my social security number, then harass me when I ask why they are calling. Then they hang up on me. 

In these conversations the only information I have been able to gather is that they claim to be from a company called Senex, possibly trying to collect a debt. 

In the course of receiving these calls I ''ve noticed that the caller, usually a woman, is becoming more and more quick to anger. It ''s almost as if she calls specifically to harass me. 

I receive these calls at all hours of the day. I even took one at work, in which she seems particularly upset that I would n''t give her my social security number. 

In one call I informed the caller that unless I stopped receiving calls I would file a complaint for harassment. The line promptly went dead. Since then I have been receiving the calls more frequently. Mostly I just ignore them but the occasional one I answer lately is just dead air until the line goes dead. 

My concern is that this " company '''' is fishing for peoples information for personal gain. At the very least, if they are a collection company, people should not have to deal with this sort of harassment without even being told why they are calling.','Senex Services Corp.',2.0,2.0,'a woman on the line asked for her social security number. she asked for her social security number. she hung up on me.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4074,'11/15/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Credit determination','I applied for a hotel chain ''s credit card, in order to take advantage of a promotion it was offering. I did not bother to look up our actual income, but just entered a number I thought would be lower than the actual income, but still sufficient. 

The new hotel card was to be issued by Chase bank, where I already have a MasterCard and a Visa. Their internal Formula apparently decided that the {$2000.00} extra Line of Credit ( LOC ) of the card I was applying for was over what that income number would support. 

Chase did not call me during their deliberations. Instead, they sent a letter after the fact, saying the new card had been approved, but that it ''s LOC had been deducted from the LOC of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] existing Chase cards! 

In other words, instead of discussing the situation with me during the deliberation stage, they unilaterally issued the new {$2000.00} LOC card, and REDUCED the LOC on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of my existing cards by {$2000.00}! 

I called them today, when their letter came, and spoke to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] persons, a regular agent and an " escalation '''' agent. I gave them both our actual income, which is far higher than the estimate I had used, and asked them to return the LOC on my existing card to it ''s original amount. 

While they both agreed that I should have been called, they said they are often " too busy '''' to do that. Both also insisted they could not return the LOC on the existing card to it ''s original limit. 

The Chase letter to me cited " key factors that adversely affected your credit score '''' and mentioned that my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Score was used, too. The letter stated they had gotten their information, " in whole or in part '''' from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

What followed was a list of things like " Installment loans '''' ( we do n''t have any ) and " few accounts paid as agreed '''' ( ALL of them are paid as agreed, and they are all Chase! ) etc. The agents I spoke to today said that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] information did not actually apply to this decision. The decision was based on an internal Chase formula relating Income to Credit Limits. So, their ACTUAL reason was not cited on the letter. 

They both said, to fix this, I must either CANCEL the new card ( which would, of course, show on my Credit Reports as a cancelation by me ) and go then to the time and trouble of re-appyling, with my correct income. ( That also would show as another inquiry on my Credit Reports. ) Or, I must take the time and trouble to call them BACK with my correct income and ask for an increase in the old card ''s LOC, the one they had just reduced! That also would show as yet another inquiry on my Credit Reports. 

Also, when I said I would complain about this inconvenience to ''the proper agencies, the second, supposedly " escalated '''' agent said, in a threatening voice ... '''' Well, if you are going to sue us (??!! ) there is someone who will call you within 2 business days, '''' and proceeded to " verify '''' my phone number. I reminded him that I had n''t said I was going to SUE them, just report their failing to call me before making changes to my existing credit profile. He insisted I was still going to get this mystery call. 

To me, this was a thinly-veiled attempt to intimidate me into not reporting this incident. 

So now I am waiting to see what that phone call will be. Will they cancel all my Chase cards, for being a pain in their necks? Can they do that? One of those cards has over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] air miles on it. I ''ll bet they would love to have the excuse to cancel it! 

Also, can they really change my credit profile without telling me they are contemplating it, and why?','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',6.0,6.0,'a new hotel card was to be issued by a bank, where I already have a MasterCard and a Visa. they unilaterally issued the new $2000.00');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4075,'11/14/2016','Consumer Loan','Installment loan','Managing the loan or lease','I took a loan from Springstone Financial now Lending Club in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] through dental office " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' in the amount of {$24000.00} for dental implants. When I signed up for the loan I was told that it is interest free for 24 months and after that the interest will kick in on the amount remaining in the account. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was charged {$6400.00} in my account. I contacted Lending Club and asked about these charges and that ''s when they explained to me that these are deferred interest charges from the 24 months of their promotional plan that just expired that month. I had {$3300.00} remaining from the original {$24000.00} loan. I immediately paid this amount. I also disputed the interest charges ( {$6400.00} ) and asked to close my account. I was told that I will not be able to close my account until the disputed amount is resolved. I was also told that I do n''t need to make monthly payments on this disputed amount until it is resolved. Since then, I am being charged every month finance charges ( {$160.00} for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and {$190.00} for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) on amount that I ''m disputing and on the account that I ca n''t close. These are very high charges that are unfair to me since I am in this financial position because the terms were not provided to me the day I signed up for this loan. I received a letter on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from Lending Club rejecting my request to dispute these charges explaining to me that these are " valid ''''. And that the plan information was provided to me in my monthly statement. The crucial information of " Deferred interest '''' was never provided to me when I signed up for the plan for me to make a decision to take it or leave it. Also because I was not informed about this condition in the plan, I did n''t not look for it in the monthly statement. I believe that I was tricked to sign up for a plan and was not made aware of its crucial condition and wo n''t be able to withdraw from it if I saw it after the fact because of my dental needs at the time. 
Quick search in the internet, I found that Springstone Financial ( now Lending Club or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) has lawsuits and CFPB Actions regarding the " Deferred interest promotional plan '''' that I apparently was signed up for without my knowledge because of deceitful means used to promote this plan. In the CFPB action that I am attaching here with my complaint, Springsone was ordered to refund {$700000.00} in consumer relief to 3200 consumers as a result of the deceptive marketing and enrolment practices in its dental-service provider network. Springstone was also ordered by CFPB to reimburse and notify consumers affected by these practices. I am a consumer that is affected by this program and I am finding Lending Club action to pursuit me with these charges after CFPB took actions against them unfair and unreasonable.','LENDING CLUB CORP',2.0,2.0,'springstone financial now lending club charged me $6400.00 in my account. I disputed the interest charges and asked to close my account. the loan was ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4076,'11/14/2016','Mortgage','Conventional adjustable mortgage (ARM)','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','I have been trying to modify my mortgage sine XX/XX/2016 with Select Portfolio. 
Its now XX/XX/2016 and still nothing has been done. I followed there instructions of going on to there website and checking on my status loan and the website does not work If I do NOT call them I have NO idea if they need additional information.I have cooperated by sending them any documents that are missing by uploading them because its quicker and they receive it in 24 hours. I call them faithfully every week and they tell me the same thing that every thing is fine your in review and it takes time. Yesterday I was served with foreclosure complaint for the FIRST time and its not even the intent they went right to the complaint and when you call SPS they have no idea whats going on. 
Im upset because I want to save my house and I have followed there direction followed there rules and they never wanted to help me at all. They lead me to believe that they were going to help me and they had NO intentions ever to help me.When I called SPS and questioned the foreclosure complaint they told me to call a certain number and extension and when I called it turned out it was there attorneys office that represents them. The attorney was rude and basically spoke down to me and he proceeded to say that they were n''t going to HELP me and that they were ACCELERATING my foreclosure and with in a few weeks I would have a sheriff sale so I should start looking for a new home. 
Why would SPS do all that and lie to me this whole time. I trusted and believed that SPS wanted to truly help me.','SELECT PORTFOLIO SERVICING, INC.',2.0,2.0,'I have been trying to modify my mortgage sine XX/XX/2016. I followed there instructions of going on to there website and checking on my status loan. the website does');
