the debt to credit reporting companies Provide me with the records I request Thank you for your cooperation. 
Sincerely, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] SOC SEC # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] DOB [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ADDRESS [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], FL [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','ERC',2.0,2.0,'a thief used my personal information without my permission to open an account several account in my name this debt is not mine. I have enclosed a copy of the f');
