INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4087,'11/10/2016','Debt collection','Medical','Improper contact or sharing of info','This collector [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] contacted my friend off of my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]! He was my old boss ... I Do not work anymore and i had his old info on my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. He told me they called once before and said they were a debt collector .. They called him again and i was visiting. Ironic. So they stalked my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and called my friend to contact me. Not only did they Embaress me, but she talked down to me, yelled at me and was down right demeaning! I have NEVER been talked to like that before. Like i was just scum. I didnt even get a chance to ask what the debt was for before she started yelling at me. I dont know what kind of business is aloud to treat people that way!! If she wanted money, that is most definitely not the way to go about it. To threaten, yell and intimidate and harass. Its awful!','ENCORE CAPITAL GROUP INC.',2.0,2.0,'a debt collector called a friend off of his [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. he told me they called once before and said they were a debt');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4088,'11/10/2016','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Account opening, closing, or management','I have not used my Citibank credit card for a period of time. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I made a purchase with the credit card. This transaction was successful, but any future transactions were declined. When I called the Citibank customer services, I was notified that my Citibank credit card account was closed on the same day. I did not have any overdue balance and did n''t get an explanation why the bank closed down my account. I am concerned that the involuntary closure of my credit card account will affect my credit score.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,4.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] made a purchase with the credit card. this transaction was successful, but any future transactions were declined');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4089,'11/09/2016','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','Navient is the private loan servicer. I am the cosigner for my son. Originally these ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loans ) were [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loans. I have been paying on the loans since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Loan [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was disbursed in the amount of {$21000.00}. To date I have paid over {$17000.00} on this loan. The outstanding balance is {$17000.00}. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was disbursed in the amount of {$31000.00}. To date I have paid almost {$20000.00} on this loan. The outstanding balance is {$24000.00}. I submit that the fees and interest on these loans are predatory and unethical. Consequently, I have retained counsel to help me navigate a course of action. Repeatedly Navient has refused to help me over the years with a reasonable payment plan and reduction of interest and fees. Finally in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I discontinued my payments to Navient after receiving a bill for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that indicated that my most recent payment of {$130.00} only lowered the balance by {$46.00}. Although I have retained counsel, CFPB needs to be aware of the predatory practices of Navient. I have retained counsel for 6 months and to date, although we have offered a reasonable amount for a monthly payment, Navient has refused to cooperate.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',10.0,10.0,'Originally these loans were [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loans. to date I have paid over $');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4090,'11/09/2016','Debt collection','Medical','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','This is a collection agency. My medical bill was already written off by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I am even on a Medical Financial Assistance from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. However, the Collection is still insisting that I pay them the medical bills.','USCB, INC.',2.0,2.0,'medical bills were written off by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] collection agency insists that I pay them the medical bills');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4091,'11/09/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Rewards','I have been a Chase [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] preferred customer since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. In the middle of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I became aware of the new Chase [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reserve card. I simultaneously closed my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] preferred card account and opened my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reserve card account. At the time I believed that my accumulated points, worth close to {$2000.00}, would be rolled-over from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account to the next. 

