INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4116,'11/02/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I have a Public Record listed on my credit report that is inaccurate and incomplete such as a Bankruptcy that Experian is reporting. The Federal law requires that the credit reporting agencies provide mechanisms to ensure that each item on my credit report belongs to me and is accurate and complete. I have requested from Experian numerous times for VALIDATION that is competent evidence bearing my signature, name, address and telephone number of each person they have contacted to VALIDATE this bankruptcy and they have failed me only to return stating that it has been verified with no substantiation whatsoever. I have received a letter from Federal Bankruptcy Courts stating that they DO NOT report information to the credit reporting agencies, but yet Experian is saying they have verified it with Federal Bankruptcy Courts, and I know they do n''t because the information they are reporting is inaccurate and incomplete.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'the Federal law requires that the credit reporting agencies provide mechanisms to ensure that each item on my credit report belongs to me. the Federal law requires that the credit reporting agencies provide mechanisms to ensure that');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4117,'11/02/2016','Debt collection','Credit card','Taking/threatening an illegal action','I have received multiple phone calls and one letter from Real Time Resolutions attempting to collect an old credit card debt from approximately 14 years ago. The statute of limitations in the state of Oregon is ten years. They continue to run my credit score affecting it. Despite a few attempts to explain to them that they are in violation of Oregon law they persist in their illegal harassment.','Real Time Resolutions, Inc.',10.0,10.0,'real time resolutions has received multiple calls and one letter. they continue to run my credit score affecting it.');
