INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4119,'11/01/2016','Debt collection','Auto','Communication tactics','they call me everyday sometimes 2-4 times in 1 day, they call my job 2-3 times a day, and they even send text messages everyday to my phone. Is there anything I can do, I owe them and pay but I pay late but the calls so often make life even more [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','Friendly Finance Corporation',10.0,10.0,'call me everyday sometimes 2-4 times in 1 day, call my job 2-3 times a day. they even send text messages everyday to my phone.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4120,'11/01/2016','Debt collection','I do not know','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','I have been contacted on my mobile phone four times by CMRE Financial Services. The first two times they left a message asking specifically for my child who is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years old. I called the number that was left ( the contact number changes every time ) and was able to speak with a representative who told me that this was a financial matter regarding my child. When I informed the agent that my child was a minor, the representative then said that she needed to verify some information and asked for my child ''s birthdate. I told the representative that I would not provide her with my child ''s birthdate and she proceeded to ask for our home address. I did not provide that either. I requested that she forward any billing statement or printed materials regarding my child to the address that they have on file. The representative became belligerent and then disconnected me. This has happened twice. I do not know where this stems from and it has me concerned. Any assistance that you can provide would be greatly appreciated.','CMRE Financial Services, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a representative told me that my child was a minor. she asked for my child''s birthdate'' and asked for her''s birthdate''. the representative');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4121,'11/01/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Forbearance / Workout plans','Synchrony Bank previously GE Retail Bank now is the financing company for Lowe ''s, and HH Gregg. I made an unemployment claim back in 2013 to now have Synchrony Bank state that I did not have card coverage. I had both card for more than 20 years. I can not say how terrible this made me feel and how hard this is for this retail giant. I have these account that I paid on time over the years. I now need your assistance I know I was sold the card service to only have these companies report a Collection Balance when this is a Unemployment claim from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that should have paid both these accounts off. Now that they are Synchrony Bank I am told I did not have coverage this can not be true as long as I had these cards. I need your help to investigate and resolve this for me.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'GE Retail Bank has been a financing company for lowe''s and HH Gregg. i have both accounts that I paid on time over the years. I');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4122,'10/31/2016','Debt collection','Medical','False statements or representation','*Complaint number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] My credit report shows collections accounts that seem to have been unlawfully re-aged by the collection agencies and law firms that hold the debts. 

