INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4123,'10/31/2016','Debt collection','Mortgage','Disclosure verification of debt','I have disputed these accounts and I have not received any evidence of any transfers from the entity recorded as lender on the Notes of which Ditech has been trying to collect on, instead the have sent me as validation copies of unendorsed Notes as validation. I have received a copy of an affidavit stating that Ditech has purchased one of the Notes and yet this was not recorded into the county records. Ditech has reported false and misleading information to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CRA ''s including but not limited to double reporting the debt under 2 account # ''s for each Note one current and one late for the same amount. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has denied them the right to report due to not being able to produce proper documentation on one of the accounts.The CRA ''s have reported different information on my reports monthly and have refused to send me a copy of my files submitted to them to validate any debt. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stopped reporting for six months due to lack of proof but now has determined to start reporting again although they show no information as to the payment history. I have retained an attorney to handle these problems and repeatedly stated that Ditech contact him in these matters but to date they have not attempted contact him but instead have continued collections.','Ditech Financial LLC',2.0,2.0,'ditech has reported false and misleading information to the CRA. the CRA has denied the right to report due to not being able to produce proper documentation on one of the accounts ');
