INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4138,'10/27/2016','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Application, originator, mortgage broker','Let me first start off by stating this is my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] attempt to submit an complaint against Wells Fargo Loan Modification Department in regards to case number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
It ''s my right to state that Wells Fargo Loan dept. has a policy that is federally mandated to help those who are in need or having hardships in their lives. However in our case, I will prove how Wells Fargo ignored that policy that boldly stand by and deliberately mislead my husband and I into thinking we were being helped but in fact Wells Fargo had no intentions on helping anyone. 

Within the 16 years we have had our mortgage with Wells Fargo we have paid on time. Due to the economic downfall and loss of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s employment in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], we found ourselves unable to pay our mortgage. Therefore in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we had asked Wells Fargo for assistance and received a modification loan with NO issues or NO concerns. At the end of our loan modification we found ourselves still trying to manage our obligated debt and requested for an extension to our loan modification. At that time ww were told to resubmit another loan application to Wells Fargo Loan dept requesting a completely new loan. 
This is where the nightmare started. We were assigned a new home preservation specialist, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who was very rude and deceitful from the beginning. Every time I called to speak with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was either ignored by being placed on hold too long or I was told she was not at her desk and that I could leave a message on her voicemail. In addition to my frustration on not given the chance to speak with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] person who was supposedly going to help save our home for us, I was told that all my calls and concerns would be noted in my file for all to see see. That was completely untruthful because every time I called in regarding my loan, I was asked the exact same questions as if I never called in. Also when I asked what documents were supposedly missing, the reps had no clue on what documents I was referring too or if any documents were received via fax. 

After multiple calls and left messages I finally got to speak with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was told she never received any faxed documents from me and told me then what missing documents were needed to continue my loan request. Without any delay I re-faxed all the missing documents to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] attention that evening and kept the faxed confirmation sheet stating all documents were completely delivered. 
I have legiable documented proof that all documents i faxed over on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and submitted to Wells Fargo Loan Mitigation Dept. were completely delivered to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

Sadly, Wells Fargo Loan Mitigation Department and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], would turn their backs on our situation by ignoring any further calls or email attempts I made on behalf of my home of 16 years. In the end, Wells Fargo had foreclosed on our home and auctioned off to the highest bidder on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Without legal notification or any required signatures made by either my husband or I. became a statistic as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the millions of struggling homeowners in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and sadly had worked so hard to keep this home of 16 years. 

So I hope and pray this 3rd attempt to be heard is taken seriously. I do not want a response back stating what Wells Fargo said happened. I want this case to be opened up and looked into the non communication and non responsive [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was to our case. In addition, I want someone to step in and investigate the documents that were faxed over and just misplaced. I want justice and I want to believe Wells Fargo is not a SCAM and that they do want to help people who are having hardships paying their mortgages.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a new home preservation specialist was called in to speak with a new home preservation specialist. he was told that all my calls and concerns would be noted in my file. ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4139,'10/26/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016, I called Capital One 360, regarding a fraudulent transaction on my checking account. Someone hacked into my online bank account and sent a cashier ''s check to a person I do n''t know, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], in the amount of {$2000.00} on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. In addition, I was charged a {$20.00} service charge for this fraudulent transaction. I told Capital One 360 that the amount of {$2000.00} had been deducted from my account because of the fraudulent cashier ''s check from someone hacking into my online bank account. Capital One 360 told me they would contact me within 48 hours to setup a new bank account, and my money would be redeposited into my new bank account because it was removed fraudulently from my old bank account which was closed by Capital One 360 on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when I reported the fraudulent transaction. 

As of today, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I have not heard back from Capital One 360 regarding my money, I am out {$2000.00} and no one from Capital One 360 has contacted me as to where the {$2000.00} is or how to setup a new bank account and deposit that amount into my new account. I called Capital One 360, fraud department on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and they asked me to send a screenshot of my iphone to check for malware, which I sent to Capital One 360 on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] via email. I also called Capital One 360, on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] because I had n''t heard back from Capital One 360 regarding the {$2000.00} that was fraudulent taken from my bank account. Capital One 360 told me to resend the screenshot of the malware check that I did on my iphone which I resent on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

As of today [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I have n''t heard back from Capital One 360, regarding my missing money {$2000.00}, which I am expecting to be reimbursed into a bank account in my name.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'a cashier ''check'' sent to a person I don''t know. a cashier''s check was sent to a person I do ');
