INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4187,'10/14/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Problems caused by my funds being low','I opened an account with my then boyfriend, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], at the US Bank branch he [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Illinois a couple years ago. I kept the account, even after we had broken up, as a savings vehicle. I rarely have more than {$100.00} in this account. The last time I checked the account, there was less than {$10.00}. I received an e-mail alert about a new balance yesterday and checked my account. It ''s in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] by $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. US Bank will not help me. They refuse to refund the overdraft! They state that I signed a form that gave them authority to authorize purchases on my card, even if I did n''t have the funds to back them up. They are refusing to give me a copy of the form I " supposedly '''' signed that gave them this permission. Furthermore, they left the final decision in my ex-boyfriend ''s court. He naturally denied to refund me the overdraft! I have tried to work with US Bank. I asked to close the account and they wo n''t. Even after I have paid {$150.00} towards the balance ( automatic debits that had the wrong information to draft from ), there are still overdraft fees to keep the account open. Every 8 days, they are going to charge me another {$25.00} for the overdraft fees!','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,2.0,'a new balance was found in the account of my then boyfriend. the account is in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] by $. the account is open');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4188,'10/14/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I recently pulled a copy of my credit report and noticed the following information are in error : Credit Inquires : The FCRA states that the only permissible purpose for pulling someone ''s credit report is a ) firm offer of credit b ) insurance c ) employment or d ) a court order. 
The following credit inquiries are related to none of the aforementioned permissible purposes : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] And [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] You have failed to provide me with a copy of any viable evidence, bearing my signature, showing the account is being reported accurately. 
Be aware that I am making a final goodwill attempt to have you clear up this matter. The listed item is entirely inaccurate and incomplete, and represents a very serious error in your reporting. I am maintaining a careful record of my communications with you for the purpose of filing a complaint with the FTC and the Attorney General ''s office, should you continue in your non-compliance of federal laws under the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act. I further remind you that you may be liable for your willful non-compliance, as per FDCPA 807. False or misleading representations [ 15 USC 1962e ] As you have now violated federal law, by not properly investigating and I have evidence of such, via certified mail receipts, you must now remove the item. Any other action ( or in-action ) on your behalf will result in a small claims action against your company. 
I will be seeking {$5000.00} in damages for the following : 1. ) Defamation 2. ) Negligent Enablement of Identity Fraud 3. ) Violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act You will be required to appear in a court venue local to me, in order to formally defend yourself.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'credit inquiries are related to none of the aforementioned permissible purposes. the only permissible purpose for pulling someone''s credit report is a firm offer of credit b');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4189,'10/13/2016','Consumer Loan','Vehicle loan','Managing the loan or lease','My new car ( less than [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] car payments were made ) was deemed un-repairable due to damages it sustained in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. It is financed through Well Fargo Dealer Services. My insurance company is handling the claim and waiting on them to issue the Letter of Guarantee since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 so they can issue them payment. The collections guy, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], was screaming at me when I tried to explain this. He said I was " changing the subject '''' and that I should n''t be avoiding paying my bills. I said I was n''t, that it will be paid in full once they release the document to my insurance company. He then continued to yell and talk over me and scream at me that I should n''t be getting a new car until this [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is dealt with. My insurance company has been trying to pay them since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16, 5 days after it was totaled. But Wells Fargo is holding up the process. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was so nasty saying things like, " Does n''t your insurance company give you a rental? ", etc. This may be true but it is none of his concern. I had to hang up on him as he would n''t let me speak and when he would he ''d scream at me and all I wanted to do was advise him that payment is pending if they release the letter of guarantee.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'my insurance company has been trying to pay them since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16. the letter of guarantee is pending if they release the document.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4190,'10/13/2016','Debt collection','Auto','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','Car was repossessed in 2009. The account went to a collection company which I paid. Now currently, Jefferson Capitol has recently added the debt to my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit files. I have never heard of or received anything from this company. I paid a different company back in 2009. This company just re-aged a paid account from another debt company and reported it on my credit which I know has to be illegal.','CL HOLDINGS LLC',2.0,2.0,'the account went to a collection company which I paid back in 2009. now, Jefferson Capitol has added the debt to my credit files.');
