INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4233,'10/03/2016','Mortgage','Reverse mortgage','Settlement process and costs','My parents ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) had a reverse mortgage on their property at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This reverse mortgage was recorded with the City of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My father passed away XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My mother repaid the mortgage on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My sister and I want to put the property in our Mom ''s name. Due to doing a title search. There is still an outstanding lien. The Financial Freedom Company has not completed the process of submission to the City of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','CIT BANK, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'parents had reverse mortgage on their property at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. my father passed away XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANON');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4234,'10/03/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Rewards','Over the summer American Express offered [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sky miles points for those who spend over 2000 during the first three months. Previously, over 3 years ago I closed an account with this card and was wondering if I applied would I be eligible for the rewards. So, before applying I went and spoke to an American Express agent at the airport ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). They told me that because of the time between accounts ( plus AE had different offerings at that time ) I would qualify for the bonus points if I spend the required amount. From that conversation, I went home applied, got approved, and spent the required amount. Now American Express is not awarding me the points because I ''m not eligible for them .... I feel completely taken advantage of and feel like that agent told me this just so that American Express can have one more card holder .... I ''ve reached out to them and they ''ve opened and closed a case investigating this issue without giving me the points I ''ve earned. Right now, I completely understand the qualification of this card, however, I should not be the person punished for the mistake their employee made by telling me I would qualify','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',6.0,6.0,'over the summer, I closed an account with this card and was wondering if I applied would I be eligible for the rewards. a ''compte_anony');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4235,'10/03/2016','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with my lender or servicer','Hello, I sent in a check to Navient to pay off one of the my loans in full. I included a letter with the check and indicated on the check which loan the monies should be applied to. Navient did not apply the monies to the correct loan. The loan does not show it is paid in full. Instead they arbitrarily spread the monies through all ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) loans.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'a check to Navient was sent to pay off one of the loans in full. the loan does not show it is paid in full.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4236,'10/02/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Billing disputes','With CapitalOne Bank I have wasted a lot of time during the last 4 months ( since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 ) while trying get back my money that a merchant stole from me. CapitalOne just keeps putting me through hassle again and again - by making me talk with its reps on the phone, fill out endless paperwork as a formal dispute, explain it all over again and again ... I have already filed a claim with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] before on this matter. All useless. The disputed amount keeps being refunded on my credit card and then rebuilt/charged back. I am not going to talk it over here again. Now, my resolution offer is as follows : send me a CHECK on DOUBLE disputed amount. Period.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'capitalOne has spent a lot of time trying to get back my money. I have already filed a claim with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] before.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4237,'10/02/2016','Debt collection','Medical','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','I am writing to complain about Central Financial Control Agency, CA reporting on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reports that I have unpaid medical payment. 
The balance on the medical bill was transferred to the collection agency by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], TX XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] due to an error from their billing department stating that I missed a monthly payment. I had to fax over my credit card statements showing that I made the payment before it was resolved. I asked for my account to be removed from collection, since it was an error on their part but was told that they could n''t retrieve it since it was already in collection. 
I started paying monthly payments of {$100.00} to Central Financial Control, CA from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and made the final payment of {$100.00} for the balance on my bill on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I asked for a letter stating that I had finished paying the medical bill ; I was told the letter would be sent to my address. I was surprised a few months after to receive a bill stating I was owing another {$100.00}. 
I called several times and was told that a refund was issued to my credit card and that caused me to owe that amount. I told them I did not receive any refund and faxed over my credit card statements showing no refund issued to me. I was told several times that it was being sent to their research department. I never got a response back and called for several months, even till XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
I felt it was resolved and forgot all about it, until I saw it on my credit reports XX/XX/2016. 
I paid the final balance on the bill on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and do not owe any amount since I did n''t get any refund on my credit card as stated by the collection agency. I want the {$100.00} medical item deleted from my credit report with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reporting agencies - [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
Thank you for your assistance in getting this resolved.','TENET HEALTHCARE CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'the balance on the medical bill was transferred to the collection agency. the balance on the medical bill was transferred to the collection agency. the balance was transferred to the collection agency.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4238,'10/01/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Credit determination','I applied for a credit card as well as a mortgage loan and was turn down when at that time when I applied for a mortgage with a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I was turn down and now a simple credit card I was turn down all because I think of my race all because I ''m a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] man who work [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] jobs and no criminal back ground and a honest paying tax payer so how in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I do n''t get approve shaking my head on this matter ... ..I think I need to sue everyone that ''s involved in this set back','FIRST NATIONAL BANK OF OMAHA',2.0,4.0,'i applied for a credit card as well as a mortgage loan and was turn down. now a simple credit card I was turn down all because I think of my race all');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4239,'10/01/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Billing disputes','While contacting Barclays to activate my rewards, the IVR stated that I had a payment due. Knowing that I had a payment posted today, I contacted their customer service at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The first man I spoke to informed me that they had not yet posted my payment and that it would take 2 business days to post. I asked if they would be effective dating the payment and he said no. I asked him if he was sure because they are required post my payment with the effective date as of when they receive my money. He again said no. He said their policy was 2 business days. I told him that they can not continue to charge me or any other customer interest if they already have my money. I asked to speak to a supervisor. After waiting on hold for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], his Supervisor [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] got on the phone. I asked her the same question, since you received my money today, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16, will you be effective dating my payment. She too said no, that their policy was that it would not be posted for 2 business days. I again said that that is not right. You have my money and you can not charge me interest from today [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( Friday ) until two business days next week ( Tuesday. ) I told her that is not acceptable and that I would be filing a complaint on the CFPB website. She told me to call back in two business days to verify the money was received. I told her I know the money was received by Barclays. I have a mobile confirmation and my bank also confirmed. She tried to say that my bank had not yet sent the money which was not accurate. She said that if I paid it on the Barclay ''s website I would have received credit today but since I sent the funds electronically from my bank, it would take 2 business days. I told her that is not fair and they are still obligated to effective date my payment today [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 regardless of when they post it because they had my money today. I have confirmation the money was received by Barclays today [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 and it was not posted to my account. When I called my bank, they said this was not the first complaint that they have had about Barclays. I would like a full audit of my account and an interest credit from Barclays for every payment that they have held my funds for two business days. I would also like interest on the interest that I was overcharged. I would like all prior payments effective dated the day they received my money.','BARCLAYS BANK DELAWARE',2.0,2.0,'I contacted barclays to activate my rewards, but they stated that I had a payment due. the first man I spoke to informed me that they had not yet posted my payment');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4240,'09/30/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','I ( co-borrower ) am currently applying for a modification with Bayview Loan Servicing. My file was under review, until I was notified by the underwriter that I must remove the primary borrower ( quit claim deed ) in order to proceed with my modification request. This to me seems to be unethical, that in order to continue the review for a modification my wife must relinquish her rights to the property per the hardship. 
Our current hardship is that we have legally separated. We both agreed to work on resolving the mortgage issue as we are both responsible for the loan. We have provided proof to our servicer that my wife ( borrower ) is not contributing to the household income. Yet this did not satisfy the servicer. 
The servicer is now requesting the removal of my wife from title, through a quit claim deed, so that my file remains under review. Please help us to determine if in fact this is truly a requirement for a modification review.','BAYVIEW LOAN SERVICING, LLC',2.0,2.0,'my file was under review until I was notified by the underwriter that I must remove the primary borrower. my wife must relinquish her rights to the property per the hardship');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4241,'09/30/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','I was experiencing hardship and requested my mortgage company, Seterus to assist me in reducing my payment. I was always on time and current with my payments prior to my request for assistance. Originally, I was told that I did n''t qualify unless I was late with my payments. I was told that I must be late or delinquent with my payments before they would consider my case for approval. I submitted a letter which detailed my hardship. I expressed that I am responsible for my debt and I want to pay my payments on time ; however, I foresee it becoming very difficult to maintain all accounts as I was operating with a negative balance. My payments were lowered for a temporary period until the loan modification was complete. My original payment was apprx. {$1600.00} and my payments were lowered to apprx {$1200.00}. I paid these payments directed by Seterus, on time during this period ( 10-12 months ) before the modification became final. I recently ran my credit score and my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] shows that I have been late 6 months, which is incorrect. Seterus report my account late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was never late. I made the temp mod payments on time and continue to pay my mortgage on time. I have paid my mortgage on time since I bought the property in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I filed a complaint through the credit bureau challenging the information they have posted on my account. My account lists as a FHA and conventional loan. Unsure if it is reported correct.','Seterus, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'my payments were lowered for a temporary period until the loan modification was complete. my original payment was apprx. $1600.00 and my payments were lowered to');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4242,'09/30/2016','Bank account or service','Savings account','Making/receiving payments, sending money','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016 a double payment has been made on my personal loan by mistake, I made a payment from my saving account to my personal loan and an ACH was processed ; I could n''t afford to process both and I called the bank to requested a refund of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payments. As a result of my request the bank processed multiple unauthorized transactions moving money back and forth from my saving account and my personal loan. After a few days I checked my online banking and a big red flag showed on the screen indicating a 41 days past due payment due of more than [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars, and this late payment was already reported to the credit agencies for no reasons. After a series of phone calls and speaking with bank employees who had no idea on what to do finally I got connected with and executive office employee who at least was able to understand the problem and seemed to be able to do something about it ; as a result I received a letter from the bank saying that they made a mistake and would communicate it to the credit agencies to clear my credit report and the case would be closed. On the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I checked my online bank and my saving account was short the amount of {$810.00}, the bank withdrew the money without giving me notice or advice and without my authorization, without explanation. After multiple phone calls and email to the same executive office employee the explanation given to me was that nobody could understand why the money was withdrawn and most important where it went. After almost a month I received a senseless letter containing information that once more does n''t explain to me why they took the money, it does n''t report the right information about my account and it is an insult of my intelligence personally and as a client.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'a double payment has been made on my personal loan by mistake. the bank processed multiple unauthorized transactions moving money back and forth from my saving account and my personal loan. after ');
