INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4250,'09/29/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','This company has attempted to collect a debt that is not valid. I changed cell services from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The final bill and Early Termination Fees were to be paid by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but this never happened.','Southwest Credit Systems, L.P.',2.0,2.0,'a debt that is not valid was to be paid by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the final bill and Early Termination Fees were to be paid by');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4251,'09/28/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Taking/threatening an illegal action','The City of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Texas is attempting to collect " outstanding balances '''' owed on traffic tickets. The city indicates that because this is not a " consumer debt '''', e.g., a credit card, it may use the threatening collection tactics and communication ( issuance of an arrest warrant, towing or booting vehicles ) as a lawful means to collect. 

The City also threatens forwarding the unpaid account to a collection agency and increasing the balance owed by a usurious interest amount of 30 %. 

The City of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is also attempting to collect debts older than 4 years old, but does not disclose to the individual i the notice letter that the debt may be " uncollectable '''' as a result of the expiration of a statute of limitations. 

However, the City is attempting to collect using other threatening means. The City of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] argues that this debt is not covered by FDCPA because it is not a consumer debt and has cited federal court authority ( see attached ). However, the vast majority of these individuals face the lose or suspension of their driving privileges, a right and necessity many MUST have in order to work and support their families. Therefore, this action raises constitutional concerns regarding the loss, suspension or deprivation of a necessary right without due process of law..','LINEBARGER GOGGAN BLAIR & SAMPSON LLP',2.0,2.0,'the city of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is attempting to collect " outstanding balances '''' owed on traffic tickets. the city indicates that this is');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4252,'09/28/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I paid off my mortgage with US Bank on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016. I was tolt that it would be a few weeks before an escrow refund would be processed. After not receiving the refund I called US bank on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016. They informed me that the refund was processed on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016 and that I should wait a bit longer for the check. I called back a week later and again informed them that my check had not been received. This time they informed me that they could not issue another check until after 30 days and that if they did, I would have to pay a fee to have them reissue the fee. It was my responsibility since they " mailed the check to the right address. '''' This is an unfair practice since every mortgage payment that is mailed to them is the responsibility of the customer until they receive the money. If I mail them a check that " gets lost in the mail '''' I not only have to pay the stop payment fee but I would also incur a late fee on the mortgage. The bank should be held to the same standard of responsibility that they hold the customer to. I have informed the bank that I do not have the check and they have an opportunity to stop payment to avoid fraud. I expect that if someone else were to intercept the check and cash it fraudulently I would be out the money or, at least, bear the sole burden of proof that it was n''t me. This is also inappropriate given that I already notified them of failure to deliver within a reasonable timeframe.','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,4.0,'escrow refund was processed on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016. after not receiving the refund,');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4253,'09/28/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Problems caused by my funds being low','they took my whole social security check i had no food my bills got turned off','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,2.0,'i had no food my bills got turned off. they took my whole social security check.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4254,'09/28/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Other','There was a balance on my credit card. I was informed that the money from my savings account would be released ice I paid the balance. After passing the balance, they transfer money from my savings toward the credit card. I was never notified of there intention to close the credit card or to take money from my savings account. Without notice of choosing the account','NAVY FEDERAL CREDIT UNION',2.0,2.0,'the balance was passed on to me. the balance was released ice I paid the balance.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4255,'09/28/2016','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Loan Consolidation on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015. He assured me that once I went through the process and paid {$590.00} to consolidate my loans, they would pay my loans off. I would pay $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/month. I have been paying since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2015 and contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to discuss my total loan amount that I saw on their website. It was {$2000.00} more than my initial amount and they told me that my loans had not been paid since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2015.','Student Assist Plus LLC',2.0,2.0,'he assured me that once I went through the process and paid $590.00 to consolidate my loans, they would pay my loans off. he assured me that once');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4256,'09/27/2016','Debt collection','Medical','False statements or representation','Debt collection agency continues to add interest to my medical debt. They ca n''t provide me with the interest rate information when asked. I am told just pay this and it wo n''t matter we will waive the interest when you pay us off.','Aargon Agency, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'debt collection agency continues to add interest to my medical debt. they can''t provide me with the interest rate information when asked.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4257,'09/27/2016','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I am writing in regards to the late payments on my account. In the years [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was dealing with personal illness and death in my family. I had even started the process of applying to have my student loans permanently discharged. Due to illness I was unable to work, and that is why I got behind in my loan payments. Nelnet was notified of this health issue, and I started the discharge of loan application with Nelnet, so Nelnet was property notified of my health issues and therefore should not have any negative postings on my credit. Today my health has recovered substantially, and I do work, and I am a graduate student. Upon graduation I will gladly work with Nelnet to repay my student loans ( currently they are both in deferment and in the low income repayment plan ). I wish to say my ability to repay Nelnet would be substantially increased if Nelnet removes the late payments from my credit report. While it is and always was my responsibility to repay my loans and work with Nelnet on that matter, I should not be permanently penalized for this matter because doing so impedes my ability to earn money and pay Nelnet back. Please remove the late payments from all three major credit bureaus. I have been responsible for Nelnet payments or keeping my status up to date for about two years now. After disputing this on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had deleted all but one of the negative accounts. But then Nelnet decided to repost the negative entries.','NELNET, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a graduate student has been responsible for the late payments on my account. a few negative accounts were deleted.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4258,'09/27/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I am in the process of obtaining a mortgage. I applied with a mortgage company that after looking at my credit report indicated that they not process my application because I have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts with disputes, and that they would not process the loan unless I remove the dispute. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the disputes is with collection accounts with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
I had disputed the account because [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was never able to validate the account and they are claiming an amount for medical services received in NJ in 2012. I have not received medical services in NJ. Last time I received services was due to hospitalization in 2012. 

Reluctant to do and following the instructions of the mortgage company I requested ( see attached a removal of the dispute ). Transunion incorrectly classified the account as a new account placed for collection. My credit score declined overnight from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] due to the wrong coding of the account. 
Although, I know I do n''t owe the money I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to try to settle the account because I will not be able to obtain a loan with the decline in the credit score caused by Transunion. When I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] today they indicated that they do n''t have that account anymore and refused to provide me with an explanation of what happened. Nevertheless Transunion continues to report the account and now to make matters worse they reported this as new account placed for collection. 
In addition to that Transunion does not let me do a new dispute online to provide them with the information I am including here. 
I am requesting that Transunion take immediate action to remove the account completely from my credit report and bring back the score to the level it should be without that account.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a mortgage company has disputed my application because of the wrong coding of the account. the company has not processed my application because of the dispute. the company has not received medical');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4259,'09/27/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Disclosure verification of debt','I cancelled [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] over the phone and they kept my account open for an additional month while I was connected with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When I received a bill from them I told them that I had cancelled my services through them as of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2014 but yet they still sent me bills and they turned it over to a collection agency previous collection [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had dismissed the bill but now I am getting bills from ENHANCED RECOVERY CORP and they also notified [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. If I cancel my service with their customer service, there should be no reason to pay for an additional month.','ERC',2.0,2.0,'if I cancel my service with their customer service, there should be no reason to pay for an additional month.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4260,'09/27/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I have an incorrect address on my credit file and I also would like to update my employer. I spoke with the credit bureau and after answering extension questioning my file was not updated.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'the credit bureau has an incorrect address on my credit file. I spoke with the credit bureau and my file was not updated.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4261,'09/26/2016','Prepaid card','General purpose card','Managing, opening, or closing account','I had a wells fargo gift card worth {$500.00} which i lost, ( remaining balance was about {$480.00} ) I reported it lost XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called in to report and completed the verification and requested a cheque for the balance to be issued. I was informed of the {$15.00} fees for the cheque to which i agreed. However it has been 4 months and i still have not received the cheque. I called in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as well as XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to check on the status and was assured that the funds have been processed and cheque would be sent out shortly. 

Now, as i try to follow up, I am being asked to verify the transactions right to the dollar amount. I last used the card in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and i am unable to remember the exact dollar amount. 

I had previously verified my identity and confirmed the remaining balance on the card, however now i am only givin [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] option to verify the card which is my last transaction. 

I think this is very wrong and non flexible policies by wells fargo to make me jump over the same hoop over and over again','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'i had a wells fargo gift card worth $500.00 which i lost. i reported it lost XX/XX/[COMPTE');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4262,'09/26/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','Out of the blue, a negative credit item has appeared on my Experian credit report from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], partial account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], with the original creditor OHSU Faculty Practice. I have never bought any services from this creditor, nor had an account with this creditor, nor have I any knowledge of this creditor or the original creditor. Apparently it is based on Oregon, where my ex-wife lives. I have been divorced from her for 6 years and she is no longer named [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but rather has the legal name " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. '''' I never agreed to enter into any joint account with her or have any joint responsibility with her. To have this account added to my credit report based on a date opened of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2010 and a date of status of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2010 is bizarre. This may be an obligation of my ex-wife but it is emphatically not my obligation. This must be removed immediately.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a negative credit item has appeared on my Experian credit report. it is based on a date opened of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2010 ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4263,'09/26/2016','Debt collection','Payday loan','False statements or representation','I have an agreement with Jefferson Capital ( represented in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Consumer Debt Management ) to complete the payment of a debt. From XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] this company wo n''t accept the payment and today this company call me back ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) to say that the agreement is not valid and I will pay another amount. Eliminating the agreement without any valid reason. I have all evidence of payments and agreement.','CL HOLDINGS LLC',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] consumer debt management has signed an agreement. the agreement is not valid and I will pay another amount ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4264,'09/26/2016','Mortgage','Conventional adjustable mortgage (ARM)','Settlement process and costs','I have a mortgage with Chase, loan number for my condo in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which I have been paying regularly with automated payments for over two years. Last month, I decided to get my mortgage refinanced with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as the rates provided by them are lower than my rate. Chase has informed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that they have lost my mortgage note and hence are stonewalling my efforts to refinance my mortgage with their competitor. This is an outrage as it prevents the customer from getting the best deal possible from a competing institution. I need a remedy and assistance in resolving this matter as it is preventing me from achieving significant savings.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'mortgage number for condo in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is refinanced with Chase. the rates provided by them are lower than my rate. this is an');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4265,'09/25/2016','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Credit decision / Underwriting','I am disputing an erroneous notation on my Credit Report by Wells Fargo, stating I have a foreclosure on a home in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was solicited by Wells Fargo for a Loan Modification ( which I since learned was not permissible, per the Missouri Attorney General ''s Office ). I was also asked by the loan officer handling the modification to create a false [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from a company I owned, in order to be eligible for the loan. I explained that was illegal and I would not do it. The same loan officer requested the same illegal action a second time on a different day. When I informed her it was illegal, and I would not do it, my loan modification was denied, and I was told I needed to file again, which I did, and later learned that by doing so, Wells Fargo would likely receive a bonus from the Federal Government for an additional new application. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the loan modification was approved under my threat of charges being filed for the illegal actions by Wells Fargo and I was told the foreclosure they had begun would be removed from my credit report. It was just brought to my attention within the past month that the foreclosure is still showing on my credit report, causing a lower credit score, and in turn, causing insurance rates to be higher for the past 4 years, interest rates on loans such as my car and my credit card with Wells Fargo to be higher, and to be denied a credit card by a different company, as well as denied a home loan so I could sell the home financed by Wells Fargo. Additionally, during the modification process, I was told that my initial home loan and my home equity loan would be consolidated into one loan ( the home equity loan having a very high interest rate ), but upon approval of the modification, I was told the modification only encompassed the original home loan and that I would have to refile and go through the same 10-month process to request a modification of the home equity loan, and that they needed to keep them as two separate accounts. Due to the issues with the modification of the first loan, I did not apply or request modification on the 2nd loan. 

I have made consistent payments on the modification ( copy of bank statement showing auto withdrawals for both mortgage accounts with Wells Fargo attached ) I have been working with my insurance agent to improve my rates for insurance, as shown by the attached, as well, however, they are not able to see WHY the credit rating dropped so drastically, but can only tell me it has, and therefore, my rates increased and coverage decreased ( copies of paperwork for that are attached ), and the denial letter for a new credit card is attached ( I followed up with them only to be told there was a negative statement on my credit report ) and a copy of the credit report run by a different mortgage company in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], when I was first informed why the rating had dropped and that I was ineligible for a loan with a different company other than Wells Fargo.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'loan modification was approved under my threat of charges being filed. the modification was approved under my threat of charges being filed. the modification was approved under my threat of charges being filed.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4266,'09/25/2016','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with my lender or servicer','This is my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] submission regarding the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I paid {$1000.00} to try to reduce my loan ; however, they charged {$170.00} in interest, and paid {$820.00} towards the principal. Basically, I am being penalized for paying early. I had satisfied my monthly payment right before making this payment and specifically directed them to pay down my principal, not interest. If they charge me interest every time I make an extra payment, that is neither legal nor fair. Please instruct them to accept payment on principal and to stop penalizing early payments.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'i paid $1000.00 to try to reduce my loan. but they charged $170.00 in interest, and paid $820.00 towards the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4267,'09/25/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','A fraudulent bank account was opened in my name at an address that has never been associated with me. I have previously filed a complaint with the CFPB and was informed by Fifth Third Bank that this had been resolved XX/XX/2014, as they confirmed it was a fraudulent account. Upon going through a recent refinance, I have found out that their {$200.00} collection account with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] still appears on my credit report. This has affected my credit score by showing an open collection account that is completely inaccurate. I have jumped through hoops just to prove their mistake and inaccuracy and should not have to go through this again. Please help, as this is now creating undeserved stress on me. 
Thank you.','FIFTH THIRD FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'a fraudulent bank account was opened in my name at an address that has never been associated with me. the CFPB confirmed this had been resolved XX/XX/2014');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4268,'09/24/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','My Bank of America UTMA account for my son was opened years ago. BOA insisted on a joint checking and savings account, though I needed only a savings account. The last two months, without warning, BOA has been charging me a $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] monthly maintenance fee for the checking account, which has no deposits, and claims that I owe them {$32.00}. I am trying to close the account. BOA refuses to accept consumer emails unless it is a request for a copy of a check or statement ; refuses to provide a mailing address for consumer complaints ; and insists on limiting consumers to only phone call contact ( resulting in no documented record of what happened ) or instant messaging, but the BOA live chat system is perpetually busy. I am now on perpetual hold to BOA. This is unacceptable and deceptive. It would not be surprising if BOA is trying to gouge many others with this practice of assessing unannounced fees on checking accounts on unsuspecting consumers, and then refusing or obstructing the ability of consumers to request that the account be closed.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'my son''s bank of America UTMA account was opened years ago. BOA has been charging me a $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] monthly maintenance');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4269,'09/24/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I have a tax lien on my credit report that should n''t be on there.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'tax lien shouldn''t be on credit report.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4270,'09/23/2016','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with my lender or servicer','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I consolidated my subsidized and nonsubsidized Stafford student loans through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). I signed a contract for consolidation because the fixed interest rate would reduce from 2.875 % to 1.875 % after 48 timely monthly payments, which it did during XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] by Nelnet, who became the loan servicer XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I received an email from Nelnet indicating that my interest rate was " adjusted. '''' Upon an online review of my account, I noticed that the interest rate increased back to 2.875 %. I called the customer service number three times and was informed that effective XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my student loan rate was increased by 1 % to 2.87 %. The Nelnet representatives informed me that I was no longer eligible for the reduced rate because of an error. I requested specifics and was told that no further information was available. The representatives refused to allow me to speak with a supervisor. 
The attached documents clearly support my narrative. Should you require additional documentation, please let me know. Thank you for your assistance in this matter.','NELNET, INC.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] consolidated my subsidized and nonsubsidized student loans. the fixed interest rate would reduce from');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4271,'09/23/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Deposits and withdrawals','. When you go into your chase account and make a future payment to any chase product you do not have the ability to see pending payments in the account that the payment is being made from. You can see other future pending payments for non chase payments though. Chase has decided that you should only see pending payments for their products in the account the will be credited not the account that will be debited. Chase can not and will not show their customers a true representation of what will be occurring in their checking or saving accounts. Most consumers have multiple accounts with chase. Such as mortgage, home equity loan, credit cards, car loans, student loans and so on. If you share bill paying responsibility with a spouse you will have no idea if a pending payment has been made from your checking or saving account. You must scroll though the multiple other screens to each product to see what is going on in your checking account. Why ca n''t you see it in your checking account? OVERDRAFT FEES. And late payment fees. Why would they take your ability away to actually tell what is going on in your account. It is all about fees. As a consumer we should be able to see our accounts online and to be able to see all debit activity and all pending debit activity for all payments in those account. we must be able to reconcile what debits will be made from your accounts for all activity and not just activity chase feels you should see.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'you can see other future pending payments for non chase payments. you can see other future pending payments for non chase payments.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4272,'09/23/2016','Debt collection','Mortgage','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','My uncle had a little house is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The lenders kept sucking him into cash out refinance and continued to attempt to do it even after being told he had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I am a real estate broker and quickly ran comps. He was upside down during the time they were still trying to cash out refinance. The house was worth about [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and he owed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I cleaned up the house so he could go home to live his final days and I cleaned it out more upon his death. I live in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and this involved several trips and time away from my business to do so. The bank then tried to get a default judgment on me even though I was never living in the home, never a signer on his bank account, and never on his mortgage and I lived over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] miles away! I had to spend thousands of dollars defending myself from this legal action. My husband and I were in the process of building a home a home here, and this would have messed up our financing! Despite a court order dismissing me from the case, the bank continues to try and collect from me. My uncle passed on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I ''m filing this complaint on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. M & T Bank is a predatory lender on elderly veterans, and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is unscrupulous company that is violating the debt collection laws. Also, note that I left the house cleaner than any repo I ''ve handled in my 17 years in the real estate industry. 

Please note : I put my personal information on this form. My uncle was the retired veteran.','M&T BANK CORPORATION',4.0,6.0,'my uncle had a little house in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and he owed it. the bank tried to get a default judgment on me even');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4273,'09/23/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Customer service / Customer relations','I have tried unsuccessfully with Bank Of America ( BA ) to resolve this issue. 

I must have been online in my BA account ( I have BA checking and a credit card ) on XX/XX/2016. I was paying bills. I noticed that my BA credit card showed my minimum payment due for XX/XX/2016. I went ahead and set up a transfer from my checking account of more than enough to cover the minimum payment. MY BA checking account shows that money coming out on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My BA credit card statement shows that money being credited on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

I was paying bills on the night of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I noticed my BA credit card was still showing the minimum payment due on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called the number on my credit card and talked to a reprehensive at BA. She told me that she saw what happened and did not understand why it was not showing the payment due being paid. She noted my file. 

I was on my PC paying bills again on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and decided to pay an additional payment, because I had charged more than I wanted to so far that month. When I got back on after XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], around XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], my BA account showed my account as past due. 

BA credit card is saying since I set up the transaction on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], It was applied to my previous statement! How can that be when it shows coming out and going in on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]? BA has a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] system. 

I have called BA, sent a letter to BA credit card dept. and went into the local branch. All I get out of BA is tough luck that is our system and it ca n''t be fixed. They will supposedly waive the late fee, but I have no idea how this will affect my credit. They want me to pay an additional payment. Is this any way to run a major bank?','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'a credit card shows that money coming out on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. a credit card statement shows that money coming');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4274,'09/22/2016','Debt collection','Credit card','Disclosure verification of debt','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16, I sent a certified letter to this company requesting for " validation '''' via a document bearing my signature that I owe this debt and that it is valid. I waited 31 days, and received no response from this first letter. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16, i sent a second certified letter to this company asking for " validation '''' via a document bearing my signature that this debt belongs to me and is valid. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 they responded via a letter, but did not provide anything with my signature on it. Instead stated that I did not provide sufficient information and that I needed to send them documents. Basically giving me the runaround and not providing what I asked for in the two certified letters I sent them.','ENCORE CAPITAL GROUP INC.',2.0,2.0,'on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16, i sent a certified letter to this company asking for "');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4275,'09/22/2016','Credit card',NULL,'APR or interest rate','Twice I have been charged interest after paying my balance in full. I have called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] times and had the charges reversed but I am afraid people that do n''t go over their bills carefully are being charged in error.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'I have called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] times and had the charges reversed.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4276,'09/22/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','I have disputed the account [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] This account was paid off and it was not my account. I did not open this account. This is a fraudulent account. I want it removed immediately from my credit report please. Once this is removed i want a investigation with the correct FICO Score.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'i have disputed the account [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] This account was paid off and it was not my account. I want it removed immediately from my credit');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4277,'09/22/2016','Consumer Loan','Installment loan','Problems when you are unable to pay','I obtained a loan through Argon. The payments were being made by direct debit out of my checking account. I contacted Argon XX/XX/2016 and informed them that I no longer wanted payments direct debited from my checking account. According to their disclosure statement I was within my rights to do so. They stopped debiting the payments. However on XX/XX/2016, Argon proceeded to debit my checking account without my permission after I have instructed them not to. They clearly violated my rights under the Federal Trade Act and obtained the money illegally without my permission.','Argon Credit',2.0,2.0,'the payments were being made by direct debit out of my checking account. I contacted Argon XX/XX/2016 and informed them that I no longer wanted payments direct debite');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4278,'09/22/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Citibank offered a {$400.00} bonus for opening a checking account and funding within 30 days. Citibank reneged on this promise. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I submitted funding request together with account application. Despite the fact that I have been a customer for last 20 odd years, Citibank demanded further proof of address. This delayed their completion of EFT funding to 32 days. Now Citibank is denying payment of promised {$400.00} bonus.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'Citibank offered a $400.00 bonus for opening a checking account. the bonus was delayed to 32 days.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4279,'09/21/2016','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Using a debit or ATM card','This is the letter I sent to Senator [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Senator [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], thank you for investigating Wells Fargo. My issue is that in 2007, Wells Fargo issued a debit card in my name and sent it to a address did not reside at anymore. I retired XX/XX/2007 from the CID IRS. I was not living in the state when they sent this unauthorized card. I had moved to a house I purchased in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. During this time frame I wanted to refinance my house in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in order to get a better rate. I was denied and told that I owed Wells Fargo money I had not paid back. I contacted Wells Fargo and gave them my new address and phone number. I instructed them as to how to find out who used this card and sent an affidavit stating I had never ask for or received this card. They then started to call and threaten me to the tune of over 600 calls. This lasted for over 2 years. They then sold this debt to a collection agency in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it started all over again. I could not get refinancing for my house in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I ended up losing both. I then had to use my 401 money I was saving for old age income and ended up having to pay penalty and additional tax rates of over {$48000.00} I would not have had to incur. Since the government has fined them, how can I apply for some of this fine for the actions they took against me and the fact that they destroyed my credit during this entire time frame. I have just now gotten a credit score that allows me to finance my current home. I would appreciate you help in this matter as I have contacted our state senator with no help. Can I fill out forms to receive some of the money back that I incurred for relating to all of this illegal activity and the ruining of my credit. The credit agencies would not help at all. Please continue to get the big brass removed or prosecuted. Thank you for all that you have been doing.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'a letter from a senator from the state of california sent to me. he said that he was not living in the state when they sent a');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4280,'09/21/2016','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','To whom it may concern : I had a loan with Nationstar Mortgage since 2010 I was selling my home and I missed 2 payments and had set up a repayment plan and paid the first of 3 installments. I had an offer on the house as it was for sale and talked frequently with Nationstar as we got closer to closing and even though I missed payment 2 of the payment plan I told them the closing date was just 15 days after the payment was due. Then [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] called to get payoff and all documents needed for closing, the day after that happened Nationstar all of the sudden put {$4700.00} in legal fees 5 days before closing after I had been in constant contact with them. No one from Nationstar or the Attorney themselves can justify what was done for the {$4700.00} [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] also looked up my home and there was nothing started or posted about a foreclosure on my home. I have paid off this loan and am disputing with Nationstar about the fees but they are giving me the run around and are not providing any documentation as to what the fees went to. I admit I was behind but i was very open and honest with Nationstar and told them this was a done deal with the sale of the house and the way they conducted themselves and put the fees on right before closing was very questionable.','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',2.0,2.0,'I had a loan with Nationstar Mortgage since 2010. I had a repayment plan and paid the first of 3 installments. the closing date was just 15 days after the payment');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4281,'09/21/2016','Debt collection','Medical','Improper contact or sharing of info','I was informed by one of the employees and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that that had had computer problem and that they reported old info and paid info to the credit unions on account they should not have. I have also notified them that they were not to call my personal cell and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] continues to call my cell ... .[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has informed me that they do n''t work with Advanced Bureau of Collections located at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Ga [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','Advance Bureau of Collections',2.0,2.0,'a credit union employee told me that they were not to call my cell. they reported old info and paid info to the credit unions. they did not work with Advanced Bureau of');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4282,'09/21/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Balance transfer','Discover and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] offer [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] percent interest card for 12 months on balance transfers. In the fine print with Discover they state there is a charge of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] percent each month on the remaining balance at end of month. I did not see that as it was buried in fine print. BofA doing something similar. I got a card from each and now have to make payments every month on both cards. It ''s deceiving. Only option is to cancel the cards but hurts my credit score.','DISCOVER BANK',2.0,2.0,'Discover and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] offer a card for 12 months on balance transfers. it is a charge of [COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4283,'09/21/2016','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I disputed this loan and credit bureaus remove them, then Federal loan servicing keeps putting it back on my credit report after it ''s removal and keep reporting a missed payment which is not correct and when they reported the missed payment it ''s last period of reporting on my credit with no more payment history at all','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'federal loan servicing keeps putting it back on my credit report after it''s removal'' and report a missed payment which is not correct. when they reported the missed payment it ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4284,'09/21/2016','Debt collection','Medical','Communication tactics','RevenueGroup collection agency sent a collection notice to me for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] WITHOUT ever sending me a statement or paper bill via mail in the first place as I had previously requested. After inquirery with RevenueGroup, the representative insisted I pay immediately over the phone to avoid legal action and damage to my credit. He refused to investigate the issue. I have no idea what the exact charge is for. His tone was very rude and condesending. No contact whatsoever had been made to me regarding this charge by The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] group prior to the collection notice.','Revenue Assistance Corporation dba Revenue Group',2.0,2.0,'RevenueGroup collection agency sent collection notice to me for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANON');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4285,'09/20/2016','Debt collection','Payday loan','Communication tactics','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2014, I received a PayDay loan from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was unable to pay the loan off, since I have n''t been working, due to a car accident. The loan was sold to premier Portfolio Group, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], NY [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], www.premierportfoliogroup.com. They have called all my references and provided them with details of the loan and they have threatened me with a law suit and the amount i will owe with court costs and attorney fees. I want them to stop contacting all my references and stop threatening me.','Premier Portfolio Group',2.0,2.0,'the loan was sold to premier Portfolio Group, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4286,'09/20/2016','Mortgage','Conventional adjustable mortgage (ARM)','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I reached out to Wells Fargo and informed them that I was having difficulties with making my payments due to my husband ( at the time ) loss of income for the past several months. I was informed that I may qualify for the home modification. Not, knowing much about the process, I agreed to proceed. Shortly after the modification process began, I then lost my job as well. There was minimal to no income for a short period of time. Full modification packages were sent to Wells Fargo several times from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When an trial period plan was finally offered on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], there was approximately {$120000.00} in overdue payment added to the balance of the mortgage. First payment was due on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( after years of reaching out to Wells Fargo for assistance ). XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I reached out to Wells Fargo and informed them that my current situation has changed, my husband filed for divorce and moved out. My household income went from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I asked if the trail offer can be reviewed with my income only, Wells Fargo did not respond nor was I informed that it was not an option. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a sale date was placed on my home. I had to file an action to show cause on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and had much evidence to present to the judge showing that I ''ve been reaching out to Wells Fargo for years for a modification, but due to the change in my circumstance was trying to see if there was anything that can be done, if not, I will make the trail payments. The judge ordered Wells Fargo to work with me and reinstate the trail offer payments. During XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Wells Fargo and their attorneys refused to speak to me or my attorney. We were told that since the case is in litigation they can not speak to us. During this time, late fees is being accrued. I was sending letters after letters, full modification packages after packages, but no response until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], when was informed that another sale date of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was placed on my home. I reached out to Wells Fargo, pleading with them to work with me. I sent in another modification package, but they refuse to review stating that there was no significant change in circumstance to warrant another review. The fact is my circumstance did change. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at XXXXEST I received a call from Wells Fargo , and after weeks of giving me the runaround, I was told that unfortunately there was nothing that can be done and my home will go up for sale on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I refused to accept this. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was forced to file bankruptcy to stop the sale date. This was only to buy time, so from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to the present time, I have been again sending complete modification packages for review, but each time, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] would respond back that they will not review due to no significant change. I find it mind blowing that Wells Fargo will sell my home to complete stranger, instead of working with me. There is currently another sale date on my home for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Here ''s the current status : I ''ve submitted several offers for my home to either write offer the full amount, the late fees, or offer me the asking sale cost. Proof of funds was provided and I can afford my home. Current mortgage amount $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and now there ''s $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in accrued late fees. WF was selling my home for $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] rather than extending that offer to me. When I started the modification process I was never told that my credit would be destroyed, so although I have a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] income, due to my credit score I can not get another home mortgage, rent a location, and do not qualify for low income housing. I have a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] year old daughter and Wells Fargo rather have us evicted in lieu of working with me. Is this the system that we have in place? My only option is to pay the late fees ( $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and my mortgage of $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), but they will sell my home for $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and have me and my daughter live on the street. NONSENSE!!!','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was having difficulties making payments due to my husband''s loss of income. the judge ordered Wells');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4287,'09/20/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','showing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on Experian acct. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Not my account. Please take off as I am trying to close on a house and This is holding up the closing','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a house is holding up the closing. this is holding up the closing.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4288,'09/20/2016','Debt collection','Credit card','Improper contact or sharing of info','Zwicker and Associates dropped off paperwork to my significant other, handing him a copy of the legal filing - unsealed, unstapled, and completely visible. In doing so, they disclosed this filing to my significant other, potentially in an attempt to embarrass and pressure me. This disclosure is illegal and should be addressed.','ZWICKER & ASSOCIATES',2.0,2.0,'Zwicker and Associates dropped off paperwork to my significant other. they disclosed the legal filing to my significant other. this disclosure is illegal and should be addressed.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4289,'09/20/2016','Debt collection','Credit card','Taking/threatening an illegal action','Company calls and does not provide name. It is a robo call that says I will " be sued on my social security number if I do not call immediately. '''' I called them back quickly. Original calls receive two years ago from same company claimed it was on an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] debt 16 years old, new calls claim its on a Capital One debt 3 years old. When I questioned them, they said yea Capital One took over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They say I can pay them now or be embarrassed when the sheriff comes to my job to visit me. They used my old married name from 4 years ago and not even my current name so it can not be 3 years old. I do not and never had a card from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I even pulled a credit report first time they called. Nothing shows up at all for this collection agency nor the creditor that I claim to owe. I asked them to stop calling and they said fine then we will have the sheriff come visit you. They are aggressive on the phone and when I ask questions they say you know you owe money, cut me off mid sentence and tell me to pay. Last time they called me a dead beat.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'original calls received from same company claimed it was on an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] debt 16 years old. new calls claim its on a Capital One debt 3');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4290,'09/20/2016','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','I had a mortgage with Wells Fargo Bank, who after my husband passed away from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] refused to help with loan modification after I [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from my husband passing. They told me that my credit score needed to be at least at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], then never helped me with a loan modification, and later foreclosed on my house.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'mortgage was refused by Wells Fargo Bank after husband passed away. they told me credit score needed to be at least at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] then never');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4291,'09/19/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Improper contact or sharing of info','I [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] does have a legitimate dispute that the Federal Trade Commission should investigate. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a resolution was presented to the United States [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] labeled [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This resolution was designed to specifically give permission for public utilities to post payment information against individuals for any public utility. This would have meant the redefining of the meaning of what credit was or represented. The Fair Credit Reporting Act was initiated and procured as federal law in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to establish a level playing field between consumers and the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] system. Public utilities are regulated by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] throughout every state and in many cases municipalities throughout the country. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] failed to make it out of committee and was never voted upon. In retrospect, public utilities abuse the Fair Credit Reporting Act by using the credit reporting process, even though by law they are not entitled to it. Any mention contractually that a company such as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] could use my personal information such as my social security number to report anything against me would be a serious violation of my constitutional rights. The use of my information by transfer would need to be established in writing, and that in itself could cause problems against [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in class action proportions. Because of a delay in the transfer of cable/wireless equipment to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a transfer that contained no additional remuneration, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] decided to abuse my personal credit report by the transfer of my personal information such as my social security number. This in itself is nothing less than identity theft. Accordingly, my file information from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the collection agency known as Eastern Account System needs to be purged immediately and permanently. I make my identity theft claim based upon the transfer of personal information [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had no right to share with any third party to begin with. My complaint is real and 100 % legitimate. My file information must be purged immediately and permanently.','Eastern Account Systems of Connecticut, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a resolution was presented to the united states. it was designed to give permission for public utilities to post payment information. this would have meant the redefining of the meaning of what');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4292,'09/19/2016','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Application, originator, mortgage broker','Suntrust allowed a person to complete loan documents and sign a second mortgage against my property and remove {$300000.00} without my consent, knowledge or any authorization to do so. This person along with Suntrust attempted to cover up this deal by attempted to transfer my property solely into the name of the person who signed the loan/mortgage. The mortgage is in the persons name and the Deed is solely in my name. Suntrust refuses to release the loan documents to me after repeated attempts because the loan transaction was complete before the person attempted to transfer the property into his name. The Loan documents were not signed by the deeded owner. They also refuse to release the notes or conversations relating to the business regarding my home. Because I NEVER spoke with them nor solicited their business at any point.','SUNTRUST BANKS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'suntrust allowed a person to complete loan documents and sign a second mortgage against my property. the mortgage is in the persons name and the deed is solely in my name');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4293,'09/19/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 I submitted an offer to purchase a short sale property serviced by Select Portfolio Servicing. There seem to be numerous delays by the servicer in review of the short sale that I would like to have investigated. After my offer was submitted, a BPO was not ordered until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16. Results of the BPO were not processed until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 at which time a counter offer was requested. An updated purchase contract/counter offer was given to the servicer immediately and it took until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 to get a final approval even though there was no other negotiating. I immediately completed an application with a lender, ordered and paid for an appraisal and inspection. A title search by my lender showed there was an outstanding [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] lien on the property. Negotiations with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] lien began on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 and ended on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 with them requesting a $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] settlement. The selling agent immediately went back to Select Portfolio Servicing on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 to get an updated approval including the $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] settlement to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] lien and it took SPS until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 to order the BPO again as the first [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had expired. I understand BPOs are only valid for 90 days, however I do n''t understand the delays with ordering the BPOs and providing approval documentation. I unfortunately am now at jeopardy of losing {$600.00} for the appraisal I obtained if we do not close by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 since appraisals are also only valid for 90 days. I am hoping they will rush this second review, but am not hopeful. The purpose of my complaint is to obtain confirmation that SPS has maintained compliance with CFPB regulations and required timelines in review of this short sale.','SELECT PORTFOLIO SERVICING, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a short sale property was serviced by Select Portfolio Servicing. the seller submitted an offer to purchase a property. the seller immediately completed an application with a lender ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4294,'09/19/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','Sveral months ago [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sold my mortgage back to Bank of America. I had previously fought with BOA with an attorney for 2 years unitl they gave the loan to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I resolved the mortgage and a contract was drawn up changing my interest and payments to {$780.00} per month for 40 years and they would pay the taxes. This contract was signed by the VP of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and myself as bonding as it was negotiated between attorney ''s. Within 2 months of BOA taking the loan back they started adding fees for taxes, their attorney ''s payments and insurance running the monthly mortgage payments over {$1100.00} per month and climbing. They refuse to acknowledge I have home owners insurance and requested to pay the taxes myself. I was never contracted to pay for their attorney ''s fees as I paid for my own fighting with them and their repeated lies. Their unlawful demands are now hurting my credit. I owe {$190.00} on a home valued at approximately {$130.00}. And am ordered to pay the bank {$54000.00} cash when I turn [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years of age. I have been a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for 32 years and am currently working for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Pa.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'a contract was signed by the VP of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and myself as bonding as it was negotiated between attorney''s. the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4295,'09/18/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','This is documentation that i have compiled since i began disputing inaccurate reporting and items on my credit. It began XX/XX/2016 and have not been resolved. Since then in a mater of days my credit score has dropped over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] points with no use or change in my credit. There has been a serious error made here. I have called I have mailed in paperwork and every time i do, i ''m asked to wait anther 30 days. I do n''t have anther 30 days from never to get this resolved. I ''ve included my police report, original mailed in documents and the responses from all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureaus. This has prompted me to file a formal complaint with the consumer financial protection bureau as well. One might think you would err on the side of caution before destroying ones life. I have lost a lot because of this error which is also included in my documentation i ''m asking you to cease and desist any further negative retaliation on my credit. Please address the items that listed for correction in my paperwork.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'i have compiled documentation since i began disputing inaccurate reporting and items on my credit. it began XX/XX/2016 and have not been resolved. there has');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4296,'09/18/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','Progressive Financial Services legal department mail a letter to my home claiming that I have a debt remove from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit report and that I made false letter from their company to get the debt remove. 

The company that filed the debt with Progressive Financial Services was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] this summer to let them know the debt did not belong to me and it needed to be remove from my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] report. I am also a current customer of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I am reporting this company to the CFPB and for your agency to investigate Progressive Financial Services collections practices.','Progressive Financial Services, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'progressive financial services legal department mail letter to home claiming debt remove from report. company that filed debt with Progressive Financial Services was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COM');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4297,'09/17/2016','Consumer Loan','Installment loan','Problems when you are unable to pay','I would like to make a complaint against Mobile loans. I have paid this company over {$3000.00}. I am being charged a fixed amou t of {$73.00} every two weeks. I have co tacted this company to request a deferment or a settlement. I am drowning with these online lenders requesting help. All.of my payments are being applied to i terest','Mobiloans, LLC',2.0,2.0,'mobile loans has paid me over $3000.00. I am being charged a fixed amou t of $73.00 every two weeks.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4298,'09/17/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Disclosure verification of debt','I discontinued my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] contract in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2016. According to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my new provider I needed to show receipt of payment to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for the phone device that I had leased, and they [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] would make me whole. WellXXXX immediately revoked access to all my billing statements and went ahead without any invoicing or giving me the bills even though I had asked the representative to send me those, charged my Credit Card for recurring charges. I disputed the item and the Card company agreed that the charge was n''t recurring and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] inappropriately charged the card. That was the last I heard from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or anyone on this. Just yesterday I received a notice that my credit report had been adversely affected. I researched and it turns out a Debt collection agency by the name of Diversified consultants had put this adverse action on my pristine report. I called them this morning and the agent was n''t helpful at all and she hung up on me once I asked to speak with a supervisor. 

Neither [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] nor Diversified in earnest tried to contact me. the call log on my phone number would show it and they have both the right number and the address for me.','Diversified Consultants, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'I discontinued my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] contract in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2016. a call log on my phone number');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4299,'09/16/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Rewards','I had a Wells Fargo credit card with a great Rewards Program. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016 they sent me a letter, which I received on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016, saying I was overusing their rewards program- like making too many large purchases, and that if I did n''t stop, they would close my account. I did stop immediately : I only made [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] purchases after that, both for gas under {$20.00}. I could have withdrawn all my rewards in cash at that time, but I did n''t, as I had been saving up for a trip for my family, and if I redeemed my rewards for travel, the points were worth [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % more. So I naively trusted their letter. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they sent me a follow up letter, forcing my account to be closed and seizing all of the value of all of the rewards that I had accrued, through purchases and through bonus sign-up offers. After I realized this, I called them on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], speaking with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different people and many different departments. No one could help me get my money back. I never broke any terms or laws or rules. I complied with their terms to stop making large purchases on their card. In return they seized a cash value of {$1900.00}, or a value if redeemed for travel of {$2800.00}. This also adds a stain to my credit report.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a letter from a wells Fargo credit card sent me on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. they sent me a follow up letter, forcing my');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4300,'09/16/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Credit card protection / Debt protection','In response to Capital Ones '' solicitation letter for home refinancing, I called them up and asked loan programs they have. I expressed my interest in one of the programs and asked them to send the application. They asked my credit card number to proceed. I hesitated to give, but agent said " no charge '''', " no charge '''' " no charge '' number of times. Since I did n''t sign the application yet, I assumed it will be O.K. with such a big company, so I gave them my card number. Next day I receive application forms. But before I sign I received a better offer from another company, so I cancelled the application to Capital Ones the next day. 
However, when I received my credit card statement later on, I found they charged {$450.00} commitment fee which I can not accept. At no point the agent made me understand that just giving the credit card number is an acceptance of the offer and I am subject to any commitment fee. Who would accept that kind of offer in the world unless the person is a stupid or crazy. I think this is a typical example of credit card abuse or cheating to an innocent customer. I think U.S. is lawful country and I sincerely hope you would help me to resolve this kind of nonsense.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'capital ones asked for home refinancing. they asked my credit card number to proceed. they asked me to send the application.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4301,'09/16/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','Reported that I had a fraudulent account ( checking account ) with Wells Fargo back in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2016. I have a benefit that allows for a Fraud advocate to help me. We provided all the documentation to advise I was a victim of ID Theft, including a police report and ID Theft Affidavit as well as other documents. We were told in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the offices that this was resolved as fraud, but come to find out they did not resolve it, but sold it off to a collection company during the time they were investigating the debt or after they told me it was resolved as fraud. Case [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] acct # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'I was a victim of ID Theft in 2016. we provided all the documentation to advise I was a victim of ID Theft. they sold it off to ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4302,'09/16/2016','Debt collection','I do not know','Communication tactics','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016, at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was called from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the company name is Account Outsourcing Group. I was sick that day and was very annoyed that they did not call between [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as directed by 15 United States Code Section 1692c. When I communicated that it was against the law to call my phone that early, the caller stated that it was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] where she was calling from and I stated that I was in California and it is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] here. Therefore, I asked to speak to her supervisor and she put [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on the phone and I communicated the information to her, then she got extremely rude, said they have no record of my number, and hung up. I have a record on my phone what date and time I received the call.','Account Outsourcing Group, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a caller said that it was against the law to call her phone. she said that she was in California and it is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] here');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4303,'09/16/2016','Consumer Loan','Vehicle loan','Managing the loan or lease','we have a motor home account thru Santander Consumer USA. Our payment was due [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called their customer service on Monday [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and stated we had not recieved an statment/bill. They stated the statements are generated on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the month. No date when they are really mailed. As a rule we recive the bill 1 week or less before it is due. There is no postmark on the envelope, so we can see when it is mailed. I believe there is a minimum time set by the government or banking industry to prevent this problem. Should n''t a person have more time? Please Help','SANTANDER CONSUMER USA HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,2.0,'our payment was due to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the statement is generated on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the month ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4304,'09/15/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','Debt Collection agency contacted my father on several occasions in regards to a debt they are pursuing that I no longer owe. The debt is made up entirely of penalties and fees as the principal balance was paid to the original creditor in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], prior to being made aware that any collection agency was involved. According to the agency, the debt consists of late fees and penalties that have been accruing since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have never received any prior communication from the agency, and they claim that the information was sent to an address where I have not resided in over 10 years. Contrary to their assertion that they believed this was correct address, the agency verified my identity by proffering proffering the address at which I currently reside. Additionally, the original creditor sent correspondence to me directly to my current and previous addresses. This company clearly sent communication to a known bad address in an attempt to build up interest and fees.','LINEBARGER GOGGAN BLAIR & SAMPSON LLP',2.0,4.0,'debt collection agency contacted my father on several occasions. the debt is made up entirely of penalties and fees. the principal balance was paid to the original creditor in XX/');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4305,'09/15/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','Before moving to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2012, I opened an checking account with Citibank in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] near my home. I opened this account because they convinced me that I would be able to use my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account at ATMs in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and elsewhere in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I deposited {$1000.00}. I moved soon after so never received a statement but I did receive an ATM card which I still have. I also have had a Citibank [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which I still use. 

I was not able to use the ATM card as they promised, in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] nor in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] where I now live. But when I attempted to link my Citibank [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to my checking account ATM, my phone conversation with a Citibank representative informed me that they had no record of my account ever existing. All I had was my ATM card number but I was never given a statement so I had no account number. They had no record of my account number even though they had issued the ATM card attached to the account. 

I traveled to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] last [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and went to the same [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] branch. The customer service manager named " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' first check the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Found Money database to see if my money had been returned to the state, but it had not. She saw my ATM card number and said that they had paper records in the back room that they could go through, and would give me a call. I never received a call before I had to return to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have tried calling the branch on numerous occasions but calls there are always forwarded to Citibank corporate, and they have no way yo connect me back to the customer service manager I met at the branch. So my money is gone and they have given me no recourse.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'Citibank in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] opened an account in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2012. I deposited $');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4306,'09/15/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Rewards','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016, I applied and was approved for a Chase credit card. The terms of my sign-up bonus were : " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with a required {$2000.00} spend in the first 3 months. '''' On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016, I contacted Chase via Secured message asking them to change the terms of the sign-up bonus. I found a sign-up bonus that works better for my goals. The new terms were : " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bonus [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after the first {$2000.00} in purchases within 3 months of approval, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bonus [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after {$10000.00} in purchases within the first year, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bonus [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after {$20000.00} in purchases within the first year ''''. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016, I received a reply via Secure message that stated that " We are pleased to confirm that we will honor your request to receive the tiered [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bonus [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] enrollment incentive. '''' The message reiterated the new terms and stated that " After you have exceeded {$10000.00} in purchases and {$20000.00} in purchases, please contact us at that time and we will add an additional [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bonus [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to the account. '''' On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016, Chase removed this message from my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016, I contacted Chase via [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] asking them to remind me the terms of my " upgraded sign-up bonus ''''. The same day, a Chase representative ( initials [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) replied : " Once you ''ve reached {$10000.00} spending, you would be awarded [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bonus [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], or after {$20000.00} spending, you would be awarded [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bonus [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''''. By that time, I had reached the {$10000.00} threshold and asked Chase to issue [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] points. The representative advised me to wait until I reach {$20000.00} so that they can submit that request for the full amount. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016, I contacted Chase again. They verified that I reached the {$20000.00} threshold. However, they changed their mind and denied my request for additional points. They retracted the written promise that they gave me on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016 and verified again on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016. I understand that it is up to Chase whether or not to match a better bonus. However, once a promise is made, it must be followed. I acted upon that promise and tried to spend on the credit card as much as possible to hit the required threshold. By doing that, I gave up on other opportunities given me by competitors. I would have spent significantly less on my BA Chase card, had I not received the written promise, not once but twice. If they were unwilling to extend the bones, they should ''ve done it on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Instead, they did a classic " bait-and-switch '''' : they gave me a promise, I acted upon it, and then they retracted once I fulfilled the terms of the offer they extended.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',4.0,4.0,'on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4307,'09/15/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','My late wife who was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] requested an antenna from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( she was a 15 year customer ) because the reception in the apartment we lived in at the time was very poor. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] delivered the antenna after much hassle. My wife finally succumbed to her illness and I moved [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to be with my daughter ''s. I canceled my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] phone and returned the antenna to the local [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] store [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] before I left. The young lady took the antenna and wished me well. I paid my phone bill in full but [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] kept on sending bills for the antenna. They have turned the bill over to several different collection agencies. Each one has tried to cut a deal with me. I refuse to pay for something that I returned to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','ERC',2.0,2.0,'my late wife requested an antenna from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. she was a 15 year customer and moved to be with my daughter''s.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4308,'09/15/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','My mortgage company sold my morgage to Dovenmuehle Mortgage Inc, in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016. I called the company in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], requesting information regarding my account number and payment. At the time, the mortgage company did not process my account, and that the company would mail me all the information. The company informed me that they would not double up my bill ( bill me for two months ) as I had a grace period.. 
XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the company sent me a bill, two months of back mortgage. The company just sent a bill, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with no letter introducing the company, no billing information in terms of when this is due. I called the company immediately and asked where is loan servicing agreement that states loan payment, insurance payment, and tax payment. They stated it was previously mailed, but they would mail it again. On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I called again requesting information as another bill came in with a late payment was sent. I again asked for the loan service information, tax payment and insurance payment. The costumer service representative could not fax nor fed ex the material. They assured me that I would not be billed for the late fee and that I had until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I requested that they call their other payment department, which the representative could not provide. Furthermore, the representative provided an excuse that the US Postal service must have lost the previous mailings,. I also requested a direct line to customer service, or an email address, but I was denied stating that they do not allow direct line conversations. I was refused to speak to someone higher in the department. 
I went on line to create an account and I can not access my account. 



What are my rights to pay the bill with something more official?','Dovenmuehle Mortgage, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'mortgage company sold morgage to dovenmuehle Mortgage Inc, in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016. the company sent me a');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4309,'09/14/2016','Debt collection','Credit card','Communication tactics','I have now left [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] messages on the legal resolution team at Pressler and Pressler after receiving a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] letter from their offices. I spoke to someone this afternoon and the amount I " owe '''' has increased from the {$820.00} ( amount which was repeated several times throughout our communication as well as the number presented as part of evidence in their notice of motion paperwork. I would like to understand how the sum owed has substantially increased as of this afternoon to well over {$1000.00}.','Pressler & Pressler, LLP',4.0,4.0,'a letter from the legal resolution team at pressler and pressler has been sent. the amount owed has increased from $820.00 to $1000.00');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4310,'09/14/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','This is a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] debt that has circulated among collection agencies. I have sent dispute letters each time that I do not owe this debt. I have never subscribed to have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] service nor have I ever authorized anyone to open an account in my name. I have requested proof that I opened the account and that I have ever made payments on the account but all they do is switch to another collections agency. Then the new agency puts it on my credit report. This is really annoying. I should not have to keep disputing a debt I do not owe. If there was an account started in my name, they should figure out who was paying it and go after them. I DO NOT OWE THIS DEBT. I will greatly appreciate any assistance you can give me to stop this madness. The current collections company is ERC ( Enhanced Recovery Corp ). I have disputed this with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] because it is showing on my credit report.','ERC',2.0,2.0,'debt circulated among collection agencies. I have never subscribed to have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] service.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4311,'09/14/2016','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with my lender or servicer','The numbers on my loan do not add up, and I have contacted the Fedloan Servicing Ombudsman and made multiple attempts to work with FedLoan Servicing Directly. 

