The only inquiries to be on my report at this time are the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that I mentioned above. I am not currently seeking credit, and have only sought credit during the aforementioned 4 times above. 
Anything else from TODAY ''S DATE to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] must be removed. Permissible purpose was not established nor granted by me as I did not ask for credit, and these are not soft inquiries. They are hurting any future chances of me legitimately asking for credit, which means it is hurting me financially. 
