A copy of this complaint has been forwarded to my attorney.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'Experian is posting inquiries on my report that I did not authorize. there are instances of duplicate entries on my report. the only inquiries to be on my report at this time are');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4327,'09/09/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','I am a victim of identity theft. I submitted my identity theft packet to TransUnion and they have refused to block fraudulent information from reporting on my credit report. I submitted a police report indicating the fraudulent accounts and proof of my identity. Additionally, I sent a letter requesting that they block the fraudulent information pursuant to the Fair Credit Reporting Act, Section 605B. Instead, TransUnion has chosen to not comply with the FCRA and rather opened disputes. As a victim of identity theft my personal information has been compromised and a dispute would return my name, address, dob and social security number. This is further listed in the police report that I provided to TransUnion. TransUnion has willfully decided not to comply and is in violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a victim of identity theft submitted my identity theft packet to TransUnion. they have refused to block fraudulent information from reporting on my credit report.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4328,'09/09/2016','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I have a mortgage account with Wells Fargo. Any payments I make early are not applied to the principal until the first of the month. The payments are marked " unapplied '''' and I do not receive any interest credit, as well. Rest assured, they are making interest income on my money. I have had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] mortgage accounts with them and it was the same as this is their policy. 
