INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4337,'09/07/2016','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Can''t repay my loan','I called multiple times to have a graduated repayment plan started. I thought that it had been started when I received a statement the next month for the full amount. I called again a few weeks ago and was told that everything was all set in the system again and I was put on the graduated repayment plan. No such luck. I just received the latest monthly statement with the full amount due.','SLM CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a statement was sent to me the next month for the full amount. the statement was due for the next month.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4338,'09/07/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Using a debit or ATM card','Last month I tried to withdraw {$100.00} from my account and the machine ate my money, I contacted the atm company to get my money back, they gave me letter show that the transaction I made for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars they never received it and told me to contact my bank about it, I contacted my bank and told them what happened with me and what happened when I contacted the other party, the chase customer representatives told me to send the document I have over the fax and he gave me a claim number. I have sent them the document I had over the fax with the claim number that the bank representative gave me, then he told me to wait 10 days for the investigation, after ten days I received a call from my bank they told me that their finished their investigation but they ca n''t give me my money, I asked them for the reason, they said, you need to get your money from the other party, I told them I have already tried to do that ten days ago and I could n''t, they said we ''re sorry we can not give it back to you.. NOW WHAT SHOULD I DO TO GET MY MONEY BACK!!!','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'chase customer representatives told me to send the document they had over the fax and gave me a claim number. they told me they had finished their investigation but they can''t');
