I eventually learned that PHH had canceled the loan, reopened the loan, then canceled the loan again in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
I submitted a complaint to the Office of the President along with forwarded copies of all emails between me and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] over a 2+ month period. After 11 days, I called a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the Office of the President seeking a summary of what she ''d learned during her 10 day investigation. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] told me the cancellation was the result of my not responding to PHH request for additional documentation ; I refuted that by referring to the emails I ''d forwarded to her almost 2 weeks prior. It seemed to me she might not have reviewed the timeline. 
Therefore, I found out who was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s supervisor and on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I wrote to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. He assured me he ''d have the investigation done properly and get back to me with response to my questions, which were as follows : 1. Please tell me what PHH learned thru its investigation about the processing of my loan application? 
2. Why did PHH cancel my loan application on each of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] occasions? [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Why did PHH attempt to reinstate my loan on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]? )? 
3. Timeline of the loan application process by PHH? 
