7. What ''s the status of my loan? 
8. I later asked them if they ''d refund me the fee they charged me for erroneously canceling my loan and claiming that I ''d canceled the loan application. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] assured me they ''d be responding but I have not heard from them, nor have they replied to my followup inquiry, since an initial acknowledgement from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], that he ''d received my email.','PHH Mortgage Services Corporation',2.0,2.0,'a loan application was sent to me by PHH, which was reactivated. I received a complete packet of documents from PHH. they needed me to complete/');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4344,'09/06/2016','Debt collection','Credit card','False statements or representation','Midland Credit Management has been calling me since last year regarding an account I had with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . I ''m trying to purchase a house next year and want to straighten my credit out so I decided to make an agreement. I originally agreed to make 3 payments of {$590.00} to settle the account. After the 2nd payment was made I did some research, called Midland and told them to cease anymore withdrawals from my account. I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Paid {$30.00} to stop the payment just in case they tried to take my money. After doing some extensive research I found over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] complaints about this company and their bad practices. I called them up and they stated to me " Your account is closed and we will cease reporting ''''. I then asked why would they not report that I paid them so that this will show the bureaus that I ''ve settled the account and he had no answer. I then called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they stated that I am listed in good standing with that old account, which does do n''t show up as derogatory. They also told me that Midland is n''t even on my report. I then pulled all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reports and Midland is nowhere to be found, which means the 2 previous payments were not updated with the credit bureaus. They basically conned me out of {$1700.00} that I really could not afford. The last payment that I asked them not to take out caused my account to go into the negative. This company has been fined for over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars due to their bad practices and taking advantage of people. I would like to get my money back if possible.','ENCORE CAPITAL GROUP INC.',2.0,2.0,'Midland Credit Management has been calling me since last year. I agreed to make 3 payments of $590.00 to settle the account. after the 2nd payment was made I');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4345,'09/06/2016','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I applied for a different income-driven repayment plan through FedLoans. I was already on an IDR but was eligible for a REPAYE loan to lower my monthly payment, as I plan to apply for the public svc loan forgiveness program. They told me I would be on administrative forbearance until the new payment arrangement started. They warned me that my first payment under [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] would be bigger. I paid {$5.00} in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for the forebearance payment and not two days later, they said I had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] student loan payment due on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They only gave me 2 day warning that I had a {$210.00} payment due! They did n''t respond to an email asking for clarification. I was late paying about a week and surprised the payment was due. I wish they had to inform me of the new payment and give me at least 30 days to make that first payment. Otherwise, all is well. I just want them to communicate more clearly.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'I applied for a different income-driven repayment plan through FedLoans. they told me that my first payment under [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] would be');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4346,'09/05/2016','Debt collection','Credit card','Disclosure verification of debt','I had disputed a closed charge off balance of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from Midland funding collections on all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reporting credit bureaus ... .After the dispute came back on or approximately XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] it was reported to all three bureaus that I only had a balance of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars..I then contacted Midland funding to pay the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars.They said no I still owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars and that they never reported the balance of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars to no reporting agencies. I have proof from all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reporting agencies ... .They then contacted the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bureaus after my dispute came back stating I only owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars and reopened my account to reflect the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after my call to pay the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollar balance ... ..My score dropped over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] points ... ..This is definitely a violation the fair reporting act. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','ENCORE CAPITAL GROUP INC.',2.0,2.0,'dispute came back on or approximately XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] it was reported to all three bureaus that I only had a balance');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4347,'09/04/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I have a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Account for many years and have existing Investments through them. I moved to Hawaii in 2003 and there were no [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Locations in the State. Finally I had to close my account and open a local Bank of Hawaii account. 

