The amount disputed is {$15.00}, I have contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] locally in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Nationally, There is no account number they can provide me with, nor any details regarding this late payment. Ultimately, there is no proof I was late in payment and after multiple efforts contacting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they have not removed from small late fee from my credit history. I never even knew it existed until I checked my credit report history. 

Please advise on how I can dispute this and I ''m happy to comply in anyway to remove this from my record because I ''m fiscally responsible and am always on time with payments. 

