INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4354,'09/01/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','The Public Record Information that the credit reporting agencies is reporting is inaccurate in its filing. The bankruptcy is dismissed by the Federal Court, a government agency. It is by the Federal Government that the term " Dismissed '''' means that it is adjudicated by the law. My case concerned no form of solvency, nothing was placed under conservancy, examinership, liquidation or provisional debt reconstruction. There were no exemptions, no surrender of any kind as stated within the regulations of the BAPCPA " Means Test ''''. The credit bureaus have retrieve my information from a third party entity without my authorization and I have a right to know who " verified ''''. The agencies are holding my identity and credit under " Consumer Lock '''' for 10 years, I want to know by what law? The Bankruptcy Court has confirmed that they did not verify by documentation and the credit agencies have stated I can no longer challenge this negative entry. This discrepancy has prevented me in my personal life ''s pursuit. Please advocate for me in this challenge.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the bankruptcy is dismissed by the federal court. the credit bureaus have retrieve my information from a third party entity without my authorization. the credit bureaus have a right to know');
