INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4372,'08/27/2016','Consumer Loan','Installment loan','Taking out the loan or lease','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] placed an account on my credit file which i did not recognize. The account was from a company called heights financial corporation.I immediatetly researched the company and loan in question. Obtained. Their Phone number and address. I called and spoke with a representative and explained the reason im calling. They put me in contact with a senior representative spoke with a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] again explaining the situation she researched in her company files is my name, social security number and address that matched any accounts in my name. The research camey up negative she immediatly responded that i doo not have An account with them and werey suppose. To give me a letter stating i have no account in my name to send to the credit Bureau. 
2 days passed no letter i spoke to a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] she claimed that maybe im mixing up her company with another company. I immediately emailed her the name. Of her company address and city they are located. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] immediatetly confirmed the information i send that it was correct. But, still claims its a mix up. Since i last spoke to her [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016, the company has not contacted me about my issue and no evidence they are trying to resolve this matter furthermore no letter i requested. My credit score is suffering and Heights Financial corporation is giving me no support and a cold. Shoulder. They are not helping me and in need of some. Organisation to help, Please help me resolve this issue.','MIDCOUNTRY FINANCIAL CORP',2.0,2.0,'i immediately emailed her the name of her company. she claims that she has no account in her name. the company has not contacted me about my issue.');
