uses to remove the negative item from my report. I returned the vehicle, a few weeks late, but the it is not my fought that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] let the vehicle sit on that lot for 5 months and failed to notify [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Now I have suffered for that mistake and error. On top of that the reporting entries on my credit report are in error, misleading, and in consisted. For these reasons and others, I have ask the reporting agencies to remove the items and they refuse. I am requesting that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dba [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] immediately remove any entry they made from my report. Also I request they be held responsible for sending notification of their error to each and every company that I have obtained or attempted to obtain credit from over the last 5 years.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] leased a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Chrysler 300. on the lease end date, I dropped the');
