Among others, following statutes have been violated : Violated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) ( A ) by falsely characterizing the account as " Open '''', with date opened listed as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

Violated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( by communicating credit information which is known or which should be known to be false, by reporting the account as " Open '''' and with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as the date it was opened. 

violated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] by using any false representation or deceptive means to collect or attempt to collect any debt by knowingly reporting the account as " Open '''' and with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] date. 

