I called my credit card company to dispute this charge and credit card company open dispute charge but did n''t get my money. Now citi castco credit card company tell me that i should get my money on any other ways because they will not help me to resolve this issue. My request is reasonable because why should i go by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] route if there has some problems. I m so upset about the policey of citicastco credit card company. 
If you neend any other information about this issue please let me know and i will try to provide you. 
Thank you for your time.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'i requested to change my routing because of Clashes between [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Government and 20 days');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4424,'08/12/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Closing/Cancelling account','Capital one closed/locked me out of using my credit card to update the card to a chip. Thus for over 1 month I was unable to have access to my revolving credit as they were unable to send the card during that time.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'capital one closed/locked me out of using my credit card to update the card to a chip. thus for over 1 month I was unable to have access to my revol');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4425,'08/12/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','Recently I requested a copy of my husband ''s and my credit report, and after receiving it I had to dispute several items, which were not only old, but incorrect. Thus, causing many problems for us trying to convince any new creditors with whom we tried to establish credit that the information they saw was wrong. All they saw was that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] wrong account, never mind the 95 % of those accounts that were paid on time and a bankruptcy that is now eight years old. 
I do n''t have to tell you how screwed up our economy has become, and in my opinion these so called credit bureaus we have allowed to dictate our lives is only making it harder not for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Americans to regain their financial status in society. The vast majority of people are not dead beats. Bad things happen to good people, those who have worked hard and did their best to maintain a good credit rating, only to have it suddenly torn away from either a job loss, an illness or a disaster that they have no control over, often going so far as to force them into bankruptcy, something that my husband and I had to do and would n''t wish on anyone. But instead of being able to work our way back, because of the credit laws of being able to keep accounts up to seven years and a bankruptcy for ten, it takes people three times longer to regain their credit status, therefore, making it impossible for them to buy homes, cars, furniture and the list goes on. This not only puts a further burden on our economy, but makes people lose their dignity as human beings. Why work or bother paying your bills if nobody cares that you are trying. 
This also makes it hard for people who want to start a business, when creditors are more interested in what happened ten years ago, then now. And as an American I feel it discriminating that foreigners who come to this country are given loans to help them start a business and no one cares if they have good credit or not. 
I also resent the fact that these companies who run these bureaus have been allowed to ship our personal information to countries like [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of which you can not deny, as I have asked them where they are when I ''ve spoken with them. Then you wonder why identity theft is growing. These people can steal whatever information they have on us. Something most Americans do not realize. 
All these politicians talk about is boosting the economy and making more jobs, but what ''s the point if we continue to treat hardworking people who have to start over as if they had a contagious disease that no one wants to deal with. We need to change the laws, remove bad accounts after three years as well as any bankruptcies. Since our bankruptcy, finally after four years we ''ve been able to buy a house, new cars and get credit cards. Things we could have had earlier if we had not been treated like we were criminals. That is exactly how most people feel when they keep trying to start over. 
Credit bureaus should be better monitored to see that they do n''t keep items that are over ten and fifteen years old as I have found on mine. And all bureaus need to begin keeping the same records, whereas most of the time all of them are different. And they need to reduce the information they are now reporting. It used to be plain and simple now they literally have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] unnecessary information. Why do they need to put each exact amount for each month, it ''s insane. Finally, why should a credit score become lowered when a creditor decides to raise your limit. If they do n''t '' want you using it then why offer it. It ''s contradictory. Your score should go up the higher the limit to show that you are trusted enough to be offered it in the first place. The whole system is screwed up and needs to be changed. Why have Consumer programs if you have no intentions of doing anything about it???','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a credit report from a credit bureau reveals that the information they saw was wrong. a bankruptcy is now eight years old, and the vast majority of people are not dead beat');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4426,'08/11/2016','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I applied and received approval for an education loan from Citizens Bank National Association to refinance my existing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] federal student loans. After executing the loan documents online, I was informed that the new loan would be funded on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I logged in to the Citizens Bank web portal to discover that Citizens Bank had created a loan account naming me as the debtor, and assigned the servicing of the loan to a third party. I checked the third party servicer ''s records to discover that their records matched those of Citizens Bank, and that there was a debt in my name for the amount I initially agreed to. Interest had begun to accrue on this purported loan as of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

I then checked my existing federal loan servicing account ( the " Original Loan '''' ) to discover that the Original Loan was still outstanding and that according to their records, I was still responsible to make payments to them. 

I called Citizens Bank to figure out how I ended up with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] outstanding loans, and their representatives explained that it could take up to two months for my Original Loan to be repaid. The representatives claimed that a check had been mailed to my Original Loan servicer, but they had not been in direct contact with the Original Loan servicer, and I have not seen any records to confirm that the check had been mailed to the proper address. I was not informed that they would be charging me interest for a loan while their check was in transit, notwithstanding the fact that no actual funds had been funded on my behalf by Citizens Bank, and in effect, I was being charged interest by Citizens Bank for the repayment of funds that have yet to be credited on my behalf ( their check being purportedly in transit, but not yet redeemed ). 

I asked Citizens Bank ''s representatives to defer interest on the purported loan that they made to me until funds were received by my Original Loan servicer. The refused, citing two separate provisions of the promissory note I had allegedly agreed to, claiming that these provisions together entitled them to charge me interest for up to 60 days without ever making a disbursement of funds. In other words, they said that they were entitled to charge me interest for a loan that has yet to be credited to me.','CITIZENS FINANCIAL GROUP, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a new loan was approved by Citizens Bank to refinance my existing federal student loans. the loan was funded on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMP');
