É');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4428,'08/11/2016','Debt collection','I do not know','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','For over 60 days Pioneer Credit, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], has been calling my cell phone asking for a person named [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I am not [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I am a man. I have repeatedly asked them not to call my cell phone and that I am not [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They then have told me they are attempting to collect a date in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s name. I do not believe they are even allowed to tell me someone ''s first & last name, are they? In addition, their phone calls have not ceased. I would like to file a formal complaint against this company. If I ever had a collection I would not want a company calling random people telling everyone I had a collection. Is n''t this personal information and why wo n''t they stop calling me?','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'Pioneer Credit, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has been calling my cell phone for over 60 days. they have asked me not to call my cell phone and that I');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4429,'08/11/2016','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','In 2014, I went to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in order to buy a mobile home. I paid them in good faith a deposit of {$3.00}. They promised me that my monthly payment would be {$830.00} and would not rise. A few days of being there I got an increase in the payment. An later, I got another increases in the payment. With this second increases my budget was not enough to pay. So, I decided to leave because I could not afford the new payment. I preferred to lose the {$3500.00} that had given of deposit. To my surprise I am seeing that they put a judgment against me on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Please see my credit report ( attachment ). I should put a judgment against them for {$3500.00} I lost. Please investigate this company because I ''m not the only one who has had this kind of issues by this entity. Additionally, I need help in order to remove the trial they put against me.','Global Mobile Limited Liability Company',2.0,2.0,'in 2014, I paid them a deposit of $3.00 and promised me that my monthly payment would be $830.00. they promised me that my monthly');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4430,'08/11/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] charged off an account of mine in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. There were payments still being made. I had been under the impression that the balance was actually paid off. No communications from barclays until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when doing a background check for employment. Found the balance double the limit. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has told they tried to contact me for a brief time, ultimately it was not their responsibility and that they sold it off to a debt collection agency ( this was told to me by a member of the office of the president ). I never had such an account on my report, no such company has ever tried to contact me. The balance has been paid in full. I have asked barclays to present post dated proof, where they have attempted to contact me. I do not trust what they log in their system. That can always be altered. I want physical, post dated proof, because I was not contacted for a period of three years. Further, they charged off an account which was still being paid, I have confirmation of payment emails still in my inbox. 

I demand that this trade line be removed from my experian report.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ has charged off an account of mine in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] there were payments');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4431,'08/10/2016','Student loan','Federal student loan servicing','Dealing with my lender or servicer','The loan servicer, NelNet, continues to make changes to the amount I am supposed to pay, in spite of a letter from them dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 acknowledging that I have been approved for the income-driven repayment plan and that my payment will be {$130.00}. First, they deducted several [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars from my checking account with no notice, this deduction was not authorized and it was unwarranted and incorrect. Now they have for some unexplained reason put my loans into some sort of forbearance with no notice to me or explanation that this is happening. 

I work in a non-profit and all I want to do is make [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on time payments so that I can apply for PSLF. 

I think this company is shady and purposely is trying to extend the life of the loans and the capital balance so that they can charge the Dept of Education as much as possible and increase their profits. Some investigative journalist ought to take a look at it. I ''m sure plenty of loan holders and plenty of front line customer service employees will have lots to say.','NELNET, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the loan servicer, NelNet, continues to make changes to the amount I am supposed to pay. they deducted several [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars');
