INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4463,'08/02/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','I had my identity stolen in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2007. In less than a month ''s time the ID thieves in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], ( Im in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), bought [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] top line [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] COMPUTERS @ {$3000.00} each. Also a few other smaller checks for random items, accounts, etc. On about [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2007 I finally get a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank postcard stating my check for {$3000.00} had bounced and already began the computer ''s process of double charging the overdraft fee, then the fee for that, which lead to more overdraft fees. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was of no help with the problem, in fact they were " shady '''' about it. I called several times only to be mocked, laughed at, and literally called a liar. Even though copies to every check & transaction I had ever done with them was available anytime for my viewing- they refused me any information, viewing, what the large amount paid for ... NOTHING. This was all witnessed by officers at the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Police Dept as my final call to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] about this was in front of them so they could listen. The representative mocking my call and handwriting changes his tune when a Detective took phone from me and politely tore into his unprofessional behavior and that ID theft reports had been filed ; investigations started. So there ''s more but I ''ll cut to where this strange collection letter comes in. For over a year now I have begun receiving NEW debt collection letters [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] behalf of a Jefferson Capital Systems , for the old, fraudulent, closed and erased from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank ''s system, debt! They have the amount of {$920.00} as the total, then proceed to coax me in by asking for a mere {$180.00} within 28 days and they ''ll forgive the whole thing. BUT, there ''s fine print stating that once I do acknowledge them and even offer a payment, not make a payment, but offer- that will put me back in the clear to be sued, and start the debt ''s full amount over again like new! I am blown away, first off- the debt was never theirs to forgive, it was a mistake in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank ''s system, which has been completely erased therefore already forgiven, because obviously they do n''t want any records of it to be accessible and do n''t want to ever have it brought up- ( possibly in court or elsewhere ). A [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] branch manager about 7 months ago searched extensively throughout their archives/database and current systems for anything on that former account with them or my name even, turn up nothing at all. Like it never existed even asked me if I was sure I banked with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] back then! It ''s not on my credit reports, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] definitely is n''t pursuing this and so bottom line- Who the heck do these shady negotiating debt swindlers think they are?! I ''ve had it with them! I will not contact them directly, as why I listed above. And I surely wo n''t be paying for a debt I did n''t even cause, to these people to pocket every bit of it! Which is exactly what they ''d do because why would [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] want it? I do n''t exist to them anymore. And on a side note, I ''ve read about the FTC already coming down on these [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] companies for fraudulent acts, especially Jefferson Capital, so I think the FTC needs to know that the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] & [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] games have n''t stopped, their just changing up their strategies starting with their debt letters approach on people.','CL HOLDINGS LLC',2.0,4.0,'a''shady'' call to a''shady'' person was in front of him. he mocked his call and handwritten his tune ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4464,'08/01/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','There is a class action suit going on at this time - but my situation is after the time period that the lawsuit is for. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] v. PNC Bank, N.A., well this settlement settled nothing. PNC is still continuing their practice! I ca n''t file in the suit since this is happening to me NOW. I have been dealing with PNC for 2 months now. Our area just got mapped as a flood zone ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). I was notified that I had to purchase flood ins for the VALUE of house. I contacted the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] county tax area - my home structure is worth {$160000.00}. My balance is {$210000.00}. I purchased insurance for $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-more than the value ( there first letter stated that I needed to purchase flood insurance for the value of the structure ). I notified PNC - have copies of letters, faxes, contact people names. I was told they would look into value and notify me by mail on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], per [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Loan Support Analyst, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - Flood Servicing, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], PNC [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( p ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] | ( f ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I received a letter today, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016 - acting like I have totally ignored them -and they purchased additional insurance of {$23000.00}, which is more than the value of the home OR MY balance! Charging me {$140.00} - I have already paid out {$450.00} additional monies over my homeowners insurance for this special flood insurance. PNC is TERRIBLE to work with - I just keep getting transferred to one dept to another dept - the rep telling me - they do n''t handle my issue. I have spent so much time on the phone and on letters and emails. I am totally frustrated. Is there anything I can do?','PNC Bank N.A.',2.0,2.0,'a class action suit is going on at this time. the settlement settled nothing. the settlement is for.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4465,'08/01/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','Hello, I lived in a property that had such a poor reputation by the people who lived there it had to be renamed from : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The properties management company was out of state ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] apartments ) and a rental office was on site. The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] did not communicate well, and after a man was shot and killed in the garage of the complex I decided not to resign my lease. My relationship with the office was poor already because I called homelinemn on them because none of the properties out door security parking lot lights were functioning and because of the shooting I felt incredibly unsafe. I made a verbal agreement with the office manager in the leasing office on property who told me that was fine and to write out a letter and bring it back to him when I had time. I made [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] attempts to bring it in, once he was not in, and once the office leasing agents asked me to come back later because they were preparing for their holiday party. I obliged and I brought it in the next week. 

When we moved out we assumed that some of our [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollar deposit would go towards the two years of wear and tear of living there, however once we left we received [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] invoices, the first had less charges then the second which also now said we owed a months rent for not getting our letter to leave in on time. The charges owed took our deposit and demanded an additional [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This invoiced sited things like the black mold on the window seals and toilet, photo charges for them to take pictures of that mold, dog fesses they found outside they said was my dogs, new closet doors because the doors they replaced while we were there did n''t match, and a late charge of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] month ''s rent from the property management for not submitting my letter to leave in time, something I was verbally told by the leasing office was fine, and was attempted twice. 

We went to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( who should have a file on this still ) and spoke with someone who said they could have helped with this had we still been living there but that because we moved and the bill came after they could not. 

Because we refused to pay they forwarded the charges to collections and now I am called at all hours of the day from debt collectors and my parent get harassing mail sent to their home address in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Please help me stop this. This was a wrongful charge, I believe they sent this to collections and did n''t take us to small claims court because they knew they would lose. And this [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] thing is making my credit score suffer. I need your help in removing this or at the very least asking them to stop harassing my family. I have copies of the charges and the letter they send my parents monthly. Please let me know if you would like these documents. 

Thank you,','FAIR COLLECTIONS & OUTSOURCING, INC.',2.0,2.0,'property management company was out of state and a rental office was on site. a man was shot and killed in the garage of the complex. he was unable to communicate');
