Ultimately, they made no attempt to contact my attorney. They are currently reporting a collection on my collection report that is simply not true. It appears to be simply made up as it does not correspond to anything related to the original matter.','GLA Collection Company, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a collection agency repeatedly began contacting me after having no contact from the doctor. they were told via telephone the matter was in dispute and that I had representation. they were sent ');
