Also, on my credit report it shows that I did n''t pay the full balance to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account I had. I have attached receipts to show that the account was paid in full. 
