Our records confirm you met all requirements for promotion code [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bonus miles will be credited by Citibank to your [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] within 90 calendar days from the date when you completed all offer requirements. Please keep in mind this waiting period is standard for all promotions and can not be waived. After your 90 day waiting period is complete or by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16, the bonus miles will be applied at the end of the next statement billing cycle, which will be no later than the end of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016 statement. 

Please note, all promotions will differ and are targeted to specific account holders during specific time frames. If you did not receive this promotion via your Citi credit card statement, personal email, or through U.S mail to your home address you will not qualify for this promotion. 

