At Citibank, we take customer satisfaction seriously, and invite you to share your opinions about the service you received from me, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Please click the link below to take a short survey on your contact experience. You will need the reference number # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] listed above to complete your feedback.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'CitiGold Checking offers a discount on a Citigold checking account. the promotion is a fake promotion and will not honor the bonus miles promise. CFPB is asking');
