Since then, Chase has sent several emails to my personal email account with details about the account that I had requested to be closed and shut down. 

I highly prize my privacy and financial security. I am very concerned that Chase has disregarded my multiple requests to close this account. 

I am requesting that Chase close this account, and that they immediately stop contacting via email with details about this account.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'Chase sent me a new Chase Freedom Credit Card in the mail. I signed up for the card when I was a college student in XX/XX/[COMP');
