INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4590,'06/24/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], First Citizens Bank has an advertisement on line, in their website https : //www.firstcitizens.com, where there is a bonus of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for opening a new checking account. However, it does n''t say that the checking account is subject to credit approval. After I fill out all my information, at the end, I was denied. I thought maybe they needed more information like my Driver License and proof of address etc. However, today I received an alert, that yesterday [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank checked on my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureau. It is an usual or not a common practice for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bank to measure credit exposure when a client is not requesting a lending product. It is uncommon to be subject to a credit risk check for a checking account, and more important to not disclose that as part of the application process. It is deceiving that their website does n''t disclose that First Citizens Bank checking account products are subject to credit approval. I believe that is in violation of the fair lending act and it constitutes an unfair and deceptive banking practice. The website withhold material information that if I would have known right upfront I was going to be subject to credit approval for a checking account, it would have affected my decision to apply and I would n''t have applied.','FIRST CITIZENS BANCSHARES, INC.',2.0,2.0,'first citizens bank has an ad on their website https : //www.firstcitizens.com. it doesn''t say that the checking account is');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4591,'06/24/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Billing disputes','I attempted to purchase a mobile text gift card through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with my paypal account. The payment did not authorize but it still came out of my Paypal account as a pending transaction. I called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] told me to contact PayPal. Paypal then told me to call [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and tell them to void the transaction because it ''s not authorized. PayPal stated they wo n''t give me my money back for 30 days. I ''ve filed several complaints about purchases I have not received or that was not authorized and they wo n''t give me my money back. For once I would like my money back after I complain about not receiving an item. The invoice number is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'a mobile text gift card came out of my paypal account as a pending transaction. the payment did not authorize but it still came out of my account.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4592,'06/24/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','TransUnion has deliberately " re-aged '''' [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of my old credit accounts ( # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and illegally continues reporting adverse information on those accounts, causing the negative credit listing to remain on my credit report longer than allowed by federal law. 
Previously, TransUnion was reporting the estimated date when these items will be removed of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( as clerly shown in earlier credit reports from this company ). However, TransUnion failed to delete this information in a timely manner which is in violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ). The continuous reporting of the incorrect information also unduly damages my credit file and prevents me to refinance and obtain business credits, causing monetary losses and distress for me, my family and my business.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'TransUnion has deliberately re-aged ''''[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of my old credit accounts. the negative credit listing will remain on my credit report');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4593,'06/23/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Rewards','Late last year, in 2015 I went ahead and applied for a CITI Gold Package account. The account package offered a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] miles bonus directly targeted to me. The miles where to be awarded to my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account after meeting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stipulations, that I pay [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bills from the account and that I spend at least {$1000.00} using the debit card. I completed both of these stipulations well within the time frame allotted and for the last six months have invested over 5 hours of call time and a number of emails have been sent over to Citi in order to get to the bottom of why the miles have never been added to my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account. I feel that Citi is using these promotional tactics to bait customers into opening accounts and then reneging on their end of the deal. I do n''t feel that this practice is fair to consumers and I feel it is predatory.','CITIBANK, N.A.',8.0,8.0,'a CITI gold package account offered a mile bonus to me. the miles were awarded to my account package. the miles were awarded to me.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4594,'06/23/2016','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','Good Afternoon, I sent Discover Student Loans a message inquiring about how much interest I was being charged per month. I explained to them, I did the daily simple interest method. For my loans, right now using that method, I ''m being charged around {$1.00} per day which is fine and that amounts to around {$35.00} per month in interest. 

I do n''t understand how I was charged {$70.00} in interest for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I made two payments, one on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016 for {$640.00} and another on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016 for {$540.00}. The amount of interest that would have accrued between those dates would have been around {$24.00}, not {$70.00}. For the months prior to that, I ''ve averaged around {$35.00} per month. 

The second issue, I pay interest monthly through my statement, and thats the {$35.00} or {$70.00} as seen above, now my overall balance is also increasing daily by around $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]- {$2.00}. So not only am I paying interest monthly on my statements, but I ''m also paying interest through having my balance grow. It seems to me, I ''m being double dinged on interest. 

Can you please research this or look into this for me? If interest was incorrectly calculated, can they apply that to my principal balance. For this loan, I originally took out {$26000.00} and my balance today is {$14000.00}. So far, I ''ve paid a total of {$21000.00} on this loan. ( {$15000.00} has gone towards principal and {$6600.00} has gone towards interest. ) So, if we were to minus the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( that has gone to principal ) out of the original balance not including interest, my balance today would be {$11000.00}. And that does n''t include the {$6600.00} that was already paid to interest. 

Can CFPB or Discover please help? 

Thank you.','DISCOVER BANK',8.0,8.0,'a loan company has a loan company that has a loan company. it has a loan company that has a loan company that has a loan company. the loan');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4595,'06/23/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','Credit Bureau refuses to remove or validate erroneous false information on my credit report. Credit Bureau Reps admit that a " computer " verifies it. I have repeatedly asked for their method of verification which is my right under the FCRA section 611 ( a ) ( 7 ). I have contacted the courthouse and I have a letter from the Clerk of Court that stated that they DO NOT VERIFY with the bureaus. They will not tell me what third party vendor they " verify '''' with so that I can dispute directly with them. 
The information that they are reporting has many factual inaccuracies which they refuse to correct or delete.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'credit bureau reps admit that a " computer " verifies it. they refuse to remove or validate erroneous false information. they refuse to correct or delete the information');
