Regions Bank needs to notify me that this bill was a mistake, that the collection agency will not harass me again over a bogus bill, and that this does not appear on my credit report. Period.','REGIONS FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a collection agency called to collect a debt owed to Regions Bank. a collection agency called to report a debt. a collection agency called to report a');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4605,'06/21/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Problems caused by my funds being low','I am writing to complain about a penalty charge of {$89.00} put on my sole current account at US bank. 
On the morning of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016, I checked my account which showed a balance of negative {$20.00}, while in the process going to the bank to deposit the {$20.00}, I was told that my account was actually negative {$89.00}. I attempted to call customer service for assistance, but was scolded about what : my job '''' is as a customer. There was no valid explanation about why the account showed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different balances, within hours apart. I am requesting assistance from the Federal Reserve Consumer for help. bill. transaction. I do not understand this as I was not overdrawn on my account at that time.','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,2.0,'a penalty charge is put on my sole current account at US bank. the account showed a balance of negative $20.00. the account was negative $');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4606,'06/20/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','I received my experian credit report today [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 ... .The report is dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016. My express account is still showing as accounts that are potentially negative. I immediately contacted experian to dispute this because I have supplied them with a letter staing that this account should be reporting as accounts in good standing. I spoke with the rep and was told the express account was updated on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016 and showing as accounts in good standing. However the report I received today shows different. I requested a new and corrected report be mailed to me and was told I have to wait till it ''s updated. I am very confused as I was told the report updated on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016 and the report I received today is date [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016 so this account should have be updated and moved to satisfactory already. I went online and it shows accounts in good standing. But I am concerned because if I apply for credit and my report is pulled it is going to show incorrect information. I was unable to receive another report. I want to see it in writing that this account is reporting as accounts that are in good standing.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'experian credit report is dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016. my express account is still');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4607,'06/20/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','1st I submitted a dispute as " not mine '''' the information came back as verified. After reading information on the internet ( dangerous, I know ) I came across the FCRA 605 ID theft request for block. Armed with knowledge I promptly went to the local police department and fill out a report in relation to Id theft ; I then filed an FTC affidavit. after all that work I was ready to tackle [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] once more. I bundled all the information and sent it off! 4 days later received this ... Results Of Your Investigation ( For your security, the last [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] digits of your credit account number ( s ) have been replaced by * ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] We have reviewed the current address. The results are : The current address has been added/updated per the information you have supplied. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] We have reviewed your concerns and our conclusions are : Please be advised that Equifax , at this time, will not block the information subject to the submitted identity Theft and/or police report you provided as part of your dispute. We are contacting each creditor directly to verify The account/s on your behalf. We will also forward a copy of documents you have provided to each creditor for their Review.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a dispute was made with the information you provided as part of your dispute. the information came back as verified. the information came back as verified.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4608,'06/20/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','Firstly, this is a new complaint against the same mortgage company ( Nationstar ) as my first complaint was. 
