INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4631,'06/12/2016','Debt collection','I do not know','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','For the past 2 weeks I have been receiving harassing phone calls from Fair Collection and Outsourcing ( FCO ) regarding an alleged debt owed to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have spoken to this agency once and informed them that I have never lived in Maryland and that they have the wrong individual. Today, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016. I received a collections letter in the mail informing me that I owe {$8000.00} and that I need to pay it. I have reviewed my credit report from all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureaus. This company has inquired about my credit via [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] without my permission or consent. I suspect this is a scam as the company called my home and asked to speak to me but then they wanted me to give them the last [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] digits of my social security number and/or my mailing address. I did not provide them with either. In addition, I am sending FCO a certified letter requesting validation of debt and reporting them to the fraud department at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] before they try to add false negative debt information to my credit.','FAIR COLLECTIONS & OUTSOURCING, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a collection letter in the mail has been sent to fair collection and outsourcing. a debt owed to me is a debt. the company has inquired about my credit');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4632,'06/12/2016','Bank account or service','Savings account','Account opening, closing, or management','I am excercising Power of Attorney over joint assets, because JP Morgan has engaged in the elder abuse of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] attempted to use their money from account [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a joint account with my name on it, they were denied access to their money. They could not access funds to pay an exterminator for maintenance services of real estate property. There is a specific company set up to manage real estate property and assets, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] My company, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is helping with the real estate law management of this situation. JP Morgan has repeatedly spat in my face and abused elderly people in my family. They have repeatedly committed acts of fraud and taken over {$200000.00} in cash assets and real estate assets from me. They have also given [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and other questionable individuals access to money from my bank accounts when they did not have any legal right to. I would say that the people running JP Morgan have some severe mental issues. If I am given a difficult time while exercising power of attorney over joint assets, I am going to have my elder law attorney file papers in surrogate court. JP Morgan is under investigation by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for participating in this type of abuse. I already have been to the correct court and I have obtained a judge ''s order against certain abusive third parties. If the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] continues, I am going to begin to file motions against JP Morgan.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,4.0,'a company set up to manage real estate property and assets is helping with real estate law management. a judge has ordered a motion against the abusers. the abuser');
