On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was handling the file, I decided to request for the Beneficiary of my house Note. These requests continued until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], when [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] produced a fake name of a Beneficiary ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and address of which a certified mail was returned undelivered. 
On XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the Servicing of my loan was transferred to Ocwen Loan Servicing. I continued to request the same Note Holder ''s information and the title information, but always receiving partial documentation ; hoping that I would stop my requests. 
