We are able to provide any work travel or bank documentation ( i.e. check cancellation, etc. ) as verification during these events to assist in reviewing and granting this approval to remove the negative report from our account/credit.','FIRST MORTGAGE CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'first mortgage checks were not deposited during the month of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the checks were not deposited and the payments were not processed. first');
