This erroneous debit of funds has caused my Chase account to be overdrawn by the amount of $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called customer service promptly at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to resolve the issue. A large sum of money has essentially been taken from me without explanation, remedy, or even the most basic level of customer service offered. 

