INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4669,'06/01/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Rewards','Filed a complaint about Amex telling me on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different occasions that I was eligible for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] point offer. I told Amex to check their phone recordings in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they said they were not available. CFPB notified Amex about my complaint and they sent me a letter. The letter states that they did review the phone listings and the representatives did not inform me of my eligibility. So [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] lies [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they were not available and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] if available there would support my case. Amex includes a general phone number for some not involved and ca n''t really respond. I asked the general rep. to request the consumer advocates dept.. for the transcripts of my call on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to employee [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Its a nice smoke screen that most people would just give up. They made a mistake and at least I want an apology','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'CFPB notified amex about my complaint and sent me a letter. CFPB notified me about my complaint and they sent me a letter. if available');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4670,'05/31/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Rewards','My credit card account was closed abruptly and I called the bank but they did not have any information to provide other than saying a letter has been sent on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but that does not help me. 
For this card I pay an annual fee and I have lots of rewards associated with this credit card account. I have always paid on time actually paid mostly ahead of time and If Barclay wanted to end relationship they should have informed me ahead of time so I would have moved to another company. I have followed every policy and Barclay by ending abruptly is gaining more than [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] $ in rewards which they have refused to give me back as they claim that can be redeemed only when account is open, but the account was closed by Barclay not me so they taking my rewards is not a fair for me. I choose to use Barclay for my purchases only for the rewards otherwise I would have moved to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] etc. 
I believe Barclay has scammed many customers like this as I see this is a pattern of behavior exhibited by Barclay. The only reason I was with Barclay was for the rewards as I do have high spending purchases and it makes sense for me to get the best cash back in term of rewards for my purchases which help offset my cost. I have more than {$3000.00} spent on travel and could have easily redeemed the {$600.00} rewards had they provided me a notice for their intent to break the relationship. I spoke to a supervisor [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from Barclays and she mentioned that they are unable to help as account is closed and there is no much she could do. Barclay did not attempt to call me or even inform me of this, I happened to know that my account was closed when I had logged in to their website. I also want to clearly state my account does not have any disputes charges every purchased are verified purchase and authorized purchases. With Barclay holding my rewards it puts me at a tough spot as I am not willing to sacrifice my rewards for a scam bank like Barclay. I am reaching out to seek your help me get back my rewards and annual fee of {$89.00} back for the mistake done by Barclays and also put an advisory to consumers on how these companies are scamming individuals. The total miles that barclay did not credit me was close to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] miles including the 10 % which I would have got back for redeeming towards my travel purchases. i would like to see {$680.00} posted as credit to my account.','BARCLAYS BANK DELAWARE',2.0,2.0,'barclay has refused to give me back rewards for redeemed purchases. a supervisor from barclays said that the account was closed. he said that the bank did');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4671,'05/31/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Disclosure verification of debt','I have a a unverified account [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I had previously disputed this account with BAY AREA CREDIT SERVICE. I have never done business with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Pursuant to the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ) 15 U.S.C.169g, I dispute the validity of the debt [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] purport I owe.This is a old account from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( bal. {$250.00} ) that has been sold at least four times to various Third Party collections agencies and the previous agencies could not validate the account and it was deleted form my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit report. 
I request that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Provide verification of the following : 1. ) The original Application or contract ; 2. ) Any and all statements allegedly related to this debt ; 3. ) Any and all signed receipts ; 4. ) Any and all canceled checks ; 5. ) Original date of default and collection activity begin 6. ). Whether you purchased the debt, and if so, the amount paid for the debt 7. ) The date ( s ) the debt allegedly accrued ; 8. ) An itemization of the costs, including an accounting, for any additional interest, charges, or other fees placed on this account. I want to request that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Cease and Desist all further communications and collection actives and provide the verification of the purported debt.','I.C. System, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a unverified account has been sold at least four times to third party collections agencies. the account was deleted from my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit report ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4672,'05/31/2016','Debt collection','Medical','Taking/threatening an illegal action','over the past 1 year a debt collector called about a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollar fee for a medical dev ice on my husbands [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I told the company to pick it up before because it did not work properly anyway. At the time the man who called cussed me out, yelled at me, threaten me. He said awful things. My husband suffered a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].I was taking care of him full time .With no help. I have no family. He is also a veteran and now he is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Mind you this bill was from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when this man did this he probably called 50 times. Than after about4 months another man started calling from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. He was trying to collect and said it was handed to him and he was with a law office. I told him to quit calling me. Well he did not stop. He plays the nice guy. I told him I was not paying and to sue us. I also told him my husband is almost [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and has a brain disorder leave us alone. He wanted the machine back but medicare paid for that i found out. Please do something for us. I have a husband ill and am [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','Law Office of Charles G. McCarthy Jr. & Assoc.',2.0,2.0,'debt collector called about a medical dev ice on my husbands. he called me 50 times and he probably called 50 times. he was trying to collect the');
