INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4682,'05/26/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I had a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Card with a {$0.00} balance. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] apparently decided to switch their business to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I did not want a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] nor did I receive one. Several months later in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016, I received a bill from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called and was told that I should have known about this and that I owed this money. When I asked what it was for they indicated that it was for the annual fee +late charges+interest. I asked how they could charge me an annual fee on a card that I had neither signed for nor asked for. - They indicated that they did not charge it, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] did ( I recd no bill from them ) and then [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] transferred the charge to their [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They indicated they could reverse the the late fees etc. and make sure they did not get on my credit report if I agreed for them to send me a new card ( which meant paying the {$40.00} ) I felt compelled to do this to keep my credit rating. Before I activated the new card, I checked my credit report and found they had reported me to the credit agency. Not only that but they had once again charged me late fees and interest even though I did not have a new account number to send the {$40.00} to. Once again I called them and asked to speak to a supervisor -after telling me that they could not do that without me giving my social security number, I told them I was calling the FTC and a supervisor was instantly found. I told the supervisor my story and told her that I did not want the card because they had lied to me about sending the information to the credit agency and charged me fees and interest once again even though I had no new credit card number to apply a payment to. She indicated that I could have cancelled the card last month when I spoke to the other person because it was within their time frame but now it was too late and I must pay the {$40.00}. 
I have now paid the $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] however, I feel I should not have to pay a fee for a credit card I could not and did not use for all these months - In addition, I feel my credit report should be wiped clean of this mess. I feel that it is fraudulent to charge a fee on one account after you have indicated you will not be doing business and then trade the charge to another account without the express ( written ) consent of the consumer. If this is legal please tell me in what section of the Federal Rules it resides and I will be looking to get the law changed in favor of the consumer. 
I want my fee refunded and my credit report cleansed. Thank you','BARCLAYS BANK DELAWARE',2.0,4.0,'a card with a balance of $0.00 was sent to me by a supervisor. they indicated that they did not charge the card, and then transferred the charge to their');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4683,'05/26/2016','Consumer Loan','Vehicle loan','Taking out the loan or lease','I entered into a contract with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Ohio ( buy here pay here auto sales ). The car sold was a lemon and the transmission died on the vehicle early in the loan. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Would not help me and sent me to call Guardian Finance whom bought out the loan on the vehicle. I was told by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to send the car to an approved auto body shop and she would approve for the car to get fixed ; then she would take the price of the fix on the car and put it on the back of my loan. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reneged on this deal after a verbal agreement was made. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] approved for the car to get fixed then told me I owed upfront for the car and an incurring balance for the car ''s loan. I was unable to pay {$3000.00} for this process and the car was commandeered instead. Guardian Finance sued me for the {$3000.00} ; posted on my credit report that I owed {$3500.00} with them and {$3000.00} with the courts. The creditor proceeded to harass me and my family for the money telling family and friends that I owed on another amount for the loan. Now, Guardian Finance has reported on my credit report that I owe them {$8000.00} instead of {$3500.00}. This car was resold after being fixed.','PARK NATIONAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'the car sold was a lemon and the transmission died on the vehicle early in the loan. the car was resold after being resold after being fixed. the');
