d n''t pay bills nor could I take care of other important things I had to and this company did n''t give a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] way or the other and within 24 hours they have tried to force me to go to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of their branches when I made it very clear that I ''m [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and not able to get to either of their branches which once again why I opened the account online. I have health issues and I was kept on the phone for hours being transferred from this person to that person more than once. 

