This appears to be a bait and switch by Chase to enroll card holders through travel rewards and then at a future date after all conditions were met to deny those promised promotions.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'a new cardholder has never applied for a promo like this before. he received a letter from Chase stating the premium was denied. the promotion was only available to');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4718,'05/15/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 CFPB CC EQUIFAX Dear CFPB I want to thank you for allowing me to argue my case on behalf of Equifax I have submitting documents after documents on supporting my point about Equifax in violation pof the FCRA 609 ACT that congress put into law to protect consumer ''s I have sent in document ''s, Certified letter recipt costing well Over {$100.00} or more and they have still not yet demand my request. They are well Over there 30 days of investigation time that the federal government allow them to investigate such a complaint. As you know we have recieved on your site from they did n''t know what i was disputing from they have verify the account with the orginial creditor.. I had forward supporting documents on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that they are reporting the wrong account number That is none of mine. so there Investigation is a straight up Lie.. I asked Once again to have have the closed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account removed from my credit file and also the barclaycard card beremoved ( not my account ) and the closed onemain account be removed as well. Since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] i have been asking for documents from Equifax since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2016 and nothing yet So cfpb I ask you to take this case Over and take all the Legal power that you have to fine this company to your fullest. The reporting agencies number 1 is not for the consumer ''s as we all Know but their is a federal law in place that they have to follow that law and do it promptly I can not break the laws and bilaw and you can not either so why should equifax think that they do not have to follow the federal so I thank you so much for allow me to use your site to argue and fight for my rights ... ( So i asked you to take charge and do what you have to do to the fullest!! 
Thank you [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'cfpb asks you to take this case over and take all the Legal power that you have to fine this company to your fullest. cfpb asks');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4719,'05/15/2016','Debt collection','Medical','Disclosure verification of debt','CFPB, The amount of the allege debt in question is {$1200.00}. This amount should be {$200.00}. I have been trying to resolve this matter with Central Financial Control and only to be ignored and transfer from department to department with no resolution in sight. 

I have sent out request for verification of this debt which requires Central Financial Control to obtain proper account level documentation and they have yet to provide me of this from the original creditor ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). I even went as far as contacting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they have no records of this debt in their system. Central Financial Control continues to collect and report to all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureaus. 

In addition to this Central Financial is reporting to the credit bureaus that I ''m " Late '''' causing severe damage to my credit report and score. How can this be when CFC is a collection agency and not lender or financial institution that grants installment or revolving lines of credit to consumers. This is a violation of the FCRA and FDCPA by misrepresentation of themselves. 

Another issue is " 1 month term '''' being displayed. Again what contract or agreement did I enter with you at the time when you purchase this debt from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. You are engaging in misleading and deceptive practices and collecting on debts that you can not obtain proper verification.','TENET HEALTHCARE CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'the amount of the allege debt in question is $1200.00. this amount should be $200.00. Central Financial Control has yet to provide me of');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4720,'05/14/2016','Debt collection','Credit card','Taking/threatening an illegal action','I failed to appear in court for a credit card debt in 2009 and there is now a judgement against me. I was unemployed for 5 years and was unable to pay the debt. There is now a lein on my bank accounts and i can not access my funds.','Blitt and Gaines, P.C.',2.0,2.0,'i failed to appear in court for a credit card debt in 2009. there is now a judgement against me.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4721,'05/14/2016','Debt collection','Credit card','Communication tactics','I was only 8 days overdue for my payment. I was initialy called at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on Friday, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016. Woman collector, I informed her I had some unexpected financial issues and I would pay as soon as I could. She ignored my information and she argued with me over harassment laws ; not the subject of the collection. Also on Friday, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the Citibank automated service started calling at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( immediately after human collector call ), [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], all were hang up calls except for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when the automated service left a voicemail message for me to call Citibank immediately. Saturday, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016, the automated service called and hung up again. That is six ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) calls within a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] hour period. I know they are all from Citibank as the same phone number and location come up on my caller id.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'the Citibank automated service started calling at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on friday. the automated service started calling at [COMPTE_ANONYMIS');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4722,'05/13/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Improper contact or sharing of info','This is the letter I sent to CPA with no response. It explains the negligent actions taken by the debt collector. I would appreciate my name being cleared or restitution being made for the adverse effects this has on my finances " I received a letter about a collection being made for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. It was actually for my roommate, but the account was in my name, so that was not your fault. The letter threatened to report to the credit bureau if I did not pay or set up a payment plan. Not wanting the hit on my credit, I decide it ''s just best to take care of it myself. I call about setting up a payment plan, and am told it can only be divided into 2 payments. So I pay the first and set up to pay the second in a months time. I am told that I have complied with all requests, and as long as I make my final payment, there would be no more action taken. About a week later I relieve a letter saying that my remaining balance has been reported to the credit agencies. I confirm on a credit site, and sure enough, my credit has taken a huge hit due to this. I am in the market for a car and house and this has set me back an immeasurable amount. I believe, at the very least, the rest of my debt should be forgiven, and I would like a formal notice sent to the credit agencies that you reported to. If that repairs my credit to the previous state, I would consider the matter resolves. But such a hit to my credit would take an extremely long time to repair as well as costing me thousands of dollars. I complied with every request of yours and was still adversely affected. I would really like for you to make restitution on this matter as I do not want to have to contact further agencies about the matter. I do not believe honest business tactics were used and I will take every avenue I can to right this injustice. Thank you for your time, and I look forward to hearing from you soon. "','Credit Protection Association, L.P.',2.0,2.0,'a letter from a debt collector explains the negligent actions taken by the debt collector. the letter threatened to report to the credit bureau if I did not pay or set up ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4723,'05/13/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','Capital One Bank, Loan opened XX/XX/2008 [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] mtg. Shortly after the loan was opened the financial crisis hit. I went past due almost right away and was charged off. I continued to work with the bank catching up on payments to avoid fcl. After catching up I asked the CSR why it still showed a charge off on my report. She told me they had a policy that I had to stay current for one year and until then it would show charge off. I argued that I could not refinance the house at a lesser rate and pay them off because of the charge off on my report. I was current buy they refused to change the rating. Time passed I went in and out of delq all along trying to sell the house. They hounded me at home and work even leaving message on my work recorder that they were going to forclose causing me quite the emb at work. I continued to try to sell the house but to no avail. I then became sick and was in the hospital for quite some time, my neighbors helped keep the house up and on the market but no one was buying. When I got out of the hospital I called them to tell them I was out and was going to begin to borrow from friends to bring current again. 
Two days later they filed for fcl. I get it, I kept trying to sell the house and got a bid that would pay off the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] if I came up with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at closing. I told them I would be a little short at closing and they told me too bad and continued the fcl. I had to file bk to stay in the house and get another place to live. I did this, they got the house in fcl. After filing bk they sent me invoices for two years for the full amount and at the bottom it said " this is not an invoice ''''. So I have asked them to change or delte the account because of their FDCPA violations, their claims they were helping people during that time and they would not even short sale the account for less then [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], because that even after I brought the account current they refused to change it from a charge off so I could refi at a lower rate and pay them off. Capital One went out of their way to make sure I was fcl on and evicted even when they had several chances to change the rating and allow me to refi. I have disputed this with the credit reporting agencies on 6 sep occasions and asked for documents and for them to report the first date of delq and they just respond saying " investigation complete '''' without sending me a thing. I dont think a person looks at the disputes I think, just like my fcl, it is all automated. I have spoken with one attorney, not retained, and he wants me to just sue them but I feel at the end of the day despite the financial crisis, despite that homes of this value would not sell I was responsible. With that said I am not responsible for robo fcl ''s or robo responses to my disputes. If the will delete the account I will go about my business if they wont I will take this to court for all it is worth. The recording of the lady telling me " I better pay up or I will be out in the street '''' should be worth something in front of a Jury. Once again I only want them to delte the account nothing more and nothing less. Thank you','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'capital one bank, Loan opened XX/XX/2008. a year later the bank showed a charge off on my report. a year later the bank was');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4724,'05/13/2016','Mortgage','VA mortgage','Settlement process and costs','We refinanced our VA loan with Lowvarates.com The process began about XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or XX/XX/2016. Because we were a " streamline '''' VA refinance, we did not have to have alot of paperwork done and were advised it would n''t take long. We were " about '''' to close on several occasions and finally XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we got a closing date of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016. We signed all of the closing papers on Friday, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016. We understood that our XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment was included in the payoff and we would not have to make the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment. We went on about our business and on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016 I received an email from our broker. He sent the email after [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] p.m. and I read it somewhere around [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. He advised that there was a mistake in he paperwork and we had to resign the papers. They sent a notary to us around [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to sign the corrected paperwork. After the paperwork was corrected we realized that the mistake in the paperwork delayed the funding and they payoff of our old loan did not happen until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016. At that point, the our payment that we were told was paid in the payoff of the house was 30 days late. We had spent the month of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] expecting to close on more than one occasion and did not make the payment because we were supposed to close and were told it would be included. The next morning I emailed our broker and asked about if we would be considered 30 days late, his exact words were, " you should n''t. With that said, if the lender does report we will provide a letter to clear it. '''' So with that, we were ok UNTIL a couple of weeks later I checked my credit and saw that the payment WAS reported 30 days late and it had reduced our scores nearly [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] points. Our broker wrote a letter to the mortgage company explaining that we were told the payment was made, but our mortgage company refused to make any change to the reporting. 
Our broker should have told us this could happen! He should have advised us to pay that payment immediately - although it was already after [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when he tried to contact us on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the month and the payment was more than likely already late.','United Military Mortgage, LLC',2.0,2.0,'we signed all of the closing papers on Friday, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANON');
