INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4755,'05/04/2016','Mortgage','Home equity loan or line of credit','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','I have a home equity line of credit with USAA in the amount of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I am current in my payments with the loan, but have been late in the past. Due to previous late payments, USAA froze the account, meaning I am unable to borrow more money. However, they report it as " closed '''' to the credit agencies. Having [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in revolving debt but not an offsetting amount of credit, creates a credit utilization ratio of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] %. This significantly hurts my credit report and makes it impossible to get things like car loans or credit cards. The account is not " closed '''' it is frozen.','UNITED SERVICES AUTOMOBILE ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'a home equity line of credit with USAA in the amount of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is currently in my payments with the loan. due to previous late');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4756,'05/03/2016','Debt collection','I do not know','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] your agency completed an investigation and entered into a Consent Judgment with Ocwen Financial Corporation and Ocwen Loan Servicing , LLC for unlawful conduct related to loan servicing and foreclosure processing.The purpose of this communication is to alert you to the fact that Ocwen has, to the best of my knowledge and belief, violated that agreement pertaining to one of the most significant restrictions in that agreement, i.e. : submitting forged documents in a judicial foreclosure proceeding. 

The history of our case is lengthy and not necessary to detail at this time other than there have been three attempts to foreclose on our home since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and all have failed due to submission or public recording of a plethora of fraudulent and/or forged documents. 

The most recent attempt to foreclose was filed on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which contained exhibits and documents supplied by Ocwen as the loan servicer. Among the exhibits was an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to the Note which had not previously appeared in the preceding foreclosure filed in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] nor did it surface in a Chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bankruptcy filed previous to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] foreclosure action. 

Despite Ocwen ''s assurance to your agency ( as well as all of the Attorneys General listed in the Consent Judgment ) that they would refrain from using fraudulent or forged documents in foreclosure proceedings, Ocwen included this ( undated ) Allonge to the Note in this third foreclosure filing even though there should have been historical records available to them to verify the validity of the initials of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Option One, on this very important document. My own diligent research uncovered what I believed to be [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] actual initials and handwriting derived from her very own mortgage documents. I hired a handwriting expert to compare the initials on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to actual mortgage documents of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the conclusion was that it was not the same individual. Once I supplied this information to my attorney and he in turn supplied it to counsel for the Plaintiff ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) just prior to trial, Plaintiff mysteriously and suddenly withdrew their complaint and counsel for Plaintiff also quickly withdrew their representation of Plaintiff. 

In addition to recording a forged/fraudulent document in a court proceeding, Ocwen continues to harass us by mail in attempt to collect a debt that was categorized in default at the time they ( or their predecessors ) obtained the account.','OCWEN LOAN SERVICING LLC',2.0,4.0,'a judicial foreclosure proceeding has been filed on a plethora of fraudulent documents. the most recent attempt to foreclose was filed on [COMPTE_ANON');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4757,'05/03/2016','Debt collection','I do not know','False statements or representation','These folks filed a garnishment on my wages. But, when I called to make arrangements before the first garnishment payment came out I was told they would stop the garnishment. They did not. When making the arrangements and signing documents I asked if I could print and fax the papers, so I had time to read them. I was told they could not have time to stop the garnishment if I did n''t sign right now. I was told where to sign while an agent was on the phone with me on hold. I told them I needed to go but they insisted I sign all the papers or they could stop the garnishment. I signed the papers so I would not miss the opportunity to get the garnishment stopped. The following Friday my paycheck was short [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I called them and asked what happened? They denied telling me the garnishment would stop. I was then told the garnishment would stop after [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on time payments. So I said you are taking 5 months of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] garnishment and my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payments? they said yes. They said we will send a modification to reduce you garnishment to 5 %. They did not. I would not be near as upset about any of this until I got the documents detailing my arrangements request for additional documentation. They are charging me {$13000.00} on a {$10000.00} dollar loan. After 5 month of garnishment i will have only paid the their collection fees. And on top of that I have to send in more documentation before the arrangement is valid. They were calling XXXX5 times a day, weekends, and holidays. Making me crazy. They began calling my ex-husband and my daughter. I just do n''t understand how they can garnish me and take payments at the same time and I am paying 30 % in collection fees on a Federal student loan.','ECMC Group, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a garnishment payment came out on my wages. they denied telling me the garnishment would stop. they said they will send a modification to reduce you garnishment to 5 ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4758,'05/03/2016','Consumer Loan','Vehicle loan','Managing the loan or lease','I went to drive time with my granddaughter to buy a car. I was told I had to " cosign '''' for her. She did not make timely payments however has paid [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] more than if she had. This has my credit looking very poorly. Drive time refuses to sent me itemized statements. And to top it off I was told I was n''t a " cosigner '''' at all. Her names nowhere on the contract yet she signed the same paperwork I did.','DriveTime',2.0,2.0,'drive time refuses to send me itemized statements. she signed the same paperwork she did.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4759,'05/03/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Disclosure verification of debt','Received Alert for my credit bureau alerts stating I have an open account and failed to pay to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I closed my account with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and due to previous collection tactics I was told to deal straight with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] phone serivce due to previous problems with collection shrewed tatics, threating court ect. I have been in communications with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] paying the last balance of my account which is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I ''m was confused when I received an alert from my credit montntoring agency that states that Convergent Collections indicates that they have been attempting to collect a debt in which I never received correspondent especially since I have been dealing with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and paying by check. In order to report to the credit bureaus of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they must show that they have been in contact with my debt in an extensive time, I fails to make any attempt to pay my debt, which is crazy cause i have a check for last months agreement of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] cashed out by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have no written correspondence from Convergent or any contact with any rep, or even a written correspondence to dispute any amount. Under fair credit reporting jaw can you submit to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Credit bureau without any documentation, phone call or any correspondence and then report on my credit without any written correspondence. Under fair credit reporting is is unjustifiable, especially since I was and have paid a whole [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance and have been speaking to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] even when they reported this to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit bureau.','Convergent Resources, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'alerts from credit bureaus stating I have an open account and failed to pay to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. alerts from credit bureaus indicate that');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4760,'05/03/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Other','Bank of America continues to pursue Collections for a balance that was long ago reported as dispute : reason fraud. They are sending no reply emails to collect on account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], after first trying to Collect on account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( not sure if that ''s the exact lastXXXX because I shredded the card then was cut off from electronic statements. 

The reason for card re-issuance was the fraud on that number. After reporting that there should not be ANY balance on the card I was not using or receiving paper statements for, and receiving acknowledgement that this is clearly fraud, I suggested CLOSING the card for reason : Lost/Stolen and replacing it to prevent further fraud. 

The balance was verbally agreed to be in dispute, and I had to go to the Fidelity Service center to request they act on my behalf after nearly a week of not being able to get through to the department to be transferred to for fraud & disputes. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] made the call for me and was privy to the conversation. 

The vendor was changed because of their gross negligence, and the account was purchased as part of a collections portfolio, when it should have been a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance and off my credit report. In fact, the account was only reported delinquent AFTER I reported fraud, placed the balance in dispute and was reissued a new card. A week or more later I received a credit alert that I was delinquent. 

I am willing to email BoA and have in writing what is being communicated but they are only sending no-reply emails with demands to contact Collections, noting the time frame within which they require an item to be placed in dispute. I am not willing to place the item in dispute AGAIN and miss their imposed time frame. The balance continues to grow, along with my desire to expose their devious practices to every person on the face of the earth. 

This was supposed to be resolved a very long time ago, and was the result of not doing the most basic fraud detection and prevention that is the expected standard for a financial institution. I am not willing to get into their technicality trap of fine legal print because they are ignoring the original dispute. They should not be in the banking business to be perfectly honest. 

This is an addendum to complaint # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'a balance was reported as dispute : reason fraud. the balance was verbally agreed to be in dispute. the balance was only reported delinquent AFTER I reported');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4761,'05/02/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','Real Time solutions continues to report a balance owed to them at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] based upon a 2nd mortgage that was foreclosed on back in 2006. According the Fair Credit Reporting Act, a creditor is only allowed to report inaccurate information on one ''s credit report for a period of seven years. However, Real Time Solutions has purposely changed the dates of activity on this account to continue to report it. This is a direct violation of my rights, as outlined in the Fair Credit Reporting Act.','Real Time Resolutions, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'real time solutions continues to report a balance owed to them at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] based');
