INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4815,'04/15/2016','Credit card',NULL,'APR or interest rate','I have several credit cards through J P Morgan Chase. I have had to carry a balance on these cards because of emergencies and various other expenses. I have a perfect payment record for over ten years! I recently called this bank to ask for a lower interest rate ( now at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % ) and this terrible institution refused after a half hour on the phone. Is this agency doing anything about this legalized loan sharking? Why are these criminal interest rates allowed to stand? Credit card reform is almost meaningless without attacking these high rates. Again, I have a perfect payment record for over a decade- no late fees, no missed payments. Please advise. Thank you','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'credit card reform is almost meaningless without attacking these high rates. I have a perfect payment record for over a decade.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4816,'04/14/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','False statements or representation','My wife and I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] around [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to see if we could restart service with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] using the Overdrive Pro device that we still had but was out of contract. After further conversation with some potential hope that we could activate it we were told that we could n''t because the device was outdated. We explained that we were looking for something that would allow us to watch my daughter ''s basketball games and for my son ''s x-box. We were offered a newer device that was supposed to be better and the lady checked the coverage area and said we should have good coverage. We agreed on a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] plan to start and was told that we could monitor data used right from the device itself. We received the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to activate it. We were told to really use the device to see if its something that ''s going to work for you. We were told that just in case that you see its not going to work you have 14 days to cancel otherwise we would be obligated to contract. We used the device for a few hours and could not get the device to reveal data use. We called and reported this to sprint thinking we were not doing something right and was told that we would have to go on line to check our data. The first time we checked data on line we were well under the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. We used the device the next day for a few hours and when we checked on line it said we were over our limit ( but no way near the limit that they are reporting as " overage ''''? I immediately took out batteries and repacked the unit in its original container contacted sprint and reported that we were sending the unit back because its not going to work for us. I was told that we had just started the plan and we sill have 14 days to try it and I told them I did n''t need 14 days to know that it ''s not for us. I was told that we had to pay a re-stocking fee of {$35.00} and we had to wait for a return package to arrive and to send it back in that package. I was not happy about the restock fee but paid it and returned the unit in new condition. I totally dispute the validity of this referenced dept. for the following reasons. 1. We did not receive the device that was agreed upon during our order. During initial order conversation with the lady we were told that " we could monitor the data used from the device '''' That was False. 2. We were told to really use the device to see if it is something that ''s going to work for you. We were told that we had 14 days to try out and if there were any problems we would have to cancel before the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] day, after that we would be obligated to contract. ( By looking at the first bill of {$57.00} to now {$510.00} that was false ) and for what two days of use for hours at a time? 3. After seeing the overage of more than [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but not the amount they are reporting we contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] immediately and the device was returned ASAP in new condition. According to the initial representative we could have still continued to use the device up until the 13 day and then cancel and return it with no obligation. 4. After receiving first bill of {$57.00} bill dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] told them what happened and that I did n''t know why I was being charged? I was told that they could see that there was a problem and that they would have a supervisor call me to fix problem. I gave them my cell number, They never called. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] collection agency to make them aware of my dispute, during that conversation I was told that part of this bill was for early termination fee? How is that possible when I never was in contract?','AFNI INC.',4.0,4.0,'a newer device was offered to watch my daughter''s basketball games and for my son. we were told that we couldn''t use the device because it was outdated');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4817,'04/14/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Application, originator, mortgage broker','Complaint Details I filled out an application for prequalification on a home mortgage about a month ago. After about 3 days i received a prequalification letter saying i was qualified for a home loan of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with 5 % down. It said that the next step was to find a home and get a contract. So I did.I put [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] $ down ernest money and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] $ for option period then another [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] $ on home inspection. I then had the realtor send over the contract and was instructed to call USAA to make sure everything was going well. Well I call the number listed on the pre qual and ask for the status and they say it has not been prequalified ... .then why did i get a prequalification letter? They said something might have got messed up so I went through the whole process again with no luck. The denial i got from the second one cited insf funds to close loan yet I had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in USAA buyer was going to pay [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] plus [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ernest and a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] gift ... that would be [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] plus by the time the loan closed i would have had another [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This is besides the point though ... I got a paper saying im prequalified for a loan through USAA yet when i called they said no. So someone made a mistake and it has cost me [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in inspections and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in option fees ... that is a {$490.00} error because i received a prequalification from USAA and began the home buying process. Only one person told me exactly what was going on and actually advised me that USAA offers first time home buyers program that would help us out. The first like 6 people should have told me about this program, I clearly told them this would be my fist home. Anyways I am not out {$490.00} and have wasted a month going back and forth with bad services. I have never had issues with any of my other products but to fail so badly and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] us over will make me seriously reconsider another product through this company. And I do expect a reimbursement for my losses as if I did not have that prequalification we would have never continued the process and spent that money. I also now have numerous credit pulls because all said and done I went through 4 applications before I got the full story.','UNITED SERVICES AUTOMOBILE ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'i received a prequalification letter from USAA saying i was qualified for a home loan of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with 5 % down');
