INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4834,'04/10/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Credit line increase/decrease','Since 2005 I approximate that I have had at least [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different AMEX cards. Those would be personal credit cards. I own [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] so maybe another [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]? I know my husband has had at least [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have had access to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] AMEX credit cards in the last 11 years. I was so grateful to have so many credit cards because those cards were what enabled me to juggled the finances of my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and maintain financial sanity at home. So when I was trying to book some Delta flights for my son and a friend to fly to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a scouting event, my husband to attend a family friend ''s funeral and an employee ''s flight for a weeklong conference, I was amazed by the lack of empathy on the part AMEX. 
Over the last 9 months I have had a false tax lien placed against me by the State of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Department of Taxation. I am still trying to have it removed from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] have both deleted it from their records. 
I found out we had a tax lien while I was applying for a VA Refinance Loan. We were told that we did n''t qualify due to our loan because of our credit scores being below their minimum requirement of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The lien was placed on my credit file in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I sought out the VA loan in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I own [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I reached out to those same credit cards that once saved me and AMEX had decreased my credit limits. This act injured my life twofold, first, my personal finances became very tight but I still managed to pay our bills and secondly my Credit Score took an unrecoverable nose dive. When AMEX lowered my credit limits my Credit Card Utilization increased causing my Credit Score to decrease. I have a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % Payment History. I am not a credit risk. 
Since then, I have been denied numerous times for all types of loans and credit increases. I requested a {$5000.00} increase on a business card for inventory in my retail but because of my credit score was poor, the bank that holds all of my business accounts, said " No. '''' When I asked her why, she said, " Your credit card utilization is too high. '''' If my credit limits had not been decreased I would only need to be dealing having a falsely placed Tax Lien on my record. 
Earlier this week, my son got the okay to go to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and he and another boy needed flights to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for this trip. Because, my son has just made [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and turned [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in a matter of weeks, I thought it would be a nice gesture and get him a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ticket. But that would n''t be right for him to sit alone in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. So, I used my first class companion ticket and now both scouts are flying in first class. When I went to purchase the tickets the system would only allow me to use my AMEX Delta Select credit card. Being forced to do so, I did. Then yesterday morning my husband got the call that his friend ''s father had died. I attempted to book him a flight paying with miles from of my Skymiles account and once again I was only allowed to use my AMEX Delta Reserve Card. BUT this time I could n''t, my card was now over its limit. So I booked my husband ''s flight on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] because they accepted my other credit cards. 
Last night I needed to book another flight, this time for an employee to fly from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for business. I decided to call AMEX to ask for a credit increase so I could use my AMEX Delta Reserve credit card to purchase my Delta flight. They denied the increase based on my incorrect credit score. How do you have a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % repayment rating but a low credit score? That ''s a separate complaint for a different company. I ended up calling Delta and buying her a coach ticket over the phone using a different credit card. 
I need my ability to obtain loans and credit. Please help.','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a false tax lien has been placed against me by the state of. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] department of taxation. the lien was placed on my');
