RCS is not taking responsibility for their problems. I see no reason for me to try and work around their issues. It cost me {$5.00} this time, but I had issues with them in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] where my payments were " lost '''' in their system for a few days at a time. This is the only servicer I had issues like this with. 
