In a letter dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Vice President, Customer Service, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Loans, she states : " Furthermore your allegations are regarding the previous servicer and not [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Please be advised [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is unable to confirm any actions or provide any answers in regards to the previous servicer as we are not affiliated with them. In order to have these concerns adequately addressed, you should contact your prior servicer directly. '''' Beneficial is the prior servicer and they refuse to address the problems.','HSBC NORTH AMERICA HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,2.0,'Beneficial continues to deny responsibility for the mistakes they made with our home loan. they sold our loan to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_');
