INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4886,'03/24/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I had an Inquiry on my credit report from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], So Icalled [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Texas where this Inquiry came from. I spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different people they ran my SS # they also ran my last name and my phone number as well. I was told they have no knowledge of any of this so I reported it to equifax as fraudlaunt and they respond with this letter within a few hours claiming it was verified.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'inquiry came from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Texas. I called the inquiry on my credit report.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4887,'03/24/2016','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I went to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and recieved little to no government assistance for some unknown reason, considering I was not dependant on my parents at all. This forced me to turn to private loans. Now, I have almost [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in private student loan debt. The monthly payments are {$1200.00} and I can not afford to live. Even after making this payments on the loans, my interest is 9 % ,8 %, 7 % interest so that the loans continue to get bigger. I own two businesses and would otherwise be doing well for myself. I have called, emailed, sent in letters to the private loan companies, only to have them raise my rates instead of lowering them. There is no end in sight, I would have to be making [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] per year just to live a normal life. Where is the protection on these loans? Why ca n''t I refinance them? 

The fact of the matter is this, this rock is too heavy to lift because it causes me to have a horrible credit score. Bad credit = no loans to buy a house or get money to start another businesses. It ''s a vicious cycle and I have exhausted all of my options. I can not refinance them because no one will lend me a better rate because of my credit ( even though I make every payment on time ). 

Please help me do something, anything to get out of this debt trap I am in. It has caused me to tell everyone I know to forgo college until this fraudulent behaviour is fixed.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,4.0,'i have almost [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in private student loan debt. the monthly payments are $1200.00 and I can not afford to live');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4888,'03/23/2016','Debt collection','I do not know','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','they keep calling. they wont send any verification of debt. they threaten to come to my place of work and have my boss sign papers. This is not my debt. I have never done business with a company called " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' now they placed the debt on my credit file','Midwest Recovery Systems',2.0,2.0,'they threaten to come to my place of work and have my boss sign papers. they placed the debt on my credit file.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4889,'03/23/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','I opened a checking account with Bank of America last year with the promotion of {$300.00}. I finished the requirement and confirmed with the customer service member. The endorsed that I had finished it and should just wait for the bonus to post. But I have never received this bonus ever since. When I was checking with the customer service people again, they refuse to admit that I was qualified for the promotion.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'a checking account with bank of America has been promoted. the customer service member endorsed that I had finished the requirement.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4890,'03/23/2016','Money transfers','Domestic (US) money transfer','Other transaction issues','I attempted to use PayPal to make a {$3500.00} from a credit card. Despite the fact that my credit card was listed as the payment method, the summary following the transaction stated that the payment would be drawn from my checking account. When I contacted PayPal, I spoke to a representative who explained I would need to contact the vendor or my bank to request a refund or stop payment, respectively. I explained that I would be responsible for an additional fee if I pursued either of those actions. The representative told me that PayPal was still in the process of contacting my bank. I asked that since payment had not actually been processed, that PayPal put a hold or cancellation on my payment so that I could correct which account was being used. She stated she was unable to assist me. I then asked to speak to a supervisor. After a significant amount of time on hold, I spoke to a supervisor named [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who was also unwilling to make any corrective actions. I asked to speak to his supervisor at this point. When he asked why, I told him that this is a consumer fairness issue. He again asked me why, and I reiterated the same response. He then told me " We will be happy to keep telling you the same information, '''' and placed me on hold again. I then waited on hold for over 25 minutes before hanging up without speaking to a senior supervisor.','PAYPAL HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,2.0,'a representative told me that PayPal was still in the process of contacting my bank. she said she was unable to assist me. she asked to speak to a supervisor who');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4891,'03/23/2016','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Account opening, closing, or management','PNC [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] branch is billing me for a safe deposit box owned by my deceased mother. 
I am not the executor of the account and I was not one of the cosigners when she passed. 
They added my name to a document they sent to my local branch. Next to my name is the address of my brother, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], who was the executor, POA, and cosigner for the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
My signature is not anywhere on the documents they sent., nor is my address. 
They added my name to documents without my consent. 
[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is bank manager whom I consider negligent and did not perform due diligence with this account, Initially told me I needed to provide a death certificate, even though they had on their files that she was deceased','PNC Bank N.A.',2.0,2.0,'the bank manager was not the executor of the account. she was not one of the cosigners when she passed. the bank manager was negligent and did not perform due diligence ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4892,'03/22/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','Do want to thank the CFPB for providing a forum to address Mortgage fraud. In my case JPMorgan Chase and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as the CEO. JPMorgan Chase was and is the judge and jury in this case of downright fraud. They gave me a verbal mortgage ( their written word ) and decided after the first payment that they would no longer accept anymore payments. Dealing with over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of their representatives - who were working under the direction of JP Morgan Chase with an incentive to foreclose on homes ( still waiting for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to confirm ). No amount of forms filled out and sent by every conceivable method would ever arrive intact for this company. The stress, the torture that I went through is unbelievable. The answer was always the same - your file is empty, nothing in the file - who gave you the mortgage, who told you your home is in foreclosure, we have no idea what you are talking about. In the meantime bills that I was not allowed to pay was being wracked up by this dishonest institution. They finally had to agree recently that the claim of sending [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] inspectors to our home was a mistake. I never saw one. No one ever rang the doorbell. Absolutely dishonest financial institution and as they say ''A fish stinks from the head down ''. Now I am constantly on a ''merry-go-round '''' of papers with them. Each week I can guarantee that they will send another form telling me that they are " Researching '''' and will get back to me. Researching what. You had nothing in the file to begin with, unless you are trying to find ways to lie. What is there to research after all this time and fooling the CFPB about ''partial response ''. A morass of corruption if ever I see one. At this time, I am taking my frustrations to the next level..Let me and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] take our case to the American Consumer. Let them continue with the useless ''researching and asking for extension '' routine. So thank you CFPB for providing a platform, however this is going nowhere and JPMorgan Chase has this figured out. In every instance of corporations and countries having a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] moment '' it is usually done by one individual. Well, I will make sure that ''Too Big to Fail '''' JPMorgan Chase has its day of reckoning and hope to one day see the CEO [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] doing the ''perp walk ''. It is about time. There are many politicians out there in this competitive election year who would definitely like to put a face to the mortgage mess created by dishonest institutions like JPMorgan Chase while taking government bailout. Thanks again to CFPB but dishonest institutions like JPMorgan Chase feel secure in knowledge that they can fool you and everyone with useless extensions.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,4.0,'CFPB gave me verbal mortgage and decided after first payment that they would no longer accept anymore payments. despite the fact that they were working under the direction of JP Morgan Chase');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4893,'03/22/2016','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I am writing a complaint about my mortgage company ditech, I was billed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which was grossly incorrect, so I contacted them. While doing so I encountered a representative that treated me with a discriminatory tone because I am a recipient of assistance with my mortgage. My payments are divided into a percentage that I pay and the remaining is paid by a subsidy. I have not had any issues with my previous mortgage company regarding my payments, but this is the second such incident I have encoutered with my current one. The call I am referring to took place on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016 at between [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and is recorded by the mortgage company. I was given [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different amounts owed during the call and finally the customer service representative said that after running the numbers she could not see where I owed the amounts stated but that it was about {$130.00}. She said she would have to get with her supervisor before she could say for sure. I was told that it was the fact that I get assistance that my statements are n''t accurate and that I should n''t go by my statements. I asked what other method could I go by to determine my payments.','Ditech Financial LLC',2.0,2.0,'ditech billed me for a mortgage which was grossly incorrect. the customer service representative said she could not see where I owed the amounts. she said she would have to');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4894,'03/22/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','Over the past year I received numerous letters regarding an alleged debt, In addition to phone calls. This company or individuals have been Continuously harassing me in regards to the alleged debt. In my attempt to put an end to these harassing letter I responded that I do not owe this individual or company any money. However, as soon as I responded to one company I receive a new Collection Letter but from different company but in the attempt to collect the same ALLEGED DEBT. I can not continue to respond to all these letters because it seems that this would be AN endless effort on my part','First National Collection Bureau, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a company or individual has been harassing me in regards to an alleged debt. this company or individuals have been continuously harassing me in regards to the alleged debt. however');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4895,'03/22/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I recently reviewed my Experian Credit Report. Since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I have been disputing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( Account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] & [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). On my Experian Credit Report these [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts show no payment activity and or transactions. Furthermore, the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts are more than 7 years old. ( # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] & [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] )','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts show no payment activity and transactions. the accounts are more than 7 years old.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4896,'03/21/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','Our latest mostly statement shows a deferred p and I in the amt of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and when I called and asked what this was about ditech could n''t tell me and said it was a mistake and to disregard it. When I asked for something in writing stating what they had just told me for my records I was told that they could n''t give me anything in writing only that it had been noted in our acct.','Ditech Financial LLC',2.0,2.0,'ditech apologises and says it was a mistake. ditech apologises and says it is a mistake.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4897,'03/21/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','The debt in which the collection agency has posted on my credit report does not belong to me. I have called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they have no file or information stating that I owe this debt and proof that it s mine. I have tried to contact the collection agency numerous of times and they can not provide me with proof either. Every time I call they put me on hold. One time I was on hold for 1 1/2 hours and never came on. I want to file a complaint and also seek legal council to help me with this.','Pinnacle Credit Services, LLC',2.0,2.0,'the debt in which the collection agency has posted on my credit report does not belong to me. I have called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and they have no file');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4898,'03/21/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Improper use of my credit report','I am disputing with Equifax certain inquiries that were added to my account which I gave NO authorization or consent for. I have requested to Equifax to remove them as these vendors and merchants have no permissible purpose to view my report in accordance to 15 U.S.C 1681b. I have faxed this dispute in and have provided CFPB with a copy of a confirmation.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'I have requested to remove some inquiries that were added to my account. they were added to my account which I gave no authorization or consent for.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4899,'03/21/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Customer service / Customer relations','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 I had with the continues calls from Chase & asked that they remove my phone numbers from their records. This however, was not honored so the calls continued. Everyday since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I received 4-9 calls/day. On Sunday ''s they doubled their efforts & called me every 1/2 hour.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'Chase has received 4-9 calls/day since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4900,'03/20/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Settlement process and costs','We were unable to close because the lender refused to accept hand-written corrections to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] application and the loan officer refused to correct the information in their system. In addition, we were told that if we refused to sign the blank continuation sheet we would not receive funding. Fannie Mae ''s own website as well as countless other agencies specifically warns consumers against signing blank forms. We had expressed concern about these issues well before closing and no corrections were made. At closing, we corrected the errors on the Form [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] by hand and drew a line across the blank page. The lender rejected the application form. We asked the loan officer who could correct these issues and we were told no one. The loan officer refused to release the funds out of escrow because we would not sign the forms containing incorrect financial information. 
We are retaining our current home with the intent of using it as a future rental. It has never had a mortgage or other lien. First, our current home was incorrectly listed as having a lien under the liabilities portion of Sec [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and having a value of more than twice its assessed value under the asset column. Fannie Mae ''s own instructions state to list real property expenses under Sec [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the " present '''' column with appropriate line items for taxes and hazard insurance. Second, in Sec [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the loan officer is insisting on listing our annual property tax and insurance expense as a mortgage liability when in fact it is not. A specific box for this expense does exist on the table. There are no current unpaid balances for property taxes or hazard insurance. Finally, page [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the URLA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is a continuation page to be " used if necessary ''''. While we understand that it is part of the application requiring signatures, it is absolutely unacceptable to expect an individual to sign a blank document. Surely, this is not the intent of the continuation page. A disclaimer such as, " No Additional Information Included '''' or something to prevent additions after the fact should be allowed.','Cornerstone Home Lending Inc.',2.0,2.0,'the lender refused to accept hand-written corrections to the application form. the loan officer refused to release the funds out of escrow. the lender has warned consumers against signing blank');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4901,'03/20/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','Transunion has listed negative information on my credit report that is not true. I do not owe [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] any money.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'negative information on my credit report is not true. I do not owe any money to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4902,'03/19/2016','Debt collection','I do not know','False statements or representation','This debt is over seven years old. I have talked to them and asked them to remove it. They informed me that while they could not sue me after two years for the debt, they could report it for as long as they wanted. I went on line and verified that this was untrue. I then pointed this out to them, and they told me that it had been sold to them and that the debt date had started over. Many years ago when I bought this TV from Cons, I bought a warranty that covered physical as well as technical damage. When the TV sustained physical damage, they would not honor the warranty yet wanted me to still pay for the TV. The tricked me many times into making a payment, promising me to have the TV repaired. After I would make the payment I would not hear from them until it was time to make another payment. This went on for sometime, until I got tired of going around in circles. I also found out that I was not the only one dealing with this sort of thing from Cons. There is a blog on line in-regards to customers going through the same thing. If you ask them to let you listen to past conversation, which they claim to have recorded, yet can never remember the promises they made to me, it will backup my complaint. Thank you for any help.','Conn''s, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a debt date has started over when I bought a TV from Cons. they told me that it had been sold to them and that the date had started over. they said that');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4903,'03/19/2016','Consumer Loan','Vehicle loan','Problems when you are unable to pay','I have sent multiple letters asking for copies of proof of the legal notices and proof of the commercially reasonable manner of resale of a vehicle that American Credit Acceptance is claiming to be repossessed. The first letter was sent on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This letter was sent certified mail return receipt and I have proof of delivery. This letter was received by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This letter was asking for copies of proof of the legal notices and the commercially reasonable manner of resale of the vehicle in question. 

Under the laws of the State of Georgia UCC [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and State [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statutes a deficiency can not be claimed unless all of the required notices were properly and timely given, and all of the allowable redemption and cure time limits were adhered to. 

I asked American Credit Acceptance to provide proof within 14 days from the receipt of this notice or the claim of a deficiency will be considered null and void, and any continued collection activities, or continued reporting of this invalid claim on my credit reports will be considered a violation of the FDCPA and FCRA. 

There was no response from this letter. I then sent a follow up letter on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reminding American Credit Acceptance that they have failed to respond to my letter to them in a timely manner, and requested that the remove their entry on my credit reports ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) within the next 14 days of receiving my letter. 

I believe my request were reasonable and American Credit Acceptance has failed to respond in a timely manner. This is a fraudulent claim by American Credit Acceptance on my credit reports and American Credit Acceptance is now in violation of both the FDCPA and FCRA.','American Credit Acceptance, LLC',2.0,4.0,'letter was sent on COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and certified mail return receipt. letter was sent by american Credit');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4904,'03/18/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit monitoring or identity protection','Equifax put a fraud alert on my credit for what reason, I do n''t know. The problem is that I am not able to get credit because they did not include my phone number on the Fraud alert. I called and wrote Equifax asking them to add my phone number to the alert or to remove the fraud alert. Each time I do that Equifax put a brand new fraud alert on my credit. I was denied credit for the fourth time with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] because of the fraud alert. This has been going on for a year','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,4.0,'Equifax put a fraud alert on my credit for what reason, I don''t know. the problem is that I am not able to get credit because they did not');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4905,'03/18/2016','Debt collection','Mortgage','Disclosure verification of debt','I have contacted the Udren Law Offices three times with no reply. They are proceeding with a foreclosure action in which I have not personally been served. I would like to bring this mortgage current but they will not return my calls. Unfortunately because of the lack of response from Udren, I am sure they are racking up fees to be charged to me. I do not see why I should be responsible for additional fees. Also, because of this situation I do not want to go into foreclosure. I obtained the services of a law firm of which there is no reason I had to do, but Udren does not return my law firms phone calls or correspondence either. I think Udren should be responsible for any attorney costs that I will incur because of their lack of response.','Udren Law Offices, P.C.',2.0,2.0,'a foreclosure action is in which I have not personally been served. the law firm does not return my phone calls or correspondence.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4906,'03/18/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Payoff process','My latest statement from Bank of America for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] balance total was {$4500.00}. The due date was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016. I paid this amount in full on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016. Then received a new statement stating that I owe {$32.00}. I do not understand, nor do I agree to this practice. It is completely non-transparent to the consumer. When you receive a bill stating total due and you pay that total prior to the due date, that should be it. Done. Instead, credit card companies send you another bill. Why is this allowed? I contacted customer service, spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] today, and she said they could credit me {$16.00}, meet me half-way. but I would still need to pay the {$32.00} in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and then on my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statement I would see the {$16.00} credit. I intend to close my account so how will I receive the credit of {$16.00}? It ''s stupid. And essentially she said that my credit score is affected if I do n''t pay. I paid my bill in full as required via the statement they calculated and presented to me and I did it prior to the due date they provided me Nice. The same thing is happening on my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit card account. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]?','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'the due date was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016. I paid this amount in full on [COMPTE_');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4907,'03/17/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Billing disputes','My dad is a credit card/identify theft victim. He fell for a scam in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and again in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that have wiped his savings and created major debt. First, in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] it was a telephone call saying that he was late on paying a bill and needed to pay immediately, so he provided a credit card number with his personal information. That created a ridiculous amount of charges, which he was unaware of. He is in his [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s with some [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] caring for my mom who was very ill. Then in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] he received a phone call, letting him know that he had won the big prize of Publisher ''s Clearance but that he needed to follow very strict instructions. So he did. The result : Someone opened via internet a Citibank credit card in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and charged {$10000.00}. In addition, they charged over {$12000.00} on his [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] card and another {$10000.00} at another institution. Both Citibank and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] refuse to accept the fact that he did not make any of the purchases and have released the case to Collection agencies to recover the funds. I ''ve documented all the transactions and we can not believe that after all the documentation, either institution have not properly looked into the case. What we get is letters telling us " You opened the account via internet in Citibank and this is your responsibility ''''. My dad does not own a computer nor did he have internet service. We ''ve written to Citibank several times and get the same response, " you opened it, it is your responsibility ''''. The crooks were brilliant in how they managed everything. They opened the Citibank account and deposited the money in his checking/savings account at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], then proceeded to make telephone transfers. They completed wiped all this checking and savings. My mom died on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and her memorial was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Because of his [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] situation, and my mom ''s death - I took over my parents '' finances in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have spent considerable time understanding what had transpired, documenting much of the transaction. Both banks ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Citibank ) have been unsympathetic. We spent considerable time at the local [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bank and ultimately chose to close his account after my dad ''s account was cleaned out. I ''m at wit ''s end on what to do. I ''ve over communicated with both institution. My parents, who have had wonderful credit scores in the past and now my dad, are now considering bankruptcy as a solution, which for us is a last resort. I am disgusted by the arrogance and disrespect conveyed by both banks.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'a credit card fraud victim fell for a scam in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and again in XX/XX');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4908,'03/17/2016','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Application, originator, mortgage broker','Why would there be a need for a mortgage servicer to obtain another Abstract Title? As I understand it, the original Title should prevail throughout the life of the loan. According to my settlement sheet, I paid well over {$3500.00} for Title from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], located in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], NY in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Now, I ''ve found, according the County Clerk ''s records, that yet another Title has surfaced from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], located in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], PA, obtained by LoanCare Servicing, who in turn supposedly sold the loan to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], even though LoanCare was not the owner of the Note. How could they sell something they do n''t own and paid absolutely nothing for? Did I mention the original Lender was the infamous " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' I thought when [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] went defunct, all loans were to be delivered to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Mine was n''t delivered until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], three years later. During that time, there was NO ASSIGNMENT until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to none other than who else, the servicer, LoanCare. Also, this was an FHA loan. If in default, should n''t FHA have obtained it and sold it themselves? Where are they? Why was there a need to change Title Trustee from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]? Does n''t this place a cloud on the tile? I may be a novice concerning Real Estate but something just ai n''t right. The way LoanCare and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] conduct their business, I ''m sure we ''re headed for a repeat meltdown of the housing industry, as was the case in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I ''m hoping the Courts have gained more knowledge of these dirty dealings and will not let them seize consumers homes fraudulently.','LoanCare, LLC',2.0,4.0,'a mortgage servicer has a Title from a mortgage servicer. the original Title should prevail throughout the life of the loan. the original Title should be obtained from loanCar');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4909,'03/17/2016','Debt collection','Credit card','Taking/threatening an illegal action','I believe that I have been targeted by debt collection scam by a firm named [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] purporting to be a law firm and threatening suit on a stale account in addition to not identifying themselves as a debt collector. Today I received a voicemail from their computerized pre-recorded auto-dialer that stated the following message : " This message is intended for [ my name ], we have been instructed to obtain a statement from [ my name ] prior to filing in your jurisdiction you can provide your statement directly to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. '''' I later called the number and the call was answered as " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' by someone identifying themselves as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who reluctantly said was a receptionist after extended questioning. I asked her why they called and she said that it was regarding a debt I owed. I asked where they were based out of and she said they are out of New York. I asked her if they were a debt collector and she said that they were not a debt collector, but a " pre-litigation '''' ( her words ) company. I asked what that was and if this was a law firm, she stated again that they are a pre-litigation company and work with a group of attorneys. At no time did she explicitly state that the call was for debt collection purposes, despite stating the call was regarding a debt I owed. She confirmed my name and the county my address is in. 

She said that she would transfer my call to the paralegal handling my case after verifying my information which I gave to her. She transferred me to someone identifying themselves as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who said that they were calling on behalf of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who I failed to repay a debt to. I told her I do not recall having any current [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] debts and she said that I opened the account in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and stopped paying it in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I asked her if she was threatening me with a lawsuit on a time barred debt and she stated that it was illegal not pay them back. I told her failing to pay debts was not illegal and asked again if they were trying to sue me on a debt outside of the statute of limitations. She became very loud, abusive and insulting, which made me angry and I yelled back and she hung up on me. 

I called back the original number and spoke with the same person that answered the original call, I asked for her name and she said it was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I asked for my representative ''s name and she said that it was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the name [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and found out that the company was currently being sued by the FTC and has a history of similar actions in addition to no longer being licensed in my state.','PORTFOLIO RECOVERY ASSOCIATES INC',2.0,2.0,'a firm called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] purporting to be a law firm. she said that they were not a debt collector, but ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4910,'03/17/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','Equifax re-inserted accounts on my credit that do not belong to me without proper verification. I requested that Equifax verify the " method of verification '''' under the FCRA, Section 611 ( a ) ( 6 ) and ( 7 ). The credit reporting agency must give you the method of verification information within 15 days of your request. Equifax have not done so. These are the accounts that do not belong to me : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2007 account.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'Equifax requested that you verify the method of verification. the credit reporting agency must give you the method of verification information within 15 days of your request.');
