INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4913,'03/16/2016','Debt collection','Payday loan','False statements or representation','This complaint concerns the actions of Greenback Recovery Group in an attempt to collect a debt. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 I received a voice mail message from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at GR Group. She identified herself as a " Senior Arbitrator '''' in the legal division, and stated that she had received documents identifying me as the " primary Respondent ''''. She proceeded to state that I had written " bad checks from a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank checking account attached to a social security number ending in xxxx ''''. She then threatened to " pursue charges under the Federal Bank Fraud Statute for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Arizona ''''. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2016, I received another voicemail message from Greenback Recovery Group. This time, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] claimed that " this matter has been approved for suit for A [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] filing to bring you up on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] separate charges for Theft by Deception, Breach of Contract, and Writing Bad Checks out of your [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank account ending attached to your social security number ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and I do have the full social ''''. She stated she represented an unnamed attorney network. At no time during either of the messages on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/16 did she identify herself as a debt collector. Additionally, I had not received any kind of written correspondence from the GR Group. I contacted my attorney, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They then provided me with a demand letter that failed to identify the current creditor. I have attached a copy of this letter, and I have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] voice mail messages saved. Not only have I been the victim of illegal collection practices under the FDCPA, but I believe GR Group has violated the Arizona [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), a person commits theft by extortion by knowingly obtaining or seeking to obtain property or services by means of a threat to accuse anyone of a crime or bring criminal charges against anyone. The use of the threat language to " bring charges '''' for theft by deception, writing bad checks and violations of the Federal Bank Fraud Statute is a clear attempt to get me to pay on a claim for breach of contract, by putting me in fear of criminal prosecution. I have been very distraught over these threats. I believe my attorney is in contact with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] office regarding GR Group ''s violation of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The communications with Greenback Recovery group have been very threatening, and much of the language used, such as " Senior Arbitrator for the legal division '''' and " approved for Suit '''' seem intended to convey that the collection agency is a Law Firm. 

My attorney, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], can be contacted at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','Greenback Recovery Group, LLC',2.0,4.0,'complaint concerns actions of Greenback Recovery Group in an attempt to collect a debt. she identified herself as a " Senior Arbitrator '''' in the legal division. she threatened');
