INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(4930,'03/10/2016','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we filed for a loan modification with Stonegate Mortgage due to a loss of job. We were simply asking for the removal of PMI, due to being over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % LTV. We have had over 30 conversations with the company since we filed this, and get different answers almost every time. We were originally told the process would take 30 days, this drug in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and were we given several conflicting reasons why. 

