INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5005,'02/16/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Deposits and withdrawals','I was the victim of identity theft. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I noticed an unauthorized [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] pending withdrawal from my wells fargo checking account to an account at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I requested this transfer be stopped on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Wells fargo denied my request to stop this illegal transferred allowed it to occur on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. After contacting the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], NJ police Wells fargo did request a return of my money from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Since wells fargo could not guarantee the safety of my money I transferred most of my accounts to another bank. I did leave in enough money to cover my monthly automatic withdrawals as it would take time to notify all my accounts. Wells Fargo placed a hold on my newly formed account and would not allow bill payment until I spoke with a supervisor, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], in fraud protection. Wells Fargo also sent my new checks and ATM card via postal service and I still do n''t have then as of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Also every single day since the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the Wells Fargo online system locks my account access so I ca n''t verify any activity without contacting customer service and the fraud department to unlock and reset my password. If Only Wells Fargo would have been as diligent in stopping transactions before the fraud, none of this may have occurred.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'I was the victim of identity theft. I requested this transfer be stopped on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5006,'02/15/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Taking/threatening an illegal action','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] send me a renewal policy XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].The policy was much higher than the previous year. I decided to go with another company and I did not realize that I had to give decline in writing. 
A collection company R.M.S ( Receivable Management Services Corporation ) contacted me to set up a payment plan.I was contacted by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Agent I came to a payment agreement that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] negotiated with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
The agreement of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payments of {$160.00} totaling {$1200.00}. My first payment was on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2015. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] all checks were electronic and everything went smoothly. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I send a check on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for the regular {$160.00}. I received a text notification that my account was overdrawn on Monday morning. I looked into my account and noticed that {$1000.00} had been deducted instead of the regular {$160.00}. I went directly to the branch and my banker contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and asked to reverse the excess funds. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] thing happened [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we could not access the account as it had been closed. Keep in mind this was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] time on Monday morning. No one including [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was willing to help in any way as she was well aware of our agreement fully knowing that there was a serous over pay.After many attempts in the branch and within the coming days i tried with no success as no one was willing to discuss this.Every phone call was transferred to another person which led to nobody and finally it disconnected. The anger and helplessness was emotionally upsetting. Thankfully after evaluating my problem [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reversed the payment. I was told to close my account and open a new account. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I received a call from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who said I owe money at first I could not believe she would call after everything that I went through.She was not apologetic. i was so disgusted I wanted nothing to do with them. I received a letter and called to be told that it was given to a law firm. 
