INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5033,'02/05/2016','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Can''t repay my loan','I was called by the South Carolina Student Loan in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], SC XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The representative name was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When we talked XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I stated to her that I had a lawyer that was consolidating all of my loans ( private and federal ) no where in the conversation did she state that private loans could not be consolidated. My lawyer had told me prior to me and her talking that private loan companies will tell you that because it is more work to consolidate private loans than federal loans. Nevertheless, when [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I talked, I stated that I would TRY and make a payment on XX/XX/<YYYY> of {$44.00} until my lawyer gets all my consolidation paper done. She said okay and that was the end of the conversation. So today ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2016 ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] calls again and said that I did n''t make a payment on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I needed to make a payment today. I told her I did n''t have the money to make the payment today and she went in defense mood after that. She became very argumentative. I reminded her that I told her in our previous conversation that all my loans were getting consolidated. She then stated that private loans could not get consolidated and she told me that in the previous conversation over the phone. I said no ma''am you did n''t and I even recommended her to pull the phone call because all calls are recorded. She dismiss what I said saying no she told me in the previous conversation about all of that and I needed to make a payment today. Do to the fact that I will not go back and forth with a representative that is suppose to be acting in a professional manner at all times, I then told her I wanted to talk to someone else over her to resolve the issue. At first she told me that her supervisor was not in and I had to wait until they called me back and I did not accept that because I know there is a supervisor over you that is working today. She then put me on hold and transferred me to some one that said he was the vice president. So when he ask me what was wrong I asked did she not tell you but I would be happy to tell you what is going on and why I want to complain and speak with someone else. He interrupted me in the middle of my sentence stated that I was calling him a liar because I said she had told him was the issue was. I said no but he became very argumentative towards me also. When I got a chance to talk I tried telling him what the issue was but he was n''t trying to here it he said it was in the notes what she said and I then asked for the call to be pulled because I would like to hear it and he continued to not listen to what I had to say. Now, I it was in the notes why did n''t the rep tell me this her self instead of fussing a me telling me she know what she said. He continue to get loud with me stating it was in the notes and I ''m saying no sir it is not. Then he hangs up in my face. I was not asked when could I make the payment nor was the issue taken care of. Not that I ''m not trying to pay, I just recently made a payment on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of {$130.00} and I was not able to do the other payment that I said would TRY to make. I feel I was not heard on this call and my considerations was not taken in to count.','SOUTH CAROLINA STUDENT LOAN CORP.',2.0,2.0,'a representative was called by the south Carolina Student Loan in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], SC XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5034,'02/05/2016','Debt collection','Credit card','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','Commonwealth Financial Services contacted me by phone telling me I had by end of day the next day to pay a debt of {$2000.00} or they would be sending me a summons for criminal charges. They tole me the additional fees could be upwards of {$8000.00} if we ended up in court. I told them to send me something in writing. I received a letter from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]? Email address was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ). The letter stated that I had to settle the debt by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to avoid any further collection proceedings. I received several harassing emails after our initial contact. I looked in my records and saw that this account had been satisfied in full with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] back on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I feel that this was a complete fraud tactic to scam me out of {$2000.00}.','Commonwealth Financial Systems, Inc.',2.0,4.0,'a letter from a friend of mine said that he had to settle the debt. the letter stated that he had to settle the debt by [COMPTE_ANON');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5035,'02/05/2016','Mortgage','Conventional adjustable mortgage (ARM)','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I have paid my mortgage down to 78 % of the home ''s original value. The lender should remove my mortgage insurance automatically. The lender is telling me that I need to get an appraisal done. I should not need an appraisal. They will not allow me to speak to the person making the decision. Specialized Loan Servicing. Not very specialized.','Specialized Loan Servicing LLC',4.0,4.0,'mortgage insurance is a 78 % of the home''s original value. the lender should remove my mortgage insurance automatically.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5036,'02/05/2016','Money transfers','International money transfer','Other service issues','I am writing because of what I perceive to be a blatantly dishonest practice on the part of Western Union and because I have tried many, many times to contact the company through every means of communication they offer and have been unable to reach anyone who can or will help with a resolution or even take the time to answer [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] simple question. Here is the problem. When you transfer money with Western Union they offer [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] main methods of payment, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of which are transferring directly from a bank account and transferring from a credit or debit card. Every single time I transfer money with them and select to use my bank account, the less expensive option, I always get a message stating the transaction could not be completed using the selected payment method and directing me to choose another payment method. Yet as soon as I switch to using my bank debit card, from the same bank and connected to the same bank account, and also the more expensive option, the transaction goes through just fine immediately every single time. The difference in fees between these [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment methods is substantial, many times the fee is literally double to use the debit card option! 

I have discussed this with my bank and they have assured m they are not blocking or restricting the transaction in any way whatsoever, and that it is not a fault in their system, so the problem definitely is on Western Union ''s end of the transaction. When I call their " customer service '''' agents on the phone I am told by them that for " security reasons '''' they are not given access to the information that would enable them to tell me why this problem continuously occurs, they are not able to give me any further information and they can not give me a solution other than to tell me to try again later. I have emailed Western Union several times through the main email address for customer service on their website and through an additional email given for their customer service advocate department and no one will respond or get back to me to help me resolve this issue. All of these things cause me to feel like these practices are intentional on Western Union ''s part and that I and other people who are undoubtedly having the same problem with Western Union are being cheated by this company to force us to pay the higher, often double fees. I am a patient and courteous man but I have tried every [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] available to resolve this directly with Western Union and they simply will not respond and help me or even take the simple common courteousy to offer me any explanation whatsoever! 

Therefore it is finally in frustration that I turn to the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau for help in this matter because I am really concerned that Western Union has a dirty, dishonest practice that is cheating me and a lot of other people out of a lot of extra money! Please take the time look into this matter and do kindly reply and let me know how the bureau may be able to help us bring a resolution to this matter. 

Sincerely [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','WESTERN UNION COMPANY, THE',2.0,2.0,'Western Union offers main payment methods, transferring directly from a bank account. the transaction goes through just fine every single time. the problem is on the end of the transaction.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5037,'02/04/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','We have been trying to work with OCWEN mortgage company on reversing our mortgages back to an interest only payment on our rentals properties. We have followed all their requests filled out a huge package of forms and were declined. We have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] mortgages with this company and have made consistent payments for 10 yrs.. The mortgages reverted to a principal and interest recently, and we can not afford to make the principal and interest payment. It seems like a simple procedure, but yet no one is willing to help us keep our properties, which were purchased as an investment property for our kids education. This company has also been sharing our information with adjacent neighbors in the area. Is n''t this in violation of some federal laws? We are happy to provide any information necessary to resolve our issues. This company has been nothing but uncooperative and rude.','OCWEN LOAN SERVICING LLC',2.0,2.0,'mortgage company has been trying to work with the company on reversing mortgages. the mortgages reverted to a principal and interest recently. no one is willing to');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5038,'02/04/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','You have no statements for this period. It may be because : Your account is new or it ''s the first month of the year and your account has n''t generated a statement yet. 
Credit card/Line of credit : You ''ve closed your account or there has been no activity on the account for the entire billing period. 
Auto finance account : You ''ve closed your account or you ''ve signed up for automatic debit. 
Note : Online statements will be available for viewing within 3-5 business days of the statement closing date. 
Above you will find Chase ''s credit card statement discrepancy and falsification on reporting processes. By referencing the Chase statements I will without a doubt prove this falsification of inaccuracy and another reason why my receipt of proper monthly statement is falsified and inaccurate by Chase. In turn Chase placed a 30 day late on my Slate account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I will compare [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of my accounts and highlight the errors as I continue to dispute my case. 
Reference document [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] attached account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] references the above statement. This account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is not a new account but it is in the first month of the year and in this case has generated a statement ( Discrepancy ). Reference document [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] attached account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] references the above statement. This account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is not a new account but it is in the first month of the year and has not generated a statement. ( Possible reason for no statement as stated by Chase ) Neither of these accounts above are closed and neither of them have had any activity on the accounts for this monthly billing period. Please reference statement document [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for this reference. Another discrepancy here is that both accounts had no activity for the monthly billing statement yet one of them generated a monthly statement and the other did not. Why would I receive a statement for one and not the other for proper notification to the consumer? You can also reference due date document [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which also states the payment due dates which are only [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] days apart yet [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statement is generated for the consumer on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account but not the other account in my name. 
Finally referencing the delivery method document you will find exactly how my accounts are setup by US Mail and all of them are set for the same default mailing address. I have since setup 10 day alert notifications which I also do not receive. With regard to the receipt of physical statements received by US Mail, I only receive [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] physical statement out of all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Chase accounts. As an example, my Marriot account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is the only statement I receive by mail in which I did for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with no current activity on that account with a credit balance. On the other account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I did not receive a physical monthly billing statement by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Mail for XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and again the account had no current activity and a credit balance. ( Discrepancy ) There are many inaccuracies with Chase and the consumer is punished for these inaccuracies by reporting negative and inaccurate information for reporting purposes. 
I am reporting this to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], FTC, CFPB, Attorney General, Secret Service, FBI and to protect my Fair Credit Reporting Rights. I will contact the attorney general to file a lawsuit against Chase for counsel for the state as well as a personal law suit toward Chase for damages. 

See all docs. Any information on your credit file that can not be verified has to be removed. Chase placed a 30 day late on my Slate account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I never received a statement from Chase either by mail or electronically. Chase can verify that a statement was generated but I would like to ask Chase to verify that without a doubt I received the statement on my end either by US Postal Mail or electronically by email? Was the physical statement certified with a return receipt for verificatio','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'credit card/Line of credit : You''ve closed your account or you''ve signed up for automatic debit'' online statements will be available for viewing within 3-5 business days of');
