INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5046,'02/02/2016','Bank account or service','Checking account','Problems caused by my funds being low','I am not clear as to what exactly happened with my Bank of America account. I do know that the account was ultimately closed and has been reported to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as " fraud '''' because of a returned check that was deposited. I have made two trips to Bank of America to try and resolve the issues at hand ( I have been placed in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] & [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for {$240.00} ). The branches themselves have not been able to help me. The reporting to both bureaus has resulted in all my bank accounts being closed with my previous institution because of the " fraud '''' attachment to my account. I have attempted to resolve the issue at Bank of america to no avail. It is IMPOSSIBLE to open another bank account for myself and or my business because of the fraud. My business will be closed by the end of the month because we can not operate without a bank account and our credit card reserves will be maxed out. Who gave Bank of America the right to shut down businesses it is very apparent that they have more power than our Government does.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'bank accounts have been closed with my previous institution. the reporting has resulted in all my bank accounts being closed.');
