[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','MONEYGRAM PAYMENT SYSTEMS WORLDWIDE INC',2.0,2.0,'moneygram sent to brother in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for mother and family. moneygram has not released money, ruining my family''s [COMP');
