INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5078,'01/22/2016','Credit card',NULL,'Identity theft / Fraud / Embezzlement','A co-worker wanted me to co sign for a loan so we went in to Wells Fargo where we both bank, my co-worker had already spoke with a personal banker which explained to him the whole process. That day she asked us for all the requirements, I told the banker I was in a hurry and my time was limited. So I told her let me now when I can leave, I ''ll sign what I need to and my co-worker can finish the process. While we waited for the loan approval she asked if I was interested in a credit card she did n''t explain much all she said is that it was 15 months 0 interest, so I told her again that I had an appointment that maybe another day she can give me all the details about the credit card. after that we did n''t discuss anything about the credit card. Once approved for the loan she handed each of us a copy of what we had signed for the personal loan, I went on my way and my co-worker stayed to receive the loan. About a week after I received in the mail [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit cards [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for my co-worker and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for me, I was shocked to when I opened the envelope. I looked for the copies that the banker had gave me but nothing showed that I had signed for a credit card. I waited about [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] weeks, never activated the credit cards went in to the same bank to explain what had happened. Once the banker went over the credit card details I told her I would keep it only if I could remove my co-worker from the credit card and still keep the 15 moths 0 interest. She made some calls to see what she could do, she said that in order for me to keep the credit card I had to close the account and re-apply on my own. Even though I had not even applied for it to begin with. that would require running my credit again. She promised to give me 15 months 0 interest she even put notes on her computer stating that she had called credit services and they would honor my request. 
well that was not true, when I activated my new card I called to verify the interest. They ran my credit for nothing, it was just a waste of my time, I went in to the bank a few times to solve that. A banker told me I would get a response within 10 days its been about 20 days I ''ve never received a call regarding that incident. I want my credit restored and the can keep their credit card.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'co-worker asked me to sign for a loan so we went in to Wells Fargo. she asked if she was interested in a credit card and gave me ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5079,'01/21/2016','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','hi im [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my complaint is with green tree mortgage green tree mortgage does not want help me getting my home qualified for a loan modification my home goes on sale Monday [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they are telling me im 8 months behind and its not true there reason for my delinquency there not applying my payments to the my account they keep asking to speak to my husband [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who is also on the title but he passed away XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we were originally with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but later was passed to green tree because I filled a law suit with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they gave my husband a loan when they new he was placed on hospice care soon after his passing I later had to get a loan modification because I was upside down on my house and since green tree is now the lender they refuse to deal with me even when I sent more proof of my husband being passed away I got a lawyer and found out it was a scam I lost money on that if it was n''t for my oldest son moving back in I would of lost everything my family and my house is all I got and there trying to take that from me I did find out there was some illegal stuff done in my contract from the bankruptcy attorney that I hired this week im going for chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] so I can get time to find help for a fair and new loan modification its a lot more I would speak to some who can help me im up in age and would like for my grand kids to have my home in the future please help me','Ditech Financial LLC',2.0,2.0,'green tree mortgage does not want help me getting my home qualified for a loan modification my home goes on sale. my complaint is with green tree mortgage green tree mortgage does not want help me');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5080,'01/21/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Credit decision / Underwriting','My financial hardship began when my husband which I am now separated from abandoned me on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015. My soon to be ex-husband relinquished all rights to the property which we resided by quit claiming his interest over to me. My husband no longer supports or assist me in any way financially. I obtained the assistance of a housing counselor in order to help me submit a modification request to my Servicer Penny Mac in order to assist me with getting the loan modified to an affordable monthly payment along with getting the account current into my name only. I submitted the modification request with the assistance of my housing counselor [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015. I was approved for trial modification on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015. I was approved for the Final Modification on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015 after I successfully completed the trial modification payments. But, the modification papers included me having my separated husband sign the modification documents. The modification request clearly states that I was applying for the modification to have my separated husband removed from the loan along with obtaining an affordable monthly payment which I could afford to pay with my income only. The servicer requested the quit claim deed to show proof that my husband had released his rights to the property. I provided the quit claim deed to the servicer on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015. Presently, the servicer underwriter removed my Final Modification Approval because my separated husband would n''t sign the modification agreement. The Underwriter stated on my denial that I notified the servicer to state that I did n''t accept the offer which is a lie. I completed my modification trial plan based upon the fact that the loan would be modified into my name only. He was never suppose to be on the modified loan. The modification was submitted in my name only.','PENNYMAC LOAN SERVICES, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'my soon to be ex-husband quit claiming his interest over to me. my husband no longer supports or assists me financially. he submitted a modification request to my service');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5081,'01/21/2016','Debt collection','Medical','Disclosure verification of debt','I also have not received ANY response to the debt validation letter that I sent them. They just stay on my credit report without validating the debt with me and keep verifying with the credit bureau the unvalidated debt. This appears to be illegal collection tactics to me.','COLLECTION SERVICES OF ATHENS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'debt validation letter sent by debt validation letter. they stay on credit report without validating the debt with me. this appears to be illegal collection tactics to me.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5082,'01/21/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit monitoring or identity protection','I was seeking [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of my free credit reports and so I went to the FTC website at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I followed the recommended link to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I filled everything out and selected TransUnion. I filled more forms out for them, eventually it came time to access my credit report and they required me to fill out a card number form. I thought this was part of the process of getting my free credit report. Nowhere did it say they were going to charge me {$1.00} or sign me up for any services, there was no agreement or information regarding this. I gave them my card number to access my credit score and received an email about a charge that they had made for {$1.00}, which I did not authorize. I contacted my bank and they said that I would be charged again as part of a service if I did not cancel. This was news to me. I immediately canceled. I called TransUnion to get a refund, but they asked me for my social security number and my credit card number. I can not trust this company and do not want to interact with them regarding personal information. I simply want them to refund my money, I provided them an order number which should be enough. I am disappointed that a .gov website sent me to a finance company that is capable of such a fraudulent scam.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a.gov website sent me to a finance company capable of such a fraudulent scam. a.gov website sent me to a finance company that is capable of');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5083,'01/20/2016','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Can''t repay my loan','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] University, American Education Services. Graduating in the great recession was difficult, dealing with AES is impossible. I just started [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] businesses and I wanted to postpone payments to get back on my feet. I ''d done this once before to catch up. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I ''d filled out the paperwork suggested by AES, faxed it in ( which is difficult, no one has a fax these days ). They said " that ''s it you ''re all set '''' 3 months later I ''m getting collection calls at all hours of the day and night while my grandma was on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] none the less. Thanks! Finally I just paid the money so they ''d stop calling. The same thing keeps happening. I go through the trouble of filling out all this paperwork, sending my tax return and wasting time with customer service. Each AES representative has something different to say. This has happened several times. They assure me everything is all set, or that they ''re sending forms via email and regular mail. Now I ''m not even getting forms. I ''ve had nearly everything I own robbed from me in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. That was an awful feeling, the feeling AES is giving me is even worse. I ''m just trying to get my business off the ground and AES is there to ruin any chance of me succeeding, probably buying a house in the future. The only thing they ''re good at is ruining my credit. I ''m confident that this is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the worst run businesses in the world. Oh and want to know about my other student loans, NO PROBLEM. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of them is paid off in full. AES on the other hand is raping my financial stability. I studied [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and that was a walk in the park compared to dealing with AES. If you call their customer service, an automated voice takes 10 minutes to check if you were in the armed forces. I ca n''t believe I owe this company money and I will certainly be looking for any alternative. A high interest credit card would be a better option in my opinion. I ''m absolutely broken by this company, words really ca n''t describe how I feel. It ''s not like this has happened once or twice. It ''s happened so many times that robbing a bank seems like a sensible option to get rid of this loan. I bet if I had the money in my hand to pay off in full, it would be a huge hassle. I hope that something can be done about this. It ''s completely unfair.','AES/PHEAA',2.0,2.0,'a faxing service is a problem for a business owner. a faxing service is a problem for a business owner. a faxing');
