ng to credit card account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. BASIS FOR DISPUTE 1. Date of last activity ( Inconsistent across all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bureaus ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Experian - unknown/not listed 2. Payment history ( Inconsistent across all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bureaus ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - Late 30days [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], late 60days [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], late 90days [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; worst delinquency - Bad debt/Collection [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - Late 30days [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], late 60days [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], late 90days [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; worst delinquency - None reported Experian - Late 30days [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], late 60days [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], late 90days [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; worst delinquency - Collection ***Payment status is showing charge off from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; however, Experian payment status is showing " charge off '''' on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], then " ok '''' [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], then " charge off '''' again [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], then " ok '''' [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], then listed as " charge off '''' [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. *** [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Status ( Inconsistent across all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bureaus ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - " Charge off '''' Transunion - " Charged off as bad debt '''' Experian - " Unpaid balance reported as a loss by credit grantor '''' I also have NO knowledge of this account. 
Below I have attached a copy of my original letter to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank, a copy of their response letter and a copy of the section of false information that is still reporting on my credit report.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'this company is reporting false information on my credit report. I have requested verification and they continue to violate my rights. this company is reporting false information on my credit report.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5085,'01/20/2016','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], which is the most recent servicer of my loan has demanded payment from me for a number of years from me, regarding what appears to be somewhat of a phantom debt. This debt has been long disputed multiple times with multiple servicers with relation to the origination of my predatory loan. My loan which was conceived as a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] line of credit of {$70000.00}, with a rate of 9.5 % interest and placed me at great risk based upon complete disregard for my Tangible Net Benefit and ability to repay. At the time my loan was originated with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], failed to protect my future financial interests and ultimately forced my loan into foreclosure as a result of ignoring basic underwriting guidelines as well as violations to The Real Estate Settlement Procedures Act ( RESPA ) which prohibits unfair lending practices. Furthermore, there has been unfounded and incomplete evidence provided by SLS surrounding that the above mentioned loans origination, chain of title and assignments are unclear. 
SEE EXHIBIT " A '''' [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] INCOMPLETE QWR RESPONSE Due to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], failed response to my issues, I ''m considering raising this matter in the Court as I feel it may be the proper venue for action under [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] UXXXX [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], because [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or more of the Defendants maintains executive offices in or conducts business in the district relevant to where real estate is located in this concern. 
The interagency Statement on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] enumerates certain tactics that may indicate predatory lending. Nonprofit groups have also published widely accepted guidance on these kinds of practices that may constitute predatory lending. Predatory loans typically combine risky loan features, thereby placing the borrower at an excessive risk of default or foreclosure. 
For purposes of this Complaint, " Combined-Risk Loans '''' are loans that meet the definition of high-cost loan under [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], which is an extension of The Home Ownership and Equity Protection Act ( HOEPA ) and enacted in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as an amendment to the Truth in Lending Act ( TILA ) to address abusive practices in refinancing and home-equity mortgage loans with high interest rates or high fees. Loans that meet HOEPA ''s high-cost coverage tests are subject to special disclosure requirements and restrictions on loan terms, and borrowers in high-cost mortgagesXXXX have enhanced remedies for violations of the law. 
[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], was incorporated under the laws of the State of Delaware. In subsequent paragraphs of this complaint, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank will be referred to as " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], '''' " the lender '''' or " the defendant. " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''s business includes engaging in residential real estate-related transactions and regularly extending credit to persons. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], as an entity whose business includes engaging in residential real estate transactions -- including home equity lending as well as home purchase and refinancing lending -- is subject to the requirements of the Fair Housing Act, as amended, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is also a creditor as that term is defined by section [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the ECOA, 15 U.S.C. 1692a ( e ), and is, therefore, subject to the requirements of the ECOA and its implementing Regulation B, as amended, 12 [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], in effect on or after [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
The provisions of TILA, including HOEPA, are implemented in the Bureau ''s Regulation Z. and also contain [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or more of the following high risk terms : ( a ) the loan was issued based upon the " stated income, '''' rather than the verified income, of the borrower ; ( b ) the debt-to-income ratio exceeds 55 % ; of the actual income ( c ) the loan-to-value ratio is at least 125 % based on the values at time of closing ; ***SEE CONT. COMPLAINT PART [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] VIA ATTACHMENTS***','E*TRADE BANK',2.0,2.0,'a '''' [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bank''s line of credit of $70000.00 was conceived as a phantom');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5086,'01/20/2016','Payday loan',NULL,'Charged fees or interest I didn''t expect','I got a loan from a Payday Place in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] GA. When I took the loan out 3 mos ago they told me that it was an installment loan and i agreed i didnt have to put any of my stuff up the man behind the counter told me he already took care of that. I asked him and he showed me a paper of many items on a list I told him that I dont own any of that and he told me dont worry that he makes up paper work all the time so he told me my 1 st payment will be around {$70.00} dollars because I am on SSI check I get once a month. I get {$680.00} to live on a month for myself and my younger son. I went into pay my 1st payment and since i was 1 day early I had to pay a fee of {$110.00} that upset me I asked the lady where that man was that took my loan app. And she said that he is not with the company anymore so they moved me from a installment loan to a 30 payday loan i could not pay {$700.00} back to them so the lady told me that she will keep my payments low. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I called Insta Loan in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Ga, and told them that I am sending a friend in to pay my payment of {$70.00} i told them i was sending a little extra of {$80.00} dollars The lady was very very rude to me she said that since i was paying early that i had to pay {$90.00} and if I didnt pay that it will cost me each day of being late {$35.00} dollars. They have called me everyday for 10 days now and told me that I have no rights. They called me day and night and even on there own cellphones. I called then yesterday [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the lady at Insta Loan told me that if I did have {$200.00} To her I will be in jail she was so rude to me My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] are falling apart ehat can I do. Thank You.','TMX Finance LLC',2.0,2.0,'i got a loan from a Payday Place in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] GA. i called the lady who took my loan app and told');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5087,'01/19/2016','Consumer Loan','Installment loan','Managing the loan or lease','I took a loan for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I ''ve made over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payments for each month, and I ''m still owing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after making payments totaling [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after 3 months. I ''ve made [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payments since the middle of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They have me schedule to pay the loan in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but since I ''m sending extra they now have move the payoff day to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] instead of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. With the payments I have schedule their going to earn over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] extra in fees and interest for a loan to be paid off in less then a year. The name of the company is Rise [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from of the Internet.','Risecredit, LLC',2.0,2.0,'''comPTE_ANONYMISÉ'' has made payments totaling [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payments. they have me schedule to pay the loan');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5088,'01/19/2016','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Account opening, closing, or management','In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2015 I bought a foreclosed property owned by U.S. Bank National Association. We closed on the house on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015. Upon Inspection of the Settlement Statement ( HUDXXXX ), it was discovered that there was an error in how the prorated property tax was figured and I was shorted by about {$260.00}. I have been in touch with the settlement agent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on several occasions. They acknowledge the error and they have said that they have referred the matter to the seller ( U.S. Bank National Association ) for payment of the amount they shorted me. However, After more than 5 months, I have not received the payment due me. I am attaching a copy of the Settlement Statement and copies of all emails between me and the settlement agent documenting all our interactions regarding this matter.','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,2.0,'in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2015, I bought a foreclosed property owned by the u.s. bank national association. the settlement agent');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5089,'01/19/2016','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','There is a collection agency trying to collect a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bill for {$240.00}. I have cleared this with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This is fraud. They said they were going to clear it up but so far it has not happened. Someone used my name and address but a different SS. Despite that, the derogatory collection issue is still showing on my credit report and the collection agency is still calling me.','Amsher Collection Services, Inc.',2.0,4.0,'collection agency trying to collect a bill for $240.00. they said they were going to clear it up but so far it has not happened.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5090,'01/19/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I have tried multiple times, from multiple sources, to get my Credit score. Every time, it asks me to choose an item ( i.e Mortgage, credit card ) that I ''ve never signed up. Every time I select ''None of the above '', because the information it asks for does n''t fit anything I ''ve signed up for. I do n''t own a house, therefore have no mortgage and I do n''t have a credit card opened in my name despite every company thinks I do. It fails to give me my Credit information. I looked up the reasons why my Credit is bad, it says I have medical bills not paid for in Arkansas from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I have lived in Georgia since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and have not lived in Arkansas since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I believe I ''m a victim of Identity theft. 

