INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5091,'01/18/2016','Debt collection','I do not know','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','I contacted TSC Accounts Receivable Solutions at the phone number given in response to another complaint. I agreed that account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], for date of service [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], with a current balance is {$270.00}, including principal and interest, was indeed mine, even though they did not have anything with my signature on it as such. I paid this in full and was told it would be totally removed off all my credit reports. 

The account, # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], for date of service [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], for {$220.00}, including principal and interest ( the lessor of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reported ), is unknown to me, so I asked for debt validation. At this time, TSC does not have anything with my signature on it proving it is indeed my debt and not an error. I requested debt validation and was told I will have to call back in a month to find out the results of the dispute. As TSC does not have proof that this is my debt, reporting it as such is a violation of the FCRA. I request TSC remove this debt from all reporting agencies until such time as they can prove this debt as valid and owed by myself. I have already suffered loss because of the reporting stated in my initial dispute and this item will continue to cause me losses.','TSC Accounts Receivable Solutions',2.0,2.0,'a dispute with TSC accounts receable solutions was resolved. the account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for date of service was $270.00');
