INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5093,'01/17/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I have submitted information to correct my employer ''s information and as one can clearly see they list my work in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] instead ofXXXX Massachusetts. My second issue is that I use my middle initial and not my full middle name. My third issue is that I was denied an credit card through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] due to not having sufficient number of accounts. I also have accounts with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Gasoline which is not on the reports. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the bureaus does not list a previous paid up account at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. It is frustrating dealing with and attempting to dispute and clearify the above issues. I am also attempting to determine when I requested a credit report from the bureaus. I prefer to have them sent to me and not through the internet as I then have a copy for reference, particularly if I do not have the luxury of a printer or there is an issue with obtaining the copy. Once the information is lost, it is lost. Also, have tried to find the credit reporting agency that submits the information to the bureaus with no luck. Please advise. Thank you for your understanding and assistance in this matter. 
