INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5128,'01/05/2016','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Application, originator, mortgage broker','I was working with Quicken Loans for the loan I was trying to obtain. They approved it and ask me to get an appraisal on the house. After this was done Quicken denied the loan. I asked about a refunds on the appraisal and they denied it. According to them it was a service provide that is non-refundable. I was not told this upfront only after everything was done. Now I want to used another lender and they mentioned I might have to to another appraisal done. I am very displeased because this is money coming out my pocket and its not cheap.','QUICKEN LOANS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'Quicken loans approved the loan and asked me to get an appraisal. they denied the loan and said it was a service provide that is non-refundable.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5129,'01/05/2016','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit monitoring or identity protection','I recently bought a home. I went on line to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reporting agencies for my free credit reports. I found the sites difficult to navigate and before I was through, I had become a member of both [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and TransUnion. I was afraid to tamper with the process, so I kept the memberships in effect until now. I was able to terminate my membership with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] without difficulty, but have found the TransUnion website to be very opaque about the process. It looks like I have to call a phone number during working hours to be able to terminate my membership. That is not right. I should not have been directed toward membership in the first place, and it should not be difficult to terminate a membership.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',4.0,4.0,'a member of both [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and TransUnion was afraid to tamper with the process. a member of the transUnion website');
