/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stated that my monthly payment should be {$1700.00} to include Property TAX. Hence, property tax was/is paid by me ever since I bought my VA Mortgage home, WHY is PennyMac not crediting/refunding/returning paid excess property tax payment to me first, the County Tax Collector have been paid till XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; OR, credit it to my account with me paying {$1400.00} till final disbursement in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. OR, better yet In response to my CFPB Case Number : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Priority Complaint Specialist, PennyMac Loan Services LLC, my LATEST Monthly Mortgage Statement Amount Due : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is {$5200.00}. I am aware that my VA Loan mortgage payment pays for my Thirty ( 30 ) years Fixed Rate of 3.25 % for {$320000.00} only for PRINCIPAL, INTEREST ( {$1400.00} ), and PROPERTY TAX. My home insurance is also paid/covered till XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. PennyMac is committing fraud for collecting with threat/schemes already paid property taxes, accepting disburse money from me and the County Tax Collector Office ''s and not reporting all on the Annual/Monthly Statements for paid previous property taxes. With clear conscience, I paid my property taxes ever since buying my home knowing that it was NOT IN ESCROW when I signed the contract, ensuring that I would not PAY " ESCROW '''' but the term " impound '''' was use which I was not aware ; hence, I was focused on the word " ESCROW. '''' REGARDLESS!! PennyMac if it is an honest mortgage lender should/shall credit paid property taxes in my account as mentioned above or returned to me. Documented payments from me will all be accounted for, it is simple math.','PENNYMAC LOAN SERVICES, LLC.',2.0,4.0,'PennyMac loan Services, LLC is committing fraud by not reporting or writing my direct advanced payments. the annual Escrow Account Disclosure Statement is due on june 1 ');
