My DFS bill dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 reinstated the {$140.00} [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] charge. I called DFS to explain and complain ; on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 I sent requested supporting documents to DFS which they confirm having received. 
