Under the National Mortgage Settlement Act ( NMSA ), my mortgage loan qualifies for the following reasons:1. Unexpected home repairs2. I was deceived regarding the ability to make the mortgage payment3. I completed a trial loan modification plan4. I was not offered any ways to avoid foreclosure5. I did not receive proper notification of the foreclosure6. robosigning documents without my authorityThe foreclosed address is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I did not receive any documentation or a settlement check as advertised on the NMSA site. I called the Ocwen office and was informed by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), an Ocwen representative that documents were mailed to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] address but I still have not received anything as of right now. I was advised to submit a letter. My first letter was in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] then another in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. No response from Ocwen. 
Ally did not return my calls or provide assistance and I feel that the same thing will occur with Ocwen. 
I am an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Veteran but did not use my VA loan. I respectfully request assistance in this matter regarding financial relief from Ocwen for mortgage settlement. Thank you.','OCWEN LOAN SERVICING LLC',2.0,2.0,'a complaint is about the foreclosure process. the complaint is about the nhs not providing consumer financial relief. the complaint is about the foreclosure process.');
