[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a lien has been released for approximately a year and has not been removed from my credit report. a lien has been released for approximately a year and has not been removed from');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5208,'12/04/2015','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Account opening, closing, or management','Lately I ''ve been monitoring my credit report, and out of nowhere I saw that my score had dropped [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] points, which really discouraged me because I ''ve been trying to pay my bills on time to have my score in a good standing point. I looked for further details on why my score dropped and it was because CREDCO pulled my report. I ''m not familiar with this company, and I ''m not even located in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], im located in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I then took action and sent them a dispute letter, for them to remove this item because they are violating the law by having no permissible purpose on pulling my report. 2 weeks later they sent a printout, which i will attach, basically saying they had a permissible purpose, and that someone that I have no knowledge authorized them to pull it from my report. I then sent another letter demanding them to remove it, and today on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 they sent me the same printout, which is far away from proving that i authorized them to pull my report. Even after i told them I have no knowledge of this company, they still did not delete this off of my credit report.','CORELOGIC INC',2.0,2.0,'i''m not familiar with this company,'' and''m not even located in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5209,'12/04/2015','Mortgage','Conventional adjustable mortgage (ARM)','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I requested a loan modification because of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] hardships. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] hardship, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], my ex-husband lost his job and was unable to pay child support. As a single mother of an 8 year old, I was able to manage my finances for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] yrs. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after the recession. To help balance the budget, my employer authorized a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]+ % pay cut across the board with no warning. I exhausted my savings to make up the difference. I tried to be proactive and contacted NationStar ( loan purchased from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) 2 months prior to exhausting my savings. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I started the process for a loan modification. I submitted all requested documents and was assigned a Customer Service Rep ( CSR ), who assured me that I submitted all required documentation and indicated a response would take 45 business days. To no avail, I tried to contact my assigned CSR. I left numerous messages. None of my calls were returned until 6 months later, from an Automated Messaging System stating that additional info was needed. I tried to contact the CSR to confirm exactly what was needed. 1 month later, I called and spoke with a different rep who reviewed my file, told me what was missing, and said it takes more than 30 days for an answer. In the meantime, I was told to send paystubs/bank statements every pay period/month to keep my file up-to-date. I did this for over 6 months. Then was told that too much time had lapsed and that I would need to reapply. I provided all of the documentation again, awaiting a response, and continuing to send the updated info. At no time was I instructed to continue making my monthly payments. So, based on the past modification with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( original lender ), which I was told not to make payments until the new payment structure was issued. While waiting for approval, my CSR changed 5 times and I never spoke with any of them. The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] reps never explained why my modification was denied. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], because of reduced income, I did not make my HOA payments. The HOA filed a case with the courts for non-payment. At that time, I retained Attorney [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to assist me with the overwhelming process. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was served court documents stating that the mtg company was filing suit for non-payment. Attorney [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] opined he would ask the courts to merge the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] cases together, with the expectation that the HOA would settle [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and then arrangements could be made with NationStar to refinance. The other option offered me was to file Chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bankruptcy so that I could get a ''forced '' modification and keep my house. I agreed and had him prepare the paperwork. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Attorney [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] instructed me to complete the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] online certifications that are required for filing bankruptcy. He stated that they only take 30 minutes and to provide him with the certificates that Monday ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) morning for him to file the complete package with the courts. I was able to complete [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] certification and then there was an issue with the website. I contacted the company Monday morning, got it resolved and completed the certifications and sent them to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. At that time, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] told me that he was going to pull the file and refile because he did not have all of the documentation ready since he was in court most of that day. As a result, the bank is foreclosing on my home. The bank has filed a Motion for Writ of Possession and the court date is scheduled for Tues, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I ''m terrified that I will have to move and displace my child in the middle of a school year. What is so upsetting is that I have been in a position to make the monthly mortgage payments. All I wanted was for them to move the back payments to the end of the loan and make me current. I believe this is so unfair when I have been asking NationStar to work with me since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Humbly requesting your assistance.','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was unable to pay child support. my employer authorized a pay cut across the board with no');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5210,'12/03/2015','Bank account or service','Savings account','Account opening, closing, or management','bait and switched savings account and money market account resulting in fees if minimums not met','CITIBANK, N.A.',6.0,6.0,'bait and switched savings account and money market account resulting in fees if minimums not met.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5211,'12/03/2015','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Making/receiving payments, sending money','I have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] issues with Bank of America. I have my main checking account with them, and I use that checking account to pay all my credit card payments, and I have over a dozen active cards with NEVER EVER ANY MISSED OR LATE PAYMENTS. I log on once a week to all my accounts to verify the balances, and after I make my monthly payments, I WRITE DOWN THE AMOUNT AND DATE. Unfortunately, BofA has an app that does n''t give any details about accounts such as statements, no means to email the bank either, and the website is n''t any better as from the dozens of institutions I deal with online, BofA is the ONLY ONE NOT TO GIVE YOU A " FULL SITE OPTION ''''. 

I also have a credit card account at BofA, so instead of payments, I do a transfer from my checking account to my credit card account, and the transfer gets credited as a payment ( I have been doing it for 10 years with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] problem during the transfer about 8 years ago when I still lived in Nevada ). 

On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015, I logged on to my BofA app, and I made a transfer of {$30.00} from my checking to my credit card account. The app crashed shortly after that while I was scrolling through my checking account transactions, and when I tried logging back on, it asked me to update the app, stating I had an old version ( I was using a different wifi phone ). You may be in an emergency with a slow connection, and they will NOT LET YOU ONLINE UNLESS YOU DOWNLOAD THE NEW VERSION, which would have taken me quite a while on a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] connection, so I did n''t as I did n''t have half an hour to waste and that was it. I doubt they suddenly had an app update right while I was using the app but who knows. Unlike my other cards, I check BofA maybe 3 times a month as I would rather not use that app, and it ''s usually early in the month ( I get about a {$3000.00} inbound transfer at the beginning of every month from the rental for my houses, and that I verify the first week of the month ), and then to make my transfer and then maybe one more time. 

I logged on yesterday to make my payment, and it showed me as having MISSED A PAYMENT for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. There is no indication that I made the transfer even though I HAVE IT WRITTEN DOWN AS PAID AFTER MAKING THE TRANSFER ( I am neither stupid nor senile not to know when I make a payment ). In the meanwhile, I did NOT get a single notice or call about having missed a payment either, so it was a bit of a surprise. However, BofA keeps logs of when their customers log on, and what pages they go to when they are online, so it should n''t be a problem to check the logs for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to see that I was on the transfer page. Whether the site had problems, or whether it was the app, that is not my problem, I made my regular payment as I have been for the past 10 years or so, so I would like that transfer to be honored. If not, I am going to be closing my account as I am about done, and it would be a good opportunity to never use that app again. 

The other issue is that I have a yearly fee for my credit card in the amount of {$29.00} which is charged in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to my account. I went through 6 months of statements to see if there were other payment issues with the app, and I noticed that I was being charged 29.59 % interest on the MANDATORY BANK FEE which showed AS A PURCHASE. It may not be much to pay 29.59 % interest on {$29.00} dollars but the fact of the matter is that the {$29.00} balance is a bank forced fee, and it is NOT a purchase. So why should I even pay any interest on {$29.00}? Plus, are n''t banks supposed to credit your payments towards higher interest balances first? If it is so, the fee was charged in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and my next payment of {$30.00} should have paid the whole thing off, not to mention I had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] more payments after that ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] if the " missing one '''' does n''t count ). Either way, if they do that to a few [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] customers, they are suddenly earning [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of UNJUST INTEREST, and I have an issue with that.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'a credit card account at BofA is a problem with bank of America. it''s a problem with the app, and it''s not a problem.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5212,'12/03/2015','Consumer Loan','Installment loan','Taking out the loan or lease','Lender has a {$150.00} service fee which is added to the finance charge at closing. However, the APR is not adjusted to reflect this. Thus, the APR is incorrect. Also, since the top rate is 27.99 %, adding the service fee would violate usury limits.','ONEMAIN FINANCIAL HOLDINGS, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'the service fee is added to the finance charge at closing. the top rate is 27.99 %.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5213,'12/02/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','I have asked Experian to investigate and if not verifiable delete negative information on my report. I have explain and shown Experian the mistakes such as re-aged, recent monthly payments on accounts that are closed and they have fail to provide me with validation of accounts from collection agencies. Experian has responded twice that the information is accurate according to the furnishers of the information, also sending a final notice that unless I send additional relevant information that supports my claim they would not re-investigate the dispute accounts again.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'experian has responded twice that the information is accurate. experian has responded that the information is accurate.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5214,'12/02/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','Equifax is knowingly reporting an incorrect balance and payment status for an account that was settled with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I initially disputed the above referenced account with Equifax in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) but the account apparently was verified. I subsequently disputed the account directly with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] under Section 623 ( a ) ( 8 ) ( D ) of the FCRA multiple times, eventually even filing a complaint with the CFPB under this Federal law. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] response was, and I quote : '''' Our records indicate that we received a payment of {$21000.00}, which settled the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] notified the consumer reporting agencies the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was settled. We have investigated your complaint and found that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] furnished information relating to your account in accordance with industry guidelines. In response to your complaint, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] verified the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account ending in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the accuracy of the information we furnished to the consumer reporting agencies. " In support of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] claim of correct reporting, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is correctly reporting the balance as zero, with a payment status of " Settled, '''' which indicates that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is correctly reporting the information but that Equifax is ignoring the corrected information from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and continuing to knowingly report false information to my credit report to my detriment!! This represents a blatant violation of the FCRA!!! 
I have attached the settlement letter from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and the Certificate of Satisfied Judgment as proof of the settlement as well as a partial credit report, dated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] showing the false reporting.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'Equifax knowingly reported an incorrect balance and payment status for an account that was settled with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the account apparently was verified, but the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5215,'12/02/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','My investment property was foreclosed on almost 6 years ago - [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2010 - and the foreclosure deed with land court has yet to be filed. This foreclosure was a direct result of the whole mortgage debacle and land court has rejected the deed I ''ve been told. This is continuing to adversely affect my credit since it takes 7 years from the filing of the foreclosure deed for someone ''s credit to clear - and after almost 6 years nothing has been done due to the lenders incompetence.','OCWEN LOAN SERVICING LLC',2.0,2.0,'land court has rejected the deed and has rejected it. it takes 7 years from filing for someone''s credit to clear.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5216,'12/02/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','Dispute # XXXXTo Whom It May Concern : After carefully reviewing copies of all three of my credit reports I discovered that I was a victim of identity theft. I immediately took action by filing a police report as well as contacting all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the bureaus. I have recently furnished them with the appropriate documents that would verify and validate my stolen identity. 

However, I have made several attempts with Transunion via phone, certified mail, and online corresponding to get an unknown public record ( Bankruptcy ) that does not belong to me removed. As to date I have not received adequate help in resolving this issue. I have become very frustrated with this ordeal. Upon some of my many attempts to resolve the above issue with Transunion, I have experienced phone reps with language barriers ( non English speaking individuals ) trying to help me, representatives providing me with false information such as ( i.e. stating that they did n''t have to verify or validate the accuracy of the unknown bankruptcy on my report ). 

Also, upon my request to inquire about Transunion ''s methodology for verifying the Bankruptcy ( that is falsely reported on my report ) I was told by a representative that they did not have to furnish verifying that information to me. In short, I went to the courts to inquire about the bankruptcy and the courts stated that they do not verify Bankruptcy ''s or any other public records for anyone by any method. The Clerk also stated, " that the credit bureaus often put incorrect public records and bankruptcy ''s peoples credit files because they never request verifying information because the courts ca n''t furnish it and that they have never spoken to any at a credit bureau. '''' Contrary to the above, Transunion has not verified the bankruptcy # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] nor furnished me with any proof that they have verified the bankruptcy ; nor will they assist me with help on how to verify that it is not my bankruptcy. 

Lastly, not only has Transunion left me with inaccurate information on my credit report ; they have perjured/misinformed me regarding their means of verifying the bankruptcy. In congruence with the above, this has greatly impacted my life in a negative way. I am unable to move forward with my career and educational endeavors.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'a representative told me that they did not have to furnish verifying the bankruptcy. a representative said that they did not have to furnish verifying the bankruptcy. a representative said');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5217,'12/01/2015','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Account opening, closing, or management','I have authorized electronic/paperless delivery of all my monthly statements & bills for multiple accounts & have not incurred any problems with delivery other than Cap1/Cosco The membership renewal for Costco was sent to my spam folder in XX/XX/2015 which I do not monitor because I have not used the card to incur a balance since XX/XX/2015 due to prior issues with " their '''' statement delivery. In XX/XX/2015 I was clearing my spam folder & noticed a Costco account alert e-mail. This was a renewal of which resulted in late charges & a credit report of a balance unpaid after 30 days, which in turn resulted in a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] point drop on my credit rating. Although the membership renewal was not paid since XX/XX/2015 I was still allowed use of the membership card for access & multiple purchases. My long standing credit file & payment history was recognized when I spoke with an account representative who said she would transfer me to a capitol one account representative who could further assist me in resolving my issue. The Cap/1 representative responded that it is their legal responsibility to report any balances due over 30 days to the credit reporting agencies & could not assist me any further. Although I can sense the outcome, I forge forward & recontact yet another Costco account representative who also recognizes my excellent credit history & is willing to wave the {$1.00}? balance due so that my account would be paid in full .When I first became aware of the renewal e-mail I did proceed to pay in full with late charges & all {$120.00} ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 ). I have no idea were a balance due of {$1.00} relates to nor did the representative ( today [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 ). Nonetheless she was willing to wave the {$1.00}, as well as offer a credit for {$50.00}, but could not offer any resolve to the 30 day delinquency as reported. I can provide copies & dates of all as explained per request. In closing, after all these years I have managed to adapt to the inevitable changes that we experience & accept everyday, but I just do n''t get it. With that being said I hereby request " your '''' review & assistanceSincerely,','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'costco membership renewal was not paid since XX/XX/2015. it resulted in late charges & a credit report of a balance unpaid after 30');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5218,'12/01/2015','Debt collection','I do not know','Communication tactics','I have received phone calls from IC System repeatedly at all hours of the early morning and late evening ( including [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on the weekend ). the numbers were originally from the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] area code. I was never able to answer the phone, and nobody ever left a message.also called from an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( CT ) number. In the past 2 days they have robocalled me from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( ID ) and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( WY ) and have either not left a message, or I have answered with the delayed response from them and hung up ( indicating a robocall ). I returned their call both times and asked who they were and they refused to give me any information until I verified my address or my social security number. I do not give out personal information on the phone. I suggested that if they wanted to collect from me [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which they never actually confirmed who the creditor was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they needed to send me something in writing, and we returned to other person demanding that in order to do this, i had to give them my identifying information. They hung up on me in the middle of my own sentence about why they would n''t be getting my information over the phone. they called me back about an hour later and it was another delayed call without a person on the other end. If i legitimately owe a debt, I am MORE Than willing to pay it, but I ''m not giving out any information over the phone ... not when they clearly already have that information if they are asking me to " verify '''' it with them.','I.C. System, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'i have received phone calls from IC System repeatedly at all hours of the early morning and late evening. they have robocalled me from [COMPTE_ANONYMIS');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5219,'12/01/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I see on my credit report that I have approx 18 months of 120 days on my mortgage loan. I was divorced XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and the house was awarded to my husband. He moved in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and never paid another payment. The house was sold approx 2.5 yrs ago and the back payments were settled by the proceeds of the sale.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'the house was awarded to my husband. the back payments were settled by the proceeds of the sale.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5220,'11/30/2015','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','Our couple has had a checking account with JP Morgan Chase and several credit cards for over 40 years. Our home address was a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( JP M Chase has held the mortgage for the last twelve years of its 30 year life ). We were ask for a physical address which we did not have until recently. Being abroad very, very often we called the branch to give the address early [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The account manager being busy we gave it to another person. A few weeks later we got the same request. We called again and this time asked for an email address of the bank officer. We got it and had an exchange of email where we sent the physical address. We received another letter in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which got to us in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as we were abroad and called the call center again to give the address for the fourth tim. 
In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the bank closed our account alleging that we had not sent the address. Which we did and can prove with the copy of the email. The said officer has supposedly left the bank ... 
Our [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts were closed ( savings and checking ). checks were sent. But all history has been eliminated from our internet connection to the bank. payments made through the accounts before we knew of its closure were rejected creating poor credit and expenses ( bounced payments and late payments ). We were in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at the time and it took many hours of work to be able to get back to a situation where we could honour our due payments. ALL THIS BECAUSE THE BANK FAILED TO DO ITS JOB','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',4.0,4.0,'bank closed account after claiming that we had not sent the address. bank closed accounts alleging that we had not sent the address. bank has a checking account with the bank for');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5221,'11/30/2015','Debt collection','Credit card','False statements or representation','In 2009 [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] " represented '''' [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] whom had purchased a debt from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] whome purchased from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank, and the representative prior to us meeting with the judge coherced me to sign a settlement form by stating whom did I think the judge would believe me or her an attorney and besides since I was going through a divorce at that time most likely I would file bankruptcy and as head of household no one could ever come after me. NO ONE EVER VALIDATED ANY DEBT AMOUNT. Then I recently had Rosen and Pollock try to garnish my wages stating I owed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( per a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) Then when called on this to complete a payoff a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] informed me that I neglected my debt I had a contract with them, she mentioned that she was an attorney, an attorney representative and also [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that is no longer around. The problem all along with this was that the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] institute did not honor their contract and by breaching that contract I should not pay for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for which I can not use. I get the run around with lasik and any credit to be offered has to be through them and routed accordingly. I dont have a problem paying what is fair and just but not the almost [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stated I owed because I had not paid my bills.','Pollack & Rosen, P.A.',2.0,2.0,'a judge ruled that a lawyer owed me a debt. a representative said that she was an attorney, an attorney representative and a contract with them. ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5222,'11/30/2015','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Using a debit or ATM card','I have a Direct Express [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Comerica Bank [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], my Social Security [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] money is loaded onto this card monthly. I had fraud on my card starting on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of this month and someone was able to take all of money out of my account. I reported the fraud to Direct Express as soon as I realized I had no money left in my account, my card was still in my possession, so they canceled my card and sent a new [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They are telling me it could take up to 90 days for them to give me my money back. It was over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars that was taken all of my money, I ''m [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and depend on this money to pay the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] live in Oregon and was on a mini vacation in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Oregon with my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] year old Grandson, I was using this same card to pay for my vacation, at the time the fraud was taking place in New York [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the people that used my card went to a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] several times and withdrew money from my account, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] should be able to see these people on their Surveylance cameras right? I have filled out the Fraud Questionnaire and will fax it to the Direct Express Fraud Department today, I will also mail a copy to them. I read on your website that they should put the money back into my account in at least [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] business days after I report the fraud, they are telling me again it can take up to 90 days, are Direct Express cards treated differently? I have talked to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different people in the level [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] fraud department at Direct Express and both have told me they have 90 days to return my my money. I sure hope you can help me, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is around the corner, I was planning on using some of my money for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Thank You! 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','Comerica',2.0,4.0,'direct Express has canceled my card and sent a new card to the ''comPTE_ANONYMISÉ''. the money is loaded on my card monthly.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5223,'11/30/2015','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','I was a customer of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]-XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I had a single line, with no data plan. At that time they did not give away phones or let you buy them on payment plans. There is no way that they would allow someone to be over {$600.00} past due without shutting off their service! I have also never recevied any type of correspondence from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] stating that I owed any money, I also have never been contacted by a collector about owing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] money.','Convergent Resources, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a customer of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had a single line');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5224,'11/29/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','Experian continues to report an illegally obtained/fraudulent account from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XXXXThe original account, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], was paid in full and closed on XX/XX/2009. This account is currently reporting positively to all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] bureaus on my file. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], without any prior warning, opens a NEW collections account from this old paid and closed account- and begins reporting it as an open, past due collections account. 

FIRST, I do not owe this money. This account was settled and paid in full in 2009 directly with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

SECOND, this account is LONG past the statute of limitations in TX ( 4 years ). It is absolutely 100 % illegal for them to continue to report this. I just purchased a new vehicle in the last month, and because this illegal debt collector has added this account to my report, i was not only DECLINED for credit, but it SEVERELY and ADVERSELY affected my interest rate. 

Now, I have incurred damages as a result of this fraudulent collections account and will need to refinance my new vehicle loan as a result, once this is deleted. 

I *will* be pursuing additional legal action after this complaint has been addressed with CFPB, if necessary.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'experian continues to report an illegally obtained/fraudulent account. account was paid in full and closed on XX/XX/2009. account is currently reporting');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5225,'11/28/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Settlement process and costs','We opened a construction loan with Hancock Bank ( a division of Whitney Bank ) to build a new house in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. As of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] our house is still not complete because the bank is not requiring the builder ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) to adhere to the draw schedule set forth in the builders agreement. We had a draw schedule in our builders agreement which set forth specific goals that would be met during the construction process before the builder would be allowed reimbursement by the bank. Neither the bank nor the builder is following the draw schedule which has allowed a ''300 day completion '' for the house per the builders agreement to balloon into over 900 days from contract signing without a completed house. From the very beginning of the process the bank allowed the builder to draw more money than allowed per the builders agreement. The initial down payment at closing should have been [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % but the bank gave the builder [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] %. It took the builder 7 months after getting [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % from the bank to get building permits for the house. There are no penalties or completion date in the building agreement so the only schedule that had any deadlines or accountability to it was the draw schedule. The builder would be required to complete a certain portion of the house before being reimbursed by the bank. The builders agreement had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] draws in it. The bank has already allowed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] draws and the house is not complete. The bank has undermined that schedule by allowing the builder to break down the draw schedule into a percentage completion draw schedule. The bank has paid for as little as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % work completed. On average the builder is completing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % per month and being reimbursed regularly by the bank. I have objected to this from the beginning but when I refused to sign the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % draw schedule the builder stopped work completely. Allowing the percentage completion draw schedule without a completion date or penalties has allowed the builder to take as long as he wants to finish the house. He has no money on the table. If he spends {$100.00} the bank reimburses him. The bank has been pro builder from the very beginning. It ''s like the old days where the bank and builder get together and the consumer is left to fend for themselves against [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] professional firms who know how to game the system. I was treated harshly from the Sr mortgage construction officer saying there was nothing the bank could do and that ''this was my guy, I picked the builder not the bank. I needed to work it out with the builder ''. But again, when I asked the bank to abide by the draw schedule in the builders agreement, they would n''t do it. I also told the builder I wanted to abide by the builders agreement and they refused saying the bank was willing to pay on a percentage completion basis and they would refuse to work until I agreed to percentage completion. I ''m caught in this vicious circle where I ca n''t get my house completed. I have a 15 year mortgage with the first 12 months as the construction period where I pay interest only. The construction period began XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], which is now 2 years 2 months of interest only and the fixed portion of my mortgage is reduced to 12 years 10 months to pay off the entire mortgage balance-subject to house completion date. The bank set up one meeting with the builder in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] after I told the bank I was going to file a complaint with the CFPB. After that meeting the bank sent one follow up email last week after I reminded the bank that the builder said the house would be completed by XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The builder called for another inspection last week and the house was another [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % complete ( since XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], averaging [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] % per month for the last three months ) for a total completion of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] %. The bank paid the draw. At this pace, it will be another 3 months before the house is complete','WHITNEY BANK - NEW ORLEANS MAIN BRANCH',4.0,4.0,'construction loan opened with Hancock Bank to build a new house in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the builder would be');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5226,'11/28/2015','Credit card',NULL,'APR or interest rate','on or about [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 i called Walmart mastercard to find out why i had a mastercard on my regular walmart credit card account. the agent told me that they had upgraded me to a mastercard and that i could go ahead and close my walmart regular credit card account, so i did so, but before doing that i did ask the rep. when was this mastercard sent out and he told me it was sent out today [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 and i should receive it in 7 to 10 business days. those 10 business days went by and i called and told them i had not received this new mastercard. and the rep i spoke to this time told me " i ''m sorry it was sent out yesterday '''' which made it [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 so once i got the mastercard which was a couple of days later i called to activate the card but it would not activate, and the rep. i spoke with said " i ''m sorry [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] your mastercard can not be activated because you closed your walmart regular credit card account, and i told the rep. at that time i was told i could go ahead and close the account. and she told me she would pass it on to another department and see what would become of it, about the time she told me that our call got droped so i call right back and this time i ask to speak directly and i mean directly with a supervisor so they connected me to one. she ask what could she help me with and i told her the whole story, and she said well you do n''t have to worry now [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] i have got your card activated, and i ask her at that time i said i want to know what my APR is on this Mastercard because none of that disclosed to me when i recieved the card, which by law you are suppose to receive, and she told me my APR was at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and i ask her will you please make sure because i will not use this card if the APR is to high and she told me " I ''m looking at it right here on my screen [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it says 16.99 %. I said ok thank you and the call ended. since that day i have requested them to send me the terms and conditions on this card that include late fees APR ... .ect ... and i still have not received them. so on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 I called back and requested a supervisor again and they placed me with GE Capital Escalations team. that team is telling me that my APR is 20.99 % and i said no its not the supervisor i spoke with said it was at 16.99 % and she confrimed that not once but twice when i ask her. The gentleman that is in Escalations said they would have to pull that call, and if that was the case that i was told that then they would correct it. he told me i could call back in 4 or 5 days and it would all be cleared up. i waited 6 to 7 days and when i call tonight ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 ) the rep would not place a supervisor on the phone and they still would not give me any information about the papers they where to send and about my APR being 16.99 % as i was told. i ''ve have been gave the run around over this long enough. i ''ve had [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] rep and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] supervisor tell me the APR is 16.99 % and i ''ve had about the same amount to tell me its 20.99 % ... and its not right to do a customer that helps place food on the peoples table at GE this way and it needs to STOP!!','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'walmart mastercard sent out mastercard to find out why i had a mastercard on my regular credit card account. i called the rep and told them i had not received');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5227,'11/27/2015','Debt collection','I do not know','Communication tactics','The debt collection agency recently called my employer to find me. When my supervisor stated that I was unable to receive personal phone calls at work the agent on the phone became incredibly rude, and while she did not use obscene or profane language she was incredibly unprofessional. It was incredibly embarrassing for me to have to speak with my supervisor about this issue.','Southwest Credit Systems, L.P.',2.0,2.0,'debt collection agency called my employer to find me. she was incredibly rude and incredibly unprofessional.');
