INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5245,'11/19/2015','Debt collection','Payday loan','Taking/threatening an illegal action','Had a man call me claiming he was a detective and I owed on a payday loan for Ace cash express claiming that I had missed a civil suit court date today and that if I I did n''t pay the amount owed he would have the bench warrant executed and I would be taken to jail. He said I needed to pay what was due today which was a little more than [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars or I would be taken to jail until they give me another court date. Threatened wage garnishment and my license being suspended and when I told him I had no money due to my situation he said I need to borrow money for a down payment or I would go to jail. I was never even served with any type of lawsuit. I honestly felt so scared and had no idea what to think but when I get off the phone with him I reversed the telephone number and it went to an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I believe and saw many reveiws claiming it was a scam.','ACE CASH EXPRESS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a man called me claiming he was a detective and owed on a payday loan for Ace cash express. he said he had missed a civil suit court');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5246,'11/19/2015','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','This complaint is in relation to Planet Home Lending Mortgage Company. I have been charged additional fees up and above my regular mortgage payment for the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] time this year. I went through a loan modification XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and it is currently XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I continuously am being charged fees. I have called Planet Home Lending customer service and they ca n''t give me a straight answer. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they charged me a fee of {$34.00}. Their explanation was that it was in regard to my loan modification and was a fee that was not paid. I reluctantly paid. Then XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was charged a fee of {$51.00}. When I called to inquire, they were not sure what the fee was for and they credited my account, but left a fee of {$3.00} which again I paid. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they again charged me another fee of {$46.00}. Again after speaking to them, they corrected the fee. Now, I received my XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] statement and another fee for {$17.00} has been charged to me. I am very frustrated with these fees almost every month. I called and inquired about this fee and they said it was a fee for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] drive by '''' that was conducted during my loan modification process XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. A year and a half later and they are charging me for someone to drive by my home to check if it is occupied. I am tired of taking time to inquire about these extra charges for all these months. I feel I am being penalized for obtaining a loan modification and they continuously are finding some kind of fee to charge me above the regular mortgage payment. Is there anyone that can look into this company? Maybe conduct an audit and check if this is happening to other customers. I received a loan modification in order to afford my monthly mortgage, but the fees they keep assessing is not helping me what so ever.','PLANET HOME LENDING, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a year and a half later, a company is charging me for a loan modification. a year and a half later, they are charging me for someone to drive');
