INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5283,'11/06/2015','Bank account or service','Checking account','Making/receiving payments, sending money','I made a payment of {$800.00} on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15. The bank processed this transaction, and it was officially pending on my account. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15, the transaction for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/015 has completely disappeared from my online statement. I call BB & T to see what happened to the payment and the representative informed me that the transaction had been cancelled by the debtor and she proceeded to tell me that this transaction would not be posting to my account because it had been cancelled. I had some other bills due since this transaction had been cancelled I thought I would put this payment off [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I went ahead and paid [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] other bills and was not concerned about being overdrafted since it was evident that transaction for {$800.00} had not been processed and had been cancelled according to the BB & T representative. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 the transaction of {$800.00} had been posted to my account even though I had not been told that there was no way this transaction could post. Now I have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] other ACH items out at the moment and once they post my account will completely overdraft. I called a BBT representative again to only be told that there is nothing that they can do.','BB&T CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'the bank processed the payment and it was officially pending on my account. the transaction for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5284,'11/05/2015','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','I was foreclosed on in 2008. I feel as though I was a victim of fraud, discrimination, scam, and robo signing. The lender in question is Courntrywide Home Loans, now known as Bank of America. I begged and pleaded with this lender to work with me instead of working with parties involved whom were intercepting my information. Till this day I have no knowledge of how all of these terrible things have taken place to displace us of our home. End resulting of the bank working with this ring whom end resulted in purchasing my home from the bank for {$500.00}','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'i was foreclosed on in 2008 and was foreclosed on in 2008. the lender in question is Courntrywide Home Loans.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5285,'11/05/2015','Debt collection','Federal student loan','Communication tactics','In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I made payment arrangements with Allied Interstate for some of my student loans that went into default ... the only reason I was in default on these loans was becuase [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] made an error on my payment arrangement with them and was/is only applying my monthly payments I automatically make to them to half of my loans ( unknown to me and even [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] does nto know why that happened and they are the ones that set the payment up ). 
Anyway I have been making payments by automatic deduction to my debit card ( because I was told by Allied Interstate they can not do ACH debits for payments just debit cards which I do not believe is correctnd seems a bit shady/illegal ). the payments are made every 2 weeks and have been taken since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2015 but I still continue to receive calls daily, sometimes several times a day and letters threatening to garnish my wages or take further legal action if I do n''t make payment arrangements. When I called them to tell them I am making payments and to stop the letters and calls I was told that they would stop but they have not. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I was changing jobs and called to have them change the payment dates as my pay schedule was changing and I explained that my new payroll would not reflect dedcutions for insurance, union dues, etc for at least 60 days but that I would provide copies of my new paystubs and new income amount at that time. I was assured this was acceptable but still keep getting calls and today received another voice mail threatening this time not only threatening to garnish my wages but to cancel my payment arrangements if I did not send in the payroll information. I left them a voicemail in return explaining again that I had arranged to send in my new payroll information at the end of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] as agreed and that I was tired of being harrassed and ifit did not stop I would contact an attorney as I am tired of it ( this was all said politely ). In the voice mail I explained I was at work and was unable to talk and yet they called back again. This has been going on for months and I feel is harrassment. This company has had previous legal issues with their collection methods from my research and I want them held accountable.','Allied Interstate LLC',2.0,2.0,'Allied Interstate made payment arrangements for some student loans that went into default. the only reason I was in default was becuase. Allied Interstate made an