Please, permit me to mention that I ''m prepared and willing to pay any reasonable amount in consideration to my expenses which will be between $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] request and appeal is to reduce the {$700.00} to reasonable payment plan that I will be committed. Thank you once again for your assistance in this matter.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a law firm asked me to pay over $1000.00 a month. he asked me to pay $700.00 for one year, $');
