INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5313,'10/28/2015','Debt collection','I do not know','Disclosure verification of debt','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] hired attorney Gordon & Wong Law group who filed judgment against me XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on a debt that is not mine. They just recently levied my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account in ths amount of {$860.00} I contacted Attorneys office and they advised me to file police report of id theft and that this alleged debt is not mine. I filed police report along with FTC complaint and submitted all documentation to attorneys office by certified mail USPS tracking # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] They advised me they would speak to there client and get clarification of the debt. I have called there office every week and they claim that it is still being investigated and that there client has not responded to them with definite answer on validation of this debt. I have asked for my money back from bank levy and to this day they have no answer for me or cant even tell me where this debt came from. Please get me my money back this is not my debt.','Gordon & Wong Law Group, P.C.',2.0,2.0,'attorney hired by attorney who levied my account in ths amount of $860.00. he filed police report and contacted attorneys office. they advised me');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5314,'10/27/2015','Mortgage','VA mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','We are currently in the process of a short sale. Unfortunately the lender ''s inspector is making regular visits to our home and has stolen [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] items from the home and continue to damage the property. Initially the locks were destroyed and now the garage door has been destroyed. It appears this individual is deliberately trying to further destroy our property every time we file a complaint about the damage to the property. The new buyer should not have to be responsible for repairing these damages because they were not there when she viewed the home and made an offer on the home. Every week we find some damage done inside of the home and the inspector is the only one with a key, besides my husband. This needs to stop!!!!','CARRINGTON MORTGAGE SERVICES, LLC',2.0,4.0,'lender''s inspector is making regular visits to our home. the inspector has stolen items from the home and continues to damage the property. the new buyer should not have to be responsible for');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5315,'10/27/2015','Consumer Loan','Vehicle loan','Problems when you are unable to pay','Hello. My Name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Veteran on a fixed VA income and Social Security. I put down [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] down around XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Mersades Benz 2 Door coupe ; 4 seater. The cost of the car was {$6000.00}. I thought I was getting a good deal however the car turned out to not only be a lemon for which I have filed a previous case with your organization, but I was stuck with paying not only 35 % intrest rates on a {$6000.00} auto loan through United Finance located on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Nevada [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ; [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), but also I am still paying the 35 % so it is like my principal hardly moved at all. I still owe {$4800.00} and now I have a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit rating which is worse than when I started making payments to better my credit and I am in a negative status with all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit breaus while United Finance is making a fortune from me concerning paying for this lemon car I have previously reported to you this month. I need assistance in both cases to get justice because I am being stressed out and robbed all the way around and I am still making {$300.00} a month payments.','United Group Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] car was a lemon. the cost of the car was $6000.00');
