INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5323,'10/24/2015','Bank account or service','Checking account','Problems caused by my funds being low','I have reason to believe my bank is structuring my transactions in a way that generates maximum overdraft fees. In the past three months, on at least [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] occasions, I have been hit with as many as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] overdraft fees on transactions that could have been covered if the bank ordered them smallest-to-largest, or even if they took place in chronological order. The bank now wants me to switch to a savings account that would refuse to honor the purchases [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but which would mean I ''d receive fees from the company I was attempting to pay ).','BB&T CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'in the past three months, my bank has been hit with as many as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] overdraft fees. the bank now wants me to switch');
