INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5354,'10/15/2015','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','I tried to open a checking [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Classic checking [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account in santanderbank via online. Provided all the required information plus initial amount of {$250.00} to open the account. Also uploaded Driver ''s license, other bank statement, utility Bills ( internet and electricity Bills ) scanned versions. But after few hours come to know that they have declined the application with some weird reason that " We regret we can not open your account and/or add your name as an owner/signer to an account with Santander Bank, N.A. 

We were unable to verify your identity or other personal information at this time. Please visit a Branch to complete your application. '''' What??? 
I was suppose to get {$150.00} in 90 days as a new account opening bonus after satisfying few conditions. Why they could n''t open the account - it ''s a big surprise to me. 

Later I sent them inquiry regarding this which they were suppose to respond back within 24 hours which i have n''t heard of till now.','SANTANDER BANK, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'a checking account was scanned by a branch. the account was unable to verify your identity or other personal information. the application was declined.');
