INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5356,'10/15/2015','Prepaid card','General purpose card','Managing, opening, or closing account','I have had no access to my money on my card for 3 days since they tried to upgrade, I have spent several hours on hold, with no resolution. They have sent out several social media messages saying the problem is fixed, or saying it will be fixed and as of this moment I still can not access my funds.','Empowerment Ventures, LLC',2.0,2.0,'i have had no access to my money on my card for 3 days. they have sent out social media messages saying the problem is fixed.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5357,'10/15/2015','Consumer Loan','Vehicle loan','Problems when you are unable to pay','I purchased a car for my then husband in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that was financed through Santander. In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when our divorced was finalized, our divorce decree stated he was responsible for all payments on the vehicle. This was forwarded to Santander who stated they could not honor the divorce decree and the loan was still my responsibility. My ex husband continued to make payments sporadically then decided he no longer wanted the car. I tried to continue the payments on them but just could not financially afford to. The vehicle was voluntarily surrendered to Santander in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They have sold the vehicle since and reported the unpaid balance as a charge off/repo. However they are also reporting it monthly as a late payment. If the loan has been charged off, why are they continuing to report a late payment monthly.','SANTANDER CONSUMER USA HOLDINGS INC.',2.0,4.0,'the car was voluntarily surrendered to the owner in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the loan was still my responsibility. my ex husband continued to make');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5358,'10/14/2015','Bank account or service','Checking account','Account opening, closing, or management','I have a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] corporate accounts with US Bank, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] checking and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Money Market. I am the single and only shareholder to the corporation there are no other signers or anyone else authorized on my accounts. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015, my corporate bank accounts and information were breached by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] manager of US Bank. My ex husband went into US National Bank and without my knowledge or permission obtain from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] my corporate bank account numbers and their balances, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the bank manager, took it a step further and provided the corporations profile which included the Federal Tax I '''' D #. Currently, there is a restraining order against my ex-husband which my branch of US Bank is well aware of. My ex-husband went to a branch where he knew the manager in order to illicit and obtain information that he was not privy to. At the time I open the account XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with US Bank, I was required to put in writing any other person or persons authorized on the account and all shareholders, which there were none, again, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I was required to provide the same information. 
[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at the time he accesses the accounts for my ex-husband could clearly see that his name was not on any of the accounts for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and if there were any doubts, a quick telephone call to my opening branch would have confirmed the following : My ex husband is not part of the corporation in any form and there is a restraining order against him and he is not on any of the corporate accounts nor has he ever been. Now knowing this information it is completely baffling to me, that anyone could walk off the streets and present absolutely [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and obtain bank statements, corporate profile, tax id number. By [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] providing the Tax ID number and profile to my ex husband this has caused catastrophic harm to me both financially and medically. This action by US Bank has set back and impeded my recovery from recent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and more recent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I am expending energy, time and resources which I do not have on US Bank ''s egregious and willful act.','U.S. BANCORP',2.0,2.0,'a restraining order against my ex-husband is being imposed against him. he was required to provide the same information to all shareholders. he was required');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5359,'10/14/2015','Prepaid card','Transit card','Unauthorized transactions/trans. issues','I have had rushcard since 2010 and I get my direct deposit everyother Tuesday by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] rushcard has n''t posted my direct deposit and also are not showing the money I had on my card previous to my direct deposit. I have been trying to log on to the website for me than 24 hours with no avail and also have been trying to speak with a representative for for than 24 hours to be placed on hold for more than 2 hours each time when I get through to someone. I have bills to pay and children to feed and am getting no reason on why my money is n''t available to me I was never informed of a system update or system change that they supposedly are doing this is unacceptable and I need to be compensated for late payments on the bills that I have to have paid. Very angry and frustrated.','Empowerment Ventures, LLC',2.0,2.0,'rushcard hasn''t posted my direct deposit and are not showing the money. I have been trying to log on to the website for more than 24 hours.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5360,'10/14/2015','Credit card',NULL,'Credit line increase/decrease','My wife and I have a credit card with Chase ( in her name ) that had a {$9000.00} credit limit. We own a few small businesses and we needed a credit card to make some purchases and gave the card someone in our office to make the purchases. We told them to use the card until it reaches its limit. We expected the card to stop working when it reached it limit at {$9000.00}. Instead {$24000.00} in charges were approved. This is ok with us. We were investing into something and actually happy {$24000.00} was approved. 

Why we are complaining is that Chase now is reporting my wife as 245 % over her credit limit. This is not right if the limit was {$9000.00} the should not have allowed the account to reach {$24000.00}. We asked Chase to consider increasing the line to {$24000.00} or more than {$9000.00} and they have declined the application because this account is 245 % over its limit. Catch 22 basically if you can call it that. 

All we ask is they report the card as at its limit not 245 % over its limit. They refuse and now my wife ''s credit score is poor when before it was good.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',6.0,6.0,'a credit card with Chase had a $9000.00 credit limit. we told them to use the card until it reaches its limit. instead $2');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5361,'10/14/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','I sent a dispute letter to the bureaus ( Experian, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) this past [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2015 requesting that they remove a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] debt of {$4000.00} that does not belong to me. They never removed the debt, but stated that it would remain in my credit reports. I investigated this debt and Representative [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ID # : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/Branch # : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] confirmed on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015 that they have no record of this debt in their system with my name, social security, nor address. Please, investigate and find out why the bureaus are not investigating debts properly and doing the job that they are responsible for ; which is resolving disputes as accurately as they can. Your attention to this matter would be greatly appreciated.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a dispute letter to the bureaus asking that they remove a debt of $4000.00 that does not belong to me. they never removed the debt, but stated that');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5362,'10/13/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','Am Filing this complaint because Equifax has ignored my request to provide me with the documents they have on file to verify the accounts I disputed under section 611 ( 5 ) ( a ) of FCRA thy are required to promptly delete all information I requested that can not be verifiedPlease resolve this manner as soon as possible Thank You','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'am Filing this complaint because Equifax has ignored my request to provide me with the documents they have on file to verify the accounts I disputed. the documents are required to promptly delete all');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5363,'10/13/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I applied for an equity credit line only to be declined because unbeknowns to me the mortgage company had placed a lien equal to 150 % of the loan on the property. I ''ve contacted the company, CMC Funding ( they use [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to service their loans ) regarding releasing the additional 50 %. After several emails and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] phone calls assuring me that they would be quickly getting back with me I have heard nothing from them. My request was pretty simple but they seem content ignoring me. If by chance I did sign something in the closing documents that allowed then to increase the lien on the proerty to 150 % of the loan value it was done in a very deceptive manner. None of the previous loans that I have had ever had anything like this and if something this restrictive was added to the loan documents it at a minimum should have to be made crystal clear to the applicant as part of the truth in lending. It appears to me that if I took action using the Kentucky Revised Status that they could consider me in default of the loan, which seems absurd but even my personal bank did n''t understand the process and that is why I ''ve tried to deal with CMC/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] regarding this issue in a civil manner but apparently they do n''t operate under the concept of real customer care. If I had known I would have either negociated it out of the terms of the loan or found a different mortgage company.','Capital Markets Cooporative, LLC',4.0,4.0,'a lien was placed on the proerty to 150 % of the loan value. the lien was a deceptive measure and the lender did not understand the process ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5364,'10/13/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','We refinanced our home in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2015. We took the mortgage out and Ditech Financial LLC turned out to be the loan servicing company ( Originally it was Green Tree but they were bought by Ditech [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Our loan paperwork says our mortgage is set up to put taxes into an escrow account and the money is included with our payment each month. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I called ditech regarding my taxes not being paid. The person I spoke with said my account was not set up for tax payments. I told him I have a copy of my mortgage saying I should be. He said he would submit a " Research Request '''' and that it would take 14 business days. 
I called back on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] around [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was informed it had not been the full 14 business days and I should call back tomorrow - even though there were only a few short hours until the end of their business days. 

I called back on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the tax department. She indicated there was n''t anything in the notes regarding the results of the research request. I told her this was unacceptable, as it ''s been two full weeks and my taxes are still not paid. I waited on hold for close to an hour, hoping to speak with a supervisor. Apparently there was n''t a supervisor available. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] said she spoke with someone from Customer Service regarding my account and that they indicated my account was not set up for tax escrow. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] told me she would submit an " Escalation Request '''' for me but that escalations can take up to 3 business days. She told me a supervisor would be calling me back within the three business days. 
I never received a phone call, so on the fourth business day [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) I called back and spoke with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] again. After waiting on hold for more than 30 minutes for a supervisor, one could not be found for me to speak to. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] then completed a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] way conference call between her, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the customer service representative and me. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] also confirmed my account is not set up to escrow taxes. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] provided me with the following directions : Fax a copy of the pages of my mortgage where it states my taxes should be paid via escrow to both customer service and the tax departmentProvide a cover letter giving my name, account #, Block and lot numbers, an explanation that my taxes are not listed on the escrow line and the request to have my taxes paid. 
I sent the cover letter and requested information to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] fax numbers on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] indicated it could take up to 5 business days to correct the issue. I will call back on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
After daily calls to Ditech Financial LLC the issue is still not resolved.','Ditech Financial LLC',2.0,2.0,'refinanced home in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of 2015. we took the mortgage out and Ditech Financial LLC turned out to be the loan servicing company ');
