_ANONYMISÉ], I then turned around and financed {$16000.00} with PenFed for the same [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. PenFed claims that a check for {$9200.00} was issued to me and placed into a share draft account. PenFed then states that the {$9200.00} was used to payoff the mercedes. PenFed then claims that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was issued a check for {$11000.00} and produced a promissory note to go with the others that were created. PenFed claims that the {$11000.00} was used to payoff a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. This [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] belongs to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was paid off in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. PenFed trips themselves up by claiming that the {$11000.00} and the {$9200.00} [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] went to payoff the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The payoff notices from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and follow-up on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] proves beyond a shadow of a doubt that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] have been defrauded and scammed. In my complaint of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] we did not have these documents. These documents from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank clearly refutes any claim that PenFed could possibly make. Since my complaint [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] others have been found who have had similar experiences. None of their experiences are as blatant as the experience of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I will give PenFed the opportunity to satisfy my damages in an expedited time-frame. All supporting documents have been attached. Thank you. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','PENTAGON FEDERAL CREDIT UNION',2.0,4.0,'penFed contacted me and was told they would pay off the loan. he agreed to the loan amount and faxed an aceptance back. the');
