and overdrawn money back to my bank but they do n''t care because they have their money now. the way they handled everything was very unprofessional and I am so unhappy with them. I really was hoping to start making monthly payments to finally pay off this debt, now I have lost trust and faith in them.','PORTFOLIO RECOVERY ASSOCIATES INC',2.0,2.0,'a collection account with Portfolio Recovery Associate''s was for a credit card. they told me they could lower the debt to $620.00. they agreed to');
