INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5497,'08/28/2015','Credit card',NULL,'Cash advance','I have a dispute with Bank of America on how to calculate the variable interest rate for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) charged to a Credit Card Account ending in # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
We both agree the contractual rate for any [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on the Account is calculated using the " index '''', the U.S. Prime rate as published in the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with a margin of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
We disagree on whether interest rate charged to the Account increases or decreases as the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] fluctuates. Bof A contends the rate is fixed at the time of the transaction - the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I contend, per the contract at page [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], " How to Calculate Variable Rates '''', quoting the contract verbatim - emphasis added in brackets : " An increase or decrease in the index will cause a corresponding increase or decrease [ note the disjunctive ] in your variable rates [ plural ] on the first day of your billing cycle .... " The Credit Card Agreement goes on to explain, again, quoting the contract verbatim : " An increase in the index means you will pay [ mandatory ] higher interest charges and will have a higher Total Minimum Payment Due. '''' Simply put, the interest charges may go higher. BofA asserts the interest charged can only go higher but NEVER lower. The U.S. Prime has indisputably gone down, but Bank of America will not re-calculate interest rate charges to reflect " the decrease in your [ consumer ''s ] variable rate ''''. 
I believe our dispute centers on how to read a credit card agreement written by the Bank. 
I believe the contract must read as a whole construed according to applicable law. If the APR for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] can go up, it certainly can go down. This means the consumer should be paying LOWER interest charges when the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Prime Rate goes DOWN per the express terms of the Credit Card Agreement. 
Even if Bank of America is correct and the APR for the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] will remain permanently at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - the rate is unconscionable - it amounts to a penalty rate not reflecting market conditions when the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Prime goes down, but only accepting the variable rate when the U.S. Prime Rate goes up - penalizing the diligent consumer who has not defaulted. 
I seek a recalculation of the APR for any [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when the published U.S. Prime Rate went down and the balance on the Account corrected. 
Respectfully Submitted.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'bank of America agrees to calculate variable interest rate. interest rate charged to account is calculated using the index '''', the rate of the u.s. prime. we');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5498,'08/28/2015','Credit card',NULL,'Billing disputes','I was first solicited [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] by phone. I paid a deposit of {$4600.00} for a business opportunity. I was supposed to receive including but not limited to the following : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], Page Setup : fill out available fields, custom URL, News feed builder : Like [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] industry or niche leaders, Install FB Badge onto client ''s website, discovery report, competitor & industry analysis, research client ''s business model & offerings, Identify targeted customer audience : demographic, behaviors and interests, develop final discovery report detailing findings, strategy report, determine top engagement best practices, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], consulting, publishing & scheduling post. I did n''t understand alot of what was going on. Everyone was telling me not to worry they would help me. I admit I do n''t understand alot about the computer and have related that information to them. They took advantage of a senior citizen. I requested a refund in my demand letter, because I was n''t given the face to face attention imperative for my success which I was guaranteed before signing our agreement. On that basis, to date I have never used their services and was n''t given the product as described. I am aware that there is a duration in which you can dispute a billing item with your credit card company but these are unordinary circumstances and therefore an exception should be made under the " claim and defense '''' regulation. My credit card company should provide a certain level of protection to me. Please have my credit card company investigate the issue and refund the monies paid out when I was under duress.','PNC Bank N.A.',2.0,2.0,'a credit card company should provide a certain level of protection to me. a refund should be made under the " claim and defense '''' regulation.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5499,'08/27/2015','Bank account or service','Checking account','Problems caused by my funds being low','After numerous troubles with fraudulent charges, unjust service charges, poor customer service and policies that change to suit the bank, we decided to bank elsewhere. In trying to make sure that auto charges are being switched over to the new account, I checked the account yesterday morning and found that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] auto-debit was floating and needed to be addressed. I immediately deposited cash to cover the " pending '''' charges. During our problems with fraudulent charges, we were informed that " pending '''' charges could n''t be disputed or stopped because they had not been honored yet and we were forced to wait three weeks and face late fees from our mortgage institution and utilities because we had to wait a long period of time to have the charges investigated because of their " pending '''' status. Additionally, according to their online banking site, there was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] item pushing my account to {$6.00} overdrawn and then they delayed processing the cash deposit so they could charge another item fee, therefore totaling [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] item fees. When I checked this morning [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of my insurances had erroneously billed their account instead of the new account and I rushed to make the cash available. I was told that this " pending '''' item was already being honored and that even if I got my insurance company to reverse the error, they would charge another item fee. I am complaining, because when the opportunity suits them " pending '''' transactions can be held in cyberspace and the financial stability of my family can be left in limbo for days and weeks, but I can not address erroneous charges while they are " pending. '''' I have no way of correcting or disputing charges without incurring fees anyway. Cash deposits should be immediately available funds and be able to be applied to charges that by the bank ''s own admission have not cleared their institution yet. It leaves consumers powerless to prevent fees in erroneous situations while pursuing action against those improperly billing. Charging fees for charges yet cleared while not immediately honoring cash deposits only benefits the bank and unjustly penalizes the account holder.','ZIONS BANCORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'pending charges couldn''t be disputed or stopped because of their pending '''' status. pending charges couldn''t be disputed or stopped because they');
