INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5543,'08/14/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','Greetings, I am a resident of NC and a home owner that has had some hardship as having no employment to working [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] jobs to keep my home. Ive submitted a loan modification to OCWEN a loan bank to please make adjustment accordingly to my income and adjust my interest rate to be affordable. However, they have denied and proceeded with attorney to for foreclosure / or short sale. I submitted paperwork and documents requested, paystubs employer statements over and over and they down play my income and deny any options. By the time you receive this i would hope that I am not put out. I would hope that they consider this is where i live. I want my home and I surely will pay. I only asked for a lower interest rate and an affordable payment. What affordable [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars with an interest rate of at least [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
