INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5551,'08/12/2015','Credit card',NULL,'Customer service / Customer relations','I file a dispute with American Express. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015, I purchased though the internet from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I received the product and was is satisfied with quantity and size. I requested a refund from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I returned their product to them on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015. Received an email from " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015 acknowledging receipt of the product. The only options for a refund is exchange or purchase another [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and call in a give them the order number and they will refund the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] order. I disputed this with my Credit Card company American Express. On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015 I received an email stating they have completed their investigation and they found that " the merchant has provided support and an explanation for charge in question. " I have requested to see the documents that merchant has provided. I called and though email. No response from American Express. I have called [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] times to have my case reopen and I am put on hold for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] min. at a time and sometimes longer. Only for American Express Serve to tell me that they will send and email to the dispute department. In the meantime, I have no product or my money. American Express Serve customer services are rude and unhelpful. I never said that I did not authorize the charge. I sent their product back to them and I would like a refund. They are refusing a refund until I make another purchase. I am never making a purchase from this company. I am closing my account with American Express Serve and I do n''t recommend this product. I feel that American Express Serve customer service are lying about my depute and about reopening my case.','AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY'