INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5666,'07/09/2015','Bank account or service','Checking account','Using a debit or ATM card','There were fraudulent transactions on my debit card. The new perpetrator also had my PIN ; my card was used at an ATM and to purchase airline tickets. I reported the fraud to Wells. They deactivated my card. They conducted an investigation but denied my claim. I now have a negative balance. The fraudulent transactions total over {$1000.00}. I will have to call Wells Fargo loss prevention denied my claim, presumably because I refused to answer the same questions again and again to WF employees in different departments. I will deplete my account to near [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but, of course, the account will remain open until this has been resolved to my satisfaction. Banks and credit unions in this country are corrupt and will play a major part in our eventual economic collapse. I will provide further information and documentation, should you require it.','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,4.0,'the fraudulent transactions total over $1000.00. the new perpetrator also had my PIN.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5667,'07/09/2015','Bank account or service','Checking account','Problems caused by my funds being low','When I opened my checking account with Bank of America [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years ago, I deliberately declined to opt in for overdraft protection. My hulu payment through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accidentally overdrew my account [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] days before my direct deposit. It was my understanding that this should have been declined since I opted out of overdraft protection. A BAC customer service representative told me in writing that opting out of overdraft protection had no effect whatsoever on my account and I was penalized {$35.00} for the overdraft.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'my hulu payment accidentally overdrew my account. a BAC customer service representative told me that opting out of overdraft protection had no effect on my account');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5668,'07/09/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I have had repeated issues with my loan servicing company/escrow account. They have, on multiple occasions, paid, duplicate or incorrect amounts and even after requesting a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] speaking representative, I get people who do n''t understand me when I work for resolution. 
