Then I get another letter stating my mortgage payment was going up [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] plus dollars to include my escrow. I called the bank again and was told to protect their interest and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] they were going to do escrow. They called my insurance company and told them they would be doing the payments. I stated again that I never consented or signed any papers for any loan modification and my insurance and taxes were all paid up. They went ahead and requested payment from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that was already paid and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sent them {$260.00} which was paid a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] time. Then they contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] a company that is taking over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts and requested {$1000.00} wind insurance which is not due until the contract runs out with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] goes ahead before the due date requesting payment and Bank of America sends them a check of {$1000.00} on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015. Then they added all of this supposedly escrow which was not in place for the past [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years and are adding it to my mortgage payment. This will surely push me over the edge when I am trying to get caught up. They already threatened me with foreclosure and have been adding on late fees and inspection fees until I get caught up. 
In summary I never applied or signed for any loan modification. Ask them to prove this and they will be unable to unless they forge my signature. They started this escrow when everything was paid. They plan to do this with my taxes next which also is paid to date. The contract with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was not to start until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] when [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] expired and Bank of America sent [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] {$1000.00} in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from my supposedly escrow account which I never had in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years adding it to my mortgage payment when all was paid until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015. Bank of America has created a total mess of my account.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,2.0,'bank of America approved a loan modification for me. the loan modification stated the rate would be the same but they would stretch the loan out. the loan modification stated the rate would be');
