INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5740,'06/15/2015','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','My husband and I fell behind on our mortgage. We were given the wrong information by Chase and finally after six months we were told what we could do. That was XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and now three years later we finally were approved for a modification and our payments were suppose to start in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. We submitted our [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] set of documents and they were rejected, we submitted our [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] set and again rejected. So XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has come and gone and we submitted our [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] set and it was accepted but the problem is they were accepted on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. We are now two months behind on our modified mortgage! I asked Chase when will the payments start and I was told the date on the documents. Chase found something wrong with all of our documents! There was nothing wrong with them but they are dragging it out all over again! How can something designed to help you start out by drowning you? We are in the same boat we were in last time! So now we have to play catch up! That is not fair!','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'we were given the wrong information by Chase and finally after six months we were told what we could do. we submitted our [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] set of documents');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5741,'06/15/2015','Debt collection','Payday loan','Communication tactics','I received a phone call at my place of employment from a man stating he was pressing criminal charges on behalf of a payday loan that was not satisfied 3 years ago. I asked that he not contact me at my place of employment and asked for a number to call him back. I promptly called back to find out what the issue was. The man stated that I was a criminal that defrauded a payday loan company and that I was being charged. I stated that I have n''t received any sort of information regarding the debt and did n''t know what he was talking about. He went on the call me a ''piece of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '' who was criminally taking out loans and defrauding companies. He continued to yell and verbally abuse me and accuse me of criminal activities I did not commit. I immediately asked to speak to a supervisor.','Solidus Group LLC.',2.0,4.0,'a man called me a ''piece of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]'' who was taking out loans and defrauding companies. he continued');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5742,'06/15/2015','Credit card',NULL,'Credit determination','I have been working really hard over the last 2 to 3 years paying down my credit cards. I have made all my payments on time, I have paid extra and sometimes [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to pay off my credit card debt. I have not purchased any cars, used additional credit NOTHING .... Just paying down my debt. working hard. My credit card account had a balance of {$24000.00} I paid it down to {$17000.00}. I had it down to 71 %. Now they lowered my credit limit to {$17000.00} now I am at 97.3 %. My credit scored just plummeted for working hard!!!!!!!! ... My other account was at {$10000.00} and I paid it down to {$5800.00}. I had it to 58.8 % they just lowered my credit to {$6200.00} now I am at 94.9 %. Zapped my credit score just fell through the floor again. I could understand if I was not paying my bills. If I was running up credit cards, if I took out a bunch of loans. But I have not done any of these. I am a hard working, mother of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] who pulled through the tough times and trying to build up my credit because we all know, everything we want or need is built on Credit in this wonderful US of A. We live in a small house and was saving up to make a bigger home for my kids and CHASE just took everything away because someone is sitting there hitting buttons without anything else better to do. ITS NOT FAIR!!!!!! Obama had them add all those disclosures to the cards to help people learn about credit card debt and help them get out of debt. I could have filed bankruptcy a long time ago, just like the banks, instead I continued to pay all of bills and now have been paying extra and CHASE just [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] me and my whole family. I will pay off the rest of this debt no matter what, but I will find a way to remove everything I have from Chase. And I mean everything. I can not believe they rule mine and my childrens future when I have worked so hard. Read my credit report. No LATE PAYS 5 Years plus!!!!! No Cancellations!!!! No Bankruptcies!!!!!. More than Minimum always paid!!! And this is what I get. My Credit score has now dropped from a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] .... OVERNIGHT. NOT FAIR!!!!!!!!!!!!','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'a hard working mother of a hard working mother of a hard working mother of a hard working mother of a hard working mother. she has made all my payments on time');
