INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5750,'06/11/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit monitoring or identity protection','I have been a victim of multiple cases of identity theft within the last [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years. Most recently, i have been a victim of identity theft about [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] times in the last 3 months. I have purchased a protection program with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and have set up [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Alerts with all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] major credit reporting agencies. Even though I have fraud alerts set up, the credit reporting agencies are still authorizing the opening of accounts without my verification. I have had accounts opened in my name with all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reporting agencies. Each agency is failing to contact me to verify that I am opening these accounts. This issue has now negatively effected my credit score. I will be filing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] separate complaints for each of the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reporting agencies. This one is specifically for Experian.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'i have been victim of identity theft in the last 3 months. i have been a victim of identity theft about [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] times ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5751,'06/11/2015','Debt collection','Auto','Cont''d attempts collect debt not owed','I spoke to the original company with DEBT and they said that the TRADELINE HAS been DELETED for that supposed debt. According to the original debt company the TRADE LINE was already deleted and no one after that should be contacting me that I owe a debt. When none of the information on file for that debt collector for me was inaccurate. But according to DEBT RECOVERY SOLUTIONS IN NY, I still owe the money to the original debt company. I told them I found out about the debt bc I am getting ready to buy a home and the individual from that company told me " I WILL NOT BUY ANYTHING TILL I PAY THEM OFF FOR THIS DEBT '''', the individual that I called was harassing me bc I will not be able to buy the home am looking to buy bc of this debt. He also told me that he knows what happen bc I did not know the address he had on file for this debt, he was saying that I did all of this and that he already heard all the excuses so that whatever I said was not true at all. When I told him I was not even in the state during that time frame of the debt and not to mention the address they have on file I do not even know. I forwarded DEBT RECOVERY SOLUTIONS the letter from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the original debt company that the TRADELINE has been deleted.','Debt Recovery Solutions, LLC',2.0,2.0,'original debt company says the TRADELINE has been deleted. the original debt company said the TRADELINE was deleted. the original debt company said the TRADELINE was deleted.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5752,'06/11/2015','Debt collection','Medical','False statements or representation','I have been speaking with representatives over a course of a couple of years. Most recently, I decided to call and speak with someone about getting these accounts taken care of. There was a delay because there was some accounts that they had that needed to be retracted/deleted by the original creditor. I ended up speaking with someone that gave me a total of a certain dollar amount over {$700.00} to pay in order to settle the account for deletion. She gave me this option with either removing all interest or giving me a 25 % discount, which equated to almost the same total. She said this would both resolve the account and result in deletion from my credit report. Between that conversation and the one that I had today, I called and attempted to settle for less ( understanding there might not be a deletion ) and was told they could n''t accept only that. So I told them I would continue to get the rest of the total that was originally requested from me because I wanted the deletion. I finally got all of the money together and called back only to be told by someone else that paying this amount would not result in deletion, only showing account as paid. This does not make sense to me that a company is able to be so disorganized, that different reps are able to give different rules. Now I am being told that there ''s no way to get rid of all interest or there can be no deletion.','Collection Consultants of California',2.0,2.0,'a total of $700.00 was given to me to pay to settle the account for deletion. she gave me a 25% discount, which equated to almost the same total ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5753,'06/10/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','In early 2014, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sold my mortgage loan to Everhome Mortgage. I started calling Everhome in early [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and on a daily basis and could not get a response. Shortly after, I received a letter stating the foreclosure sale would be cancelled for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Then Everhome agreed to a modification trial payment plan. I started making my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2014 and continued to do so. When my payment for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was mailed in On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2014 my check was returned and I received a notice stating unless I was in an prior arrangement they could not accept the payment. I was already on a trial plan. My home was foreclosed in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The balance of my home was {$52000.00} dollrs and they sold it for {$68000.00}. My property was illegally foreclosed. Everhome told me that they sent the documents to my home. The only address I ever received my was at my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] . They were aware that my home was rental property and they explanation for foreclosing was because they [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the documents to the house.','TIAA, FSB',2.0,2.0,'in early 2014, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sold my mortgage loan to Everhome Mortgage. I started calling Everhome in early [COMPTE_ANON');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5754,'06/10/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','My husband and I have our mortgage thru Wells Fargo Bank and I use on line banking for everything. Unfortunately, like millions of Americans, we struggled with the poor economy, high medical bills and job loss and filed chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bankruptcy. During this process, we reached out to Wells regarding the mortgage payment and were given the opportunity to do a loan modification to reduce our monthly payment. We were very grateful for the help and completed the process. The mortgage is not behind or in any jeopardy, with the manageable payments. My complaint is simple. We are being denied the option to pay the monthly payment on line. When I pressed for an answer as to why, I was told it was the bank policy, the account is restricted because of bankruptcy, I would not be allowed that privilege. In addition, I am being denied the chance to vocalize my complaint with the upper administration of the organization. I feel this practice is discriminatory in nature. We pay the mortgage directly, as it was never looped into the bankruptcy. In essence, we are being punished by the bank for resorting to filing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Is there any recourse we can take?','WELLS FARGO & COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'a mortgage payment is not behind or in any jeopardy, with the manageable payments. the mortgage is not behind or in any jeopardy, with the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5755,'06/10/2015','Credit card',NULL,'Identity theft / Fraud / Embezzlement','On XX/XX/2015 I received an inquiry from TJ Maxx. This inquiry was unauthorized and I politely explained that to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different people in the credit services fraud department. I asked them to contact the credit bureaus where my credit was pulled and informed them that the inquiry was unauthorized and I was told that they could not do anything about anyone using my information. I was told by everyone I spoke to that no application was opened in my name and for me to call them myself and inform them that the inquiry was unauthorized. I have never spoke to such rude individuals in my life. I have a fraud alert on my credit report for a reason. This unauthorized inquiry has shot my credit score down [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] points. Someone needs to have this inquiry removed or I will be bringing legal action.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,4.0,'unauthorized inquiry shot credit score down points. unauthorized inquiry has shot credit score down points.');
