INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5757,'06/09/2015','Credit card',NULL,'Closing/Cancelling account','on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2015, I called citi to close my account ( paid off with zero balance ), and citi call agent ( Name : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], agent id : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) gave me a hard time refusing to close my accounts and after [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] mins of me begging him it was still not clear if my account was closed or not. 
on the same day, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2015, I had to fill a CFPB complaint hoping citi can respond and close my account. Case number : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2015, citi responded and claimed my account was closed. But I checked online and my citi online account showed " This account has been converted to a new number. " on the same day, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2015, I followed up on my CFPB complaint to dispute, hoping citi can take real actions to close my account with no further delay. Unfortunately citi did n''t respond. 
on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/2015, I received a letter through mail from citi celebrating my account has reached 1 year anniversary, stating " your account has been current for the past year. we are confirming that your citi AAdvantage gold world elite master card account has been in good standing for the past 12 months. during that time, you ''ve kept the account current under the terms of your card agreement we appreciate it. we are working hard to serve you, and we ''re always look for ways to do more. feel free to contact us if you have ". A scanned copy is attached [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
Seriously, citi? I have only [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] suggestion which you failed for weeks : CLOSE MY ACCOUNT! I would never ever have anything from citi, given this horrible experience. 

