ad consumer centered customer service in this situation. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] tried to give me a repair order but it was too late now what do I do I ca n''t afford to keep paying for this rental.','EXETER FINANCE CORP.',2.0,2.0,'a car from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] put $6000.00 down and in less than four months transmission went out they told me the car was still');
