" you just did not pay it. '''' I was already lied to about payment and now to me if it was for late payment fine but to be told just did not pay it I will not accept. Then since I paid up to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I thought I was up to date but I guess not. The called continued. I am a former [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I have a completely [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that prevents me from walking far at all otherwise I am in excruciating pain. I realized that I kept quitting my jobs because I could stand that long or my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] prevented me from working. I do not and can not afford insurance and the last time I applied with the state I was told I can not be receiving unemployment well since I work as a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is saying I lied and they over paid me for the week of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I have to pay that week back. My [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] medication is {$300.00} every [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] weeks. Now I a petrified that my apartment complex is going to find a way to evict me and I as of XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I have missed [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] work day as a temporary employee and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] days as a part time employee for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Capitol One repossessed my ford on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( and my regular payment is due [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of each month ) which is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] month and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] day of non payment. I can not walk anywhere with out pain or very far or my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] will kick in and I am stuck at the store. I do not like to call my friends to take me back and forth and do not have a Primary Care doctor to fill out a form for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for the XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Please help me.','CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'a person on the phone said that if you are [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] month behind they will call me. the person on the phone was very rude');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5870,'05/01/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','I months ago signed up for a service provided by experian for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars designed to help Victums of I ''d theft and uphold the law. We all know that service should be free. Regardless I have submitted affidavits and police reports along with proof from their own third party. Reporting system and IRS affidavits that this info is inaccurate and related to 10 years of Id theft. They have been impossible to deal with and I was told by experian people in that department that experian does not fall under the same law that the other [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] CRAs do and that any part of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of the FACRA holds no weight. I have sent deletion letters from those creditors and still they scoff. Please see attached files and their responses.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'experian has provided a service to victims of I ''d theft. affidavits and police reports are inaccurate and related to 10 years of Id theft');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5871,'05/01/2015','Credit card',NULL,'Delinquent account','I have received multiple calls from target red card services. I advised the rep if they would waive the late charge then I would pay off the full balance. The rep refused since I had been past due on my account. I discontinued call then on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 I spoke with a rep who refused to do the same. I said something off subject not offensive or rude or containing fowl language. He advised that we should conduct this phone call in a mature manner. I replied then hung up. i called back to ask for a manager and got [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] employee id [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. She refused to allow me a manager [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in total. This is after advising her of my concern and request to waive late charges. She declined the request also. I advised at that time they no longer had permission to contact me on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] since it is a cell phone and they use an autodialer. She refused to remove the number based on the fact that satisfactory arrangements had not been made and my refusal to provide her with another number. I do n''t have a non-cell phone number to provide her with since I ca n''t have calls at work. My spouse is about to be laid off ... this is undue stress over [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] dollars. She refused a supervisor stating that she was an account manager misrepresenting her position level. I advised the employee [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that is a title for a glorified CSR AND that I knew the law and fully intended to include all in a CFPB complaint. She advised that I would still get manual calls to my phone so I provided her with the number of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] since she continued to refuse to remove my number. I advised that it is a punishable fine or them to continue to call to which she continued to reply that no .. refusal to remove and so on. Please investigate this claim. This is ridiculous and these employees are misrepresenting themselves as managers and refusing manager or supervisor. In addition to refusal to remove my telephone number from their system which in fact a cell phone.','TD BANK US HOLDING COMPANY',2.0,2.0,'i have received multiple calls from target red card services. the rep refused because I had been past due on my account. he said something off subject not offensive or rude or ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5872,'05/01/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I am disturbed, this is very appalling, something that never went through the system, and that you continue to list the Current Disposition Dismissed/Closed CHXXXX as confirmed within my credit file.This is very damaging to my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] grandkids, my family, and is very detrimental. Although it is your policy to keep reporting bankruptcies that are filed, dismissed or adjudicated for ten years, the Fair credit Reporting Act mentions nothing in Section 1681c relating to bankruptcy about dismissals or filings. The law clearly states from " date of adjudication '''' or date of " order of relief ''''. The other [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] agencies have already deleted this data when 7 years was done. I suffered enough because I never finished this proceeding out filing chapter [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Also there is no signatures. 

Any case, civil or otherwise, which is dismissed no longer exists in the eye of the law and a case filed may never have actually been adjudicated. Therefore, you have no right to maintain information which the government has deemed nonexistent. 

Therefore, pursuant to Section 1681 ( a ) ( 5 ) of the FCRA, you must delete this information from my credit report and send me an updated copy when this action is completed. 

Considering that this does not require an investigation, I would appreciate your response within 14 calendar days from receipt of this letter.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the Fair credit reporting Act mentions nothing in Section 1681c relating to bankruptcy. the law clearly states from " date of adjudication '''' or date of " order');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5873,'04/30/2015','Bank account or service','Checking account','Using a debit or ATM card','I have been with M & T bank for a while and have had issues with my money being played withThe feds frauded meI have n''t received my policies and I ''m just to the point idk know what to doMy debit card is offMy name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','M&T BANK CORPORATION',2.0,4.0,'i have been with the feds and have had issues with my money being played with the feds. my debit card is offMy name is [COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5874,'04/30/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] funding is currently reporting an old [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] collection account 120 days late as of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2015 on my credit report. I have never made a payment on this account with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] therefore i can not have a payment history nor did I sign a contract with the original creditor. I called midland to dispute this information and I was told they do not report as late on credit report. I disputed the inaccurate information with Equifax and equifax said that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] validated the information. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and equifax refuse to move the 120 day late on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] 2015. I have been back and forth with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Equifax and neither are helping. It is my understanding that collection agencies are not allowed to report monthly late payment history therefore I would like this deleted from my credit report because it is inaccurate. I would like [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Equifax to provide me with all documents relating to this account, all payment history, original contract and NOT use the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] verification process as it is not detailed. I am attaching files showing that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] did indeed report the lateness andit is not accurate. This has been causing me numerous problems and I would just like to get it settled','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] collection account is reporting an old account 120 days late. i have never made a payment on this account with [COMPTE');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5875,'04/30/2015','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Settlement process and costs','XX/XX/2014 I was approved for a FHA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] modification and a KEEP YOUR HOME CALIFORNIA REISTATEMENT GRANT. I was sent a copy of the approval, monthly payments that I would be making, interest of 43/4 and was waiting to receive the loan docs. On XX/XX/2014 I had already made two trial payments and was informed by the loan servicer that my loan docs were sent to me by mail, I also received a phone message that my KYHC file was being closed because my loan servicer had opted out of giving me a loan modification because I had not provided them a document that had been requested and I no longer had a loan modification. I contacted my loan servicer and was assured that I no document was missing and my loan modification was secure and that KYHC had opted out and would not be offering any financial assistance to reinstate my loan. I tried to explain to KYHC that I did have a loan modification but KYHC refused to contact my loan servicer and sent me an email that when I start making more money I could reapply for assistance. This information was false, once my loan modification docs are signed KYHC will not offer a home owner assistance. I recently filed a complaint against KEEP YOUR HOME CALIFORNIA with the California [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and again I questioned my loan servicer who still maintains that they did not opt out of accepting financial assistance.. KEEP YOUR HOME CALIFORNIA addressed my claim but the story has changed slightly. They maintain that an opt-out document was received from my sevicer and that an opt out can be decided for no reason or any reason. I want to also state in my claim that my loan servicer treated me just as bad. A {$35000.00} balloon payment was never stated or was addressed when I received the preliminary approval for the FHA HAMP loan .I wanted the fees explained and asked why this was never mentioned. My loan servicer refuse to discuss the balloon payment or itemize the amount I was being charged. A debt counsler that I had been assigned to called my loan servicer and a three way conversation was held. The request again was made to itemize the {$35000.00} and the servicer agreed. I was then told that the late payments added up to {$22000.00} which I already knew and that the rest were fees. I got nothing. I than received a letter from my loan servicer that due to my inquiry an adjusted fee was discovered and now my balloon would be {$37000.00}. New loan docs were mailed to be signed and notarized again. Also, soon after my first mortgage payment I was informed that my new payment would now be {$79.00} more due to a rise in taxes. My loan servicer decided the value of my home would jump from {$140000.00} to {$190000.00} and was well aware that my taxes had been hiked. So you see I have been treated very bad and both of these agency are pointing the finger at each other.','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/2014 was approved for a FHA modification and a KEEP YOUR HOME CALIFORNIA REISTATEMENT GRANT. my loan service');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5876,'04/30/2015','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Taking/threatening an illegal action','According to my credit report, there is a collection item showing that does n''t make any sense. Not only does it have my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] delinquency in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but it also has my account being opened in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On top of that, the last time I was delinquent on any account was in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The name of the company showing the collection is Asset Acceptance Corporation. I have requested them to validate the debt to no avail. I am sure they purchased and ancient collection item and put it on my credit report as if it were still within the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
As I have stated, I have not been delinquent on any account since [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and did NOT open any accounts until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. There should be no retail credit account on my credit report opened in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. My wife added me on as an authorized user on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of her accounts that were open in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I have student loans opened in those years. I have requested validation of this debt numerous times and I ca n''t seem to get them to explain to me how they claim how I went delinquent on an account in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that was OPEN in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. On top of that, I am 100 % sure I NEVER opened any type of retail credit account in the above mentioned years. 
I want Asset Acceptance Corp. to acknowledge that this account on my credit report is re-aged, has become a zombie debt, and needs to be removed immediately. I have no plans on seeking legal action against them at this time, I would just like this resolved. 
Please pull my credit report and verify the information that I am telling you ... there is no other collection item or closed account that correlates with this collection item. Thank you so much for taking my complaint ... not a day goes by when I do n''t thank [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and all that she has done for the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] people. This agency is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] more thing to add to her legacy.','ENCORE CAPITAL GROUP INC.',2.0,2.0,'a collection item shows that my account is re-aged, has become a zombie debt. the last time I was delinquent on any account was in [COMP');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5877,'04/29/2015','Credit card',NULL,'Customer service / Customer relations','Payed off the balance due in full on a Walmart credit card by electronic transfer of funds from our checking bank account. Walmart took the payment and credited the credit card account for the amount but will not make the line of credit available again. They have said it is their policy in the event of large payments ( which this one was ) to wait to make the credit available again until there is no chance we will cancel our electronic transfer of funds from our checking account.','SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL',2.0,2.0,'the balance due in full on a Walmart credit card by electronic transfer of funds from our checking bank account. Walmart took the payment and credited the credit card account for the amount.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5878,'04/29/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','To whom it may concern : I am writing because there are some errors on my credit report and they belong to my sister and my mother. My name is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and I am continually linked to my mother, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and my sister [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I can not change my address because whenever I have my mother and sister ''s mail is redirected as well. I have realized that this is due to errors on my report. I have never lived in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], MA. My sister, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has. I have also never had a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit card, this account belongs to my sister, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and I need it to be removed from my financial record. We are [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different people, with similar names and addresses, until recently, but we do not share a social security number. I need my account separated from my mothers and sister ''s as I plan on moving and purchasing a home. My sister had been dealing with the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] crediting companies for many years, trying to separate her financial record from my mothers, but I do not understand how this could be hurting me as well, since I do not share the same first name with my mother or sister. The [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] crediting agencies have made these errors on my report and have not corrected them, thus I thought to report it once again before seeking legal action. I have attached copies of our [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different passports, in the hopes of showing [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] different individuals, whom happen to be related, not the same person.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'my sister, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has. my sister, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONY');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5879,'04/29/2015','Debt collection','Medical','Communication tactics','I ''ve been working with American Medical Collections company to facilitate the resolution of some laboratory charges. In this I have asked on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] separate occassions to be called after [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] pacific time during which I ''ve worked with them on several tactics to resolve this. They continue to call me during working hours despite this communication and have been push [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 
The billing problem originally occured because the lab I was scene at did n''t validate my address or my insurance info. I went to collections without ever receiving a bill or phone call. Once in collections, I requested the original biller ''s address and my account number and sent a photocopy of my insurance card so they could bill the correct insurance. 
AMC left me alone for several months while we waited for this to resolve the issue. Apparently my letter was ignored because I received more calls recently ( again, during my working hours despite the notes I asked put on my account ). 
The last polite call I received said they would mail me a form so I could forward it to the insurance company myself. After [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] I have not received the form and got more pushy calls.','Retrieval-Masters Creditors Bureau, Inc.',4.0,4.0,'aMC left me alone for several months while we waited for this to resolve the issue. the last polite call I received said they would mail me a form so I could');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5880,'04/29/2015','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Disclosure verification of debt','I am being harassed by a collections agency, who according to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] complaints and others that have been shared publically, are very good at scamming additional fees from people who can not afford it. They have very clearly avoided contact with me, and have refused to provide me with an itemized account of the fees they are charging me, even after I agreed to pay. Now, despite the fact that I agreed to pay on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they are unwilling to accept my money and have filed in court for additional fees that have more than doubled the original amount. They have provided false names, they have refused to let me speak to anyone above them, claiming that they ( multiple people using the same name ) are [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the supposed owner of the company. According to the state website, the owner is a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], not [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

Here is my story, and I hope that someone can help to force them to act ethically and honestly. I am a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] veteran, as is my husband, and we are trying to raise our [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] children on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] income. We can not afford to be scammed out of our money. 

I received a call in late [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) regarding an account I had not been using at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I was told the amount I owed, which seemed excessive. I agreed to pay the amount less any charges beyond an overdraft fee. The young man stated he would call me back after he spoke to his manager regarding the fees. 

He called my husband ''s phone in early [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), who, due to a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], told the man to contact me. It was n''t until [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the I received a call stating that I had to appear in court on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015. I explained that I could not appear, but that I had previously agreed to pay the amount. He advised me he was no longer willing to settle and that I had to appear in court. I asked to speak to his manager, at which time he told me that he, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], was the manager. I did n''t believe him due to his demeanor, and stated that I would then like to speak to the owner. He then told me that he, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], was the owner. 

After stating several more times that I was willing to pay the amount, he told me the amount was now more, including additional fees and attorney ''s fees. I asked him the amount so that I could pay it, but he could n''t provide it. Instead he told me he was no longer " willing to settle ''''. I told him it was unfair because a ) I had already agreed to settle the first time I was contacted but never received a call back ; and b ) because I had never received an itemized account despite several requests. He became very angry and hung up on me. 

I tried calling back the same day and left a message with a young man that stated I had to speak to " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ''''. I told him that I was fully aware that no such person existed and the young man became flustered and stated he would have the owner call me back. I received no return call. My husband then tried on Monday, the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and was told 3 separate times that " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' was unavailable. I called again on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and finally the mysterious " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' answered the phone. I asked, again for the itemized list and was told that it was filed with the paperwork at the courthouse. I asked him if he was n''t supposed to legally provide me with any documents that were filed in court, and he explained that because it was an initial meeting, he did not, that it was only required prior to a hearing. I then asked him several more times, and he repeatedly told me I could access the documents at the courthouse. I finally stated " so you ''re refusing to provide me a copy? '''' and he finally agreed to mail me out a copy. 

I have researched this company, and I fear that they are master scam artists. They purposely did not call me back, and and instead, filed at court so that they could receive additional fees, despite the fact that I told them I was more than happy to pay what I owed. Even now, they are refusing to accept my money.','Alternative Revenue Systems, Inc',2.0,2.0,'a collection agency has refused to accept my money, claiming they are the supposed owner of the company. they have provided false names, refused to let me speak to anyone above them ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5881,'04/28/2015','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','Hi, This is going to be difficult to explain so bear with me. Last year my brother became terminally ill. In an effort to try and find the moneys to go see my brother before he passed away I reached out to my mortgage company to see if I had any hardship plans to help me with the expense. I called them Nationstar Mortgage and told them the situation and wanted to know if I could miss [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment to make the flight. The lady on the phone said yes they could waive [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] month ''s payment and I could pay it up by paying {$1000.00} amount for the next 5 month to catch it up, my normal mortgage is {$830.00}. I also asked her if that would impact my credit and she assured me that it would not and she would also set up my account so that I would not receive the automated phone calls about a missed payment. So for the first 2 months it was working well, no phone calls and I was paying {$1000.00} per month as opposed to my {$830.00}. Then all of the sudden I start getting automated calls. Then I got an alert on my credit reporting agency. So when I looked it up the mortgage company came up as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] month missed payment. I called Nationstar and asked them what they were doing and had to explain to them what the arrangement was. At first they had not record of that agreement. I asked for a Manager, and he was finally able to find the record of the agreement. He then informed me that the agreement I was told could happen was not allowed and she was not supposed to do that ''''. So I told him ok but then what happened to the overages I paid towards my mortgage and how could they be showing me one month behind since I was not. Where did that money go? I told him based on the money I paid over the amount owed I should only owe you a couple of hundred not a fully month premium. He asked me to fax him my I was checking account statement that shows how much I have paid above the mortgage rate. So I have faxed it never heard back from them. As of today I have fax it and called them repeatedly and have yet to get anyone to investigate and fix this. 
On my last call which was last week I again re-iterated the story and told them the name of the last manager I spoke to and I gave her his name. In that conversation the lady said that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was not a manager and she would report him for saying he was. Now I faxed the form again and she said they would get back to me in two days that was last week. How can a mortgage company be allowed to operate so unethically? What do I have to do to get this fixed? I have never missed a payment before since I purchase this house and this nightmare is never ending I need help can someone out there please help me. Please is there anything I can do to get this resolved they are ruining my credit and keeping in loss of my bother ever a nightmare that never ends. This company has no business operating as a mortgage company. They bought out my mortgage from the original mortgage company and when I look them up they are a collection agency. How can this be clearly they have no business buying out mortgages and operating as a mortgage company.','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',2.0,2.0,'my brother became terminally ill last year. he was unable to pay for the mortgage and was unable to pay for it. he was told he was not');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5882,'04/28/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','Dear CFPB, I am trying to resolve a debt collection dispute with this agency, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] which is a utitlity company in NYS. For years I have dealt with the unconscionable collection practices of this agency who has not considered that I am a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] person and has put my life in serious jeopardy. I filed a complaint with my BBB and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] responded. They have not vaildated that the debt is owed by I, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They have not brought forth the contract expressed or implied written or oral that a debt is due and owing by me. 
Dear CFPB, I continue to be harrased and contacted by a debt collector to paid a debt that is not mine. I live on a fixed income and they continue to use unconscienable means to collect. 
Dear CFPB, there is a item that appears on my credit reports as a charge off/ bad debt. It is a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Credit [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] debt. It is being reported as settled. This company has not provided for me validation of the debt and the CRA ''s have continued to report this information on my credit file without the furnisher of the information validating it ''s authenticity that I, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] owes any debt.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a debt collector has not vaildated that a debt is due and owing by me. the utitlity company has not provided for me validation of the debt');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5883,'04/28/2015','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','My wife and I have a mortgage with Chase. They have forced placed flood ins. on our property and we can not get anyone on the phone that even knows what a flood map is.Please reply asap the bare charging us 6000 dollars a year and we are not in a flood zone.','JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.',2.0,2.0,'my wife and I have a mortgage with Chase. they have placed flood ins on our property.');
