INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5885,'04/27/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] account # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] The late dates are an inaccurate representation of my billing history with this company. They did not deliver my furniture as specified. I have a long history going back and forth ; it took them more than 90 days to complete delivery of the goods purchased. During which time they were accuring billing and late fees. However, until they delivered my furniture as agreed, they should have begun billing me. I began paying them when I recieved my furniture order in full.They are claiming I ''m late and reporting dates are inaccurately. I paid them in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but they also began billing me before delivering my products undamaged.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the late dates are inaccurate representation of my billing history with this company. they did not deliver my furniture as specified. they were accuring billing and late fees.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5886,'04/27/2015','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','I came into a non-profit office to get help with a Loan Modification for our home. In the process of calling the lender and talking to the housing counselor, what we found out was my was sold in XX/XX/2010. I have no records of a foreclosure notice being mailed or an auction or sale of my home, yet now I am facing leaving a home that I am not sure I own. All the information that my counselor and I have received from the lender says I do not own the home and the lender shows our loan number not existing in their records. 
The lender did give us an attorney that has the files to be able to tell me that I still own my home. We called that number in my counselors office and it was disconnected. 
I am desperate to know if I can continue in my home or do myself, my wife who can not do anything for herself and our [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] children, do we have to move. 
Records at the county where we live and on the property taxes, show the home owned by someone other than my wife. Yet we have lived in the home since XX/XX/2010 when the records showing it was sold.','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'the lender gave me an attorney to tell me that I still own my home. the lender gave me an attorney that has the files to tell me that I still own my home. the');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5887,'04/27/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','Ocwen Home Mortgage has been assuring customers that they are paying out their escrow to their Home Owners Insurance Companies, but are not doing so. I have had multiple contacts with the company, to which they do not update that I have called stressing the importance of this being paid. 

In contact with my Home Owners Insurance Company ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ), they have told me that Ocwen is notorious for not paying their homeowners escrow. I believe they are doing this for financial gain. Since HomeOwners Insurance is a contingency on a loan, Ocwen does n''t pay a 3rd party, because if I lose my insurance ( which I did temporarily due to their negligence ), I automatically get enrolled on Ocwen ''s very expensive Home Owners Policy. 

I was forced to pay out of pocket for my Insurance, even though my money is in the escrow account. Now I want my money back from Ocwen, and they are pretending that they have no knowledge of my request every time I call. 

They are able to keep my money and not pay me back, but if I keep my money and do n''t pay them the due mortgage until they refund me, then I lose my house. This is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] banking at it ''s finest.','OCWEN LOAN SERVICING LLC',2.0,2.0,'Ocwen Home Mortgage has been assuring customers that they are paying out their escrow to their Homeowners Insurance Companies. they have told me that they are doing this');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5888,'04/26/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Settlement process and costs','We are working with a Mortgage Broker, Horizon Lending Services LLC NMLs # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], that has changed the terms of our loan the business day before we were to close. I will attach later the email chain in which we are told that we are locked as well as the GFE that shows an increase in the points they want us to pay. Because this is so last minute, we stand to lose a deposit of {$21000.00}. I asked several times for a GFE, and now realize the reason she sent the information in a different format was just so she could change it at the last minute and expect us to pay.','Horizon Lending services, LLC',2.0,2.0,'we are working with a mortgage broker, Horizon Lending Services LLC. they have changed the terms of our loan the business day before we were to close. we stand to lose ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5889,'04/26/2015','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I called bayview to ask why they were charging me late fees on my mortgage, when I send my payments two weeks ahead of time.I can send my payments on the first of the month and by the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. off the month and they will tell me they have not recieve my payment and will charge me a late fee, I have until the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of each month before my payments are late.When I called bayview loan servicing on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015 an ask when will they send my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] to file my taxes, they said that it will be mailing them out on a saturday [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I waited until the end of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I still did not recieve a form. I called bayview back and they said oh we sent them out and if it do n''t come go online an get a copy on their web site. I went on their web site an could not find it When I called them back and asked about my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they did''nt want to talk about the form an kept asking me why they have''nt recieve my payment. I called back in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and asked them to send out a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] again, an all they wantrd to talk about was my payments being late. All along its seem like l am getting the run around, I ''m still waiting for [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','BAYVIEW LOAN SERVICING, LLC',2.0,2.0,'bayview loan servicing asked me when they sent me my payments. they will tell me they have not recieve my payment and will charge me a late fee. they will');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5890,'04/25/2015','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Can''t repay my loan','I went to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. When I was registering I was told I had to pull out a Genesis Loan or I could not attend school. At the time I was more focused on the prospect of having a career to help provide for my son at the time. I graduated XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and I managed to get hired at the place that I externed at. Well, I was there for about a year and then me and my husband decided to move back down to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Well, we have been down in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for almost 2 months and I have n''t had any luck finding a job. My husband just started his this past Monday. I ''m two months behind on my Genesis loan and this is the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] time I have ever been late on it. I was evening paying on time when I was going to school. My monthly payment is {$65.00} a month. So far I ''ve missed XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payments so I owe $ 130 month payments but the late fees are outrageous. I owe {$100.00} in late fees as of today XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. That ''s {$230.00} that I owe as of today. I wont be able to make a payment until my husbands second check which wont be until XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. And my next payment will be due on the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] so that ''s another {$65.00} for monthly and then whatever late charges I owe by then. I ''m afraid that its going to be well over {$300.00} by the time I can pay and I wont be able to pay the full amount because its gotten so large. I have [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] sons ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] mths and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] yrs ) and I have things that I have to buy for them and I have other bills. I had to defer my federal loan because I could n''t afford to pay on it at the moment. So any help or information would be greatly appreciated. I know that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] colleges are getting sue and I do n''t really have an idea of what that can do for me and my family. So and info would be great. Thank you.','Genesis Lending',4.0,4.0,'i owe $ 130 month payments but the late fees are outrageous. i owe $230.00 that I owe as of today XX');
