fund my current overage Immediately.My taxes and Hazard Insurance = {$2400.00} + [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] = {$3500.00} /12 mos = $ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] month. I am paying {$500.00} /month for no apparent reason. Can you please help? 
thanks, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','Cornerstone Home Lending Inc.',2.0,2.0,'Cornerstone Home Lending is the servicer of my home loan. I made my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment on my new construction home. Cornerstone');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5911,'04/18/2015','Debt collection','Auto','Improper contact or sharing of info','On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015, I received a call from an [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] number on my cell phone and since I was at work, the call went to my voice mail. My announcement on my voice mail, starts by identifying myself by first and last name. This call came in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. At [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I received a call from my father, saying [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] had contacted him stating they have been trying to contact me and they think I must of changed my phone number and address, then asked how to contact my daughter-in-law, who I had given them permission to call and discuss any payment problems with ( the loan is in my name and my son and daughter in law make the payment since they drive the auto ). My dad, being [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] years old, panicked and called me thinking something was wrong. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] minutes later at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I received a call from the son on my deceased girlfriend, saying he had received a similar phone call, but they only stated they have lost contact with me and wanted to know how to reach me. I have had the same phone number for about 17 years, and the same address since I purchased the auto where I receive my monthly statements and all other correspondence from them at.','TCF NATIONAL BANK',2.0,2.0,'a call from my father came in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on my cell phone. the call came in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ');
