INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5924,'04/13/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','This is really getting to be a problem. The dates are listed very clear and the police report was given along with other corroborating evidence to this bureau via fax. There are not even taking the time to investigate only reporting inaccuracies. I have been taking several hours of my day to call these banks ect. only to hear that they have not gotten some type of questionnaire that comes from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] usually. Even, there how can an account be verified by a questionnaire. This was verbatim from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] legal team. Thus far upon me calling directly to these creditors I get results even before Equifax alleged attempt to reach out and verify its accuracies. Someone is lying and it has to be EQUIFAX because the proof is in black and white. I am attaching [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) letters with regard to these inquiries while I await the others. So far [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] apologize and would like to delete but they are still waiting for Equifax to send them something and so is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. They have NOTHING except my complaint. Now attached are [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] letters that were sent via email and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Mail stating that inquiries will be removed and they are dated before the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit file sent from Equifax saying they verified the information. These people should really stop hurting a persons chance to obtain credibility when they are not even viable themselves. It ''s almost like they never even bothered. They just state that I need to contact the creditor directly and do their job, which I am forced to do anyway to receive any type of vindication. I see why they are number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] in the news for bad reporting yet they claim they will do their best to help. When this only proves they are doing NOTHING. Says so the creditors as well, because not all people are trained to know the answers so they rely on the help of the bureau to assist the consumer. I am a witness to this first hand now. Please do something about this as I do not have the time and money to keep wasting fighting these people to do what is right. I am a new mother just getting back into the work field and just ca n''t give all my time to Equifax for them to get paid for bad reporting. It should not be on the consumer to do their job. Thank you.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'a police report was given along with other corroborating evidence to this bureau via fax. the bank has not gotten some type of questionnaire that comes from [COMPTE');
