INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5929,'04/11/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Credit reporting company''s investigation','I sent a letter to TransUnion in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and received a response today in the mail that they will not be updating my credit report to more accurately represent my profile. The issue arises from the reporting of a " photo '''' radar traffic ticket that I was never made aware of. Upon first seeing this on my credit report, I contacted the City of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] regarding this ticket and promptly paid it in full even though I disputed the validity of the ticket, never being sent a notice, or being able to defend it in court. 
The City of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has sent me notices that they have sent a " Clear Record '''' to TransUnion as well. I even have a copy of this " Clear Record '''' that I have forwarded to TransUnion myself. 

Also, TransUnion made agreements with the Attorney General of New York ( though the agreement stipulated nationwide ) about just this type of debt. TransUnion ( and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) agreed that " consumer debt that did not arise from a contract '''' will no longer be reported. Specific examples mentioned in the agreement were medical debt and traffic related debt. 

Bottom line, this account being listed is in no way an accurate representation of my credit worthiness. Continuing to report this is causing me unnecessary harm. I am only asking that this " Paid '''' debt be removed from my TransUnion credit report. 

I am including a copy of the " text '''' portion of the letter that I sent to TransUnion in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. 

-- -- -- -- -- -- TransUnion [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], PA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] TransUnion, This letter is a formal complaint that you are reporting information that you should no longer be. 

I have no doubt that you have a desire to correct and ensure that my credit report shows only accurate information that is also PERTINENT to my credit history. 

The City of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has acknowledged the issues that I have brought up previously, and despite also having sent to me a CLEAR RECORD that I have also already sent to you this debt remains listed. 

Additionally, and for purpose of this follow-up, I write due to a recent settlement that TransUnion entered into with the Attorney General of New York. I demand immediate removal of this " consumer debt that did not arise from a contract '''' be removed from my credit report. My specific issue of receiving a traffic ticket is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] specifically mentioned as applying in my case of having no justifiable reason of appearing on my credit report. My claim also has to do with this ticket being of a " photo '''' variety, meaning I never actually RECEIVED a ticket. Based on the settlement that TransUnion entered into, I can speculate that the Attorney General and TransUnion agree with me on the need to have this removed. 

My overall claims of this being valid in the first place also have merit. Either way, I ask for this to be permanently deleted from my report. 

[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] / City of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] - [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] # : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], please send me an updated copy of my credit report that reflects this change. 
-- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- Thanks for your help!','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,2.0,'the issue arises from the reporting of a " photo '''' radar traffic ticket. the city of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has sent me notices');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5930,'04/10/2015','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','this is the worst company to deal with. customer service is awful. i ca n''t get ahold of anyone. the website is so incredibly bad that you ca n''t pay a bill. so the only way to make sure you pay on time is to pay by phone for a ridiculous pay-by-phone service charge. they are the bottom feeders of the mortgage world. this is my mortgage, and i '' the one paying back a quarter of a million dollars and i can not deal with the company i ''m giving my money to. i believe i should have some say in where my mortgage goes and who is handling it. Based on EVERY review i can online says this company is evil. someone should take a look.','LoanCare, LLC',2.0,2.0,'customer service is awful. i can''t get ahold of anyone. the website is so incredibly bad that you can''t pay a bill.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5931,'04/10/2015','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Account opening, closing, or management','My brother and I rolled his change so it could be deposited into his savings account. We went to the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], MI branch to deposit the money. As soon as the tellers saw the rolled coins the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of them began arguing about which one had to wait on us because they did n''t want nor need the change. It was not only frustrating, but also highly embarassing. My family was so embarrassed we are ready to empty [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] accounts from PNC bank and taking the money elsewhere!','PNC Bank N.A.',2.0,2.0,'brother and I rolled his change so it could be deposited into his savings account. the change was a frustrating, but embarassing experience.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5932,'04/10/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I have a debt collection for an account that I am not responsible for. It appeared on my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Experian credit file last year. I disputed, and the debt collection was removed from both. The same debt was sold to another company in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and was placed back on my credit file with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The name of the company was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and collection. I disputed this again and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] removed the collection on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15. Today experian reported the exact same debt but now with a different company. The account reads as followed : Company : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Account # : N/ABalance Amount : XXXXStatus : The original debt is from [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The debt has been disputed and every time it has been removed due to the debt not being true. I have disputed this debt a total of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] time with different debt collectors that buy the collection. I was never notified by the debt collection agency but rather found out by checking my credit. Can we please address this collection as it is becoming a nuisance everytime its sold to another debt collection agency.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'debt collection appeared on my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and Experian credit file. the same debt was sold to another company in [COMPTE_AN');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5933,'04/09/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I can not get in touch with a human to express my problem. Out of frustration I am filing a complaint about the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] credit reporting agencies. I have several creditors showing up as bad debt and they have been closed for over 7 years. This situation is really messing me up at repairing my credit.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,2.0,'a complaint is filed about the credit reporting agencies. several creditors have been closed for over 7 years.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5934,'04/09/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','Can you help me or tell me who I can contact for help? My husband andI are 3 months behind in our mortgage payments to OCWEN. Wecontacted them for a loan modification. Yesterday we received a trialperiod modification that expires in 8 days. We were told what our newpayments would be, which are only {$40.00} less than our current paymentsare but they did not give us any other information about the terms of themodification. We were supposed to approve these new terms blindly in8 days ( by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ) without any idea of what the new terms would be. 
Are they supposed to give us the written terms with the trial paymentletter? Because they did n''t. 
My husband called OCWEN yesterday evening and asked about theterms of the modification. OCWEN said that we would have the sameinterest rate but they were going to add another 13 years to our loan tomake it a 40 year loan. The new payment would be {$1300.00}. For a {$40.00} reduction in monthly payment, we would have to pay an extra 13years of mortgage payments at {$1300.00} per month, or {$15000.00} peryear, totaling {$200000.00} in extra payments to reduce our mortgagepayment {$40.00} per month! Our outstanding loan is only {$140000.00}. 
Is this legal? Can they really consider that to be assistance? They''renot helping us, they are helping themselves. I think they want toforeclose on our house because we have equity. They are telling usthis is our only option. When we asked about the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] insettlement funds, we got the run around. We were told that we weren''tflagged for that money and that money was used for people who hadalready been foreclosed upon. I told her that was untrue, that only aportion of that went to people who were foreclosed already and that therest was earmarked for current customers underwater and/or havingdifficulties. She continued to give me the run around and was n''t beinghelpful at all. When I finally asked for a supervisor, she put me on holdfor so long that I finally hung up. She never called back. I ''m sure sheleft me on hold to intentionally avoid discussing the settlement fundswith me. 
Is there anybody who can help us? 
Thank you','OCWEN LOAN SERVICING LLC',2.0,2.0,'a trialperiod modification expires in 8 days. the new payment would be $40.00 less than our current payments. the modification would be a');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5935,'04/09/2015','Bank account or service','Other bank product/service','Making/receiving payments, sending money','A check for an amount greater than {$4000.00}, dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 was endorsed, presented, and accepted by a bank for deposit on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15. I do not believe this to be proper procedure for a check to be accepted before the date written on the check. What can be done to ensure that this does not occur in the future?','KEYCORP',2.0,2.0,'check for an amount greater than $4000.00 was dated [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/15 ');
