INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5941,'04/07/2015','Debt collection','I do not know','Taking/threatening an illegal action','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], SC [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/XXXXNational Credit AdjustersXXXX [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], KANSAS XXXXRE : Letter of Intent to SueTo Whom It May Concern : This letter serves as the formal notice of my intent to file a lawsuit against National Credit Adjusters for {$12000.00} as a result of violations of FDCPA 813. Civil liability [ 15 USC 1692k ], FCRA [ Title 15 United States Code Section 1681 ], TCPA [ 47 U.S.C. 227 ]. 
I was contacted by your company which called my cell phone on an auto dialer at which time I was made aware of an account fraudulently opened with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. At that time I informed said collector the account was not mine and requested validation I also informed said collector to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] & [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the account until full validation was provided. Yet to my dismay the calls continued and no mail correspondence has ever been received. I had filed an initial complaint with your company at which time I was advised that the account would be closed and I would be mailed a letter that the account was satisfied. Now several months later I have requested that letter and it has never been provided. Now I have checked my credit and this account is listed on there as a collection/chargeoff account which has had an adverse effect on my credit and my ability to obtain credit. Your failure to update the credit bureaus and original creditor have caused me financial harm i.e. increased APR percentages on my loans/credit cards as well as being out right denied for lines of credit. Constituting actual damages. 
If you wish to resolve this matter without court action, a check or money order for {$5000.00} must be received by myself at the address listed above in addition to removing the account from all [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] major credit bureaus within 14 days. If I do not hear from your company, I will initiate a lawsuit. I believe that is a fair and reasonable settlement considering a previous lawsuit I filed the business incurred legal fees in excess of {$5000.00} prior to agreeing to settlement. I can be reached by email at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] : [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of Suit Other Statutes - Other Statutory ActionsCause [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Fair Debt Collection ActCase # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] XXXXYour prompt attention is appreciated, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','National Credit Adjusters, LLC',2.0,4.0,'a letter of intent to sue national credit adjusters for $12000.00. the letter serves as the formal notice of my intent to file a lawsuit.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5942,'04/07/2015','Mortgage','Other mortgage','Loan modification,collection,foreclosure','Nationstar was negotiating a HAFA short sale with us. We received a full price offer and were waiting on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] tasks to complete as well as their investor approval. Nationstar failed to request the trustee sale postponement and it went to foreclosure without our knowledge last month. We are STILL processing a short sale with them even today! Agents will lose their commission after working for 4 months on this file, sellers lose relocation funds, buyers lose their new home! This should have NEVER gone to foreclosure!','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',2.0,2.0,'Nationstar failed to request the trustee sale postponement. it went to foreclosure without our knowledge last month. agents will lose their commission after working for 4 months on this file.');
