INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5970,'03/27/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I recently applied for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and received a denial letter and they used my credit report from Equifax. Reasons for denial, judgement, derogatory public record, no recent non mortgage balance information. All false information and none should appear on my credit report as I just received my current credit report from Equifax.','EQUIFAX, INC.',2.0,2.0,'i recently applied for a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and received a denial letter. they');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5971,'03/26/2015','Credit card',NULL,'Other','I sent the below letter to Bank of America for a resolution, which they denied. I believe their actions are unjust. 

I am writing you with a very heavy heart. I am extremely dishearten and dissatisfied with the level of insensitivity and lack of understanding and communications received from Bank of America ''s representatives regarding my closed account, now " charged off ''''. I am requesting the charge off be reversed due to miscommunications and technicality. In XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I spoke with a representative, who I notified that I was having hardship ( became unemployed ). She notified me that my account would be charged off on XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Being XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was on a Saturday ( weekend ). I paid the bill on Monday, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], which was paid the next business day, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I had no idea my account would be charged off on a weekend and neither was I explained this information in detailed. 

Additional information : I also was told that I had a cease and desist order on my account, which too was puzzling. I never requested a cease and desist and was never told such an order would be put on my account when requesting not to contacted via telephone. Today, XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], the represented mentioned that the cease and desist stopped all phone calls and correspondence, which I would have never agreed to. Requesting not to receive phone calls is totally different then not receiving mail. I never knew there was an issue until now, because I was still receiving my monthly statements. Therefore, I did n''t get any reminder notice for the upcoming charge off or notice of the actual charge off or any notice pertaining to this cease and desist order that I did not consent to. 

I have had several hardships during the course of this account from being unemployment several times, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], newborn ( a bundle of joy, nevertheless a financial adversity ), accepting a [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] " only '''' [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] position, which was insufficient, thus having to move in with my mother, then recently in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], becoming unemployed again. Through it all, I did the best I could. Now, that I have almost completed my payment in full, it is quite unfair and disappointing to receive a charge-off on my account for a difference of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] days, of which [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] were weekend days. Furthermore, I never receive any notification pertaining to this charge-off, due to the above mentioned unauthorized communications disconnect. I thought Bank of America was in the business of helping people and that Bank of America would much rather see me pay my bill and build up my credit vs. damage my credit with a derogatory " charge-off ''''. 

I am asking that you have compassion, thereby reversing the charge-off on the aforementioned account, in so doing allowing me to pay my outstanding balance in the amount of {$1200.00} without such a steep penalty. I really like Bank of America and hope to be a customer again, when my financial situation changes for the better. 

Thank you kindly for your consideration, time and immediate attention to this matter. Providing you require additional information, please feel free to contact me.','BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION',2.0,4.0,'a representative notified me that my account would be charged off on a weekend. he notified me that my account would be charged off on XX/XX/');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5972,'03/26/2015','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','I have received notice from my student lender, Navient, that they are not receiving my payments. My payments are however automatically made from my bank account for years to the previous company, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], and I have never had a problem. This issue began in the last month when my check was, for the first time, not cashed by Navient. I have tried contacting them through an online form and received no response. I tried calling them at the customer support number on their website, and the number goes into a never ending loop where an actual customer service agent never answers the phone. As I have never been late for a payment, have impeccable credit and now risk an implication on my record due to the company ''s own inability to manage its clients, I am filing a complaint in an effort to expedite a resolution. My automatic payment has gone to [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] again for my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment as per the regular monthly schedule, and I fear it will also not be collected. In the absence of a conversation with Navient I am however unable to resolve this issue and therefore require assistance.','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'my payments are automatically made from my bank account to the previous company. my check was not cashed by Navient. I have never had a problem with the company.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5973,'03/26/2015','Debt collection','Credit card','Communication tactics','Incessant phone calls are coming in to cellphone number [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from General Service Bureau ( GSB ) out of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Nebraska. Phone calls to a ''cellphone '' is a violation of the Telephone Consumer Protection Act ( " TCPA '''' ) 47 U.S.C. Section 227 ( a ) ( 1 ) based on the fact that under the TCPA it shall be unlawful for any person or entity to make any call ( other than an emergency ) or prior expressed ( written ) consent of the called party, using any automatic telephone dialing system or artificial or pre-recorded voice. Consumer has NOT given ( written or verbal ) permission for entity to call consumer. If after the agency is notified that consumer does not wish to receive calls and the agency continues to do so the agency can be sanctioned in the amount of {$500.00} dollars to {$1500.00} dollars per each violation there after. Consumer is making this report with your agency as consumer wishes all phone calls to ''CEASE '' immediately!!!!','General Service Bureau, Inc.',2.0,2.0,'phone calls to a ''cellphone'' are a violation of the Telephone Consumer Protection Act ( " TCPA '''' ) 47 U.S.C. Section 2');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5974,'03/26/2015','Debt collection','Other (i.e. phone, health club, etc.)','Improper contact or sharing of info','XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] purchased laptop from " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' on account. I lost my job and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. Who Knew ... When it rains it pours. It was a recession. I did not see it coming. I was unable to pay any bills including my mortgage and utilities. The account went into delinquency and later turned over to webbank to collect. XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] the account was sold to attorney " Buchan and Hosto '''' in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Arkansas. Thats when all hell began. I returned to work and of course after being unemployed for over a year, and working now for less money, I still am in hardship. " Buchan and Hosto '''' harrassed and threatened for over a year. They taxed and added on astronamical fees to the actual cost. They finally got a court order to garnish my salary. I forwarded a letter to the judge explaining my financial situation and hardship. I beg for mercy from the court. I explained the numerous medical bills I know have and the need to heal in order to work. My " little '''' salary was garnished. For 4 months 30 % of my salary was taken and given to " Buchan & Hosto ''''. A month after said amount was satisfied, my salary was AGAIN garnished from " Buchan & Hosto '''' for additional accumulated interest fees. 7 years from XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I am sure this account has been written off. " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' has received a credit from the government in taxes for debts annually. Where is the statue of limitations? Why do we as consumers must be punished over and over and over for the same purchase? We suffer the credit bureau as is. Then the attorneys go on a blood thirsty hunt to take your money. No matter what. If, I had not started to work and depended on the state or government to support me ; the govt would not pay any debts especially for a computer. I feel my medical bills are more important than a credit account. Double standards! The government has limits but the consumer " it ''s open game ''''. Garnishments from salary should not be a free for all debt collectors. I think the judge, never even read my letter or maybe they all work togeather. This is unfair. The consumer should have more protection. I only thank " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' I did not lose my home and was not put to the streets.','Hosto & Buchan, PLLC',2.0,2.0,'XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] purchased laptop from " [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] '''' on account ');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5975,'03/25/2015','Debt collection','Credit card','Communication tactics','I am extremely upset that a collection agency called my family members and employer after they had my correct contact information. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] from United Recovery Systems [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] ext [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] left a message on my cell and then proceed to contact my family members and work. He did not give me an opportunity to call him back after [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] message. I spoke with his manager to notify him that that was inappropriate to contact my family members.','URS Holding, LLC',2.0,2.0,'collection agency called my family members and employer after correct contact information. he did not give me an opportunity to call him back after [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] message');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5976,'03/25/2015','Debt collection','Medical','Disclosure verification of debt','I called to ask about the account that I saw in collections and informed the company that they had the wrong address. I never received the bill. I did n''t know what it was. I asked to have a bill sent to me so I could review it. I was told that if I did n''t pay immediately it would stay on my report no matter what. I ended up paying for it and I ''m not sure if it was my debt. They would n''t give me the doctors name or anything. When I contacted the original creditor they did n''t have my information. No social security numbers nothing. I ''m not sure who I gave my credit card information to.','ESCALLATE, LLC',2.0,2.0,'if I didn''t pay immediately it would stay on my report no matter what. if I didn''t pay immediately it would stay on my report no matter');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5977,'03/25/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','Unfortunately I was the victim of identity theft. I have done everything required of me by law to substantiate my claim and submitted a report number, an FTC complaint number and an FTC Affidavit to Experian via certified mail. Experian refuses to honor my claim & the evidence submitted. Experian continues to report fraudulent & inaccurate information on my credit report. The FCRA ensures that all information contained in a consumers file is 100 % accurate. The following accounts are inaccurate and/or fraudulent ; 1 ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is not my account please remove this from my credit report. 
2 ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is not my account please remove this from my credit report. 
3 ) The Department of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is not my account please remove this from my credit report, In addition to this account being reported multiple times. 
4 ) Navient # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is not my account please remove this from my credit report, In addition to this account being reported multiple times. 
5 ) [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] # [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] is not my account please remove this from my credit report. 
4 ) Diversified Consultants [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Is not my account ( s ), please delete them from my credit file I would also like for Experian to send me my entire credit file as required of them upon request per Section 609 ( a ) ( 1 ) ( A ), so that I may have the verification sent in by these alleged creditors examined for signatory forgeries.','Experian Information Solutions Inc.',2.0,4.0,'experian refuses to honor my claim & the evidence submitted. the alleged creditors have been contacted by the alleged creditors.');
