INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5979,'03/24/2015','Bank account or service','Checking account','Deposits and withdrawals','Citibank ''s business practices and lack of sensitivity toward the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] violates [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Laws. Upon speaking to Citibank concerning charges, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] on chat online began to enlarge text after I disclosed that I was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. She began to repeat the same text and send enlarged text. I found this to be highly insensitive and offensive. I did not request for her to enlarge the text and I never told her that my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was visual impairment. I am requesting that this be attached to any previous complaint submitted regarding the discrimination that I have endured while banking at Citibank. I was refused service at the local branch in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] because I was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. The accounting practice subject customers to overdraft fees, charges that are exorbitant, customers are forced to pay merchants who do not provide the merchandise, etc. The bank does not display a policy that is supportive of their [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] customers. I have also noticed that the same person who assisted me on this chat was not named [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], but [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and this same person was the same person who chatted with me regarding a different company like [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I will support the chat transcript of CITI and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ].','CITIBANK, N.A.',2.0,2.0,'Citibank''s business practices and lack of sensitivity toward the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] violates [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] law');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5980,'03/24/2015','Credit reporting',NULL,'Incorrect information on credit report','I contacted the credit agency TransUnion. They tell me that in order to get the false inquiry on my credit report removed, I need to send an authorization letter and an inquiry deletion letter. I contacted the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Bank to try and obtain an inquiry deletion letter and they told me to contact the credit agency. So I kept calling back and forth with no result or progress. [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] companies gave me a lot of numbers that could n''t help me at all, so I ''m trying to find out how I resolve this unauthorized hard inquiry on my credit report.','TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.',2.0,4.0,'contacted the credit agency TransUnion. they tell me that in order to get the false inquiry removed, I need to send an authorization letter and an inquiry deletion letter.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5981,'03/24/2015','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] with Nationstar on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] @ [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] called to informed me AGAIN my loan modification had a problem, he noted that it was an accounting error. The papers were re signed on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] time. He noted they would offer {$300.00} cash gift card. I received a letter tape to my door offering {$150.00} stating my MOD loan was rejected. My loan modification has been booked several times once in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] now they ''re saying it has been rejected. Please see previous compliant on case # CFPBXXXXXXXX On [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Nationstar deducted out of my checking account than what is agreed according to my Modification. My agreed amount is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], they deducted {$990.00}. Solution provide correct documentation my loan should also remain as per noted on Loan Modification documents, refund the amount they taken out of my account unauthorized.','NATIONSTAR MORTGAGE',2.0,4.0,'a letter from Nationstar stating my loan modification was rejected. the papers were re signed on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/[COMPTE_');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5982,'03/23/2015','Mortgage','Conventional fixed mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','I refinanced my mortgage loan with BB & T. They received a wire on [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015. The payoff left an escrow balance of {$4000.00}. I called BB & T today to find out when my funds would be released to me. I was told that it would be 2-3 weeks before the funds were " mailed '''' to me. The loan servicing agent then give me the date of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], 2015 as the date I could expect my funds to be " mailed '''' to me. That date would add another 3-5 days before receipt, or possibly as long as 1 full month from the date BB & T received wired, good funds. I inquired if I would be receiving interest on my funds and was told no. This seems like an exorbitant delay without compensation for BB & T ''s use of my funds.','BB&T CORPORATION',2.0,2.0,'BB & T received wire on loan. a wire left an escrow balance of $4000.00.');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5983,'03/23/2015','Student loan','Non-federal student loan','Dealing with my lender or servicer','In [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] or [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], I attended [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] University. I applied for financial aid but what I was to receive was not enough to cover the tuition for 2 years at [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I took out a private student loan through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] that my mother co-signed for that was about {$9000.00}. I still had a balance of about {$7000.00} and I took out another private student loan but this was through the school itself to cover what financial aid and the first student loan did not cover. I have been fighting with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for years to have them provide me with copies of my original loan documentation ( promisary note, monthly statements and loan information ) to no avail and it has been at least 10+ years and I have not received a single piece of paper proving anything. It has also been 15 - 16 years since I missed my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment ( making the original default date well past the 7 years that this can be kept on my credit report ) but [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] keeps reporting a original default date of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] for a loan I took out back in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. I doubt this company would let me go 8-9 years on loan without reporting late payments. And even though I have repeatedly disputed this with all three credit bureau ''s, somehow these loans come back verfied to their ( the credit bureau ''s ) satisfaction so they are still on my credit report. This [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] loan is scheduled to come off my credit report in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], just like it was supposed to come off back in XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]/XX/XX/[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] but somehow was re-aged and now has been negatively reported on all three of my credit reports for 15-16 years. I also recently pulled my Experian and Equifax report and saw that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] has also placed this loan back on my credit report using the same original default date as [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], therefore also re-aging my account with them. I contacted [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] back in [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] of [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and requested all my original loan documentation from them ( promissary note, monthly statement and attendance ) and have not received a response from them. I do have federal sudent loans that are in good standing which were with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] and then were bought by the government when Obama took office and took the third party lenders out of the financial aid loop ( US department of education ) but all of those loans including the private loan through [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] have been bought by Navient ( which is owned by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], go figure ). I ''m tired of fighting this fight and I ''m told that although I requested this information from these [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] comanies, they do not have a set time to respond with my documentation or to respond at all. And that is not fair, especially when we are given 30 days to dispute the validity of a debt from the time we receive the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] collection notice. I went to this school when I was young and bounced around quite a bit so that [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] collection notice may not have even gotten to me but as I have grown older and am trying to be responsible and get my debts and credit in order, I am faced with this giant lender ( [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], now Navient ) not having to respond to my request in a timely manner. Especially when this is a debt that is almost as old as my [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] child who is [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ], so I am not mistaken about when I attended this school and took out these loans. My intentions were to pay back my loans but like a lot of people, I was unable to find a job in my field to do that. And when I maxed out my deferments with them because it was a private student loan, I had no choice but not to pay and get told that they would not work with me and just take me to court and sue me for the money. I was never served with any paperwork to go to court and if I had been sued, it is still well beyond 7 years of the original default date and I ''m still fighting this fight. Is this not illegal. Do I not have any recourse regarding this issue? Please help!','Navient Solutions, LLC.',2.0,2.0,'a private student loan was to be paid for by [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]. the first student loan was through the school itself to cover what financial aid did');
INSERT INTO "reclamations" VALUES(5984,'03/23/2015','Mortgage','FHA mortgage','Loan servicing, payments, escrow account','[COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] transferred the servicing of my loan. I was [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payments into a FHA [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] payment trial. I have continued to pay my monthly mortgage payment to my new servicer. Carrington Home loans. My previous foreclosure with [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] was supposed to be dismissed once I accepted the Modification. Last week I had to attend a hearing with my private attorney and the [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] attorney. The Judge wants to advance the foreclosure. I am afraid of losing my home during the modification. Carrington mortgage needs to dismiss the foreclosure and get my loan modification completed. Pursuant to the CFPB bulletin [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] Your agency was concerned about loans being transferred during the modification process and this is exactly what has happened to me. Please help me get this resolved so that I can keep my home. Thanks, [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ] [COMPTE_ANONYMISÉ]','CARRINGTON MORTGAGE SERVICES, LLC',2.0,2.0,'a new servicer has been transferred to a mortgage payment trial. the judge wants to advance the foreclosure. the judge wants to advance the foreclosure.');
